  ('856084668794360387', '¡Asu Mare! 2', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ricardo Maldonado, Gianfranco Alcántara', 'Rasec Barragan, Roberto Simer, Alberto Rojas Apel', 'Emilia Drago, Christian Meier, Carlos Alcántara, Andrés Salas, Anahí de Cárdenas, Carlos Carlín, Wendy Ramos, Johanna San Miguel', null, 'Follows Machin''s conflicted relationships with his girlfriend Emilia and with his best friend Culicich.', 'Follows Machin''s conflicted relationships with his girlfriend Emilia and with his best friend Culicich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhIpa49R57KxWJYc98f99n1bpFf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:335031'),
  ('404123887810385032', '¡Asu Mare! 3', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Ulloa, Alejo Chauvin, Gianfranco Alcántara', 'Rasec Barragan, Carlos Galiano, Jorge Ulloa', 'Carlos Alcántara, Anahí de Cárdenas, Emilia Drago, Denisse Dibós, Melania Urbina, Carlos Carlín, Andrés Salas, Alex Duran', null, 'The long-awaited third installment of the blockbuster Asu Mare hits theaters. Cachin and Emilia, already married, prepare to be parents. Cachín gets the long-awaited visa to the United States and together with Emilia, Coolie and Pamela they travel to Miami, where they will spend a thousand and one adventures that will turn their relationship and that of both families upside down.', 'The long-awaited third installment of the blockbuster Asu Mare hits theaters. Cachin and Emilia, already married, prepare to be parents. Cachín gets the long-awaited visa to the United States and together with Emilia, Coolie and Pamela they travel to Miami, where they will spend a thousand and one adventures that will turn their relationship and that of both families upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fykOg72qCnDjXhgomFaudRtYzsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564297'),
  ('69749888181905300', '¡Asu Mare! The Friends', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Alcántara, Gianfranco Alcántara', 'Rasec Barragan, Marco Rubina, Renato Fernandez', 'Andrés Salas, Franco Cabrera, Emilram Cossío, Miguel Vergara, Ximena Palomino, Fiorella Luna, Sandro Calderón, Joaquin Barreto', null, 'Cachin''s friends are back. After overcoming many adversities, an inheritance will put them to the test, facing funny situations and dark characters that will try to boycott one of their greatest dreams.', 'Cachin''s friends are back. After overcoming many adversities, an inheritance will put them to the test, facing funny situations and dark characters that will try to boycott one of their greatest dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKH8hvs6aNT3SH0brcgepUNokny.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1046064'),
  ('726995165112227065', '¡Atraco!', 2012, 'Thriller, Comedy', 'Eduard Cortés, Angie Paul Risque', 'Piti Español, Eduard Cortés, Marcelo Figueras', 'Óscar Jaenada, Amaia Salamanca, Guillermo Francella, Jordi Martínez, Jorge Suquet, Francesc Albiol, Nicolás Cabré, Daniel Fanego', null, 'In 1956, after the assault on a jewelry by two Argentines thieves, starts a police operation that ends with the arrest and imprisonment of offenders. However, the loot doesn´t appear, and his search will unleash a complex plot of complicity.', 'In 1956, after the assault on a jewelry by two Argentines thieves, starts a police operation that ends with the arrest and imprisonment of offenders. However, the loot doesn´t appear, and his search will unleash a complex plot of complicity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anpsNk0HOhrizUZSC6SbLqSBCw9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138092'),
  ('429071110471602499', '¡Ay, mi madre!', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Frank Ariza', 'Frank Ariza', 'Secun de la Rosa, Estefanía de los Santos, Mariola Fuentes, Marta Torné, Paz Vega, Terele Pávez, María Alfonsa Rosso, Concha Galán', null, 'When her estranged mother suddenly dies, a woman must follow the quirky instructions laid out in the will in order to collect an important inheritance.', 'When her estranged mother suddenly dies, a woman must follow the quirky instructions laid out in the will in order to collect an important inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9483qTrQWGA3O8zgx1SJexbyLke.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437023'),
  ('854900675049071122', '¡Biba la banda!', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Ricardo Palacios', 'Ricardo Palacios', 'Manuel Alexandre, Miguel Ayones, Florinda Chico, Fiorella Faltoyano, Antonio Ferrandis, Óscar Ladoire, Alfredo Landa, Antonio Mayans', null, 'In 1938, at the height of the civil war, the musicians of the military band were very worried about their next concert. Agustín receives a letter from his girlfriend, who tells him about the difficulties he is going through with the rice harvest. She then decides to ask permission to go and help her, but as Lieutenant Urquiza refuses, she escapes. Two companions sent to bring him back, finally, stay with him. Also Sergeant Perez and several musicians who go looking for him stay with them.', 'In 1938, at the height of the civil war, the musicians of the military band were very worried about their next concert. Agustín receives a letter from his girlfriend, who tells him about the difficulties he is going through with the rice harvest. She then decides to ask permission to go and help her, but as Lieutenant Urquiza refuses, she escapes. Two companions sent to bring him back, finally, stay with him. Also Sergeant Perez and several musicians who go looking for him stay with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS6G7IIALkRgGblYNUlMnSNRV65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75516'),
  ('887373675640943304', '¡Bruja, más que bruja!', 1977, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Leopoldo Villaseñor, Martín Sacristán', 'Pedro Beltrán, Fernando Fernán Gómez', 'Fernando Fernán Gómez, Emma Cohen, Francisco Algora, Mary Santpere, José Lifante, Luis Sánchez Polack, Estela Delgado, Carmen Martínez Sierra', null, 'A small provincial town lives under the caprices of Don Justin, the local cacique. This forces the young Mariana to marry him, taking advantage of the fact that her nephew Juan, the boyfriend of the girl, is far away from military service. Upon his return, Juan is mocked and goes to a witch to assist him in his revenge.', 'A small provincial town lives under the caprices of Don Justin, the local cacique. This forces the young Mariana to marry him, taking advantage of the fact that her nephew Juan, the boyfriend of the girl, is far away from military service. Upon his return, Juan is mocked and goes to a witch to assist him in his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlZjL3B35whCLNtKVh9sTrGN2hl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406803'),
  ('1096627184917781020', '¡Casa Bonita Mi Amor!', 2024, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Arthur Bradford, P.H. O''Brien', null, 'Trey Parker, Matt Stone, Dana Rodriguez, Benjamin Schrader, Jared Polis, Randy Parker, Betty Boogie Parker', 'NR', 'Casa Bonita opened in 1974 in an unassuming strip mall. The massive "Disneyland of Mexican restaurants" is an Old West and Acapulco-inspired fever dream made famous by its indoor waterfall, cliff divers, and haunted caves, and was featured in a classic 2003 episode of South Park. When its creators, Trey Parker and Matt Stone, learn that Casa Bonita might close its doors for good, they attempt to preserve a crumbling piece of their childhood and Denver history.', 'Casa Bonita opened in 1974 in an unassuming strip mall. The massive "Disneyland of Mexican restaurants" is an Old West and Acapulco-inspired fever dream made famous by its indoor waterfall, cliff divers, and haunted caves, and was featured in a classic 2003 episode of South Park. When its creators, Trey Parker and Matt Stone, learn that Casa Bonita might close its doors for good, they attempt to preserve a crumbling piece of their childhood and Denver history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEktirdxkXk42NuM8WGlUcP9D28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1278666'),
