  ('668844245408023087', '¡Que viva México!', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Luis Estrada, Alberto Anaya', 'Luis Estrada, Jaime Sampietro', 'Damián Alcázar, Alfonso Herrera, Joaquín Cosío, Ana de la Reguera, Ana Martín, Angelina Peláez, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Sonia Couoh', 'R', 'After his grandfather''s death, a man travels with his wife and kids to his hometown, where chaos ensues with his relatives over the inheritance.', 'After his grandfather''s death, a man travels with his wife and kids to his hometown, where chaos ensues with his relatives over the inheritance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ieyUpr5ES9QEz1cn4clCnBf9XJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:868985'),
