  ('540275016363146171', '¡Se armó el belén!', 1969, 'Comedy', 'José Luis Sáenz de Heredia, Michel Kelber, Ricardo Sáenz de Heredia', 'Rafael J. Salvia, José Luis Sáenz de Heredia', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Germán Cobos, Irán Eory, Julia Caba Alba, Marisa Porcel, Rafael López Somoza, Javier Loyola, Erasmo Pascual', null, 'An old priest, who has old ideas, is intended to exercise the apostolate in a neighborhood in the suburbs of Madrid. There the revolutionary climate and anti-religious character of the congregation thwarts all his attempts to attract them. The Archbishop admonishes him and asks to renew his methods, using the example of a young priest of a modern parish. The old priest tries to apply in his environment what he has seen in the parish model, setting off a chain of events.', 'An old priest, who has old ideas, is intended to exercise the apostolate in a neighborhood in the suburbs of Madrid. There the revolutionary climate and anti-religious character of the congregation thwarts all his attempts to attract them. The Archbishop admonishes him and asks to renew his methods, using the example of a young priest of a modern parish. The old priest tries to apply in his environment what he has seen in the parish model, setting off a chain of events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmX7xRJtFhsKlLxLvxpU8HnvylH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86048'),
  ('210086512441670065', '¡Semos peligrosos! (Uséase Makinavaja 2)', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Suárez, Carlos Suárez, Francesc Brualla', 'Carlos Suárez', 'Andrés Pajares, Jesús Bonilla, Llàtzer Escarceller, Mario Pardo, Pedro Reyes, Lita Claver, Albert Vidal, Boris Ruiz', null, 'As soon as he is released from prison, Maki goes to look for his friend Popeye. Together they rescue the grandfather from a dangerous form of "Russian roulette" played in the asylum, and decide to take a vacation at the beach.', 'As soon as he is released from prison, Maki goes to look for his friend Popeye. Together they rescue the grandfather from a dangerous form of "Russian roulette" played in the asylum, and decide to take a vacation at the beach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTq10fIkhIOK0Ybh8qmsGpsWVBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134629'),
  ('497565462396617967', '¡Sufre, mamón!', 1987, 'Comedy, Music', 'Manuel Summers, Tote Trenas', 'Francisco Summers, Tomás Summers', 'David Summers Rodriguez, Marta Madruga, Gerardo Ortega, Curro Martín Summers, Javier Molina, Daniel Mezquita, Rafael Gutiérrez, Antonio Gamero', null, 'David, Javier, Dani and Pepe are four friends expelled from a religious school who must join the discipline of a mixed center. His passion for music leads them to create the group Los Residuos, facing Rocky Lacoste, the idol of the new school. In addition to singing in the rival group Yellow Fever, Lacoste also conquers Patty, David''s girlfriend. At the end of his irregular career, Manuel Summers directed this musical taking advantage of the enormous success among the youthful public of the group of pop Men G, led by his son David.', 'David, Javier, Dani and Pepe are four friends expelled from a religious school who must join the discipline of a mixed center. His passion for music leads them to create the group Los Residuos, facing Rocky Lacoste, the idol of the new school. In addition to singing in the rival group Yellow Fever, Lacoste also conquers Patty, David''s girlfriend. At the end of his irregular career, Manuel Summers directed this musical taking advantage of the enormous success among the youthful public of the group of pop Men G, led by his son David.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUCMkIQcNiNB349UHpmuQ3OuvKu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166461'),
  ('836987731056407144', '¡Three Amigos!', 1986, 'Comedy, Western, Action', 'Ronald W. Browne, John Landis, Jackie Burch', 'Lorne Michaels, Steve Martin, Randy Newman', 'Chevy Chase, Steve Martin, Martin Short, Alfonso Arau, Tony Plana, Patrice Martinez, Jorge Cervera Jr., Kai Wulff', 'PG', 'A trio of unemployed silent film actors are mistaken for real heroes by a small Mexican village in search of someone to stop a malevolent bandit.', 'A trio of unemployed silent film actors are mistaken for real heroes by a small Mexican village in search of someone to stop a malevolent bandit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUNRnhl2cwjFJ6TOsaPJmZeMZ0S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8388'),
  ('578336035226715258', '¡Vaya par de gemelos!', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater, Manuel Rojas, José Luis Escolar', 'Dionisio Ramos, Joaquín Abati, Federico Reparaz', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Margot Cottens, María Isbert, Inma de Santis, José María Guillén, Inés Morales, Pedro Hurtado, Julián Navarro', null, 'Pedro and Lucas are two twin brothers, residents of Tarazona, whom fortune smiles very differently. Luke is married to the owner of a modest supermarket and works as dependent, porter and whatever is needed ... Moreover, unlike his brother, he has never left the village. Instead, Pedro is married to the richest chocolate maker in the place, lives like a king and often travels to Madrid. But to justify his travels he has invented an illegitimate son who lives there studying architecture and that his wife wants to protect, giving him all the money he needs. The plan goes perfect until love complicates things.', 'Pedro and Lucas are two twin brothers, residents of Tarazona, whom fortune smiles very differently. Luke is married to the owner of a modest supermarket and works as dependent, porter and whatever is needed ... Moreover, unlike his brother, he has never left the village. Instead, Pedro is married to the richest chocolate maker in the place, lives like a king and often travels to Madrid. But to justify his travels he has invented an illegitimate son who lives there studying architecture and that his wife wants to protect, giving him all the money he needs. The plan goes perfect until love complicates things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWQ7t3LXXN7q8701mwebZKQGsoR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80507'),
  ('282039386803348450', '¡Vente a Alemania, Pepe!', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Lazaga Sabater, Raúl Pérez Cubero, José Luis Pérez Tristán', 'Vicente Escrivá, Vicente Coello', 'Alfredo Landa, José Sacristán, Tina Sainz, Gemma Cuervo, Antonio Ferrandis, Fernando Guillén, Josele Román, Rafael Hernández', null, 'Peralejos, a quiet village in Upper Aragon, is a place where nothing ever happens. One day Angelino returns home to spend the holidays, an immigrant who drives a Mercedes and tells great wonders of Germany and their women. Pepe, fascinated by the stories of his friend, decides to immigrate, but his dream begins at five o''clock, cleaning windows, and ends at twelve o''clock pasting posters.', 'Peralejos, a quiet village in Upper Aragon, is a place where nothing ever happens. One day Angelino returns home to spend the holidays, an immigrant who drives a Mercedes and tells great wonders of Germany and their women. Pepe, fascinated by the stories of his friend, decides to immigrate, but his dream begins at five o''clock, cleaning windows, and ends at twelve o''clock pasting posters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNlloBU61xRKfIR40yIQaG1hHJV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100039'),
  ('743168303145226798', '¡Vivan las Antipodas!', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Viktor Kossakovsky, Viktor Kossakovsky', null, null, null, 'What would be the shortest route between Entre Rios in Argentina and the Chinese metropolis Shanghai? Simply a straight line through the center of the earth, since the two places are antipodes: they are located diametrically opposite to each other on the earth''s surface. During his visits to four such antipodal pairs, the award-winning documentary filmmaker Victor Kossakovsky captured images that turn our view of the world upside down.', 'What would be the shortest route between Entre Rios in Argentina and the Chinese metropolis Shanghai? Simply a straight line through the center of the earth, since the two places are antipodes: they are located diametrically opposite to each other on the earth''s surface. During his visits to four such antipodal pairs, the award-winning documentary filmmaker Victor Kossakovsky captured images that turn our view of the world upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQXnilDLv47xyTSVDZ0K0TXwdpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102873'),
