  ('489931926309970945', '¿Dónde estará mi niño?', 1981, 'Comedy, Music', 'Luis María Delgado', null, 'Manolo Escobar, Antonio Garisa, Rafaela Aparicio, África Pratt, María Kosty', null, 'Manolo is a famous singer who has a brief affair with Diana, a beautiful hitchhiker. Diana becomes pregnant and gives birth to a child, Lito, the Manolo ignores their existence. Seven years later, Diana wants her son Manolo meet and therefore decided to look for him. However, when he is suffering a great disappointment because Manolo does not remember her. One person who remembers the father Manolo, who follows that Lito is his grandson and both plan unite Manolo and Diana.', 'Manolo is a famous singer who has a brief affair with Diana, a beautiful hitchhiker. Diana becomes pregnant and gives birth to a child, Lito, the Manolo ignores their existence. Seven years later, Diana wants her son Manolo meet and therefore decided to look for him. However, when he is suffering a great disappointment because Manolo does not remember her. One person who remembers the father Manolo, who follows that Lito is his grandson and both plan unite Manolo and Diana.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1JfU60pBNZjVNZCnjU9XGTOfqo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129014'),
