  ('23632670313804305', '...First Do No Harm', 1997, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jim Abrahams, Pierre Letarte, Libby Hodgson', 'Ann Beckett', 'Meryl Streep, Fred Ward, Allison Janney, Seth Adkins, Margo Martindale, Tom Butler, Leo Burmester, Mairon Bennett', 'PG-13', 'When Lori Reimuller learns that her young son Robbie has epilepsy, she first trusts the judgment of the hospital staff in how best to bring it under control. As Robbie''s health slides radically downhill, however, she becomes frustrated and desperate, and so does her own research into the existing literature on treatments. When she decides to try an alternative treatment called the Ketogenic Diet, devised long ago by a doctor from Johns Hopkins, she is met with narrow-minded resistance from Robbie''s doctor, who is prepared to take legal action to prevent Lori from removing him from the hospital.', 'When Lori Reimuller learns that her young son Robbie has epilepsy, she first trusts the judgment of the hospital staff in how best to bring it under control. As Robbie''s health slides radically downhill, however, she becomes frustrated and desperate, and so does her own research into the existing literature on treatments. When she decides to try an alternative treatment called the Ketogenic Diet, devised long ago by a doctor from Johns Hopkins, she is met with narrow-minded resistance from Robbie''s doctor, who is prepared to take legal action to prevent Lori from removing him from the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmxbYkaX4OZIuR0wVDJQuaPJx7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26716'),
  ('70092377872833580', '...God Forgives All', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Pif, Guido Michelotti', 'Pif, Michele Astori', 'Pif, Carlos Hipólito, Giusy Buscemi, Francesco Scianna, Maurizio Marchetti, Domenico Centamore, Francesca Lozito, Lollo Franco', null, 'Arturo is a lonely, gluttonous, and disillusioned Sicilian real estate agent. His mundane life finally finds its spark through his one true passion: Sicilian pastries. It’s over a tray of cannoli that he meets his soulmate, Flora. She is everything he ever dreamed of—beautiful, witty, and brilliant. To top it off, she’s a pastry chef. However, a divine obstacle stands between them: God. While Flora is a devout, fervent Catholic, Arturo abandoned his faith as a child. Desperate not to lose the woman of his dreams, he decides to "fake it ''til he makes it," pretending to be a man of deep conviction. Guiding Arturo on this chaotic journey toward truth, faith, and Flora’s heart is an unlikely mentor and friend: Pope Francis himself.', 'Arturo is a lonely, gluttonous, and disillusioned Sicilian real estate agent. His mundane life finally finds its spark through his one true passion: Sicilian pastries. It’s over a tray of cannoli that he meets his soulmate, Flora. She is everything he ever dreamed of—beautiful, witty, and brilliant. To top it off, she’s a pastry chef. However, a divine obstacle stands between them: God. While Flora is a devout, fervent Catholic, Arturo abandoned his faith as a child. Desperate not to lose the woman of his dreams, he decides to "fake it ''til he makes it," pretending to be a man of deep conviction. Guiding Arturo on this chaotic journey toward truth, faith, and Flora’s heart is an unlikely mentor and friend: Pope Francis himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9a8l2fGK9cPbLEvxObO3bJBYKoj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1508701'),
  ('248215332987726843', '...ing', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'E.oni', 'Kim Jin', 'Lim Soo-jung, Kim Rae-won, Chang Yun, Lee Mi-sook, Kim In-mun, Lee Yu-jeong, Choi Deok-moon, Kim Ji-young', null, 'Follows the life of a young woman who has become reserved and indifferent to the world as a result of her chronic illness deformed hand and quietly portrays the unconventional, yet endearing relationship between mother and daughter as well as the development of Min-ah as she is befriended by the high spirited and carefree photographer Young-jae who moves into their apartment complex.', 'Follows the life of a young woman who has become reserved and indifferent to the world as a result of her chronic illness deformed hand and quietly portrays the unconventional, yet endearing relationship between mother and daughter as well as the development of Min-ah as she is befriended by the high spirited and carefree photographer Young-jae who moves into their apartment complex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUy74ts2Ru4mOjXUGzWP1Gs3LG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41091'),
  ('1009127576266172875', '...It''s Snowing Outside!', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Emanuele Imbucci, Fabio Olmi', 'Antonio Guerriero, Vincenzo Salemme', 'Vincenzo Salemme, Carlo Buccirosso, Nando Paone, Maurizio Casagrande, Giorgio Panariello, Margareth Madè, Paola Quattrini', null, 'After their mother dies, three brothers must live together in order to get their inheritance — and soon start to uncover dark family secrets.', 'After their mother dies, three brothers must live together in order to get their inheritance — and soon start to uncover dark family secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUIK94dc66ER57Ri6foVkWwDuQw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297745'),
  ('634380922533177166', '...No Lies', 1973, 'Drama', 'Mitchell Block, Alec Hirschfeld', 'Mitchell Block', 'Shelby Leverington, Alec Hirschfeld', null, 'A young filmmaking student turns his camera on a female friend as she gets ready to go out for the night. She confides in him something he struggles to come to grips with.', 'A young filmmaking student turns his camera on a female friend as she gets ready to go out for the night. She confides in him something he struggles to come to grips with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p6Gpft1X60QwCRWoCqC1EyuNfDA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416884'),
  ('720384415424351650', '...Re', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Sunil Kumar Desai', null, 'Ramesh Aravind, Harshika Poonacha, Anant Nag', null, 'Re is a Kannada comedy drama starring Ramesh Aravind and Anant Nag. A rich man arrives at an old palatial house to find that his ancestors are cursed to an afterlife in the house. Now it becomes his responsibility to undo the curse.', 'Re is a Kannada comedy drama starring Ramesh Aravind and Anant Nag. A rich man arrives at an old palatial house to find that his ancestors are cursed to an afterlife in the house. Now it becomes his responsibility to undo the curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zD462oTVwka6bUAZxEzix5BsZQj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468853'),
  ('1101932862930457071', '...Watch Out, We''re Mad', 2022, 'Comedy, Action', 'Niccolò Celaia, Antonio Usbergo, Antonio Silvestre', 'Marcello Fondato, Francesco Scardamaglia, Andrea Sperandio', 'Edoardo Pesce, Alessandro Roja, Alessandra Mastronardi, Christian De Sica, Francesco Bruni, Massimiliano Rossi, Michael Schermi, Gabriele Cristini', null, 'Estranged, quarreling brothers Carezza and Sorriso have to put aside their differences to reclaim their father''s beloved dune buggy from predatory real estate developer Torsillo, with the help of beautiful circus performer Miriam, whose family business is threatened by Torsillo''s enforcers.', 'Estranged, quarreling brothers Carezza and Sorriso have to put aside their differences to reclaim their father''s beloved dune buggy from predatory real estate developer Torsillo, with the help of beautiful circus performer Miriam, whose family business is threatened by Torsillo''s enforcers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ohiRHcLgqtpg82Keglufvlp8xuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838197'),
  ('833579031973674791', '.45', 2006, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Gary Lennon, Teodoro Maniaci', 'Gary Lennon', 'Milla Jovovich, Angus Macfadyen, Stephen Dorff, Aisha Tyler, Sarah Strange, Vincent Laresca, Tony Munch, Kay Hawtrey', 'R', 'Kate and her brutish boyfriend Big Al sell handguns on the streets of New York. She''s smart, stylish, and self-confident, but all that leaves her when Al, in a jealous and self-indulgent rage, beats her. Three friends encourage her recovery: Vic, a woman who would like to be Kate''s lover; Reilly, who runs with Al but also is attracted to Kate and repulsed by Al''s violence; and, Liz, the counselor assigned to Kate from a battered-women''s program. Vic and Reilly talk about killing Al, Liz gives pep talks; Kate remains frightened. Will Al''s menace and Kate''s dependency hold sway?', 'Kate and her brutish boyfriend Big Al sell handguns on the streets of New York. She''s smart, stylish, and self-confident, but all that leaves her when Al, in a jealous and self-indulgent rage, beats her. Three friends encourage her recovery: Vic, a woman who would like to be Kate''s lover; Reilly, who runs with Al but also is attracted to Kate and repulsed by Al''s violence; and, Liz, the counselor assigned to Kate from a battered-women''s program. Vic and Reilly talk about killing Al, Liz gives pep talks; Kate remains frightened. Will Al''s menace and Kate''s dependency hold sway?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clv6FaRRliTN5E6GpDJI4FPFguk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14062'),
  ('1052287506843087649', '.hack//G.U. Returner', 2007, 'Drama, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Manamu Amasaki, Koichi Mashimo, Toru Nakano', 'Hiroshi Matsuyama, Hiroto Niizato, Miu Kawasaki', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Ayako Kawasumi, Kaori Nazuka, Megumi Toyoguchi, Takumi Yamazaki, Kenta Miyake, Akiko Yajima, Hiroki Touchi', null, 'The characters receive an email from Ovan requesting them to go to Δ Hidden Forbidden Festival where a mysterious summer festival is set up. There they encounter an AIDA Chim Chim who wishes to peacefully co-exist with the players of The World. It then transforms into the word "Returner", which Haseo assumes it to mean that Ovan will return to The World.', 'The characters receive an email from Ovan requesting them to go to Δ Hidden Forbidden Festival where a mysterious summer festival is set up. There they encounter an AIDA Chim Chim who wishes to peacefully co-exist with the players of The World. It then transforms into the word "Returner", which Haseo assumes it to mean that Ovan will return to The World.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQ9H4dee9NKHT3sHHA4Dc336Bwe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803329'),
  ('691657075522712459', '.hack//G.U. Trilogy', 2007, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Mystery', 'Hiroshi Matsuyama', 'Saeko Hirotsu, Hiroto Niizato', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Ayako Kawasumi, Sanae Kobayashi, Shin-ichiro Miki, Takumi Yamazaki, Sayaka Aida, Masumi Asano, Atsuko Enomoto', null, 'Join Haseo on his quest to track down Tri-Edge, the devious PK responsible for leaving one of his closest friends in a coma. Along the way he meets Atolli, a gentle girl who takes an interest in him despite his chilly demeanor. Together, Haseo and Atolli will attempt to survive long enough to decipher the riddle of the entities known as AIDAs—and save their fellow gamers from permanent sleep.', 'Join Haseo on his quest to track down Tri-Edge, the devious PK responsible for leaving one of his closest friends in a coma. Along the way he meets Atolli, a gentle girl who takes an interest in him despite his chilly demeanor. Together, Haseo and Atolli will attempt to survive long enough to decipher the riddle of the entities known as AIDAs—and save their fellow gamers from permanent sleep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zged85q5jE6qD0kbcasdhUXQinq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26595'),
  ('710308162156732343', '.hack//The Movie', 2012, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'Hiroshi Matsuyama', 'Kazunori Ito', 'Kei Tanaka, Hitomi Miyauchi, Tori Matsuzaka, Saki Fujita, Yukari Fukui, Marina Inoue, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Masako Katsuki', null, 'In 2024, the computer network prevails throughout the daily life. Arishiro Sora is a 14 year old girl. One day, she is invited to an online game "The World". After an accident in the game, the real world begins to deform.', 'In 2024, the computer network prevails throughout the daily life. Arishiro Sora is a 14 year old girl. One day, she is invited to an online game "The World". After an accident in the game, the real world begins to deform.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tW9FYOBX6pBWHfDtvwparLrXnag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128253'),
  ('1012411921848512377', '''38 - Vienna Before the Fall', 1986, 'Drama', 'Wolfgang Glück, Harald Eberhard, Robert Vacík', 'Wolfgang Glück, Lida Winiewicz', 'Tobias Engel, Sunnyi Melles, Heinz Trixner, Romuald Pekny, Ingrid Burkhard, David Cameron, Josef Fröhlich, Tanja von Oertzen', null, 'The film presents the political events surrounding the Anschluss in March of 1938 through the lives of Carola Hell, a popular young actress at the prestigious Theater in der Josefstadt, and Martin Hofmann, the Jewish journalist she plans to marry. When we encounter the couple in the lovely springtime weather their future is full of promise. They are determined to stay clear of politics. Yet in the climate of the time, nobody of her prominence or his religion can remain apolitical. Although Martin''s journalist friend, Drechsler, calls to inform them that the Nazis plan to take over Austria soon, they concentrate on their work and their private happiness and dismiss the warnings.', 'The film presents the political events surrounding the Anschluss in March of 1938 through the lives of Carola Hell, a popular young actress at the prestigious Theater in der Josefstadt, and Martin Hofmann, the Jewish journalist she plans to marry. When we encounter the couple in the lovely springtime weather their future is full of promise. They are determined to stay clear of politics. Yet in the climate of the time, nobody of her prominence or his religion can remain apolitical. Although Martin''s journalist friend, Drechsler, calls to inform them that the Nazis plan to take over Austria soon, they concentrate on their work and their private happiness and dismiss the warnings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKCkNmBGcB4b9rOa4LwM95wCUXn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42016'),
  ('158132890655789580', '''71', 2014, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, War', 'Yann Demange, Tat Radcliffe, Nigel Pollock', 'Gregory Burke', 'Jack O''Connell, Sean Harris, Paul Anderson, Sam Reid, Sam Hazeldine, Barry Keoghan, Charlie Murphy, Richard Dormer', null, 'A young British soldier must find his way back to safety after his unit accidentally abandons him during a riot in the streets of Belfast.', 'A young British soldier must find his way back to safety after his unit accidentally abandons him during a riot in the streets of Belfast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ZfUpDXEFQxEyXfzfxGFA9rcbP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252178'),
  ('82184900533242428', '''A Santanotte', 1922, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elvira Notari', null, 'Rosè Angione, Eduardo Notari, Alberto Danza, Antonio Palmieri, Elisa Cava, Carluccio', null, 'Nanninella, a young girl, is exploited and abused by her father, whom she maintains with her waitress salary. She falls madly in love with Tore, a handsome and upright man, whose friend Carluccio plots to have Nanninella for himself. Based on a popular Neapolitan song, ‘A Santanotte is the earliest extant feature film by Elvira Notari, Italy''s first and most prolific female filmmaker.', 'Nanninella, a young girl, is exploited and abused by her father, whom she maintains with her waitress salary. She falls madly in love with Tore, a handsome and upright man, whose friend Carluccio plots to have Nanninella for himself. Based on a popular Neapolitan song, ‘A Santanotte is the earliest extant feature film by Elvira Notari, Italy''s first and most prolific female filmmaker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEKw80a6En86USEQilFfRgansce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190149'),
  ('875746413616528162', '''Bullitt'': Steve McQueen''s Commitment to Reality', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Ronald Saland, Marcel Broekman, Verne Carlson', 'Jay Anson', 'Steve McQueen, Bill Hickman, Harry Kleiner, Peter Yates, Robert Vaughn, Jacqueline Bisset', 'NR', 'A behind the scenes look at the making of the movie Bullitt with a strong focus on the attention to details taken. It features some of the preparations made before shooting began, but is mostly focused on the onsite filming locations which brings a strong amount of reality to the film as the title suggests.', 'A behind the scenes look at the making of the movie Bullitt with a strong focus on the attention to details taken. It features some of the preparations made before shooting began, but is mostly focused on the onsite filming locations which brings a strong amount of reality to the film as the title suggests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aEcqkVlYl5nIJ9neXpDFe6SfXCb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:331248'),
  ('983999201810305982', '''E''', 1981, 'Animation', 'Břetislav Pojar, Francine Desbiens', null, 'Patrice Arbour, Bernard Carez', null, 'A giant statue of the letter "E" arrives in the park. One man sees it as "B"; they are preparing to cart him off to the looney bin when a doctor arrives and determines the man needs glasses. Then the king arrives...', 'A giant statue of the letter "E" arrives in the park. One man sees it as "B"; they are preparing to cart him off to the looney bin when a doctor arrives and determines the man needs glasses. Then the king arrives...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DWKBzIM25eHfNWNv5J7xQGaLfe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130828'),
  ('393924285840253038', '''G'' Men', 1935, 'Crime, Drama', 'William Keighley, Sol Polito, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Seton I. Miller', 'James Cagney, Margaret Lindsay, Ann Dvorak, Robert Armstrong, Barton MacLane, Lloyd Nolan, William Harrigan, Russell Hopton', 'NR', 'James “Brick” Davis, a struggling attorney, owes his education to a mobster, but always has refused to get involved with the underworld. When a friend of his is gunned down by a notorious criminal, Brick decides to abandon the exercise of the law and join the Department of Justice to capture the murderer.', 'James “Brick” Davis, a struggling attorney, owes his education to a mobster, but always has refused to get involved with the underworld. When a friend of his is gunned down by a notorious criminal, Brick decides to abandon the exercise of the law and join the Department of Justice to capture the murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jY4xH5SDNrRIxlYoXskXniO2Zl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26718'),
  ('97713601264918260', '''Gator Bait', 1974, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Ferd Sebastian, Beverly Sebastian, Ferd Sebastian', 'Beverly Sebastian', 'Claudia Jennings, Sam Gilman, Douglas Dirkson, Clyde Ventura, Don Baldwin, Bill Thurman, Janit Baldwin, Tracy Sebastian', 'R', 'Desirée lives deep in the swamp and supports herself and her siblings by poaching. After an accident involving Deputy Billy and a friend, the Sheriff, Deputy and a family of locals go after Desirée. Soon the hunters become the hunted as she exacts her revenge for their violence against her family.', 'Desirée lives deep in the swamp and supports herself and her siblings by poaching. After an accident involving Deputy Billy and a friend, the Sheriff, Deputy and a family of locals go after Desirée. Soon the hunters become the hunted as she exacts her revenge for their violence against her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8e5wUW4VCDzXCmprAOKVaqvxHjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88950'),
  ('118093569571125406', '''Neath Brooklyn Bridge', 1942, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, War', 'Wallace Fox', 'Harvey Gates', 'Leo Gorcey, Bobby Jordan, Huntz Hall, Gabriel Dell, Noah Beery Jr., Marc Lawrence, Ann Gillis, Dave O''Brien', 'NR', 'The East Side Kids find a young girl in the apartment of a man who has just been murdered. Believing her to be innocent, they hide her in their clubhouse while they try to find the real killer. The killer, however, used a baseball bat as his murder weapon, and the bat has the fingerprints of one of the gang on it.', 'The East Side Kids find a young girl in the apartment of a man who has just been murdered. Believing her to be innocent, they hide her in their clubhouse while they try to find the real killer. The killer, however, used a baseball bat as his murder weapon, and the bat has the fingerprints of one of the gang on it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNrOAj4rrD1FNYEP467IqaPBr4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242667'),
  ('841637846660043211', '''Neath the Arizona Skies', 1934, 'Action, Western', 'Harry L. Fraser, Archie Stout', 'Burl R. Tuttle', 'John Wayne, Sheila Terry, Shirley Jean Rickert, Jack Rockwell, Yakima Canutt, George ''Gabby'' Hayes, Jay Wilsey, Harry L. Fraser', 'NR', 'Chris Morrell, the guardian of half-Indian girl Nina, is helping her find her missing white father. so she can cash in on her late mother''s oil lease. Outlaw Sam Black is after the girl and her father as well. Besides dealing with the Black gang, Morrell has to find another robber, Jim Moore, who switches clothes with him after he finds Chris unconscious from a fight with Sam Black. Along the way, he meets a lady who''s the sister of Jim Moore, another bad hombre who''s in cahoots with Jim Moore, and an old friend who takes in Nina and helps Chris locate Nina''s father and fight off the various desperadoes', 'Chris Morrell, the guardian of half-Indian girl Nina, is helping her find her missing white father. so she can cash in on her late mother''s oil lease. Outlaw Sam Black is after the girl and her father as well. Besides dealing with the Black gang, Morrell has to find another robber, Jim Moore, who switches clothes with him after he finds Chris unconscious from a fight with Sam Black. Along the way, he meets a lady who''s the sister of Jim Moore, another bad hombre who''s in cahoots with Jim Moore, and an old friend who takes in Nina and helps Chris locate Nina''s father and fight off the various desperadoes', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nc6apiqjIWP4CdKNRwOhS3FhJ4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53830'),
  ('377113614452503550', '''night, Mother', 1986, 'Drama', 'Stephen M. Katz, Cheryl Downey, Patrick Regan', 'Marsha Norman', 'Sissy Spacek, Anne Bancroft, Ed Berke, Carol Robbins, Jennifer Roosendahl, Michael Kenworthy, Sari Walker, Claire Malis', 'PG-13', 'A mother and daughter spend a night together after the daughter reveals that she will kill herself by the end of it.', 'A mother and daughter spend a night together after the daughter reveals that she will kill herself by the end of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qMUD4HGqjH1I8LBZI9kcT6Dxmyh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34760'),
  ('50378765912005304', '''o Re', 1989, 'History, Drama, Comedy', 'Luigi Magni, Franco Di Giacomo, Roberto Pariante', 'Luigi Magni', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Ornella Muti, Carlo Croccolo, Luc Merenda, Cristina Marsillach, Anna Maria Ackermann, Corrado Pani, Massimo Abbate', null, 'One of the key factors in Italian unification was the overthrow in 1860 of Francesco, the King of Naples and the two Sicilies, who went into elegant but impoverished exile in Rome with his Queen, Maria Sofia. This seriocomic drama follows the deposed royals as they adapt to their new lives. The former king has recognized the political finality of his deposition, but his queen has taken to traveling in men''s clothing all over Italy trying to foment an uprising to restore them to the throne. She is also frantic to have a baby, an heir, but the king has become celibate as a kind of homage to his beloved mother; he spends all his time lobbying the Vatican to get her declared a saint.', 'One of the key factors in Italian unification was the overthrow in 1860 of Francesco, the King of Naples and the two Sicilies, who went into elegant but impoverished exile in Rome with his Queen, Maria Sofia. This seriocomic drama follows the deposed royals as they adapt to their new lives. The former king has recognized the political finality of his deposition, but his queen has taken to traveling in men''s clothing all over Italy trying to foment an uprising to restore them to the throne. She is also frantic to have a baby, an heir, but the king has become celibate as a kind of homage to his beloved mother; he spends all his time lobbying the Vatican to get her declared a saint.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSHfsS4vVb5a5MmfSzy8COtbRnS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271884'),
  ('493754936451605889', '''Ora sí ¡tenemos que ganar!', 1981, 'Drama', 'Sergio Jara, Antonio Ruiz, Toni Kuhn', 'Leonor Álvarez, Raúl Kamffer', 'Manuel Ojeda, Patricia Reyes Spíndola, Carlos Castañon, Ana Ofelia Murguía, Eduardo López Rojas, Farnesio de Bernal, Martin LaSalle, María del Carmen Farias', null, 'Subjugated by power, the workers of a mining town organize clandestinely.', 'Subjugated by power, the workers of a mining town organize clandestinely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgM3tOovT4pSGuXcX4AYhjvy20B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:304371'),
  ('363598718187093914', '''R Xmas', 2001, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Abel Ferrara, Louis DiGiaimo, Vebe Borge', 'Abel Ferrara, Scott Pardo', 'Drea De Matteo, Lillo Brancato, Ice-T, Victor Argo, Denia Brache, Meredith Ostrom, Janis Corsair, Gloria Irizarry', 'R', 'A New York drug dealer is kidnapped, and his wife must try to come up with the money and drugs to free him from his abductors before Christmas.', 'A New York drug dealer is kidnapped, and his wife must try to come up with the money and drugs to free him from his abductors before Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/DzoSalOppsZ5by1X2ISevQH2U4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49110'),
  ('942334548882551497', '''Round Midnight', 1986, 'Drama, Music', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Bruno de Keyzer, Frédéric Bourboulon', 'Bertrand Tavernier, David Rayfiel', 'Dexter Gordon, François Cluzet, Gabrielle Haker, Christine Pascal, Pierre Trabaud, Frédérique Meininger, Liliane Rovère, Ged Marlon', 'R', 'Inside the Blue Note nightclub one night in 1959 Paris, an aged, ailing jazzman coaxes an eloquent wail from his tenor sax. Outside, a young Parisian too broke to buy a glass of wine strains to hear those notes. Soon they will form a friendship that sparks a final burst of genius.', 'Inside the Blue Note nightclub one night in 1959 Paris, an aged, ailing jazzman coaxes an eloquent wail from his tenor sax. Outside, a young Parisian too broke to buy a glass of wine strains to hear those notes. Soon they will form a friendship that sparks a final burst of genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aNGnEsvLBldNvaBkfYkGGgZDhe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14670'),
  ('446356008254761636', '''Til Madness Do Us Part', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Wang Bing, Xianhui Liu, Wang Bing', 'Wang Bing', null, null, 'An insight into the everyday lives of 50 inmates of a mental institution in the Chinese province of Yunnan, who are there for killing someone, committing a crime against a public official, or have a developmental disability.', 'An insight into the everyday lives of 50 inmates of a mental institution in the Chinese province of Yunnan, who are there for killing someone, committing a crime against a public official, or have a developmental disability.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62wwooby7hp3d1CQsURnL4ZoOc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214775'),
  ('431435881400912989', '''Til There Was You', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Scott Winant, Jon H. Epstein, Bobby Bukowski', 'Winnie Holzman', 'Jeanne Tripplehorn, Dylan McDermott, Kale Browne, Alice Drummond, Sarah Jessica Parker, Jennifer Aniston, Karen Allen, Joshua Rubin', 'PG-13', 'Two strangers, whose paths are always crossing, finally meet when fate steps in. It took them twenty years to fall in love at first sight.', 'Two strangers, whose paths are always crossing, finally meet when fate steps in. It took them twenty years to fall in love at first sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndbW89bKquf5gMXgncY2fCkrIa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32872'),
  ('479852280033918210', '''Till Death Do Us Part', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Robert Guédiguian, Bernard Cavalié', 'Robert Guédiguian, Jean-Louis Milesi', 'Ariane Ascaride, Jacques Boudet, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Jacques Gamblin, Gérard Meylan, Jacques Pieiller, Pascale Roberts, Laetitia Pesenti', null, 'In Estaque, a northern suburb of Marseilles, stuck between oil refinery smokestacks and the Mediterranean sea, a handful of die-hards has taken refuge in a cabaret. There is José, the owner, a big-hearted gypsy who loves cars and women''s bodies; Joséfa, his wife, the establishment''s stripper despite her advanced years and Marie-Sol who climbs the hill every day to visit Notre-Dame de la Garde and beseech Virgin Mary to give her a child. There is Patrick, her husband who has been unemployed for ages but who is kind despite appearances and their friend Jaco who is having a hard time. His wife and daughters hate him for not keeping up on the mortgage repayments. Last but not least is Papa Carlossa who believes that Franco still rules Spain and fantasizes about bumping him off.', 'In Estaque, a northern suburb of Marseilles, stuck between oil refinery smokestacks and the Mediterranean sea, a handful of die-hards has taken refuge in a cabaret. There is José, the owner, a big-hearted gypsy who loves cars and women''s bodies; Joséfa, his wife, the establishment''s stripper despite her advanced years and Marie-Sol who climbs the hill every day to visit Notre-Dame de la Garde and beseech Virgin Mary to give her a child. There is Patrick, her husband who has been unemployed for ages but who is kind despite appearances and their friend Jaco who is having a hard time. His wife and daughters hate him for not keeping up on the mortgage repayments. Last but not least is Papa Carlossa who believes that Franco still rules Spain and fantasizes about bumping him off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sCPcgs2QODbgDMKDlYlxpa2ArcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134275'),
  ('917752751740364017', '''Tis Pity She''s a Whore', 1971, 'Drama, Romance', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi, Vittorio Storaro, Carlo Carunchio', 'Giuseppe Patroni Griffi', 'Fabio Testi, Charlotte Rampling, Oliver Tobias, Antonio Falsi, Angela Luce, Rik Battaglia, Rino Imperio, Eva Axén', null, 'Annabella marries Soranzo. She happens to also be pregnant by Giovanni — who also happens to be her brother. Destiny, and jealousies threaten to expose her past, and Soranzo plots revenge.', 'Annabella marries Soranzo. She happens to also be pregnant by Giovanni — who also happens to be her brother. Destiny, and jealousies threaten to expose her past, and Soranzo plots revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fBFNRPpyc7L5HLmO1DmwHqoloJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113776'),
  ('741666126030877135', '''Tis the Season for Love', 2015, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Terry Ingram', 'Nina Weinman', 'Sarah Lancaster, Brendan Penny, Gwynyth Walsh, Andrew Francis, Jessica Harmon, Garry Chalk, Anna Van Hooft, Jason Schombing', null, 'An out-of-work New York City actress returns home to the quaint small town she escaped 10 years before and finds a place far different than the hamlet she left. She suddenly finds performing possibilities and even romance that kind of blow her away.', 'An out-of-work New York City actress returns home to the quaint small town she escaped 10 years before and finds a place far different than the hamlet she left. She suddenly finds performing possibilities and even romance that kind of blow her away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cpWLQw59uTsrz27bDyPMrxn0Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362886'),
  ('279064536321020479', '''Tis the Season to Be Irish', 2024, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Lesley Demetriades, Ciarán Tanham, Ian Adams', 'Joie Botkin, Samantha Herman', 'Fiona Gubelmann, Eoin Macken, Rosemary Henderson, Jolly Abraham, David Herlihy, Flavia Watson, Tara Egan Langley, Shane O''Reilly', null, 'A house flipper heads to Ireland to renovate and sell a cottage, but her plans change when she meets a local realtor determined to preserve his town’s heritage.', 'A house flipper heads to Ireland to renovate and sell a cottage, but her plans change when she meets a local realtor determined to preserve his town’s heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i1z1goMHlFqjjoEkOwwm2hZEZyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1360791'),
  ('315277798879518541', '''Tis the Season to be Merry', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Gary Yates, Paul Suderman', null, 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Travis Van Winkle, Karen Malina White, Amy Groening, Paul Essiembre, Lois Brothers, John B. Lowe, Adam Hurtig', 'G', 'Looking for a fresh angle to her book on relationships, Merry heads to snow-covered Vermont. She finds a new perspective and Christmas cheer with charismatic aid worker Chris.', 'Looking for a fresh angle to her book on relationships, Merry heads to snow-covered Vermont. She finds a new perspective and Christmas cheer with charismatic aid worker Chris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/539aWeHrqkbaUz2Dw4m07zBARhU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888500'),
  ('724710317847455566', '''Twas the Fight Before Christmas', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Becky Read, Britton Foster', null, 'Jeremy Morris', 'R', 'In this true-life twist on a holiday fable, Jeremy Morris brings a whole new meaning to Christmas spirit when his extravagant seasonal display sparks a dispute with his neighbors that lands them all in court.', 'In this true-life twist on a holiday fable, Jeremy Morris brings a whole new meaning to Christmas spirit when his extravagant seasonal display sparks a dispute with his neighbors that lands them all in court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5TNSfR1OdcNHMnJV7QczdqdfaGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888652'),
  ('1147892347380578856', '''Twas the Night', 2001, 'TV Movie, Family, Comedy', 'Nick Castle, Milan Podsedlý, Jill Campbell Samson', null, 'Bryan Cranston, Josh Zuckerman, Jefferson Mappin, Brenda Grate, Barclay Hope, Torri Higginson, Rhys Williams, Sandy Robson', 'G', 'A mischievous 14-year-old boy and his irresponsible uncle almost ruin Christmas when they decide to take Santa''s new high-tech sleigh for a joyride.', 'A mischievous 14-year-old boy and his irresponsible uncle almost ruin Christmas when they decide to take Santa''s new high-tech sleigh for a joyride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVVmBXXaMM6SMvzhp3n4Wlej2CY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103014'),
  ('348881778347283280', '''Twas the Night Before Bumpy', 1995, 'Animation', 'Jerold Howard, Ken Pontac, David Bleiman Ichioka', 'Jeremy Cushner', 'Rob Paulsen, Gail Matthius, Jim Cummings, Cheech Marin, Danny Mann, Valery Pappas, Jennifer Darling', null, 'The following trio of lovable characters has emerged from every child''s imagination and landed under the bed of a young boy: Mr. Bumpy, the zany green, purple-warted mischievous sock-eating monster with the uncontrollable energy of a 10 year old, and his two best friends Squishington and Molly Coddle. The gang stars in a holiday musical adventure in which Mr. Bumpy and Squishington head for the North Pole to bag some Christmas loot. En route, the misdirected buddies are sidetracked and find themselves in the jungles of Peru - where they are held captive by an earthworm soldier.', 'The following trio of lovable characters has emerged from every child''s imagination and landed under the bed of a young boy: Mr. Bumpy, the zany green, purple-warted mischievous sock-eating monster with the uncontrollable energy of a 10 year old, and his two best friends Squishington and Molly Coddle. The gang stars in a holiday musical adventure in which Mr. Bumpy and Squishington head for the North Pole to bag some Christmas loot. En route, the misdirected buddies are sidetracked and find themselves in the jungles of Peru - where they are held captive by an earthworm soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mTNGyMmljbv26sfZhC8rve6vgx1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151150'),
  ('904665109997879930', '''Twas the Night Before Christmas', 1974, 'Animation, Family', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Jerome Coopersmith', 'Joel Grey, George Gobel, Tammy Grimes, John McGiver, Patricia Bright, Scott Firestone, Christine Winter, Allen Swift', 'NR', 'When a town learns that Santa Claus has struck it off his delivery schedule due to an insulting letter, a way must be found to change his mind.', 'When a town learns that Santa Claus has struck it off his delivery schedule due to an insulting letter, a way must be found to change his mind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5qPfBSeKjNbFPl1CseOUSNqKGe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26547'),
  ('450929181375516245', '''Twas the Night Before Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Shawna Steele, Gary Yates, William Smith', 'Gary Yates, C. Jay Cox', 'Torrey DeVitto, Zane Holtz, Shawn Ahmed, Amanda Barker, Tanisha Thammavongsa, Richard Waugh, Jennie Esnard, Ava Weiss', 'G', 'A former actress trying to break into directing tests her skills with a town’s annual Christmas Eve courtroom production in which the true authorship of the famous poem “A Visit from St. Nick” is debated.', 'A former actress trying to break into directing tests her skills with a town’s annual Christmas Eve courtroom production in which the true authorship of the famous poem “A Visit from St. Nick” is debated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTpIRq1CzhLiAu5zUIhVPV6cj80.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028547'),
  ('509794798521180507', '''Twas the Text Before Christmas', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'T.W. Peacocke, Paul Mitchnick', 'Cara J. Russell', 'Merritt Patterson, Trevor Donovan, Rob Stewart, Jayne Eastwood, Marisa McIntyre, Peyton Boulley, Derek Moran, Tara Andrea', 'PG', 'Addie is a New York City chiropractor mistakenly receives a text from “Nana.” The accidental text turns into a loving friendship between the matronly Nana and Addie who now communicate regularly. Nana invites Addie to spend the holiday in Vermont. It is picture-postcard perfect and exactly as Nana described except for one surprise. Nana’s single son, James, a traveling doctor is also home for the holidays. Over three consecutive years, James and Addie are together during the holidays, though it isn’t until they are both single that they begin to see each other in a different light.', 'Addie is a New York City chiropractor mistakenly receives a text from “Nana.” The accidental text turns into a loving friendship between the matronly Nana and Addie who now communicate regularly. Nana invites Addie to spend the holiday in Vermont. It is picture-postcard perfect and exactly as Nana described except for one surprise. Nana’s single son, James, a traveling doctor is also home for the holidays. Over three consecutive years, James and Addie are together during the holidays, though it isn’t until they are both single that they begin to see each other in a different light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1fvQdD63RP2MS9jCB8jzg7fkdr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100642'),
  ('880168377236835027', '"..." Reel 5', 1998, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'Reel #5 of (...) is composed of scratch-imagery edited to music by James Tenney. The music starts accompanied only by black leader: then there is a sudden flare of pure white which begins to flicker with negative-colored ephemeral shapes, until finally the music and a fulsome mass of scratched images are accompanying each other. At times a distinctly different quality of colored image appears and continues for awhile (non-orange negative photography of painted film as well as picture images).', 'Reel #5 of (...) is composed of scratch-imagery edited to music by James Tenney. The music starts accompanied only by black leader: then there is a sudden flare of pure white which begins to flicker with negative-colored ephemeral shapes, until finally the music and a fulsome mass of scratched images are accompanying each other. At times a distinctly different quality of colored image appears and continues for awhile (non-orange negative photography of painted film as well as picture images).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1rr9izT7Q92FFl5iFPBSH8Q3S3w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163360'),
  ('725041932495455617', '"Pimpernel" Smith', 1941, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Leslie Howard, George Pollock, Mutz Greenbaum', 'Roland Pertwee, Anatole de Grunwald', 'Leslie Howard, Francis L. Sullivan, Mary Morris, Hugh McDermott, Raymond Huntley, Manning Whiley, Peter Gawthorne, Allan Jeayes', null, 'Eccentric Cambridge archaeologist Horatio Smith takes a group of British and American archaeology students to pre-war Nazi Germany to help in his excavations. His research is supported by the Nazis, since he professes to be looking for evidence of the Aryan origins of German civilisation. However, he has a secret agenda: to free inmates of the concentration camps.', 'Eccentric Cambridge archaeologist Horatio Smith takes a group of British and American archaeology students to pre-war Nazi Germany to help in his excavations. His research is supported by the Nazis, since he professes to be looking for evidence of the Aryan origins of German civilisation. However, he has a secret agenda: to free inmates of the concentration camps.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2MeWLt3pwvb1PMv8IT2HyFkbswI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43788'),
  ('1030070642182809231', '"Sr."', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Chris Smith, Chris Smith, Kevin Ford', null, 'Robert Downey Sr., Robert Downey Jr., Chris Smith, Alan Arkin, Sean Hayes, Norman Lear, Lawrence Wolf, Exton Elias Downey', 'R', 'A portrait of the life and career of Robert Downey Sr. (1936-2021), the visionary and fearless US filmmaker — father of actor Robert Downey Jr. — who in the sixties and seventies laid the foundations for countercultural comedy.', 'A portrait of the life and career of Robert Downey Sr. (1936-2021), the visionary and fearless US filmmaker — father of actor Robert Downey Jr. — who in the sixties and seventies laid the foundations for countercultural comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lyqE4OQaEvNvNQwngsZH9xzg4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013577'),
  ('1060476482430302809', '"Wuthering Heights"', 2026, 'Romance, Drama', 'Emerald Fennell, Andy Madden, Linus Sandgren', 'Emerald Fennell', 'Margot Robbie, Jacob Elordi, Hong Chau, Alison Oliver, Shazad Latif, Martin Clunes, Ewan Mitchell, Amy Morgan', 'R', 'Tragedy strikes when Heathcliff falls in love with Catherine Earnshaw, a woman from a wealthy family in 18th-century England.', 'Tragedy strikes when Heathcliff falls in love with Catherine Earnshaw, a woman from a wealthy family in 18th-century England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3YBce6dTh1D5oCMITXk2S5QhPt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1316092'),
