  ('981489257793455255', '«5/4»', 1990, 'Animation', 'Ivan Maximov', null, null, null, 'A small being transported water to the sound of the very famous song ''Take Five'' by The Dave Brubeck Quartet.', 'A small being transported water to the sound of the very famous song ''Take Five'' by The Dave Brubeck Quartet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reV1QpwJTCpuD0QAkEbCbDAuc2c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351328'),
  ('431934036823772838', '(500) Days of Summer', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Marc Webb, Eric Steelberg', 'Michael H. Weber, Scott Neustadter', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Zooey Deschanel, Geoffrey Arend, Chloë Grace Moretz, Matthew Gray Gubler, Clark Gregg, Patricia Belcher, Rachel Boston', 'PG-13', 'Tom, greeting-card writer and hopeless romantic, is caught completely off-guard when his girlfriend, Summer, suddenly dumps him. He reflects on their 500 days together to try to figure out where their love affair went sour, and in doing so, Tom rediscovers his true passions in life.', 'Tom, greeting-card writer and hopeless romantic, is caught completely off-guard when his girlfriend, Summer, suddenly dumps him. He reflects on their 500 days together to try to figure out where their love affair went sour, and in doing so, Tom rediscovers his true passions in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXAuQ9hF30sQRsXf40OfRVl0MJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19913'),
  ('298548110943554423', '(Ab)normal Desire', 2023, 'Drama', 'Yoshiyuki Kishi, Takashi Matsuo, Kôzô Natsumi', 'Takehiko Minato', 'Goro Inagaki, Yui Aragaki, Hayato Isomura, Kanta Sato, Ayaka Higashino, Maho Yamada, Nozomi Bando, Shohei Uno', null, 'Director Yoshiyuki Kishi and screenwriter Takehito Minato—the team behind acclaimed boxing epic Wilderness—reunite to adapt Ryo Asai''s prize-winning novel. A sensitive drama about the aberrant in a society without regard for diversity, the story unites characters trying to hide abnormalities: a prosecutor who is worried that his pubescent son is a shut-in, an introverted saleswoman with a peculiar habit, and a student tortured by feelings she can’t express. In a world fill with abnormalities, what if it’s actually normal to be abnormal?', 'Director Yoshiyuki Kishi and screenwriter Takehito Minato—the team behind acclaimed boxing epic Wilderness—reunite to adapt Ryo Asai''s prize-winning novel. A sensitive drama about the aberrant in a society without regard for diversity, the story unites characters trying to hide abnormalities: a prosecutor who is worried that his pubescent son is a shut-in, an introverted saleswoman with a peculiar habit, and a student tortured by feelings she can’t express. In a world fill with abnormalities, what if it’s actually normal to be abnormal?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdTgQsYXf5xQBoxSo7NhYTnd1Ar.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025444'),
  ('927024738046012971', '(Be)Longing', 2015, 'Documentary', 'João Pedro Plácido, João Pedro Plácido', 'Laurence Ferreira Barbosa, João Pedro Plácido', 'Daniel Xavier Pereira, António Guimarães, Daniela Barroso', null, 'At Uz, an isolated hamlet in the northern mountains of Portugal, four generations live together in a group of around fifty people. When life is rough, solidarity is of the highest order. Everything else is left in God’s hands. They could have emigrated, like so many others, but chose to stay and keep their ancestral way of life, away from the racket of modernity.', 'At Uz, an isolated hamlet in the northern mountains of Portugal, four generations live together in a group of around fifty people. When life is rough, solidarity is of the highest order. Everything else is left in God’s hands. They could have emigrated, like so many others, but chose to stay and keep their ancestral way of life, away from the racket of modernity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d9WcOlaJqzsrKJGa3beUC4QbP5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302314'),
  ('216003740850988200', '(Blooper) Bunny!', 1997, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Greg Ford, Terry Lennon', null, 'Jeff Bergman, Gordon Hunt', null, 'A behind-the-scenes look at the making of "The Bugs Bunny 51st-and-a-Half Anniversary Spectacular," complete with shaky camera and a variety of outtakes from stars Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck, Elmer Fudd, and Yosemite Sam.', 'A behind-the-scenes look at the making of "The Bugs Bunny 51st-and-a-Half Anniversary Spectacular," complete with shaky camera and a variety of outtakes from stars Bugs Bunny, Daffy Duck, Elmer Fudd, and Yosemite Sam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUXOkwRSKcrnA7q0we84Iorkb3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197748'),
  ('511493340479941822', '(Des)controle', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Rosane Svartman, Carol Minêm, Mauro Pinheiro Jr.', 'Iafa Britz, Rosane Svartman, Felipe Sholl', 'Carolina Dieckmmann, Júlia Rabello, Caco Ciocler, Irene Ravache, Daniel Filho', null, 'At a turbulent time in her life and career, an overwhelmed writer seeking relief returns to drinking after 15 years of sobriety, but goes from a simple glass of wine to total loss of control.', 'At a turbulent time in her life and career, an overwhelmed writer seeking relief returns to drinking after 15 years of sobriety, but goes from a simple glass of wine to total loss of control.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fk5OmRX7YdJNaged0RuGYiCBDeUt.jpg', 'plex:movie:descontrole-2026'),
  ('1056387458328625254', '(Dis)Honesty: The Truth About Lies', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Yael Melamede, Tom Hurwitz', 'Chad Beck, Yael Melamede', 'Dan Ariely', 'NR', 'Documentary exploring the human tendency to be dishonest. Inspired by the work of social scientist, Dan Ariely, the film interweaves personal stories, expert opinions, behavioral experiments, and archival footage to reveal how and why people lie.', 'Documentary exploring the human tendency to be dishonest. Inspired by the work of social scientist, Dan Ariely, the film interweaves personal stories, expert opinions, behavioral experiments, and archival footage to reveal how and why people lie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqn5YPQySbYgum0VJzOZza8gOsq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329750'),
  ('693651461133669130', '(Girl)Friend', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Victor Saint Macary', 'Benjamin Charbit, Thomas Cailley, Audrey Diwan', 'William Lebghil, Margot Bancilhon, Camille Razat, Jonathan Cohen, Béatrice de Staël, Hubert Saint-Macary, Christophe Odent, Marie-Christine Orry', null, 'Vincent and Nefeli just moved in together. They''re best friends and swore to never fall in love again. That is until Vincent meets Julie.', 'Vincent and Nefeli just moved in together. They''re best friends and swore to never fall in love again. That is until Vincent meets Julie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIIXWCg9tBgjGhKjAR8IdZ3TuDN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470211'),
  ('931994366332127844', '(Im)perfetti Criminali', 2022, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alessio Maria Federici, Manfredo Archinto', 'Giovanni Galassi, Luca Federico, Ivano Fachin', 'Filippo Scicchitano, Fabio Balsamo, Guglielmo Poggi, Babak Karimi, Matteo Martari, Anna Ferzetti, Marouane Zotti, Rocío Muñoz Morales', null, 'Riccardo, Amir, Pietro and Massimo, four security guards, not particularly brilliant or courageous, are bound by an indissoluble friendship. When Amir, who has a large family to support, loses his job, the other three feel called to help him at any cost. Going from a bad idea to an impromptu criminal plan, the four friends will find themselves in a whirlwind of encounters, adventures and pitfalls, but also some surprises. Because our heroes still have more than one trick up their sleeve…', 'Riccardo, Amir, Pietro and Massimo, four security guards, not particularly brilliant or courageous, are bound by an indissoluble friendship. When Amir, who has a large family to support, loses his job, the other three feel called to help him at any cost. Going from a bad idea to an impromptu criminal plan, the four friends will find themselves in a whirlwind of encounters, adventures and pitfalls, but also some surprises. Because our heroes still have more than one trick up their sleeve…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKlHgIyM4Ou4F0cW1R0HvgRcV1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884129'),
