  ('151246339843720324', '(re)kindle', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aron Matschulat Aguiar', 'Aron Matschulat Aguiar', 'Joana Dória, Manuela Afonso', null, 'Ana and Helen, two divorced women, were close friends as teenagers. Today, amidst the corona virus pandemic and in quarantine, they get in touch after 20 years via internet. Through video conference calls, memories, sensations and emotions reflourishes.', 'Ana and Helen, two divorced women, were close friends as teenagers. Today, amidst the corona virus pandemic and in quarantine, they get in touch after 20 years via internet. Through video conference calls, memories, sensations and emotions reflourishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s72KUZGSTvRlRSyIhRKnevvO0G2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:984945'),
  ('16130653538230922', '(T)Raumschiff Surprise - Periode 1', 2004, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Michael Twinem, Andrea Kapeller, Oliver Klein', null, 'Michael Herbig, Rick Kavanian, Christian Tramitz, Anja Kling, Til Schweiger, Sky du Mont, Hans-Michael Rehberg, Hans Peter Hallwachs', null, 'Hundreds of years after humans have settled on Mars, Regulator Rogul and Lord Jens Maul, lead a force of Martians to Earth in order to conquer the planet. Queen Metaphor looks to the gay heroes aboard the spaceship Surprise -- Captain Kork, Mr. Spuck, and first engineer Schrotty -- for help.', 'Hundreds of years after humans have settled on Mars, Regulator Rogul and Lord Jens Maul, lead a force of Martians to Earth in order to conquer the planet. Queen Metaphor looks to the gay heroes aboard the spaceship Surprise -- Captain Kork, Mr. Spuck, and first engineer Schrotty -- for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60YgMkDDwobP4JXwc2hOFa2VmGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9805'),
