  ('1068056842507767940', '*batteries not included', 1987, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'John McPherson, Matthew Robbins, Richard C. Kratina', 'Matthew Robbins, Brent Maddock, S.S. Wilson', 'Hume Cronyn, Jessica Tandy, Frank McRae, Elizabeth Peña, Michael Carmine, Dennis Boutsikaris, Tom Aldredge, Jane Hoffman', 'PG', 'In a soon to be demolished block of apartments, the residents resist the criminal methods used to force them to leave so a greedy tycoon can build his new skyscraper. When tiny mechanical aliens land for a recharge, they decide to stay and help out.', 'In a soon to be demolished block of apartments, the residents resist the criminal methods used to force them to leave so a greedy tycoon can build his new skyscraper. When tiny mechanical aliens land for a recharge, they decide to stay and help out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8NkpnpdLd8J6zCR8ZGTeGTur4uO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11548'),
