  ('654777215303367430', '#SalveRosa', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Susanna Lira, Lílis Soares', 'Ângela Hirata Fabri', 'Klara Castanho, Karine Teles, Ricardo Teodoro, Indira Nascimento, Alana Cabral, Julia Helen, Cláudio Mendes, Juliana Guimarães', null, 'A young influencer decides to investigate her past after fainting at school. What she discovers puts not only her relationship with her overprotective mother at risk, but also her own life.', 'A young influencer decides to investigate her past after fainting at school. What she discovers puts not only her relationship with her overprotective mother at risk, but also her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCivukZVNGjvj7VGwsPMFFHq0Zx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1280234'),
