  ('389695314258484293', '#Stayhome', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Gianluca Palma, Roan Johnson, Giulia Cosentino', 'Roan Johnson', 'Dario Aita, Tommaso Ragno, Giordana Faggiano, Lorenzo Frediani, Martina Sammarco, Fabio Traversa, Natalia Lungu, Leonardo Maddalena', null, 'The world out there is halted by a pandemic, and during lockdown, an apartment in Rome becomes the same as one in Milan, Naples, Paris, and New York. Each one lives a story identical to all the others, yet unique and personal. Four young people under thirty have been sharing an apartment for some time and, stopped by the infection, find themselves facing shadows bigger than living there. The opportunity to make some easy money at the expense of their shady landlord will lead to a crescendo of tension and delirium. The young people''s choices and actions will become increasingly ambiguous as the consequences upend their dreams and hopes, fears and loves, until the unexpected ending.', 'The world out there is halted by a pandemic, and during lockdown, an apartment in Rome becomes the same as one in Milan, Naples, Paris, and New York. Each one lives a story identical to all the others, yet unique and personal. Four young people under thirty have been sharing an apartment for some time and, stopped by the infection, find themselves facing shadows bigger than living there. The opportunity to make some easy money at the expense of their shady landlord will lead to a crescendo of tension and delirium. The young people''s choices and actions will become increasingly ambiguous as the consequences upend their dreams and hopes, fears and loves, until the unexpected ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5eIsRMO9BYkNH8Z6Eg6QiLKlyYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798200'),
  ('523818487825880431', '#UNFIT: The Psychology of Donald Trump', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Dan Partland', 'Dan Partland', 'George Thomas Conway III, Malcolm Nance, John Gartner, Lance Dodes, Justin Frank, Anthony Scaramucci, William Kristol, Richard Painter', null, 'Medical doctors and mental health professionals go on camera, on the record, for the record, for a discussion, analysis, and science-based examination of the behavior, psyche, condition, and stability of President Donald Trump. Also examines Trump''s effect on our citizenry, culture, and institutions.', 'Medical doctors and mental health professionals go on camera, on the record, for the record, for a discussion, analysis, and science-based examination of the behavior, psyche, condition, and stability of President Donald Trump. Also examines Trump''s effect on our citizenry, culture, and institutions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DgSiNMiHh1JreAOjWseAO3vyJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:581802'),
  ('677396337943076372', '#Xmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Heather Hawthorn-Doyle, Mel Ward', 'Joie Botkin, Emily Baer', 'Brant Daugherty, Clare Bowen, Sebastian Stewart, William MacDonald, Matt Clarke, Karen Kruper, Lillian Doucet-Roche, Greg Kean', 'G', 'When Jen gets the chance to enter a brand’s design contest, she poses as a family influencer, enlisting the help of her best friend, Max, and her baby nephew. When her video is selected as a finalist, Jen is torn on whether to go on with her perfect “family” or reveal the truth.', 'When Jen gets the chance to enter a brand’s design contest, she poses as a family influencer, enlisting the help of her best friend, Max, and her baby nephew. When her video is selected as a finalist, Jen is torn on whether to go on with her perfect “family” or reveal the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/675FCHUSN10vzfW4V2BB2udHxdb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028550'),
