  ('206139600693945511', '10,000 Km', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Carlos Marques-Marcet, Dagmar Weaver-Madsen', 'Clara Roquet, Carlos Marques-Marcet', 'Natalia Tena, David Verdaguer', null, 'Two people in love, two apartments - one in Barcelona and another in Los Angeles - and the images of their past, present and future. Can love survive 10,000 km?', 'Two people in love, two apartments - one in Barcelona and another in Los Angeles - and the images of their past, present and future. Can love survive 10,000 km?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxBhKSu1HY9elCiJ3u64oPEcNLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253251'),
  ('1133190845289813691', '10,000 Saints', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Shari Springer Berman, Ben Kutchins, Robert Pulcini', 'Shari Springer Berman, Robert Pulcini', 'Ethan Hawke, Asa Butterfield, Emily Mortimer, Julianne Nicholson, Hailee Steinfeld, Emile Hirsch, Avan Jogia, Nadia Alexander', 'R', 'A sweeping multigenerational story set against the backdrop of the raw, roaring New York City of the late 1980s; adoption, teen pregnancy, drugs, hardcore punk rock, the unbridled optimism and reckless stupidity of the young—and old—are all major elements in this heart-aching tale of the son of diehard hippies and his strange odyssey through the extremes of late 20th century youth culture.', 'A sweeping multigenerational story set against the backdrop of the raw, roaring New York City of the late 1980s; adoption, teen pregnancy, drugs, hardcore punk rock, the unbridled optimism and reckless stupidity of the young—and old—are all major elements in this heart-aching tale of the son of diehard hippies and his strange odyssey through the extremes of late 20th century youth culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zZpQfrdXhNq5sqMMzDQkpqZQxXq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:253406'),
  ('1020712583226804408', '10:30 P.M. Summer', 1966, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jules Dassin, Gábor Pogány', 'Jules Dassin, Marguerite Duras', 'Melina Mercouri, Romy Schneider, Peter Finch, Julián Mateos, Isabel María Pérez, Beatriz Savón, Juan Estelrich March, Tota Alba', 'NR', 'A female traveling companion seduces a married man and his alcoholic wife.', 'A female traveling companion seduces a married man and his alcoholic wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEEifnz7dswBLA5hAIBe2xTHRaj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3008'),
  ('946263945458853000', '10.0 Earthquake', 2014, 'Drama, Adventure, Action', 'David Gidali, Damian Horan', 'Nancy Leopardi, Alex Greenfield', 'Heather Sossaman, Henry Ian Cusick, Cameron Richardson, Chasty Ballesteros, Jeffrey Jones, Kristen Dalton, Olivia Jordan, Malcolm Barrett', null, 'Los Angeles is about to be hit by a devastating earthquake, and time is running out to save the city from imminent danger.', 'Los Angeles is about to be hit by a devastating earthquake, and time is running out to save the city from imminent danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xk2XMdPM29ETA491JVEBj1BhJ7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:302666'),
  ('900744389094258413', '10/65: Self-Mutilation', 1965, 'Drama, Horror', 'Kurt Kren', null, 'Günter Brus', null, 'Kren’s 10/65 Selfmutilation is developed from a Gunter Brus “action”. What the film emphasizes is the surrealistic drama of symbolic self-destruction that Kren drew out of Brus’ action, pacing out each gesture so that one gets a tense, iconoclastic revelation of a man covered in white plaster lying surrounded by razor blades and a range of instruments looking as if they have been taken from an operating theatre. The blades, scissors and scalpels are gradually inserted into him in a ritualistic self-operation. (Stephen Dwoskin)', 'Kren’s 10/65 Selfmutilation is developed from a Gunter Brus “action”. What the film emphasizes is the surrealistic drama of symbolic self-destruction that Kren drew out of Brus’ action, pacing out each gesture so that one gets a tense, iconoclastic revelation of a man covered in white plaster lying surrounded by razor blades and a range of instruments looking as if they have been taken from an operating theatre. The blades, scissors and scalpels are gradually inserted into him in a ritualistic self-operation. (Stephen Dwoskin)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35Yu6MXOrux6Re493X2jdEFFgNW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196035'),
  ('610511850003574291', '100 Bloody Acres', 2012, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Colin Cairnes, Cameron Cairnes, John Brawley', 'Colin Cairnes, Cameron Cairnes', 'Damon Herriman, Angus Sampson, Anna McGahan, John Jarratt, Oliver Ackland, Jamie Kristian, Chrissie Page, Paul Blackwell', 'R', 'Reg and Lindsay run an organic fertiliser business. They need a fresh supply of their "secret ingredient" to process through the meat grinder. Reg comes across two guys and a girl with a broken-down vehicle on their way to a music festival.', 'Reg and Lindsay run an organic fertiliser business. They need a fresh supply of their "secret ingredient" to process through the meat grinder. Reg comes across two guys and a girl with a broken-down vehicle on their way to a music festival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYUolYFQ7F8E2rEunRNwtbpLwmW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126757'),
  ('1082716941051530381', '100 Candles Game: The Last Possession', 2023, 'Horror', 'Guillermo Lockhart, Maximilian Niemann, Carlos Goitia', 'Camilo Zaffora', 'Magui Bravi, Nacho Francavilla, Josefina Inés Fariña, Justina Ceballos, Zhon Li, Agustin Olcese, Pachi Lucas, Iago Illescas', null, 'Influencer bloggers evoke spirit of vanished "black countess" during ritual at her mansion. She disappeared playing dimensional game. Their ritual unleashes otherworldly demons, and survivors must banish them back.', 'Influencer bloggers evoke spirit of vanished "black countess" during ritual at her mansion. She disappeared playing dimensional game. Their ritual unleashes otherworldly demons, and survivors must banish them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hTBpHgivJQtdsjFPgAc3U8KxSX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211728'),
