  ('891719695069450561', '100 Days', 1991, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Partho Ghosh', 'Devjyoti Roy, Bhushan Banmali', 'Jackie Shroff, Madhuri Dixit, Javed Jaffrey, Laxmikant Berde, Moon Moon Sen, Sabeeha, Ajit Vachani, Jay Kalgutkar', null, 'Devi is gifted with Extra Sensory Perception (ESP). Her gift comes to light one day while playing tennis with her friend, Sudha, when she has a vision of her sister, Rama, being shot to death by a man in a black raincoat. She telephones Rama, finds she is safe and is relieved. Shortly thereafter Rama disappears, the police are notified, but are unable to find any trace of her. Devi then meets multi-millionaire, Ram Kumar, both fall in love and get married. She moves into his once abandoned and legally disputed bungalow, and that''s when she starts having visions again. These visions lead her to a wall that is loosely plastered', 'Devi is gifted with Extra Sensory Perception (ESP). Her gift comes to light one day while playing tennis with her friend, Sudha, when she has a vision of her sister, Rama, being shot to death by a man in a black raincoat. She telephones Rama, finds she is safe and is relieved. Shortly thereafter Rama disappears, the police are notified, but are unable to find any trace of her. Devi then meets multi-millionaire, Ram Kumar, both fall in love and get married. She moves into his once abandoned and legally disputed bungalow, and that''s when she starts having visions again. These visions lead her to a wall that is loosely plastered', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZJcxCrwjBl9bRLwOD8u5HfDT0x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55627'),
  ('803987736628064839', '100 Days Before the Command', 1991, 'Drama', 'Hussein Erkenov, Vladislav Menshikov', 'Vladimir Kholodov, Yuri Polyakov', 'Vladimir Zamanskiy, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Oleg Vasilkov, Roman Grekov, Valery Troshin, Aleksandr Chislov, Mikhail Solomatin, Sergei Rozhentsev', null, 'Hussein Erkenov''s courageous and stinging indictment of communism. Five young Red Army recruits struggle for survival against the merciless violence that surrounds them on a daily basis. Their only means of saving their dignity is by preserving the humanity and compassion they share for each other.', 'Hussein Erkenov''s courageous and stinging indictment of communism. Five young Red Army recruits struggle for survival against the merciless violence that surrounds them on a daily basis. Their only means of saving their dignity is by preserving the humanity and compassion they share for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RijQWf4W5KEUqZAsRBo5OHxhgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19830'),
  ('142717644952938673', '100 Days Love Story', 2026, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Vijay Mitra', 'Vijay Mitra', 'Jai Siva Surya, Nikhitha Sri, Isha Monohari Priya, Akella, Gayathri Arasavelli', null, 'Its love story about a broken man who falls in love with another girl, after that he know she was sister of murderer of his girl friend but her love changes him a lot, the past love came as ghost and take revenge on them', 'Its love story about a broken man who falls in love with another girl, after that he know she was sister of murderer of his girl friend but her love changes him a lot, the past love came as ghost and take revenge on them', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZmYyMzhhMTktYjE3YS00ODVmLTllNmYtYTYzYmE3NmY5MmNkXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:100-days-love-story'),
