  ('1031680019869474417', '100 Degrees Below Zero', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'John Mehrer, Judit Bánházi, Gergely Porvai', 'H. Perry Horton, Richard Schenkman', 'John Rhys-Davies, Jeff Fahey, Judit Fekete, Andray Johnson, Sara Malakul Lane, Jane Doole, Iván Kamarás, Luke Healy', 'NR', 'After freak climate and weather events destroy the world around them, a group of rogue scientists attempt to reverse the deadly new ice age.', 'After freak climate and weather events destroy the world around them, a group of rogue scientists attempt to reverse the deadly new ice age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1keE9oReldd7QmG8epHoY23jQXv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182228'),
