  ('1036646673108335152', '100 Feet', 2008, 'Horror', 'Eric Red, Ken Kelsch, Michelangelo Csaba Bolla', 'Eric Red', 'Famke Janssen, Bobby Cannavale, Ed Westwick, Michael Paré, Patricia Charbonneau, John Fallon, Kevin Geer, Tibor Pálffy', 'R', 'After Marnie Watson kills her abusive husband in self-defense, she is condemned to house arrest... only to discover that the house is possessed by the enraged and violent spirit of her dead husband.', 'After Marnie Watson kills her abusive husband in self-defense, she is condemned to house arrest... only to discover that the house is possessed by the enraged and violent spirit of her dead husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ryocnetNNLWs0Oefkqkea6HccqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14098'),
  ('465338002811058237', '100 Girls', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'James Lawrence Spencer, Michael Davis, D. Alan Newman', 'Michael Davis', 'Jonathan Tucker, Emmanuelle Chriqui, James DeBello, Katherine Heigl, Larisa Oleynik, Jaime Pressly, Marissa Ribisi, Johnny Green', 'R', 'Matthew, a college freshman, meets his dream girl in a dorm elevator during a blackout. He never sees her face, but instantly falls in love. In the morning, the power is restored, but the "dream girl" has vanished. All Matthew knows is that she lives in an all-girls dorm. He sets out on a semester-long journey to find his mystery girl among a hundred female suspects. Could it be Wendy? Dora? Arlene? Patty? Cynthia? Or the 95 other girls, any of whom could have been in that elevator with Matthew.', 'Matthew, a college freshman, meets his dream girl in a dorm elevator during a blackout. He never sees her face, but instantly falls in love. In the morning, the power is restored, but the "dream girl" has vanished. All Matthew knows is that she lives in an all-girls dorm. He sets out on a semester-long journey to find his mystery girl among a hundred female suspects. Could it be Wendy? Dora? Arlene? Patty? Cynthia? Or the 95 other girls, any of whom could have been in that elevator with Matthew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sspDghFACtzitHyNV4sMBQcQKsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10035'),
  ('680547482945976619', '100 grams for Bravery', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Anatoli Markelov, Boris Bushmelev, Georgi Shchukin', 'Viktoriya Tokareva, Grigori Gorin, Nikolai Pushkov', 'Igor Yasulovich, Yuriy Kuzmenkov, Vladimir Basov, Mikhail Svetin, Mykola Hrynko, Boryslav Brondukov, Tatyana Vasileva, Aleksandr Belyavskiy', null, 'The movie consists of three short stories that share a common satirical theme: alcoholism and drunkenness. The stories are "Such an imprudence!," "According to the laws of hospitality," "100 grams for bravery".', 'The movie consists of three short stories that share a common satirical theme: alcoholism and drunkenness. The stories are "Such an imprudence!," "According to the laws of hospitality," "100 grams for bravery".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iHydIJc7jHBSGiqOXHkkN6NAD6h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77720'),
  ('34032254822303850', '100 Liters of Gold', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Teemu Nikki, Jarmo Kiuru, Tuula Nikkola', 'Teemu Nikki', 'Elina Knihtilä, Pirjo Lonka, Ville Tiihonen, Ria Kataja, Jakob Öhrman, Elmer Bäck, Jari Pehkonen, Pertti Sveholm', null, 'Middle-aged sisters Taina and Pirkko are famous for their Finnish farmhouse ale called “sahti”. The third sister, Päivi, is getting married, and she asks her sisters if they can make 100 liters of sahti for the wedding. Unfortunately, it’s too good not to drink it. The sisters wake up in a horrible hangover and realize they have drunk it all. They have 24 hours to find 100 liters of good sahti, or they will lose all the respect.', 'Middle-aged sisters Taina and Pirkko are famous for their Finnish farmhouse ale called “sahti”. The third sister, Päivi, is getting married, and she asks her sisters if they can make 100 liters of sahti for the wedding. Unfortunately, it’s too good not to drink it. The sisters wake up in a horrible hangover and realize they have drunk it all. They have 24 hours to find 100 liters of good sahti, or they will lose all the respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzcuxURPVLEDaeooIAOTcFENlLt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1204016'),
  ('92791992877838590', '100 Meters', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Xavi Giménez, Marcel Barrena', 'Marcel Barrena', 'Dani Rovira, Alexandra Jiménez, Karra Elejalde, Maria de Medeiros, David Verdaguer, Andrea Trepat, Bruno Bergonzini, Clara Segura', null, 'Based on the incredibly true story of a Spanish man with Multiple Sclerosis who tried to finish an Iron-Man: 3,8km swimming, 180km cycling and 42 running. And he was told that he could not make 100 meters.', 'Based on the incredibly true story of a Spanish man with Multiple Sclerosis who tried to finish an Iron-Man: 3,8km swimming, 180km cycling and 42 running. And he was told that he could not make 100 meters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqrRtRwH4qNMYA1xKTGLD9kvKK1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402693'),
  ('866925177900998764', '100 METERS', 2025, 'Animation, Drama', 'Kenji Iwaisawa, Maaki Komazuki, Takahiro Ikeda', 'Yasuyuki Muto', 'Tori Matsuzaka, Shota Sometani, Yuma Uchida, Koki Uchiyama, Kenjiro Tsuda, Jun Kasama, Rie Takahashi, Yuki Tanaka', 'NR', 'A gifted runner trains a determined but unskilled classmate, unaware he''s creating a rival who will challenge him on the track for years to come.', 'A gifted runner trains a determined but unskilled classmate, unaware he''s creating a rival who will challenge him on the track for years to come.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w2pzrRTevXrW3vgIK4CCYaXvtIc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1295026'),
  ('1004840340438234516', '100 Million!', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Nath Dumont, Christel Bordon, Gérard Moulévrier', 'Nicola Cuvelier-Mella, Nath Dumont', 'Kad Merad, Michèle Laroque, Martin Karmann, Jade-Rose Parker, Fatsah Bouyahmed, Guy Lecluyse, Heza Botto, Arielle Sémenoff', null, 'A printing house worker and union leader inherits EUR100m, but the windfall costs him his job and puts his marriage at risk.', 'A printing house worker and union leader inherits EUR100m, but the windfall costs him his job and puts his marriage at risk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2i6ajHwV6lcIWgLw4CbDWgoYvU5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309410'),
  ('674811506609739951', '100 Numaralı Adam', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Osman F. Seden, Arif Erkus, Zafer Par', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Oya Aydoğan, Leman Akçatepe, Ali Şen, Feridun Şavlı, Cem Erman, Osman F. Seden, Oya Akkartal', null, 'A poor young man chosen by a advertising company, and they made him a public hero to make him advertise poor quality products that no one buys.', 'A poor young man chosen by a advertising company, and they made him a public hero to make him advertise poor quality products that no one buys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mL87572Gurwi5YWNMY9oWWaEZ5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52281'),
  ('419616746793257036', '100 Rifles', 1969, 'Adventure, Western, War', 'Tom Gries, Cecilio Paniagua, Chuck Roberson', 'Clair Huffaker, Tom Gries', 'Jim Brown, Raquel Welch, Burt Reynolds, Fernando Lamas, Dan O''Herlihy, Eric Braeden, Aldo Sambrell, Soledad Miranda', 'PG', 'When half-breed Indian Yaqui Joe robs an Arizona bank, he is pursued by dogged lawman Lyedecker. Fleeing to Mexico, Joe is imprisoned by General Verdugo, who is waging a war against the Yaqui Indians. When Lyedecker attempts to intervene, he is thrown into prison as well. Working together, the two escape and take refuge in the hills, where Lyedecker meets beautiful Yaqui freedom fighter Sarita and begins to question his allegiances.', 'When half-breed Indian Yaqui Joe robs an Arizona bank, he is pursued by dogged lawman Lyedecker. Fleeing to Mexico, Joe is imprisoned by General Verdugo, who is waging a war against the Yaqui Indians. When Lyedecker attempts to intervene, he is thrown into prison as well. Working together, the two escape and take refuge in the hills, where Lyedecker meets beautiful Yaqui freedom fighter Sarita and begins to question his allegiances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slmaFStLZ0RMaWopC1xMT125cXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37308'),
  ('309183623981929915', '100 Streets', 2016, 'Drama', 'Jim O''Hanlon, Philipp Blaubach, Charlie Endean', 'Leon Butler', 'Idris Elba, Gemma Arterton, Tom Cullen, Ryan Gage, Kierston Wareing, Franz Drameh, Ken Stott, Charlie Creed-Miles', null, 'Three extraordinary stories covering infidelity, adoption, and a drug dealer turned actor intertwine as characters meet in the streets of London.', 'Three extraordinary stories covering infidelity, adoption, and a drug dealer turned actor intertwine as characters meet in the streets of London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1s5j2raM0vSQ5pqB41TKN44oO0d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334532'),
  ('1070316363330200510', '100 Sundays', 2023, 'Drama', 'Antonio Albanese, Francesca Polic Greco, Riccardo Vincentini', 'Antonio Albanese, Piero Guerrera', 'Antonio Albanese, Liliana Bottone, Sandra Ceccarelli, Bebo Storti, Maurizio Donadoni, Elio De Capitani, Giulia Lazzarini, Donatella Bartoli', null, 'Antonio, a former shipyard worker, leads a mild and peaceful life: he plays bowls with friends, takes care of his elderly mother, has an ex-wife with whom he is on excellent terms and Emilia, his only and beloved daughter When Emilia announces to him one day that she has decided to get married, Antonio is filled with joy, he can finally fulfill his dream by giving her the reception they have always dreamed of together being able to count on the savings of a lifetime.However, the bank of which he has always been a client seems to be hiding something, the employees are suddenly elusive and the director inexplicably changes constantly.The task of paying for his daughter''s wedding will prove increasingly difficult and Antonio will discover, against his will, that those who keep our treasures don''t always keep our dreams as well.', 'Antonio, a former shipyard worker, leads a mild and peaceful life: he plays bowls with friends, takes care of his elderly mother, has an ex-wife with whom he is on excellent terms and Emilia, his only and beloved daughter When Emilia announces to him one day that she has decided to get married, Antonio is filled with joy, he can finally fulfill his dream by giving her the reception they have always dreamed of together being able to count on the savings of a lifetime.However, the bank of which he has always been a client seems to be hiding something, the employees are suddenly elusive and the director inexplicably changes constantly.The task of paying for his daughter''s wedding will prove increasingly difficult and Antonio will discover, against his will, that those who keep our treasures don''t always keep our dreams as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yVYTR3TA8c3eoHPAg2lwt3UBWmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013221'),
  ('732179422999600446', '100 Things', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Florian David Fitz, Jana Filzhuth, Pia Schlipphak', 'Florian David Fitz', 'Florian David Fitz, Matthias Schweighöfer, Miriam Stein, Hannelore Elsner, Wolfgang Stumph, Katharina Thalbach, Johannes Allmayer, Sarah Viktoria Frick', null, 'Best friends Toni and Paul decide to relinquish all of their belongings for 100 days, whereby they receive one of their items back on each day. During this challenge the two realize, that the only thing they cannot be without is their friendship. A story about contemporary materialism and the quest for the truly important things in life.', 'Best friends Toni and Paul decide to relinquish all of their belongings for 100 days, whereby they receive one of their items back on each day. During this challenge the two realize, that the only thing they cannot be without is their friendship. A story about contemporary materialism and the quest for the truly important things in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTfpEmMitPaOOmzRZ3NGvLhamz6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546630'),
  ('1000160295862625871', '100 Ways to Murder Your Wife', 1986, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kenny Bee', 'Alex Law Kai-Yui', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Joey Wong, Kenny Bee, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Wong Jing, Anthony Chan Yau, Shing Fui-On, Wu Ma', null, 'Two men, Fat and Roberto, are both married and unhappy. Together they make diverse plans to murder their wives.', 'Two men, Fat and Roberto, are both married and unhappy. Together they make diverse plans to murder their wives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8ZmCqrdYMulB3O0mf1n2bSFH0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147590'),
  ('790566820873824172', '100 Women', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Davis, James Lawrence Spencer', 'Michael Davis', 'Chad Donella, Jennifer Morrison, Erinn Bartlett, Steve Monroe, Chene Lawson, Juleah Weikel, A.J. Buckley, Clint Howard', 'R', 'A young man returns to his ex-girlfriend and true love to discover the source of her increasing depression. As the young man earnestly tries to help his girlfriend through her troubles, their love begins to bloom.', 'A young man returns to his ex-girlfriend and true love to discover the source of her increasing depression. As the young man earnestly tries to help his girlfriend through her troubles, their love begins to bloom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ssSg7Bm05i4QRIQWdkGKLpALQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20648'),
  ('881120171415876094', '100 Yards', 2024, 'Action, Drama', 'Xu Junfeng, Xu Haofeng', 'Xu Haofeng', 'Jacky Heung, Andy On Chi-Kit, Bea Hayden Kuo, Tang Shiyi, Li Yuan, Zhao Zheng, Li Mei, Kevin Lee', 'PG-13', 'Set in 1920s Tianjin, northern China, and centres on the rivalry between the son of a martial arts master and his most talented apprentice. When the old master dies, the two face off to take over his prominent martial arts academy. But rather than obey the rule of settling disputes behind closed doors, they take their fight to the street.', 'Set in 1920s Tianjin, northern China, and centres on the rivalry between the son of a martial arts master and his most talented apprentice. When the old master dies, the two face off to take over his prominent martial arts academy. But rather than obey the rule of settling disputes behind closed doors, they take their fight to the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eb2p5wkvXaqleoB2dbTXxPqpk9g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1122824'),
