  ('86866729994930909', '100 Yen Love', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Masaharu Take, Hiromitsu Nishimura', 'Shin Adachi', 'Sakura Ando, Hirofumi Arai, Toshie Negishi, Miyoko Inagawa, Saori, Shohei Uno, Tadashi Sakata, Yuuki Okita', null, 'Slacker Ichiko gets into a fight with her younger sister and begins to live on her own, working the late shift at a 100 yen shop. On her way home, she passes a gym and meets boxer Kano who trains there in silence...', 'Slacker Ichiko gets into a fight with her younger sister and begins to live on her own, working the late shift at a 100 yen shop. On her way home, she passes a gym and meets boxer Kano who trains there in silence...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qbXJNb6Q7ludf5vOKptDrBniQL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314606'),
  ('593744957324364944', '100% Organic', 2020, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Fabien Onteniente', 'Fabien Onteniente', 'Didier Bourdon, Catherine Jacob, Lolita Chammah, Nicolas Bridet, Olivier Barthélémy, Thomas Goldberg, Olga Mouak, Jacques Vendroux', null, 'The daughter of a Basque butcher brings her new boyfriend — a Parisian vegan — home to meet her family.', 'The daughter of a Basque butcher brings her new boyfriend — a Parisian vegan — home to meet her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHnFRyZm8u9hby2wOxYPtyMcZTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718529'),
  ('543657701889646692', '100% Wolf', 2020, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Alexs Stadermann', 'Fin Edquist', 'Ilai Swindells, Jai Courtney, Samara Weaving, Rhys Darby, Jane Lynch, Rupert Degas, Magda Szubanski, Akmal Saleh', 'PG', 'Freddy Lupin, heir to a proud family line of werewolves, is in for a shock when on his 14th birthday his first ''warfing'' goes awry, turning him into a ferocious poodle. The pack elders give Freddy until the next moonrise to prove he has the heart of a wolf, or risk being cast out forever. With the help of an unlikely ally in a streetwise stray named Batty, Freddy must prove he''s 100% Wolf.', 'Freddy Lupin, heir to a proud family line of werewolves, is in for a shock when on his 14th birthday his first ''warfing'' goes awry, turning him into a ferocious poodle. The pack elders give Freddy until the next moonrise to prove he has the heart of a wolf, or risk being cast out forever. With the help of an unlikely ally in a streetwise stray named Batty, Freddy must prove he''s 100% Wolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VrvxK4yxNCU6KVgo5TADJeBEQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520946'),
  ('133629421443362808', '1000 Mabrouk', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ahmed Nader Galal, Islam Khairy, Ahmed Yousef', 'Mohamed Diab, Khaled Diab', 'Ahmed Helmy, Mahmoud ElFishawy, Laila Ezz El Arab, Mohamed Farag, Sarrah Abdelrahman, Rahma Hassan, Hani ElSabagh, Omar El Mohandes', null, 'A man finds himself stuck in a mysterious time loop, reliving the same day again and again. As the cycle repeats, he is forced to confront his daily routines, question his relationships, and search for meaning in a world that refuses to change.', 'A man finds himself stuck in a mysterious time loop, reliving the same day again and again. As the cycle repeats, he is forced to confront his daily routines, question his relationships, and search for meaning in a world that refuses to change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Dsxc1YpF95yca8aEKrSAq6y3wM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44090'),
  ('936366310560697947', '1000 Men and Me: The Bonnie Blue Story', 2025, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Victoria Silver', null, 'Bonnie Blue, Victoria Silver, Belle Delphine, Lily Phillips, Annie Knight, Josh Lee Spooner, Ermes de Cristofaro, Ollie Davidson', null, 'Adult content creator Bonnie Blue announced that she’d slept with 1057 men in 12 hours. Exploring the polarising debate around Bonnie and the pornification of our society, the film follows her over the most eye-opening six months of her life.', 'Adult content creator Bonnie Blue announced that she’d slept with 1057 men in 12 hours. Exploring the polarising debate around Bonnie and the pornification of our society, the film follows her over the most eye-opening six months of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dcgoyf8nt6Xt4VSR6Nrn6nwhuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1522126'),
  ('216819045001343456', '1000 Miles From Christmas', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Álvaro Fernández Armero, Sergi Gallardo, Federico Untermann', 'Francisco Arnal, Daniel Monedero', 'Tamar Novas, Andrea Ros, Peter Vives, Verónica Forqué, Mar del Hoyo, Raúl Jiménez, Fermí Reixach, Macarena Sanz', null, 'An auditor who completely despises Christmas is sent to a small town for work, where he meets a woman determined to change his view about the holiday.', 'An auditor who completely despises Christmas is sent to a small town for work, where he meets a woman determined to change his view about the holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXEtICgk28bDJbhrQObIfwtSgjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852590'),
  ('49783197263419310', '10000 Years Later', 2015, 'Fantasy, Animation, Action', 'Li Yi', 'Liu Yong, Li Yi, Nie Sheng-jie', 'Chong Wang, Yalayam, Joma', 'PG-13', 'Hundreds of thousands of years after the collapse of civilization, the world is a post-tech wasteland, and is inhabited by humanoid tribes. The Peace held between them is threatened by the return of Wushen, an evil shape-shifting ghost of modern technology. Wushen threatens to enslave the world population. Zhuma, a ten-year-old girl is the heroine of the story, accompanied by Zhanggong, her lion-like Tibetan Mastiff dog. Chosen, and helped by a ethereal goddess she must assemble a band of allies from the surviving tribes to fight Wushen, and stop him from gaining control over an ancient power.', 'Hundreds of thousands of years after the collapse of civilization, the world is a post-tech wasteland, and is inhabited by humanoid tribes. The Peace held between them is threatened by the return of Wushen, an evil shape-shifting ghost of modern technology. Wushen threatens to enslave the world population. Zhuma, a ten-year-old girl is the heroine of the story, accompanied by Zhanggong, her lion-like Tibetan Mastiff dog. Chosen, and helped by a ethereal goddess she must assemble a band of allies from the surviving tribes to fight Wushen, and stop him from gaining control over an ancient power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nyQBg6NsxpFmTAMBPaT69MBdh5w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337302'),
  ('308330189769623305', '1001 Arabian Nights', 1959, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney, Abe Levitow', 'Czenzi Ormonde', 'Jim Backus, Kathryn Grant, Dwayne Hickman, Hans Conried, Herschel Bernardi, Alan Reed, Daws Butler, The Clark Sisters', null, 'In this animated retelling of the classic tale, Abdul Aziz Magoo -- an ancestor of Mr. Magoo -- is the lamp-selling uncle of Aladdin. Tired of his nephew''s laziness, Abdul insists that Aladdin find a wife. To his uncle''s surprise, Aladdin falls in love with the beautiful Princess Yasminda. Before he can make his move, however, Aladdin is whisked away by the evil Wazir on a quest to find a magic lamp that will grant its owner unlimited power in the form of three magic wishes.', 'In this animated retelling of the classic tale, Abdul Aziz Magoo -- an ancestor of Mr. Magoo -- is the lamp-selling uncle of Aladdin. Tired of his nephew''s laziness, Abdul insists that Aladdin find a wife. To his uncle''s surprise, Aladdin falls in love with the beautiful Princess Yasminda. Before he can make his move, however, Aladdin is whisked away by the evil Wazir on a quest to find a magic lamp that will grant its owner unlimited power in the form of three magic wishes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NDQlf8FXAtOYbTFQkbjz8Jkoom.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44871'),
  ('396141059079892880', '1001 Nights', 1990, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Philippe de Broca, Jean Tournier', 'Jérôme Tonnerre, Philippe de Broca', 'Catherine Zeta-Jones, Gérard Jugnot, Thierry Lhermitte, Stéphane Freiss, Vittorio Gassman, Roger Carel, Marc Dudicourt, Georges Montillier', null, 'Sheherazade has been married to a ruler who wants many wives, but only one at a time. Consequently, as soon as he has bedded them, he has them put to death. In most retellings, the girl staves off this unfortunate conclusion by putting off the connubial event for a thousand and one nights, telling irresistible stories instead. In this one, she gets hold of a magic lamp.', 'Sheherazade has been married to a ruler who wants many wives, but only one at a time. Consequently, as soon as he has bedded them, he has them put to death. In most retellings, the girl staves off this unfortunate conclusion by putting off the connubial event for a thousand and one nights, telling irresistible stories instead. In this one, she gets hold of a magic lamp.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wFubQZcMS5ZEPX3kf1XatDQPAmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20220'),
  ('881622527192594983', '1001 Nights', 1998, 'Animation, Drama, Fantasy', 'Noriaki Kaneko, Yoshitaka Amano, Mike Smith', null, 'Gena Rowlands', 'PG-13', 'Presented in the form of a feverish love dream, 1001 Nights is the first and only installment of the ground-breaking "Filmharmonic" project, which presents original compositions created by pairs of A-list film composers and directors.', 'Presented in the form of a feverish love dream, 1001 Nights is the first and only installment of the ground-breaking "Filmharmonic" project, which presents original compositions created by pairs of A-list film composers and directors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qLZVrwp60LW6e2kUFExMXTCyzWD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42067'),
  ('984547760849742174', '101 Dalmatians', 1996, 'Family, Comedy', 'Stephen Herek, Adrian Biddle, Alan Tomkins', 'John Hughes', 'Glenn Close, Jeff Daniels, Joely Richardson, Joan Plowright, Hugh Laurie, Mark Williams, John Shrapnel, Tim McInnerny', 'G', 'An evil, high-fashion designer plots to steal Dalmatian puppies in order to make an extravagant fur coat, but instead creates an extravagant mess.', 'An evil, high-fashion designer plots to steal Dalmatian puppies in order to make an extravagant fur coat, but instead creates an extravagant mess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8o2ADoAyG796UwTjwBFjPyBz0yG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11674'),
  ('373473780183443517', '101 Dalmatians II: Patch''s London Adventure', 2003, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'Brian Smith, Jim Kammerud', 'Brian Smith, Jim Kammerud', 'Barry Bostwick, Jason Alexander, Martin Short, Bobby Lockwood, Susanne Blakeslee, Samuel West, Maurice LaMarche, Jeff Bennett', 'G', 'Being one of 101 takes its toll on Patch, who doesn''t feel unique. When he''s accidentally left behind on moving day, he meets his idol, Thunderbolt, who enlists him on a publicity campaign.', 'Being one of 101 takes its toll on Patch, who doesn''t feel unique. When he''s accidentally left behind on moving day, he meets his idol, Thunderbolt, who enlists him on a publicity campaign.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uB0DQU4Cog8tYrkiOEVTmDw6Qnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13654'),
  ('452590519331121451', '101 Reykjavik', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Peter Steuger', 'Baltasar Kormákur', 'Victoria Abril, Hilmir Snær Guðnason, Hanna María Karlsdóttir, Þrúður Vilhjálmsdóttir, Þröstur Leó Gunnarsson, Ólafur Darri Ólafsson, Gudmundur Thorvaldsson, Baltasar Kormákur', null, 'A 30-year-old slacker who lives with his mother finds his life turned upside down when his mother''s flamenco-dancing friend moves in.', 'A 30-year-old slacker who lives with his mother finds his life turned upside down when his mother''s flamenco-dancing friend moves in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4zKQ9Wz68tLQ4WGirHDNXR1NdLf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10989'),
  ('1013593369191056632', '10½', 2010, 'Drama', 'Podz, Bernard Couture', 'Claude Lalonde', 'Claude Legault, Robert Naylor, Eugénie Beaudry, Blaise Tardif, Martin Dubreuil, Félixe Ross, Norman Helms, Isaac Bellemare', null, 'Tommy, 10 years old, is well known by Social Services. He is considered a danger to society. Gilles, his guardian at this halfway house, sees potential for redemption in this kid driven by violence.', 'Tommy, 10 years old, is well known by Social Services. He is considered a danger to society. Gilles, his guardian at this halfway house, sees potential for redemption in this kid driven by violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBBJ7xSNRuH5JKBXNUPrd7SCKlr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70018'),
  ('262759995665698024', '102 Dalmatians', 2000, 'Family, Comedy', 'Kevin Lima, Adrian Biddle, Jamie Christopher', 'Brian Regan, Kristen Buckley, Bob Tzudiker', 'Glenn Close, Gérard Depardieu, Ioan Gruffudd, Alice Evans, Tim McInnerny, Eric Idle, Ben Crompton, Carol MacReady', 'G', 'Get ready for a howling good time as an all new assortment of irresistible animal heroes are unleashed in this great family tail! In an unlikely alliance, the outrageous Waddlesworth - a parrot who thinks he''s a Rottweiler - teams up with Oddball - an un-marked Dalmatian puppy eager to earn her spots! Together they embark on a laugh-packed quest to outwit the ever-scheming Cruella De Vil.', 'Get ready for a howling good time as an all new assortment of irresistible animal heroes are unleashed in this great family tail! In an unlikely alliance, the outrageous Waddlesworth - a parrot who thinks he''s a Rottweiler - teams up with Oddball - an un-marked Dalmatian puppy eager to earn her spots! Together they embark on a laugh-packed quest to outwit the ever-scheming Cruella De Vil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ueE6u2GTECzGBtas6PFx7wwi9y0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10481'),
  ('751640827656731975', '102 Minutes That Changed America', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Nicole Rittenmeyer, Seth Skundrick', null, null, 'NR', 'The morning of September 11, 2001 is shown through multiple video cameras in and around New York City, from the moment the first WTC tower is hit until after both towers collapse.', 'The morning of September 11, 2001 is shown through multiple video cameras in and around New York City, from the moment the first WTC tower is hit until after both towers collapse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psTueksm8XxnCTi5c4dXzjWx5rZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36130'),
  ('205826068331612696', '102 Not Out', 2018, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Umesh Shukla, Laxman Utekar', 'Saumya Joshi', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Rishi Kapoor, Jimit Trivedi, Dharmendra Gohil, Nileash Pandya, Ashok Pathak, Vijay Raaz, Sunil Vishrani', null, 'An unusual love-hate relationship between a 75-year-old son and his 102-year-old father, who wants to break the oldest-man-alive record.', 'An unusual love-hate relationship between a 75-year-old son and his 102-year-old father, who wants to break the oldest-man-alive record.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2opq0dUfQUuiTzdip9BDqjWKQNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460713'),
  ('1127640610060289107', '108', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Renate Costa, Carlos Vásquez', 'Renate Costa', 'Miguel Auad Petunia, Renate Costa, Manuel Cuenca, Nancy Baruja', 'NR', 'Of all my uncles, Rodolfo was the only one who didn''t want to be a blacksmith like my grandfather: He wanted to be a dancer. The search for the traces of his life leads to the discovery that in the eighties in Paraguay, under Stroessner''s dictatorship, Rodolfo was included in one of the "108 lists of homosexuals", arrested and tortured. Rodolfo''s story reveals a part of the hidden and silenced history of my country. In "Cuchillo de palo" two generations come face to face in a confrontation that ultimately allows each of us to understand our place in the world.', 'Of all my uncles, Rodolfo was the only one who didn''t want to be a blacksmith like my grandfather: He wanted to be a dancer. The search for the traces of his life leads to the discovery that in the eighties in Paraguay, under Stroessner''s dictatorship, Rodolfo was included in one of the "108 lists of homosexuals", arrested and tortured. Rodolfo''s story reveals a part of the hidden and silenced history of my country. In "Cuchillo de palo" two generations come face to face in a confrontation that ultimately allows each of us to understand our place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znChMWIqLviFNuhRGUVCcHYPelD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97093'),
  ('1136241408371040206', '108 Stitches', 2019, 'Drama, Family', 'Fernando Kalife', null, 'Kuno Becker, Ximena Navarrete, José Ángel Bichir, Antonio de la Vega, Mauricio Herrera, Luis Gatica, Mara Cuevas, Gaby Arrollo', null, 'Two young kids dream about being professional baseball players.', 'Two young kids dream about being professional baseball players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xn2LVWfcSA5A2OXAhtXrZispWMr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387743'),
  ('226042726587279241', '10DANCE', 2025, 'Romance, Drama', 'Keishi Otomo, Tatsunosuke Sasaki', 'Tomoko Yoshida, Keishi Otomo', 'Ryoma Takeuchi, Keita Machida, Shiori Doi, Anna Ishii, Shinya Hamada, Oshirō Maeda, Nadiya Bychkova, Susie Trayling', 'R', 'Two dancers, opposites in all but their art, agree to train together for a competition. At first, they clash, but soon become drawn to each other.', 'Two dancers, opposites in all but their art, agree to train together for a competition. At first, they clash, but soon become drawn to each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwWzQvuQhxngTiGmX70PcYW99mB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400032'),
  ('519176626268588480', '10th & Wolf', 2006, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Bobby Moresco, Alex Nepomniaschy', 'Bobby Moresco, Allan Steele', 'James Marsden, Giovanni Ribisi, Brad Renfro, Piper Perabo, Dennis Hopper, Brian Dennehy, Lesley Ann Warren, Leo Rossi', 'R', 'A former street thug returns to his Philadelphia home after a stint in the military. Back on his home turf, he once again finds himself tangling with the mob boss who was instrumental in his going off to be a soldier.', 'A former street thug returns to his Philadelphia home after a stint in the military. Back on his home turf, he once again finds himself tangling with the mob boss who was instrumental in his going off to be a soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2OBZth9rnSyMzZR8M0WwGj8ivDG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13197'),
  ('272494311050025556', '11 A.M.', 2013, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Kim Hyun-seok, Lee Woong-kyu, Hwang Ki-suk', 'Kim Hyun-seok, Yu Young-ah, Kim Kyu-Won', 'Jung Jae-young, Kim Ok-bin, Choi Daniel, Lee Dae-yeon, Shin Da-eun, Oh Kwang-rok, Park Cheol-min, Kim Hyo-seo', null, 'In the not-so distant future, researchers at a deep-sea laboratory have finally invented a time machine. Head researcher Woo-seok is promised funding from a mega-corporation if he completes a test flight. He and Young-eun carry out the mission and travel to 11 A.M. the next day, only to find the base on the verge of collapse. All the researchers are gone and someone is out to kill them.', 'In the not-so distant future, researchers at a deep-sea laboratory have finally invented a time machine. Head researcher Woo-seok is promised funding from a mega-corporation if he completes a test flight. He and Young-eun carry out the mission and travel to 11 A.M. the next day, only to find the base on the verge of collapse. All the researchers are gone and someone is out to kill them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4XCE1T5TFbWNGYkh7ExW7qv9UJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239853'),
  ('1061688373237557315', '11 Days, 11 Nights Part 3', 1989, 'Drama', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', 'David Resseguier', 'Valentine Demy, Allen Cort, Carey Sally, Robert LaBrosse, Laura Gemser, Moses Gibson', null, 'Courtney a young reporter is assigned to report on the story of a young woman who lost her husband in a bizarre voodoo ritual. He decides to take his highly sexed wife Connie on the trip to New Orleans. Connie is drawn into a secret affair with one of the locals. Gradually captivated by his spell she eventually flaunts her affair in front of her husband and finally leaves with her new lover to join the voodoo follower. Torn between contempt for his wife''s infidelity and fear for her life Courtney is left to decide their destiny in the highly charged climax....', 'Courtney a young reporter is assigned to report on the story of a young woman who lost her husband in a bizarre voodoo ritual. He decides to take his highly sexed wife Connie on the trip to New Orleans. Connie is drawn into a secret affair with one of the locals. Gradually captivated by his spell she eventually flaunts her affair in front of her husband and finally leaves with her new lover to join the voodoo follower. Torn between contempt for his wife''s infidelity and fear for her life Courtney is left to decide their destiny in the highly charged climax....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcK5AzVcXnnvIVEedyMLEOJV1qv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362865'),
  ('233743328243054833', '11 Flowers', 2012, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Dong Jinsong, Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Wang Xiaoshuai', 'Liu Wenqing, Yan Ni, Mo Shi-ni, Wang Jingchun, Yu Yue, Qiao Renliang, Wang Ziyi, Zhong Guo Liuxing', null, 'A coming-of-age story set during China''s Cultural Revolution. 11 year old Wang Han finds himself entangled with a fugitive and struggles to understand the adult world.', 'A coming-of-age story set during China''s Cultural Revolution. 11 year old Wang Han finds himself entangled with a fugitive and struggles to understand the adult world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilGIMyX6IaBZ3I6kfLZKdU8COIU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98232'),
  ('204564626589538892', '11 Harrowhouse', 1974, 'Drama, Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Aram Avakian, Arthur Ibbetson, Anthony Squire', 'Jeffrey Bloom', 'Charles Grodin, Candice Bergen, James Mason, Trevor Howard, John Gielgud, Helen Cherry, Peter Vaughan, Cyril Shaps', 'PG', 'A small time diamond merchant jumps at the chance to supervise the purchase and cutting of a large first class diamond. But when the diamond is stolen from him, he is blackmailed into pulling off a major heist at the Diamond Exchange, located at 11 Harrowhouse.', 'A small time diamond merchant jumps at the chance to supervise the purchase and cutting of a large first class diamond. But when the diamond is stolen from him, he is blackmailed into pulling off a major heist at the Diamond Exchange, located at 11 Harrowhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o47sg7uqKpxeVppCDjKZhvJfwiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42268'),
  ('676426050382062535', '11 Minutes', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jerzy Skolimowski, Mikołaj Łebkowski, Tomasz Krzemieniecki', 'Jerzy Skolimowski', 'Richard Dormer, Wojciech Mecwaldowski, Andrzej Chyra, Dawid Ogrodnik, Mateusz Kościukiewicz, Agata Buzek, David L. Price, Paulina Chapko', null, 'The lives of urbanites intertwine in a world where anything can happen at any time.', 'The lives of urbanites intertwine in a world where anything can happen at any time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZ07UY5rEbvygj87YeOZElk7hDW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:314371'),
  ('1018236691121106644', '11 Rebels', 2024, 'Action, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Kazuya Shiraishi, Yoshimasa Fujie, Hiromichi Matsuo', 'Junya Ikegami', 'Takayuki Yamada, Taiga Nakano, Ukon Onoe, Riho Sayashi, Takara Sakumoto, Seiji Chihara, Amane Okayama, Yuya Matsuura', 'NR', 'When the brutal Boshin War breaks out in Japan, a group of inmates on death row unite to defend a fortress against the Imperial army.', 'When the brutal Boshin War breaks out in Japan, a group of inmates on death row unite to defend a fortress against the Imperial army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tERSzQgaSPYyChGn5AFFZ8hn3iY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310682'),
  ('398226577631421799', '11 Settembre 2001 - Inganno Globale', 2006, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Massimo Mazzucco', 'Massimo Mazzucco', null, null, 'Starting immediately after the first siege of Vienna took place in the previous century narrates the conflicts that preceded the events of September 11, 1683, known as the Battle of Vienna. The film shows the circumstances of the second siege of Vienna and the onslaught of the Ottoman Turks led by Kara Mustafa against the Habsburg Monarchy: the massive attack was stopped by King John III of Poland, who managed to reduce the Ottoman expansion in the Old Continent.', 'Starting immediately after the first siege of Vienna took place in the previous century narrates the conflicts that preceded the events of September 11, 1683, known as the Battle of Vienna. The film shows the circumstances of the second siege of Vienna and the onslaught of the Ottoman Turks led by Kara Mustafa against the Habsburg Monarchy: the massive attack was stopped by King John III of Poland, who managed to reduce the Ottoman expansion in the Old Continent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aupgx3pLtfoAAa7QhqpBJur24n9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128075'),
  ('129764457090675732', '11-11-11', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Darren Lynn Bousman, Joseph White', 'Darren Lynn Bousman', 'Timothy Gibbs, Michael Landes, Wendy Glenn, Lluís Soler, Brendan Price, Denis Rafter, Ángela Rosal, Benjamin Cook', 'PG-13', 'After the death of his wife and child, an author travels to Barcelona to see his estranged brother and dying father, where he learns that his life is plagued by events that occur on 11/11/11.', 'After the death of his wife and child, an author travels to Barcelona to see his estranged brother and dying father, where he learns that his life is plagued by events that occur on 11/11/11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6Wd9gY6e1yJVVXRtgICFqwieyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51248'),
  ('786722721420988546', '11:11', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Bafaro, John Drake', 'Pat Bermel, Evan Tylor, Michael Bafaro', 'Paul Dzenkiw, Laura Mennell, Kristina Copeland, Christie Will Wolf, Cathy Weseluck, Chris Harrison, Michael St. John Smith, Matt Bellefleur', null, 'Eighteen years after the murder of her parents, Sara Tobias searches for the meaning of the numbers ''11:11'' that was scratched in blood beside her mother''s body. Following three sudden murders, supernatural events are unleashed as she gets closer to the truth.', 'Eighteen years after the murder of her parents, Sara Tobias searches for the meaning of the numbers ''11:11'' that was scratched in blood beside her mother''s body. Following three sudden murders, supernatural events are unleashed as she gets closer to the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46YgmuMaRDlMWO4BmsPH52qqNA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16843'),
  ('21692914905028826', '11:14', 2004, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Greg Marcks, Shane Hurlbut, Morgan Blackledge', 'Greg Marcks', 'Rachael Leigh Cook, Ben Foster, Clark Gregg, Colin Hanks, Shawn Hatosy, Barbara Hershey, Stark Sands, Hilary Swank', 'R', 'Tells the seemingly random yet vitally connected story of a set of incidents that all converge one evening at 11:14pm. The story follows the chain of events of five different characters and five different storylines that all converge to tell the story of murder and deceit.', 'Tells the seemingly random yet vitally connected story of a set of incidents that all converge one evening at 11:14pm. The story follows the chain of events of five different characters and five different storylines that all converge to tell the story of murder and deceit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TFB0Doe92l9Jgc5qtUnE6r9rqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9282'),
  ('387414771303564611', '11.6', 2013, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Philippe Godeau, Michel Amathieu', 'Agnès de Sacy, Philippe Godeau', 'François Cluzet, Bouli Lanners, Corinne Masiero, Juana Acosta, Johan Libéreau, Mireille Franchino, Stéphan Wojtowicz, Jean-Claude Lecas', null, 'In November 2009, French security van driver Toni Musulin makes off with nearly 12 million euros, then turns himself over to the authorities a week later.', 'In November 2009, French security van driver Toni Musulin makes off with nearly 12 million euros, then turns himself over to the authorities a week later.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNcSL9QUmiaTQpfWXbPJCWMp0jX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182246'),
  ('687681006896822571', '1½ Ritter - Auf der Suche nach der hinreißenden Herzelinde', 2008, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Torsten Künstler, Til Schweiger, Christof Wahl', 'Oliver Philipp, Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Til Schweiger, Rick Kavanian, Julia Dietze, Thomas Gottschalk, Udo Kier, Tobias Moretti, Mark Keller, Ralph Herforth', null, 'The story of Lanze who is in love with the princess. One day the princess is kidnapped by the Dark Knight and Lanze starts his journey to rescue her. But he is not alone because Erdal, a turk, joins him on his journey.', 'The story of Lanze who is in love with the princess. One day the princess is kidnapped by the Dark Knight and Lanze starts his journey to rescue her. But he is not alone because Erdal, a turk, joins him on his journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nk3fmnVbnrtJ4tukuuwpIoxbcRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9510'),
  ('935454268849380457', '11M: Terror in Madrid', 2022, 'Documentary', 'José Gómez', null, null, null, 'Survivors and insiders recount March 11, 2004''s terrorist attack on Madrid, including the political crisis it ignited and the hunt for the perpetrators.', 'Survivors and insiders recount March 11, 2004''s terrorist attack on Madrid, including the political crisis it ignited and the hunt for the perpetrators.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuhSpdStKgnB0biWBctOYFgLeF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940332'),
  ('468825964119310481', '11th Hour Cleaning', 2022, 'Horror', 'Ty Leisher', 'Ed Morrone, Ty Leisher', 'Chloe Brooks, Edward Finlay, Ed Morrone, Anita Leeman, Dave Baez, J. Kristopher', null, 'A group of crime scene cleaners struggle to escape a murder house after becoming trapped by an ancient Nordic demon that is hell-bent on driving them insane.', 'A group of crime scene cleaners struggle to escape a murder house after becoming trapped by an ancient Nordic demon that is hell-bent on driving them insane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkWEQx1qJfdOkCvXQTIOQDrMaa1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:982317'),
  ('895464907759208214', '12', 2003, null, 'Lawrence Bridges', 'Lawrence Bridges', 'Alison Elliott, Tony Griffin, Allen Lulu, Brenda Varda, Eugene Rubenzer, Blake Robertson, Golde Starger, David Franco', null, 'A half-sister and brother, illegitimate offsprings of Zeus, are stranded on a Channel Island ranch and face eviction by the US Government. They must find a play fated by Zeus and perform it flawlessly for the gods'' amusement. If they do not act well, they will die. Shot over a period of 10 years "12" is 1 part L.A. love story, "The Importance of Being Earnest", a pagan spoof, personal diary of LA disasters of the 90''s, and an unforgettable adventure about characters in search of themselves.', 'A half-sister and brother, illegitimate offsprings of Zeus, are stranded on a Channel Island ranch and face eviction by the US Government. They must find a play fated by Zeus and perform it flawlessly for the gods'' amusement. If they do not act well, they will die. Shot over a period of 10 years "12" is 1 part L.A. love story, "The Importance of Being Earnest", a pagan spoof, personal diary of LA disasters of the 90''s, and an unforgettable adventure about characters in search of themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0H1EhvKFrAJgJtuRxMyPryXeoV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712608'),
  ('426469779136616603', '12', 2007, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Nikita Mikhalkov, Vladislav Opelyants, Галина Каськова', 'Aleksandr Novototskiy-Vlasov, Nikita Mikhalkov, Vladimir Moiseenko', 'Sergey Makovetskiy, Nikita Mikhalkov, Sergey Garmash, Valentin Gaft, Aleksey Petrenko, Yuriy Stoyanov, Sergey Gazarov, Mikhail Efremov', 'PG-13', 'A loose remake of “12 Angry Men”, “12” is set in contemporary Moscow where 12 very different men must unanimously decide the fate of a young Chechen accused of murdering his step-father, a Russian army officer. Consigned to a makeshift jury room in a school gymnasium, one by one each man takes center stage to confront, connect, and confess while the accused awaits a verdict and revisits his heartbreaking journey through war in flashbacks.', 'A loose remake of “12 Angry Men”, “12” is set in contemporary Moscow where 12 very different men must unanimously decide the fate of a young Chechen accused of murdering his step-father, a Russian army officer. Consigned to a makeshift jury room in a school gymnasium, one by one each man takes center stage to confront, connect, and confess while the accused awaits a verdict and revisits his heartbreaking journey through war in flashbacks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bl0aH8u7oBcd4QK9Fml01IN8KU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20714'),
  ('1109657111104387897', '12', 2009, 'Drama', 'Brooke Lynn Wright', null, 'Sydni Bourg, Michael Martin', null, 'After blowing his professional ballet career, John''s only way to redeem himself is to concoct the demise of his former partner, Leah, who he blames for his downfall; he rehearses his salvation in his mind in the way that he rehearses a dance, but being able to break from the routine will be the key to his success.', 'After blowing his professional ballet career, John''s only way to redeem himself is to concoct the demise of his former partner, Leah, who he blames for his downfall; he rehearses his salvation in his mind in the way that he rehearses a dance, but being able to break from the routine will be the key to his success.', null, 'tmdb:movie:43421'),
  ('102016653961307025', '12', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Jyri Pitkänen, Eemi Lehto', 'Jyri Pitkänen', null, null, 'An old Finnish athlete travels alone through eastern Europe with his van.', 'An old Finnish athlete travels alone through eastern Europe with his van.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/deX3pO476eQjSmr51EgBO01e3lh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767295'),
  ('144790595177123481', '12 and Holding', 2006, 'Drama', 'Michael Cuesta, Romeo Tirone', 'Anthony Cipriano', 'Zoe Weizenbaum, Conor Donovan, Jesse Camacho, Jeremy Renner, Annabella Sciorra, Jayne Atkinson, Linus Roache, Marcia DeBonis', null, 'Three close knit 12-year-olds - introverted Jacob, precocious Malee and vulnerable Leonard - start down the path of self-discovery and begin to distinguish their own voices from those of their parents.', 'Three close knit 12-year-olds - introverted Jacob, precocious Malee and vulnerable Leonard - start down the path of self-discovery and begin to distinguish their own voices from those of their parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jOs1N3B7w5ASq80hvTu1m9DiPmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18164'),
  ('92540691824785286', '12 Angry Men', 1957, 'Drama', 'Boris Kaufman, Sidney Lumet, Don Kranze', 'Reginald Rose', 'Martin Balsam, John Fiedler, Lee J. Cobb, E.G. Marshall, Jack Klugman, Edward Binns, Jack Warden, Henry Fonda', 'NR', 'The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young Spanish-American is guilty or innocent of murdering his father. What begins as an open and shut case soon becomes a mini-drama of each of the jurors'' prejudices and preconceptions about the trial, the accused, and each other.', 'The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young Spanish-American is guilty or innocent of murdering his father. What begins as an open and shut case soon becomes a mini-drama of each of the jurors'' prejudices and preconceptions about the trial, the accused, and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zhG3vKWyDRaZYoaww1UVAi29T9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389'),
  ('45325143035285841', '12 Chairs', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Aleksandr Belinsky', null, 'Igor Gorbachyov, Nikolai Boyarsky, Rem Lebedev, Glikeriya Bogdanova-Chesnokova, Alisa Freyndlikh, Vera Sonina, Konstantin Adashevsky, Anatoli Abramov', null, 'Who was the first to bring the great novel "12 Chairs" to the screen? You say "Leonid Gaidai" - and it will be a mistake. In our country, the first director was Alexander Belinsky (Leningrad television, 1966). Filming the favorite books of millions is a difficult task. The audience knows the plot in detail. Winged phrases have long gone to the people. Everyone has their own idea of ​​the main characters. In general, dissatisfied will be sure. So the version of "12 chairs", proposed by Alexander Belinsky, of course, will not suit everyone.', 'Who was the first to bring the great novel "12 Chairs" to the screen? You say "Leonid Gaidai" - and it will be a mistake. In our country, the first director was Alexander Belinsky (Leningrad television, 1966). Filming the favorite books of millions is a difficult task. The audience knows the plot in detail. Winged phrases have long gone to the people. Everyone has their own idea of ​​the main characters. In general, dissatisfied will be sure. So the version of "12 chairs", proposed by Alexander Belinsky, of course, will not suit everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ylEuvsRgSK03WLS6iQUUR6ghRnP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696060'),
  ('930430042949837824', '12 Chairs', 1971, 'Comedy, Adventure, Crime', 'Leonid Gaidai, Valery Shuvalov, Sergei Poluyanov', 'Vladlen Bakhnov, Leonid Gaidai', 'Archil Gomiashvili, Sergei Filippov, Mikhail Pugovkin, Glikeriya Bogdanova-Chesnokova, Natalya Varley, Natalya Vorobyova, Nina Grebeshkova, Natalya Krachkovskaya', null, 'A former aristocrat Ippolit Vorobyaninov leads a miserable life in Soviet Russia. His mother-in-law reveals a secret to him - she hid family diamonds in one of the twelve chairs they once had. Vorobyaninov in cooperation with a young con artist Ostap Bender start a long search for the diamonds.', 'A former aristocrat Ippolit Vorobyaninov leads a miserable life in Soviet Russia. His mother-in-law reveals a secret to him - she hid family diamonds in one of the twelve chairs they once had. Vorobyaninov in cooperation with a young con artist Ostap Bender start a long search for the diamonds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVzfgLPgrEOti2svUqwyLCtIeML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31648'),
  ('1011268928078933140', '12 Citizens', 2014, 'Drama, Crime', 'Xu Ang, Cai Tao', 'Xu Ang, Han Jinglong, Li Yujiao', 'Lei Jia, Wang Gang, Han Tongsheng, Zhao Longhao, Gao Dongping, Li Guangfu, Qian Bo, He Bing', null, 'When the film broke out that a young man coming from a rich adopted family murdered his birth father, the controversy around the case hit a nerve with the public at large. An experiment was held through the form of virtual court inside a college to discuss this hot topic. During the process of virtual court, 12 Chinese people from different walks of life got together and discussed the case like a jury. Through intricate and thought provoking questions from the main character, people start to think more critically about the case. During this process, one sees the revelation of people''s bias and emotional-preconceptions about the suspect, about each other, and also about the society.', 'When the film broke out that a young man coming from a rich adopted family murdered his birth father, the controversy around the case hit a nerve with the public at large. An experiment was held through the form of virtual court inside a college to discuss this hot topic. During the process of virtual court, 12 Chinese people from different walks of life got together and discussed the case like a jury. Through intricate and thought provoking questions from the main character, people start to think more critically about the case. During this process, one sees the revelation of people''s bias and emotional-preconceptions about the suspect, about each other, and also about the society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ewbDgWOEtg6Riassh0e1VDVtat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299117'),
  ('23080730328417477', '12 Dates of Christmas', 2011, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'James Hayman, Richard Black, Felix Gray', null, 'Amy Smart, Mark-Paul Gosselaar, Benjamin Ayres, Peter MacNeill, Mary Long, Jayne Eastwood, Laura Miyata, Cherisse Woonsam', 'PG', 'In an attempt to win back her ex-boyfriend Jack on Christmas Eve, Kate ends up ruining her blind date with Miles, a handsome guy she''s been set up with. In a strange twist of fate, Kate is magically given the chance to re-live Christmas Eve twelve times!', 'In an attempt to win back her ex-boyfriend Jack on Christmas Eve, Kate ends up ruining her blind date with Miles, a handsome guy she''s been set up with. In a strange twist of fate, Kate is magically given the chance to re-live Christmas Eve twelve times!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26X4Lldt6bwLnrX6kkLfUZTLojw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81393'),
  ('527373627951777868', '12 Days', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon', null, null, null, 'A new documentary by filmmaker-photographer Raymond Depardon – where justice and psychiatry meet.', 'A new documentary by filmmaker-photographer Raymond Depardon – where justice and psychiatry meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVVu9qO7uhLpsjNDser7AZXCEwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452221'),
  ('87753006857723386', '12 Days of Christmas Eve', 2004, 'TV Movie, Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Drama', 'Martha Coolidge, Derick V. Underschultz', 'J.B. White, Jean Abounader', 'Steven Weber, Mark Krysko, Chad Willett, Teryl Rothery, Vincent Gale, Kade Phillips, Stefanie von Pfetten, Patricia Velásquez', 'PG', 'Calvin Carter, a successful business executive, has it all, but neglects those closest to him. On Christmas Eve, all that changes when the sign on his office building falls on him. He awakes in a hospital bed, attended to by Angie, a nurse who soon lets him know he has 12 days (12 chances) to get his act together and achieve the "perfect" Christmas Eve. If he doesn''t, there will be dire consequences.', 'Calvin Carter, a successful business executive, has it all, but neglects those closest to him. On Christmas Eve, all that changes when the sign on his office building falls on him. He awakes in a hospital bed, attended to by Angie, a nurse who soon lets him know he has 12 days (12 chances) to get his act together and achieve the "perfect" Christmas Eve. If he doesn''t, there will be dire consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/256r0WmLu730bca8q52OxoSJZnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59700'),
  ('301327198671632285', '12 Days of Terror', 2004, 'Drama, Horror, TV Movie', 'Jacques Haitkin, Jack Sholder', null, 'Colin Egglesfield, Mark Dexter, Jenna Harrison, John Rhys-Davies, Jamie Bartlett, Adrian Galley, Patrick Lyster, Adrienne Pearce', 'PG-13', 'July of 1916 was a time of record heat, a polio epidemic, and a World War in Europe. But beachgoers in New Jersey are threatened by a even greater terror: a shark that has suddenly developed a taste for human flesh. Starting July 1st and lasting over a period of 12 days, the unidentified shark kills four people and seriously injures a fifth before the attacks stop, and threatens New Jersey''s thriving tourist industry. Based on true events, and one of the inspirations behind Peter Benchley''s Jaws.', 'July of 1916 was a time of record heat, a polio epidemic, and a World War in Europe. But beachgoers in New Jersey are threatened by a even greater terror: a shark that has suddenly developed a taste for human flesh. Starting July 1st and lasting over a period of 12 days, the unidentified shark kills four people and seriously injures a fifth before the attacks stop, and threatens New Jersey''s thriving tourist industry. Based on true events, and one of the inspirations behind Peter Benchley''s Jaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5H1p1ljwpDuXQgbzesb5kYoXoVl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153102'),
  ('501886242781287094', '12 Feet Deep', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Matt Eskandari, James Mahoney, Darius Siwek', 'Matt Eskandari, Michael Hultquist', 'Nora-Jane Noone, Alexandra Park, Diane Farr, Tobin Bell, Dogen Eyeler, Donald Prince, Matthew Ryan Michaels, Christian Kain Blackburn', 'NR', 'Two sisters are trapped under the fiberglass cover of an Olympic sized public pool and must brave the cold and each other to survive the harrowing night.', 'Two sisters are trapped under the fiberglass cover of an Olympic sized public pool and must brave the cold and each other to survive the harrowing night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3B4MLYYr5WTjQiJMbA8fCFF8M4O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459928'),
  ('856831226786342684', '12 Gifts of Christmas', 2015, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Sullivan, Theo Angell', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro, Lynn Grant Beck, Peter Sullivan', 'Katrina Law, Aaron O''Connell, Donna Mills, Melanie Nelson, Alesandra Durham, Jill Adler', 'G', 'When Anna Parisi, an unemployed fine arts painter, is unable to make ends meet, she is hired to become a personal Christmas shopper for Marc, an uptight corporate exec. As they begin working together, Marc learns that Christmas giving has less to do with the amount of money spent and more to do with the importance of the gift, while Anna discovers she might find success as an artist in a way she never expected. The best gift of all of course is the love they discover with one another.', 'When Anna Parisi, an unemployed fine arts painter, is unable to make ends meet, she is hired to become a personal Christmas shopper for Marc, an uptight corporate exec. As they begin working together, Marc learns that Christmas giving has less to do with the amount of money spent and more to do with the importance of the gift, while Anna discovers she might find success as an artist in a way she never expected. The best gift of all of course is the love they discover with one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2gBuhcMRL03OLd5IOD5cVFe8gBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:363483'),
  ('364075029675608331', '12 Hour Shift', 2020, 'Comedy, Crime, Horror', 'Brea Grant, Matt Glass', 'Brea Grant', 'Angela Bettis, David Arquette, Chloe Farnworth, Mick Foley, Kit Williamson, Nikea Gamby-Turner, Tara Perry, Brooke Seguin', 'NR', 'It''s 1999 and over the course of one 12-hour shift at an Arkansas hospital, a junkie nurse, her scheming cousin and a group of black market organ-trading criminals start a heist that could lead to their collective demise.', 'It''s 1999 and over the course of one 12-hour shift at an Arkansas hospital, a junkie nurse, her scheming cousin and a group of black market organ-trading criminals start a heist that could lead to their collective demise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y40lD9qpKxnzsdKqAA1TiEKX5gb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667141'),
  ('1015021948918637973', '12 Men of Christmas', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Arlene Sanford, Peter Benison', 'Jon Maas', 'Kristin Chenoweth, Josh Hopkins, Anna Chlumsky, Erin Dilly, Stephen Huszar, Heather Hanson, Jefferson Brown, Craig Eldridge', 'PG', 'A high-powered New York publicist finds herself in Montana promoting a charity calendar after being betrayed by her boss and fiancé. Unfortunately, matters of the heart are just as complicated in the wilds as they are in the big city.', 'A high-powered New York publicist finds herself in Montana promoting a charity calendar after being betrayed by her boss and fiancé. Unfortunately, matters of the heart are just as complicated in the wilds as they are in the big city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GIDNspYuIE8P9DycaYTrvDzhaw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42556'),
  ('786410713202043012', '12 Mighty Orphans', 2021, 'History, Drama, Action', 'David McFarland, Kat Hess, Ty Roberts', 'Lane Garrison, Ty Roberts', 'Luke Wilson, Vinessa Shaw, Wayne Knight, Martin Sheen, Jake Austin Walker, Scott Haze, Levi Dylan, Jacob Lofland', 'PG-13', 'Haunted by his mysterious past, a devoted high school football coach leads a scrawny team of orphans to the state championship during the Great Depression and inspires a broken nation along the way.', 'Haunted by his mysterious past, a devoted high school football coach leads a scrawny team of orphans to the state championship during the Great Depression and inspires a broken nation along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIY2QF211NLB1AOjZPFImusCLI1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625169'),
  ('941349880435690124', '12 Paces without a Head', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Sven Taddicken', null, 'Ronald Zehrfeld, Matthias Schweighöfer, Franziska Wulf, Oliver Bröcker, Hinnerk Schönemann, Jacob Matschenz, Sascha Reimann, Jana Pallaske', null, 'The era of the feared sea pirates Klaus Störtebeker and Gödeke Michels is coming to an end. After a long period with no booty at last a bulging ship appears on the horizon. However, Störtebeker is badly wounded in the attempted capture and the pirates suffer ignominious defeat. Not only their ship is down the drain - Störtebeker himself is suddenly plagued by anxiety and doubt about his very existence as a pirate. He is drawn to the beautiful country girl Bille, while Michels gets rebuffed by the friesian princess Okka. In the very moment that the crew have mutinied and co-captain Michels is literally at the end of his tether, they discover on board their ramshackle old tub a most unique wonder weapon. Glory days are quickly revived - until the mighty Hanse consolidate their power and weaponry and go to war against the pirates. Störtebeker and Michels are forced to decide: To live as a farmer or to die as a pirate.', 'The era of the feared sea pirates Klaus Störtebeker and Gödeke Michels is coming to an end. After a long period with no booty at last a bulging ship appears on the horizon. However, Störtebeker is badly wounded in the attempted capture and the pirates suffer ignominious defeat. Not only their ship is down the drain - Störtebeker himself is suddenly plagued by anxiety and doubt about his very existence as a pirate. He is drawn to the beautiful country girl Bille, while Michels gets rebuffed by the friesian princess Okka. In the very moment that the crew have mutinied and co-captain Michels is literally at the end of his tether, they discover on board their ramshackle old tub a most unique wonder weapon. Glory days are quickly revived - until the mighty Hanse consolidate their power and weaponry and go to war against the pirates. Störtebeker and Michels are forced to decide: To live as a farmer or to die as a pirate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9SnYLgpdOYxZubtPiEb3ruROKi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47845'),
  ('353503223715736757', '12 Rounds', 2009, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Renny Harlin, David Boyd, Robert Thayer', 'Daniel Kunka', 'John Cena, Aidan Gillen, Ashley Scott, Steve Harris, Brian J. White, Gonzalo Menendez, Taylor Cole, Kyle Clements', 'PG-13', 'When New Orleans Police Detective Danny Fisher stops a brilliant thief from getting away with a multimillion-dollar heist, the thief''s girlfriend is accidentally killed. After escaping from prison, the criminal mastermind enacts his revenge, taunting Danny with 12 rounds of near-impossible puzzles and tasks that he must somehow complete to save the life of the woman he loves.', 'When New Orleans Police Detective Danny Fisher stops a brilliant thief from getting away with a multimillion-dollar heist, the thief''s girlfriend is accidentally killed. After escaping from prison, the criminal mastermind enacts his revenge, taunting Danny with 12 rounds of near-impossible puzzles and tasks that he must somehow complete to save the life of the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7k7qhrO57sVoBLrNo5HYoTp24sT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17134'),
  ('187165954034783250', '12 Rounds 2: Reloaded', 2013, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Roel Reiné, Anthony C. Metchie', 'David Benullo', 'Randy Orton, Brian Markinson, Cindy Busby, Sean Rogerson, Tom Stevens, Colin Lawrence, Chelsey Reist, Sebastian Spence', 'PG-13', 'Nick Malloy portrays an Emergency Medical Technician (EMT) who finds himself caught in a deadly 12-round game of cat and mouse with a vigilante tied to the paramedic''s past. With little time to spare and his wife''s life hanging in the balance, the EMT must figure out why he''s been chosen to be the pawn in this maniac''s game before it''s too late.', 'Nick Malloy portrays an Emergency Medical Technician (EMT) who finds himself caught in a deadly 12-round game of cat and mouse with a vigilante tied to the paramedic''s past. With little time to spare and his wife''s life hanging in the balance, the EMT must figure out why he''s been chosen to be the pawn in this maniac''s game before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btThjvVC4lOqE95F9iVK118kpj2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195269'),
  ('167039037444541104', '12 Rounds 3: Lockdown', 2015, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Stephen Reynolds, Mahlon Todd Williams, Mike Crain', 'Bobby Lee Darby, Nathan Brookes', 'Jonathan Good, Roger Cross, Daniel Cudmore, Lochlyn Munro, Sarah Smyth, Lee Tomaschefski, Rebecca Marshall, Courtney Hojenski', 'R', 'Detective Shaw returns to active duty after the death of his partner. When he uncovers evidence linking his fellow officers to a murder, they frame him for a homicide he didn''t commit. Trapped in his own precinct, Shaw will do whatever it takes to expose the dirty cops and clear his name. With twelve rounds in the clip and one shot at redemption, nothing will stand in Shaw''s way in this action-packed thriller.', 'Detective Shaw returns to active duty after the death of his partner. When he uncovers evidence linking his fellow officers to a murder, they frame him for a homicide he didn''t commit. Trapped in his own precinct, Shaw will do whatever it takes to expose the dirty cops and clear his name. With twelve rounds in the clip and one shot at redemption, nothing will stand in Shaw''s way in this action-packed thriller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wAIu7q72mINXVplVnU6pMbZmQQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351901'),
  ('751348519333971441', '12 Strong', 2018, 'War, Drama, Action, History', 'Sam Gutentag, Nicolai Fuglsig, Rasmus Videbæk', 'Ted Tally, Peter Craig', 'Chris Hemsworth, Michael Shannon, Michael Peña, Navid Negahban, Trevante Rhodes, Geoff Stults, Thad Luckinbill, Austin Stowell', 'R', 'A team of special forces head into Afghanistan in the aftermath of the September 11th attacks in an attempt to dismantle the Taliban.', 'A team of special forces head into Afghanistan in the aftermath of the September 11th attacks in an attempt to dismantle the Taliban.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37Qwani2g0jVPU7N4OkkTZ7aERz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429351'),
  ('857177028910961590', '12 Suicidal Teens', 2019, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Shigetomo Madarame', 'Yutaka Kuramochi', 'Mahiro Takasugi, Yūto Fuchino, Kotone Furukawa, Kanna Hashimoto, Mackenyu, Yuina Kuroshima, Hana Sugisaki, Riku Hagiwara', null, 'A group of boys and girls, twelve in total, gather at an abandoned hospital to die for various different reasons. There, they find the body of a dead boy. The group of twelve attempt to find the person who killed the boy. During their search, the reasons why they want to die are revealed.', 'A group of boys and girls, twelve in total, gather at an abandoned hospital to die for various different reasons. There, they find the body of a dead boy. The group of twelve attempt to find the person who killed the boy. During their search, the reasons why they want to die are revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5yAnJxRuiLPabIrwinqGbCGetQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566387'),
  ('1018086780940398706', '12 to the Moon', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Adventure', 'David Bradley, John Alton, Gil Mandelik', 'DeWitt Bodeen', 'Ken Clark, Muzaffer Tema, Michi Kobi, Tom Conway, Anthony Dexter, Anna-Lisa, John Wengraf, Robert Montgomery Jr.', 'NR', 'Landed on the moon, Capt. John Anderson and his fellow astronauts quickly find their mission threatened – first by the disappearance of two team members, then by a troubling interaction with aliens who appear to be living within the moon itself. The aliens have weapons that could plunge parts of Earth into another ice age, and they''re aiming for the United States.', 'Landed on the moon, Capt. John Anderson and his fellow astronauts quickly find their mission threatened – first by the disappearance of two team members, then by a troubling interaction with aliens who appear to be living within the moon itself. The aliens have weapons that could plunge parts of Earth into another ice age, and they''re aiming for the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xZPAi8RWHdQ8ctKDE2RkxHsvFis.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61702'),
  ('748282693067641669', '12 Winter', 2009, 'Crime', 'Thomas Stiller', null, 'Jürgen Vogel, Axel Prahl, Matthias Koeberlin, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Thomas Darchinger, Katharina Palm, Doreen Jacobi, Torsten Michaelis', null, 'Based on one of the most spectacular series of bank robberies in Germany, Zwölf Winter tells the story of Klaus and Mike, two criminals who became friends in prison. When they happen to meet each other again after they have been released they begin to plan the perfect bank robbery, and it seems to work. For twelve years the two keep on robbing banks, always in winter. The police are in the dark for years. But they won''t stick to their guns...', 'Based on one of the most spectacular series of bank robberies in Germany, Zwölf Winter tells the story of Klaus and Mike, two criminals who became friends in prison. When they happen to meet each other again after they have been released they begin to plan the perfect bank robbery, and it seems to work. For twelve years the two keep on robbing banks, always in winter. The police are in the dark for years. But they won''t stick to their guns...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pvWnX6KAvaxjwUdR1640QII3w1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62335'),
  ('112329102605990477', '12 Years a Slave', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Sean Bobbitt, Steve McQueen, Doug Torres', 'John Ridley', 'Chiwetel Ejiofor, Michael Fassbender, Lupita Nyong''o, Benedict Cumberbatch, Paul Dano, Sarah Paulson, Adepero Oduye, Scoot McNairy', 'R', 'In the pre-Civil War United States, Solomon Northup, a free black man from upstate New York, is abducted and sold into slavery. Facing cruelty as well as unexpected kindnesses Solomon struggles not only to stay alive, but to retain his dignity. In the twelfth year of his unforgettable odyssey, Solomon’s chance meeting with a Canadian abolitionist will forever alter his life.', 'In the pre-Civil War United States, Solomon Northup, a free black man from upstate New York, is abducted and sold into slavery. Facing cruelty as well as unexpected kindnesses Solomon struggles not only to stay alive, but to retain his dignity. In the twelfth year of his unforgettable odyssey, Solomon’s chance meeting with a Canadian abolitionist will forever alter his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xdANQijuNrJaw1HA61rDccME4Tm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76203'),
  ('268520787032682123', '12 years, 7 months and 11 days', 2024, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Alexandre Coffre, Marine Guérard, Justinien Schricke', 'Alexandre Coffre, Monica Rattazzi', 'Marie Denarnaud, Julie Gayet, Hubert Delattre, Anton Alluin, Mhamed Arezki, Hadrien Heaulmé, Jehan Renard, Christophe Kourotchkine', null, 'Inès was found innocent in the accident that caused the death of Raphaël at the age of 12 years, 7 months, and 11 days. Today, Inès'' son, Théo, is that age. And she is convinced that Lucie, Raphaël''s mother, will avenge his death. Intuition or paranoia? To protect Théo, she hides him in the forest and then confronts the mother of his victim.', 'Inès was found innocent in the accident that caused the death of Raphaël at the age of 12 years, 7 months, and 11 days. Today, Inès'' son, Théo, is that age. And she is convinced that Lucie, Raphaël''s mother, will avenge his death. Intuition or paranoia? To protect Théo, she hides him in the forest and then confronts the mother of his victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJaPJSNUgdyYoUUdJsRW1iF2Hvj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1036934'),
  ('62201442923836851', '12:01', 1993, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Jack Sholder, Anghel Decca, Adam Druxman', 'Philip Morton', 'Jonathan Silverman, Helen Slater, Martin Landau, Nicolas Surovy, Robin Bartlett, Jeremy Piven, Constance Marie, Glenn Morshower', 'PG-13', 'Office employee Barry Thomas is caught in a "time bounce" caused by a glitch in the company''s secret project. Now the same day occurs again and again - and Barry''s the only one who can do anything about it, including saving the life of beautiful research assistant Lisa Fredericks.', 'Office employee Barry Thomas is caught in a "time bounce" caused by a glitch in the company''s secret project. Now the same day occurs again and again - and Barry''s the only one who can do anything about it, including saving the life of beautiful research assistant Lisa Fredericks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xK3d7mT6D7v2y8jp5Kv7c9FXzen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17803'),
  ('1143992610867481629', '12:01 PM', 1990, 'Science Fiction', 'Jonathan Heap, Charlie Lieberman, Thompson O''Sullivan', 'Jonathan Heap, Stephen Tolkin', 'Kurtwood Smith, Jane Alden, Don Amendolia, John Bachelder, Laura Harrington', 'PG-13', '12:01 PM is a 1990 short film directed by Jonathan Heap and starring Kurtwood Smith. It follows Myron Castleman, an everyman who keeps repeating the same hour of his life, from 12:01 PM to 1:00 PM. The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', '12:01 PM is a 1990 short film directed by Jonathan Heap and starring Kurtwood Smith. It follows Myron Castleman, an everyman who keeps repeating the same hour of his life, from 12:01 PM to 1:00 PM. The film was nominated for an Oscar for Best Live Action Short Film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zT5R8VahhZlE1TDcwEtmvyr8c8K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30647'),
  ('540690975384537226', '12:08 East of Bucharest', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Corneliu Porumboiu, Alexandru Vitzentzatos, Marius Panduru', 'Corneliu Porumboiu', 'Mircea Andreescu, Teodor Corban, Ion Sapdaru, Mirela Cioabă, Luminița Gheorghiu, Cristina Ciofu, Lucian Iftime, Anne Marie Chertic', null, 'It''s the 22nd of December. Sixteen years have passed since the revolution, and in a small town Christmas is about to come. Piscoci, an old retired man is preparing for another Christmas alone. Manescu, the history teacher, tries to keep up with his debts. Jderescu, the owner of a local television post, seems not to be so interested in the upcoming holidays. For him, the time to face history has come. Along with Manescu and Piscoci, he is trying to answer for himself a question which for 16 years has not had an answer: "Was it or wasn''t it a revolution in their town?"', 'It''s the 22nd of December. Sixteen years have passed since the revolution, and in a small town Christmas is about to come. Piscoci, an old retired man is preparing for another Christmas alone. Manescu, the history teacher, tries to keep up with his debts. Jderescu, the owner of a local television post, seems not to be so interested in the upcoming holidays. For him, the time to face history has come. Along with Manescu and Piscoci, he is trying to answer for himself a question which for 16 years has not had an answer: "Was it or wasn''t it a revolution in their town?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a7bBUXKWzhtqaPDyksOebSHeD6N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24159'),
  ('480085590890241983', '12.12: The Day', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller, Action, War, History, Crime', 'Lee Mo-gae, Lee Seong-hwan, Kim Sung-soo', 'Hong In-pyo, Kim Sung-soo, Hong Won-chan', 'Hwang Jung-min, Jung Woo-sung, Lee Sung-min, Park Hae-joon, Kim Sung-kyun, Kim Eui-sung, Jeong Dong-hwan, Ahn Nae-sang', null, 'After the assassination of President Park, martial law has been declared. A coup d''état bursts out by Defense Security Commander Chun Doo-gwang and a private band of officers following him. Capital Defense Commander Lee Tae-shin, an obstinate soldier who believes the military should not take political actions, fights against Chun Doo-gwang to stop him. The conflict between the two grows while military leaders are holding their decision and Defense Minister is gone. In the midst of chaos, the spring of Seoul that everyone longed for heads to unexpected direction.', 'After the assassination of President Park, martial law has been declared. A coup d''état bursts out by Defense Security Commander Chun Doo-gwang and a private band of officers following him. Capital Defense Commander Lee Tae-shin, an obstinate soldier who believes the military should not take political actions, fights against Chun Doo-gwang to stop him. The conflict between the two grows while military leaders are holding their decision and Defense Minister is gone. In the midst of chaos, the spring of Seoul that everyone longed for heads to unexpected direction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vy14tKxsbJYdDyFl6kQuVkK2s44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919207'),
  ('650995899816152590', '12/12/12', 2012, 'Horror', 'Jared Cohn, Ben Demaree', 'Jared Cohn', 'Sara Malakul Lane, Jesus Guevara, Carl Donelson, Steve Hanks, Jon Kondelik, Samuel Fisher, Samantha Stewart, Sam Ingraffia', 'R', 'When baby Sebastian is born on 12/12/12 everyone around him starts to die. Soon, his mother realizes that her son is the spawn of Hell.', 'When baby Sebastian is born on 12/12/12 everyone around him starts to die. Soon, his mother realizes that her son is the spawn of Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oubHb1teqWP69qUJZbjHAEZvyJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147879'),
  ('458695767848091980', '120', 2008, 'History, Drama, War', 'Özhan Eren, Mustafa Kuşçu, Murat Saraçoğlu', 'Özhan Eren', 'Özge Özberk, Burak Sergen, Cansel Elçin, Emin Olcay, Demir Karahan, Ahmet Uz, Oytun Öztamur, Alican Yılmaz', null, 'During the Sarikamis Battle, the Ottoman army runs out of ammunition and appeals to the people of Van for help, who happen to have supplies. However, the First World War is on and all men are fighting at four corners of the empire and therefore can not respond to to the appeal. The young children of Van want to do something...', 'During the Sarikamis Battle, the Ottoman army runs out of ammunition and appeals to the people of Van for help, who happen to have supplies. However, the First World War is on and all men are fighting at four corners of the empire and therefore can not respond to to the appeal. The young children of Van want to do something...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qfuusVNYVYyKQcmr0LGS7zsAUxT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10821'),
  ('283356068861511214', '120 Bahadur', 2025, 'Action, War', 'Razneesh Ghai, Tetsuo Nagata, Vishesh D. Sareen', 'Rajiv G. Menon', 'Farhan Akhtar, Sparsh Walia, Ankit Siwach, Vivan Bhatena, Dhanveer Singh, Brijesh Karanwal, Sahib Verma, Eijaz Khan', null, 'Valiant Indian soldiers fight against Chinese troops during the 1962 Sino-Indian War, preventing a potential occupation of Ladakh region in the Battle of Rezang La.', 'Valiant Indian soldiers fight against Chinese troops during the 1962 Sino-Indian War, preventing a potential occupation of Ladakh region in the Battle of Rezang La.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdxf02vUous6fty6O4nollyuo4m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1351923'),
  ('368947872401861929', '120 Seconds to Get Elected', 2006, 'Comedy', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Denis Villeneuve', 'Alexis Martin', null, 'A politician has just a couple of minutes to convince people to vote for him, and tries to seduce his audience with promises he thinks they want to hear.', 'A politician has just a couple of minutes to convince people to vote for him, and tries to seduce his audience with promises he thinks they want to hear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geRTiYuNVbrIsNDk3SJT1tTAg0p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239070'),
  ('232239108966518900', '1212. The Battle of Las Navas de Tolosa', 2023, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Santiago Mazarro', null, null, null, 'On 16 July 1212, a Crusader army made up of Castilians, Aragonese and Navarrese (but also French, English and Germans) confronted the army of the Almohad Caliph an-Nasir at the foot of the Sierra Morena mountain range. The Battle of Las Navas de Tolosa, as the battle is known, is considered the most important battle of the Middle Ages on the Iberian Peninsula and is a key event in the history of Spain. More than 800 years later, a group of archaeologists and specialists have begun an archaeological study of the battlefield. Is everything that has been said about the battle true? What secrets does the terrain hide? And, above all, what can we learn today about events that took place hundreds of years ago and that pitted tens of thousands of people against each other in the south of our country?', 'On 16 July 1212, a Crusader army made up of Castilians, Aragonese and Navarrese (but also French, English and Germans) confronted the army of the Almohad Caliph an-Nasir at the foot of the Sierra Morena mountain range. The Battle of Las Navas de Tolosa, as the battle is known, is considered the most important battle of the Middle Ages on the Iberian Peninsula and is a key event in the history of Spain. More than 800 years later, a group of archaeologists and specialists have begun an archaeological study of the battlefield. Is everything that has been said about the battle true? What secrets does the terrain hide? And, above all, what can we learn today about events that took place hundreds of years ago and that pitted tens of thousands of people against each other in the south of our country?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qDeOZhcVwRUjdBVZmMPfHW0Rtqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192043'),
  ('705953917765407927', '122', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ahmed Kardous, Yasser Al Yasseri', 'Salah El Geheiny', 'Ahmed Dawood, Amina Khalil, Tarek Lotfy, Mohamed Mamdouh, Ahmed Al Fishawy, Mohammad Lotfi, Mahmoud Hegazy, Asmaa Galal', null, 'During a bloody night, a young man and his lover are struggling, not to get to the hospital, but to escape and survive.', 'During a bloody night, a young man and his lover are struggling, not to get to the hospital, but to escape and survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Y5gnwYVSCnQ1Ne6vK2Mg2lm88k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512959'),
  ('732918996847452382', '123', 2012, null, 'Carlo Obispo', 'Carlo Obispo', null, null, 'Short film from the Philippines', 'Short film from the Philippines', null, 'tmdb:movie:303233'),
  ('142084620921233208', '125 rue Montmartre', 1959, 'Crime', 'Gilles Grangier, Jacques Lemare, Jacques Deray', 'Michel Audiard, Jacques Robert, Gilles Grangier', 'Lino Ventura, Andréa Parisy, Robert Hirsch, Jean Desailly, Dora Doll, Lucien Raimbourg, Pierre Mirat, Alfred Adam', null, 'Desperate, Didier throws himself out in the Seine. Pascal, a newsboy, jumps and saves him. It’s the beginning of the friendship between them.Once, as Pascal helps Didier, he finds himself involved in a murder. Only the superintendent believes in his innocence…', 'Desperate, Didier throws himself out in the Seine. Pascal, a newsboy, jumps and saves him. It’s the beginning of the friendship between them.Once, as Pascal helps Didier, he finds himself involved in a murder. Only the superintendent believes in his innocence…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cxTlieIMv4mQ4jhvrhShBShKZB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71323'),
  ('142474555907219022', '125 Years Memory', 2015, 'History, Drama', 'Masahiro Aida, Yusuke Nakagawa, Takashi Inoue', 'Eriko Komatsu', 'Seiyo Uchino, Kenan Ece, Shioli Kutsuna, Alican Yücesoy, Yui Natsukawa, Toshiyuki Nagashima, Naoto Takenaka, Takashi Sasano', null, 'Two historical incidents that deepened the friendship between Japan and Turkey are connected in this story of friendship and compassion: In the night of 16 September 1890 the Turkish frigate Ertuğrul is caught up in a typhoon and sinks off the Japanese coast. Risking their own lives, local villagers are able to rescue 69 Turkish sailors. Although being very poor and having hardly to eat, the villagers share what little they have with strangers from a country 9,000 kilometers away. 95 years later, during the Iran-Iraq War, more than 300 Japanese are stranded in Tehran. In the morning of 19 March 1985 a Turkish Airlines aircraft takes off for Tehran to evacuate the Japanese. But the remaining Turks at Tehran Mehrabad Airport still need to be convinced that they won''t be able to board their own country''s rescue flight.', 'Two historical incidents that deepened the friendship between Japan and Turkey are connected in this story of friendship and compassion: In the night of 16 September 1890 the Turkish frigate Ertuğrul is caught up in a typhoon and sinks off the Japanese coast. Risking their own lives, local villagers are able to rescue 69 Turkish sailors. Although being very poor and having hardly to eat, the villagers share what little they have with strangers from a country 9,000 kilometers away. 95 years later, during the Iran-Iraq War, more than 300 Japanese are stranded in Tehran. In the morning of 19 March 1985 a Turkish Airlines aircraft takes off for Tehran to evacuate the Japanese. But the remaining Turks at Tehran Mehrabad Airport still need to be convinced that they won''t be able to board their own country''s rescue flight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1hcwZFFKfA1hLqM7HWWEeyUuHh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:402455'),
  ('879929884352920114', '127 Hours', 2010, 'Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Danny Boyle, Anthony Dod Mantle, Enrique Chediak', 'Simon Beaufoy, Danny Boyle', 'James Franco, Kate Mara, Amber Tamblyn, Clémence Poésy, Lizzy Caplan, Kate Burton, Treat Williams, Sean Bott', 'R', 'The true story of mountain climber Aron Ralston''s remarkable adventure to save himself after a fallen boulder crashes on his arm and traps him in an isolated canyon in Utah.', 'The true story of mountain climber Aron Ralston''s remarkable adventure to save himself after a fallen boulder crashes on his arm and traps him in an isolated canyon in Utah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h0RMdn0rfl9l5hWXz3tUh6QVkhi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44115'),
  ('801097604554524242', '12th Fail', 2023, 'Drama', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Rangarajan Rambadran', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Jaskunwar Kohli', 'Vikrant Massey, Medha Shankr, Anant Joshi, Anshumaan Pushkar, Priyanshu Chatterjee, Geeta Agrawal Sharma, Harish Khanna, Vikas Divyakirti', null, 'Based on the true story of IPS officer Manoj Kumar Sharma, 12th Fail sheds limelight on fearlessly embracing the idea of restarting the academic journey despite the setbacks and challenges and reclaiming one''s destiny at a place where millions of students attempt the world''s toughest competitive exam: UPSC.', 'Based on the true story of IPS officer Manoj Kumar Sharma, 12th Fail sheds limelight on fearlessly embracing the idea of restarting the academic journey despite the setbacks and challenges and reclaiming one''s destiny at a place where millions of students attempt the world''s toughest competitive exam: UPSC.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eebUPRI4Z5e1Z7Hev4JZAwMIFkX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1163258'),
  ('254831791899735791', '12th Man', 2022, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Arfaz Ayub, Sudheesh Ramachandran, Jeethu Joseph', 'K R Krishna Kumar', 'Mohanlal, Unni Mukundan, Saiju Kurup, Anusree Nair, Anu Sithara, Priyanka Nair, Sshivada Nair, Aditi Ravi', null, 'A group of 11 friends go away to a resort for a weekend bachelor party, but the day ends in a death.', 'A group of 11 friends go away to a resort for a weekend bachelor party, but the day ends in a death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkQWgiNeum4oDO9ZIEK4MaQGPnG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847726'),
  ('1040959674202907315', '13', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Gela Babluani, Christopher Hosey, Doug Torres', 'Gregory Pruss', 'Sam Riley, Jason Statham, Mickey Rourke, Ray Winstone, 50 Cent, Michael Shannon, Alexander Skarsgård, Alice Barrett', 'R', 'A naive young man assumes a dead man''s identity and finds himself embroiled in an underground world of power, violence, and chance where men gamble behind closed doors on the lives of other men.', 'A naive young man assumes a dead man''s identity and finds himself embroiled in an underground world of power, violence, and chance where men gamble behind closed doors on the lives of other men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJAVjARKe3YBabnbhdbYWXD7Hdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44982'),
  ('367569814686020958', '13 Assassins', 1963, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Eiichi Kudō, Jūhei Suzuki', 'Kaneo Ikegami', 'Chiezo Kataoka, Kōtarō Satomi, Ryōhei Uchida, Tetsuro Tamba, Satomi Oka, Sumiko Fuji, Yuriko Mishima, Kantarō Suga', null, 'A sadistic Daimyo (feudal lord) rapes a woman and murders both her and her husband, but even when one of his own vassals commits suicide to bring attention to the crime, the matter is quickly hushed up. Not only will there be no punishment, but because the Daimyo is the Shogun''s younger brother, he will soon be appointed to a high political position from which he could wreak even more havoc. Convinced that the fate of the Shogunate hangs in the balance, a plot is hatched to assassinate the Daimyo. The two most brilliant strategic minds of their generation find themselves pitted against each other; one is tasked to defend a man he despises, and has a small army at his disposal. The other is given a suicide mission, and has 12 brave men. They are the 13 Assassins.', 'A sadistic Daimyo (feudal lord) rapes a woman and murders both her and her husband, but even when one of his own vassals commits suicide to bring attention to the crime, the matter is quickly hushed up. Not only will there be no punishment, but because the Daimyo is the Shogun''s younger brother, he will soon be appointed to a high political position from which he could wreak even more havoc. Convinced that the fate of the Shogunate hangs in the balance, a plot is hatched to assassinate the Daimyo. The two most brilliant strategic minds of their generation find themselves pitted against each other; one is tasked to defend a man he despises, and has a small army at his disposal. The other is given a suicide mission, and has 12 brave men. They are the 13 Assassins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXidHcawgIXstU4EcDcgHm5s1YG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52011'),
  ('386559473728144226', '13 Assassins', 2010, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Takashi Miike, Nobuyasu Kita, Kaori Ohtagaki', 'Daisuke Tengan', 'Koji Yakusho, Takayuki Yamada, Yūsuke Iseya, Goro Inagaki, Kazue Fukiishi, Hiroki Matsukata, Tsuyoshi Ihara, Ikki Sawamura', 'R', 'A bravado period action film set at the end of Japan''s feudal era in which a group of unemployed samurai are enlisted to bring down a sadistic lord and prevent him from ascending to the throne and plunging the country into a war-torn future.', 'A bravado period action film set at the end of Japan''s feudal era in which a group of unemployed samurai are enlisted to bring down a sadistic lord and prevent him from ascending to the throne and plunging the country into a war-torn future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yUsVsiVXUwClk4vSCx80vrdO6MV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58857'),
  ('777630977304104564', '13 at a Table', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Alessandro Grossi', 'Enrico Oldoini', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Nicolas Vaporidis, Silvia De Santis, Kasia Smutniak, Paolo Bonacelli, Gianna Giachetti, Luca Angeletti, Niccolò Enriquez', null, 'Giulio, a divorced middle-aged man, returns to the family villa in Tuscany where he spent his childhood holidays with his entire family, to arrange, with his brothers and cousins, for its sale. The house brings back memories of his youth and of the beautiful Anna, whom all her brothers pursued--but he was the one who ultimately won her over. Overcome with emotions, and now aware of the significance of the property, Giulio decides to buy all his relatives'' shares and move back to the villa with his family.', 'Giulio, a divorced middle-aged man, returns to the family villa in Tuscany where he spent his childhood holidays with his entire family, to arrange, with his brothers and cousins, for its sale. The house brings back memories of his youth and of the beautiful Anna, whom all her brothers pursued--but he was the one who ultimately won her over. Overcome with emotions, and now aware of the significance of the property, Giulio decides to buy all his relatives'' shares and move back to the villa with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lfkvXRV47mFK9O6JkuuGgawH8mU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82236'),
  ('1072803633625821869', '13 Bombs', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Arnand Pratikto, Leon Lolang, Riri Pohan', 'Angga Dwimas Sasongko, Mohammad Irfan Ramly', 'Chicco Kurniawan, Ardhito Pramono, Lutesha, Kaan Lativan, Putri Ayudya, Ganindra Bimo, Rukman Rosadi, Niken Anjani', null, 'An organization races against time to uncover the mastermind behind the placement of 13 bombs in Jakarta before the city falls into chaos.', 'An organization races against time to uncover the mastermind behind the placement of 13 bombs in Jakarta before the city falls into chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vSfQ5nIjA5c2TB0EMTXCBRwvJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1126128'),
  ('505582280789412850', '13 Cameras', 2016, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Victor Zarcoff, Jess Dunlap', 'Victor Zarcoff', 'Brianne Moncrief, PJ McCabe, Neville Archambault, Sean Carrigan, Sarah Baldwin, Jim Cummings, Heidi Niedermeyer, Andy Gould', null, 'Newlyweds Claire and Ryan have just moved into a new house. Both are hoping Claire’s pregnancy will be the cement needed to hold their already fraying relationship together. Little do they know their marital issues are the least of their problems. For unbeknownst to them, their scruffy, sleazy and lascivious landlord has installed numerous miniature cameras all over their home and has been spying on them from Day One. Then Ryan begins an office affair, and the landlord kits out the secret basement with chains and soundproofing. Something is going to give in this suburban shocker packed with nasty surprises.', 'Newlyweds Claire and Ryan have just moved into a new house. Both are hoping Claire’s pregnancy will be the cement needed to hold their already fraying relationship together. Little do they know their marital issues are the least of their problems. For unbeknownst to them, their scruffy, sleazy and lascivious landlord has installed numerous miniature cameras all over their home and has been spying on them from Day One. Then Ryan begins an office affair, and the landlord kits out the secret basement with chains and soundproofing. Something is going to give in this suburban shocker packed with nasty surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cwsXVI6pLsUjKxrkyLL1noTaXvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347751'),
  ('452077537305007765', '13 Chairs', 1938, 'Comedy', 'E.W. Emo, Eduard Hoesch', 'E.W. Emo, Per Schwenzen', 'Heinz Rühmann, Hans Moser, Annie Rosar, Inge List, Hedwig Bleibtreu, Menta Egies, Karl Skraup, Alfred Neugebauer', null, 'A classical art junk dealer and an almost bankrupt hairdresser who unexpectedly makes an inheritance go hunting behind thirteen chairs from which of a 100,000 DM contains which the rich aunt has hidden there.', 'A classical art junk dealer and an almost bankrupt hairdresser who unexpectedly makes an inheritance go hunting behind thirteen chairs from which of a 100,000 DM contains which the rich aunt has hidden there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UI6WGy2eBebPnVUlusmB5H2yYA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81356'),
  ('568898238466521923', '13 Curses', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Xavier Villaverde', 'Curro Royo, Juan Vicente Pozuelo', 'Juan Diego Botto, Luis Tosar, Marta Etura, Elvira Mínguez, Laura Mañá, Rosa Álvarez, Diogo Infante, Gonzalo Uriarte', null, 'Jacobo is a young sculptor that returns to native city, Santiago of Compostela, to see his mother, locked up a psychiatric hospital for to kill to her husband, when he believed she dead years ago. To their arrival, visions of Mateo, his dead father eighteen years ago, begin to persecute to him, since his father died by shot gun, peculiarly, when thirteen peals sounded in the cathedral, fact what obsesses to Jacobo. After watching several times, Mateo convinces his son to make the work for the cathedral that his father couldn''t finish in life, but what begins as a simple work becomes a madness spiral when Jacobo discovers the true intentions of the ghost of his father: to kill to his son to usurp his body to finish the statue, and after to return to the life.', 'Jacobo is a young sculptor that returns to native city, Santiago of Compostela, to see his mother, locked up a psychiatric hospital for to kill to her husband, when he believed she dead years ago. To their arrival, visions of Mateo, his dead father eighteen years ago, begin to persecute to him, since his father died by shot gun, peculiarly, when thirteen peals sounded in the cathedral, fact what obsesses to Jacobo. After watching several times, Mateo convinces his son to make the work for the cathedral that his father couldn''t finish in life, but what begins as a simple work becomes a madness spiral when Jacobo discovers the true intentions of the ghost of his father: to kill to his son to usurp his body to finish the statue, and after to return to the life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWAE375sVrHOFXAfvIsFHrohnYP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114047'),
  ('657999538568829855', '13 Days, 13 Nights', 2025, 'War, Action, Thriller', 'Martin Bourboulon, Juliette Crété, Rose Wicksteed', 'Trân-Minh Nam', 'Roschdy Zem, Lyna Khoudri, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Christophe Montenez, Sina Parvaneh, Yan Tual, Fatima Adoum, Shoaib Saïd', null, 'Kabul, August 15, 2021. US troops are preparing to withdraw from Afghanistan, while the Taliban are marching on the capital to seize power. Amid the chaos, Commander Mohamed Bida and his men are in charge of security at the French embassy, the last Western mission to remain open. Trapped along with 500 people, left to their own devices, the team must reach the airport at all costs. A perilous mission with no guarantee of success to flee the hell of Kabul and rescue what remains of humanity.', 'Kabul, August 15, 2021. US troops are preparing to withdraw from Afghanistan, while the Taliban are marching on the capital to seize power. Amid the chaos, Commander Mohamed Bida and his men are in charge of security at the French embassy, the last Western mission to remain open. Trapped along with 500 people, left to their own devices, the team must reach the airport at all costs. A perilous mission with no guarantee of success to flee the hell of Kabul and rescue what remains of humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/orcdyqJZhbr731iN7yq7TK5zluc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1254135'),
  ('1139857308229077050', '13 Eerie', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Lowell Dean, Carmen Kotyk, Sheree Fondeur', 'Christian Piers Betley', 'Katharine Isabelle, Michael Shanks, Brendan Fehr, Brendan Fletcher, Nick Moran, Jesse Moss, Kristie Patterson, Michael Eisner', 'NR', 'Forensics students arriving on an isolated island "body farm" get to try out their CSI skills on a bunch of corpses under the watchful eye of their grumpy professor. The island used to house a state penitentiary, where the authorities were experimenting on death row inmates, and now the bodies won''t stay still.', 'Forensics students arriving on an isolated island "body farm" get to try out their CSI skills on a bunch of corpses under the watchful eye of their grumpy professor. The island used to house a state penitentiary, where the authorities were experimenting on death row inmates, and now the bodies won''t stay still.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3EU0EzOI9MH659vLjeUx6G2biGt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122369'),
  ('850863889879502566', '13 Exorcisms', 2022, 'Drama, Horror', 'Jacobo Martínez, Daniel Sosa Segura', 'Carlos Ruano, Teresa Fernández-Valdés, David Orea', 'María Romanillos, Ruth Díaz, Urko Olazábal, Pablo Revuelta, José Sacristán, Daniela Bini, Cristina Castaño, Silma López', null, 'After participating in a séance, young Laura begins to behave strangely. Alarmed, her parents ask Father Olmedo, one of the few exorcists authorized by the Vatican to intervene in cases of demonic possession, for help.', 'After participating in a séance, young Laura begins to behave strangely. Alarmed, her parents ask Father Olmedo, one of the few exorcists authorized by the Vatican to intervene in cases of demonic possession, for help.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdaEAPrT3Dq7pPjdhfTgNyMeOnK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026563'),
  ('319888484368003922', '13 Fanboy', 2021, 'Horror', 'Ben Meredith, Daniel Zollinger, Deborah Voorhees', 'Joel Paul Reisig, Deborah Voorhees', 'Dee Wallace, Hayley Greenbauer, Corey Feldman, C.J. Graham, Kane Hodder, Judie Aronson, Tracie Savage, Ron Sloan', 'NR', 'An obsessed fan stalks his favorite actors from the Friday the 13th films and beyond, mirroring his idol Jason Voorhees.', 'An obsessed fan stalks his favorite actors from the Friday the 13th films and beyond, mirroring his idol Jason Voorhees.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8nB3kkT10hJMyERJDz0jdlqi6ZE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582292'),
  ('1126021188995276107', '13 Frightened Girls', 1963, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'William Castle, Gordon Avil', 'Robert Dillon', 'Murray Hamilton, Joyce Taylor, Hugh Marlowe, Khigh Dhiegh, Charlie Briggs, Norma Varden, Garth Benton, María Cristina Servera', null, 'While attending a Swiss school for diplomats'' daughters, the teenage daughter of the American ambassador uses her access to various embassies to engage in espionage.', 'While attending a Swiss school for diplomats'' daughters, the teenage daughter of the American ambassador uses her access to various embassies to engage in espionage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VKI7CHcrpZoOOANETqB9ZDfSBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61221'),
  ('834076491203358341', '13 Gantry Row', 1998, 'Horror, TV Movie, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Catherine Millar, Tanya Jackson, Joe Morley', 'Tony Morphett', 'Rebecca Gibney, John Adam, Doris Younane, Nicholas Hammond, Mark Gerber, Erik Thomson, Marshall Napier, Michael Caton', null, 'When newlyweds Peter and Julie purchase an old house with plans to renovate it, they begin to discover the strangest things. First, they find one of the living room walls covered with iron plates that reveal an expanding sepia stain. Afterwards, they realize that the stain is beginning to take the shape of a man climbing from the darkness under the house. Whenever they paint over the stain, it reappears. The evil events that took place in the house 100 years prior, are becoming the cause of strange occurrences. Soon, the couple is directly threatened by the evil history of their home.', 'When newlyweds Peter and Julie purchase an old house with plans to renovate it, they begin to discover the strangest things. First, they find one of the living room walls covered with iron plates that reveal an expanding sepia stain. Afterwards, they realize that the stain is beginning to take the shape of a man climbing from the darkness under the house. Whenever they paint over the stain, it reappears. The evil events that took place in the house 100 years prior, are becoming the cause of strange occurrences. Soon, the couple is directly threatened by the evil history of their home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Ye32qQC0Cr5r3aAidpfw6N4gsy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173795'),
  ('550281905544675667', '13 Ghosts', 1960, 'Horror', 'William Castle, Joseph F. Biroc, Max Stein', 'Robb White', 'Charles Herbert, Jo Morrow, Martin Milner, Rosemary DeCamp, Donald Woods, Margaret Hamilton, John van Dreelen, David Hoffman', 'NR', 'The reclusive Dr. Zorba has died and left his sprawling mansion to his nephew Cyrus and his family. They will need to search the house to find the doctor''s fortune, but along with the property itself, they have also inherited the occultist''s collection of thirteen ghosts.', 'The reclusive Dr. Zorba has died and left his sprawling mansion to his nephew Cyrus and his family. They will need to search the house to find the doctor''s fortune, but along with the property itself, they have also inherited the occultist''s collection of thirteen ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8CyQj2VIfmGzjvdoLwYLyT8h4YS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29756'),
  ('771830207174325963', '13 Going on 30', 2004, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Don Burgess, Gary Winick, Hope Garrison', 'Josh Goldsmith, Cathy Yuspa', 'Jennifer Garner, Mark Ruffalo, Judy Greer, Andy Serkis, Kathy Baker, Phil Reeves, Sam Ball, Marcia DeBonis', 'PG-13', 'After total humiliation at her thirteenth birthday party, Jenna Rink wants to just hide until she''s thirty. Thanks to some magic wishing dust, Jenna''s prayer has been answered. With a knockout body, a fabulous wardrobe, an athlete boyfriend, a dream job, and superstar friends, this can''t be a better life. But soon Jenna realizes that adult life isn’t as easy as she hoped for.', 'After total humiliation at her thirteenth birthday party, Jenna Rink wants to just hide until she''s thirty. Thanks to some magic wishing dust, Jenna''s prayer has been answered. With a knockout body, a fabulous wardrobe, an athlete boyfriend, a dream job, and superstar friends, this can''t be a better life. But soon Jenna realizes that adult life isn’t as easy as she hoped for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iNZdSIfhSCMtRILDNyhLn8UKeSG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10096'),
  ('670054193299578827', '13 Hours in a Warehouse', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Dav Kaufman', 'Dav Kaufman', 'Paul Cram, Chars Bonin, Carson Lee, Cody Lyman, Daniel Jay Salmen, Meisha Johnson, Carly McMenoman, Rachel Grubb', 'R', 'As five underworld heavies settle in for an all night stay at an abandoned warehouse and former film studio, a series of bizarre and unsettling occurrences quickly lead them to believe they are not alone. It was supposed to be a simple night of babysitting a single hostage, but when a series of numbers began to appear on the walls things soon took a dark turn. Later, after the hostage escapes, the perplexed thugs not only learn that there is a rat in the ranks, but also discover the unsettling nature of the films that were shot in the warehouse. Now, as terror takes hold, the thieves are about to discover that they are being stalked from the shadows and that their odds of living to see daybreak are shrinking with each passing minute.Written by Jason Buchanan, All Movie Guide', 'As five underworld heavies settle in for an all night stay at an abandoned warehouse and former film studio, a series of bizarre and unsettling occurrences quickly lead them to believe they are not alone. It was supposed to be a simple night of babysitting a single hostage, but when a series of numbers began to appear on the walls things soon took a dark turn. Later, after the hostage escapes, the perplexed thugs not only learn that there is a rat in the ranks, but also discover the unsettling nature of the films that were shot in the warehouse. Now, as terror takes hold, the thieves are about to discover that they are being stalked from the shadows and that their odds of living to see daybreak are shrinking with each passing minute.Written by Jason Buchanan, All Movie Guide', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awX2SwpV7MUCjK59d3LtxhJtxA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16280'),
  ('336366664516628323', '13 Hours: The Secret Soldiers of Benghazi', 2016, 'War, Action, History, Drama, Thriller', 'Michael Bay, Dion Beebe, Sebastian Schroder', 'Chuck Hogan', 'John Krasinski, James Badge Dale, Dominic Fumusa, Max Martini, Pablo Schreiber, Matt Letscher, Alexia Barlier, David Costabile', 'R', 'An American Ambassador is killed during an attack at a U.S. compound in Libya as a security team struggles to make sense out of the chaos.', 'An American Ambassador is killed during an attack at a U.S. compound in Libya as a security team struggles to make sense out of the chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZlAxZMo6BId1SiqyjLmkd7oUB7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300671'),
  ('93855329180247922', '13 m²', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Barthélémy Grossmann, Colin Wandersman', 'Nagar Djavadi', 'Barthélémy Grossmann, Lucien Jean-Baptiste, Youssef Hajdi, Thierry Lhermitte, Bérénice Bejo, Alain Figlarz', null, 'Jose is looking for a way out of his small time banlieue deals. When he overhears a conversation between his girlfriend and his step-brother,he might just have found a very lucrative way.Together with his two best friends,he decides to attack an armored vehicle, full of cash. But everything goes wrong and they''re forced into hiding,in a 13 square meters bunker. There, they will have to test their friendship, their motivations, as every move outside triggers even more, paranoia.', 'Jose is looking for a way out of his small time banlieue deals. When he overhears a conversation between his girlfriend and his step-brother,he might just have found a very lucrative way.Together with his two best friends,he decides to attack an armored vehicle, full of cash. But everything goes wrong and they''re forced into hiding,in a 13 square meters bunker. There, they will have to test their friendship, their motivations, as every move outside triggers even more, paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOVCKchS6yp4JZxbXa3hX01VAfu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31862'),
  ('683500808545304812', '13 Minutes', 2015, 'History, Drama', 'Oliver Hirschbiegel, Astrid Poeschke, Judith Kaufmann', 'Fred Breinersdorfer, Léonie-Claire Breinersdorfer', 'Christian Friedel, Katharina Schüttler, Burghart Klaußner, Johann von Bülow, Felix Eitner, David Zimmerschied, Rüdiger Klink, Oliver Bigalke', 'R', 'The breathtaking story of a man who nearly would have changed the world. In 1939, when Hitler tricked millions of people at the height of his power, radical Georg Elser — disparaged as an assassin — is one of the greatest resistance fighters.', 'The breathtaking story of a man who nearly would have changed the world. In 1939, when Hitler tricked millions of people at the height of his power, radical Georg Elser — disparaged as an assassin — is one of the greatest resistance fighters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dSaDHmmDWLdoJnCnwJQToFkXJp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:319337'),
  ('773667698672385984', '13 Minutes', 2021, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Steve Mason, Lindsay Gossling, Casey Crowdis', 'Lindsay Gossling', 'Trace Adkins, Anne Heche, Yancey Arias, Thora Birch, Will Peltz, James Austin Kerr, Gabriel Jarret, Tokala Black Elk', 'PG-13', 'As a new day begins in the small American town of Minninnewah, the residents start their day as ordinary as the next. Mother Nature, however, has other plans for them. Inhabitants have just 13 minutes to seek shelter before the largest tornado on record ravages the town, leaving them struggling to protect their loved ones and fighting for their lives. Left to deal with the aftermath, four families must overcome their differences and find strength in each other in order to survive.', 'As a new day begins in the small American town of Minninnewah, the residents start their day as ordinary as the next. Mother Nature, however, has other plans for them. Inhabitants have just 13 minutes to seek shelter before the largest tornado on record ravages the town, leaving them struggling to protect their loved ones and fighting for their lives. Left to deal with the aftermath, four families must overcome their differences and find strength in each other in order to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oKng4fEr4QgS869UuWLSjAsR2rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:787723'),
  ('120471050902990851', '13 Moons', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexandre Rockwell, Phil Parmet, Jasmine Marie Alhambra', 'Alexandre Rockwell, Brandon Cole', 'Jennifer Beals, Elizabeth Bracco, Steve Buscemi, Peter Dinklage, Daryl Mitchell, Karyn Parsons, David Proval, Sam Rockwell', 'R', 'Things aren''t looking so good for television clown Banana''s career, and the fact that his estranged wife, Suzi, has just been arrested for assaulting his girlfriend, Lily, just serves to compound Banana''s despair.', 'Things aren''t looking so good for television clown Banana''s career, and the fact that his estranged wife, Suzi, has just been arrested for assaulting his girlfriend, Lily, just serves to compound Banana''s despair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzFrhP1kS0vko51GSdQc1KsMt5r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43656'),
  ('858630178366371425', '13 Never Again!', 1996, 'Drama, Family', 'Sirin Eide', 'Sirin Eide, Maureen Thomas', 'Sofie Cappelen, Martine Karlsen, Svein Roger Karlsen, Anne Krigsvoll, Lene Bragli, Tonje Louise Kjølholt, Ragnhild Hilt, Arild Kristo', null, '13-year old Rikke sees Bea, the new girl in her class, as a challenge. After an endurance test to find which of them can lie longer in a circle of flames, they become friends. However, as a result of some unfortunate truths and half-truths, the friendship falters. Rikke feels that Bea has let her down, and resolves to continue the rivalry between them, but now in a less physical, more artful way. In addition we meet Rikke''s elder sister Ninni, who has been in England to learn the language, and has had to leave her great love, a man twelve years her senior. The film is also about the problems Rikke encounters in fulfilling the expectations of those around her as she approaches womanhood.', '13-year old Rikke sees Bea, the new girl in her class, as a challenge. After an endurance test to find which of them can lie longer in a circle of flames, they become friends. However, as a result of some unfortunate truths and half-truths, the friendship falters. Rikke feels that Bea has let her down, and resolves to continue the rivalry between them, but now in a less physical, more artful way. In addition we meet Rikke''s elder sister Ninni, who has been in England to learn the language, and has had to leave her great love, a man twelve years her senior. The film is also about the problems Rikke encounters in fulfilling the expectations of those around her as she approaches womanhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3lWEnOtXNoCw3DS3oEblgcNNI9h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80275'),
  ('885422193977797952', '13 Rue Madeleine', 1947, 'Thriller, War', 'Henry Hathaway, Abe Steinberg, Norbert Brodine', 'Sy Bartlett, John Monks Jr.', 'James Cagney, Annabella, Richard Conte, Frank Latimore, Walter Abel, Melville Cooper, Sam Jaffe, Karl Malden', 'NR', 'Bob Sharkey, an instructor of would-be spies for the Allied Office of Strategic Services, becomes suspicious of one of the latest batch of students, Bill O''Connell, who is too good at espionage. His boss, Charles Gibson confirms that O''Connell is really a top German agent, but tells Sharkey to pass him, as they intend to feed the mole false information about the impending D-Day invasion.', 'Bob Sharkey, an instructor of would-be spies for the Allied Office of Strategic Services, becomes suspicious of one of the latest batch of students, Bill O''Connell, who is too good at espionage. His boss, Charles Gibson confirms that O''Connell is really a top German agent, but tells Sharkey to pass him, as they intend to feed the mole false information about the impending D-Day invasion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LWLFo2F618U6nb35PujPuXdEyi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18200'),
  ('1014024011466322737', '13 Semester', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Frieder Wittich, Christian Rein', 'Frieder Wittich, Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Max Riemelt, Robert Gwisdek, Claudia Eisinger, Alexander Fehling, Daniel Zillmann, Dieter Mann, Moritz Pliquet, Cyril Sjöström', null, 'When Momo leaves his small home town to go to university, he is full of enthusiasm and confidence, but slowly the pressures of study and campus living begin to grind him down. Half way through his course he finds himself at a crossroads with both his relationship and studies.', 'When Momo leaves his small home town to go to university, he is full of enthusiasm and confidence, but slowly the pressures of study and campus living begin to grind him down. Half way through his course he finds himself at a crossroads with both his relationship and studies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2gpyPWurLpHFUJi6zFizrlr0Tg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38813'),
  ('438290752346462679', '13 Sins', 2014, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Daniel Stamm, Zoltan Honti', 'David Birke, Daniel Stamm', 'Mark Webber, Devon Graye, Tom Bower, Ron Perlman, Rutina Wesley, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Clyde Jones, Deneen Tyler', 'R', 'Drowning in debt as he''s about to get married, a bright but meek salesman receives a mysterious phone call informing him that he''s on a hidden-camera game show where he must execute 13 tasks to receive a multi-million dollar cash prize.', 'Drowning in debt as he''s about to get married, a bright but meek salesman receives a mysterious phone call informing him that he''s on a hidden-camera game show where he must execute 13 tasks to receive a multi-million dollar cash prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x4tC1s6oFG9nEyxVSM0FiIsLea1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155084'),
  ('477737149387184365', '13 Steps of Maki: The Young Aristocrats', 1975, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Makoto Naito, Yoshikazu Yamasawa', 'Takeo Kaneko, Makoto Naito', 'Etsuko Shihomi, Sonny Chiba, Ohara Misa, Hiroshi Nawa, Tatsuya Nanjo, Hiroshi Kondō, Kōji Fujiyama, Hideo Murota', null, 'Maki is the leader of a female gang who fights for justice, but she ends up being framed and sent to a sadistic woman''s prison. Will Maki be able to escape and take revenge?', 'Maki is the leader of a female gang who fights for justice, but she ends up being framed and sent to a sadistic woman''s prison. Will Maki be able to escape and take revenge?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fwNBpiaNV1T57Y4tYJAOQs5jIYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199790'),
  ('147941314066928327', '13 Tzameti', 2006, 'Action, Thriller', 'Gela Babluani, Tariel Meliava', 'Gela Babluani', 'Giorgi Babluani, Aurélien Recoing, Pascal Bongard, Fred Ulysse, Nicolas Pignon, Vania Vilers, Christophe Vandevelde, Olga Legrand', null, 'Sebastian, a young man, has decided to follow instructions intended for someone else, without knowing where they will take him. Something else he does not know is that Gerard Dorez, a cop on a knife-edge, is tailing him. When he reaches his destination, Sebastian falls into a degenerate, clandestine world of mental chaos behind closed doors in which men gamble on the lives of others men.', 'Sebastian, a young man, has decided to follow instructions intended for someone else, without knowing where they will take him. Something else he does not know is that Gerard Dorez, a cop on a knife-edge, is tailing him. When he reaches his destination, Sebastian falls into a degenerate, clandestine world of mental chaos behind closed doors in which men gamble on the lives of others men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kSpFeY6ibND9ygqSFcOzEKK0Cl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6077'),
  ('831520791368957695', '13 West Street', 1962, 'Crime, Drama', 'Philip Leacock, Eddie Saeta', 'Robert Presnell Jr., Bernard C. Schoenfeld', 'Alan Ladd, Rod Steiger, Michael Callan, Dolores Dorn, Kenneth MacKenna, Margaret Hayes, Stanley Adams, Chris Robinson', 'NR', 'Walt Sherill is attacked and beat down by a group of juvenile delinquents on his way home from work one night. The boys who attacked him are not previously known by the police and are therefore hard to track down. As Sherill starts getting impatient he begins his own investigation. Meanwhile, Detective Sergeant Koleski does his best to track down the culprits.', 'Walt Sherill is attacked and beat down by a group of juvenile delinquents on his way home from work one night. The boys who attacked him are not previously known by the police and are therefore hard to track down. As Sherill starts getting impatient he begins his own investigation. Meanwhile, Detective Sergeant Koleski does his best to track down the culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTHB2dpYVStwbxjxyMz0OSRuXmT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134834'),
  ('1648182677346848', '13: Game of Death', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, Crime', 'Chookiat Sakveerakul, Chitti Urnorakankij, Kunnaree Rungsaroj', 'Eakasit Thairaat, Chookiat Sakveerakul', 'Krissada Sukosol Clapp, Achita Sikamana, Sarunyu Wongkrachang, Nattapong Arunnate, Namfon Pakdee, Piyapan Choopetch, Philip Wilson, Sukanya Kongkawong', 'NR', 'After losing his job, his car and his money, Phuchit, races against time to complete 13 tasks ordered by an anonymous caller who promised 100 million Baht upon completion.', 'After losing his job, his car and his money, Phuchit, races against time to complete 13 tasks ordered by an anonymous caller who promised 100 million Baht upon completion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Y0mGD2jZ456V4Wmnemlii54lgM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13436'),
  ('540311789783084336', '13: The Musical', 2022, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Jonnie Katz, Tamra Davis, Adam Santelli', 'Robert Horn, Jason Robert Brown', 'Eli Golden, Gabriella Uhl, JD McCrary, Lindsey Blackwell, Frankie McNellis, Jonathan Lengel, Debra Messing, Rhea Perlman', 'PG', 'After moving from New York City to Indiana, a 12 year old navigates his parents'' divorce, his impending bar mitzvah and his new school''s social circles.', 'After moving from New York City to Indiana, a 12 year old navigates his parents'' divorce, his impending bar mitzvah and his new school''s social circles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqShG2kTbsVbgrgjfoEwawjR88N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673271'),
  ('841584990001809761', '13:14: The Challenge of Helping', 2022, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Santiago Fábregas', null, 'Juanpa Zurita, Pambo, Eugenio Derbez, Lele Pons, Luis Arturo Villar Sudek, Pati Chapoy, Sofía Niño de Rivera, Montserrat Oliver', null, 'On September 19, 2017, at 1:14 p.m., an earthquake devastated Mexico City and its environs. Immediately, citizens mobilized to help, including the actor and youtuber Juanpa Zurita who quickly organized a group of friends that included singers, actors, content creators and other celebrities from the world of entertainment who helped him raise funds for the reconstruction of the city.', 'On September 19, 2017, at 1:14 p.m., an earthquake devastated Mexico City and its environs. Immediately, citizens mobilized to help, including the actor and youtuber Juanpa Zurita who quickly organized a group of friends that included singers, actors, content creators and other celebrities from the world of entertainment who helped him raise funds for the reconstruction of the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dwR8Qj1uKXYfJAekOfctuiJzAz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017619'),
  ('956466510495098134', '13/13/13', 2013, 'Horror', 'James Cullen Bressack, Brian Weber, Peter Paul Basler', 'James Cullen Bressack', 'Trae Ireland, Erin Coker, Jody Barton, Nihilist Gelo, Bill Voorhees, Tiffany Martinez, Jared Cohn, Calico Cooper', 'R', 'It''s the 13th month of the 13th year of the new millennium.', 'It''s the 13th month of the 13th year of the new millennium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sa32pdw1YJzl8tNeAc2CTCNhJ3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226269'),
  ('605836678193467142', '13Hrs', 2010, 'Horror, Action', 'Jonathan Glendening, Jordan Cushing', 'Adam Phillips', 'Isabella Calthorpe, Tom Felton, Gemma Atkinson, Joshua Bowman, Peter Gadiot, John Lynch, Simon MacCorkindale, Cornelius Clarke', 'R', 'Sarah Tyler returns to her troubled family home in the isolated countryside, for a much put-off visit. As a storm rages outside, Sarah, her family and friends shore up for the night, cut off from the outside world. But something comes out of the driving rain and darkness. Something that holds a dark secret so devastating that, in one night, it could wipe out the entire family.', 'Sarah Tyler returns to her troubled family home in the isolated countryside, for a much put-off visit. As a storm rages outside, Sarah, her family and friends shore up for the night, cut off from the outside world. But something comes out of the driving rain and darkness. Something that holds a dark secret so devastating that, in one night, it could wipe out the entire family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0HG7FTIbJIotckZj07DEjNuD68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48015'),
  ('498667879160274293', '13th', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Ava DuVernay, Kira Kelly, Hans Charles', 'Ava DuVernay, Spencer Averick', 'Jelani Cobb, Angela Davis, Henry Louis Gates, Jr., Michelle Alexander, Cory Booker, Marie Gottschalk, Michael Hough, Gina Clayton', null, 'An in-depth look at the prison system in the United States and how it reveals the nation''s history of racial inequality.', 'An in-depth look at the prison system in the United States and how it reveals the nation''s history of racial inequality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcKNWD6IFPPsvkpvyZ548naz0is.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407806'),
  ('567222674989599823', '14 and Under', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ernst Hofbauer, Klaus Werner, Peter Weissflog', 'Günther Hunold', 'Harald Baerow, Ulrike Butz, Elke Deuringer, Sonja Embriz, Marisa Feldy, Rosl Mayr, Enzi Fuchs, Rinaldo Talamonti', null, 'This episodic film is a close relative of Wolf Hartwig''s schoolgirl report movies, made by the same people, in a similar style, around similar topics. However, this one specifically focuses on the coming-of-age aspects, to an extent that it also touches on delicate issues such as paedophilia.', 'This episodic film is a close relative of Wolf Hartwig''s schoolgirl report movies, made by the same people, in a similar style, around similar topics. However, this one specifically focuses on the coming-of-age aspects, to an extent that it also touches on delicate issues such as paedophilia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sreO7KKeh6s99jYFl9XzpxDkOeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80295'),
  ('574600955227496224', '14 Blades', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Thriller', 'Daniel Lee, Tony Cheung Tung-Leung', 'Daniel Lee', 'Donnie Yen, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Wu Chun, Kate Tsui Tsz-Shan, Qi Yuwu, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Wu Ma, Law Kar-Ying', 'R', 'Commander Qinglong is the loyal leader of the assassin group that serves the emperor. But when his allies plan a rebellion against the ruler, he finds himself in danger.', 'Commander Qinglong is the loyal leader of the assassin group that serves the emperor. But when his allies plan a rebellion against the ruler, he finds himself in danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1VWOEN0UXFiSgCNvWO3lQuzLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34179'),
  ('186173012471428310', '14 Cameras', 2018, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Seth Fuller, Scott Hussion, Seth Fuller', 'Victor Zarcoff', 'Zach Dulin, Kodi Lane, Neville Archambault, Chelsea Edmundson, Lora Martinez-Cunningham, John-Paul Howard, Hank Rogerson, Gavin White', null, 'When a family of four rent a beautiful house for their summer vacation, the price seems too good to be true. Unbeknownst to them, the lascivious owner has set up a series of spy cams throughout the house, documenting their most intimate moments and live streaming them to the dark web.', 'When a family of four rent a beautiful house for their summer vacation, the price seems too good to be true. Unbeknownst to them, the lascivious owner has set up a series of spy cams throughout the house, documenting their most intimate moments and live streaming them to the dark web.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAwp3GNmrDFjhqO6kAKnyPhh2Ew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:534235'),
