  ('1046810801240079461', '14 Days', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ivan Cotroneo, Luca Bigazzi', 'Monica Rametta, Ivan Cotroneo', 'Thomas Trabacchi, Carlotta Natoli', null, 'A love story between a husband and wife who got lost, and not just because of a betrayal.', 'A love story between a husband and wife who got lost, and not just because of a betrayal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWZMtsaGeco7Mqha5nOOr48jdcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:842479'),
  ('944214787762241243', '14 Days to Feel Better', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Anouk Barrere, Mathis Dujardin, Edouard Pluvieux', 'Lionel Dutemple, Olivier Ducray, Edouard Pluvieux', 'Maxime Gasteuil, Zabou Breitman, Chantal Lauby, Romain Lancry, Lionel Abelanski, Anne Serra, Michel Boujenah, Bernard Farcy', null, 'Maxime, an ambitious and Cartesian executive, thinks only of his career and his future marriage to Nafège, the daughter of his boss. On the verge of burnout, alone in not realizing it, he finds himself embarked by his future stepfather Romain in the middle of his worst nightmare... A well-being course supervised by Clara and Luc, a couple of "clairvoyants", with trainees more lunar than each other. 14 days to get better, during which his principles and prejudices will be subjected to the zenitude and benevolence regime!', 'Maxime, an ambitious and Cartesian executive, thinks only of his career and his future marriage to Nafège, the daughter of his boss. On the verge of burnout, alone in not realizing it, he finds himself embarked by his future stepfather Romain in the middle of his worst nightmare... A well-being course supervised by Clara and Luc, a couple of "clairvoyants", with trainees more lunar than each other. 14 days to get better, during which his principles and prejudices will be subjected to the zenitude and benevolence regime!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgGsB4S5T0ERx9ct6OgPIIqKdLP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1118841'),
  ('316249536758704108', '14 Days to Life', 1997, 'Drama', 'Martin Langer, Roland Suso Richter', 'Holger Karsten Schmidt', 'Kai Wiesinger, Michael Mendl, Katharina Meinecke, Axel Pape, Sylvia Leifheit, Axel Milberg, Jürgen Schornagel, Detlef Bothe', null, 'Konrad von Seidlitz is a young yuppie lawyer currently celebrating his engagement with Cornelia, daughter of minister of justice Volkerts. As a public relations gag, he hasn''t paid his parking fines for two years and now insists on being sentenced to jail for two weeks as punishment. Using his knowledge as a lawyer he makes the best out of his visit in jail still working, still in a splendid mood and not adapting to any rule. Probably a good way to get the desired public attention, but also a good way to make enemies inside the jail-house. One day before Konrad is to be released his booth is searched and two hundred grams of cocaine are found. That''s a serious problem even for a brilliant lawyer like Konrad and even if you''re innocent', 'Konrad von Seidlitz is a young yuppie lawyer currently celebrating his engagement with Cornelia, daughter of minister of justice Volkerts. As a public relations gag, he hasn''t paid his parking fines for two years and now insists on being sentenced to jail for two weeks as punishment. Using his knowledge as a lawyer he makes the best out of his visit in jail still working, still in a splendid mood and not adapting to any rule. Probably a good way to get the desired public attention, but also a good way to make enemies inside the jail-house. One day before Konrad is to be released his booth is searched and two hundred grams of cocaine are found. That''s a serious problem even for a brilliant lawyer like Konrad and even if you''re innocent', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/njygNL24AuOhwulcGKewxIn01cx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10369'),
  ('10092298132420231', '14 Days, 12 Nights', 2019, 'Drama', 'Jean-Philippe Duval, Yves Bélanger', 'Marie Vien', 'Anne Dorval, Leanna Chea, François Papineau, Laurence Barrette, Ngoc Thoa, Tran Thi Le Hang, Hiep Tran-Nghia, Que Chi', null, 'Isabelle Brodeur embarks on a journey to Vietnam, her adopted daughter’s birthplace. Throughout this stunningly beautiful journey, Isabelle discovers her daughter’s country through the eyes of the woman who brought her into this word.', 'Isabelle Brodeur embarks on a journey to Vietnam, her adopted daughter’s birthplace. Throughout this stunningly beautiful journey, Isabelle discovers her daughter’s country through the eyes of the woman who brought her into this word.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiAao6UF3h2eFelRZuWlvUjbg3G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603488'),
  ('968138813118650267', '14 Going on 30', 1988, 'Science Fiction, Romance, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Paul Schneider', 'Jim Cruickshank, James Orr', 'Steven Eckholdt, Daphne Ashbrook, Adam Carl, Gabriel Olds, Irene Tedrow, Patrick Duffy, Harry Morgan, Loretta Swit', null, 'Danny is hopelessly in love with his teacher Peggy Noble. Of course she doesn''t even notice him while she plans to marry the obnoxious coach Roy "Jack-jaw" Kelton. When Danny''s friend Lloyd invents a growth accelerator for fruit and vegetables to "solve world hunger", Danny uses it on himself and as an adult tries to show her Roy''s real personality. However at his first appearance at school as an adult, he''s mistaken for someone else...', 'Danny is hopelessly in love with his teacher Peggy Noble. Of course she doesn''t even notice him while she plans to marry the obnoxious coach Roy "Jack-jaw" Kelton. When Danny''s friend Lloyd invents a growth accelerator for fruit and vegetables to "solve world hunger", Danny uses it on himself and as an adult tries to show her Roy''s real personality. However at his first appearance at school as an adult, he''s mistaken for someone else...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qRvBf2V11iPht7CekKM2khupuo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163523'),
  ('1003835416736967599', '14 Kilometers', 2007, 'Drama', 'Gerardo Olivares', null, 'Adoum Moussa, Aminata Kanta, Mahamadou Alzouma', null, 'Three people looking for a better life become stranded in the desert with little hope of survival.', 'Three people looking for a better life become stranded in the desert with little hope of survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eZ7Xk7bB5rkuI0OGIAMa724cX0j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51067'),
  ('622461193001101792', '14 Peaks: Nothing Is Impossible', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Torquil Jones', 'Gabriel Clarke, Torquil Jones', 'Nirmal Purja, Jimmy Chin, Reinhold Messner, Klára Kolouchová, Conrad Anker', null, 'In 2019, Nepalese mountain climber Nirmal “Nims” Purja set out to do the unthinkable by climbing the world’s fourteen highest summits in less than seven months. (The previous record was eight years). He called the effort “Project Possible 14/7” and saw it as a way to inspire others to strive for greater heights in any pursuit. The film follows his team as they seek to defy naysayers and push the limits of human endurance.', 'In 2019, Nepalese mountain climber Nirmal “Nims” Purja set out to do the unthinkable by climbing the world’s fourteen highest summits in less than seven months. (The previous record was eight years). He called the effort “Project Possible 14/7” and saw it as a way to inspire others to strive for greater heights in any pursuit. The film follows his team as they seek to defy naysayers and push the limits of human endurance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YS9oRn9rcAyBhYELFbGKk1TpFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890825'),
  ('580767884345484135', '14 Phere', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Devanshu Singh, Riju Das', 'Manoj Kalwani', 'Vikrant Massey, Kriti Kharbanda, Gauahar Khan, Jameel Khan, Vineet Kumar, Yamini Das, Priyanshu Singh, Govind Pandey', null, 'Sanjay, a Rajput from Jahanabad, falls in love with his college senior Aditi, a Jat from Jaipur. They want to get married, but don''t want to hurt their families. So they plan to get married by arranging a fake set of parents. Will they succeed?', 'Sanjay, a Rajput from Jahanabad, falls in love with his college senior Aditi, a Jat from Jaipur. They want to get married, but don''t want to hurt their families. So they plan to get married by arranging a fake set of parents. Will they succeed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/afEOWT6LvwPz9oeHnNKzObBu2NB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:732886'),
  ('587581904396625679', '14+', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Andrey Zaytsev, Alexandra Avdonina, Shandor Berkeshi', 'Andrey Zaytsev', 'Gleb Kalyuzhny, Ulyana Vaskovich, Olga Ozollapinya, Dmitriy Blokhin, Irina Frolova, Shandor Berkeshi, Vladislav Goryachkin, Dmitry Barinov', null, 'Alex glides his mouse tenderly over online images of Vika. He has been smitten ever since he saw her with her friends and cannot get her out of his head. Unfortunately, Vika is beyond Alex’s reach because he''s not welcome in her neighborhood. Nonetheless, Alex sneaks into a disco at her school and finds up the courage to ask her to dance. Moments are intense as Alex feels infatuation for the first time.', 'Alex glides his mouse tenderly over online images of Vika. He has been smitten ever since he saw her with her friends and cannot get her out of his head. Unfortunately, Vika is beyond Alex’s reach because he''s not welcome in her neighborhood. Nonetheless, Alex sneaks into a disco at her school and finds up the courage to ask her to dance. Moments are intense as Alex feels infatuation for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qzFbkoJkI1GaOuIwarRxcpKQ9P3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325388'),
  ('741213235869452363', '1408', 2007, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Benoît Delhomme, Mikael Håfström, John Greaves', 'Scott Alexander, Larry Karaszewski, Matt Greenberg', 'John Cusack, Samuel L. Jackson, Mary McCormack, Jasmine Jessica Anthony, Tony Shalhoub, Len Cariou, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Noah Lee Margetts', 'PG-13', 'A man who specializes in debunking paranormal occurrences checks into the fabled room 1408 in the Dolphin Hotel. Soon after settling in, he confronts genuine terror.', 'A man who specializes in debunking paranormal occurrences checks into the fabled room 1408 in the Dolphin Hotel. Soon after settling in, he confronts genuine terror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yE9MCW7ZNxSw5SC1TMqm51pMBIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3021'),
  ('378646112518958647', '143 Sahara Street', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Hassen Ferhani, Hassen Ferhani', 'Hassen Ferhani', 'Malika, Chawki Amari, Samir Elhakim', null, 'Alone in a small white house on the edge of national road 1, the Trans-Saharan road, which connects Algiers to Tamanrasset crossing the immensity of the desert, Malika, 74, one day opened her door to the director Hassen Ferhani, who came there to scout with his friend Chawki Amari, journalist at El Watan and author of the story Nationale 1 which relates his journey on this north-south axis of more than 2000 km. The Malika of Amari''s novel, which Ferhani admits to having first perceived as a "literary fantasy", suddenly takes on an unsuspected human depth in this environment naturally hostile to man. She lends herself to the film project as she welcomes her clients, with an economy of gestures and words, an impression reinforced by the mystery that surrounds her and the rare elements of her biography which suggest that she is not from the region, that she left the fertile north of Algeria to settle in the desert where she lives with a dog and a cat.', 'Alone in a small white house on the edge of national road 1, the Trans-Saharan road, which connects Algiers to Tamanrasset crossing the immensity of the desert, Malika, 74, one day opened her door to the director Hassen Ferhani, who came there to scout with his friend Chawki Amari, journalist at El Watan and author of the story Nationale 1 which relates his journey on this north-south axis of more than 2000 km. The Malika of Amari''s novel, which Ferhani admits to having first perceived as a "literary fantasy", suddenly takes on an unsuspected human depth in this environment naturally hostile to man. She lends herself to the film project as she welcomes her clients, with an economy of gestures and words, an impression reinforced by the mystery that surrounds her and the rare elements of her biography which suggest that she is not from the region, that she left the fertile north of Algeria to settle in the desert where she lives with a dog and a cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/axL6z7LNdMb2sayDEhpV1DfABHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616291'),
  ('496300522558867012', '1448 Love Among Us', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Arunsak Ongla-or', 'Worawisuth Chalacheebh, Arunsak Ongla-or, Juldit Singoun', 'Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Isabella Lete, Pudit Kunchanasongkarm, Patchata Janngeon, Somprasong Singhawanawat, Chakkrit Silapachai, Soontree Vechanon, Nonie Wachirakanok', null, 'Pim is unsatisfied with her man and when he chooses to leave her to study abroad, she makes sure all ties with him are cut. Enter another woman, Pat. The two women embark on a relationship almost too quickly. They go as far as having a wedding, in which Pat''s parents refuse to attend.', 'Pim is unsatisfied with her man and when he chooses to leave her to study abroad, she makes sure all ties with him are cut. Enter another woman, Pat. The two women embark on a relationship almost too quickly. They go as far as having a wedding, in which Pat''s parents refuse to attend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13A1z6Xhv7FnqGibnVvppbqUdxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328662'),
  ('736898483317327691', '1492: Conquest of Paradise', 1992, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, History', 'Adrian Biddle, Ridley Scott, José Luis del Barco', 'Roselyne Bosch', 'Gérard Depardieu, Armand Assante, Sigourney Weaver, Loren Dean, Ángela Molina, Fernando Rey, Michael Wincott, Kevin Dunn', 'PG-13', '1492: Conquest of Paradise depicts Christopher Columbus’ discovery of The New World and his effect on the indigenous people.', '1492: Conquest of Paradise depicts Christopher Columbus’ discovery of The New World and his effect on the indigenous people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3effmbI6BbGW9i0HzEDfVGuOsvz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1492'),
  ('1143405340341235227', '15', 2003, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Lim Ching Leong, Royston Tan, Lim Ching Leong', 'Royston Tan', 'Melvin Chen, Erick Chun, Melvin Lee, Vynn Soh, Shaun Tan', null, 'Five troubled teens, abandoned by society and family, form a bond in a world of violence, drugs, and self-destruction, facing harsh realities of modern Singapore.', 'Five troubled teens, abandoned by society and family, form a bond in a world of violence, drugs, and self-destruction, facing harsh realities of modern Singapore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ew2b5z0QM8BJ5yLHtpEDTTV4W0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27748'),
  ('818625295917495351', '15 Cameras', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Danny Madden, Kristian Zuniga', 'PJ McCabe', 'Will Madden, Angela Wong Carbone, James Babson, Skyler Bible, Hilty Bowen, Shirley Chen, Jim Cummings, Courtney Dietz', 'NR', 'A couple buys a house from The Slumlord Tapes, infamous for hidden cameras and a psycho landlord. It''s not as safe as they tell themselves.', 'A couple buys a house from The Slumlord Tapes, infamous for hidden cameras and a psycho landlord. It''s not as safe as they tell themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muQrASlFPg4Hx0BEDwXjUsBMSHM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1179558'),
  ('242684717477533864', '15 Minutes', 2001, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'John Herzfeld, Jean-Yves Escoffier, Joe Walser', 'John Herzfeld', 'Robert De Niro, Edward Burns, Kelsey Grammer, Avery Brooks, Melina Kanakaredes, Karel Roden, Oleg Taktarov, Vera Farmiga', 'R', 'When Eastern European criminals Oleg and Emil come to New York City to pick up their share of a heist score, Oleg steals a video camera and starts filming their activities, both legal and illegal. When they learn how the American media circus can make a remorseless killer look like the victim and make them rich, they target media-savvy NYPD Homicide Detective Eddie Flemming and media-naive FDNY Fire Marshal Jordy Warsaw, the cops investigating their murder and torching of their former criminal partner, filming everything to sell to the local tabloid TV show "Top Story."', 'When Eastern European criminals Oleg and Emil come to New York City to pick up their share of a heist score, Oleg steals a video camera and starts filming their activities, both legal and illegal. When they learn how the American media circus can make a remorseless killer look like the victim and make them rich, they target media-savvy NYPD Homicide Detective Eddie Flemming and media-naive FDNY Fire Marshal Jordy Warsaw, the cops investigating their murder and torching of their former criminal partner, filming everything to sell to the local tabloid TV show "Top Story."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qGyTDp4K4J2RjGtT5hR81ilX9r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2749'),
  ('185697930357222685', '15 Minutes of War', 2019, 'War, Action, Drama, History', 'Fred Grivois', 'Ileana Epsztajn, Jérémie Guez, Fred Grivois', 'Olga Kurylenko, Alban Lenoir, Sébastien Lalanne, Michaël Abiteboul, Vincent Perez, Guillaume Labbé, David Murgia, Ben Cura', 'NR', 'February 1976. Somalian rebels hijack a school bus carrying 21 French children and their teacher in Djibouti City. When the terrorists drive it to a no-man’s-land on the border between Somalia and French territory, the French Government sends out a newly formed elite squad to rescue the hostages. Within a few hours, the highly trained team arrives to the crisis area, where the Somalian National Army has taken position behind the barbed wire on the border. The French unit is left with very few options to rescue the hostages. As the volatile situation unravels, the French men quickly come up with a daring plan: carry out a simultaneous 5 men sniper attack to get the children and the teacher out safely. A true story.', 'February 1976. Somalian rebels hijack a school bus carrying 21 French children and their teacher in Djibouti City. When the terrorists drive it to a no-man’s-land on the border between Somalia and French territory, the French Government sends out a newly formed elite squad to rescue the hostages. Within a few hours, the highly trained team arrives to the crisis area, where the Somalian National Army has taken position behind the barbed wire on the border. The French unit is left with very few options to rescue the hostages. As the volatile situation unravels, the French men quickly come up with a daring plan: carry out a simultaneous 5 men sniper attack to get the children and the teacher out safely. A true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHXzqCiAmgVhhJscGJIQH94vac0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484638'),
  ('339903349911890139', '15 Minutes Over Low Heat', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Neco Çelik', 'Haluk Özenç', 'Metin Akpınar, Haluk Bilginer, Ata Demirer, Özkan Uğur, Eyşan Özhim, Cezmi Baskın, Janset Paçal, Aysun Kayacı', null, 'The paths of Resul, a blind sculptor who served time for murder; Kader, a famous actress; Fazıl Bir, a deranged director who turned into a human bomb in order to force Kader to star in his film; Güngör, a hard-working classical musician; and Muhtar, Güngör''s incompetent manager who caused him to become a loser, intersect at a French restaurant called Le Chic , and within 15 minutes, a series of extraordinary events unfold and come to a head.', 'The paths of Resul, a blind sculptor who served time for murder; Kader, a famous actress; Fazıl Bir, a deranged director who turned into a human bomb in order to force Kader to star in his film; Güngör, a hard-working classical musician; and Muhtar, Güngör''s incompetent manager who caused him to become a loser, intersect at a French restaurant called Le Chic , and within 15 minutes, a series of extraordinary events unfold and come to a head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dl60gUO6fGwP9v3G8clRTLi7RJ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75460'),
  ('1120429196242191390', '15 Ways to Kill Your Neighbour', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Santiago Mitre', 'Santiago Mitre, Mariano Llinás', 'Daniel Hendler, Vimala Pons, Melvil Poupaud, Sergi López, Françoise Lebrun, Éric Caravaca, Hervé Vilard, Jean Luc Piraux', null, 'Drinking, dancing and... killing me. It''s the new life my neighbour Jose has decided to live. What better way to escape boredom than coming to kill me every thursday? His wife, Lucie, prefers to go to a shrink. To each their own therapy.', 'Drinking, dancing and... killing me. It''s the new life my neighbour Jose has decided to live. What better way to escape boredom than coming to kill me every thursday? His wife, Lucie, prefers to go to a shrink. To each their own therapy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMO0n5CAMRftZGebjTCXmufuJiZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660327'),
  ('719295420804425930', '15 Years', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Daniela Knapp, Chris Kraus', 'Chris Kraus', 'Hannah Herzsprung, Hassan Akkouch, Albrecht Schuch, Christian Friedel, Adele Neuhauser, Stefanie Reinsperger, Katharina Schüttler, Ninia LaGrande', null, 'Pianist Jenny, once a musical prodigy, finds her footing in the Christian faith after serving 15 years for a murder she didn''t commit. When she learns that her childhood sweetheart, once responsible for her ordeal, has become an internationally acclaimed star, the overwhelming need for revenge threatens her fragile agreement with God and her relationship with a Syrian musician who offers Jenny honest care and trust.', 'Pianist Jenny, once a musical prodigy, finds her footing in the Christian faith after serving 15 years for a murder she didn''t commit. When she learns that her childhood sweetheart, once responsible for her ordeal, has become an internationally acclaimed star, the overwhelming need for revenge threatens her fragile agreement with God and her relationship with a Syrian musician who offers Jenny honest care and trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ghjHQ5rbd3iJMqh3SNi30ug9m2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1182222'),
  ('582444178338344648', '15 Years and One Day', 2013, 'Drama', 'Gracia Querejeta, Juan Carlos Gómez, Angie Paul Risque', 'Gracia Querejeta', 'Maribel Verdú, Belén López, Tito Valverde, Arón Piper, Boris Cucalón, Susi Sánchez, Pau Poch, Sfía Mohamed', null, 'Jon is a troubled teenager who has been expelled from school. His mother decides to teach him a lesson by sending him away with his grandfather Max, a retired military man who lives in a village by the seaside. But the time they will spend together won’t be that simple, Jon likes to flirt with danger and bad companies, and the veteran has now settled down into a comfortable life.', 'Jon is a troubled teenager who has been expelled from school. His mother decides to teach him a lesson by sending him away with his grandfather Max, a retired military man who lives in a village by the seaside. But the time they will spend together won’t be that simple, Jon likes to flirt with danger and bad companies, and the veteran has now settled down into a comfortable life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cidTFapHXtGXxVUUxtPI18V6Q0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180418'),
  ('281803691011921359', '15/67: TV', 1967, 'Drama', 'Kurt Kren', null, null, null, 'Kren frames the image to suggest a proscenium, with a view to the harbor that conveys a literal sense of “tele-vision”. The static framing of the image and the clearly stratified mise-en-scène can hardly provoke interpretation. The sight of the girls does so all the more. Kren, the gentle voyeur - who turns the viewer into a secret accomplice - observes three teenagers, and probably like them, awaits a rendezvous. (Thomas Trummer)', 'Kren frames the image to suggest a proscenium, with a view to the harbor that conveys a literal sense of “tele-vision”. The static framing of the image and the clearly stratified mise-en-scène can hardly provoke interpretation. The sight of the girls does so all the more. Kren, the gentle voyeur - who turns the viewer into a secret accomplice - observes three teenagers, and probably like them, awaits a rendezvous. (Thomas Trummer)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83rHY6XHwVhcnvYvy5vtNIjBSaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143551'),
  ('1065153362534994766', '15+ Coming of Age', 2017, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Naphat Chitveerapat, Atsawanai Klinaiem, Saroch Nuamsamran', 'Chiangmun Ngamkanokwan, Naphat Chitveerapat', 'Yongsin Wongpanitnont, Ploynarin Sornarin, Thanaset Suriyapornchaikul, Jirakit Kuariyakul, Lita Janvarapa, Adirek Watleela, Pinsuda Tanpairoh, Nattakorn Thavornchat', null, 'With their teen hormones raging, three high school boys help one another explore their curiosity about the opposite sex and love in this raunchy comedy.', 'With their teen hormones raging, three high school boys help one another explore their curiosity about the opposite sex and love in this raunchy comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jakY67RmeNW51xUTWtQSJCwZvTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483877'),
  ('562283325158953492', '150 Milligrams', 2016, 'Drama', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Emmanuelle Bercot, Séverine Bosschem', 'Sidse Babett Knudsen, Benoît Magimel, Charlotte Laemmel, Isabelle De Hertogh, Lara Neumann, Patrick Ligardes, Philippe Uchan, Gustave Kervern', null, 'In the hospital where she works in Brest, France, a lung specialist discovers a direct link between suspicious deaths and state-approved medicine. She fights single-handedly for the truth to come out.', 'In the hospital where she works in Brest, France, a lung specialist discovers a direct link between suspicious deaths and state-approved medicine. She fights single-handedly for the truth to come out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffRZK8sbisdgriDOZkeHwIVt1jo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393945'),
  ('271910074770419593', '16 Blocks', 2006, 'Action, Adventure, Crime, Thriller', 'Glen MacPherson, Richard Donner, Jim Van Wyck', 'Richard Wenk', 'Bruce Willis, Yasiin Bey, David Morse, Jenna Stern, Casey Sander, Cylk Cozart, David Zayas, Robert Racki', 'PG-13', 'An aging cop is assigned the ordinary task of escorting a fast-talking witness from police custody to a courthouse, but they find themselves running the gauntlet as other forces try to prevent them from getting there.', 'An aging cop is assigned the ordinary task of escorting a fast-talking witness from police custody to a courthouse, but they find themselves running the gauntlet as other forces try to prevent them from getting there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBLqMVfTZpuKmMQKDLKusb93dbR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2207'),
  ('562858835886705093', '16 Days of Glory', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Bud Greenspan, Mike Chevalier, Chuck Cohen', null, 'David Perry, Caitlyn Jenner, Carl Lewis, Mary Lou Retton, Béla Károlyi, Daley Thompson, Jürgen Hingsen, Edwin Moses', 'G', 'The definitive photographic record of the 1984 Los Angeles Olympics, told "from the inside" through the lives of the participants, the words of David Perry, and the singing voice of Placido Domingo. From the opening to closing ceremonies, this unique style of storytelling shows a side of the Olympic Games not seen by television audiences.', 'The definitive photographic record of the 1984 Los Angeles Olympics, told "from the inside" through the lives of the participants, the words of David Perry, and the singing voice of Placido Domingo. From the opening to closing ceremonies, this unique style of storytelling shows a side of the Olympic Games not seen by television audiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/akmst4kyIY6BeLiK5SpD8qqzwEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376400'),
  ('533509622158342723', '16 December', 2002, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Mani Shankar', 'Mani Shankar', 'Milind Soman, Danny Denzongpa, Sushant Singh, Dipannita Sharma, Gulshan Grover, Aditi Gowitrikar', null, 'Indian intelligence agents race against time to stop a renegade Pakistani terrorist from detonating a nuclear weapon in Delhi. White collar crimes that drain the nation of precious foreign exchange is connected to the funding of international terrorism. The much-told Hollywood theme is retold in the Indian context with much needed technical wizadry.', 'Indian intelligence agents race against time to stop a renegade Pakistani terrorist from detonating a nuclear weapon in Delhi. White collar crimes that drain the nation of precious foreign exchange is connected to the funding of international terrorism. The much-told Hollywood theme is retold in the Indian context with much needed technical wizadry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sWFJFSIKnqyk0wRSn56uSWpuQM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46369'),
  ('1002038733892772009', '16 December', 2019, null, 'Álvaro Gago, Lucía C. Pan', 'Álvaro Gago', 'Cris Iglesias, Javier Valcárcel, Fran Pérez, Diego Abal, Ruth Boente, Martín Duplá', null, 'Saturday. Nightfall. The ball travels quickly across the court as the players move to take advantage of gaps in the defense. Lucía, twenty-five years old, leaves handball training and sets off to pick up her brother under the lights of a city she thinks she knows.', 'Saturday. Nightfall. The ball travels quickly across the court as the players move to take advantage of gaps in the defense. Lucía, twenty-five years old, leaves handball training and sets off to pick up her brother under the lights of a city she thinks she knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrf15zhIq61wHVYKQuPN1JNLeRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616256'),
  ('157133160081497029', '16 Sunrises', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Pierre-Emmanuel Le Goff', null, 'Thomas Pesquet, Peggy Whitson, Oleg Novitsky', null, '450 kilometers from the Earth, during these six months when the world seems to be moving into the unknown, a dialogue is woven between the astronaut and the visionary work of Saint Exupéry that he took to the space station', '450 kilometers from the Earth, during these six months when the world seems to be moving into the unknown, a dialogue is woven between the astronaut and the visionary work of Saint Exupéry that he took to the space station', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bTwIBNcUJ2unNveA8BrJZZznkVD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:544522'),
  ('288046891979566742', '16 Vayathinile', 1977, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bharathiraja, P. S. Nivas', 'Bharathiraja', 'Sridevi, Kamal Haasan, Rajinikanth, Goundamani, Ganthimathi', null, 'Sixteen-year-old Mayil is secretly loved by her handicapped cousin, Chappani, and the village rowdy, Parattai. But, she falls for a city doctor who takes advantage of her and deserts her. Gradually she realises how much Chappani loves her meanwhile, Parattai also eyeing for Mayil.', 'Sixteen-year-old Mayil is secretly loved by her handicapped cousin, Chappani, and the village rowdy, Parattai. But, she falls for a city doctor who takes advantage of her and deserts her. Gradually she realises how much Chappani loves her meanwhile, Parattai also eyeing for Mayil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxe8MvqDjxsf7CocBNnVCmnhX6M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66332'),
  ('658591991520180685', '16 Wishes', 2010, 'Fantasy, Drama, Family', 'Peter DeLuise, Michael Lohmann, Corinne Clark', 'Annie DeYoung', 'Debby Ryan, Jean-Luc Bilodeau, Keenan Tracey, Anna Mae Wills, Karissa Tynes, Brenda Crichlow, Kendall Cross, Joel Semande', 'G', 'The story about Abby Jensen, a girl who''s been eager to reach her 16th birthday and has kept a secret wish list since she was a little girl. When the Big Day actually arrives, utter disaster strikes, leaving Abby to think her birthday is ruined. But when a mysterious box of magical birthday candles arrives to turn things around, Abby''s 16 Wishes start to come true. Her day gets better and better...until she makes one wish that threatens to change everything.', 'The story about Abby Jensen, a girl who''s been eager to reach her 16th birthday and has kept a secret wish list since she was a little girl. When the Big Day actually arrives, utter disaster strikes, leaving Abby to think her birthday is ruined. But when a mysterious box of magical birthday candles arrives to turn things around, Abby''s 16 Wishes start to come true. Her day gets better and better...until she makes one wish that threatens to change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tO8TZvH83uHtrLnec6f684xfzOB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40205'),
  ('434489423968316830', '16 Years of Alcohol', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'John Rhodes, Richard Jobson', 'Richard Jobson', 'Kevin McKidd, Laura Fraser, Susan Lynch, Stuart Sinclair Blyth, Michael Moreland, Russell Anderson, Iain De Caestecker, Lewis Macleod', null, '16 Years of Alcohol is a 2003 drama film written and directed by Richard Jobson, based on his 1987 novel. The film is Jobson''s first directorial effort, following a career as a television presenter on BSkyB and VH-1, and as the vocalist for the 1970s punk rock band The Skids.', '16 Years of Alcohol is a 2003 drama film written and directed by Richard Jobson, based on his 1987 novel. The film is Jobson''s first directorial effort, following a career as a television presenter on BSkyB and VH-1, and as the vocalist for the 1970s punk rock band The Skids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWOrn2waRpTNNpSrSkBoDm657lD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29656'),
  ('923497804816002621', '1612: Chronicles of the Dark Time', 2007, 'History, Drama', 'Vladimir Khotinenko, Ilya Dyomin', 'Arif Aliev', 'Pyotr Kislov, Artur Smolyaninov, Michał Żebrowski, Violetta Davydovskaya, Mikhail Porechenkov, Aleksandr Baluev, Marat Basharov, Ramón Langa', null, 'The czar of Russia has died and a power vacuum has developed. This period in the late 16th and early 17th century has been called "The Time of Troubles." There are many impostors who claim to the right to rule, but there''s only one heir, the Czarina Kseniya Godunova. She has married a Polish military leader who wants to claim the Russian throne in her name so he can rule all of Russia. As the Poles move in on Moscow in an attempt to install the czarina on the throne, Andrei, a serf with a life-long infatuation of the czarina attempts to save her from her brutal Polish husband.', 'The czar of Russia has died and a power vacuum has developed. This period in the late 16th and early 17th century has been called "The Time of Troubles." There are many impostors who claim to the right to rule, but there''s only one heir, the Czarina Kseniya Godunova. She has married a Polish military leader who wants to claim the Russian throne in her name so he can rule all of Russia. As the Poles move in on Moscow in an attempt to install the czarina on the throne, Andrei, a serf with a life-long infatuation of the czarina attempts to save her from her brutal Polish husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArIJqMWe2NkaQq3ZMmmKAQdlUNv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52256'),
  ('1108113766952170466', '1618', 2023, 'History, Drama', 'Luís Ismael, Francisco Vidinha, Andreia Ribeiro', 'Luís Ismael', 'Pedro Laginha, Paulo Manso, Francisco Beatriz, Catarina Lacerda, Mafalda Banquart, Hugo Olim, Ivo Bastos, Heitor Lourenço', null, 'The Inquisition continues the persecution of Portuguese Jews, sending Visitador Sebastião Noronha to the city of Oporto. With his family and community in danger, António Álvares, decides to outline an escape plan.', 'The Inquisition continues the persecution of Portuguese Jews, sending Visitador Sebastião Noronha to the city of Oporto. With his family and community in danger, António Álvares, decides to outline an escape plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dl1twEgiX6xC9hZNzek9Nxv5ax9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:813729'),
  ('290786337232329849', '17 Again', 2009, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Drama, Romance', 'Burr Steers, Tim Suhrstedt, Peter Dress', 'Jason Filardi', 'Zac Efron, Leslie Mann, Thomas Lennon, Michelle Trachtenberg, Sterling Knight, Matthew Perry, Tyler Steelman, Allison Miller', 'PG-13', 'On the brink of a midlife crisis, 30-something Mike O''Donnell wishes he could have a "do-over." And that''s exactly what he gets when he wakes up one morning to find he''s 17 years old again. With his adult mind stuck inside the body of a teenager, Mike actually has the chance to reverse some decisions he wishes he''d never made. But maybe they weren''t so bad after all.', 'On the brink of a midlife crisis, 30-something Mike O''Donnell wishes he could have a "do-over." And that''s exactly what he gets when he wakes up one morning to find he''s 17 years old again. With his adult mind stuck inside the body of a teenager, Mike actually has the chance to reverse some decisions he wishes he''d never made. But maybe they weren''t so bad after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEcfFXEWpuXcfsR9nKESVCFneqV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16996'),
  ('446102570523045624', '17 Girls', 2011, 'Drama', 'Delphine Coulin, Muriel Coulin, Jean-Louis Vialard', 'Muriel Coulin, Delphine Coulin', 'Louise Grinberg, Juliette Darche, Roxane Duran, Esther Garrel, Yara Pilartz, Solène Rigot, Noémie Lvovsky, Florence Thomassin', 'NR', 'When Camille accidentally becomes pregnant, she encourages her friends and fellow high school classmates to follow suit. It''s only a matter of time, before seventeen girls in the high school are pregnant and the town is thrown into a world of chaos.', 'When Camille accidentally becomes pregnant, she encourages her friends and fellow high school classmates to follow suit. It''s only a matter of time, before seventeen girls in the high school are pregnant and the town is thrown into a world of chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sej5qgyMyDnYk0Wl1gzwLH48lS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87368'),
  ('617470766280573934', '172 Days', 2023, 'Drama, Romance', 'Adrian Sugiono, Arief Havidz, Abie Prabu', 'Archie Hekagery', 'Yasmin Napper, Bryan Domani, Abun Sungkar, Yoriko Angeline, Amara Sophie, Meisya Siregar, Keinaya Messi Gusti, Oki Setiana Dewi', null, 'A young woman with a troubled past turns to religion as she seeks purpose in life — and a chance at finding true love.', 'A young woman with a troubled past turns to religion as she seeks purpose in life — and a chance at finding true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbeSOr5ODJMHMzR4hbLXhnHNs1S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1134754'),
  ('890181512317678398', '1776', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Peter H. Hunt, Sheldon Schrager, Harry Stradling Jr.', 'Peter Stone', 'William Daniels, Howard Da Silva, Ken Howard, Blythe Danner, Donald Madden, John Cullum, David Ford, Ron Holgate', 'G', 'Colonial representatives gather in Philadelphia with the aim of establishing a set of governmental rules for the burgeoning United States. Benjamin Franklin and John Adams charge Thomas Jefferson with the task of writing a statement announcing the new country''s emancipation from British rule.', 'Colonial representatives gather in Philadelphia with the aim of establishing a set of governmental rules for the burgeoning United States. Benjamin Franklin and John Adams charge Thomas Jefferson with the task of writing a statement announcing the new country''s emancipation from British rule.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o50REDExdajGxTWczsmC3qcawGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14902'),
  ('51880450372968084', '1778 Stories of Me and My Wife', 2011, 'Drama', 'Mamoru Hoshi', null, 'Yuko Takeuchi, Tsuyoshi Kusanagi, Ren Osugi, Shosuke Tanihara, Michiko Kichise, Jun Fubuki, Sumie Sasaki, Yasuto Kosuda', null, 'Sci-fi writer Sakutaro (Tsuyoshi Kusanagi) and bank employee Setsuko (Yuko Takeuchi) met at as high school freshmen during their summer vacation. Since that time, the couple has always been together and eventually married.One day, Setsuko complains of a stomach ache and is hospitalized. Sakutaro then learns that his wife has colon cancer. Sakutaro takes the advice from his doctor that laughter helps the immune system and proceeds to write a short story for his wife every day. At first, Setsuko was expected to live for only 1 more year, but she lived for 5 more years and Sakutaro eventually wrote 1,778 short stories for his wife.', 'Sci-fi writer Sakutaro (Tsuyoshi Kusanagi) and bank employee Setsuko (Yuko Takeuchi) met at as high school freshmen during their summer vacation. Since that time, the couple has always been together and eventually married.One day, Setsuko complains of a stomach ache and is hospitalized. Sakutaro then learns that his wife has colon cancer. Sakutaro takes the advice from his doctor that laughter helps the immune system and proceeds to write a short story for his wife every day. At first, Setsuko was expected to live for only 1 more year, but she lived for 5 more years and Sakutaro eventually wrote 1,778 short stories for his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRnwnDApIOunLCoN7FH3adgzYYn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72524'),
  ('1001682050767876156', '1789 : Les Amants de la Bastille', 2014, 'Romance, Music, History', 'Myron Jung', 'Dove Attia', 'Louis Delort, Camille Lou, Rod Janois, Roxane Le Texier, Sébastien Agius, Yamin Dib, David Bàn', null, 'In the spring of 1789, France is devastated by famine. The French people begin to rise in unrest against the ruling French king Louis XVI. Ronan, a young peasant, leads a revolt marching to Paris, where he encounters Olympe, an assistant governess of the children of Marie Antoinette of Austria. The two fall in love during the tumultuous stirrings of the French Revolution, their romance playing out amid encounters with major Revolutionary figures such as Georges Jacques Danton, Maximilien de Robespierre and Camille Desmoulins. After they are separated, Ronan and Olympe find each other again on 14 July 1789 in the course of the assault on the Bastille prison— an encounter that seals their destiny even as a new era begins.', 'In the spring of 1789, France is devastated by famine. The French people begin to rise in unrest against the ruling French king Louis XVI. Ronan, a young peasant, leads a revolt marching to Paris, where he encounters Olympe, an assistant governess of the children of Marie Antoinette of Austria. The two fall in love during the tumultuous stirrings of the French Revolution, their romance playing out amid encounters with major Revolutionary figures such as Georges Jacques Danton, Maximilien de Robespierre and Camille Desmoulins. After they are separated, Ronan and Olympe find each other again on 14 July 1789 in the course of the assault on the Bastille prison— an encounter that seals their destiny even as a new era begins.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dANzIgrcAEJqgXbDnpnZbdsjjV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238416'),
  ('832159105666512515', '18 Again!', 1988, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Paul Flaherty, Stephen M. Katz', 'Josh Goldstein, Jonathan Prince', 'George Burns, Charlie Schlatter, Tony Roberts, Miriam Flynn, Red Buttons, Jennifer Runyon, Pauly Shore, Michael J. Shea', 'PG', '81-year-old millionaire Jack Watson switches bodies with his 18-year-old grandson David, leading the two to experience life on opposite ends of the age spectrum. But when David, trapped in Jack''s aged body, ends up in a coma, his grandfather must use his meager knowledge of the youth to prevent his family from pulling the plug.', '81-year-old millionaire Jack Watson switches bodies with his 18-year-old grandson David, leading the two to experience life on opposite ends of the age spectrum. But when David, trapped in Jack''s aged body, ends up in a coma, his grandfather must use his meager knowledge of the youth to prevent his family from pulling the plug.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kDMgcjSNadUBmpkbMuX3u48qgI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38965'),
  ('634945739696646754', '18 Meals', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Jorge Coira, Brand Ferro', 'Diego Ameixeiras, Jorge Coira, Araceli G. Cabreira', 'Luis Tosar, Federico Pérez Rey, Víctor Fábregas, Esperanza Pedreño, Gael Nodar Fernández, Mario Zorrilla, José María Pérez, María del Carmen Pereira', null, 'Food, glorious food! Some of the most sumptuous and involving films revolve around that most common of acts: eating. 18 MEALS is an omnibus film of criss-crossing stories divided into three segments; breakfast, lunch and dinner. Jorge Coira''s debut feature, shot over nine days in Santiago de Compostela has enough tasty portions to please audiences. Amongst Coira''s expansive ensemble are aging street musician Edu, a pair awaking from a one-night stand, a businessman visiting his closeted homosexual brother and a lonely housewife, Sol. Victor and Sol are two of 18 MEALS'' most fascinating characters as they each hide something - his sexuality, her depression - from those around them. Best of all is Pedro Alsono as Vladimir, a local celebrity actor who makes a meal for a mystery woman who never arrives. Who hasn''t gone to a lot of trouble to do something extra special for someone just to have it go unappreciated?', 'Food, glorious food! Some of the most sumptuous and involving films revolve around that most common of acts: eating. 18 MEALS is an omnibus film of criss-crossing stories divided into three segments; breakfast, lunch and dinner. Jorge Coira''s debut feature, shot over nine days in Santiago de Compostela has enough tasty portions to please audiences. Amongst Coira''s expansive ensemble are aging street musician Edu, a pair awaking from a one-night stand, a businessman visiting his closeted homosexual brother and a lonely housewife, Sol. Victor and Sol are two of 18 MEALS'' most fascinating characters as they each hide something - his sexuality, her depression - from those around them. Best of all is Pedro Alsono as Vladimir, a local celebrity actor who makes a meal for a mystery woman who never arrives. Who hasn''t gone to a lot of trouble to do something extra special for someone just to have it go unappreciated?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x7dAPwtmwmLDnY6n1OOEzewImZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79854'),
  ('40688242857534179', '18 Presents', 2020, 'Drama, Family', 'Andrea Zuliani, Vittoria Cimarra, Giuseppe Costantino', 'Francesco Amato, Davide Lantieri, Massimo Gaudioso', 'Vittoria Puccini, Benedetta Porcaroli, Edoardo Leo, Sara Lazzaro, Marco Messeri, Betti Pedrazzi, Alessandro Giallocosta, Filippo Gili', null, 'Elisa is only forty when an incurable disease takes her from her husband and their daughter. Before her heart stops, Elisa finds a way to stay close to her: a gift for every birthday up to her adult age, 18 gifts to try to accompany her child''s growth year after year.', 'Elisa is only forty when an incurable disease takes her from her husband and their daughter. Before her heart stops, Elisa finds a way to stay close to her: a gift for every birthday up to her adult age, 18 gifts to try to accompany her child''s growth year after year.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lS7lqDT3NF2LcSPdxXNJY9pMxZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630220'),
  ('775567801398056235', '18 Year Old Model Rika''s Fancy Walk', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Jin-chul', null, 'Rika, Joo Ah, Si Hoo', null, 'At first, Yoo-jeong and Min-soo really loved each other. However, in a few months, there is a period of boredom between the two. Two people face each other and don''t eat. Yoo-jeong confides her worries to her friend So-hyeon. But So-hyeon never misses the chance and confesses her feelings to Min-soo. Min-soo’s heart is shaken by So-hyeon. I''m meeting So-hyeon secretly. After a secret meeting with So-hyeon, he finds some time to relax.', 'At first, Yoo-jeong and Min-soo really loved each other. However, in a few months, there is a period of boredom between the two. Two people face each other and don''t eat. Yoo-jeong confides her worries to her friend So-hyeon. But So-hyeon never misses the chance and confesses her feelings to Min-soo. Min-soo’s heart is shaken by So-hyeon. I''m meeting So-hyeon secretly. After a secret meeting with So-hyeon, he finds some time to relax.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/neTFIO3YIDcH6p8e8a0ka0V21fO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852363'),
  ('544119456556945930', '18 Year Old Seungha''s Easy Piece of Cake', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Jin-chul', null, 'Seung Ha, Gil Dong, Chul Jin', null, 'Min-soo, who just started living in a new home, calls his friends Woo-hyeon and Ji-yeong. The two kiss while Min-soo is away from home. Unfortunately, Min-soo also secretly had sex while sleeping. And Min-soo is watching them... Ji-yeong is provoking Min-soo after learning that he saw her having sex with Woo-hyeon. Who will Ji-yeong fall in love with after having sex with these two people? The sweet and bloody story of a woman and two men is just beginning.', 'Min-soo, who just started living in a new home, calls his friends Woo-hyeon and Ji-yeong. The two kiss while Min-soo is away from home. Unfortunately, Min-soo also secretly had sex while sleeping. And Min-soo is watching them... Ji-yeong is provoking Min-soo after learning that he saw her having sex with Woo-hyeon. Who will Ji-yeong fall in love with after having sex with these two people? The sweet and bloody story of a woman and two men is just beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iLXtwfwaFsz0ixojjmJvorJotey.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:730497'),
  ('163669193787515894', '18 Year Old Virgin', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Tamara Olson, Ben DeSousa, Benjamin Brugger', 'Naomi L. Selfman', 'Olivia May, Lauren Walsh, Todd Leigh, Dustin Harnish, Karmen Morales, Dan Sykes, J. Michael Trautmann, Robbie Henke', 'R', 'In a series of sexual mishaps, a high school senior tries to lose her virginity on the last night before graduation.', 'In a series of sexual mishaps, a high school senior tries to lose her virginity on the last night before graduation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tSYDRneeVQYxkhpFGeT4JuXxCqu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14912'),
  ('657034132034963267', '18 Years Later', 2010, 'Drama', 'Edoardo Leo, Pietro Maria Tirabassi, Henrique Laplaine', 'Marco Bonini, Edoardo Leo, Lucilla Schiaffino', 'Marco Bonini, Edoardo Leo, Sabrina Impacciatore, Eugenia Costantini, Gabriele Ferzetti, Tommaso Olivieri, Valerio Aprea, Pasquale Anselmo', null, 'Mirko and Genziano are two 35-year-old brothers who have not seen each other since their mother died in a freak accident in which they were involved—eighteen years ago. Since then, Genziano left to live in the UK and now is a stockbroker; Mirko instead remained in Rome, to stay with their father Marcello, working at the same run-down family shop. When Marcello dies, he leaves a task for the two brothers in his will: he asks them to take, on an old restored roadster, his ashes to the grave of his old mother in a village in Calabria, where the accident happened.', 'Mirko and Genziano are two 35-year-old brothers who have not seen each other since their mother died in a freak accident in which they were involved—eighteen years ago. Since then, Genziano left to live in the UK and now is a stockbroker; Mirko instead remained in Rome, to stay with their father Marcello, working at the same run-down family shop. When Marcello dies, he leaves a task for the two brothers in his will: he asks them to take, on an old restored roadster, his ashes to the grave of his old mother in a village in Calabria, where the accident happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bt6gViRmNHydQoRfCJ80D3ULQrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109979'),
  ('258741846111736030', '18 Years Old and Rising', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Frédéric Louf, Samuel Collardey', 'Frédéric Louf, Régis Jaulin', 'Pierre Niney, Lou de Laâge, Audrey Bastien, Ali Marhyar, Victor Bessière, Catherine Chevallier, Michel Vuillermoz, Marion Chabassol', null, 'Primo is an ordinary middle-class youngster studying for his baccalaureate, who gets side-tracked when he falls in love with a rich girl. They soon learn they have to deal with her condescending friends who look down upon this upstart.', 'Primo is an ordinary middle-class youngster studying for his baccalaureate, who gets side-tracked when he falls in love with a rich girl. They soon learn they have to deal with her condescending friends who look down upon this upstart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aZu7LcBkEcxdXefAqwJzVQ5TU3h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91052'),
  ('815164968284151641', '180° South', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Chris Malloy, Daniel Moder', null, 'Yvon Chouinard, Doug Tompkins, Keith Malloy, Makohe, Timmy O''Neill', 'PG', 'The film follows adventurer Jeff Johnson as he retraces the epic 1968 journey of his heroes Yvon Chouinard and Doug Tompkins to Patagonia.', 'The film follows adventurer Jeff Johnson as he retraces the epic 1968 journey of his heroes Yvon Chouinard and Doug Tompkins to Patagonia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jLvxcvpEbQ1bRETJZ3NlKpjQuLC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39333'),
  ('700909587583729287', '1860', 1934, 'Drama, History', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Giulio De Luca, Anchise Brizzi', 'Alessandro Blasetti, Emilio Cecchi', 'Giuseppe Gulino, Aida Bellia, Gianfranco Giachetti, Mario Ferrari, Maria Denis, Ugo Gracci, Vasco Creti, Totò Majorana', null, 'The story is the harried attempt of a Sicilian partisan, as part of the risorgimento, to reach Garibaldi''s headquarters in Northern Italy, and to petition the revered revolutionary to rescue part of his besieged land. Along the way, the peasant hero encounters many colorful Italians, differing in class and age, and holding political opinions of every type. There is a key train scene, and the film ends on the battlefield, Italian unification a success, despite brutal losses.', 'The story is the harried attempt of a Sicilian partisan, as part of the risorgimento, to reach Garibaldi''s headquarters in Northern Italy, and to petition the revered revolutionary to rescue part of his besieged land. Along the way, the peasant hero encounters many colorful Italians, differing in class and age, and holding political opinions of every type. There is a key train scene, and the film ends on the battlefield, Italian unification a success, despite brutal losses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7uMQ6UyIGE5hDzeZVdOIRipHfFc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94889'),
  ('882506950523465146', '1898: Our Last Men in the Philippines', 2016, 'War, Drama, History', 'Salvador Calvo, Álex Catalán', 'Alejandro Hernández', 'Luis Tosar, Javier Gutiérrez, Álvaro Cervantes, Karra Elejalde, Carlos Hipólito, Ricardo Gómez, Eduard Fernández, Patrick Criado', 'PG-13', 'The Philippines, 1898. Fifty Spanish soldiers arrive in the small village of Baler to rebuild an outpost. Although the war against the Filipinos and their American allies is almost lost, as is the Spanish Empire, the garrison will endure a cruel siege for eleven months. They will be the last to surrender.', 'The Philippines, 1898. Fifty Spanish soldiers arrive in the small village of Baler to rebuild an outpost. Although the war against the Filipinos and their American allies is almost lost, as is the Spanish Empire, the garrison will endure a cruel siege for eleven months. They will be the last to surrender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q2CbFRigH5qz8v68Q5GbadSMcOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403357'),
  ('263792764507040427', '18th Rose', 2026, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dolly Dulu', 'Dolly Dulu, John Carlo Pacala', 'Xyriel Manabat, Kyle Echarri, Yayo Aguila, Cris Villanueva, Nikki Valdez', null, 'A spirited teen dreaming of the perfect debut makes a deal with a lonely newcomer, but unexpected feelings and revelations may shatter their plans.', 'A spirited teen dreaming of the perfect debut makes a deal with a lonely newcomer, but unexpected feelings and revelations may shatter their plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pUwaXT6tdA6sek8o6SdFYudJDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1631917'),
  ('1077575623089088001', '18x2 Beyond Youthful Days', 2024, 'Romance, Drama', 'Michihito Fujii, Lucy Chen, Keisuke Imamura', 'Michihito Fujii', 'Greg Hsu, Kaya Kiyohara, Joseph Chang, Shunsuke Michieda, Haru Kuroki, Takashi Yamanaka, Yutaka Matsushige, Hitomi Kuroki', null, 'Having lost his job and the company he built, a 36-year-old man at rock bottom goes on a wistful solo trip to Japan in search of the love he left behind.', 'Having lost his job and the company he built, a 36-year-old man at rock bottom goes on a wistful solo trip to Japan in search of the love he left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nt68WTFgtZdLBwpLBF2q7GFq5Fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1188258'),
  ('771248356966842688', '19', 2000, 'Drama, Crime', 'Kazushi Watanabe, Masakazu Oka', 'Kazushi Watanabe', 'Daijiro Kawaoka, Kazushi Watanabe, Daijiro Kawaoka, Masashi Endô, Nachi Nozawa, Ryo Shinmyo', null, 'A university student is kidnapped by young men in a car. No ransom is asked as the men are just bored roving thugs who have nothing better to do nor do they have any specific mission or purpose. Fascinated by the men''s close bonds, the abused student slowly turns from victim to accomplice.', 'A university student is kidnapped by young men in a car. No ransom is asked as the men are just bored roving thugs who have nothing better to do nor do they have any specific mission or purpose. Fascinated by the men''s close bonds, the abused student slowly turns from victim to accomplice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Z5O0mrai9WoNhJCSmF3rt1oeG8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36280'),
  ('797208868471984151', '19-Nineteen', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jang Yong-woo', 'Yumiko Inoue', 'T.O.P, Huh Yi-jae, SEUNGRI, Jang So-yeon, Kim Young-ho, Lee Young-bum, Shin Min-hee, Maeng Bong-hak', null, 'After graduating from high school Min-seo fails to get into college. He spends the next year cramming for his entrance exam once again. Jeong-hun a university student fresh out of high school school.', 'After graduating from high school Min-seo fails to get into college. He spends the next year cramming for his entrance exam once again. Jeong-hun a university student fresh out of high school school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p9jVfhZ24AiPFXVLaBC27cOG5lV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50792'),
  ('533283475990270528', '1911', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, History, War', 'Zhang Li, Jackie Chan, Tang Guoqiang', 'Wang Xing-Dong, Chen Bao-Guang', 'Jackie Chan, Li Bingbing, Joan Chen, Jaycee Chan, Jiang Wu, Hu Ge, Ning Jing, Winston Chao', 'R', 'China''s first President Sun Yat-Sen and military commander Huang Xing lead the revolutionary Wuchang Uprising in a bid to put an end to the reign of the Qing Dynasty.', 'China''s first President Sun Yat-Sen and military commander Huang Xing lead the revolutionary Wuchang Uprising in a bid to put an end to the reign of the Qing Dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k93DWz849jCsHW7rIbeUAIxewpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76349'),
  ('393285462910426732', '1914 the Glorious Summer', 1996, 'Drama', 'Christian de Chalonge, Patrick Blossier', 'Christian de Chalonge', 'Claude Rich, Maria Pacôme, Hippolyte Girardot, Judith Henry, Marianne Denicourt, Philippe Torreton, Emmanuel Salinger, Julia Maraval', null, 'An old aristocrat, short of money, who does not accept the new world ruled by the bourgeois class ,epitomized by the industrialist and by the doctor who finally grabs the the aristocrat''s castle which soon will be turned into a hospital.', 'An old aristocrat, short of money, who does not accept the new world ruled by the bourgeois class ,epitomized by the industrialist and by the doctor who finally grabs the the aristocrat''s castle which soon will be turned into a hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lpDIypodI027aJKSAFu0WFLuJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107883'),
  ('558439564120784901', '1917', 2019, 'War, History, Drama', 'Joey Coughlin, Sam Mendes, Roger Deakins', 'Krysty Wilson-Cairns, Sam Mendes', 'George MacKay, Dean-Charles Chapman, Mark Strong, Andrew Scott, Richard Madden, Claire Duburcq, Colin Firth, Benedict Cumberbatch', 'R', 'At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.', 'At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530915'),
  ('505368687553533115', '1920', 2008, 'Horror', 'Vikram Bhatt, Rajat Poddar, Uday Inamati', 'Vikram Bhatt, Dheeraj Rattan', 'Rajneesh Duggal, Adah Sharma, Raj Zutshi, Vipin Sharma, Anjori Alagh, Indraneil Sengupta, Amin Hajee, Shri Vallabh Vyas', null, '1920, India. After forsaking his family and religion, a husband finds his wife is possessed by a spirit.', '1920, India. After forsaking his family and religion, a husband finds his wife is possessed by a spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i9rva37n3B27xHmcur8oxW8Ludi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19951'),
  ('1067784009751762874', '1920 London', 2016, 'Horror', 'Tinu Suresh Desai', 'Tanya Pathak, Sukhmani Sadana', 'Sharman Joshi, Meera Chopra, Vishal Karwal, Surendra Pal, Charu Rohatgi, Sushmita Mukherjee, Meenal Kapoor, Vishal Malhotra', null, 'Shivangi lives in London with her husband Veer Singh. One day, he receives a gift from Rajasthan. From then, strange things happen with Veer and his condition deteriorates.', 'Shivangi lives in London with her husband Veer Singh. One day, he receives a gift from Rajasthan. From then, strange things happen with Veer and his condition deteriorates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rs4RBiOX8qoUG5bw1SlGFuzUYws.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392222'),
  ('226985838404833449', '1920: Evil Returns', 2012, 'Thriller, Horror, Romance', 'Bhushan Patel', 'Vikram Bhatt', 'Aftab Shivdasani, Tia Bajpai, Vidya Malvade, Sharad Kelkar, Vicky Ahuja, Sanjay Sharma, Monica Patel', null, 'This story revolves around a famous poet who meets a woman who is in trouble. In order to treat her, he takes her to Shimla in a big hospital, but soon that woman gets possessed by devil and goes out of control. Now the question remains that what is the relation that poet shares with her which compelled him to go to any extent to save her, why she was possessed by devil and who is the devil.', 'This story revolves around a famous poet who meets a woman who is in trouble. In order to treat her, he takes her to Shimla in a big hospital, but soon that woman gets possessed by devil and goes out of control. Now the question remains that what is the relation that poet shares with her which compelled him to go to any extent to save her, why she was possessed by devil and who is the devil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGxYnL1fjDdzSbIowzyQTc4QNjY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158519'),
  ('480492225362358917', '1921', 2018, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Vikram Bhatt, Prakash Kutty', 'Vikram Bhatt', 'Zareen Khan, Karan Kundra, Vikram Bhatt, Angela Krislinzki, Nidhi Chitrakar, Aradhya Taing, Manjit Singh, Neil Broome', null, 'When Ayush arrives in England to learn music, he is shocked and scared when the manor he is living in becomes haunted by spirits. To exorcise them, he seeks the help of Rose, a woman who can see and speak with them.', 'When Ayush arrives in England to learn music, he is shocked and scared when the manor he is living in becomes haunted by spirits. To exorcise them, he seeks the help of Rose, a woman who can see and speak with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEOwlojOgtbfdFrMANVwVohOqyY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:492181'),
  ('280580418283983315', '1922', 1978, 'Drama, History', 'Nikos Kavoukidis, Nikos Koundouros, Thanasis Georgiadis', 'Nikos Koundouros, Stratis Karras', 'Antigoni Amanitou, Zaharias Rohas, Nikos Kapios, Vasilis Kolovos, Olga Tournaki, Betty Valassi, Eleonora Stathopoulou, Vasilis Laggos', null, 'Based on the book by Ilias Venezis "The Number 31328", the film by Nikos Koundouros unfolds through the personal tragedies of three characters, the Asia Minor Disaster and the agonizing travails of the Asia Minor Greeks who had been arrested and led to death by Kemal''s troops and armed groups of Muslims. The wife of a merchant, a teacher and a seventeen-year old boy try to survive, following the column of prisoners into the depths of Asia Minor.', 'Based on the book by Ilias Venezis "The Number 31328", the film by Nikos Koundouros unfolds through the personal tragedies of three characters, the Asia Minor Disaster and the agonizing travails of the Asia Minor Greeks who had been arrested and led to death by Kemal''s troops and armed groups of Muslims. The wife of a merchant, a teacher and a seventeen-year old boy try to survive, following the column of prisoners into the depths of Asia Minor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4M91glA1308jgyxDfVqEjlgnhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291519'),
  ('181457944964220206', '1922', 2017, 'Horror, Crime, Drama', 'Zak Hilditch, Pierre Gill, Ben Richardson', 'Zak Hilditch', 'Thomas Jane, Molly Parker, Dylan Schmid, Kaitlyn Bernard, Neal McDonough, Tanya Champoux, Brian d''Arcy James, Bob Frazer', null, 'A simple yet proud rancher conspires to murder his wife for financial gain, convincing his teenage son to participate.', 'A simple yet proud rancher conspires to murder his wife for financial gain, convincing his teenage son to participate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4FQOiSRhTLWulHl5Vpg37FMArH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452507'),
  ('981414173430766257', '1925 Studio Tour', 1925, 'Documentary', 'William H. Daniels', null, 'Carey Wilson, Howard Hawks, Victor Sjöström, Monta Bell, Josef von Sternberg, Erich von Stroheim, King Vidor, Fred Niblo', null, 'A tour of the Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Studio in 1925 shows the people who make the movies there, and gives viewers a glimpse at how movies are made.', 'A tour of the Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Studio in 1925 shows the people who make the movies there, and gives viewers a glimpse at how movies are made.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMLzIXE8lSMCxQ5Cwynu3lE3brc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184435'),
  ('302673740492311523', '1938 Diverse', 2018, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Giorgio Treves', 'Giorgio Treves, Luca Scivoletto', null, null, '1938 - 2018: Eighty years after the Promulgation of the Fascist Racial Laws: an important and unfortunately very topical anniversary. Eighty years ago, Italian population, who had not a tradition of anti-Semitism, was pushed by the fascist propaganda into accepting the persecution of a minority, which had been living in Italy for centuries.', '1938 - 2018: Eighty years after the Promulgation of the Fascist Racial Laws: an important and unfortunately very topical anniversary. Eighty years ago, Italian population, who had not a tradition of anti-Semitism, was pushed by the fascist propaganda into accepting the persecution of a minority, which had been living in Italy for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mY0q6TC1uYPrLodqLO9jYHFN0FE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539029'),
  ('181582238599525479', '1939', 1989, 'Drama, War', 'Göran Carmback, Jens Fischer', 'Kjell Sundstedt, Waldemar Bergendahl, Catti Edfeldt', 'Helene Egelund, Helena Bergström, Per Morberg, Ingvar Hirdwall, Anita Ekström, Per Oscarsson, Per Grytt, Johan Ulveson', null, 'When the war breaks out, Annika lives with her parents in Värmland, close to the border to Norway. Her cousin Harald is a dealer in the black market but has to escape from the police to Norway. Annika moves to Stockholm and gets a job as a waitress. She meets the happy-go-lucky Berit and together they have a wonderful time. She also meets a young man, Bengt, whom she marries. But almost immediately she discovers that her husband is different from the man who was courting her. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'When the war breaks out, Annika lives with her parents in Värmland, close to the border to Norway. Her cousin Harald is a dealer in the black market but has to escape from the police to Norway. Annika moves to Stockholm and gets a job as a waitress. She meets the happy-go-lucky Berit and together they have a wonderful time. She also meets a young man, Bengt, whom she marries. But almost immediately she discovers that her husband is different from the man who was courting her. Plot by Mattias Thuresson.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1a5mL6ZnDkk0XTF7ttnAzXKRwiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170442'),
  ('108087163456900882', '1941', 1941, null, 'Francis Lee, Francis Lee', null, null, null, 'In December, 1941, using music by Stravinsky, this film provides a reaction to the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor. An egg is smashed by a hammer; red color with white and then blue dominates the frame. Blue paint runs; small bulbs float. The dark colors spread. White, red, blue, and black dominate the frame. Then comes fire. The bulbs burn and break. A broken bulb''s filaments are exposed.', 'In December, 1941, using music by Stravinsky, this film provides a reaction to the Japanese attack on Pearl Harbor. An egg is smashed by a hammer; red color with white and then blue dominates the frame. Blue paint runs; small bulbs float. The dark colors spread. White, red, blue, and black dominate the frame. Then comes fire. The bulbs burn and break. A broken bulb''s filaments are exposed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/py82INBB23kuulFLvdcu9pAqqCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236578'),
  ('693827806294444110', '1941', 1979, 'Comedy, War', 'Steven Spielberg, William A. Fraker, Steve Perry', 'Bob Gale, Robert Zemeckis', 'Dan Aykroyd, Ned Beatty, John Belushi, Lorraine Gary, Murray Hamilton, Christopher Lee, Tim Matheson, Toshirō Mifune', 'PG', 'In the days after the attack on Pearl Harbor, panic grips California, where a military officer leads a mob chasing a Japanese sub.', 'In the days after the attack on Pearl Harbor, panic grips California, where a military officer leads a mob chasing a Japanese sub.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/52Bn5yC6IHQuVxPUza3Q6RZCZTu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11519'),
  ('351892157980476855', '1942: A Love Story', 1994, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Binod Pradhan', 'Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Sanjay Leela Bhansali', 'Anil Kapoor, Manisha Koirala, Jackie Shroff, Anupam Kher, Chandni, Danny Denzongpa, Brian Glover, Pran Sikand', null, 'The son of a politician loyal to the British rule falls in love with the daughter of a freedom fighter.', 'The son of a politician loyal to the British rule falls in love with the daughter of a freedom fighter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nWJj37l6rIrpegYGoobLtdHOqV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33124'),
  ('1058312460697578111', '1942: Unknown Battle', 2019, 'War, Drama, History', 'Edgar Zhamgaryan, Igor Kopylov, Evgeny Kordunsky', null, 'Sergey Zharkov, Ivan Batarev, Oleg Gayanov, Arseny Semenov, Aleksandr Gorbatov, Aleksandr Bukharov, Grigory Nekrasov, Igor Grabuzov', 'NR', 'WWII 1942: Rzhev, USSR. Stuck in a crucial strategical position, a small company from the Red Army does whatever it takes to fend off the Nazis.', 'WWII 1942: Rzhev, USSR. Stuck in a crucial strategical position, a small company from the Red Army does whatever it takes to fend off the Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k0dKShTvJZdqkwzJ4qqloy2nNFP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647498'),
  ('601855139904418036', '1944', 2015, 'War, Drama', 'Elmo Nüganen, Rein Kotov, Mart Taniel', 'Leo Kunnas', 'Kaspar Velberg, Kristjan Üksküla, Maiken Pius, Gert Raudsep, Hendrik Toompere Jr., Karl-Andreas Kalmet, Henrik Kalmet, Pääru Oja', null, 'The events of the war in 1944, from the Blue Hills to Sõrve Peninsula. Shown through the eyes of Estonian soldiers who had to pick sides and fight against fellow brothers. Choices have to be made, not only by the soldiers, but also by their loved ones.', 'The events of the war in 1944, from the Blue Hills to Sõrve Peninsula. Shown through the eyes of Estonian soldiers who had to pick sides and fight against fellow brothers. Choices have to be made, not only by the soldiers, but also by their loved ones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DyGmQ53Tj4iSvYxMrj3x4o5kwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321303'),
  ('59332608980894345', '1944 The Final Defence', 2007, 'War, Drama, History', 'Åke Lindman, Katri Kannisto, Kerkko Kuha', 'Esko Salervo, Stefan Forss, Benedict Zilliacus', 'Rauno Ahonen, Mikko Bredenberg, Riko Eklundh, Marc Gassot, Marcus Groth, Johan Hallström, Kari Hevossaari, Aku Hirviniemi', null, 'The Soviet army breaks through the Finnish defences on the Karelian Isthmus in June 1944, advancing with overwhelming force. Somehow, the Finnish troops must find the strength to fight back, with all odds against them. The Battle of Tali-Ihantala was the largest battle ever fought in the history of the Nordic countries. This film depicts the true events through five separate stories.', 'The Soviet army breaks through the Finnish defences on the Karelian Isthmus in June 1944, advancing with overwhelming force. Somehow, the Finnish troops must find the strength to fight back, with all odds against them. The Battle of Tali-Ihantala was the largest battle ever fought in the history of the Nordic countries. This film depicts the true events through five separate stories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/35azd5Cp0luhyDrgQWlWPKOqtI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49322'),
  ('131996471070436636', '1945', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ferenc Török, Elemér Ragályi', 'Ferenc Török, Gábor T. Szántó', 'Péter Rudolf, Bence Tasnádi, Tamás Szabó Kimmel, Dóra Sztarenki, Ági Szirtes, József Szarvas, Eszter Nagy-Kálózy, Iván Angelusz', null, 'An unsettling feeling overwhelms a small Hungarian town when two orthodox Jews arrive with a mysterious trunk. As residents begin to speculate on the purpose of the visit of these two strangers, order starts to crumble in town with some pursuing devious plans and others finding remorse in their hearts.', 'An unsettling feeling overwhelms a small Hungarian town when two orthodox Jews arrive with a mysterious trunk. As residents begin to speculate on the purpose of the visit of these two strangers, order starts to crumble in town with some pursuing devious plans and others finding remorse in their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31sxtOLEsuN2m2OWGti3uEYc6rz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440342'),
  ('237526091887694671', '1945: The Fall of the Reich', 2015, 'Documentary', 'David Korn-Brzoza', 'Olivier Wieviorka, David Korn-Brzoza', 'Vincent Lindon', null, 'In June 1944, optimism reigned in the Allied camp. In the West, the Normandy landings were a success. In their advance, the troops soon threatened the German border. In the East, the Red Army launched an attack. With Operation Bagration, it swept into Belarus and forced the Wehrmacht into a terrible retreat. It was a time for confidence. There was no doubt: "The war would be over before Christmas." And yet... The war dragged on for almost another year. Eleven long months of fighting, punctuated by terrible battles and atrocious war crimes. Eleven months of fear and hope, which shook the certainties of the leaders and the daily lives of the men. Eleven murderous months, which left an eternal scar on hearts and in history.', 'In June 1944, optimism reigned in the Allied camp. In the West, the Normandy landings were a success. In their advance, the troops soon threatened the German border. In the East, the Red Army launched an attack. With Operation Bagration, it swept into Belarus and forced the Wehrmacht into a terrible retreat. It was a time for confidence. There was no doubt: "The war would be over before Christmas." And yet... The war dragged on for almost another year. Eleven long months of fighting, punctuated by terrible battles and atrocious war crimes. Eleven months of fear and hope, which shook the certainties of the leaders and the daily lives of the men. Eleven murderous months, which left an eternal scar on hearts and in history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w3XiwnPGZSiPaVFURDlIJ1TgyqG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357459'),
  ('789299281474002569', '1969', 1988, 'Drama, War, Romance', 'Ernest Thompson, Jules Brenner, David B. Householter', 'Ernest Thompson', 'Robert Downey Jr., Kiefer Sutherland, Bruce Dern, Mariette Hartley, Winona Ryder, Joanna Cassidy, Christopher Wynne, Mert Hatfield', 'R', 'Two rebellious youths, Ralph and Scott, find themselves struggling with adulthood as the Vietnam War rages. Feeling trapped in their small town, Scott battles with his conservative veteran father, Cliff, and Ralph deals with his desperately sexual mother, Ev. When tragic news arrives from overseas, the entire town, inspired by Ralph and Scott''s antiwar efforts, reevaluates its attitude toward the war.', 'Two rebellious youths, Ralph and Scott, find themselves struggling with adulthood as the Vietnam War rages. Feeling trapped in their small town, Scott battles with his conservative veteran father, Cliff, and Ralph deals with his desperately sexual mother, Ev. When tragic news arrives from overseas, the entire town, inspired by Ralph and Scott''s antiwar efforts, reevaluates its attitude toward the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lM8B5gsF28UNKMJY3ZVSkpy5Ie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47817'),
  ('517768306403373975', '1971', 2007, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Amrit Sagar Chopra', null, 'Manoj Bajpayee, Ravi Kishan, Sunil Chavan, Deepak Dobriyal, Chittaranjan Giri, Deepti Gupta, Pankaj Kalra, Manav Kaul', null, 'Based on true facts, the film revolves around 6 brave soldiers who escape from the clutches of the Pakistan Army and risk death with honour and courage with sacrifice towards their journey home.', 'Based on true facts, the film revolves around 6 brave soldiers who escape from the clutches of the Pakistan Army and risk death with honour and courage with sacrifice towards their journey home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pyifRwztOHpapPWM6ewMnNTdJPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199408'),
  ('362516150670836146', '1974, une partie de campagne', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Raymond Depardon', null, 'Valéry Giscard d''Estaing, Charles Aznavour, Jacques Chirac, Philippe Clay, Alain Duhamel, Anne-Aymone Giscard d''Estaing, Jacinthe Giscard d''Estaing, Valérie-Anne Giscard d''Estaing', null, 'Following the 1974 French presidential campaign with Valéry Giscard d’Estaing.', 'Following the 1974 French presidential campaign with Valéry Giscard d’Estaing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9BfIq8HIkhWzuf1nwqPKnYT6DH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37480'),
  ('522506245125485276', '1974: The Possession of Altair', 2017, 'Mystery, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Victor Dryere, Guillermo Garza', 'Victor Dryere', 'Diana Bovio, Rolando Breme, Guillermo Callahan, Blanca Alarcón, Rubén González Garza, Oliverio Gareli, Ana Banda', null, 'A newlywed couple disappeared in 1974, their 8mm tapes reveal one of the most horrifying events in Mexican history.', 'A newlywed couple disappeared in 1974, their 8mm tapes reveal one of the most horrifying events in Mexican history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzj3C2Ef59PcRLSLcg8PPVnRcZh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416079'),
  ('226830505865793785', '1978', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Nicolás Onetti, Luciano Onetti, Luciano Montes de Oca', 'Nicolás Onetti, Luciano Onetti, Camilo Zaffora', 'Agustin Olcese, Mario Alarcón, Carlos Portaluppi, Santiago Rios, Jorge Lorenzo, Agustín Pardella, Ezequiel Pache, Valeria San Martin', null, 'During the World Cup final between Argentina and Holland, in times of military dictatorship, a group of torturers kidnap a group of young people. What begins as an inhumane interrogation turns into hell: the wrong group has been kidnapped.', 'During the World Cup final between Argentina and Holland, in times of military dictatorship, a group of torturers kidnap a group of young people. What begins as an inhumane interrogation turns into hell: the wrong group has been kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv3fys5S6uoATa3YXEVbPEJatSS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1288998'),
  ('84109076216091931', '1981', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ricardo Trogi, Steve Asselin', 'Ricardo Trogi', 'Jean-Carl Boucher, Claudio Colangelo, Sandrine Bisson, Gabriel Maillé, Élizabeth Adam, Rose Adam, Marjolaine Lemieux, Claude-Michel Bleau', 'NR', 'Filmmaker Ricardo Trogi recalls the events surrounding his family moving to a new neighborhood when he was 11 years old.', 'Filmmaker Ricardo Trogi recalls the events surrounding his family moving to a new neighborhood when he was 11 years old.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMQg4QThJsA7HjwkhNL8LMtRQNN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30174'),
  ('42173323485743696', '1982', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Lucas Gallo', 'Lucas Gallo', null, null, 'In 1982, the Argentine military dictatorship invaded the Malvinas Islands, located 500 kilometers off the country’s coast. The dictatorial government left no stone unturned in using propaganda to convince the people of their mission. Consisting almost entirely of excerpts from the TV program 60 minutes, 1982 summarizes the media campaign that took place over the 74 days of war, when Argentine troops tried to take their island back from the British. We watch TV anchormen ask viewers to donate money for weapons, inspire them to sing the national anthem at home, and welcome government leaders as heroes as they “spontaneously” show up at the studio to celebrate the importance of the mission for the motherland.', 'In 1982, the Argentine military dictatorship invaded the Malvinas Islands, located 500 kilometers off the country’s coast. The dictatorial government left no stone unturned in using propaganda to convince the people of their mission. Consisting almost entirely of excerpts from the TV program 60 minutes, 1982 summarizes the media campaign that took place over the 74 days of war, when Argentine troops tried to take their island back from the British. We watch TV anchormen ask viewers to donate money for weapons, inspire them to sing the national anthem at home, and welcome government leaders as heroes as they “spontaneously” show up at the studio to celebrate the importance of the mission for the motherland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCy5TFgcF2WtIYAv6jsVc0xbis1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:649794'),
  ('986110292412958349', '1982', 2020, 'Drama, History, War', 'Oualid Mouaness, Brian Rigney Hubbard', 'Oualid Mouaness', 'Nadine Labaki, Mohammad Dali, Ghassan Maalouf, Aliya Khalidi, Rodrigue Sleiman, Gia Madi, Lelya Harkous, Said Serhan', 'NR', 'On the eve of an invasion in 1982 Lebanon, an 11-year-old boy at a mountain school is determined to express his feelings to a classmate. As tension builds across the country, the day takes an unexpected turn, reflecting the fragile line between innocence and conflict. Through a child''s eyes, the film explores the impact of war, the power of love, and the resilience of the human spirit.', 'On the eve of an invasion in 1982 Lebanon, an 11-year-old boy at a mountain school is determined to express his feelings to a classmate. As tension builds across the country, the day takes an unexpected turn, reflecting the fragile line between innocence and conflict. Through a child''s eyes, the film explores the impact of war, the power of love, and the resilience of the human spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u9NwepU5TWxvDw00r4vkMXQz77R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:621705'),
  ('872966673553988948', '1984', 1956, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Michael Anderson, C.M. Pennington-Richards', 'William Templeton, Ralph Gilbert Bettison', 'Edmond O''Brien, Jan Sterling, Michael Redgrave, David Kossoff, Mervyn Johns, Donald Pleasence, Carol Wolveridge, Ernest Clark', 'NR', 'In a totalitarian future society, a man whose daily work is rewriting history tries to rebel by falling in love.', 'In a totalitarian future society, a man whose daily work is rewriting history tries to rebel by falling in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EOfGaRluwJe6OlR21JtbLhWDvt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1984'),
  ('492826554978418643', '1985', 2018, 'Drama', 'Hutch Crane, Yen Tan, Jeff Weiss', 'Yen Tan', 'Cory Michael Smith, Virginia Madsen, Michael Chiklis, Jamie Chung, Aidan Langford, Ryan Piers Williams, Michael Darby, Bryan Massey', 'NR', 'Having been gone for three years, closeted advertising executive Adrian returns to his Texas hometown and struggles to reveal his dire circumstances to his conservative family.', 'Having been gone for three years, closeted advertising executive Adrian returns to his Texas hometown and struggles to reveal his dire circumstances to his conservative family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mV7QRq3nI238vxlbyXRYFQKfbyL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:502220'),
  ('803966370630113887', '1987', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Steve Asselin, Ricardo Trogi', 'Ricardo Trogi', 'Jean-Carl Boucher, Claudio Colangelo, Sandrine Bisson, Laurent-Christophe De Ruelle, Pier-Luc Funk, Simon Pigeon, Éléonore Lamothe, Alyssa Labelle', null, 'In 1987, Ricardo is 17 years old. This summer, Ricardo has a busy schedule: loose his virginity, find a way to get into bars, have a car, spend time with his friends. In order to rapidly make money, Ricardo decides to use his italian inheritance and take a shortcut in the medium of crime. But things will go wrong...', 'In 1987, Ricardo is 17 years old. This summer, Ricardo has a busy schedule: loose his virginity, find a way to get into bars, have a car, spend time with his friends. In order to rapidly make money, Ricardo decides to use his italian inheritance and take a shortcut in the medium of crime. But things will go wrong...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5Od9rVwDBJ9FEtfyxJxjakaoZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280218'),
  ('646272098125075862', '1987: When the Day Comes', 2017, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Kim Sung-han, Jang Joon-hwan, Su Kim', 'Kim Kyung-chan', 'Kim Yun-seok, Ha Jung-woo, Yoo Hai-jin, Kim Tae-ri, Park Hee-soon, Lee Hee-jun, Sul Kyung-gu, Yeo Jin-goo', null, 'In January 1987, a 22-year-old college student dies during a police interrogation. Under the orders of Director Park, the police request the body to be cremated in order to destroy evidence. Public Prosecutor Choi, who was on duty on the day of the incident, denies the request and calls for an autopsy. The police maintain the lie that the death was a simple accident, resulting from shock. The autopsy results, however, point to torture as the cause of death. Yoon, a journalist following the case, reports that the death was a result of asphyxiation during torture. Director Park attempts to conceal the truth by ending the case, arresting two detectives including inspector Cho. While in prison, inspector Cho reveals the truth to prison guard Han Byung-yong, who embarks on a dangerous mission to relay the information to an opposition politician through his niece, Yeon-hee.', 'In January 1987, a 22-year-old college student dies during a police interrogation. Under the orders of Director Park, the police request the body to be cremated in order to destroy evidence. Public Prosecutor Choi, who was on duty on the day of the incident, denies the request and calls for an autopsy. The police maintain the lie that the death was a simple accident, resulting from shock. The autopsy results, however, point to torture as the cause of death. Yoon, a journalist following the case, reports that the death was a result of asphyxiation during torture. Director Park attempts to conceal the truth by ending the case, arresting two detectives including inspector Cho. While in prison, inspector Cho reveals the truth to prison guard Han Byung-yong, who embarks on a dangerous mission to relay the information to an opposition politician through his niece, Yeon-hee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3KgL5KiGk8ABfMFHzGP2GnoH8sL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437103'),
  ('941605290564863844', '1989: A Spy Story', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Ann-Sophie Heier, Torsten Königs, Sven Bohse', 'Silke Steiner', 'Petra Schmidt-Schaller, Harald Schrott, Ulrich Thomsen, Artjom Gilz, Carsten Hayes, Alexander Beyer, Nina Rausch, Mike Davies', null, 'Due to the fall of the Berlin Wall, a double agent is targeted by the American foreign intelligence service CIA.', 'Due to the fall of the Berlin Wall, a double agent is targeted by the American foreign intelligence service CIA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zrLePj2pQrBMuKrTxhyl33oe9qH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589089'),
  ('705976671223866994', '1990: The Bronx Warriors', 1982, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Enzo G. Castellari, Stefania Girolami Goodwin, Giuseppe Giglietti', 'Dardano Sacchetti, Enzo G. Castellari, Elisa Briganti', 'Vic Morrow, Christopher Connelly, Fred Williamson, Mark Gregory, Stefania Girolami Goodwin, Ennio Girolami, George Eastman, Joshua Sinclair', 'R', 'In post-apocalyptic New York City a policeman infiltrates the Bronx which has become a battleground for several murderous street gangs.', 'In post-apocalyptic New York City a policeman infiltrates the Bronx which has become a battleground for several murderous street gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w8s5YdbaXmlaXYaumDxbsuCL3c0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61755'),
  ('306385619362049509', '1991', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Steve Asselin, Ricardo Trogi, Bernard Chabot', 'Ricardo Trogi', 'Jean-Carl Boucher, Juliette Gosselin, Alexandre Nachi, Mamoudou Camara, Mara Lazaris, Sandrine Bisson, Claudio Colangelo, Rose Adam', null, 'Do you remember your first trip? Not the one you made at 5 years old with your parents to the East Coast of the United States. I mean the first time you traveled alone!? The great adventure. In 1991, I was a 21-years-old student. I went to Europe. Not because I wanted to visit all the great capitals, but because I wanted love... I wanted Marie-Ève Bernard.', 'Do you remember your first trip? Not the one you made at 5 years old with your parents to the East Coast of the United States. I mean the first time you traveled alone!? The great adventure. In 1991, I was a 21-years-old student. I went to Europe. Not because I wanted to visit all the great capitals, but because I wanted love... I wanted Marie-Ève Bernard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2hslgXSVEWv7VQlFhOzvMjnU3KR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490349'),
  ('1094565007660566070', '1991: The Year Punk Broke', 1992, 'Documentary, Music', 'David Markey, David Markey, Lee Ranaldo', null, 'Mark Arm, Lori Barbero, Kat Bjelland, Nic Close, Kurt Cobain, Don Fleming, Kim Gordon, Dave Grohl', null, 'David Markey''s documentary of life on the road with Sonic Youth and Nirvana during their tour of Europe in late 1991. Also featuring live performances by Dinosaur Jr, Babes in Toyland, The Ramones and Gumball.', 'David Markey''s documentary of life on the road with Sonic Youth and Nirvana during their tour of Europe in late 1991. Also featuring live performances by Dinosaur Jr, Babes in Toyland, The Ramones and Gumball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDWYYzzfBUeWQhWowEAExqwGbyv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28742'),
  ('444387347921691949', '1992', 2016, 'Drama', 'Anthony Doncque, Fabrice Main, Victor Baussonnie', 'Anthony Doncque', 'Louis Duneton, Matthieu Dessertine, Alain Beigel, Thibault Le Guellec, Michelangelo Passaniti, Cécile Rittweger, Isabelle Vossart', null, 'It''s 1992. Martin is 17 and he films his daily life with his Hi8 camera. He films anything and everything—his room, the world around him... But never his father, the thought doesn''t occur to him. One day he meets Dominique. He''s 23 and works as a student monitor at Martin''s high school.', 'It''s 1992. Martin is 17 and he films his daily life with his Hi8 camera. He films anything and everything—his room, the world around him... But never his father, the thought doesn''t occur to him. One day he meets Dominique. He''s 23 and works as a student monitor at Martin''s high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ywvnzsTMSygo1l90y86XJydUVKo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435104'),
  ('1084521954118199924', '1992', 2024, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Ariel Vromen, Nadeem Ashayer, Frankie DeMarco', 'Sascha Penn', 'Tyrese Gibson, Scott Eastwood, Ray Liotta, Dylan Arnold, Oleg Taktarov, Clé Bennett, Michael Beasley, Ori Pfeffer', 'R', 'In 1992, Mercer is desperately trying to rebuild his life and his relationship with his son amidst the turbulent Los Angeles uprising following the Rodney King verdict. Across town, another father and son put their own strained relationship to the test as they plot a dangerous heist to steal catalytic converters, which contain valuable platinum from the factory where Mercer works. As tensions rise and chaos erupts, both families reach their boiling points when their worlds collide.', 'In 1992, Mercer is desperately trying to rebuild his life and his relationship with his son amidst the turbulent Los Angeles uprising following the Rodney King verdict. Across town, another father and son put their own strained relationship to the test as they plot a dangerous heist to steal catalytic converters, which contain valuable platinum from the factory where Mercer works. As tensions rise and chaos erupts, both families reach their boiling points when their worlds collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPvFmQZM5HMspryyYbrtW02NR0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413846'),
  ('1009346521925707019', '1995', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Ricardo Trogi, Steve Asselin, Karel Quinn', 'Ricardo Trogi', 'Jean-Carl Boucher, Sandrine Bisson, Claudio Colangelo, Shadi Janho, Youssef Nekmouche, Rose Adam, Myriam Gaboury, Mickaël Gouin', null, 'In 1994, Ricardo gave up his dream of being a filmmaker. At twenty-four, he has already, in a way, accepted his destiny: that of a simple citizen, anonymous, lost in the immensity of consumer society. He will never be an artist. A call from Radio-Canada, however, rekindled the artistic flame of the young man whose application was selected among the finalists of the show La Course, 1994-95 Edition.', 'In 1994, Ricardo gave up his dream of being a filmmaker. At twenty-four, he has already, in a way, accepted his destiny: that of a simple citizen, anonymous, lost in the immensity of consumer society. He will never be an artist. A call from Radio-Canada, however, rekindled the artistic flame of the young man whose application was selected among the finalists of the show La Course, 1994-95 Edition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKgRzK743xFWGFarlNt3r6FJCeE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200260'),
  ('955609890814372337', '1BR', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'David Marmor, David Bolen', 'David Marmor', 'Nicole Brydon Bloom, Giles Matthey, Taylor Nichols, Alan Blumenfeld, Naomi Grossman, Celeste Sullivan, Susan Davis, Clayton Hoff', 'R', 'When Sarah lucks into a sweet one-bedroom at Asilo Del Mar Apartments in Los Angeles, she thinks she''s hit the jackpot. It''s got plenty of space, friendly tenants, group BBQs and even a cute neighbour next door. All is not what it seems: loud noises start keeping her awake at night; her cat is missing; everyone seems to be a little too helpful and friendly, except for the weirdo, Lester. Soon, Sarah learns she didn''t choose this apartment — it chose her.', 'When Sarah lucks into a sweet one-bedroom at Asilo Del Mar Apartments in Los Angeles, she thinks she''s hit the jackpot. It''s got plenty of space, friendly tenants, group BBQs and even a cute neighbour next door. All is not what it seems: loud noises start keeping her awake at night; her cat is missing; everyone seems to be a little too helpful and friendly, except for the weirdo, Lester. Soon, Sarah learns she didn''t choose this apartment — it chose her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aiYLasUoJXqOgJ9pnahDMELC9wf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611605'),
  ('895057444178791914', '1st Kiss', 2025, 'Drama, Fantasy, Romance', 'Ayuko Tsukahara, Takuji Yamada, Hidetoshi Shinomiya', 'Yuji Sakamoto', 'Takako Matsu, Hokuto Matsumura, Riho Yoshioka, Nana Mori, Lily Franky, YOU, Pistol Takehara, Daisuke Matsuda', null, 'After losing her husband to death following a troubled marriage, a woman unexpectedly travels back to the moment before their first meeting, allowing them to reconnect and rekindle their romance.', 'After losing her husband to death following a troubled marriage, a woman unexpectedly travels back to the moment before their first meeting, allowing them to reconnect and rekindle their romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8AjjOMNQxvqOP6Cv43r45W3nvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1328862'),
  ('260430736141086817', '1st Love', 2013, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Sylvestre, Nathalie Moliavko-Visotzky', 'Guillaume Sylvestre', 'Macha Grenon, Marianne Fortier, Pierre-Luc Brillant, Johanne-Marie Tremblay, Sylvie Boucher, Loïc Esteves, Benoît Gouin, Jean-Alexandre Létourneau', null, 'Antoine, 13, spends the summer vacation with his parents in a rented cottage on an island in the middle of the Saint-Lawrence River. His neighbour, 17-year-old Anna, is an enigmatic and lively young woman. Antoine begins to experience the first stirrings of love-which soon yield a troubling brew of anxiety, desire and obsession. He eventually comes across a terrible secret that will forever change his life.', 'Antoine, 13, spends the summer vacation with his parents in a rented cottage on an island in the middle of the Saint-Lawrence River. His neighbour, 17-year-old Anna, is an enigmatic and lively young woman. Antoine begins to experience the first stirrings of love-which soon yield a troubling brew of anxiety, desire and obsession. He eventually comes across a terrible secret that will forever change his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aXrdoYPnsD6wz5a9yEJfBOzNXDv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232138'),
  ('1104859166107905947', '1UP', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Kristofer Bonnell, Kyle Newman', 'Julia Yorks', 'Paris Berelc, Ruby Rose, Hari Nef, D.J. Mausner, Lolita Milena, Madison Baines, Nicholas Coombe, Taylor Zakhar Perez', 'R', 'After Valerie Lee quits her college esports team, she quickly realizes that her decision comes at the cost of her scholarship. Valerie soon discovers a loophole to save her collegiate future, if she can find a coach and assemble a whole new varsity-caliber team capable of reaching the State Finals.', 'After Valerie Lee quits her college esports team, she quickly realizes that her decision comes at the cost of her scholarship. Valerie soon discovers a loophole to save her collegiate future, if she can find a coach and assemble a whole new varsity-caliber team capable of reaching the State Finals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqhLjoz3FGywYXUNTCPItfDY2N8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:767401'),
  ('159006588356133530', '2 + 2', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Diego Kaplan, Julian Setton, Isabel Mazzaglia', 'Daniel Cúparo, Juan Vera', 'Adrián Suar, Carla Peterson, Juan Minujín, Julieta Díaz, Alfredo Casero, Tomás Wicz, Micaela Cuccaresi, Juana Wein', 'NR', 'When the fun of double dating begins to grow old, Richard and Bettina share a dirty little secret with their friends Diego and Emilia: They live a double life as swingers, and would love to share this practice with them.', 'When the fun of double dating begins to grow old, Richard and Bettina share a dirty little secret with their friends Diego and Emilia: They live a double life as swingers, and would love to share this practice with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pM6DJtGUvRzgXFfxGBScMMafew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134096'),
  ('237748816921515938', '2 Alone in Paris', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor, Philippe Piffeteau', 'Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor, Philippe Lefebvre', 'Ramzy Bedia, Éric Judor, Benoît Magimel, Kristin Scott Thomas, Élodie Bouchez, Omar Sy, MC Jean Gab''1, Fred Testot', null, 'A bumbling Paris policeman is doggedly determined to capture the master thief that repeatedly eludes him, even when they''re the last two men on Earth.', 'A bumbling Paris policeman is doggedly determined to capture the master thief that repeatedly eludes him, even when they''re the last two men on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/11DqLXRUsARo7GIxoUETLhaBDCh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13741'),
  ('1081928461789296526', '2 By 4', 1998, 'Drama', 'Jimmy Smallhorne, Declan Quinn', 'Jimmy Smallhorne, Terrence McGoff', 'Jimmy Smallhorne, Chris O''Neill, Bradley Fitts, Joe Holyoke, Terrence McGoff, Michael Liebman, Ronan Carr, Leo Hamill', null, 'Johnnie is a foreman of a construction crew. On the outside he seems very "normal" and straight, but one evening we see him putting on makeup and a feather boa and going out for a night in the city.', 'Johnnie is a foreman of a construction crew. On the outside he seems very "normal" and straight, but one evening we see him putting on makeup and a feather boa and going out for a night in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JTeZsMh3jV9BrzI4CmX1IDcJWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185175'),
  ('122238329519414601', '2 Days in New York', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Julie Delpy, Lubomir Bakchev', 'Julie Delpy, Alexia Landeau', 'Julie Delpy, Chris Rock, Albert Delpy, Kate Burton, Dylan Baker, Daniel Brühl, Alexia Landeau, Alexandre Nahon', 'R', 'Marion and Mingus both come from failed relationships but, by bringing their children together, they''ve managed to form a small yet happy family. Tensions in their household soon begin to spike when Marion''s jovial father shows up on their doorstep with his randy daughter and her peculiar boyfriend in tow. As the motor-mouthed houseguests shatter every taboo imaginable, the happy couple begin to question their commitment.', 'Marion and Mingus both come from failed relationships but, by bringing their children together, they''ve managed to form a small yet happy family. Tensions in their household soon begin to spike when Marion''s jovial father shows up on their doorstep with his randy daughter and her peculiar boyfriend in tow. As the motor-mouthed houseguests shatter every taboo imaginable, the happy couple begin to question their commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tK6G639JfQV36WRr9wTu1D9iZRg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84165'),
  ('197064593609567483', '2 Days in Paris', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Julie Delpy, Lubomir Bakchev', 'Julie Delpy', 'Julie Delpy, Adam Goldberg, Daniel Brühl, Adan Jodorowsky, Alexandre Nahon, Albert Delpy, Alexia Landeau, Vanessa Seward', 'R', 'Marion and Jack try to rekindle their relationship with a visit to Paris, home of Marion''s parents — and several of her ex-boyfriends.', 'Marion and Jack try to rekindle their relationship with a visit to Paris, home of Marion''s parents — and several of her ex-boyfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yf8vcgJtADTTPP0Ltq2KhqLfdE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1845'),
  ('918262860125106448', '2 Days in the Valley', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Oliver Wood, John Herzfeld, Charlie Picerni', 'John Herzfeld', 'Danny Aiello, Jeff Daniels, Teri Hatcher, Charlize Theron, James Spader, Eric Stoltz, Glenne Headly, Peter Horton', 'R', 'In a sleepy bedroom community of LA''s San Fernando Valley, the murder of a professional athlete by two hit men sets into motion a chain of events that puts the mundane lives of a dozen residents on a collision course. This clever tale tells the story of two hit men, a mistress, a nurse, a vindictive ex-wife, a wealthy art dealer and his lovelorn assistant, a suicidal writer and his dog, and a bitter cop and his partner.', 'In a sleepy bedroom community of LA''s San Fernando Valley, the murder of a professional athlete by two hit men sets into motion a chain of events that puts the mundane lives of a dozen residents on a collision course. This clever tale tells the story of two hit men, a mistress, a nurse, a vindictive ex-wife, a wealthy art dealer and his lovelorn assistant, a suicidal writer and his dog, and a bitter cop and his partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKmOINYPpg2W8SMRicnFdusqk1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9401'),
  ('235532181189430938', '2 Fast 2 Furious', 2003, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'John Singleton, Matthew F. Leonetti, Brian Moon', 'Michael Brandt, Derek Haas', 'Paul Walker, Tyrese Gibson, Eva Mendes, Cole Hauser, Ludacris, James Remar, Thom Barry, Michael Ealy', 'PG-13', 'It''s a major double-cross when former police officer Brian O''Conner teams up with his ex-con buddy Roman Pearce to transport a shipment of "dirty" money for shady Miami-based import-export dealer Carter Verone. But the guys are actually working with undercover agent Monica Fuentes to bring Verone down.', 'It''s a major double-cross when former police officer Brian O''Conner teams up with his ex-con buddy Roman Pearce to transport a shipment of "dirty" money for shady Miami-based import-export dealer Carter Verone. But the guys are actually working with undercover agent Monica Fuentes to bring Verone down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nDZExrDKIXvSAghsFKVFRVJuSf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584'),
  ('230105755941300921', '2 Frogs in the West', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Dany Papineau, Christian Bégin', 'Dany Papineau, David Uloth, Grégoire Bédard', 'Mirianne Brûlé, Dany Papineau, Jessica Malka, Brandon Barton, Juan Riedinger, Anik Vermette, Germain Houde, Diane Lavallée', null, 'Marie Deschamps has her whole life ahead of her but isn''t sure what to do with it. To the disappointment of her parents, she drops out of college and decides to go work in Whistler in order to perfect her English. After a journey across Canada, her arrival in British-Columbia is less glorious than she dreamt. Fortunately, she meets Jean-Francois Laforest, a Quebecois skier who has been living on the West Coast for 10 years. J-F will introduce her to his Anglo friends and to the lifestyle of the mountains. Somewhere out West, this adventure will change her life forever.', 'Marie Deschamps has her whole life ahead of her but isn''t sure what to do with it. To the disappointment of her parents, she drops out of college and decides to go work in Whistler in order to perfect her English. After a journey across Canada, her arrival in British-Columbia is less glorious than she dreamt. Fortunately, she meets Jean-Francois Laforest, a Quebecois skier who has been living on the West Coast for 10 years. J-F will introduce her to his Anglo friends and to the lifestyle of the mountains. Somewhere out West, this adventure will change her life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDysFA6geTCqqRYQQKxepZfya2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75302'),
