  ('868583956012821183', '2 Into 1', 1997, 'Drama', 'Gillian Wearing', null, 'Hilary Greene, Lawrence Greene, Alex Greene', null, 'A mother and her twins talk about each other. The device of miming each others words, gives a disconcerting twist to the children''s cruel honesty and their mother''s unconditional adoration.', 'A mother and her twins talk about each other. The device of miming each others words, gives a disconcerting twist to the children''s cruel honesty and their mother''s unconditional adoration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iUNRezr2H4fVJPgVdG7SpXx8dbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357251'),
