  ('910936173082063313', '20 30 40', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sylvia Chang, Chienn Hsiang', 'Sylvia Chang, Cat Kwan Ho-Ming, Vincci Cheuk Wan-Chi', 'Sylvia Chang, René Liu, Angelica Lee Sin-Jie, Kate Yeung, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Richie Jen, Chen Bolin', null, 'A woman in her 20s, another in her 30s and a third in her 40s must each find a way to navigate the challenges they face in life and love.', 'A woman in her 20s, another in her 30s and a third in her 40s must each find a way to navigate the challenges they face in life and love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rTxFPjjB4WGJ1b2y8I3QnAHBxUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76275'),
  ('251062510459887063', '20 Cigarettes', 2010, 'Drama, War, History', 'Aureliano Amadei, Vittorio Omodei Zorini, Mounir Saguia', 'Aureliano Amadei, Francesco Trento, Gianni Romoli', 'Vinicio Marchioni, Carolina Crescentini, Giorgio Colangeli, Gisella Burinato, Orsetta De Rossi, Luciano Virgilio, Alberto Basaluzzo, Edoardo Pesce', null, 'Based on director Aureliano Amadei''s 2003 experiences in Iraq, 20 Cigarettes is the gripping story of a twenty-eight year old anarchist and anti-war activist who receives an offer to fly to Iraq as assistant director on a film about the Italian military peace mission.', 'Based on director Aureliano Amadei''s 2003 experiences in Iraq, 20 Cigarettes is the gripping story of a twenty-eight year old anarchist and anti-war activist who receives an offer to fly to Iraq as assistant director on a film about the Italian military peace mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jYbUNMIuSyWUDj9AI0EAvw5FEi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44872'),
  ('354211071448510011', '20 Days in Mariupol', 2023, 'Documentary, War', 'Mstyslav Chernov, Evgeniy Maloletka', null, 'Mstyslav Chernov, Evgeniy Maloletka, Liudmyla Amelkina, Zhanna Homa, Oleksandr Ivanov, Irina Kalinina, Volodymyr Nikulin, Anastasiya Yerashova', 'NR', 'As the Russian invasion begins, a team of Ukrainian journalists trapped in the besieged city of Mariupol struggle to continue their work documenting the war''s atrocities.', 'As the Russian invasion begins, a team of Ukrainian journalists trapped in the besieged city of Mariupol struggle to continue their work documenting the war''s atrocities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zIRp1IeuPh4GgqFCH3y0DQuY9xP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1058616'),
  ('918749821232201922', '20 Feet from Stardom', 2013, 'Documentary, Music', 'Morgan Neville, Nicola B. Marsh, Graham Willoughby', 'Morgan Neville', 'Darlene Love, Lisa Fischer, Merry Clayton, Judith Hill, Claudia Lennear, Tata Vega, Patti Austin, Mick Jagger', 'NR', 'Backup singers live in a world that lies just beyond the spotlight. Their voices bring harmony to the biggest bands in popular music, but we''ve had no idea who these singers are or what lives they lead, until now.', 'Backup singers live in a world that lies just beyond the spotlight. Their voices bring harmony to the biggest bands in popular music, but we''ve had no idea who these singers are or what lives they lead, until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6iRxKxfE6SB586cQV3BH8NSMzoZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159014'),
  ('505135822237587342', '20 Million Miles to Earth', 1957, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Nathan Juran, Irving Lippman, Carlo Ventimiglia', 'Robert Creighton Williams, Christopher Knopf', 'William Hopper, Joan Taylor, Frank Puglia, John Zaremba, Thomas Browne Henry, Tito Vuolo, Jan Arvan, Arthur Space', null, 'When the first manned flight to Venus returns to Earth, the rocket crash-lands in the Mediterranean near a small Italian fishing village. The locals manage to save one of the astronauts Colonel Calder, the mission commander. A young boy also recovers what turns out to be a specimen of an alien creature. Growing at a fantastic rate, it manages to escape and eventually threatens the city of Rome.', 'When the first manned flight to Venus returns to Earth, the rocket crash-lands in the Mediterranean near a small Italian fishing village. The locals manage to save one of the astronauts Colonel Calder, the mission commander. A young boy also recovers what turns out to be a specimen of an alien creature. Growing at a fantastic rate, it manages to escape and eventually threatens the city of Rome.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wozerDO9kpVBN63sq3wiM5zYmSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15096'),
  ('507180606075497680', '20 Once Again', 2015, 'Comedy, Music, Fantasy', 'Charlie Lam Chi-Kin, Leste Chen', 'Lin Xiaoge, Ren Peng', 'Yang Zishan, Gua Ah-leh, Chen Bolin, Lu Han, Wang Deshun, Wang Qing, Hao Xuankai, Xing Zhaolin', null, 'A visit to the photographer''s returns the physical looks of a 70-year-old grandmother back to her 20s. Things get even stranger when his grandson asks her to join his band, and his best friend begins to fall for her.', 'A visit to the photographer''s returns the physical looks of a 70-year-old grandmother back to her 20s. Things get even stranger when his grandson asks her to join his band, and his best friend begins to fall for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umsAAisx2BSzxvczgQsm6mlbvQx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301274'),
  ('500298561561903328', '20 Years After', 2008, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Jim Torres', 'Ron Harris, Jim Torres', 'Azura Skye, Joshua Leonard, Nathan Baesel, Diane Salinger, Reg E. Cathey, Aaron Hendry, Charlie Talbert, Malika', null, 'In the middle of nowhere, 20 years after an apocalyptic terrorist event that obliterated the face of the world!', 'In the middle of nowhere, 20 years after an apocalyptic terrorist event that obliterated the face of the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAfYiDYkWXLLGOAEdeEWDiYsLoQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14642'),
  ('135374486455345837', '20,000 Days on Earth', 2014, 'Documentary, Drama, Music', 'Iain Forsyth, Jane Pollard, Erik Wilson', 'Nick Cave, Jane Pollard, Iain Forsyth', 'Nick Cave, Warren Ellis, Blixa Bargeld, Susie Bick, Arthur Cave, Earl Cave, Kirk Lake, Darian Leader', 'NR', 'A semi-fictionalized documentary about a day in the life of Australian musician Nick Cave''s persona.', 'A semi-fictionalized documentary about a day in the life of Australian musician Nick Cave''s persona.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pUmYsh07P2Bq6ip2RZmOq6mr2vF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246400'),
  ('706569270125302484', '20,000 Kisses', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sebastián De Caro, Mariano Suárez, Martín Armoya', 'Sebastián Rotstein', 'Walter Cornás, Carla Quevedo, Eduardo Blanco, Alan Sabbagh, Gastón Pauls, Clemente Cancela, Laura Azcurra, Laura Cymer', null, 'Juan is in his 30s, bored with his life, and isolated from his friends. He is just dedicated to being a good boyfriend. One day, his girlfriend dumps him, and he leaves the house they shared not knowing where to go. Eventually, he starts enjoying his life again.', 'Juan is in his 30s, bored with his life, and isolated from his friends. He is just dedicated to being a good boyfriend. One day, his girlfriend dumps him, and he leaves the house they shared not knowing where to go. Eventually, he starts enjoying his life again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcBDIOmGGtI4iWLq6G4vuGUKH8c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247684'),
  ('350817831908265616', '20,000 Leagues Under the Sea', 1907, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', 'Jules Verne', 'Manuel, Georges Méliès', null, 'The film, a parody of the novel Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea by Jules Verne, follows a fisherman, Yves, who dreams of traveling by submarine to the bottom of the ocean, where he encounters both realistic and fanciful sea creatures, including a chorus of naiads played by dancers from the Théâtre du Châtelet. Méliès''s design for the film includes cut-out sea animals patterned after Alphonse de Neuville''s illustrations for Verne''s novel.', 'The film, a parody of the novel Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea by Jules Verne, follows a fisherman, Yves, who dreams of traveling by submarine to the bottom of the ocean, where he encounters both realistic and fanciful sea creatures, including a chorus of naiads played by dancers from the Théâtre du Châtelet. Méliès''s design for the film includes cut-out sea animals patterned after Alphonse de Neuville''s illustrations for Verne''s novel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cla42RyH4nnKXGYGTAkVxfw4xvu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114136'),
  ('39981056482571912', '20,000 Leagues Under the Sea', 1916, 'Adventure, Drama, Action, Science Fiction', 'Friend Baker, Milton Loryea, H.H. Barter', null, 'Allen Holubar, Jane Gail, Howard Crampton, Matt Moore, William Welsh, Joseph W. Girard, Curtis Benton, Edna Pendleton', 'NR', 'Captain Nemo has built a fantastic submarine for his mission of revenge. He has traveled over 20,000 leagues in search of Charles Denver - a man who caused the death of Princess Daaker. Seeing what he had done, Denver took the daughter to his yacht and sailed away.', 'Captain Nemo has built a fantastic submarine for his mission of revenge. He has traveled over 20,000 leagues in search of Charles Denver - a man who caused the death of Princess Daaker. Seeing what he had done, Denver took the daughter to his yacht and sailed away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edY5eDCC08OUKjS0k7zWUxYM9BB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30266'),
  ('716398215235530892', '20,000 Leagues Under the Sea', 1954, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Fantasy', 'Richard Fleischer, C.O. Slyfield, Franz Planer', 'Earl Felton', 'Kirk Douglas, James Mason, Paul Lukas, Peter Lorre, Robert J. Wilke, Ted de Corsia, Carleton Young, J.M. Kerrigan', 'G', 'A ship sent to investigate a wave of mysterious sinkings encounters the advanced submarine, the Nautilus, commanded by Captain Nemo.', 'A ship sent to investigate a wave of mysterious sinkings encounters the advanced submarine, the Nautilus, commanded by Captain Nemo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heAEH85fdxEgV98LizHbQCL95iZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173'),
  ('788332509970323331', '20,000 Leagues Under the Sea', 1997, 'Adventure, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Michael Anderson, Alan Hume', 'Joe Wiesenfeld', 'Richard Crenna, Ben Cross, Julie Cox, Michael Jayston, Jeff Harding, David Henry, James Vaughan, Susannah Fellows', null, 'In the 19th century, an expert marine biologist is hired by the government to determine what''s sinking ships all over the ocean. His daughter follows him. They are intercepted by a mysterious captain Nemo and his incredible submarine.', 'In the 19th century, an expert marine biologist is hired by the government to determine what''s sinking ships all over the ocean. His daughter follows him. They are intercepted by a mysterious captain Nemo and his incredible submarine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8kVSztb6A7gA0K4eFJIxjzgdiH0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2965'),
  ('821450015837796703', '20,000 Species of Bees', 2023, 'Drama', 'Estibaliz Urresola Solaguren, Gina Ferrer', 'Estibaliz Urresola Solaguren', 'Sofía Otero, Patricia López Arnaiz, Ane Gabarain, Itziar Lazkano, Martxelo Rubio, Sara Cózar, Miguel Garcés, Unax Hayden', null, 'Lucía is an eight-year-old girl, who sometimes struggles as the world tries to catch up with the fact that she is trans. As the summer holidays pass, she explores her femininity alongside the women of her family who at the same time reflect on their own femininity.', 'Lucía is an eight-year-old girl, who sometimes struggles as the world tries to catch up with the fact that she is trans. As the summer holidays pass, she explores her femininity alongside the women of her family who at the same time reflect on their own femininity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MEEVVyZ1L9Lr8GeSOyFiGM3cmB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053600'),
  ('709904279349435339', '20,000 Years in Sing Sing', 1932, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michael Curtiz, Barney McGill', 'Brown Holmes, Wilson Mizner', 'Spencer Tracy, Bette Davis, Arthur Byron, Lyle Talbot, Warren Hymer, Louis Calhern, Spencer Charters, G. Pat Collins', 'NR', 'Brash hoodlum Tom Connors enters Sing Sing cocksure of himself and disrespectful toward authority, but his tough but compassionate warden changes him.', 'Brash hoodlum Tom Connors enters Sing Sing cocksure of himself and disrespectful toward authority, but his tough but compassionate warden changes him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pz6IM5TC5uLi3AQeXVMvPSgwngw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42822'),
  ('1005874251851840603', '200 American', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Richard LeMay, Jose Ortiz', 'Richard LeMay', 'Matt Walton, Sean Matic, Anthony Ames, John Dylan Howard, Mark Ford, Gail Herendeen, Lucy Smith, Spencer Aste', 'NR', 'Conrad is a gay man living in NYC. He''s also CEO of an ad agency and by nature a control freak. Although Conrad is still in love with Martin (his ex), he hires a young Aussie hustler named Tyler, first for a night and then to work for his company. Things get increasingly complicated as Conrad tries to rekindle things with Martin. Meanwhile Tyler (who''s daytime name is Ian) falls for Michael his new supervisor', 'Conrad is a gay man living in NYC. He''s also CEO of an ad agency and by nature a control freak. Although Conrad is still in love with Martin (his ex), he hires a young Aussie hustler named Tyler, first for a night and then to work for his company. Things get increasingly complicated as Conrad tries to rekindle things with Martin. Meanwhile Tyler (who''s daytime name is Ian) falls for Michael his new supervisor', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qqLClsNMO6NpqKCOb8YPWt6udiv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40937'),
  ('732061796044561375', '200 Cartas', 2013, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Bruno Irizarry', null, 'Lin-Manuel Miranda, Jaime Camil, Dayanara Torres, Monica Steuer, Mayra Matos Perez, Marisé Álvarez, Bruno Irizarry, Iris Chacón Tapia', null, 'Raul, a Puerto Rican born in New York, meets Maria, a young Puerto Rican woman visiting NY, one night. Struck by love at first sight, he travels to Puerto Rico in search of this beautiful girl.', 'Raul, a Puerto Rican born in New York, meets Maria, a young Puerto Rican woman visiting NY, one night. Struck by love at first sight, he travels to Puerto Rico in search of this beautiful girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvUUMkrZQTAUhzXz0qfX1pE6hnN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199415'),
  ('882557440497816596', '200 Cigarettes', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Risa Bramon Garcia, Vebe Borge, Amy Lynn', 'Shana Larsen', 'Ben Affleck, Casey Affleck, Dave Chappelle, Guillermo Díaz, Angela Featherstone, Janeane Garofalo, Gaby Hoffmann, Kate Hudson', 'R', 'In 1981 New York City, a collection of twentysomethings try to cope with relationships, loneliness, desire and their individual neuroses on New Years Eve.', 'In 1981 New York City, a collection of twentysomethings try to cope with relationships, loneliness, desire and their individual neuroses on New Years Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ssbx2Mk5ZCJWpXALuP2AdG0GFIT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15256'),
  ('444052716437390238', '200 Meters', 2020, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Elin Kirschfink, Ameen Nayfeh', 'Ameen Nayfeh', 'Ali Suliman, Anna Unterberger, Motaz Malhees, Mahmoud Abu Eita, Lana Zreik, Nabil Al Raee, Ghassan Ashkar, Alaa Abu Saa', null, 'Mustafa and his wife Salwa come from two Palestinian villages that are only 200 meters apart, but separated by the wall. Their unusual living situation is starting to affect their otherwise happy marriage, but the couple does what they can to make it work. Every night, Mustafa flashes a light from his balcony to wish his children on the other side a goodnight, and they signal him back. One day Mustafa gets a call that every parent dreads: his son has been in an accident. He rushes to the checkpoint where he must agonisingly wait in line only to find out there is a problem with his fingerprints and is denied entry. Desperate, Mustafa resorts to hiring a smuggler to bring him across. His once 200-meter journey becomes a 200-kilometer odyssey joined by other travellers determined to cross.', 'Mustafa and his wife Salwa come from two Palestinian villages that are only 200 meters apart, but separated by the wall. Their unusual living situation is starting to affect their otherwise happy marriage, but the couple does what they can to make it work. Every night, Mustafa flashes a light from his balcony to wish his children on the other side a goodnight, and they signal him back. One day Mustafa gets a call that every parent dreads: his son has been in an accident. He rushes to the checkpoint where he must agonisingly wait in line only to find out there is a problem with his fingerprints and is denied entry. Desperate, Mustafa resorts to hiring a smuggler to bring him across. His once 200-meter journey becomes a 200-kilometer odyssey joined by other travellers determined to cross.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyWlOsvU6S7FQ6SxMdYwLuAbe4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727012'),
  ('521076812322814012', '200 Motels', 1971, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Music', 'Frank Zappa, Tony Palmer, Tony Palmer', 'Tony Palmer', 'Frank Zappa, Mark Volman, Howard Kaylan, Ian Underwood, Aynsley Dunbar, George Duke, Theodore Bikel, Keith Moon', 'R', '"Touring makes you crazy," Frank Zappa says, explaining that the idea for this film came to him while the Mothers of Invention were touring. The story, interspersed with performances by the Mothers and the Royal Symphony Orchestra, is a tale of life on the road. The band members'' main concerns are the search for groupies and the desire to get paid.', '"Touring makes you crazy," Frank Zappa says, explaining that the idea for this film came to him while the Mothers of Invention were touring. The story, interspersed with performances by the Mothers and the Royal Symphony Orchestra, is a tale of life on the road. The band members'' main concerns are the search for groupies and the desire to get paid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bLwx4NoyPPiOtKjKT2OsFkxFgnm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27645'),
  ('235983671078105440', '200 Pounds Beauty', 2006, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Yong-hwa, Park Hyeon-cheol, Jung Sung-jin', 'Kim Seon-jeong', 'Ju Jin-mo, Kim A-joong, Sung Dong-il, Kim Hyun-sook, Im Hyun-sik, Lee Han-wi, Ji Seo-Yun, Park No-shik', null, 'Hanna, an overweight lip-sync artist who ghost sings for Ammy, a known pop diva, secretly likes Han Sang-jun. When Ammy humiliates Hanna in Han''s presence, Hanna decides to undergo a cosmetic surgery.', 'Hanna, an overweight lip-sync artist who ghost sings for Ammy, a known pop diva, secretly likes Han Sang-jun. When Ammy humiliates Hanna in Han''s presence, Hanna decides to undergo a cosmetic surgery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnyJmyOQQGiqR9DLIiQ9aejIbkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18377'),
  ('897659570453223096', '200,000 Phantoms', 2007, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot, Jean-Gabriel Périot', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot', null, null, 'In 1914, the Czech architect Jan Letzel designed in the Japanese city of Hiroshima Center for the World Expo, which has turned into ruins after the atomic bombing in August 1945. “Atomic Dome” – all that remains of the destroyed palace of the exhibition – has become part of the Hiroshima memorial. In 2007, French sculptor, painter and film director Jean-Gabriel Périot assembled this cinematic collage from hundreds of multi-format, color and black and white photographs of different years’ of “Genbaku Dome”.', 'In 1914, the Czech architect Jan Letzel designed in the Japanese city of Hiroshima Center for the World Expo, which has turned into ruins after the atomic bombing in August 1945. “Atomic Dome” – all that remains of the destroyed palace of the exhibition – has become part of the Hiroshima memorial. In 2007, French sculptor, painter and film director Jean-Gabriel Périot assembled this cinematic collage from hundreds of multi-format, color and black and white photographs of different years’ of “Genbaku Dome”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4O270a13QFzV3esWdjm858q6tWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336134'),
  ('289721531294474648', '200% Wolf', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Action, Comedy', 'Alexs Stadermann', 'Fin Edquist', 'Samara Weaving, Jennifer Saunders, Ilai Swindells, Akmal Saleh, Peter McCallum, Sarah Rose Harper, Elizabeth Nabben, Janice Petersen', 'PG', 'When Freddy Lupin''s wayward wish transforms him into a werewolf and deposits a mischievous moon sprite on Earth, Freddy must restore the cosmic order before the earth and moon collide.', 'When Freddy Lupin''s wayward wish transforms him into a werewolf and deposits a mischievous moon sprite on Earth, Freddy must restore the cosmic order before the earth and moon collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pHGB9jN31cDNKhR0VRNZsXZkGZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974663'),
  ('270503896579319840', '2000 AD', 2000, 'Action, Thriller', 'Gordon Chan, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Gordon Chan, Stuart Zicherman', 'Aaron Kwok, Daniel Wu, Phyllis Quek, James Lye, Gigi Choi, Andrew Lin Hoi, Ray Lui, Francis Ng Chun-Yu', null, 'The Y2K Bug. Real Warfare vs Electronic Gaming. Peter Tong, a carefree Hong Kong youngster, finds himself drawn into the web of a deadly espionage conspiracy. A clandestine organization schemes to use the Y2K Bug to cause mayhem throughout Asia. To survive, Peter has to call on reserves of courage and stamina he has never needed before.', 'The Y2K Bug. Real Warfare vs Electronic Gaming. Peter Tong, a carefree Hong Kong youngster, finds himself drawn into the web of a deadly espionage conspiracy. A clandestine organization schemes to use the Y2K Bug to cause mayhem throughout Asia. To survive, Peter has to call on reserves of courage and stamina he has never needed before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYJRSQkk2l1U3h4xY3pBQlHe3S8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32249'),
  ('632091395030902241', '2000 Meters to Andriivka', 2025, 'Documentary, War', 'Mstyslav Chernov, Mstyslav Chernov, Alex Babenko', 'Mstyslav Chernov', 'Mstyslav Chernov', 'NR', 'Amid the failing counteroffensive, a journalist follows a Ukrainian platoon on their mission to traverse one mile of heavily fortified forest and liberate a strategic village from Russian occupation. But the farther they advance through their destroyed homeland, the more they realize that this war may never end.', 'Amid the failing counteroffensive, a journalist follows a Ukrainian platoon on their mission to traverse one mile of heavily fortified forest and liberate a strategic village from Russian occupation. But the farther they advance through their destroyed homeland, the more they realize that this war may never end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1TC3QebWWWJ6CceqbBgAvJde8t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1400789'),
  ('774256029221793488', '2000 Mules', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Debbie D''Souza, Bruce Schooley', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Debbie D''Souza, Bruce Schooley', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Catherine Engelbrecht, Larry Elder, Eric Metaxas, Sebastian Gorka, Dennis Prager, Debbie D''Souza, Gregg Phillips', 'NR', 'Bestselling author and award-winning filmmaker, Dinesh D’Souza, exposes widespread coordinated voter fraud in the 2020 election sufficient to change the overall outcome. Drawing on research provided by the election integrity group, True the Vote, “2000 Mules” offers two types of evidence: geotracking and video. The geotracking evidence, based on a database of ten trillion cell phone pings, exposes an elaborate network of professional operatives, called mules, delivering fraudulent votes to mail-in boxes in the five key states where the election was decided. Video evidence obtained from official surveillance cameras corroborates the cellular positioning data. The film concludes by exploring ways to assist in the prevention of election fraud in future democratic elections.', 'Bestselling author and award-winning filmmaker, Dinesh D’Souza, exposes widespread coordinated voter fraud in the 2020 election sufficient to change the overall outcome. Drawing on research provided by the election integrity group, True the Vote, “2000 Mules” offers two types of evidence: geotracking and video. The geotracking evidence, based on a database of ten trillion cell phone pings, exposes an elaborate network of professional operatives, called mules, delivering fraudulent votes to mail-in boxes in the five key states where the election was decided. Video evidence obtained from official surveillance cameras corroborates the cellular positioning data. The film concludes by exploring ways to assist in the prevention of election fraud in future democratic elections.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTz0ZDc2PdHpn07O37Jmq2vaSPV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933554'),
  ('436525921176820954', '2001 Maniacs', 2005, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Steve Adcock, Tim Sullivan', 'Chris Kobin, Tim Sullivan', 'Robert Englund, Giuseppe Andrews, Peter Stormare, Dylan Edrington, Lin Shaye, Marla Malcolm, Jay Gillespie, Gina Marie Heekin', 'R', 'On their way to Spring Break, college kids take a detour through an old Southern town. The people of Pleasant Valley insist the kids stay for their annual barbecue celebration... but instead of getting a taste of the old South, the old South gets a taste of them!', 'On their way to Spring Break, college kids take a detour through an old Southern town. The people of Pleasant Valley insist the kids stay for their annual barbecue celebration... but instead of getting a taste of the old South, the old South gets a taste of them!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bVGq9FOV1uoBzfO0ntou3fE7tvR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10845'),
  ('584299259756129301', '2001 Maniacs: Field of Screams', 2010, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Tim Sullivan', 'Tim Sullivan, Chris Kobin, Christopher Tuffin', 'Bill Moseley, Lin Shaye, Christa Campbell, Nivek Ogre, Andrea Leon, Ahmed Best, Alana Curry, Katy Marie Johnson', 'R', 'When this year''s round of unsuspecting Northerners fail to show up for their annual Guts N'' Glory Jamboree, the residents of Pleasant Valley take their cannibalistic carnival on the road and head to Iowa where they encounter spoiled heiresses Rome and Tina Sheraton, the cast and crew of their "Road Rascals" reality show. Performing "The Bloodiest Show on Earth", our Southern Maniacs prove more than ratings killers in what John Landis has called "one of the rare sequels that surpasses the original".', 'When this year''s round of unsuspecting Northerners fail to show up for their annual Guts N'' Glory Jamboree, the residents of Pleasant Valley take their cannibalistic carnival on the road and head to Iowa where they encounter spoiled heiresses Rome and Tina Sheraton, the cast and crew of their "Road Rascals" reality show. Performing "The Bloodiest Show on Earth", our Southern Maniacs prove more than ratings killers in what John Landis has called "one of the rare sequels that surpasses the original".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/et5rRWZz4NMf40YPbXwXNqHWRvQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40912'),
  ('940506064187622827', '2001: A Space Odyssey', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Mystery, Adventure', 'Geoffrey Unsworth, Derek Cracknell, Stanley Kubrick', 'Arthur C. Clarke, Stanley Kubrick', 'Keir Dullea, Gary Lockwood, William Sylvester, Douglas Rain, Daniel Richter, Leonard Rossiter, Margaret Tyzack, Robert Beatty', 'G', 'Humanity finds a mysterious object buried beneath the lunar surface and sets off to find its origins with the help of HAL 9000, the world''s most advanced super computer.', 'Humanity finds a mysterious object buried beneath the lunar surface and sets off to find its origins with the help of HAL 9000, the world''s most advanced super computer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve72VxNqjGM69Uky4WTo2bK6rfq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62'),
  ('658776465387553548', '2001: A Space Odyssey - A Look Behind the Future', 1966, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Vernon Myers, Arthur C. Clarke, Anthony Masters, Keir Dullea, Stanley Kubrick, Gary Lockwood', null, 'A short documentary about the making of Stanley Kubrick''s 2001: A Space Odyssey and its impact on the ''60s view of the future.', 'A short documentary about the making of Stanley Kubrick''s 2001: A Space Odyssey and its impact on the ''60s view of the future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHsoX4JgoASLqmXzWBYof3uYcWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:494676'),
  ('494214330291766604', '2001: A Space Travesty', 2000, 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Action', 'Allan A. Goldstein, Sylvain Brault', 'Francesco Lucente, Alan Shearman', 'Leslie Nielsen, Alexandra Kamp, Verona Pooth, Ophélie Winter, Ezio Greggio, Peter Egan, Damien Masson, Pierre Edwards', 'R', 'When odd reports are received through official channels stating that the President of the United States is being held captive on a secret international moon base called Vegan and that he has been replaced on Earth by a clone, the US Marshall Service immediately sends their ''best'' man, Dix, on the mission.', 'When odd reports are received through official channels stating that the President of the United States is being held captive on a secret international moon base called Vegan and that he has been replaced on Earth by a clone, the US Marshall Service immediately sends their ''best'' man, Dix, on the mission.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNCvJuLbHjvXPvyOubbaa54ArvH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7290'),
  ('660113187624761703', '2001: The Making of a Myth', 2001, 'Documentary, Science Fiction', 'Paul Joyce', null, 'Ed Bishop, James Cameron, Arthur C. Clarke, Keith Denny, Heather Downham, Keir Dullea, Brian Johnson, Elvis Mitchell', null, 'The making of Stanley Kubrick''s classic space epic, presented by James Cameron, including unseen footage.', 'The making of Stanley Kubrick''s classic space epic, presented by James Cameron, including unseen footage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PA3BVbdtKwH5ZSO625GEIwV9J5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53164'),
  ('952949694397203695', '2009: Lost Memories', 2002, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Lee Si-myung, Park Hyeon-cheol, Nam Jin-a', 'Lee Si-myung, Lee Sang-hak', 'Jang Dong-gun, Toru Nakamura, Seo Jin-ho, Shin Gu, An Kil-kang, Kim Gyu-ri, Jo Sang-geon, Cheon Ho-jin', null, 'There are breakpoints in the history, the result of a single event may change the whole course. In 1909, an assassination attempt of a Japanese governor fails. Now, in 2009, Korea is just another state of Japan''s Empire & Seoul has become a major city. A Korean resistance group fights for liberty, independence & the restoration of true history. Two cops, Japanese & Korean, investigate the group.', 'There are breakpoints in the history, the result of a single event may change the whole course. In 1909, an assassination attempt of a Japanese governor fails. Now, in 2009, Korea is just another state of Japan''s Empire & Seoul has become a major city. A Korean resistance group fights for liberty, independence & the restoration of true history. Two cops, Japanese & Korean, investigate the group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2qVZHS3FrbF8OfWARcAfu1dU5bK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23132'),
  ('105460126649555845', '2010', 1984, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Peter Hyams, Peter Hyams, Alan B. Curtiss', 'Peter Hyams', 'Roy Scheider, John Lithgow, Helen Mirren, Bob Balaban, Keir Dullea, Douglas Rain, Madolyn Smith Osborne, Savely Kramarov', 'PG', 'While planet Earth poises on the brink of nuclear self-destruction, a team of Russian and American scientists aboard the Leonov hurtles to a rendezvous with the still-orbiting Discovery spacecraft and its sole known survivor, the homicidal computer HAL.', 'While planet Earth poises on the brink of nuclear self-destruction, a team of Russian and American scientists aboard the Leonov hurtles to a rendezvous with the still-orbiting Discovery spacecraft and its sole known survivor, the homicidal computer HAL.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mEWKXuCMv7mFMxXVSTI3v8UOQuq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4437'),
  ('337382247987608534', '2010: Moby Dick', 2010, 'Action, Adventure', 'Trey Stokes, Alexander Yellen', 'Paul Bales', 'Barry Bostwick, Renée O''Connor, Veronika Kurshinskaya, Bart Baggett, Matt Lagan, Adam Grimes, Dean Kreyling, Jay Gillespie', null, 'That infamous whale is bigger, badder and a whole lot stronger in this sci-fi reimagining of Herman Melville’s classic tale of the battle between man, sea and sea creature starring “Xena” alum Rene O’Connor as the (traditionally male) narrator. But the boat — now a high-tech submarine — is also bigger, and Capt. Ahab is as determined as ever to settle the score and take down the mighty sea mammal that maimed him.', 'That infamous whale is bigger, badder and a whole lot stronger in this sci-fi reimagining of Herman Melville’s classic tale of the battle between man, sea and sea creature starring “Xena” alum Rene O’Connor as the (traditionally male) narrator. But the boat — now a high-tech submarine — is also bigger, and Capt. Ahab is as determined as ever to settle the score and take down the mighty sea mammal that maimed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlH84l2lVZ7voCBZgDywJCGGHgX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50053'),
  ('872854369593773697', '2012', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Roland Emmerich, Laurel Bergman, Catherine Ircha', 'Roland Emmerich, Harald Kloser', 'John Cusack, Amanda Peet, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Thandiwe Newton, Oliver Platt, Tom McCarthy, Woody Harrelson, Danny Glover', 'PG-13', 'Dr. Adrian Helmsley, part of a worldwide geophysical team investigating the effect on the earth of radiation from unprecedented solar storms, learns that the earth''s core is heating up. He warns U.S. President Thomas Wilson that the crust of the earth is becoming unstable and that without proper preparations for saving a fraction of the world''s population, the entire race is doomed. Meanwhile, writer Jackson Curtis stumbles on the same information. While the world''s leaders race to build "arks" to escape the impending cataclysm, Curtis struggles to find a way to save his family. Meanwhile, volcanic eruptions and earthquakes of unprecedented strength wreak havoc around the world.', 'Dr. Adrian Helmsley, part of a worldwide geophysical team investigating the effect on the earth of radiation from unprecedented solar storms, learns that the earth''s core is heating up. He warns U.S. President Thomas Wilson that the crust of the earth is becoming unstable and that without proper preparations for saving a fraction of the world''s population, the entire race is doomed. Meanwhile, writer Jackson Curtis stumbles on the same information. While the world''s leaders race to build "arks" to escape the impending cataclysm, Curtis struggles to find a way to save his family. Meanwhile, volcanic eruptions and earthquakes of unprecedented strength wreak havoc around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c2PkTPT5D9zB8SIm5wNlDAANEqM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14161'),
  ('891502192103097338', '2012 Doomsday', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Nick Everhart, Mark Atkins, Justin Jones', 'Nick Everhart', 'Cliff DeYoung, Dale Midkiff, Ami Dolenz, Danae Nason, Joshua Lee, Sara Tomko, Caroline Amiguet, Shirley Raun', null, 'On December 21, 2012 four strangers on a journey of faith are drawn to an ancient temple in the heart of Mexico. For the Mayans it is the last recorded day. For NASA scientists it is a cataclysmic polar shift. For the rest of us, it is Doomsday.', 'On December 21, 2012 four strangers on a journey of faith are drawn to an ancient temple in the heart of Mexico. For the Mayans it is the last recorded day. For NASA scientists it is a cataclysmic polar shift. For the rest of us, it is Doomsday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNHdpeyBUki4n5tzEdEri5elJBq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16266'),
  ('488470216017505236', '2012: Ice Age', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Travis Fort, Trey Stokes', 'Paul Sinor, Victoria Dadi', 'Patrick Labyorteaux, Julie McCullough, Nick Afanasiev, Katie Wilson, Kyle Morris, Gerald Webb, Ted Monte, Jesse Daly', 'PG', 'A volcanic eruption in Iceland sends a glacier towards North America, causing everything in it''s path to freeze. A family man struggles to escape the onslaught of the coming ice age.', 'A volcanic eruption in Iceland sends a glacier towards North America, causing everything in it''s path to freeze. A family man struggles to escape the onslaught of the coming ice age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzbqGfYDxE6biVDGs6G9GEcLNbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59722'),
  ('1064819477465002906', '2012: Supernova', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Anthony Fankhauser, Mark Atkins', 'Anthony Fankhauser, Jon Macy', 'Brian Krause, Najarra Townsend, Heather McComb, Stephen Blackehart, Jeff Crabtree, Londale Theus, Stephen Schneider, Allura Lee', 'PG', 'Two hundred years ago a supernova exploded somewhere in the Lyra constellation. Now the lethal burst of radiation is headed straight for Earth, and time is swiftly running out. The only thing standing between humanity and complete devastation is astrophysicist Dr. Kelvin (Brian Krause), who heads up a project to save the planet.', 'Two hundred years ago a supernova exploded somewhere in the Lyra constellation. Now the lethal burst of radiation is headed straight for Earth, and time is swiftly running out. The only thing standing between humanity and complete devastation is astrophysicist Dr. Kelvin (Brian Krause), who heads up a project to save the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BpQxQdjZug7dhNnd9hHT8C1bgI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37059'),
  ('508250567039638532', '2016: Obama''s America', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Dinesh D''Souza, John Sullivan', 'John Sullivan, Dinesh D''Souza', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Barack Obama, Joe Biden, Cait Brasel, Gene Burris Jr., Lisa Fox, Zackary Steven Graham, Shelby Steele', 'PG', '"If Obama wins a second term, where will we be in 2016?" Across the globe and in America, people in 2008 hungered for a leader who would unite and lift us from economic turmoil and war. True to Americas ideals, they invested their hope in a new kind of president, Barack Obama. What they didn''t know is that Obama is a man with a past, and in powerful ways that past defines him--who he is, how he thinks, and where he intends to take America and the world.', '"If Obama wins a second term, where will we be in 2016?" Across the globe and in America, people in 2008 hungered for a leader who would unite and lift us from economic turmoil and war. True to Americas ideals, they invested their hope in a new kind of president, Barack Obama. What they didn''t know is that Obama is a man with a past, and in powerful ways that past defines him--who he is, how he thinks, and where he intends to take America and the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ht3rh0GVgh0rGqW99wCXWE4DP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126509'),
  ('490833499338762119', '2018', 2023, 'Thriller, Action, Adventure', 'Akhil George, Jude Anthany Joseph', 'Jude Anthany Joseph, Akhil P Dharmajan', 'Tovino Thomas, Kunchacko Boban, Narain, Asif Ali, Lal, Vineeth Sreenivasan, Aju Varghese, Aparna Balamurali', null, 'A disaster film set during the 2018 Kerala Floods where people from all walks of life faced catastrophic consequences and put in collective efforts to survive the calamity.', 'A disaster film set during the 2018 Kerala Floods where people from all walks of life faced catastrophic consequences and put in collective efforts to survive the calamity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uz9qc6lNGyqS2xvuXUfpJh2eP6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:866440'),
  ('93915807965185763', '2019: After the Fall of New York', 1983, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Massimo Manasse, Alain Sens-Cazenave, Sergio Martino', 'Sergio Martino, Ernesto Gastaldi, Gabriel Rossini', 'Michael Sopkiw, Valentine Monnier, Anna Kanakis, George Eastman, Romano Puppo, Paolo Maria Scalondro, Luigi D''Ecclesia, Edmund Purdom', 'R', 'After a nuclear war society breaks down into two groups, the evil Euraks, and the rebel Federation. A mercenary named Parsifal is hired by the Federation to infiltrate New York City, which is controlled by the Euraks, to rescue the only fertile woman left on Earth.', 'After a nuclear war society breaks down into two groups, the evil Euraks, and the rebel Federation. A mercenary named Parsifal is hired by the Federation to infiltrate New York City, which is controlled by the Euraks, to rescue the only fertile woman left on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nAGrOGYNZYReZFE5CGvCvvK30Ax.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23807'),
  ('1015276976477159604', '2020 Texas Gladiators', 1983, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Joe D''Amato, George Eastman, Joe D''Amato', 'Aldo Florio, George Eastman', 'Al Cliver, Harrison Muller Jr., Daniel Stephen, Peter Hooten, Hal Yamanouchi, Sabrina Siani, Isabella Rocchietta, Donald O''Brien', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic Texas, a band of warriors fight against a fascist regime that is trying to take control of all surviving population.', 'In a post-apocalyptic Texas, a band of warriors fight against a fascist regime that is trying to take control of all surviving population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nX8iYh2PiClqTKxgxu8r8HHXlJW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58419'),
  ('182266306036989620', '2022 Tsunami', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Toranong Srichua, Sarayut Satayaporn', 'Toranong Srichua, Nisa Tangsamrit', 'Sirinya Jantzen, Suchao Pongwilai, Pisarn Srimunkhong, Panudej Watanasuchat, Chalit Fuengarom, Nichapa Prakornkitwattana, Suchada Poonpattanasuk, Choomporn Theppitak', null, '18 years on from the devastating impact of 2004''s tsunami, the world still fights to come to terms with this devastating environmental disaster. Little does humanity know that it is about to face the ultimate peril; a monumental death wave annihilating everything in its wake. With the threat of another catastrophic tsunami, Prime Minister Tribhop sets up a national disaster alarm centre. His political future and the lives of his people depend upon the decisions he makes. But no one predicts the enormity of what is about to rise from the Thai Gulf. And no one can out run it this time. The Death Wave is coming', '18 years on from the devastating impact of 2004''s tsunami, the world still fights to come to terms with this devastating environmental disaster. Little does humanity know that it is about to face the ultimate peril; a monumental death wave annihilating everything in its wake. With the threat of another catastrophic tsunami, Prime Minister Tribhop sets up a national disaster alarm centre. His political future and the lives of his people depend upon the decisions he makes. But no one predicts the enormity of what is about to rise from the Thai Gulf. And no one can out run it this time. The Death Wave is coming', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6C077M4XIrrAXUvQJGqNqnsQyr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80706'),
  ('896582691981498538', '2025: The World Enslaved by a Virus', 2021, 'Adventure, Science Fiction, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Joshua Wesely, Simon Wesely, Simon Wesely', 'Joshua Wesely, Simon Wesely', 'Simon Wesely, Joshua Wesely, Matthew Dougan, Coby Gilyard, Isabelle Scheuermann, Antonia Joy Speer, Lukas Speer, John Vogt', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic world brought on by the Coronavirus, communism runs rampant, meetings are forbidden and Christianity is illegal. A band of young believers launch an underground revolution to reunite Christians and regain freedom from their oppressive superiors.', 'In a post-apocalyptic world brought on by the Coronavirus, communism runs rampant, meetings are forbidden and Christianity is illegal. A band of young believers launch an underground revolution to reunite Christians and regain freedom from their oppressive superiors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8S5IwaYOXMenqgW9PejoPjf4uXM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810511'),
  ('831922674664377081', '2026 EE BAFTA Film Awards', 2026, null, 'Chris Power', 'Andrew Dawson, Tim Dawson, Tim Inman, Christine Rose', 'Gillian Anderson, Jessie Buckley, Timothée Chalamet, Bryan Cranston, Alan Cumming', null, '2026 EE BAFTA Film Awards released on February 22, 2026 starring Gillian Anderson, Jessie Buckley, Timothée Chalamet and directed by Chris Power. Get notified when 2026 EE BAFTA Film Awards is available to stream!', '2026 EE BAFTA Film Awards released on February 22, 2026 starring Gillian Anderson, Jessie Buckley, Timothée Chalamet and directed by Chris Power. Get notified when 2026 EE BAFTA Film Awards is available to stream!', 'https://watch.plex.tv/_next/static/media/watch-social-share.3d6d0bee.png', 'plex:movie:2026-ee-bafta-film-awards'),
  ('657186746609398359', '2033', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Francisco Laresgoiti, Luis David Sansans, Yvette Gurza', 'Jordi Mariscal', 'Claudio Lafarga, Sandra Echeverría, Marco Antonio Treviño, Raúl Méndez, José Carlos Rodríguez, Luis Ernesto Franco, Miguel Couturier, Ariane Pellicer', null, 'In 2033, Mexico City is a hot, mechanical and chaotic megacity ruled by the military and a tyrannical government. It is an oppressed society with its religious faith and liberty of expression stolen. Pablo, the main character, is a young finantial yuppie that gets shelter in drugs and alcohol. He leaves his privileged life in order to help the unprotected and destroy the system that controls the population.', 'In 2033, Mexico City is a hot, mechanical and chaotic megacity ruled by the military and a tyrannical government. It is an oppressed society with its religious faith and liberty of expression stolen. Pablo, the main character, is a young finantial yuppie that gets shelter in drugs and alcohol. He leaves his privileged life in order to help the unprotected and destroy the system that controls the population.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fT5gRUiZzIbCkhQ7B7n59fBu7Ow.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62409'),
  ('772626967779615276', '2036 Origin Unknown', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Adam Sculthorp, Hasraf Dulull', 'Gary Hall', 'Katee Sackhoff, Ray Fearon, Julie Cox, Steven Cree, Noush Skaugen, Joe David Walters, David K.S. Tse, Neil Robertson', null, 'After the first manned mission to Mars ends in a deadly crash, mission controller Mackenzie ''Mack'' Wilson assists an artificial intelligence system, A.R.T.I. Their investigation uncovers a mysterious object under the surface of Mars that could change the future of our planet as we know it.', 'After the first manned mission to Mars ends in a deadly crash, mission controller Mackenzie ''Mack'' Wilson assists an artificial intelligence system, A.R.T.I. Their investigation uncovers a mysterious object under the surface of Mars that could change the future of our planet as we know it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3StJTYXbU3OZ26Vh1PbczqfyCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:448916'),
  ('61188420068619495', '2036: Nexus Dawn', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Luke Scott, Pierre Gill', 'Michael Green, Hampton Fancher', 'Jared Leto, Benedict Wong, Ania Marson, Ned Dennehy, Ade Sapara, Set Sjöstrand', 'PG-13', 'This in-world short film takes place in the year 2036 and revolves around Jared Leto’s character, Niander Wallace. In this short, Wallace introduces a new line of “perfected” replicants called the Nexus 9, seeking to get the prohibition on replicants repealed. This no doubt has serious ramifications that will be crucial to the plot of Blade Runner 2049.', 'This in-world short film takes place in the year 2036 and revolves around Jared Leto’s character, Niander Wallace. In this short, Wallace introduces a new line of “perfected” replicants called the Nexus 9, seeking to get the prohibition on replicants repealed. This no doubt has serious ramifications that will be crucial to the plot of Blade Runner 2049.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPci3811kFmPPEevGrnjeKWokD4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473072'),
  ('505756392493875158', '2037', 2022, 'Drama', 'Mo Hong-jin', 'Mo Hong-jin', 'Hong Ye-ji, Kim Ji-young, Kim Mi-hwa, Hwang Seok-jeong, Shin Eun-jung, Jeon So-min, Jeong In-gi, Kwon Ah-reum', null, 'Yoon-young, a 19-year-old girl who dreams of becoming a civil servant, is framed as a murderer and imprisoned in a women''s prison.', 'Yoon-young, a 19-year-old girl who dreams of becoming a civil servant, is framed as a murderer and imprisoned in a women''s prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rfYnMtNiLfqOBQjWBjN8auganXw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833593'),
  ('666524419577220952', '2046', 2004, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Romance', 'Christopher Doyle, Kwan Pung-Leung, Wong Kar-Wai', 'Wong Kar-Wai', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Gong Li, Faye Wong, Takuya Kimura, Zhang Ziyi, Dong Jie, Carina Lau, Chang Chen', null, 'Women enter and exit a science fiction author''s life over the course of a few years after the author loses the woman he considers his one true love.', 'Women enter and exit a science fiction author''s life over the course of a few years after the author loses the woman he considers his one true love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jIN65qw0Giplo4CshzMrxz204Wn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:844'),
  ('357559764658874351', '2047: Sights of Death', 2014, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Davide Manca, Alessandro Capone', 'Tommaso Agnese, Luca D''Alisera', 'Danny Glover, Rutger Hauer, Daryl Hannah, Stephen Baldwin, Michael Madsen, Neva Leoni, Kai Portman, Benjamin Stender', null, 'The year is 2047. Our planet is ruled by the repressive Confederate Central Government (CCG). Ryan is a Green War rebel agent sent on a mission by Sponge to collect evidence against the CCG for its heinous crimes. Ryan soon faces the sinister Colonel Asimov, Major Anderson and a group of mercenaries lead by Lobo. His mission quickly turns chaotic when he meets Tuage, a mutant survivor of the CCG rebellion who swears to help Ryan save what is left of their world … or does she?', 'The year is 2047. Our planet is ruled by the repressive Confederate Central Government (CCG). Ryan is a Green War rebel agent sent on a mission by Sponge to collect evidence against the CCG for its heinous crimes. Ryan soon faces the sinister Colonel Asimov, Major Anderson and a group of mercenaries lead by Lobo. His mission quickly turns chaotic when he meets Tuage, a mutant survivor of the CCG rebellion who swears to help Ryan save what is left of their world … or does she?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nfEZeyT08nTimvq92OzGPwC1bbw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277399'),
  ('46377606325268831', '2048: Nowhere to Run', 2017, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Luke Scott, Pierre Gill', 'Luke Scott, Michael Green, Hampton Fancher', 'Dave Bautista, Björn Freiberg, Adam Savage, Gérard Miller, Gaia Ottman, Orion Ben', 'PG-13', '“2048: Nowhere to Run” takes place one year before the events of Blade Runner 2049. The short film focuses on Sapper, a man who is trying to make it through life day-by-day without turning back to his old ways. We’re introduced to both the gentle nature of Sapper and the violence he’s capable of when set off.', '“2048: Nowhere to Run” takes place one year before the events of Blade Runner 2049. The short film focuses on Sapper, a man who is trying to make it through life day-by-day without turning back to his old ways. We’re introduced to both the gentle nature of Sapper and the violence he’s capable of when set off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8JKbUCIe4y1LujxMMjbxG6ueH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475759'),
  ('1041093290155017253', '2061 - Un anno eccezionale', 2007, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Carlo Vanzina, Claudio Zamarion, Giorgio Melidoni', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina, Diego Abatantuono', 'Diego Abatantuono, Emilio Solfrizzi, Sabrina Impacciatore, Dino Abbrescia, Andrea Osvárt, Stefano Chiodaroli, Jonathan Kashanian, Antonello Costa', null, 'In a post-apocalyptic future, the Italian peninsula is going through a dark moment due to a terrible energy crisis.', 'In a post-apocalyptic future, the Italian peninsula is going through a dark moment due to a terrible energy crisis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VORCNi06aCDiAwp0ZpkfimpSwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33495'),
  ('993737813925210217', '2067', 2020, 'Science Fiction', 'Seth Larney, Marianne Jade, Denson Baker', 'Seth Larney, Gareth Davies', 'Kodi Smit-McPhee, Ryan Kwanten, Sana''a Shaik, Aaron Glenane, Leeanna Walsman, Deborah Mailman, Finn Little, Matt Testro', 'NR', 'A lowly utility worker is called to the future by a mysterious radio signal, he must leave his dying wife to embark on a journey that will force him to face his deepest fears in an attempt to change the fabric of reality and save humankind from its greatest environmental crisis yet.', 'A lowly utility worker is called to the future by a mysterious radio signal, he must leave his dying wife to embark on a journey that will force him to face his deepest fears in an attempt to change the fabric of reality and save humankind from its greatest environmental crisis yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7D430eqZj8y3oVkLFfsWXGRcpEG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:528085'),
  ('806518149266991518', '2069: A Sex Odyssey', 1974, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Georg Tressler, Heinz Weninger, Michael Marszalek', 'Willi Pribil', 'Nina Frederik, Catharina Conti, Heidrun Hankammer, Alena Penz, Gerti Schneider, Franz Muxeneder, Michael Maien, Klaus Münster', 'R', 'Five vixens from Venus are sent to Earth to bring back sperm samples to their planet, which is dying out because there are no men left on it. After they land, they find that it''s not all that difficult persuading Earthmen to help them in their quest.', 'Five vixens from Venus are sent to Earth to bring back sperm samples to their planet, which is dying out because there are no men left on it. After they land, they find that it''s not all that difficult persuading Earthmen to help them in their quest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMXwRseLejv0n524ctizA6eCZTK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90787'),
  ('1061874114005992542', '2073', 2024, 'Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Asif Kapadia, Bradford Young', 'Asif Kapadia', 'Samantha Morton, Naomi Ackie, Hector Hewer', 'NR', 'Inspired by Chris Marker''s iconic 1962 featurette La Jetée; the year is 2073—a not-so-distant dystopian future—and the setting is New San Francisco, the scorched-earth tech-dominant police state where democracy and personal freedom have been well and truly obliterated.', 'Inspired by Chris Marker''s iconic 1962 featurette La Jetée; the year is 2073—a not-so-distant dystopian future—and the setting is New San Francisco, the scorched-earth tech-dominant police state where democracy and personal freedom have been well and truly obliterated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l67ir3kU53FYd6Vjwhqrkih1H1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1023915'),
  ('378353995725827355', '2081', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Austin Schmidt, Chandler Tuttle', 'Chandler Tuttle', 'James Cosmo, Julie Hagerty, Armie Hammer, Patricia Clarkson, James C. Burns, Yuris Skujins, David Healy, Alina Faye', null, '2081 depicts a dystopian future in which, thanks to the 212th Amendment to the Constitution and the unceasing vigilance of the United States Handicapper General, everyone is "finally equal...." The strong wear weights, the beautiful wear masks and the intelligent wear earpieces that fire off loud noises to keep them from taking unfair advantage.', '2081 depicts a dystopian future in which, thanks to the 212th Amendment to the Constitution and the unceasing vigilance of the United States Handicapper General, everyone is "finally equal...." The strong wear weights, the beautiful wear masks and the intelligent wear earpieces that fire off loud noises to keep them from taking unfair advantage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1XgUu6HPYONV9AVe73NgSmqFZv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35568'),
  ('180332053691497075', '2084: Video Clip for the Trade Unions'' Reflection and Pleasure', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Christian Bordès, Pascal Le Moal', 'Chris Marker', 'François Périer, Bibiane Kirby, Atika Tahiri, Sophie Garnier', null, 'Made for the centenary of France’s trade union laws, Chris Marker’s 2084 imagines a future in which a computer looks back on the labor movement of the 20th century. Mixing documentary reflection with speculative fiction, the film envisions contrasting paths for the future of workers and unions.', 'Made for the centenary of France’s trade union laws, Chris Marker’s 2084 imagines a future in which a computer looks back on the labor movement of the 20th century. Mixing documentary reflection with speculative fiction, the film envisions contrasting paths for the future of workers and unions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jhDXPScG47LHB0SMHuhO0eBNLyj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203226'),
  ('459097874949056867', '2097', 2017, 'Action', 'Esteban Calderin', null, null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAyoUnIWjROunlcIq6YSbVavD5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785899'),
  ('995799726383493154', '20min Walk from Nishi-Ogikubo Station, 2 Bedrooms, Living Room, Dining Room, Kitchen, 2mos Deposit, No Pets Allowed', 2014, 'Animation, Fantasy, Romance', 'Takeshi Honda, Mahiro Maeda, Nanae Hirabayashi', null, 'Megumi Hayashibara, Koichi Yamadera', null, 'The strange adventure of a woman that shrinks to the size of a cockroach.', 'The strange adventure of a woman that shrinks to the size of a cockroach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AdLzGx9Wn67nNE82z43qWZ8JvTG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403346'),
  ('470637723832349942', '20th Century Boys 2: The Last Hope', 2009, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Mystery', 'Satoru Karasawa, Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Tatsuya Shirashi', 'Yashushi Fukuda', 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Etsushi Toyokawa, Takako Tokiwa, Airi Taira, Nana Katase, Hitomi Kuroki, Eiko Koike, Haruka Kinami', null, 'Set 15 years after "Twentieth Century Boys," Kanna (Airi Taira) reunites with several main characters from the first film in an attempt to stop Friend''s increasing influence over the world and continued plans to eliminate humanity, as detailed in the New Book of Prophecy.', 'Set 15 years after "Twentieth Century Boys," Kanna (Airi Taira) reunites with several main characters from the first film in an attempt to stop Friend''s increasing influence over the world and continued plans to eliminate humanity, as detailed in the New Book of Prophecy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ej5rGwbyybno1pKDqqTLy7Gwc1T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25114'),
  ('757122905666168657', '20th Century Boys 3: Redemption', 2009, 'Adventure, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Satoru Karasawa, Tatsuya Shirashi', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Etsushi Toyokawa, Airi Taira, Takako Tokiwa, Teruyuki Kagawa, Naoto Takenaka, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Renji Ishibashi', null, 'The final showdown, and the final reveal. Who is Friend? How can he be stopped?', 'The final showdown, and the final reveal. Who is Friend? How can he be stopped?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zf5wTUqciMcSEUjPF5E9O8fBNo9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39123'),
  ('516770761684372633', '20th Century Boys: Beginning of the End', 2008, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Mystery', 'Satoru Karasawa, Yukihiko Tsutsumi, Tatsuya Shirashi', 'Yasushi Fukuda, Takashi Nagasaki, Naoki Urasawa', 'Toshiaki Karasawa, Takako Tokiwa, Teruyuki Kagawa, Hidehiko Ishizuka, Takashi Ukaji, Hiroyuki Miyasako, Katsuhisa Namase, Fumiyo Kohinata', null, 'In 1969, Kenji, an elementary school kid and his friends built a secret base during their summer holidays. They fantasized that they had to fight villains who were out to conquer the world and wrote them in the Book of Prophecies. Years later in 1997, Kenji becomes a convenience store manager and leads a regular life after giving up his dreams to become a rock star. His boring life is suddenly turned upside down when his old classmate dies mysteriously and an entire family in the neighbourhood disappears. At the same time, a religious cult and its mysterious leader, Friend emerges and a strange chain of events duplicating exactly the events described in the Book of Prophecies follow. Is this the beginning of the end of the world? Who is Friend?', 'In 1969, Kenji, an elementary school kid and his friends built a secret base during their summer holidays. They fantasized that they had to fight villains who were out to conquer the world and wrote them in the Book of Prophecies. Years later in 1997, Kenji becomes a convenience store manager and leads a regular life after giving up his dreams to become a rock star. His boring life is suddenly turned upside down when his old classmate dies mysteriously and an entire family in the neighbourhood disappears. At the same time, a religious cult and its mysterious leader, Friend emerges and a strange chain of events duplicating exactly the events described in the Book of Prophecies follow. Is this the beginning of the end of the world? Who is Friend?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nb1fd4nZyBLUhkjnAQx5607aBMq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36683'),
  ('355983282918383001', '20th Century Girl', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Bang Woo-ri, Cho Young-jik, Jung Hae-ji', 'Bang Woo-ri', 'Kim Yoo-jung, Byeon Woo-seok, Park Jung-woo, Roh Yoon-seo, Kim Sung-kyung, Jeong Seok-yong, Yoon Yi-reh, Jeon Hye-won', null, 'In 1999, a teen girl keeps close tabs on a boy in school on behalf of her deeply smitten best friend – then she gets swept up in a love story of her own.', 'In 1999, a teen girl keeps close tabs on a boy in school on behalf of her deeply smitten best friend – then she gets swept up in a love story of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/od22ftNnyag0TTxcnJhlsu3aLoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:851644'),
  ('19966432806991422', '20th Century Women', 2016, 'Drama', 'Mike Mills, Sean Porter, Dwayne McClintock', 'Mike Mills', 'Annette Bening, Elle Fanning, Greta Gerwig, Billy Crudup, Lucas Jade Zumann, Alison Elliott, Thea Gill, Vitaly Andrew LeBeau', 'R', 'In 1979 Santa Barbara, California, Dorothea Fields is a determined single mother in her mid-50s who is raising her adolescent son, Jamie, at a moment brimming with cultural change and rebellion. Dorothea enlists the help of two younger women – Abbie, a free-spirited punk artist living as a boarder in the Fields'' home and Julie, a savvy and provocative teenage neighbour – to help with Jamie''s upbringing.', 'In 1979 Santa Barbara, California, Dorothea Fields is a determined single mother in her mid-50s who is raising her adolescent son, Jamie, at a moment brimming with cultural change and rebellion. Dorothea enlists the help of two younger women – Abbie, a free-spirited punk artist living as a boarder in the Fields'' home and Julie, a savvy and provocative teenage neighbour – to help with Jamie''s upbringing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mso2rEr9i0MilRIOao5HaWFipS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342737'),
  ('485500085685142978', '21', 2008, 'Drama, Crime', 'Russell Carpenter, Robert Luketic, Justin Muller', 'Peter Steinfeld, Allan Loeb', 'Jim Sturgess, Kevin Spacey, Kate Bosworth, Aaron Yoo, Liza Lapira, Jacob Pitts, Laurence Fishburne, Jack McGee', 'PG-13', 'Ben Campbell is a young, highly intelligent student at M.I.T. who strives to succeed. Wanting a scholarship to transfer to Harvard School of Medicine to become a doctor, Ben learns that he cannot afford the $300,000 tuition as he comes from a poor, working-class background. But one evening, Ben is introduced by his unorthodox math professor to a small but secretive club of five students, Jill, Choi, Kianna, and Fisher, who are being trained by Professor Rosa to count cards at blackjack.', 'Ben Campbell is a young, highly intelligent student at M.I.T. who strives to succeed. Wanting a scholarship to transfer to Harvard School of Medicine to become a doctor, Ben learns that he cannot afford the $300,000 tuition as he comes from a poor, working-class background. But one evening, Ben is introduced by his unorthodox math professor to a small but secretive club of five students, Jill, Choi, Kianna, and Fisher, who are being trained by Professor Rosa to count cards at blackjack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efG8Po57alqSlhqHU1lXJ3duG6t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8065'),
  ('244865700700970263', '21 & Over', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore, Terry Stacey', 'Jon Lucas, Scott Moore', 'Miles Teller, Skylar Astin, Justin Chon, Sarah Wright, François Chau, Jonathan Keltz, Christiann Castellanos, Samantha Futerman', 'R', 'Brilliant student Jeff Chang has the most important interview of his life tomorrow. But today is still his birthday, what starts off as a casual celebration with friends evolves into a night of debauchery that risks to derail his life plan.', 'Brilliant student Jeff Chang has the most important interview of his life tomorrow. But today is still his birthday, what starts off as a casual celebration with friends evolves into a night of debauchery that risks to derail his life plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/noB71pnF8jz2IIP1LeilfnaaO2F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107811'),
  ('376471119874296355', '21 Bridges', 2019, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Brian Kirk, Paul Cameron, Andy Gill', 'Adam Mervis, Matthew Michael Carnahan', 'Chadwick Boseman, Sienna Miller, J.K. Simmons, Stephan James, Taylor Kitsch, Keith David, Alexander Siddig, Louis Cancelmi', 'R', 'An embattled NYPD detective, is thrust into a citywide manhunt for a pair of cop killers after uncovering a massive and unexpected conspiracy. As the night unfolds, lines become blurred on who he is pursuing, and who is in pursuit of him.', 'An embattled NYPD detective, is thrust into a citywide manhunt for a pair of cop killers after uncovering a massive and unexpected conspiracy. As the night unfolds, lines become blurred on who he is pursuing, and who is in pursuit of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b40ApfKDPoJYbWepUs7f09Y3fD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535292'),
  ('71395275673799437', '21 Days', 1940, 'Drama, Romance', 'Basil Dean, Jan Stallich, A.W. Watkins', 'Graham Greene, Basil Dean', 'Vivien Leigh, Laurence Olivier, Leslie Banks, Francis L. Sullivan, David Horne, William Dewhurst, Frederick Lloyd, Robert Newton', 'NR', 'After Larry Darrent accidentally kills his lover''s blackmailing husband, someone else is arrested for the crime. When he is found guilty, Larry and Wanda have just three weeks together before he must give himself up or let an innocent man go to the gallows.', 'After Larry Darrent accidentally kills his lover''s blackmailing husband, someone else is arrested for the crime. When he is found guilty, Larry and Wanda have just three weeks together before he must give himself up or let an innocent man go to the gallows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oFM4H2S4UqlbWSK0GDd6lWEw1Fa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46832'),
  ('853846216438054083', '21 Grams', 2003, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Alejandro González Iñárritu, Rodrigo Prieto, James Alan Hensz', 'Guillermo Arriaga', 'Sean Penn, Naomi Watts, Benicio del Toro, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Danny Huston, Melissa Leo, Clea DuVall, Carly Nahon', 'R', 'Paul Rivers, an ailing mathematician lovelessly married to an English émigré; Christina Peck, an upper-middle-class suburban housewife and mother of two girls; and Jack Jordan, a born-again ex-con, are brought together by a terrible accident that changes their lives.', 'Paul Rivers, an ailing mathematician lovelessly married to an English émigré; Christina Peck, an upper-middle-class suburban housewife and mother of two girls; and Jack Jordan, a born-again ex-con, are brought together by a terrible accident that changes their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wZ0l6or5juuVWqDkLEgaghs4f9l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470'),
  ('761020433716648730', '21 Hours at Munich', 1976, 'Drama, Thriller', 'William A. Graham, Wolfgang Glattes, Wieland Liebske', 'Edward Hume, Howard Fast, Serge Groussard', 'William Holden, Shirley Knight, Franco Nero, Anthony Quayle, Richard Basehart, Noel Willman, Georg Marischka, Else Quecke', 'NR', 'A dramatization of the incident in 1972 when Arab terrorists broke into the Olympic compound in Munich and murdered 11 Israeli athletes.', 'A dramatization of the incident in 1972 when Arab terrorists broke into the Olympic compound in Munich and murdered 11 Israeli athletes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVYRTI7V8TQn24f9YY3HW58KGXY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82598'),
  ('1004905148438902344', '21 Jump Street', 2012, 'Action, Comedy, Crime', 'Phil Lord, Christopher Miller, Barry Peterson', 'Michael Bacall', 'Jonah Hill, Channing Tatum, Brie Larson, Dave Franco, Rob Riggle, DeRay Davis, Ice Cube, Dax Flame', 'R', 'When cops Schmidt and Jenko join the secret Jump Street unit, they use their youthful appearances to go undercover as high school students. They trade in their guns and badges for backpacks, and set out to shut down a dangerous drug ring. But, as time goes on, Schmidt and Jenko discover that high school is nothing like it was just a few years earlier -- and, what''s more, they must again confront the teenage terror and anxiety they thought they had left behind.', 'When cops Schmidt and Jenko join the secret Jump Street unit, they use their youthful appearances to go undercover as high school students. They trade in their guns and badges for backpacks, and set out to shut down a dangerous drug ring. But, as time goes on, Schmidt and Jenko discover that high school is nothing like it was just a few years earlier -- and, what''s more, they must again confront the teenage terror and anxiety they thought they had left behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8v3Sqv9UcIUC4ebmpKWROqPBINZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64688'),
  ('1071575376607946866', '21 Nights with Pattie', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu, Yannick Ressigeac', 'Arnaud Larrieu, Jean-Marie Larrieu', 'Isabelle Carré, Karin Viard, André Dussollier, Sergi López, Denis Lavant, Mathilde Monnier, Laurent Poitrenaux, Philippe Rebbot', null, 'During the height of summer, Caroline, a forty-year-old Parisian and mother, arrives in a small village in the south of France. She must hastily organize the funeral of her mother, a flighty lawyer, whom she barely used to see. Caroline is welcomed by Pattie, who likes to talk about her love affairs with the local men to anyone who''ll listen. Then, while the whole valley gets ready for the traditional mid-summer dance, Caroline''s mother''s corpse mysteriously disappears...', 'During the height of summer, Caroline, a forty-year-old Parisian and mother, arrives in a small village in the south of France. She must hastily organize the funeral of her mother, a flighty lawyer, whom she barely used to see. Caroline is welcomed by Pattie, who likes to talk about her love affairs with the local men to anyone who''ll listen. Then, while the whole valley gets ready for the traditional mid-summer dance, Caroline''s mother''s corpse mysteriously disappears...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kIIpIyEHAViLp4Ib048wdIaGk1w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359805'),
  ('508335266905015167', '21 Up', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Michael Apted', null, 'Lynn Johnson, Tony Walker, Jacqueline Bassett, Charles Furneaux, Bruce Balden, Andrew Brackfield, Neil Hughes, Nicholas Hitchon', null, 'After another 7 year wait, director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born children from Seven Up! and 7 Plus Seven. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.', 'After another 7 year wait, director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born children from Seven Up! and 7 Plus Seven. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUpBpbicXBUEVCHOuGAyisN10V7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20553'),
  ('660814131103779820', '21-87', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Arthur Lipsett', null, 'Roman Kroitor', null, 'This short film from Arthur Lipsett is an abstract collage of snippets from discarded footage found by Lipsett in the editing room of the National Film Board (where he worked as an animator), combined with his own black and white 16mm footage shot on the streets of Montreal and New York City, among other locations. A commentary on a machine-dominated society, it is often cited as an influence on George Lucas''s Star Wars and his conceptualization of "The Force."', 'This short film from Arthur Lipsett is an abstract collage of snippets from discarded footage found by Lipsett in the editing room of the National Film Board (where he worked as an animator), combined with his own black and white 16mm footage shot on the streets of Montreal and New York City, among other locations. A commentary on a machine-dominated society, it is often cited as an influence on George Lucas''s Star Wars and his conceptualization of "The Force."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z9wqODhsxDkN8YpLSrRph8C9UKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:182099'),
  ('438866641232695941', '2103: The Deadly Wake', 1997, 'Science Fiction', 'Philip Jackson, Jonathan Freeman', 'Timothy Lee, Doug Bagot', 'Malcolm McDowell, Michael Paré, Heidi von Palleske, Mackenzie Gray, Hal Eisen, Gwynyth Walsh, Sandra Kaizer, Derek Ritschel', 'NR', 'Proxate Corporation recruits a boozy former ship captain and offers him a new identity: Sean Murdoch. His job: to take charge of large ship on one voyage. Once aboard, Murdoch realizes that the ship is a prison ship, and the cargo are criminally insane inmates. Murdoch''s other problem: someone has planted bombs aboard the vessel. Murdoch''s acrimonious relationship with the prison warden lends extra drama to the story.', 'Proxate Corporation recruits a boozy former ship captain and offers him a new identity: Sean Murdoch. His job: to take charge of large ship on one voyage. Once aboard, Murdoch realizes that the ship is a prison ship, and the cargo are criminally insane inmates. Murdoch''s other problem: someone has planted bombs aboard the vessel. Murdoch''s acrimonious relationship with the prison warden lends extra drama to the story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4wHI2gGFUfd6D7ZPQSrAhiiP5S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214717'),
  ('972829584939077443', '211', 2018, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'York Alec Shackleton, Alexander Krumov, Vessela Bannzurkova', 'John Rebus', 'Nicolas Cage, Sophie Skelton, Michael Rainey Jr., Dwayne Cameron, Weston Cage, Cory Hardrict, Ori Pfeffer, Amanda Cerny', 'R', 'Inspired by one of the longest and bloodiest real-life events in police history, Officer Mike Chandler and a young civilian passenger find themselves under-prepared and outgunned when fate puts them squarely in the crosshairs of a daring bank heist in progress by a fearless team of highly-trained and heavily-armed men.', 'Inspired by one of the longest and bloodiest real-life events in police history, Officer Mike Chandler and a young civilian passenger find themselves under-prepared and outgunned when fate puts them squarely in the crosshairs of a daring bank heist in progress by a fearless team of highly-trained and heavily-armed men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81RColr4rau6DZ7z9eMsksokcfk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500919'),
  ('1106714889870811394', '2112: The Birth of Doraemon', 1995, 'Family, Animation', 'Yoshitomo Yonetani, Yoshihiko Takakura, Masahiro Kumagai', 'Yoshitomo Yonetani', 'Nobuyo Oyama, Chisa Yokoyama, Keiko Yokozawa, Yoshiko Ohta, Yuko Minaguchi, Ichiro Nagai, Minoru Yada, Run Sasaki', null, 'Acting as a prequel, this short subject shows the life of Doraemon before traveling to the 20th century: how he was made, how he was partially broken, how he lost his ears, how he met the Nobi family and decides to return to the past to help Nobita.', 'Acting as a prequel, this short subject shows the life of Doraemon before traveling to the 20th century: how he was made, how he was partially broken, how he lost his ears, how he met the Nobi family and decides to return to the past to help Nobita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6II4Mf9Bgzqr6G4i6WKrN0OBhJm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280507'),
  ('103903266757834389', '2149: The Aftermath', 2016, 'Science Fiction', 'Vera Miller, Eric Boissonneault, Pierre Magny', 'Robert Higden', 'Nick Krause, Molly Parker, Juliette Gosselin, Jordyn Negri, Daniel DiVenere, Cassidy Marlene Jaggard, Enrique Garcia, Patricia Economo', null, 'In an oppressive future, where everyone''s only contact is their computer, one lonely young man is forced to venture forth in search of human contact.', 'In an oppressive future, where everyone''s only contact is their computer, one lonely young man is forced to venture forth in search of human contact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oHBGb6MKYvT6j1ICCV53t2Kn1Te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420410'),
  ('930522276295613407', '22 ángeles', 2016, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Miguel Bardem', 'Alicia Luna', 'María Castro, Pedro Casablanc, Octavi Pujades, Carlos Santos, Camilo Redgrave, Felipe García Vélez, José Sospedra, Tiago Rodríguez', null, 'The story of the Balmis Expedition, funded by the King of Spain, to bring the smallpox vaccine to Spanish America.', 'The story of the Balmis Expedition, funded by the King of Spain, to bring the smallpox vaccine to Spanish America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68g4XH8EJh7OJ4GZGSXGW3tBXIl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430013'),
  ('578397404498715223', '22 Bullets', 2010, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Richard Berry, Thomas Hardmeier, Ludovic Bernard', 'Matthieu Delaporte, Richard Berry, Alexandre de La Patellière', 'Jean Reno, Kad Merad, Marina Foïs, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, JoeyStarr, Richard Berry, Claude Gensac, Joséphine Berry', 'NR', 'A retired mobster goes on a revenge spree after being left for dead with 22 bullets in his body by his former childhood friend.', 'A retired mobster goes on a revenge spree after being left for dead with 22 bullets in his body by his former childhood friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4spRV4Qw0YGaWBHYJ6enu84sR81.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37645'),
  ('1046596259111033288', '22 July', 2018, 'Crime, Drama, History, Thriller', 'Paul Greengrass, Pål Ulvik Rokseth, Chris Carreras', 'Paul Greengrass', 'Jonas Strand Gravli, Anders Danielsen Lie, Jon Øigarden, Seda Witt, Ola G. Furuseth, Maria Bock, Isak Bakli Aglen, Thorbjørn Harr', 'R', 'On 22 July 2011, neo-Nazi terrorist Anders Behring Breivik murdered 77 young people attending a Labour Party Youth Camp on Utøya Island outside of Oslo. This three-part story focuses on the survivors, the political leadership of Norway, and the lawyers involved.', 'On 22 July 2011, neo-Nazi terrorist Anders Behring Breivik murdered 77 young people attending a Labour Party Youth Camp on Utøya Island outside of Oslo. This three-part story focuses on the survivors, the political leadership of Norway, and the lawyers involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd940KzuIZwbdOvOUF7XDTzn8te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474354'),
  ('646816447479087092', '22 Jump Street', 2014, 'Crime, Comedy, Action', 'Phil Lord, Christopher Miller, Barry Peterson', 'Oren Uziel, Rodney Rothman, Michael Bacall', 'Jonah Hill, Channing Tatum, Peter Stormare, Wyatt Russell, Amber Stevens West, Jillian Bell, Ice Cube, Keith Lucas', 'R', 'After making their way through high school (twice), big changes are in store for officers Schmidt and Jenko when they go deep undercover at a local college. But when Jenko meets a kindred spirit on the football team, and Schmidt infiltrates the bohemian art major scene, they begin to question their partnership. Now they don''t have to just crack the case - they have to figure out if they can have a mature relationship. If these two overgrown adolescents can grow from freshmen into real men, college might be the best thing that ever happened to them.', 'After making their way through high school (twice), big changes are in store for officers Schmidt and Jenko when they go deep undercover at a local college. But when Jenko meets a kindred spirit on the football team, and Schmidt infiltrates the bohemian art major scene, they begin to question their partnership. Now they don''t have to just crack the case - they have to figure out if they can have a mature relationship. If these two overgrown adolescents can grow from freshmen into real men, college might be the best thing that ever happened to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/850chzYHYbT3IISl6Q7dbBuFP2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187017'),
  ('695901747396081593', '22 Lengths', 2025, 'Drama', 'Mia Maariel Meyer, Tim Kuhn, Christopher Poth', 'Elena Hell', 'Luna Wedler, Jannis Niewöhner, Laura Tonke, Berke Cetin, Zoë Baier, Sabrina Schieder, Zoe Fürmann, Eleanor Reissa', null, 'Tilda''s days are strictly structured: she studies, works at the supermarket checkout and looks after her little sister Ida - on some days she also has to look after her alcoholic mother. But this summer brings a change: Tilda receives a promising job offer for a doctorate in Berlin. Viktor also turns up, who, like her, always swims 22 laps in the swimming pool. When Tilda begins to believe that everything could be better, the situation at home spirals out of control.', 'Tilda''s days are strictly structured: she studies, works at the supermarket checkout and looks after her little sister Ida - on some days she also has to look after her alcoholic mother. But this summer brings a change: Tilda receives a promising job offer for a doctorate in Berlin. Viktor also turns up, who, like her, always swims 22 laps in the swimming pool. When Tilda begins to believe that everything could be better, the situation at home spirals out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSAv70EuzDqkxZGt5vJ1O3XkQyu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1380070'),
  ('4495933347827329', '22 Minutes', 2014, 'Crime, Action', 'Dmitriy Yashonkov, Vasily Serikov', 'Denis Eleonskiy, Aleksandr Novototskiy-Vlasov, Igor Porublyov', 'Vladimir Blagoy, Vladislav Demin, Aleksandr Galibin, Petr Korolev, Ekaterina Malikova, Maxim Peshkov, Denis Nikiforov, Viktor Sukhorukov', null, '22 minutes got Russian marine to free a hijacked oil tanker far from shore.', '22 minutes got Russian marine to free a hijacked oil tanker far from shore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1z4xRxy5OGAciooLNHmqVtQlonh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271234'),
  ('35846656869553011', '22 vs. Earth', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy, Animation', 'Kevin Nolting, Andy Grisdale, Luke Martorelli', 'Josh Cooley', 'Tina Fey, Alice Braga, Richard Ayoade, Micah Chen, Adela Drabek, Aiyanna Miorin, Karee Ducharme, Samantha Ho', 'G', 'Set before the events of ‘Soul’, 22 refuses to go to Earth, enlisting a gang of 5 new souls in attempt of rebellion. However, 22’s subversive plot leads to a surprising revelation about the meaning of life.', 'Set before the events of ‘Soul’, 22 refuses to go to Earth, enlisting a gang of 5 new souls in attempt of rebellion. However, 22’s subversive plot leads to a surprising revelation about the meaning of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/32vLDKSzcCMh55zqqaSqqUA8naz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811367'),
  ('828916222719984799', '23', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Klaus Eichhammer, Andrea Kapeller', 'Hans-Christian Schmid, Michael Gutmann', 'August Diehl, Fabian Busch, Dieter Landuris, Jan-Gregor Kremp, Burghart Klaußner, Stephan Kampwirth, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Peter Fitz', null, 'The movie''s plot is based on the true story of a group of young computer hackers from Hannover, Germany. In the late 1980s the orphaned Karl Koch invests his heritage in a flat and a home computer. At first he dials up to bulletin boards to discuss conspiracy theories inspired by his favorite novel, R.A. Wilson''s "Illuminatus", but soon he and his friend David start breaking into government and military computers. Pepe, one of Karl''s rather criminal acquaintances senses that there is money in computer cracking - he travels to east Berlin and tries to contact the KGB.', 'The movie''s plot is based on the true story of a group of young computer hackers from Hannover, Germany. In the late 1980s the orphaned Karl Koch invests his heritage in a flat and a home computer. At first he dials up to bulletin boards to discuss conspiracy theories inspired by his favorite novel, R.A. Wilson''s "Illuminatus", but soon he and his friend David start breaking into government and military computers. Pepe, one of Karl''s rather criminal acquaintances senses that there is money in computer cracking - he travels to east Berlin and tries to contact the KGB.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QCfZb0KTN3Iu8jkLoog3NRBNud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1557'),
  ('834608799343293722', '23 Blast', 2014, 'Drama', 'Dylan Baker', 'Toni Hoover, Bram Hoover', 'Mark Hapka, Bram Hoover, Stephen Lang, Max Adler, Alexa PenaVega, Dylan Baker, Kim Zimmer, Becky Ann Baker', 'PG-13', 'When a high school football star is suddenly stricken with irreversible total blindness, he must decide whether to live a safe handicapped life or bravely return to the life he once knew and the sport he still loves.', 'When a high school football star is suddenly stricken with irreversible total blindness, he must decide whether to live a safe handicapped life or bravely return to the life he once knew and the sport he still loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nauBE0RFJlb0ytAOXsBMHbeWZqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295588'),
  ('92172569730580751', '23 Paces to Baker Street', 1956, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Henry Hathaway, Milton Krasner, Edmond F. Bernoudy', 'Nigel Balchin', 'Van Johnson, Vera Miles, Cecil Parker, Patricia Laffan, Maurice Denham, Estelle Winwood, Liam Redmond, Isobel Elsom', 'NR', 'Philip Hannon, a blind playwright living in London, overhears part of a conversation , that leads him into a desperate race, to find a kidnapped child. When he gets no help from the police, he along with his butler, and his ex fiancée, attempt to track down the crooks.', 'Philip Hannon, a blind playwright living in London, overhears part of a conversation , that leads him into a desperate race, to find a kidnapped child. When he gets no help from the police, he along with his butler, and his ex fiancée, attempt to track down the crooks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kh0l1cHt1aZKKsdLsQ3BnMte5VZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71171'),
  ('783791264717919609', '23 Skidoo', 1964, 'Drama', 'Julian Biggs, Paul Leach', null, null, null, 'If you erase the people of downtown America, the effect is bizarre, not to say disturbing. That is what this film does. It shows the familiar urban scene without a soul in sight: streets empty, buildings empty, yet everywhere there is evidence of recent life and activity. At the end of the film we learn what has happened.', 'If you erase the people of downtown America, the effect is bizarre, not to say disturbing. That is what this film does. It shows the familiar urban scene without a soul in sight: streets empty, buildings empty, yet everywhere there is evidence of recent life and activity. At the end of the film we learn what has happened.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNY7ytRhgj83g42RFPLaHEPUlPi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161245'),
  ('900562280478132128', '23-F: la película', 2011, 'History, Drama', 'Chema de la Peña, David Azcano', 'Joaquín Andújar', 'Paco Tous, Mariano Venancio, Juan Diego, Fernando Cayo, Juan Calot, Ginés García Millán, Lluís Marco, Luis Zahera', null, 'The failed coup d''état of February 23, 1981, which began with the capture of the Congress of Deputies and ended with the release of parliamentarians, put at serious risk the Spanish democracy.', 'The failed coup d''état of February 23, 1981, which began with the capture of the Congress of Deputies and ended with the release of parliamentarians, put at serious risk the Spanish democracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lpw6c7nRpO40NgPiNn3J9YjSn8l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101411'),
  ('307607921611097988', '23:59', 2011, 'Horror', 'Gilbert Chan, Kee Hoe Kelvin', 'Gilbert Chan', 'Tedd Chan, Stella Chung, Henley Hii, Lawrence Koh, Tommy Kuan, Josh Lai, Susan Leong, Benjamin Lim', null, 'An army recruit was found dead during a 24km road march. After the death of the recruit, strange things started to happen, haunting all the soldiers in the barracks.', 'An army recruit was found dead during a 24km road march. After the death of the recruit, strange things started to happen, haunting all the soldiers in the barracks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQGBK2mvw3x07MmwRR2J6fDADZ5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107227'),
  ('41216383699215013', '23rd Psalm Branch: Part I', 1967, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, null, null, 'In this haunting but lyrical meditation on war, Brakhage intercuts 8-mm footage of Colorado with imagery from WWII newsreels. He responds to the violence and nightmare of war by painting directly on the filmstrip.', 'In this haunting but lyrical meditation on war, Brakhage intercuts 8-mm footage of Colorado with imagery from WWII newsreels. He responds to the violence and nightmare of war by painting directly on the filmstrip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cneQhZvb81AgXgrS8r56MsZ0fID.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441812'),
  ('1056972861441564056', '23rd Psalm Branch: Part II', 1967, null, 'Stan Brakhage', null, 'Peter Kubelka', null, 'The second part: Brakhage’s layering of images spends less time with images of war, and begins filtering in scenes of Vienna and his home in Colorado. He sets up a comparison between “Kubelka’s Vienna” and his own.', 'The second part: Brakhage’s layering of images spends less time with images of war, and begins filtering in scenes of Vienna and his home in Colorado. He sets up a comparison between “Kubelka’s Vienna” and his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sWHiOSL0Y6lI5NjNSgpajg5hMW4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454400'),
  ('652465453761061329', '24', 2016, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Swaroop Mittapalli, Vikram Kumar, Advaith Ramkumar', 'Vikram Kumar', 'Suriya, Samantha Ruth Prabhu, Nithya Menen, Saranya Ponvannan, Ajay, Mohan Raman, Girish Karnad, Sathyan Sivakumar', null, 'Scientist turned Entrepreneur Dr. Sethuraman tries to safeguard his newly invented time travel device from falling into the hands of his Evil Twin Brother Aathreya.', 'Scientist turned Entrepreneur Dr. Sethuraman tries to safeguard his newly invented time travel device from falling into the hands of his Evil Twin Brother Aathreya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8d8TTADw3p75Zr4ypNWD66oqUXI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368006'),
  ('235011415630056592', '24 Bars', 2007, 'Drama', 'Josée Deshaies, Jalil Lespert', 'Jalil Lespert, Yann Apperry', 'Lubna Azabal, Benoît Magimel, Sami Bouajila, Bérangère Allaux, Archie Shepp, Steve Mac Graven, Aurélia Thiérrée, Clotilde Hesme', null, 'It is Christmas Eve. Separated from her young son, Helly struggles for money. A solitary man, Didier pays her to play his fiancée for the night. But the act comes to a tragic end. Left stunned, Helly meets Marie, who takes her in, on her way to the coast. There they encounter Chris. All three will end the night together. It’s their last move in joy and perdition.', 'It is Christmas Eve. Separated from her young son, Helly struggles for money. A solitary man, Didier pays her to play his fiancée for the night. But the act comes to a tragic end. Left stunned, Helly meets Marie, who takes her in, on her way to the coast. There they encounter Chris. All three will end the night together. It’s their last move in joy and perdition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j1KHf3000MUusbnzdutKZZIik4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17366'),
  ('36642239772497770', '24 City', 2008, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jia Zhangke, Nelson Yu Lik-wai, Wang Yu', 'Yongming Zhai, Jia Zhangke', 'Joan Chen, Lü Liping, Zhao Tao, Chen Jianbin', null, 'As a decades-old state-run aeronautics munitions factory in downtown Chengdu, China is being torn down for the construction of the titular luxury apartment complex, director Jia Zhangke interviews various people affiliated with it about their experiences.', 'As a decades-old state-run aeronautics munitions factory in downtown Chengdu, China is being torn down for the construction of the titular luxury apartment complex, director Jia Zhangke interviews various people affiliated with it about their experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAtPh6od2wiaarDxwnpXeD3IgKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29972'),
  ('939864044599162101', '24 Days', 2014, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Alexandre Arcady, Alexandre Aja, Gilles Henry', 'Alexandre Arcady, Émilie Frèche, Antoine Lacomblez', 'Zabou Breitman, Pascal Elbé, Jacques Gamblin, Sylvie Testud, Éric Caravaca, Syrus Shahidi, Kevin Elarbi, Olivier Sitruk', null, 'When Ilan Halimi is kidnapped for ransom because Jewish and supposedly rich, his family and the police start a race against time to save him from the tortures of the "gang of barbarians".', 'When Ilan Halimi is kidnapped for ransom because Jewish and supposedly rich, his family and the police start a race against time to save him from the tortures of the "gang of barbarians".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUNtHfRrFS4unXScpJbvZELPMB8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238781'),
  ('13502578616184982', '24 Hour Party People', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Michael Winterbottom, Robby Müller, Paul Cripps', 'Frank Cottrell Boyce', 'Steve Coogan, Lennie James, Paddy Considine, Shirley Henderson, Andy Serkis, John Simm, Ralf Little, Danny Cunningham', 'R', 'Manchester, 1976. Tony Wilson is an ambitious but frustrated local TV news reporter looking for a way to make his mark. After witnessing a life-changing concert by a band known as the Sex Pistols, he persuades his station to televise one of their performances, and soon Manchester''s punk groups are clamoring for him to manage them. Riding the wave of a musical revolution, Wilson and his friends create the legendary Factory Records label and The Hacienda club.', 'Manchester, 1976. Tony Wilson is an ambitious but frustrated local TV news reporter looking for a way to make his mark. After witnessing a life-changing concert by a band known as the Sex Pistols, he persuades his station to televise one of their performances, and soon Manchester''s punk groups are clamoring for him to manage them. Riding the wave of a musical revolution, Wilson and his friends create the legendary Factory Records label and The Hacienda club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8f50NQ1wz6hdxfCISCPV8XQ6DII.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2750'),
  ('508526823330184303', '24 Hours in the Life of a Clown', 1946, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jean-Pierre Melville, André Villard, Gustave Raulet', 'Jean-Pierre Melville', 'Beby, Louis Maïss, Jean-Pierre Melville', null, 'The movie follows the clock round as music hall clown Beby takes off his make up, goes home for a meal, looks at photos and goes to bed to rise, spend a day in the village and perform with his new partner.', 'The movie follows the clock round as music hall clown Beby takes off his make up, goes home for a meal, looks at photos and goes to bed to rise, spend a day in the village and perform with his new partner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ahDZoylb6NSahvvtAwhbdlfxixj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46769'),
  ('276745634263545505', '24 Hours in the Life of a Woman', 2002, 'Drama', 'Laurent Bouhnik, Gilles Henry', 'Gilles Taurand, Laurent Bouhnik', 'Agnès Jaoui, Michel Serrault, Bérénice Bejo, Nikolaj Coster-Waldau, Pascal Greggory, Valérie Dréville, Serge Riaboukine, Chloé Lambert', null, 'Set in 1913, 1936 and 2001. When he returns to the casino and seaside resort of his early teens, Louis, a 78 year old man encounters Olivia, a 19 year old young woman madly in love with a violent cad. Louis tells the story of his own mother having a passionate, driven fling with his Italian tennis instructor in 1936, and of Marie Collins Brown, the slightly older widowed woman who helped him through his confusion and pain by recounting the story of her passionate 24 hour fling with a hopeless young Polish gambler in 1913.', 'Set in 1913, 1936 and 2001. When he returns to the casino and seaside resort of his early teens, Louis, a 78 year old man encounters Olivia, a 19 year old young woman madly in love with a violent cad. Louis tells the story of his own mother having a passionate, driven fling with his Italian tennis instructor in 1936, and of Marie Collins Brown, the slightly older widowed woman who helped him through his confusion and pain by recounting the story of her passionate 24 hour fling with a hopeless young Polish gambler in 1913.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6sw0Pxe8PnFt8v9T7ipr0OsSY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64208'),
  ('286069123805326908', '24 Hours to Live', 2017, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'Brian Smrz, Darryl Hammer, Ben Nott', 'Ron Mita, Jim McClain, Zach Dean', 'Ethan Hawke, Xu Qing, Paul Anderson, Rutger Hauer, Tyrone Keogh, Nathalie Boltt, Liam Cunningham, Jeremy Yong', 'R', 'An assassin seeks redemption after being given a second chance at life.', 'An assassin seeks redemption after being given a second chance at life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0MXP33x1bq48TDC7IaNqQ8nxcc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470114'),
  ('586989134315753934', '24 Hours with Gaspar', 2023, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Teoh Gay Hian, Yosep Anggi Noen, Widya Fajriah', 'Mohammad Irfan Ramly', 'Reza Rahadian, Shenina Cinnamon, Laura Basuki, Dewi Irawan, Kristo Immanuel, Sal Priadi, Iswadi Pratama, Landung Simatupang', 'R', 'With only 24 hours left to live, a private investigator follows a trail of confounding clues to uncover the disappearance of his childhood friend.', 'With only 24 hours left to live, a private investigator follows a trail of confounding clues to uncover the disappearance of his childhood friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8jJKM0ZR3GQo6E3CUkMKKVa4S8B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1013240'),
  ('994038964861310524', '24 Nights', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Kieran Turner', 'Keiran Turner', 'Kevin Isola, Aida Turturro, Stephen Mailer, David Burtka, Robert T. Bogue, Mary Louise Wilson, Mark Bateman, Sybyl Walker', null, 'When Jonathan Parker was 4 years old, his mother''s words and a chance encounter with a Salvation Army Kris Kringle instilled in him a lifelong belief in the legend of Santa Claus. Now 24 and his parents long passed away, Jonathan is a spacey, pot-smoking college drop-out and multi loser in romance who has one shot left to find his true love; he writes a letter to Santa Claus. After meeting Toby, a new co-worker just moved to the city, Jonathan is convinced this is the one who was sent for him, even after he meets Toby''s long time boyfriend Keith. This doesn''t deter Jonathan, who proceeds to wreck everyone''s lives in pursuit of his dream man. Fighting snags, traps and pitfalls to Christmas Day, will Jonathan land his Christmas wish?', 'When Jonathan Parker was 4 years old, his mother''s words and a chance encounter with a Salvation Army Kris Kringle instilled in him a lifelong belief in the legend of Santa Claus. Now 24 and his parents long passed away, Jonathan is a spacey, pot-smoking college drop-out and multi loser in romance who has one shot left to find his true love; he writes a letter to Santa Claus. After meeting Toby, a new co-worker just moved to the city, Jonathan is convinced this is the one who was sent for him, even after he meets Toby''s long time boyfriend Keith. This doesn''t deter Jonathan, who proceeds to wreck everyone''s lives in pursuit of his dream man. Fighting snags, traps and pitfalls to Christmas Day, will Jonathan land his Christmas wish?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91nXiwOSgvBxuBdS2WYSVSJmhpj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109978'),
  ('155626401409221940', '24 Weeks', 2016, 'Drama', 'Anne Zohra Berrached, Friede Clausz', 'Carl Gerber, Anne Zohra Berrached', 'Julia Jentsch, Bjarne Mädel, Johanna Gastdorf, Emilia Pieske, Maria Dragus, Mila Bruk, Sabine Wolf, Karina Plachetka', null, 'Astrid is a comedian who makes people laugh for a living; her husband Markus is her manager and the two of them work well together. They have a nine-year-old daughter and are expecting their second child. When they learn that their child will not be born healthy, they are at first optimistic that they will be able to meet this challenge – although they have no idea what awaits them. But the closer it gets to the due date, the more Astrid begins to worry about the future of her unborn child as well as that of her family and her career. After many discussions and arguments Astrid realises that the decision that will affect all their lives must be made by her alone. What complicates matters further is the fact that, as a successful entertainer, she is in the eye of the public and the media.', 'Astrid is a comedian who makes people laugh for a living; her husband Markus is her manager and the two of them work well together. They have a nine-year-old daughter and are expecting their second child. When they learn that their child will not be born healthy, they are at first optimistic that they will be able to meet this challenge – although they have no idea what awaits them. But the closer it gets to the due date, the more Astrid begins to worry about the future of her unborn child as well as that of her family and her career. After many discussions and arguments Astrid realises that the decision that will affect all their lives must be made by her alone. What complicates matters further is the fact that, as a successful entertainer, she is in the eye of the public and the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKzmeKmZWIoSPbwxocStemcTgwL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378695'),
  ('474563524317447868', '24/7: The Passion of Life', 2006, 'Drama', 'Roland Reber', null, 'Mira Gittner, Marina Anna Eich, Michael Burkhardt, Reinhard Wendt, Lydia Hippel, Bernhard Keberle, Patricia Koch, Sabine Krappweis', null, 'Eva, a hotelier’s daughter, and Magdalena, a sociologist who works as the dominatrix “Lady Maria” in an S & M studio, meet coincidentally through a motorcycle accident. Fascinated by the bizarre world of Lady Maria, Eve begins to search for her own identity and sexuality and goes on an odyssey through the hidden locations of lust - dominatrix studio, swinger club, striptease bar – and meets other people torn between their desires: Dominik, who wants to empathize with the life and suffering of Jesus, and Mike, who pretends to be Eve''s travel guide of desire and falls madly in love with her.', 'Eva, a hotelier’s daughter, and Magdalena, a sociologist who works as the dominatrix “Lady Maria” in an S & M studio, meet coincidentally through a motorcycle accident. Fascinated by the bizarre world of Lady Maria, Eve begins to search for her own identity and sexuality and goes on an odyssey through the hidden locations of lust - dominatrix studio, swinger club, striptease bar – and meets other people torn between their desires: Dominik, who wants to empathize with the life and suffering of Jesus, and Mike, who pretends to be Eve''s travel guide of desire and falls madly in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wXLcjck851SWOCdZrY3CU6m0uVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82137'),
  ('780522388398003729', '247°F', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Mark Roper, Jaba Melkadze, Levan Bakhia', 'Lloyd S. Wagner, Beka Oniani', 'Scout Taylor-Compton, Christina Ulloa, Travis Van Winkle, Michael Copon, Tyler Mane, Rene Etore, Tornike Gogrichiani, Jeremy Inabnit', 'R', 'Four friends travel to a lakeside cabin for a carefree weekend, but the fun turns into a nightmare when 3 of them end up locked in a hot sauna. Every minute counts and every degree matters as they fight for their lives in the heat up to 247°F.', 'Four friends travel to a lakeside cabin for a carefree weekend, but the fun turns into a nightmare when 3 of them end up locked in a hot sauna. Every minute counts and every degree matters as they fight for their lives in the heat up to 247°F.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lkaFSVU0tN3z21CJV98P9dseMe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:137145'),
  ('772232038177876098', '24th Mountain Infantry: Boxing Lesson', 1897, 'Documentary', null, null, null, null, 'Alpine shooters perform various boxing exercises.', 'Alpine shooters perform various boxing exercises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnXCNn0knLlIZRAlOR71rOOKzmo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193618'),
  ('1079941965953913698', '25 km/h', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure, Family', 'Markus Goller, Frank Griebe', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Lars Eidinger, Bjarne Mädel, Sandra Hüller, Franka Potente, Alexandra Maria Lara, Jella Haase, Jördis Triebel, Wotan Wilke Möhring', null, 'A road movie about two very different brothers who have not seen each other for 20 years: city manager Christian and cabinetmaker Georg, who never left their hometown and took care of their father until his passing. After their fathers funeral, the brothers decide on a whim, and with some help from the alcohol, to fulfil their old dream: travel trough Germany together on their mopeds.', 'A road movie about two very different brothers who have not seen each other for 20 years: city manager Christian and cabinetmaker Georg, who never left their hometown and took care of their father until his passing. After their fathers funeral, the brothers decide on a whim, and with some help from the alcohol, to fulfil their old dream: travel trough Germany together on their mopeds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIyfQTe9bIxNgIhuKGVOa9wVWxJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480736'),
  ('992982254424333392', '25 October, the First Day', 1968, 'Animation, History', 'Yuri Norstein, Arkadiy Tyurin, Vladimir Sarukhanov', 'Arkadiy Tyurin, Yuri Norstein', null, null, 'A short film made by Yuri Norstein for the 60th anniversary of the October Revolution, The 25th - the First Day recounts that day using art from the revolutionary period.', 'A short film made by Yuri Norstein for the 60th anniversary of the October Revolution, The 25th - the First Day recounts that day using art from the revolutionary period.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1syRyw2Qq6oXRX3nScRTI1JcLlG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90421'),
  ('1033871952952063041', '25 Watts', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Pablo Rebella, Pablo Stoll, Bárbara Álvarez', 'Juan Pablo Rebella, Pablo Stoll', 'Daniel Hendler, Jorge Temponi, Alfonso Tort, Valentín Rivero, Walter Reyno, Damián Barrera, César Herrera, Judith Anaya', null, '24 hours in the life of three street youths in Montevideo. Three teenage guys try to figure out what they''re supposed to be doing with their lives in this drama from Uruguay that puts the emphasis on character over narrative.', '24 hours in the life of three street youths in Montevideo. Three teenage guys try to figure out what they''re supposed to be doing with their lives in this drama from Uruguay that puts the emphasis on character over narrative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agNqkre8kYfCLaFb38NhXdmPiMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63066'),
  ('187888755771462568', '25 Ways to Quit Smoking', 1989, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Bill Plympton', 'Bill Plympton', 'Bill Plympton', null, 'The perilous road to kicking the habit is explored in twenty-six vignettes that include various professionals and contraptions.', 'The perilous road to kicking the habit is explored in twenty-six vignettes that include various professionals and contraptions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDAVQWUpscgevckpge5gnlDnkcN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48708'),
  ('769079144733299663', '25 Years of Innocence', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Maciej A. Maciejewski, Jan Holoubek, Bartłomiej Kaczmarek', 'Andrzej Gołda', 'Piotr Trojan, Agata Kulesza, Dariusz Chojnacki, Łukasz Lewandowski, Adam Nawojczyk, Dariusz Toczek, Stanisław Linowski, Jan Frycz', null, 'Tomasz Komenda was 23 years old when his normal life was brutally interrupted. Overnight he was arrested, thrown into prison and charged with murder. Subsequent expert opinions confirmed his participation in the crime, and any evidence was against him. For nearly two decades in prison, he was beaten, intimidated, humiliated and on his own. Finally, after 18 years of imprisonment, prosecutors and a policeman appeared on his way, who decided to discover the truth behind the mysterious case of the detainee.', 'Tomasz Komenda was 23 years old when his normal life was brutally interrupted. Overnight he was arrested, thrown into prison and charged with murder. Subsequent expert opinions confirmed his participation in the crime, and any evidence was against him. For nearly two decades in prison, he was beaten, intimidated, humiliated and on his own. Finally, after 18 years of imprisonment, prosecutors and a policeman appeared on his way, who decided to discover the truth behind the mysterious case of the detainee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYv28JRaDzm1p7Zz2fGpA519tfl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741652'),
  ('662729579521273218', '252: Signal of Life', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Nobuo Mizuta, Tetsuro Sano, Junichiro Hayashi', 'Nobuo Mizuta, Hiroshi Saito, Tetsuya Oishi', 'Hideaki Ito, Seiyo Uchino, Takayuki Yamada, Yuichi Kimura, Yeon Min-ji, Ayane Omori, Yuu Kashii, Taro Yamamoto', null, 'At some point in the distant future, a massive, catastrophic earthquake strikes Tokyo, causing the temperature of the Pacific Ocean to rise meteorically and the largest typhoon in recorded Japanese history to sweep toward the city and inundate it with water. The Tokyo Fire Department and its team of crack rescuers swing into action, and shortly after they do, a distress call arises from an underground subway station - with repeated indications of the rescue code, 252 252, and the exclamation "We Have Survivors." It soon becomes apparent that the local rescue squad must attempt to save the survivors, doing so at the expense of their own lives and safety. Written by Nathan Southern', 'At some point in the distant future, a massive, catastrophic earthquake strikes Tokyo, causing the temperature of the Pacific Ocean to rise meteorically and the largest typhoon in recorded Japanese history to sweep toward the city and inundate it with water. The Tokyo Fire Department and its team of crack rescuers swing into action, and shortly after they do, a distress call arises from an underground subway station - with repeated indications of the rescue code, 252 252, and the exclamation "We Have Survivors." It soon becomes apparent that the local rescue squad must attempt to save the survivors, doing so at the expense of their own lives and safety. Written by Nathan Southern', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePVTIN6lfaM4G6RtQJlHGgaam0N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81391'),
  ('477273640449896840', '25th Anniversary Studio Ghibli Concert', 2008, 'Music', 'Mami Sunada', null, 'Joe Hisaishi, Naoya Fujimaki, Takaaki Fujioka, Masako Hayashi, Ayaka Hirahara, Mai, Nozomi Ōhashi, Hayao Miyazaki', null, 'Concert held on August 4, 5 and 6, 2008 at the Nippon Budōkan hall in Tokyo to commemorate both the Japanese theatrical release of Ponyo (2008) and the 25 years of musical collaboration between composer Joe Hisaishi and filmmaker Hayao Miyazaki.', 'Concert held on August 4, 5 and 6, 2008 at the Nippon Budōkan hall in Tokyo to commemorate both the Japanese theatrical release of Ponyo (2008) and the 25 years of musical collaboration between composer Joe Hisaishi and filmmaker Hayao Miyazaki.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/keTPe2MTGRUd7mSsqZGO7GrbEFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66943'),
  ('862743333181859806', '25th Hour', 2002, 'Crime, Drama', 'Spike Lee, Rodrigo Prieto, Michael A. Pinckney', 'David Benioff', 'Edward Norton, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Barry Pepper, Rosario Dawson, Anna Paquin, Brian Cox, Isiah Whitlock Jr., Tony Siragusa', 'R', 'On the eve of a seven-year prison sentence, a New York drug dealer spends his final day of freedom confronting his past, his relationships, and the choices that led to his downfall in a city still reeling from 9/11.', 'On the eve of a seven-year prison sentence, a New York drug dealer spends his final day of freedom confronting his past, his relationships, and the choices that led to his downfall in a city still reeling from 9/11.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uW7tTRElr2tRhmAVESzvHy4ByXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1429'),
  ('818303595119050469', '26 Years', 2012, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hong Seung-chul, Cho Keun-hyun, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Lee Hae-young', 'Jin Goo, Han Hye-jin, Im Seul-ong, Bae Soo-bin, Lee Kyung-young, Jang Kwang, Lee Mi-do, Jo Deok-jae', null, 'Three relatives of victims come together to get revenge on a murderer twenty-six years after the massacre. The man had killed groups of people in the 1980 Gwangju murders.', 'Three relatives of victims come together to get revenge on a murderer twenty-six years after the massacre. The man had killed groups of people in the 1980 Gwangju murders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shRmAxn7XBuNgXcFNC4vpLD3xNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:140380'),
  ('315302425336908357', '267', 2026, 'Drama', 'Jesse Frank', 'Jesse Frank', 'Rachel Petsiavas, Michael James Sewell Jr., Franny Titus, Wade Hammond', null, 'When a brother and sister are reunited after years of separation, they uncover a dark secret about one of the worlds largest pharmaceutical companies. Eager to expose the truth, they have no choice but to face their darkest fears together.', 'When a brother and sister are reunited after years of separation, they uncover a dark secret about one of the worlds largest pharmaceutical companies. Eager to expose the truth, they have no choice but to face their darkest fears together.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwU7uavcwqMf1idvyPxOm9d9xegK.jpg', 'plex:movie:267-2026'),
  ('820077760080596338', '27 Dresses', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Anne Fletcher, Peter James, Wilson Tang', 'Aline Brosh McKenna', 'Katherine Heigl, James Marsden, Malin Åkerman, Judy Greer, Edward Burns, Melora Hardin, Brian Kerwin, Maulik Pancholy', 'PG-13', 'Altruistic Jane finds herself facing her worst nightmare as her younger sister announces her engagement to the man Jane secretly adores.', 'Altruistic Jane finds herself facing her worst nightmare as her younger sister announces her engagement to the man Jane secretly adores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEfourJfgEyKiewwH8ZkUYt9AqE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6557'),
  ('245749218967550439', '27 Horas', 1986, 'Drama', 'Montxo Armendáriz', 'Montxo Armendáriz, Elías Querejeta', 'Antonio Banderas, Martxelo Rubio, Maribel Verdú, Jon San Sebastián, André Falcon', null, 'Drama on juvenile delinquency, unemployment and drugs. Jon, a boy of twenty, gets up at seven o''clock and from that moment we can see how he lives the friendship, love, family relationships and his dark passion for drugs.', 'Drama on juvenile delinquency, unemployment and drugs. Jon, a boy of twenty, gets up at seven o''clock and from that moment we can see how he lives the friendship, love, family relationships and his dark passion for drugs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oSWXSOfDWFBboL90pHir3nmCQV6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112803'),
  ('823790812854385287', '27 Missing Kisses', 2000, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nana Jorjadze, Phedon Papamichael', 'Nana Jorjadze, Irakli Kvirikadze', 'Nutsa Kukhianidze, Evgeniy Sidikhin, Shalva Iashvili, Pierre Richard, Nino Koberidze, Amaliya Mordvinova, Levan Uchaneishvili, Davit Gogibedashvili', null, 'A young woman''s passion has a remarkable effect on a Russian village in this comedy-drama with fantasy elements. Sybill is a teenager who is sent to a small town in the country to spend the summer with her aunt. Despite her tender age, Sybill is ripe and sexually aware, and while the initial object of her attention is Alexander, a widower in his early 40s, she instead pairs up with Mickey, Alexander''s teenage son. Mickey quickly becomes infatuated with Sybill and is more than happy to indulge her fondness for outdoor lovemaking. Between Sybill''s carefree, youthful sensuality and the appearance of Emmanuelle at the local movie house, suddenly love and lust are in bloom all over town.', 'A young woman''s passion has a remarkable effect on a Russian village in this comedy-drama with fantasy elements. Sybill is a teenager who is sent to a small town in the country to spend the summer with her aunt. Despite her tender age, Sybill is ripe and sexually aware, and while the initial object of her attention is Alexander, a widower in his early 40s, she instead pairs up with Mickey, Alexander''s teenage son. Mickey quickly becomes infatuated with Sybill and is more than happy to indulge her fondness for outdoor lovemaking. Between Sybill''s carefree, youthful sensuality and the appearance of Emmanuelle at the local movie house, suddenly love and lust are in bloom all over town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sByH7a0Nt0WfJnBUcm8IcRE0UQ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63607'),
  ('779946769578630728', '27 Nights', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Hendler', 'Daniel Hendler, Martín Mauregui, Agustina Liendo', 'Marilú Marini, Daniel Hendler, Humberto Tortonese, Julieta Zylberberg, Paula Grinszpan, Carla Peterson, Germán de Silva, Roberto Suárez', 'R', 'When a woman is admitted by her daughters to a psychiatric clinic for her carefree ways, an expert must judge if she is ill or simply wants to enjoy life.', 'When a woman is admitted by her daughters to a psychiatric clinic for her carefree ways, an expert must judge if she is ill or simply wants to enjoy life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kVMUTLFbfQvNYdFHiexTDnSHntV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327769'),
  ('863427166869686863', '27: Gone Too Soon', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Simon Napier-Bell', 'Simon Napier-Bell', 'Steve Blame, Barney Hoskyns, Chris Salewicz, Dan Gillespie Sells, Dylan Jones, Keith Cameron, Mick O''Shea, Olly Alexander', null, 'Brian Jones, Jimi Hendrix, Janis Joplin and Jim Morrison all died at the age of 27 between 1969 and 1971. At the time, the coincidence gave rise to some comment, but it was not until the death of Kurt Cobain, about two and a half decades later, that the idea of a "27 Club" began to catch on in public perception, reignited with the death of Amy Winehouse in 2011. Through interviews with people who knew them, such as music stars, critics, medical experts and unseen footage, the lives, music, and artistry of those who died at 27 are investigated with a bid to find answers.', 'Brian Jones, Jimi Hendrix, Janis Joplin and Jim Morrison all died at the age of 27 between 1969 and 1971. At the time, the coincidence gave rise to some comment, but it was not until the death of Kurt Cobain, about two and a half decades later, that the idea of a "27 Club" began to catch on in public perception, reignited with the death of Amy Winehouse in 2011. Through interviews with people who knew them, such as music stars, critics, medical experts and unseen footage, the lives, music, and artistry of those who died at 27 are investigated with a bid to find answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1Wn0HhpsSP70YFHBe2EcrdEH7Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:521669'),
  ('45771055560088825', '27: The Cursed Club', 2018, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Fantasy', 'Néstor Sánchez Sotelo, Martín Armoya, Inés Villanueva', 'Alex Cox, Paula Manzone, Nicanor Loreti', 'Diego Capusotto, Sofía Gala Castiglione, Daniel Aráoz, Guillermo Toledo, Ezequiel Cwirkaluk, Paula Manzone, Yayo Guridi, William Prociuk', null, 'Following the death of a musician under suspicious circumstances, a researcher and a music fan examine why rock stars often die at 27.', 'Following the death of a musician under suspicious circumstances, a researcher and a music fan examine why rock stars often die at 27.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AoiISMdxbHIG6jqp3pFNLd4O50M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496208'),
  ('692245114767863930', '28 Days', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Betty Thomas, Declan Quinn, Alan Hook', 'Susannah Grant', 'Sandra Bullock, Viggo Mortensen, Dominic West, Elizabeth Perkins, Azura Skye, Steve Buscemi, Alan Tudyk, Mike O''Malley', 'PG-13', 'After getting into a car accident while drunk on the day of her sister''s wedding, Gwen Cummings is given a choice between prison or a rehab center. She chooses rehab, but is extremely resistant to taking part in any of the treatment programs they have to offer, refusing to admit that she has an alcohol addiction.', 'After getting into a car accident while drunk on the day of her sister''s wedding, Gwen Cummings is given a choice between prison or a rehab center. She chooses rehab, but is extremely resistant to taking part in any of the treatment programs they have to offer, refusing to admit that she has an alcohol addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tlgz7Shx0UavR5pyITeJ2mUHKFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10468'),
  ('1040824834679983072', '28 Days Later', 2002, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Danny Boyle, Anthony Dod Mantle, Mark Digby', 'Alex Garland', 'Cillian Murphy, Naomie Harris, Brendan Gleeson, Megan Burns, Christopher Eccleston, Noah Huntley, Luke Mably, Stuart McQuarrie', 'R', 'Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it''s absolutely impossible to contain.', 'Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it''s absolutely impossible to contain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQckQRt17VaWbo39GIu0TMOiszq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170'),
  ('160051648367128447', '28 Hotel Rooms', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matt Ross, Jason Mesias, Keith Allen Cox', 'Matt Ross', 'Chris Messina, Marin Ireland, Robert Deamer, Anne H. Wilson, Yaitza Rivera, Paul Day, Marine Buton, Matthew L. Oliva', 'NR', 'While traveling for work in a city far from their homes, a novelist and a corporate accountant find themselves in bed together. Although she’s married, and he’s seeing someone, their intense attraction turns a one-night stand into an unexpected relationship and a respite from the obligations of daily life. Through a series of moments – some profound, some silly, some intensely intimate – we see a portrait of an evolving relationship that could become the most significant one of their lives.', 'While traveling for work in a city far from their homes, a novelist and a corporate accountant find themselves in bed together. Although she’s married, and he’s seeing someone, their intense attraction turns a one-night stand into an unexpected relationship and a respite from the obligations of daily life. Through a series of moments – some profound, some silly, some intensely intimate – we see a portrait of an evolving relationship that could become the most significant one of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8QaCLzPW5e4LlJtwZM4T7TQZNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84166'),
  ('423915991004662540', '28 Minutes for 3 Million Dollars', 1967, 'Crime', 'Maurizio Pradeaux, Oberdan Troiani, Antonio Casale', 'Maurizio Pradeaux', 'Richard Harrison, Erna Schürer, Franca Polesello, Claudio Biava, Ferruccio Viotti, Marino Carpano, Bob Tonelli, Conny Caracciolo', null, 'A billionaire hires a professional thief to steal a famous diamond.', 'A billionaire hires a professional thief to steal a famous diamond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5K7qkDQyWBYlrTi5MzVXFIUI6nV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281245'),
  ('533905768795278069', '28 Up', 1984, 'Documentary', 'Michael Apted', null, 'Lynn Johnson, Tony Walker, Jacqueline Bassett, Bruce Balden, Andrew Brackfield, Paul Kligerman, Symon Basterfield, Neil Hughes', null, 'Just two years away from turning 30, participants in Michael Apted''s documentary series are facing serious questions of identity and purpose, wondering whether they''ve found their place in the world.', 'Just two years away from turning 30, participants in Michael Apted''s documentary series are facing serious questions of identity and purpose, wondering whether they''ve found their place in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqwouPCwQF9UTl8GjIBjbLivmdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20561'),
  ('583382635771600920', '28 Weeks Later', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Juan Carlos Fresnadillo, Enrique Chediak, Katrina Mackay', 'Rowan Joffé, Juan Carlos Fresnadillo, Jesús Olmo', 'Robert Carlyle, Rose Byrne, Jeremy Renner, Harold Perrineau, Catherine McCormack, Mackintosh Muggleton, Imogen Poots, Idris Elba', 'R', 'Twenty-eight weeks after the spread of a deadly rage virus, the inhabitants of the British Isles have lost their battle against the onslaught, as the virus has killed everyone there. Six months later, a group of Americans dare to set foot on the Isles, convinced the danger has passed. But it soon becomes all too clear that the scourge continues to live, waiting to pounce on its next victims.', 'Twenty-eight weeks after the spread of a deadly rage virus, the inhabitants of the British Isles have lost their battle against the onslaught, as the virus has killed everyone there. Six months later, a group of Americans dare to set foot on the Isles, convinced the danger has passed. But it soon becomes all too clear that the scourge continues to live, waiting to pounce on its next victims.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oix0aNv1lvW3nUGspUyvSIBlpbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1562'),
  ('72725823647195435', '28 Years Later', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Danny Boyle, Anthony Dod Mantle, Emily Perowne', 'Alex Garland', 'Jodie Comer, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Alfie Williams, Ralph Fiennes, Jack O''Connell, Chi Lewis-Parry, Edvin Ryding, Christopher Fulford', 'R', 'Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.', 'Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1100988'),
