  ('134275701402003884', '29 Palms', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Leonardo Ricagni, Horacio Maira', 'Tino Lucente', 'Jeremy Davies, Rachael Leigh Cook, Chris O''Donnell, Michael Rapaport, Michael Lerner, Russell Means, Jon Polito, Kevin Sifuentes', 'R', 'When a bag filled with money goes missing from a casino, the Hitman (Chris O''Donnell) must retrieve it. While he tracks the stash down, the bag changes hands numerous times, finding its way to the Drifter (Jeremy Davies) and the Waitress (Rachael Leigh Cook), among others. As the bag''s journey continues, more characters, including the Cop (Michael Rapaport) and the Sheriff (Keith David), get drawn into the winding crime tale, and the search becomes increasingly desperate.', 'When a bag filled with money goes missing from a casino, the Hitman (Chris O''Donnell) must retrieve it. While he tracks the stash down, the bag changes hands numerous times, finding its way to the Drifter (Jeremy Davies) and the Waitress (Rachael Leigh Cook), among others. As the bag''s journey continues, more characters, including the Cop (Michael Rapaport) and the Sheriff (Keith David), get drawn into the winding crime tale, and the search becomes increasingly desperate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDNBHNJ0pu1ey6FRtJ0MwcU0Mcf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58631'),
  ('65948471925709270', '29th Street', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Steven Fierberg, George Gallo', 'George Gallo', 'Danny Aiello, Anthony LaPaglia, Lainie Kazan, Frank Pesce, Robert Forster, Ron Karabatsos, Rick Aiello, Vic Manni', 'R', 'After winning $6.2 million in the 1976 New York State Lottery, he is arrested for throwing rocks at a church. He then tells his story at the police station.', 'After winning $6.2 million in the 1976 New York State Lottery, he is arrested for throwing rocks at a church. He then tells his story at the police station.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/49qYMV5re5pug1ybxNQ4VUp6Owv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43267'),
