  ('170995699455374296', '2Night', 2017, 'Drama', 'Ivan Silvestrini, Davide Manca', 'Marco Danieli, Antonella Lattanzi, Antonio Manca', 'Matilde Gioli, Matteo Martari, Giulio Beranek', null, 'Two thirty-somethings meet in a trendy bar in Rome, feel an instant attraction, and decide to spend the night together. But finding parking in the Pigneto neighborhood is nearly impossible, and they’re forced to drive around for hours. He has a suitcase in the trunk and a secret to protect. She has an aggressive attitude and a hidden fragility she guards closely.', 'Two thirty-somethings meet in a trendy bar in Rome, feel an instant attraction, and decide to spend the night together. But finding parking in the Pigneto neighborhood is nearly impossible, and they’re forced to drive around for hours. He has a suitcase in the trunk and a secret to protect. She has an aggressive attitude and a hidden fragility she guards closely.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fm2lte9SOvpKlgHDxZYghWMfdfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459026'),
  ('475283650688336155', '2x1', 2019, 'Drama', 'Yasushi Koshizaka', 'Yasushi Koshizaka, Yuta Takahashi', 'Iori Kogawa, Kana Suzuna, Itsuka Hizuki, Atsushi Tsuda, Rina Usaki, Maki Yoshihara, Ryô Asagiri, Shinjiro Takahashi', null, 'Two brothers kidnap and abuse women. Once the new woman''s "training" is complete, the previous victim is released.', 'Two brothers kidnap and abuse women. Once the new woman''s "training" is complete, the previous victim is released.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1S5Ww977l6S2EtIzs5jnsmHDllb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642671'),
  ('112198615981200342', '3', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Aishwarya Rajinikanth, R. Velraj', 'Aishwarya Rajinikanth', 'Dhanush, Shruti Haasan, Sivakarthikeyan, Prabhu, Sunder Ramu, Rohini, Bhanupriya, Jeeva Ravi', null, 'Ram and Janani are high school sweethearts who eventually get married. However, Janani is mystified when Ram commits suicide all of a sudden and she tries to find out the truth behind his death.', 'Ram and Janani are high school sweethearts who eventually get married. However, Janani is mystified when Ram commits suicide all of a sudden and she tries to find out the truth behind his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3JB3worSWdCp64oGxpncfotoAG0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79660'),
  ('336591644881040443', '3 1/2 Hours', 2021, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'The Chau Ngo, Ed Herzog', 'Beate Fraunholz, Robert Krause', 'Peter Schneider, Jeff Wilbusch, Jördis Triebel, Susanne Bormann, Martin Feifel, Hannah Schiller, Alli Neumann, Katrin Filzen', null, 'August 13, 1961: The passengers on the interzonal train from Munich to East Berlin learn 3½ hours before crossing the border that the Wall is being built in Berlin. They have 3½ hours to make a life-changing decision: to get off the train or keep going.', 'August 13, 1961: The passengers on the interzonal train from Munich to East Berlin learn 3½ hours before crossing the border that the Wall is being built in Berlin. They have 3½ hours to make a life-changing decision: to get off the train or keep going.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7iLgsIJf0olGxxjBvh33hT4mR4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:847208'),
  ('511790564865233205', '3 ½ Minutes, 10 Bullets', 2015, 'Documentary, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Marc Silver, Marc Silver', 'Marc Silver', 'Lucia McBath, Ron Davis, Michael David Dunn, Russell Healey, John Guy, Cory Strolla, Rhonda Rouer, Chris Dunn', null, 'Black Friday, the day after Thanksgiving November 2012, four boys in a red SUV pull into a gas station after spending time at the mall buying sneakers and talking to girls. With music blaring, one boy exits the car and enters the store, a quick stop for a soda and a pack of gum. A man and a woman pull up next to the boys in the station, making a stop for a bottle of wine. The woman enters the store and an argument breaks out when the driver of the second car asks the boys to turn the music down. 3½ minutes and ten bullets later, one of the boys is dead. 3½ MINUTES dissects the aftermath of this fatal encounter.', 'Black Friday, the day after Thanksgiving November 2012, four boys in a red SUV pull into a gas station after spending time at the mall buying sneakers and talking to girls. With music blaring, one boy exits the car and enters the store, a quick stop for a soda and a pack of gum. A man and a woman pull up next to the boys in the station, making a stop for a bottle of wine. The woman enters the store and an argument breaks out when the driver of the second car asks the boys to turn the music down. 3½ minutes and ten bullets later, one of the boys is dead. 3½ MINUTES dissects the aftermath of this fatal encounter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fDYefxDiAy5SufELGMIlrKQEks6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:320349'),
  ('463502595702297511', '3 A.M.', 2001, 'Crime, Drama', 'Lee Davis, Enrique Chediak, Sarah Gyllenstierna', 'Lee Davis', 'Sarita Choudhury, Michelle Rodriguez, Arjun G. Awtramani, Sergej Trifunović, Danny Glover, Aasif Mandvi, Eric Chan, Isaach de Bankolé', 'NR', 'The feature film directing debut of Spike Lee protege Lee Davis takes the viewer into the world of taxi drivers. Developed in the Sundance Laboratory, this film offers dove-tailing stories centering on the lives of individual taxi drivers as they reflect on and experience romance, politics, sociology, and spirituality.', 'The feature film directing debut of Spike Lee protege Lee Davis takes the viewer into the world of taxi drivers. Developed in the Sundance Laboratory, this film offers dove-tailing stories centering on the lives of individual taxi drivers as they reflect on and experience romance, politics, sociology, and spirituality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QHNvh0pNpIgbHIofWHdtlHBdhQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77084'),
  ('69947874934642240', '3 A.M. 3D', 2012, 'Horror', 'Isara Nadee, Kirati Nakintanon, Patchanon Thammajira', 'Wuttichai Wongnoppadon, Bob Siriwong, Sukosin Akkrapat', 'Focus Jirakul, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Vivid Bavornkiratikajorn, Naiyapak Bhumipak, Thanawat Prasitsomporn, Nuttakan Boonjaiyai, Kamonrak Pholouyporn, Theerachai Wimolchaireuk', null, 'Three filmmakers direct three different horror stories and the only thing they have in common is all the supernatural events occur at three in the morning.', 'Three filmmakers direct three different horror stories and the only thing they have in common is all the supernatural events occur at three in the morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2CAtcC3HZjkBpLKOZVxR7HagTqz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178875'),
  ('898990882171179992', '3 A.M. Part 2', 2014, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Isara Nadee, Kirati Nakintanon, Putipong Saisikaew', 'Chanintorn Ulit', 'Suppanad Jittaleela, Ray MacDonald, Natouch Siripongthon, Sinjai Plengpanich, Apapattra Meesang, Latthgarmon Pinrojnkeerathi, Intach Leorakwong, Jirawat Wachirasarunpat', null, 'Three supernatural tales of horror after dark. A motorcycle leader comes back for vengeance. A ghostly haunting at an all-girls school. A shop for the dead to return.', 'Three supernatural tales of horror after dark. A motorcycle leader comes back for vengeance. A ghostly haunting at an all-girls school. A shop for the dead to return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1N9bdsdTolDEnVywm2tnz98b8fy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267458'),
  ('1105763380468896967', '3 Avengers', 1964, 'Action, Adventure', 'Gianfranco Parolini, Francesco Izzarelli, Ignazio Dolce', 'Lionello De Felice, Arnaldo Marrosu, Gianfranco Parolini', 'Sergio Ciani, Mimmo Palmara, Rosalba Neri, Carlo Tamberlani, Gianni Rizzo, Vassili Karis, Nello Pazzafini, Arnaldo Dell''Acqua', null, 'Ursus and his sword-wielding companions run head-on against a usurper of a throne.', 'Ursus and his sword-wielding companions run head-on against a usurper of a throne.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skGMVZ41KWezqKa29g8bqpXfLlV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296491'),
