  ('592906799755832081', '3 Bed, 2 Bath, 1 Ghost', 2023, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Fair, Tyler Walzak', null, 'Julie Gonzalo, Chris McNally, Madeleine Arthur, Sarah Almonte Peguero, Xavier Sotelo, Thomas Darya, Pauline Egan, William Vaughan', 'G', 'A ghost from the 1920s refuses to leave the home just listed by Anna, a new real estate agent. Worse, the spirit is convinced she cannot "pass over" until she gets Anna back together with her ex.', 'A ghost from the 1920s refuses to leave the home just listed by Anna, a new real estate agent. Worse, the spirit is convinced she cannot "pass over" until she gets Anna back together with her ex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hrOWLQxK7zXybn7RUqBRLYxzPqP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1160972'),
  ('672230997254268709', '3 Days in Malay', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Louis Mandylor', 'Brandon Slagle', 'Louis Mandylor, Donald Cerrone, Quinton ''Rampage'' Jackson, Peter Dobson, Ryan Francis, Randall J. Bacon, Kelly Lynn Reiter', null, 'Marines stationed at an airfield in Malay during WWII get wind of a coming raid by the Japanese. Unable to get reinforcements approved, they engage in a harrowing 3-day battle against enemy forces.', 'Marines stationed at an airfield in Malay during WWII get wind of a coming raid by the Japanese. Unable to get reinforcements approved, they engage in a harrowing 3-day battle against enemy forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hqnfqeCILvgKGWKOut5lVdxdeJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152624'),
  ('834505428925046438', '3 Days in Quiberon', 2018, 'Drama', 'Emily Atef, Thomas W. Kiennast', 'Emily Atef', 'Marie Bäumer, Birgit Minichmayr, Charly Hübner, Robert Gwisdek, Denis Lavant, Yann Grouhel, Christopher Buchholz, Vicky Krieps', null, '1981, Quiberon, a small village on the coast of Brittany, France. Hilde Fritsch arrives to visit her old friend who has retreated to a spa hotel to escape the daily pressures of her life. Her friend is world-famous star Romy Schneider, but together, they appear like two regular women who are just happy to be reunited. Yet it quickly becomes apparent that Hilde is supposed to offer the support the sensitive actress needs to be able to truly face her own demons.', '1981, Quiberon, a small village on the coast of Brittany, France. Hilde Fritsch arrives to visit her old friend who has retreated to a spa hotel to escape the daily pressures of her life. Her friend is world-famous star Romy Schneider, but together, they appear like two regular women who are just happy to be reunited. Yet it quickly becomes apparent that Hilde is supposed to offer the support the sensitive actress needs to be able to truly face her own demons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEwtaXRits97JOmZArRcAIJFdxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:495271'),
  ('766681360457519967', '3 Days Max', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Tarek Boudali, Mathias Honoré, Marie Rolindes', 'Pierre Dudan, Tarek Boudali', 'Tarek Boudali, Philippe Lacheau, Julien Arruti, Vanessa Guide, Chantal Ladesou, Marie-Anne Chazel, Reem Kherici, Rossy de Palma', null, 'Clumsy policeman Rayane has three days to rescue his kidnapped grandmother from a Mexican cartel.', 'Clumsy policeman Rayane has three days to rescue his kidnapped grandmother from a Mexican cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qIExh8vD4d5EzkXTGtnZHY1cw0m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:967582'),
  ('871085275767378435', '3 Days of a Blind Girl', 1993, 'Thriller', 'Chan Wing-Chiu, Adam Tam Chi-Wai', 'So Man-Sing', 'Veronica Yip Yuk-Hing, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Anthony Chan Yau, Jamie Luk Kim-Ming, Chan Yuet-Yue, Fruit Chan, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Chan Wing-Chiu', null, 'Mrs. Ng, who is left temporarily blind after an eye operation. Second day, her husband takes off to Macau for a business trip. Soon afterwards, Sam, a former patient of Dr. Ng, shows up to Mrs. Ng with sinister motives.', 'Mrs. Ng, who is left temporarily blind after an eye operation. Second day, her husband takes off to Macau for a business trip. Soon afterwards, Sam, a former patient of Dr. Ng, shows up to Mrs. Ng with sinister motives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQ7tIsprm1gvsDKH4qCvCX49YAC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192888'),
  ('642381095910272366', '3 Days to Kill', 2014, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'McG, Thierry Arbogast, Stephanie Laurent Delarue', 'Adi Hasak, Luc Besson', 'Kevin Costner, Amber Heard, Hailee Steinfeld, Connie Nielsen, Tómas Lemarquis, Richard Sammel, Marc Andréoni, Bruno Ricci', 'PG-13', 'A dangerous international spy is determined to give up his high stakes life to finally build a closer relationship with his estranged wife and daughter. But first, he must complete one last mission - even if it means juggling the two toughest assignments yet: hunting down the world''s most ruthless terrorist and looking after his teenage daughter for the first time in ten years, while his wife is out of town.', 'A dangerous international spy is determined to give up his high stakes life to finally build a closer relationship with his estranged wife and daughter. But first, he must complete one last mission - even if it means juggling the two toughest assignments yet: hunting down the world''s most ruthless terrorist and looking after his teenage daughter for the first time in ten years, while his wife is out of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/paDgMlfQIrK6PCG5g7UYv9YOdmK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192102'),
  ('320769928920417715', '3 Deewarein', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Nagesh Kukunoor, Ajayan Vincent', 'Nagesh Kukunoor', 'Naseeruddin Shah, Jackie Shroff, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Nagesh Kukunoor, Gulshan Grover, Sujata Mehta, Aditya Lakhia, Shri Vallabh Vyas', null, 'Three men are on death row. Jaggu (Jackie Shroff), a lawyer and a poet, is serving a sentence for murdering his wife because she was cheating on him with another man. Nagya (Nagesh Kukunoor), a man angry with the whole world, is arrested for murdering his wife too, but he claims that it was an accident where she falls off the sidewalk while they were talking. Ishaan (Naseeruddin Shah), a happy-go-lucky man, is also arrested for murder that he commits while in the act of robbery. The prison''s custodian is Mohan (Gulshan Grover), who attempts several methods to reform the prison''s inmates. A documentary filmmaker, Chandrika (Juhi Chawla) comes to the jail to set a film about these three men. In the process, she finds redemption to her troubled marriage.', 'Three men are on death row. Jaggu (Jackie Shroff), a lawyer and a poet, is serving a sentence for murdering his wife because she was cheating on him with another man. Nagya (Nagesh Kukunoor), a man angry with the whole world, is arrested for murdering his wife too, but he claims that it was an accident where she falls off the sidewalk while they were talking. Ishaan (Naseeruddin Shah), a happy-go-lucky man, is also arrested for murder that he commits while in the act of robbery. The prison''s custodian is Mohan (Gulshan Grover), who attempts several methods to reform the prison''s inmates. A documentary filmmaker, Chandrika (Juhi Chawla) comes to the jail to set a film about these three men. In the process, she finds redemption to her troubled marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dvUYYXBiXsP3KKmSDap2BrknEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73237'),
  ('326108450671210515', '3 Dumb Clucks', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Clyde Bruckman', 'Curly Howard, Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Charles Dorety, Al Thompson, Lucille Lund, Lynton Brent, Lew Davis', 'NR', 'The stooges escape from jail when they learn their father, who has just become rich, is planning to leave their mother and marry a young girl. Curly is mistaken for the stooges father (he plays both parts) and marries the girl instead. When they learn that she is working with gangsters who plan to kill their father for his money, they escape and take their father with them.', 'The stooges escape from jail when they learn their father, who has just become rich, is planning to leave their mother and marry a young girl. Curly is mistaken for the stooges father (he plays both parts) and marries the girl instead. When they learn that she is working with gangsters who plan to kill their father for his money, they escape and take their father with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kKeXrqXmvQ57EgNXgWg6R06j9an.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115906'),
  ('504395323908580855', '3 Faces', 2018, 'Drama', 'Jafar Panahi, Amin Jafari', 'Jafar Panahi, Nader Saeivar', 'Behnaz Jafari, Jafar Panahi, Marziyeh Rezaei, Maedeh Erteghaei, Narges Del Aram, Fatemeh Ismaeilmejad, Yadollah Dadashnejad, Ahmad Naderi', null, 'Filmmaker Jafar Panahi and actor Behnaz Jafari travel to a tiny village after receiving a plea for help from a girl whose family has forbidden her from studying acting. Amusing encounters abound, but they soon discover that the local hospitality is rivaled by the desire to protect old traditions.', 'Filmmaker Jafar Panahi and actor Behnaz Jafari travel to a tiny village after receiving a plea for help from a girl whose family has forbidden her from studying acting. Amusing encounters abound, but they soon discover that the local hospitality is rivaled by the desire to protect old traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clpmeXLRg65zGGP1zoyYOLIakQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517731'),
  ('953939576679815578', '3 Filles en cavale', 2011, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Didier Albert, Jean-Pierre Hervé', 'Sophie Deschamps, Isabelle de Botton', 'Mimie Mathy, Michèle Bernier, Isabelle de Botton, Yves Afonso, Patrice Juiff, Manuel Gélin, Pierre Deny', null, 'A lawyer, her assistant, and a dentist witness the execution of a man in the middle of Paris and are forced to flee to escape the criminals. They find themselves in the middle of nowhere in the countryside... For their safety, these three city dwellers will have to live together and pretend to be farmers... Will they succeed, or will they be exposed?', 'A lawyer, her assistant, and a dentist witness the execution of a man in the middle of Paris and are forced to flee to escape the criminals. They find themselves in the middle of nowhere in the countryside... For their safety, these three city dwellers will have to live together and pretend to be farmers... Will they succeed, or will they be exposed?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ffCIvwrW03cgM1k1Jve61TGegbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:260871'),
  ('319259649363986208', '3 Friends', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Michel Boujenah, Philippe Pavans de Ceccatty', 'Michel Boujenah, Pascal Elbé', 'Mathilde Seigner, Pascal Elbé, Kad Merad, Yves Rénier, Daniel Duval, Annelise Hesme, Constance Dollé, Carole Richert', null, 'Three childhood friends support each other through life''s ups and downs in this comedy/drama. Each goes through a difficult time in their life, and is "helped" by the others - always well-intentioned, but not always with the intended results! Baptiste''s (Kad Merad) wife leaves him and he becomes depressed then obsessive-compulsive. César (Pascal Elbé) has a secret affair with his boss''s daughter - he''s nervous about seeing her in case dad finds out, but if he stops seeing her she threatens to tell all anyway - either way his job is on the line. Claire (Mathilde Seigner), adopted as a baby, struggles to decide whether to try and find her birth-mother.The links between the three play a crucial part in each of their lives - a deep and supportive bond, but one which risks preventing them ever forming a relationship with someone else.', 'Three childhood friends support each other through life''s ups and downs in this comedy/drama. Each goes through a difficult time in their life, and is "helped" by the others - always well-intentioned, but not always with the intended results! Baptiste''s (Kad Merad) wife leaves him and he becomes depressed then obsessive-compulsive. César (Pascal Elbé) has a secret affair with his boss''s daughter - he''s nervous about seeing her in case dad finds out, but if he stops seeing her she threatens to tell all anyway - either way his job is on the line. Claire (Mathilde Seigner), adopted as a baby, struggles to decide whether to try and find her birth-mother.The links between the three play a crucial part in each of their lives - a deep and supportive bond, but one which risks preventing them ever forming a relationship with someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdJmX20TDJMT2pKletXlJOqoo4B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24278'),
  ('179289681708279221', '3 from Hell', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Zombie, Scott H. Campbell, David Daniel', 'Rob Zombie', 'Sheri Moon Zombie, Bill Moseley, Richard Brake, Emilio Rivera, Sid Haig, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Dee Wallace, Richard Edson', 'R', 'After barely surviving a furious shootout with the police, Baby Firefly, Otis Driftwood and Captain Spaulding are behind bars. But pure evil cannot be contained. Teaming up with Otis’ half-brother Winslow, the demented Firefly clan escape to unleash a whole new wave of murder, madness and mayhem.', 'After barely surviving a furious shootout with the police, Baby Firefly, Otis Driftwood and Captain Spaulding are behind bars. But pure evil cannot be contained. Teaming up with Otis’ half-brother Winslow, the demented Firefly clan escape to unleash a whole new wave of murder, madness and mayhem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iaURDnsqwTpFdg7RuizUp0nI2I4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489064'),
  ('419895603934460711', '3 Generations', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gaby Dellal, David Johnson', 'Nikole Beckwith, Gaby Dellal', 'Elle Fanning, Susan Sarandon, Naomi Watts, Tate Donovan, Maria Dizzia, Sam Trammell, Linda Emond, Jordan Carlos', null, 'A teenager transitions from female to male, and his family must come to terms with that fact.', 'A teenager transitions from female to male, and his family must come to terms with that fact.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4kR79ndKP6gZFHXe70sY7TUOZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300667'),
  ('756995190730418223', '3 Girls', 2007, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Murad Ibragimbekov', 'Pavel Finn, Murad Ibragimbekov', 'Joachim Paul Assböck, Alexandra Finder, Sergey Frolov, Murad Ibragimbekov, Arzu Kadirbekova, Ravshana Kurkova, Tarana Ojagverdiyeva, Mikhail Politseymako', null, 'The plot of the film is based on three love stories. The events take place in Moscow, Baku and Africa, but most of them are related to the Azerbaijani capital. The film, shot in the comedy genre, takes place during the Great Patriotic War, when the Germans left the occupied territories.', 'The plot of the film is based on three love stories. The events take place in Moscow, Baku and Africa, but most of them are related to the Azerbaijani capital. The film, shot in the comedy genre, takes place during the Great Patriotic War, when the Germans left the occupied territories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/26dV7cozcWDEOotoOLJGabPRi69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796569'),
  ('832844732014550820', '3 Godfathers', 1948, 'Western', 'John Ford, Winton C. Hoch, Edward O''Fearna', 'Robert Nathan', 'John Wayne, Pedro Armendáriz, Harry Carey, Jr., Ward Bond, Mae Marsh, Mildred Natwick, Jane Darwell, Guy Kibbee', 'NR', 'Three outlaws on the run discover a dying woman and her baby. They swear to bring the infant to safety across the desert, even at the risk of their own lives.', 'Three outlaws on the run discover a dying woman and her baby. They swear to bring the infant to safety across the desert, even at the risk of their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsVrYIpK2Rcgsr5QrfjBQWee5JE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29244'),
  ('458362657555644567', '3 Guys, 1 Girl, 2 Weddings', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Yves Cape, Stéphane Clavier', 'Jean-Luc Goossens', 'Olivier Sitruk, Arnaud Giovaninetti, Julie Gayet, Anne Azoulay, Fabio Zenoni, Jean-Claude Dreyfus, Marie Lenoir, Charlie Dupont', null, 'Romance meets farce against the backdrop of a quiet campaign to legalize gay marriage. Laurent loves his roommate Dan, who''s straight and a playboy. Laurent can''t bring himself to tell Dan, but is content to share a flat and to party with him. Then Camille comes along, Dan falls hard, and Laurent is beside himself: he tries to sabotage the relationship, but each effort backfires. After Dan moves in with Camille, Laurent enlists the help of Sam, his new lesbian flatmate, and Nick, a long-time gay friend. As the lovers head toward marriage, Laurent becomes more desperate. His efforts may be having an effect, if not on Dan, then on Camille. Which love will triumph?', 'Romance meets farce against the backdrop of a quiet campaign to legalize gay marriage. Laurent loves his roommate Dan, who''s straight and a playboy. Laurent can''t bring himself to tell Dan, but is content to share a flat and to party with him. Then Camille comes along, Dan falls hard, and Laurent is beside himself: he tries to sabotage the relationship, but each effort backfires. After Dan moves in with Camille, Laurent enlists the help of Sam, his new lesbian flatmate, and Nick, a long-time gay friend. As the lovers head toward marriage, Laurent becomes more desperate. His efforts may be having an effect, if not on Dan, then on Camille. Which love will triumph?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t4uwBTeT371q2pjYqjEiN2kPPkC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37245'),
  ('26523229647705453', '3 Hearts', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Hirsch', 'Benoît Jacquot, Julien Boivent', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Charlotte Gainsbourg, Chiara Mastroianni, Catherine Deneuve, André Marcon, Patrick Mille, Cédric Vieira, Thomas Doret', null, 'A twist of fate leaves a hapless accountant romantically torn between two sisters.', 'A twist of fate leaves a hapless accountant romantically torn between two sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0tgGgZZrotBcWTEPGYADrPbJM7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283701'),
  ('191584882588616569', '3 Idiotas', 2017, 'Family, Comedy', 'Javier Morón, Carlos Bolado', 'Martha Higareda, Mariana Alatriste, Bernardo Rugama', 'Martha Higareda, Alfonso Dosal, Christian Vazquez, Germán Valdez, Vadhir Derbez, Sebastián Zurita, Paulina Dávila, Enrique Singer', null, 'A group of friends embark on an adventure to find a classmate from university who disappeared without a trace on graduation day.', 'A group of friends embark on an adventure to find a classmate from university who disappeared without a trace on graduation day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZB9NvNLcxdmoiAh58ZfG8vdXjf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346034'),
  ('493502363483019362', '3 Idiots', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rajkumar Hirani, C.K. Muraleedharan, Karan Narvekar', 'Rajkumar Hirani, Vidhu Vinod Chopra, Abhijat Joshi', 'Aamir Khan, R. Madhavan, Sharman Joshi, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Boman Irani, Omi Vaidya, Mona Singh, Rahul Kumar', 'PG-13', 'Rascal. Joker. Dreamer. Genius... You''ve never met a college student quite like "Rancho." From the moment he arrives at India''s most prestigious university, Rancho''s outlandish schemes turn the campus upside down—along with the lives of his two newfound best friends. Together, they make life miserable for "Virus," the school’s uptight and heartless dean. But when Rancho catches the eye of the dean''s daughter, Virus sets his sights on flunking out the "3 idiots" once and for all.', 'Rascal. Joker. Dreamer. Genius... You''ve never met a college student quite like "Rancho." From the moment he arrives at India''s most prestigious university, Rancho''s outlandish schemes turn the campus upside down—along with the lives of his two newfound best friends. Together, they make life miserable for "Virus," the school’s uptight and heartless dean. But when Rancho catches the eye of the dean''s daughter, Virus sets his sights on flunking out the "3 idiots" once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66A9MqXOyVFCssoloscw79z8Tew.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20453'),
  ('261361512594209917', '3 Men and a Baby', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Leonard Nimoy, Adam Greenberg, Rob Cowan', 'James Orr, Jim Cruickshank', 'Tom Selleck, Steve Guttenberg, Ted Danson, Margaret Colin, Celeste Holm, Nancy Travis, Philip Bosco, Paul Guilfoyle', 'PG', 'Three bachelors find themselves forced to take care of a baby left by one of the guy''s girlfriends.', 'Three bachelors find themselves forced to take care of a baby left by one of the guy''s girlfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYetboAljWR2N5A7MU3i63DvUtd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12154'),
  ('804974140078803594', '3 Men and a Little Lady', 1990, 'Family, Comedy', 'Emile Ardolino, Adam Greenberg, Adam Dale', 'Coline Serreau', 'Tom Selleck, Steve Guttenberg, Ted Danson, Nancy Travis, Robin Weisman, Christopher Cazenove, Sheila Hancock, Fiona Shaw', 'PG', 'Sylvia''s work increasingly takes her away from the three men who help bring up Mary, her daughter. When she decides to move to England and take Mary with her, the three men are heartbroken at losing the two most important women in their lives.', 'Sylvia''s work increasingly takes her away from the three men who help bring up Mary, her daughter. When she decides to move to England and take Mary with her, the three men are heartbroken at losing the two most important women in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4VWWEnhX0zddRKwZWGtIdDcV5U7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11630'),
  ('305301531887378390', '3 Men in White', 1944, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Willis Goldbeck, Ray June', 'Martin Berkeley', 'Lionel Barrymore, Van Johnson, Marilyn Maxwell, Keye Luke, Ava Gardner, Alma Kruger, Rags Ragland, Nell Craig', 'NR', 'Gillespie has to finally choose his official assistant, or Red and Lee are going to kill themselves in competition. So, it''s another diagnosis competition. Lee''s assignment is a small girl who falls ill whenever she eats candy. Red has to cure a girl''s mother of a debilitating case of arthritis. But when Red needs Lee''s help, will either one live with Gillespie''s choice?', 'Gillespie has to finally choose his official assistant, or Red and Lee are going to kill themselves in competition. So, it''s another diagnosis competition. Lee''s assignment is a small girl who falls ill whenever she eats candy. Red has to cure a girl''s mother of a debilitating case of arthritis. But when Red needs Lee''s help, will either one live with Gillespie''s choice?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPCwOiOfeK31fiT0J6NpyaXwKMA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200454'),
  ('1050234459355530667', '3 Ninjas', 1992, 'Family, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jon Turteltaub', 'Edward Emanuel', 'Victor Wong, Michael Treanor, Max Elliott Slade, Chad Power, Rand Kingsley, Alan McRae, Margarita Franco, Kate Sargeant', 'PG', 'Each year, three brothers Samuel, Jeffrey and Michael Douglas visits their Japanese grandfather, Mori Shintaro whom the boys affectionately refer to as Grandpa, for the summer. Mori is a highly skilled in the fields of Martial arts and Ninjutsu, and for years he has trained the boys in his techniques. After an organized crime ring proves to be too much for the FBI, it''s time for the 3 brother NINJAS! To use their martial arts skills, they team up to battle the crime ring and outwit some very persistent kidnappers!', 'Each year, three brothers Samuel, Jeffrey and Michael Douglas visits their Japanese grandfather, Mori Shintaro whom the boys affectionately refer to as Grandpa, for the summer. Mori is a highly skilled in the fields of Martial arts and Ninjutsu, and for years he has trained the boys in his techniques. After an organized crime ring proves to be too much for the FBI, it''s time for the 3 brother NINJAS! To use their martial arts skills, they team up to battle the crime ring and outwit some very persistent kidnappers!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJjhmLG9eJWVZrKimZ6kCrQ0urF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16314'),
  ('520794285261066991', '3 Ninjas Kick Back', 1994, 'Family, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Charles T. Kanganis, Christopher Faloona', 'Shin Sang-ok', 'Victor Wong, Max Elliott Slade, Sean Fox, J. Evan Bonifant, Caroline Junko King, Dustin Nguyễn, Alan McRae, Margarita Franco', 'PG', 'During a championship baseball match, the three brothers hear that their grandfather in Japan is in trouble, and head out to help him, conceding the match. When they arrive in Japan, they must use all their powers to defend him against his ancient enemy, who has returned to exact revenge.', 'During a championship baseball match, the three brothers hear that their grandfather in Japan is in trouble, and head out to help him, conceding the match. When they arrive in Japan, they must use all their powers to defend him against his ancient enemy, who has returned to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXuh3c0DyvqSGo0DBatoemBwEtz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18885'),
  ('733085276225472968', '3 Ninjas Knuckle Up', 1995, 'Family, Adventure, Action, Comedy', 'Shin Sang-ok, Eric Small, Thomas B. Park', 'Alex S. Kim', 'Victor Wong, Charles Napier, Michael Treanor, Max Elliott Slade, Chad Power, Crystle Lightning, Patrick Kilpatrick, Don Shanks', 'PG-13', 'Rocky, Colt and TumTum must battle an evil wealthy toxic waste dumper in order to save a local Indian tribe and their friend Joe. The 3 Ninjas must help find Joe''s father and find a secret disk that contains evidence that could stop the toxic landfill that is destroying the Indian community. However the town is owned by the rich man and he controls the police and even the mayor. They must fight a motorcycle gang and renegade cowboys in this non-stop ninja adventure.', 'Rocky, Colt and TumTum must battle an evil wealthy toxic waste dumper in order to save a local Indian tribe and their friend Joe. The 3 Ninjas must help find Joe''s father and find a secret disk that contains evidence that could stop the toxic landfill that is destroying the Indian community. However the town is owned by the rich man and he controls the police and even the mayor. They must fight a motorcycle gang and renegade cowboys in this non-stop ninja adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A2664BFz1Xmxyprh9DoxXIEldhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40508'),
  ('983878147117891885', '3 Ninjas: High Noon at Mega Mountain', 1998, 'Family, Action, Comedy', 'Sean McNamara, Blake T. Evans', 'Jeff Phillips, Sean McNamara', 'Victor Wong, Mathew Botuchis, Hulk Hogan, Loni Anderson, Jim Varney, Michael O''Laskey II, James Paul Roeske II, Alan McRae', 'PG', 'Three young boys, Rocky, Colt and Tum Tum together with their neighbor girl, computer whiz Amanda are visiting Mega Mountain amusement park when it is invaded by an army of ninjas led by evil Medusa, who wants to take over the park and hold the owners for ransom. Kids and retired TV star Dave Dragon, who made his farewell appearance at the park at the time the ninjas appeared, have to break Medusa''s vicious plans.', 'Three young boys, Rocky, Colt and Tum Tum together with their neighbor girl, computer whiz Amanda are visiting Mega Mountain amusement park when it is invaded by an army of ninjas led by evil Medusa, who wants to take over the park and hold the owners for ransom. Kids and retired TV star Dave Dragon, who made his farewell appearance at the park at the time the ninjas appeared, have to break Medusa''s vicious plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jKefCfhcXLd1qVnmc1zBhSgPjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32302'),
  ('266597789545871748', '3 Nuts in Search of a Bolt', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Tommy Noonan', 'Tommy Noonan, Ian McGlashan', 'Mamie Van Doren, Tommy Noonan, Ziva Rodann, John Cronin, Howard Koch, T.C. Jones, Charles Irving, Alvy Moore', 'R', 'An out-of-work method actor is hired by a male model, an ecdysiast, and a car salesman who live together to save money. They want the actor to listen to their problems and go see a psychiatrist, so they can get counseling for cheap. The psychiatrist is intrigued by the split personalities indicated by the three separate sets of problems presented by the actor, and soon producers are climbing out of the woodwork trying to buy the rights to the film, while the actor is having trouble keeping his act together.', 'An out-of-work method actor is hired by a male model, an ecdysiast, and a car salesman who live together to save money. They want the actor to listen to their problems and go see a psychiatrist, so they can get counseling for cheap. The psychiatrist is intrigued by the split personalities indicated by the three separate sets of problems presented by the actor, and soon producers are climbing out of the woodwork trying to buy the rights to the film, while the actor is having trouble keeping his act together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGEJ5F6Xpl09U6x05HKQX8QAXaB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161104'),
  ('75144029916179454', '3 Ring Circus', 1954, 'Comedy', 'Joseph Pevney, Loyal Griggs, Charles C. Coleman', 'Don McGuire', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Joanne Dru, Zsa Zsa Gabor, Wallace Ford, Elsa Lanchester, Sig Ruman, Nick Cravat', 'NR', 'Jerry and Pete are two friends with no money and are looking for a job. They finally find employment working in a circus, but Jerry has different dreams. He wants to become a clown.', 'Jerry and Pete are two friends with no money and are looking for a job. They finally find employment working in a circus, but Jerry has different dreams. He wants to become a clown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mFrKtwikSILuDQufhimJctne6qI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62396'),
  ('517651211025877530', '3 Strikes', 2000, 'Action, Comedy, Romance', 'DJ Pooh', 'DJ Pooh', 'Brian Hooks, N''Bushe Wright, Faizon Love, E-40, Starletta DuPois, George Wallace, David Alan Grier, Dean Norris', 'R', 'Brian Hooks plays a character who is just released from jail. And the state adopts a "3 strikes" rule for felons that involves serious penalties. Hooks has 2 strikes, and wants to change his life for the better. When a friend picks him up, they are pulled over, and his friend shoots at police officers, and Hooks escapes. Now Hooks, a wanted man, must clear his name of having nothing to do with the shooting.', 'Brian Hooks plays a character who is just released from jail. And the state adopts a "3 strikes" rule for felons that involves serious penalties. Hooks has 2 strikes, and wants to change his life for the better. When a friend picks him up, they are pulled over, and his friend shoots at police officers, and Hooks escapes. Now Hooks, a wanted man, must clear his name of having nothing to do with the shooting.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ca7xVIgh7UYsFOCBLP8ERmBktC5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47816'),
  ('458892014567259236', '3 Türken und ein Baby', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Armin Franzen, Joanna Bielinski, Sinan Akkuş', 'Sinan Akkuş', 'Kostja Ullmann, Alexander Beyer, Frederick Lau, Anna Böger, Julia Thurnau, Christoph Maria Herbst, Axel Stein, Jytte-Merle Böhrnsen', null, 'The Yildiz brothers - Celal, Sami and Mesut - still live under one roof - despite their differences. The family bridal shop is doing really badly and they each yearn for a different life: Heartthrob Celal pines for his ex-girlfriend Anna and risks every last cent of their family inheritance for his dream of a mobile phone shop. Sami is searching for true love but ruins every blind date with his anger mis-management. And Mesut, the youngest of the three, tries to combine a cool music career with his strict adherence to the Koran. So when a sweet little baby comes careering into their lives, nothing is as it was before. The three young Turkish bachelors are given a crash course in responsibility.', 'The Yildiz brothers - Celal, Sami and Mesut - still live under one roof - despite their differences. The family bridal shop is doing really badly and they each yearn for a different life: Heartthrob Celal pines for his ex-girlfriend Anna and risks every last cent of their family inheritance for his dream of a mobile phone shop. Sami is searching for true love but ruins every blind date with his anger mis-management. And Mesut, the youngest of the three, tries to combine a cool music career with his strict adherence to the Koran. So when a sweet little baby comes careering into their lives, nothing is as it was before. The three young Turkish bachelors are given a crash course in responsibility.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/en9lCv7CO5LF8dAdx0MI5W86jAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308174'),
  ('514331357705567747', '3 Women', 1977, 'Drama', 'Robert Altman, Charles Rosher Jr., Carol Himes', 'Robert Altman, Patricia Resnick', 'Shelley Duvall, Sissy Spacek, Janice Rule, Robert Fortier, Ruth Nelson, John Cromwell, Sierra Pecheur, Craig Richard Nelson', 'PG', 'Two co-workers, one a vain woman and the other an awkward teenager, share an increasingly bizarre relationship after becoming roommates.', 'Two co-workers, one a vain woman and the other an awkward teenager, share an increasingly bizarre relationship after becoming roommates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uL5Yg8MEgHGXymTaJBYXn9g0xsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41662'),
  ('470147292173276372', '3-D Sex and Zen: Extreme Ecstasy', 2011, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christopher Sun, Jimmy Wong, Kwok Man-Ki', 'Stephen Shiu Jr., Mark Woo Yiu-Fai, Stephen Shiu Yeuk-Yuen', 'Hiro Hayama, Leni Lan, Yukiko Suo, Saori Hara, Tony Ho, Vienna Lyn, Vonnie Lui, Kirt Kishita', 'R', 'A young scholar named Yangsheng who gets married to the beautiful daughter of a local merchant. When their sex life proves unsatisfactory, Yangsheng leaves home and journeys to the Pavilion of Ultimate Bliss.', 'A young scholar named Yangsheng who gets married to the beautiful daughter of a local merchant. When their sex life proves unsatisfactory, Yangsheng leaves home and journeys to the Pavilion of Ultimate Bliss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yohLYaQEoiw8Oaa4RJCRyBfCrZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67308'),
  ('327659351774312069', '3-Headed Shark Attack', 2015, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Christopher Ray, Alexander Yellen', 'Jacob Cooney, Bill Hanstock', 'Jena Sims, Jaason Simmons, Rob Szatkowski, Danny Trejo, Dawn Hamil, Brad Mills, Brianna Ferris, Scott Thomas Reynolds', null, 'The world’s greatest killing machine is three times as deadly, when a mutated shark threatens a cruise ship. As the shark eats its way from one end of the ship to the next, the passengers fight the deadly predator using anything they can find.', 'The world’s greatest killing machine is three times as deadly, when a mutated shark threatens a cruise ship. As the shark eats its way from one end of the ship to the next, the passengers fight the deadly predator using anything they can find.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qiwQDfhNyvtTVEO7lZVTUhkkgpp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342927'),
  ('669513866749962688', '3, 2, 1... Frankie Go Boom', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Jordan Roberts, Mattias Troelstrup', 'Jordan Roberts', 'Charlie Hunnam, Chris O''Dowd, Nora Dunn, Sam Anderson, Lizzy Caplan, Ron Perlman, Kate Luyben, Chris Noth', 'NR', 'Frank Bartlett has been tortured, embarrassed, and humiliated by his brother Bruce — usually on film — his entire life. Now that Bruce is finally off drugs and has turned his life around, things should be different. They are not.', 'Frank Bartlett has been tortured, embarrassed, and humiliated by his brother Bruce — usually on film — his entire life. Now that Bruce is finally off drugs and has turned his life around, things should be different. They are not.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5JOlPMiErxebf0nBDW8dK64zF3n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94104'),
  ('309065968123108113', '3:10 to Yuma', 1957, 'Western, Drama, Thriller', 'Delmer Daves, Charles Lawton Jr., Sam Nelson', 'Halsted Welles', 'Glenn Ford, Van Heflin, Felicia Farr, Leora Dana, Henry Jones, Richard Jaeckel, Robert Emhardt, Sheridan Comerate', 'NR', 'Dan Evans, a small time farmer, is hired to escort Ben Wade, a dangerous outlaw, to Yuma. As Evans and Wade wait for the 3:10 train to Yuma, Wade''s gang is racing to free him.', 'Dan Evans, a small time farmer, is hired to escort Ben Wade, a dangerous outlaw, to Yuma. As Evans and Wade wait for the 3:10 train to Yuma, Wade''s gang is racing to free him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/emYeJVZrpl2WfndJlhbls1e7lzQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14168'),
  ('804719672033593564', '3:10 to Yuma', 2007, 'Western', 'James Mangold, Phedon Papamichael, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Michael Brandt, Derek Haas, Halsted Welles', 'Russell Crowe, Christian Bale, Peter Fonda, Gretchen Mol, Ben Foster, Dallas Roberts, Alan Tudyk, Vinessa Shaw', 'R', 'In Arizona in the late 1800s, infamous outlaw Ben Wade and his vicious gang of thieves and murderers have plagued the Southern Railroad. When Wade is captured, Civil War veteran Dan Evans, struggling to survive on his drought-plagued ranch, volunteers to deliver him alive to the "3:10 to Yuma", a train that will take the killer to trial.', 'In Arizona in the late 1800s, infamous outlaw Ben Wade and his vicious gang of thieves and murderers have plagued the Southern Railroad. When Wade is captured, Civil War veteran Dan Evans, struggling to survive on his drought-plagued ranch, volunteers to deliver him alive to the "3:10 to Yuma", a train that will take the killer to trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/voMB69AsLnPNmtfbrBl0lbeFKDH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5176'),
  ('382915264983042046', '3:15 the Moment of Truth', 1986, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Larry Gross', 'Sam Bernard, Michael Jacobs', 'Adam Baldwin, Jesse Aragon, René Auberjonois, Wendy Barry, Bradford Bancroft, Joseph Brutsman, John Scott Clough, Wayne Crawford', 'R', 'Violent crime is routine. Organized drug trade runs rampant in the face of powerless authority. And a vicious street gang holds dominion with a savage reign of terror. Welcome to Lincoln High! Here the cobras rule the school and everyone in it. Everyone except for Jeff Hanna.', 'Violent crime is routine. Organized drug trade runs rampant in the face of powerless authority. And a vicious street gang holds dominion with a savage reign of terror. Welcome to Lincoln High! Here the cobras rule the school and everyone in it. Everyone except for Jeff Hanna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c5gC8MdNp1WsjUjwhdLjinM6iZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26447'),
  ('262430390456091845', '3/19', 2021, 'Drama', 'Silvio Soldini, Matteo Cocco, Cinzia Castania', 'Silvio Soldini, Davide Lantieri, Doriana Leondeff', 'Kasia Smutniak, Francesco Colella, Caterina Forza, Paolo Mazzarelli, Martina De Santis, Antonio Zavatteri, Anna Ferzetti, Arianna Scommegna', null, 'Camilla is a successful attorney in her forties who accidentally causes the death of an undocumented migrant. At first, she is only interested in exonerating herself, but soon a feeling of responsibility starts nagging her: the dead body of a young man is lying in the morgue because their destinies fatally crossed. Camilla is used to shielding herself from pain, and she is incapable of really caring, even for her own daughter. In the midst of discovering the victim’s identity, she meets Bruno, the head of the morgue, who seems to be the only one who can truly understand her. The investigation she pursues will take her far from her surroundings until she will be forced to question herself, her unresolved past, and the life she really wants to live.', 'Camilla is a successful attorney in her forties who accidentally causes the death of an undocumented migrant. At first, she is only interested in exonerating herself, but soon a feeling of responsibility starts nagging her: the dead body of a young man is lying in the morgue because their destinies fatally crossed. Camilla is used to shielding herself from pain, and she is incapable of really caring, even for her own daughter. In the midst of discovering the victim’s identity, she meets Bruno, the head of the morgue, who seems to be the only one who can truly understand her. The investigation she pursues will take her far from her surroundings until she will be forced to question herself, her unresolved past, and the life she really wants to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WLw8jhwcPlDsJ7EC4ye6G9lfWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:828264'),
  ('823790662822902528', '3/60: Trees in Autumn', 1960, null, 'Kurt Kren', null, null, null, 'The first embodiment of (a) concept of structural activity in cinema comes in Kren''s Bäume im Herbst, where the camera as a subjective observer is constrained within a systematic or structural procedure, incidentally the precursors of the most structuralist aspect of Michael Snow''s later work. In this film, perception of material relationships in the world is seen to be no more than a product of the structural activity in the work. Art forms experience.', 'The first embodiment of (a) concept of structural activity in cinema comes in Kren''s Bäume im Herbst, where the camera as a subjective observer is constrained within a systematic or structural procedure, incidentally the precursors of the most structuralist aspect of Michael Snow''s later work. In this film, perception of material relationships in the world is seen to be no more than a product of the structural activity in the work. Art forms experience.', null, 'tmdb:movie:263197'),
  ('1101036100983111389', '3%', 2011, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Dani Libardi, Daina Giannecchini, Jotagá Crema', 'Pedro Aguilera, Ivan Nakamura, Josefina Trotta', 'Julia Ianina, Geraldo Rodrigues, Leandro D''Errico, Thiago Franco Balieiro, Denise Palmieri, Georgette Fadel, Rita Batata', null, 'A post-apocalyptic thriller set in near-future Brazil, where a select few are allowed to join a privileged society after undergoing an intense and competitive process.', 'A post-apocalyptic thriller set in near-future Brazil, where a select few are allowed to join a privileged society after undergoing an intense and competitive process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDdPCIwq4GPhQw5G9DFg3zjQZgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:350724'),
  ('450123377677370580', '30 anni (di meno)', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Mauro Graiani, Andrea Arnone', 'Mauro Graiani', 'Massimo Ghini, Nino Frassica, Antonio Catania, Claudio Colica, Claudio Gregori, Claudio Casisa, Leonardo Ghini, Giulia Elettra Gorietti', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aXg4i48dmutn4m775jxNSE4F5L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1296824'),
  ('1095246844605283356', '30 Days Max', 2020, 'Comedy, Action', 'Vincent Richard-Marquis, Tarek Boudali', 'Grégory Boutboul, Pierre Dudan, Tarek Boudali', 'Tarek Boudali, Philippe Lacheau, Julien Arruti, Vanessa Guide, José Garcia, Marie-Anne Chazel, Reem Kherici, Nicolas Marié', null, 'Rayane is a scared and clumsy young cop who is constantly mocked by other cops. The day his doctor wrongly tells him that he has only thirty days to live, he understands that this is his last chance to become a hero within his police station and impress his colleague Stéphanie. The eternal fearful man then turns into a real hothead who will take all the risks to catch a big drug lord...', 'Rayane is a scared and clumsy young cop who is constantly mocked by other cops. The day his doctor wrongly tells him that he has only thirty days to live, he understands that this is his last chance to become a hero within his police station and impress his colleague Stéphanie. The eternal fearful man then turns into a real hothead who will take all the risks to catch a big drug lord...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/okepE7ytt7bWyFdD77Et273sAtt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613377'),
  ('152675704675733184', '30 Days of Night', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jo Willems, David Slade, Paul Grinder', 'Stuart Beattie, Brian Nelson, Steve Niles', 'Josh Hartnett, Melissa George, Danny Huston, Ben Foster, Mark Boone Junior, Mark Rendall, Amber Sainsbury, Manu Bennett', 'R', 'This is the story of an isolated Alaskan town that is plunged into darkness for a month each year when the sun sinks below the horizon. As the last rays of light fade, the town is attacked by a bloodthirsty gang of vampires bent on an uninterrupted orgy of destruction. Only the small town''s husband-and-wife Sheriff team stand between the survivors and certain destruction.', 'This is the story of an isolated Alaskan town that is plunged into darkness for a month each year when the sun sinks below the horizon. As the last rays of light fade, the town is attacked by a bloodthirsty gang of vampires bent on an uninterrupted orgy of destruction. Only the small town''s husband-and-wife Sheriff team stand between the survivors and certain destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LwSrvFA0gz1KAlcrGcinoQPene.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4513'),
  ('1109478302782260796', '30 Days of Night: Dark Days', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ben Ketai, Eric Maddison', 'Steve Niles, Ben Ketai', 'Kiele Sanchez, Mia Kirshner, Diora Baird, Rhys Coiro, Harold Perrineau, Monique Ganderton, Ben Cotton, Stacey Roy', 'R', 'After surviving the incidents in Barrow, Alaska, Stella Olemaun relocates to Los Angeles, where she intentionally attracts the attention of the local vampire population in order to avenge the death of her husband, Eben.', 'After surviving the incidents in Barrow, Alaska, Stella Olemaun relocates to Los Angeles, where she intentionally attracts the attention of the local vampire population in order to avenge the death of her husband, Eben.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXHaXVGncI2WKUrNRYDyTyj3ymR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42941'),
  ('307503272338182824', '30 Miles from Nowhere', 2018, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Caitlin Koller, Ben McBurnett, Angelo Umlauf', 'Seana Kofoed', 'Carrie Preston, Seana Kofoed, Rob Benedict, Cathy Shim, Marielle Scott, William Smillie, Postell Pringle, Rusty Schwimmer', null, 'When five college pals return to rural Wisconsin for their estranged friend''s funeral, what begins as an uneasy reunion becomes a terrifying fight for survival.', 'When five college pals return to rural Wisconsin for their estranged friend''s funeral, what begins as an uneasy reunion becomes a terrifying fight for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/la033FX81LsiIId67AM5SEtVSXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:564082'),
  ('953692846239773495', '30 Minutes or Less', 2011, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Ruben Fleischer, G.A. Aguilar, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Michael Diliberti', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Danny McBride, Aziz Ansari, Nick Swardson, Dilshad Vadsaria, Michael Peña, Bianca Kajlich, Fred Ward', 'R', 'Two fledgling criminals kidnap a pizza delivery guy, strap a bomb to his chest, and advise him that he has mere hours to rob a bank or else...', 'Two fledgling criminals kidnap a pizza delivery guy, strap a bomb to his chest, and advise him that he has mere hours to rob a bank or else...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/12VgS5G6OG7ANKrSbhtUD2POHb8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62206'),
  ('901886788996821090', '30 Nights of Paranormal Activity With the Devil Inside the Girl With the Dragon Tattoo', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Craig Moss, Paul Holman, James Todd', 'Craig Moss', 'Kathryn Fiore, Flip Schultz, Olivia Alexander, Arturo del Puerto, Danny Woodburn, French Stewart, Peter Gilroy, Tyler Phillips', 'R', 'After a stint in a psychiatric hospital, a young woman returns to the house where her father killed the entire cast of The Artist during his exorcism.', 'After a stint in a psychiatric hospital, a young woman returns to the house where her father killed the entire cast of The Artist during his exorcism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xng4MvtKEj8mV2aHgc51tGZzkdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157058'),
  ('32061701596615863', '30 Nights with My (Ex) Husband', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Guido Chiesa, Emanuele Pasquet, Tommaso Pagliai', 'Adrián Suar', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Edoardo Leo, Gloria Harvey, Claudio Colica, Francesca Valtorta, Luca Massaro, Andrea Pisani, Beatrice Arnera', null, 'Bruno, a textbook anxious man, is persuaded by his teenage daughter to host his ex-wife Terry for a month, just out of a long psychiatric hospitalization. After all, it’s only 30 nights—what could possibly go wrong? Yet Terry’s exuberance and blunt honesty put Bruno’s routine to the test, as he finds himself stuck in a lackluster relationship and in a job where he struggles to assert himself as he would like.', 'Bruno, a textbook anxious man, is persuaded by his teenage daughter to host his ex-wife Terry for a month, just out of a long psychiatric hospitalization. After all, it’s only 30 nights—what could possibly go wrong? Yet Terry’s exuberance and blunt honesty put Bruno’s routine to the test, as he finds himself stuck in a lackluster relationship and in a job where he struggles to assert himself as he would like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sr8yQglOwVYzdJaa1m0RJyHAVxn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1317140'),
  ('861668053063736460', '30 Nights with My Ex', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Félix "Chango" Monti, Luis Bernárdez, Adrián Suar', 'Javier Gross', 'Adrián Suar, Pilar Gamboa, Rocío Hernández, Martín Campilongo, Pichu Straneo, Elisa Carricajo, Elvira Onetto, Jorge Suárez', null, 'At the request of his daughter, Turbo is reluctantly forced to open his doors for 30 days to his emotionally fragile and eccentric ex-wife, Loba, following a prolonged stay at a mental hospital. As old feelings reemerge, Turbo and Loba find themselves at the center of a perfect storm that could set them on an odyssey of rediscovery… or send them both back to the madhouse.', 'At the request of his daughter, Turbo is reluctantly forced to open his doors for 30 days to his emotionally fragile and eccentric ex-wife, Loba, following a prolonged stay at a mental hospital. As old feelings reemerge, Turbo and Loba find themselves at the center of a perfect storm that could set them on an odyssey of rediscovery… or send them both back to the madhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nXbhchOec3MKtAcKPO82Qu8r5AW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:882040'),
  ('29748839807221853', '30 Years to Life', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Vanessa Middleton', 'Vanessa Middleton', 'Erika Alexander, Melissa De Sousa, Tracy Morgan, Paula Jai Parker, Allen Payne, T.E. Russell, Kadeem Hardison, Janet Hubert', 'R', 'An ensemble comedy that follows the lives of six friends in New York City during the year in which they each reach their 30th birthday. We meet an investment banker from Wall Street, a stand-up comedian, a real estate agent, a marketing executive who perceives any career advancement as a sign of getting old, and a man whose thanks for being in a four-year relationship is a girlfriend who insists on an even greater commitment.', 'An ensemble comedy that follows the lives of six friends in New York City during the year in which they each reach their 30th birthday. We meet an investment banker from Wall Street, a stand-up comedian, a real estate agent, a marketing executive who perceives any career advancement as a sign of getting old, and a man whose thanks for being in a four-year relationship is a girlfriend who insists on an even greater commitment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHOUR1DI7vbT6nmDrCFwphZX1hL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41756'),
  ('314687511472582418', '30,000 Leagues Under The Sea', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Gabriel Bologna', 'Eric Forsberg', 'Lorenzo Lamas, Natalie Stone, Kim Little, Sean Lawlor, Declan Joyce, Victor J. Springer, Emilio Roso, Michael Tower', 'PG', 'Captain Nemo goes even deeper into insanity in this mesmerizing fantasy tale. Once again at the helm of his fearsome, wildly advanced vessel, the nautical madman endeavors to turn the world above the waves upside down.', 'Captain Nemo goes even deeper into insanity in this mesmerizing fantasy tale. Once again at the helm of his fearsome, wildly advanced vessel, the nautical madman endeavors to turn the world above the waves upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxcM9XbumJHpYAstef4BrUcD6zR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20609'),
  ('250332478096920082', '30,000 Miles Under the Sea', 1970, 'Animation, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Reiko Okuyama, Kazuya Miyazaki, Takeshi Tamiya', 'Katsumi Okamoto', 'Masako Nozawa, Kurumi Kobato, Gorō Naya, Akira Hitomi, Katsuwo Umino, Yonehiko Kitagawa, Reiko Seno, Tetsuya Kaji', null, 'The ruler of the underground world, is planning to conquer the whole world. Riding the fire dragon Isamu and Angel, the princess of the undersea kingdom, try to stop him from destorying their world.', 'The ruler of the underground world, is planning to conquer the whole world. Riding the fire dragon Isamu and Angel, the princess of the undersea kingdom, try to stop him from destorying their world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cbX39IxMUb6Xjs5QYSWc74ccdd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104682'),
  ('714574009610146941', '300', 2007, 'Action, Adventure, War', 'Zack Snyder, Larry Fong, Isabelle Guay', 'Zack Snyder, Kurt Johnstad, Michael B. Gordon', 'Gerard Butler, Lena Headey, Dominic West, David Wenham, Vincent Regan, Michael Fassbender, Tom Wisdom, Andrew Pleavin', 'R', 'A story very loosely based the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, where the King of Sparta led his army against the advancing Persians.', 'A story very loosely based the 480 B.C. Battle of Thermopylae, where the King of Sparta led his army against the advancing Persians.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7Lcio0c9ohxPhSZg42eTlKIVVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1271'),
  ('1042965879780028569', '300 Miles to Heaven', 1989, 'Drama', 'Maciej Dejczer, Morten Henriksen, Krzysztof Ptak', 'Cezary Harasimowicz, Maciej Dejczer', 'Wojciech Klata, Rafał Zimowski, Jadwiga Jankowska-Cieślak, Andrzej Mellin, Kama Kowalewska, Wojciech Biedroń, Tadeusz Teodorczyk, Tomasz Kamiński', null, 'Based on a true story dating back to 1985 when two Polish boys, a teenager and his little brother, escaped from communist Poland all the way to Sweden, hidden under a truck. In the movie, their destination has been changed to Denmark.', 'Based on a true story dating back to 1985 when two Polish boys, a teenager and his little brother, escaped from communist Poland all the way to Sweden, hidden under a truck. In the movie, their destination has been changed to Denmark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3i2tszRVYsaa5CYGhOsKAWvDCbi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155325'),
  ('157820641142503330', '300 Worte Deutsch', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Züli Aladag, Kolja Brandt', 'Arne Nolting, Ali Samadi Ahadi', 'Pegah Ferydoni, Christoph Maria Herbst, Vedat Erincin, Christoph Letkowski, Semih Yavsaner, Beste Bereket, Navid Navid, Pelin Öztekin', null, 'For years, the immigration officer Dr. Ludwig Sarheimer and the chairman of the Turkish community Cengiz Demirkan in Cologne have been fighting a small war. While the one, as a hodja, upholds the traditions of his homeland and brings Anatolian brides to Germany for Turks who are willing to marry, the other wants to prevent exactly that. Cengiz''s daughter Lale Demirkan is at the center of these ongoing disputes. At home, the young woman plays the well-behaved Turkish daughter, but as soon as the German studies student leaves the house, she takes off her headscarf and sense of tradition and has fully arrived in German life. In her free time, she practises martial arts fighting techniques. So far, she has successfully fended off potential grooms.', 'For years, the immigration officer Dr. Ludwig Sarheimer and the chairman of the Turkish community Cengiz Demirkan in Cologne have been fighting a small war. While the one, as a hodja, upholds the traditions of his homeland and brings Anatolian brides to Germany for Turks who are willing to marry, the other wants to prevent exactly that. Cengiz''s daughter Lale Demirkan is at the center of these ongoing disputes. At home, the young woman plays the well-behaved Turkish daughter, but as soon as the German studies student leaves the house, she takes off her headscarf and sense of tradition and has fully arrived in German life. In her free time, she practises martial arts fighting techniques. So far, she has successfully fended off potential grooms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pU4UJaR1Li1PWUiPHkvMyBqYhJf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309038'),
  ('166406227825322549', '300: Rise of an Empire', 2014, 'Action, Drama, War', 'Noam Murro, Simon Duggan, Sue Chan', 'Kurt Johnstad, Zack Snyder', 'Sullivan Stapleton, Eva Green, Lena Headey, Callan Mulvey, David Wenham, Rodrigo Santoro, Jack O''Connell, Andrew Tiernan', 'R', 'Greek general Themistocles attempts to unite all of Greece by leading the charge that will change the course of the war. Themistocles faces the massive invading Persian forces led by mortal-turned-god, Xerxes and Artemesia, the vengeful commander of the Persian navy.', 'Greek general Themistocles attempts to unite all of Greece by leading the charge that will change the course of the war. Themistocles faces the massive invading Persian forces led by mortal-turned-god, Xerxes and Artemesia, the vengeful commander of the Persian navy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYDdWN1McB1Sio4z1dPSkb40Z78.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53182'),
  ('243628472058004708', '3000 Miles to Graceland', 2001, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Demian Lichtenstein, David Franco, Attila Szalay', 'Richard Recco, Demian Lichtenstein', 'Kurt Russell, Kevin Costner, Courteney Cox, Christian Slater, Kevin Pollak, David Arquette, Jon Lovitz, Howie Long', 'R', 'It was an ingenious enough plan: rob the Riviera Casino''s count room during an Elvis impersonator convention. But Thomas Murphy decided to keep all the money for himself and shot all his partners, including recently-freed ex-con Michael Zane. With $3.2 million at stake, the Marshals Service closing in, Michael must track down Murphy.', 'It was an ingenious enough plan: rob the Riviera Casino''s count room during an Elvis impersonator convention. But Thomas Murphy decided to keep all the money for himself and shot all his partners, including recently-freed ex-con Michael Zane. With $3.2 million at stake, the Marshals Service closing in, Michael must track down Murphy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJgr5sGoXnsgZ0EVt80i6X9dQiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12138'),
  ('867229196377468719', '301/302', 1995, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Park Cheol-su, Lee Eun-gil', 'Lee Suh-goon', 'Pang Eun-jin, Hwang Shin-hye, Kim Chu-ryeon, Park Cheol-ho, Jae Young, Park Young-rok, Lee Ji-yeon', null, 'Two obsessive-compulsives, a chef and an anorexic writer, are neighbors in an apartment building. The chef (301) tries to entice her neighbor to eat with fabulous meals. The writer (302) refuses to eat, and this refusal begins a turbulent relationship that forces both women to delve into their pasts of torment.', 'Two obsessive-compulsives, a chef and an anorexic writer, are neighbors in an apartment building. The chef (301) tries to entice her neighbor to eat with fabulous meals. The writer (302) refuses to eat, and this refusal begins a turbulent relationship that forces both women to delve into their pasts of torment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7gMh5BcWebJ5qy4M1529FjmK94H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54285'),
  ('364081070121046624', '3022', 2019, 'Science Fiction', 'John Suits, Will Stone', 'Ryan Binaco', 'Omar Epps, Kate Walsh, Angus Macfadyen, Jorja Fox, Miranda Cosgrove, Enver Gjokaj, Haaz Sleiman, Audrey Looye', 'R', 'A group of astronauts living in the haunting emptiness of deep space struggle to cope after Earth suffers an extinction-level event.', 'A group of astronauts living in the haunting emptiness of deep space struggle to cope after Earth suffers an extinction-level event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dp1brl24LXGFU3JPFaDoljDONRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:640882'),
  ('180556827498898023', '303', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Hans Weingartner, Mario Krause, Sebastian Lempe', 'Silke Eggert, Hans Weingartner', 'Mala Emde, Anton Spieker, Arndt Schwering-Sohnrey, Thomas Schmuckert, Jörg Bundschuh, Hannah Ley, Caroline Erikson', null, 'Two university students gain insight into life and love as they get to know each other during a road trip across Europe.', 'Two university students gain insight into life and love as they get to know each other during a road trip across Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GzC8xdGojbSabzsi2tm1TqEU8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493900'),
  ('173825260444573497', '303 Squadron', 2018, 'War, Drama, History', 'Denis Delić, Waldemar Szmidt, Monika Lewicka', 'Krzysztof Burdza, Tomasz Kępski, Zdzisław Samojłowicz', 'Maciej Zakościelny, Piotr Adamczyk, Krzysztof Kwiatkowski, Maciej Cymorek, Cara Theobold, Anna Prus, Maciej Marczewski, Jan Wieczorkowski', null, 'After the fall of the September Campaign of 1939, two Polish pilots are forced to fight for their nation in foreign battlefronts.', 'After the fall of the September Campaign of 1939, two Polish pilots are forced to fight for their nation in foreign battlefronts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3O1zY9INsubcJp1od8ccQULfhm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430727'),
  ('191449835439729510', '3096 Days', 2013, 'Drama', 'Sherry Hormann, Michael Ballhaus', 'Bernd Eichinger, Peter Reichard', 'Antonia Campbell-Hughes, Thure Lindhardt, Trine Dyrholm, Amelia Pidgeon, Dearbhla Molloy, Roeland Wiesnekker, Ellen Schwiers, Erni Mangold', null, 'A young Austrian girl is kidnapped and held in captivity for eight years. Based on the real-life case of Natascha Kampusch.', 'A young Austrian girl is kidnapped and held in captivity for eight years. Based on the real-life case of Natascha Kampusch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2bybyGMtyFSVNjFSxeDNu2fnPD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166666'),
  ('379367874624673136', '31', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Rob Zombie, David Daniel', 'Rob Zombie', 'Sheri Moon Zombie, Richard Brake, Meg Foster, Malcolm McDowell, Daniel Roebuck, Lawrence Hilton-Jacobs, Jeff Daniel Phillips, Andrea Dora', 'R', 'Five carnival workers are kidnapped and held hostage in an abandoned, Hell-like compound where they are forced to participate in a violent game, the goal of which is to survive twelve hours against a gang of sadistic clowns.', 'Five carnival workers are kidnapped and held hostage in an abandoned, Hell-like compound where they are forced to participate in a violent game, the goal of which is to survive twelve hours against a gang of sadistic clowns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHkIIkP4O0vUkSACcizOPZQIiF7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:284564'),
  ('73004098315254471', '31 Minutes: One Hot Christmas', 2025, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Music', 'Pedro Peirano, Álvaro Díaz González, David Bravo', 'Pedro Peirano, Álvaro Díaz González', 'Pedro Peirano, Álvaro Díaz González, Jani Dueñas, Patricio Díaz, Daniel Castro, Felipe Godoy, Rodrigo Salinas, Francisco Schultz', 'PG', 'Puppeton, the town of 31 Minutes, faces such an infernally hot Christmas that Santa Claus cancels his visit! Bodoque the rabbit heroically volunteers to rescue the presents from the North Pole, while his friends improvise a disastrous Christmas show. But what they don''t expect is Bodoque giving in to some irresistible temptations along the way.', 'Puppeton, the town of 31 Minutes, faces such an infernally hot Christmas that Santa Claus cancels his visit! Bodoque the rabbit heroically volunteers to rescue the presents from the North Pole, while his friends improvise a disastrous Christmas show. But what they don''t expect is Bodoque giving in to some irresistible temptations along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5Y0qRZGgdbNsxshhuIwXyslUYc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1237082'),
  ('1061041713742799024', '31 Minutes: The Movie', 2008, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure', 'Pedro Peirano, M.I. Littin-Menz, Álvaro Díaz González', 'Daniel Castro, Pedro Peirano, Álvaro Díaz González', 'Pedro Peirano, Álvaro Díaz González, Rodrigo Salinas, Jani Dueñas, Daniel Castro, Patricio Díaz, Francisco Schultz, Catalina Saavedra', null, 'When the evil billionaire Cachirula kidnaps Juanín Juan Harry to complete her bizarre animal collection, the 31 Minutos crew embarks on a chaotic rescue mission, proving that friendship is always worth the chaos.', 'When the evil billionaire Cachirula kidnaps Juanín Juan Harry to complete her bizarre animal collection, the 31 Minutos crew embarks on a chaotic rescue mission, proving that friendship is always worth the chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8OPMXLAIQGxagKOPkjMz12NK9o7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36999'),
  ('462490341955700205', '31/75: Asylum', 1975, null, 'Kurt Kren', null, null, null, 'A meadow, a lake, the silhouette of a hill, trees. 21 days of the same view in Saarland. 21 days with five different cut-outs in a mask before the camera, which finally reveals a complete panorama. The landscape changes with the advancing seasons and becomes slowly delirious in its technical alienation.', 'A meadow, a lake, the silhouette of a hill, trees. 21 days of the same view in Saarland. 21 days with five different cut-outs in a mask before the camera, which finally reveals a complete panorama. The landscape changes with the advancing seasons and becomes slowly delirious in its technical alienation.', null, 'tmdb:movie:143554'),
