  ('975931046015783760', '36 Hours', 1953, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Walter J. Harvey, Montgomery Tully, Jimmy Sangster', 'Steve Fisher', 'Dan Duryea, Elsie Albiin, Gudrun Ure, Eric Pohlmann, John Chandos, Kenneth Griffith, Harold Lang, Marianne Stone', 'NR', 'When his wife stops writing to him and his letters are returned unanswered, Dan becomes extremely concerned about her welfare. He returns home but is only able to meet with her briefly before she is found murdered. Dan is the obvious suspect but has only 36 hours to find out who murdered her. In so doing he uncovers a shocking catalogue of his wife''s past affairs and an identity that he knew nothing about.', 'When his wife stops writing to him and his letters are returned unanswered, Dan becomes extremely concerned about her welfare. He returns home but is only able to meet with her briefly before she is found murdered. Dan is the obvious suspect but has only 36 hours to find out who murdered her. In so doing he uncovers a shocking catalogue of his wife''s past affairs and an identity that he knew nothing about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLkuNZvpNq21fZ66FEGHh4XdBJo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60617'),
  ('225475914959290013', '36 Hours', 1964, 'Drama, Thriller, War', 'George Seaton, Donald Roberts, Philip H. Lathrop', 'George Seaton', 'James Garner, Eva Marie Saint, Rod Taylor, Werner Peters, John Banner, Russell Thorson, Alan Napier, Oscar Beregi Jr.', 'NR', 'Germans kidnap an American major and try to convince him that World War II is over, so that they can get details about the Allied invasion of Europe out of him.', 'Germans kidnap an American major and try to convince him that World War II is over, so that they can get details about the Allied invasion of Europe out of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JrkndJe6vmkrMorF7l3TjuTvB9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37684'),
  ('1078485683249340713', '36 Hours to Die', 1999, 'TV Movie, Crime, Thriller', 'Yves Simoneau, Carole Vaillancourt', 'Robert Rodat', 'Treat Williams, Kim Cattrall, Carroll O''Connor, Saul Rubinek, Alain Goulem, Barbara Eve Harris, Stewart Bick, Hrothgar Mathews', null, 'Treat Williams stars in this drama as the owner of a brewing company who refuses to knuckle under when gangsters make threats against him, his business, and his family. With the help of his wife and his uncle, he''s able to outsmart and outmuscle the crooks. Carroll O''Connor and Kim Cattrall are featured in the supporting cast.', 'Treat Williams stars in this drama as the owner of a brewing company who refuses to knuckle under when gangsters make threats against him, his business, and his family. With the help of his wife and his uncle, he''s able to outsmart and outmuscle the crooks. Carroll O''Connor and Kim Cattrall are featured in the supporting cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeRHW2ZG8WCquSpojo9jLtjhp5C.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62207'),
  ('471973077727962444', '36 Steps', 2006, 'Horror', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Ramiro García Bogliano, Adrián García Bogliano, Honorio Galarza', 'Noelia Balbo, Ines Sbarra, Melisa Fernandez, Ariana Marchioni, Priscila Rauto, Andrea Duarte, Priscila Caldera, Victoria Witemburg', null, 'There are important rules that must be obeyed. Don''t talk back, Don''t leave the grounds, have fun! For a group of girls kept in a house following the rules can mean life or death in this Spanish horror film.', 'There are important rules that must be obeyed. Don''t talk back, Don''t leave the grounds, have fun! For a group of girls kept in a house following the rules can mean life or death in this Spanish horror film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/isFLTVPV5JqsAKIfNBNwUA9wU3m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129074'),
  ('395282896993634450', '360', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Fernando Meirelles, Adriano Goldman', 'Peter Morgan', 'Rachel Weisz, Jude Law, Ben Foster, Anthony Hopkins, Moritz Bleibtreu, Gabriela Marcinková, Jamel Debbouze, Mark Ivanir', 'R', 'A disparate group of characters unknowingly bond by the sexual choices they make. Consumed by loneliness, a British businessman ponders a rendezvous with a prostitute. The businessman''s wife prepares to call it quits with her younger lover. A Brazilian student breaks up with her boyfriend in London. A recovering alcoholic travels to Phoenix in search of his missing daughter. A paroled sex offender struggles to stay composed when propositioned in a Denver airport. A widower''s religious devotion is put to a difficult test.', 'A disparate group of characters unknowingly bond by the sexual choices they make. Consumed by loneliness, a British businessman ponders a rendezvous with a prostitute. The businessman''s wife prepares to call it quits with her younger lover. A Brazilian student breaks up with her boyfriend in London. A recovering alcoholic travels to Phoenix in search of his missing daughter. A paroled sex offender struggles to stay composed when propositioned in a Denver airport. A widower''s religious devotion is put to a difficult test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzI3p0c2oFRMx5fYQg2BoQzYCE0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89455'),
  ('301238740232601988', '36th Precinct', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Olivier Marchal, Denis Rouden', 'Olivier Marchal, Franck Mancuso, Julien Rappeneau', 'Daniel Auteuil, Gérard Depardieu, André Dussollier, Roschdy Zem, Valeria Golino, Daniel Duval, Francis Renaud, Catherine Marchal', null, 'In Paris, two cops are competing for the vacant job of chief of police, in the middle of the search for a gang of violent thieves. The movie is directed by Olivier Marchal, a former police officer who spent 12 years with the French police before creating this story, taken in part from real events of the 1980s.', 'In Paris, two cops are competing for the vacant job of chief of police, in the middle of the search for a gang of violent thieves. The movie is directed by Olivier Marchal, a former police officer who spent 12 years with the French police before creating this story, taken in part from real events of the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exD0FsvhkZqetOVOYrfGqwnc7nX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7291'),
  ('269687383397859675', '37 : The Shadow and the Prey', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Arthur Môlard, Sophie Lainé Diodovic, Matthias Castegnaro', 'Arthur Môlard, Claire Patronik', 'Guillaume Pottier, Melodie Simina, Agnès Sourdillon, Arnaud Churin, Christophe Vandevelde, Ary Gabison, Sandra Macedo, Lisa Perrio', null, 'Vincent, a truck driver, picks up a young pregnant woman. She turns out to have an unstable temper… and an automatic pistol. She orders Vincent to continue driving, without stopping. When he''s out of gas, she''ll kill him.', 'Vincent, a truck driver, picks up a young pregnant woman. She turns out to have an unstable temper… and an automatic pistol. She orders Vincent to continue driving, without stopping. When he''s out of gas, she''ll kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtiApujoWBgX9WzmucFtySDp9NN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1130410'),
  ('850983161195037104', '37 Seconds', 2019, 'Drama', 'Akihito Kajiya, Stephen Blahut, Hikari', 'Hikari', 'Mei Kayama, Misuzu Kanno, Shunsuke Daitoh, Makiko Watanabe, Yoshihiko Kumashino, Minori Hagiwara, Haruka Imou, Kiyohiko Shibukawa', 'NR', 'Yuma, a 23-year-old comic book artist with profound cerebral palsy, has been emotionally stunted by her well-meaning but overprotective mother. As she begins to seek independence and sexual awakening on her own terms, she discovers an unexpected path to love and forgiveness.', 'Yuma, a 23-year-old comic book artist with profound cerebral palsy, has been emotionally stunted by her well-meaning but overprotective mother. As she begins to seek independence and sexual awakening on her own terms, she discovers an unexpected path to love and forgiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kM70qpiQ3P1agNAZwlsUrBnv6Nw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570735'),
