  ('1149354999866318491', '4', 2005, 'Drama', 'Ilya Khrzhanovsky, Aleksandr Ilkhovskiy, Shandor Berkeshi', 'Vladimir Sorokin', 'Yuri Laguta, Konstantin Murzenko, Sergey Shnurov, Marina Vovchenko, Shavkat Abdusalamov, Anatoli Adoskin, Aleksei Khvostenko, Andrei Kudriashov', null, 'Two men and a woman happen to meet in a bar. We learn from their conversations both the intriguing and banal details of their lives. But is anyone really telling the truth?', 'Two men and a woman happen to meet in a bar. We learn from their conversations both the intriguing and banal details of their lives. But is anyone really telling the truth?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NTYBptoe7cGNt3xiPxR9AX9hGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31227'),
