  ('638734572699938031', '4 Days in France', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Jérôme Reybaud, Sabine Lancelin', 'Jérôme Reybaud', 'Pascal Cervo, Arthur Igual, Fabienne Babe, Nathalie Richard, Laetitia Dosch, Liliane Montevecchi, Marie France, Jean-Christophe Bouvet', null, 'A man leaves everything behind to travel aimlessly through France, letting himself be guided only by the people and landscapes he encounters: four days and four nights of wandering, during which his lover tries to locate him via Grindr, a smartphone dating app.', 'A man leaves everything behind to travel aimlessly through France, letting himself be guided only by the people and landscapes he encounters: four days and four nights of wandering, during which his lover tries to locate him via Grindr, a smartphone dating app.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7VXVRhfVhwBHYZft9o9jj4qOZr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408422'),
  ('837641624780793989', '4 Days in May', 2011, 'Drama, War', 'Achim von Borries, Bernd Fischer, Max von Saurma', 'Achim von Borries', 'Pavel Wenzel, Aleksey Guskov, Ivan Shvedoff, Andrey Merzlikin, Sergey Legostaev, Maksim Kowalewski, Yevgeni Sitokhin, Vladimir Svirskiy', null, 'Germany, Baltic Sea coast, May 1945, a few days before the end of World War II. A small Soviet patrol arrives at an isolated house where an elderly baroness gives shelter to a group of orphan girls and a boy who is determined to continue the fight.', 'Germany, Baltic Sea coast, May 1945, a few days before the end of World War II. A small Soviet patrol arrives at an isolated house where an elderly baroness gives shelter to a group of orphan girls and a boy who is determined to continue the fight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5aeeBdCGFRUCuk0sSkhU9Y3Sl3S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82666'),
  ('160036831981579108', '4 Dollars of Revenge', 1966, 'Western', 'Jaime Jesús Balcázar, Tino Santoni, Ví­ctor Monreal', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Aldo Grimaldi, Bruno Corbucci', 'Robert Woods, Dana Ghia, Angelo Infanti, Antonio Casas, José Manuel Martín, Gérard Tichy, Antonio Molino Rojo, Tomás Torres', null, 'Bandits ambush Capt. Roy Dexter of the U.S. Cavalry while he and his men escort a fortune in Confederate gold coins. Only Dexter survives the attack. He''s subsequently sentenced to life in prison on the false belief he masterminded the ambush. Escaping from prison, Dexter sets about tracking down and exposing the true culprits.', 'Bandits ambush Capt. Roy Dexter of the U.S. Cavalry while he and his men escort a fortune in Confederate gold coins. Only Dexter survives the attack. He''s subsequently sentenced to life in prison on the false belief he masterminded the ambush. Escaping from prison, Dexter sets about tracking down and exposing the true culprits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ga6YIfpaXUaFs7x5NKPL3vsGYeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67213'),
  ('131003162519723881', '4 for Texas', 1963, 'Comedy, Western', 'Robert Aldrich, Ernest Laszlo, David Salven', 'W.R. Burnett', 'Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin, Anita Ekberg, Ursula Andress, Barbara Payton, Charles Bronson, Victor Buono, Edric Connor', 'NR', 'In the 1870s, two rival businessmen, Zack Thomas and Joe Jarrett, on a stagecoach heading to Galveston, Texas, must pull together to protect $100,000 from an outlaw named Matson. Once in Galveston, however, their rivalry continues, as Thomas joins up with Elya Carlson and Jarret with Maxine Richter. But Matson is still on the loose, and a scheming banker threatens both Thomas and Jarrett.', 'In the 1870s, two rival businessmen, Zack Thomas and Joe Jarrett, on a stagecoach heading to Galveston, Texas, must pull together to protect $100,000 from an outlaw named Matson. Once in Galveston, however, their rivalry continues, as Thomas joins up with Elya Carlson and Jarret with Maxine Richter. But Matson is still on the loose, and a scheming banker threatens both Thomas and Jarrett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kElgIdPt8cCjrbR6qOSjgJ4LE8Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17691'),
