  ('511908353341454474', '4:30', 2005, 'Drama', 'Royston Tan, Lim Ching Leong', 'Royston Tan, Liam Yeo', 'Young-jun Kim, Xiao Li Yuan', null, 'Longing for human contact Xiao Wu tries all he can to make a connection through physical and metaphorical walls in that hour between night and day.', 'Longing for human contact Xiao Wu tries all he can to make a connection through physical and metaphorical walls in that hour between night and day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UmmfxA96BPAGpkQ2IYORgcAK7A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79957'),
  ('279220747883744196', '4:44 Last Day on Earth', 2012, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Abel Ferrara, Ken Kelsch, Michael T. Meador', 'Abel Ferrara', 'Willem Dafoe, Shanyn Leigh, Toni Redman, Pat Kiernan, Francis Kuipers, Selena Mars, Justin Restivo, Bojana Vasik', 'R', 'A look at how a painter and a successful actor spend their last day together before the world comes to an end.', 'A look at how a painter and a successful actor spend their last day together before the world comes to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSeQ7eXy1tmig0jkX63wACDiLM4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86820'),
  ('1099720786921365721', '4.3.2.1', 2010, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Noel Clarke, Franco Pizzino, Mark Davis', 'Noel Clarke', 'Emma Roberts, Noel Clarke, Ophelia Lovibond, Tamsin Egerton, Shanika Warren-Markland, Michelle Ryan, Alexander Siddig, Mandy Patinkin', null, 'Jo is chained down in a dead end supermarket job while all her friends are all out on their own separate adventures. But a chance encounter with some diamond thieves sends their separate worlds on a collision course with not only each other, but fate itself.', 'Jo is chained down in a dead end supermarket job while all her friends are all out on their own separate adventures. But a chance encounter with some diamond thieves sends their separate worlds on a collision course with not only each other, but fate itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEarMWLtn185KElEuZw04pz0wIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44877'),
  ('126818083900113575', '4.48', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jacky Katu, Rémy Chourlay', 'Jacky Katu', 'Aurélie Houguenade, Jean-Marie Galey, David Chausse, Ynda Rouya, Marie Menges, Matt Gras, Manuel Lambinet, Charlotte Schiøler', null, 'In order to win over a tough dramatist at her next audition, a young actress turns to method acting to such an extreme that she slowly loses herself in the coveted role of a promiscuous bisexual self-destructive wild girl and starts sleeping around, provoking fights and cutting herself. Can she pull herself back from the edge of the abyss before it''s too late?', 'In order to win over a tough dramatist at her next audition, a young actress turns to method acting to such an extreme that she slowly loses herself in the coveted role of a promiscuous bisexual self-destructive wild girl and starts sleeping around, provoking fights and cutting herself. Can she pull herself back from the edge of the abyss before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KabnHybueEyJQuvqEUkIqCmLPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322524'),
  ('625723957740331979', '40', 2009, 'Action, Drama', 'Clint Lealos, Emre Şahin', 'Emre Şahin', 'Ali Atay, Deniz Çakır, Ntare Guma Mbaho Mwine, Kwesi Boakye, Kofi Siriboe, Rıza Akın, Sarp Aydınoğlu, Rafi Emeksiz', null, 'A bag full of money lands in front of you. Is it luck? The answer to your prayers? Part of a predetermined plan? Or all of the above? Set in the chaotic streets of Istanbul, 40 is a story of three strangers making their way in a city of 12 million, all searching...for one bag. Shot entirely on location, ''40'' combines intense story telling with documentary style cinematography embarking on a synchronistic journey dealing with faith, love, luck, destiny, human trafficking...and a bag of cash that falls from the sky.', 'A bag full of money lands in front of you. Is it luck? The answer to your prayers? Part of a predetermined plan? Or all of the above? Set in the chaotic streets of Istanbul, 40 is a story of three strangers making their way in a city of 12 million, all searching...for one bag. Shot entirely on location, ''40'' combines intense story telling with documentary style cinematography embarking on a synchronistic journey dealing with faith, love, luck, destiny, human trafficking...and a bag of cash that falls from the sky.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oPCaMQEHM5PlVrnFYyEIhLLSZJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71698'),
  ('132754649905370959', '40 Acres', 2025, 'Action, Thriller, Drama, Science Fiction', 'R.T. Thorne, Jeremy Benning, Reid A. Dunlop', 'R.T. Thorne, Glenn Taylor', 'Danielle Deadwyler, Kataem O''Connor, Michael Greyeyes, Milcania Diaz-Rojas, Leenah Robinson, Jaeda LeBlanc, Haile Amare, Elizabeth Saunders', 'R', 'Hailey Freeman and her family are the last descendants of African American farmers who settled in rural Canada after the Civil War. In a famine-decimated near future, they now struggle to safeguard their farm, as they make one last stand against a vicious militia hell-bent on taking their 40 Acres.', 'Hailey Freeman and her family are the last descendants of African American farmers who settled in rural Canada after the Civil War. In a famine-decimated near future, they now struggle to safeguard their farm, as they make one last stand against a vicious militia hell-bent on taking their 40 Acres.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zCEo21Y9wVFBgGhgDVWCyvMZ47.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1319951'),
  ('505996096086056568', '40 Carats', 1973, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Milton Katselas, Dick Moder, David Hawks', 'Pierre Barillet, Jean-Pierre Grédy, Jay Presson Allen', 'Liv Ullmann, Edward Albert, Gene Kelly, Binnie Barnes, Deborah Raffin, Billy Green Bush, Nancy Walker, Don Porter', 'PG', 'After an overnight fling with a man nearly 20 years her junior while vacationing in Greece, Ann Stanley returns to New York assuming she''ll never see Peter Latham again. Until, that is, he shows up on her doorstep to take her daughter to a party. Despite her yearning for Peter and the encouragement of her friends and family, Ann initially rebuffs him when he pursues her, but slowly she yields to his charm and her own stifled emotions.', 'After an overnight fling with a man nearly 20 years her junior while vacationing in Greece, Ann Stanley returns to New York assuming she''ll never see Peter Latham again. Until, that is, he shows up on her doorstep to take her daughter to a party. Despite her yearning for Peter and the encouragement of her friends and family, Ann initially rebuffs him when he pursues her, but slowly she yields to his charm and her own stifled emotions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeO80hxMee4zN1VSsRH1M6ntzEk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42456'),
  ('85598641221702589', '40 Days and 40 Nights', 2002, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Elliot Davis, Michael Lehmann', 'Rob Perez, Rob Perez', 'Josh Hartnett, Shannyn Sossamon, Paulo Costanzo, Vinessa Shaw, Maggie Gyllenhaal, Adam Trese, Griffin Dunne, Emmanuelle Vaugier', 'R', 'Matt Sullivan''s last big relationship ended in disaster and ever since his heart''s been aching and his commitment''s been lacking. Then came Lent, that time of year when everybody gives something up. That''s when Matt decides to go where no man''s gone before and make a vow: No sex. Whatsoever. For 40 straight days. At first he has everything under control. That is until the woman of his dreams, Erica, walks into his life.', 'Matt Sullivan''s last big relationship ended in disaster and ever since his heart''s been aching and his commitment''s been lacking. Then came Lent, that time of year when everybody gives something up. That''s when Matt decides to go where no man''s gone before and make a vow: No sex. Whatsoever. For 40 straight days. At first he has everything under control. That is until the woman of his dreams, Erica, walks into his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5a60NuJToRAc0gijjI5IRSVGKL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2752'),
  ('202237429201465260', '40 Days and Nights', 2012, 'Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Thriller', 'Peter Geiger, Tim Gagliardo, Ulf Soderqvist', 'H. Perry Horton', 'Alex Carter, Christianna Carmine, Emily Sandifer, Mitch Lerner, Victoria Barabas, Emily Davenport, Kevin Jackson, Monica Keena', 'PG', 'When a colossal tectonic shift causes the sea level to start rising, a microbiologist gathers the DNA of as many species as she can, while the military creates an "ark" in a desperate attempt to preserve life on Earth.', 'When a colossal tectonic shift causes the sea level to start rising, a microbiologist gathers the DNA of as many species as she can, while the military creates an "ark" in a desperate attempt to preserve life on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bAHXPIZy1t8kiEqb7hn4BRbuuBd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145738'),
  ('1016317029762538209', '40 Guns to Apache Pass', 1967, 'Western', 'William Witney, Jacques R. Marquette', 'Willard W. Willingham, Mary Willingham', 'Audie Murphy, Michael Burns, Kenneth Tobey, Laraine Stephens, Robert Brubaker, Michael Blodgett, Michael Keep, Kay Stewart', 'NR', 'The Apaches are on the warpath and the Army must defend them. Murphy''s mission is to get a shipment of rifles, but it''s stolen by greedy white traders with the help of mutinous soldiers', 'The Apaches are on the warpath and the Army must defend them. Murphy''s mission is to get a shipment of rifles, but it''s stolen by greedy white traders with the help of mutinous soldiers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jyIw7iw40epEMCOilkdrAH5trks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38680'),
  ('1121504587991843143', '40 Pounds of Trouble', 1962, 'Comedy', 'Norman Jewison', 'Marion Hargrove', 'Tony Curtis, Suzanne Pleshette, Claire Wilcox, Phil Silvers, Larry Storch, Howard Morris, Edward Andrews, Stubby Kaye', 'NR', 'Hilarity ensues when a casino manager spends a day at Disneyland with a cute but troublesome little girl.', 'Hilarity ensues when a casino manager spends a day at Disneyland with a cute but troublesome little girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3wnQF0Xb7lLKiXJlNSuQvzmCGcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42990'),
  ('695996519530993818', '40 Secondi', 2025, 'Drama', 'Vincenzo Alfieri, Andrea Reitano, Federica Baglioni', 'Giuseppe G. Stasi, Vincenzo Alfieri', 'Justin De Vivo, Francesco Gheghi, Beatrice Puccilli, Enrico Borello, Francesco Di Leva, Giordano Giansanti, Luca Petrini, Sergio Rubini', null, 'It explores the tragic events leading up to the murder of 21-year-old Willy Monteiro Duarte, highlighting the intertwining of chance encounters, rivalries, and latent tensions.', 'It explores the tragic events leading up to the murder of 21-year-old Willy Monteiro Duarte, highlighting the intertwining of chance encounters, rivalries, and latent tensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJHWc5wnjLdSasFYXtS4O7E212W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1476460'),
  ('700098369604247237', '40 Years of Rocky: The Birth of a Classic', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Derek Wayne Johnson', null, 'Sylvester Stallone, John G. Avildsen, Carl Weathers, Talia Shire, Burgess Meredith, Burt Young, Joe Spinell, Thayer David', null, 'Sylvester Stallone and John G. Avildsen narrate behind-the-scenes footage from the making of "Rocky" to mark the film''s 40th anniversary.', 'Sylvester Stallone and John G. Avildsen narrate behind-the-scenes footage from the making of "Rocky" to mark the film''s 40th anniversary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itLorKvIQHsmY0D22hiqQLHGIGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421057'),
  ('653712701828048555', '40 Years Young', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Pietro Loprieno', 'Pietro Loprieno', 'Adal Ramones, Erick Elías, Gaby Espino, Sonia Couoh, Ximena Rubio, Anabel Ferreira, Miguel Pizarro, Giovanna Zacarías', null, 'After turning 40, César is invited to a culinary contest in Cancún, but a bitter discovery threatens to destroy his family as well as his chances to win the competition.', 'After turning 40, César is invited to a culinary contest in Cancún, but a bitter discovery threatens to destroy his family as well as his chances to win the competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHD5BquWEciEUNJtuCHjr35cxzn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949270'),
  ('398101218922506426', '40-Love', 2014, 'Drama', 'Stéphane Demoustier', 'Gaëlle Macé, Stéphane Demoustier', 'Olivier Gourmet, Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Charles Mérienne, Vimala Pons, Jean-Yves Berteloot, Sam Louwyck, Husky Kihal, Sandrine Dumas', null, 'Jérôme, a senior executive, has just left his company. Determined to never work for nobody else ever again, he attempts to set up his own company, come what may, even ignoring the reluctance of his wife Laura. Ugo, their 11-year-old son, is a tennis player and a promising champion. To reach his goal, he must make it into the Roland Garros national training centre. Just like his dad, he’s willing to do whatever it takes to make it. Together, Ugo and Jérôme will realize that not all rules can be bent in the quest for success.', 'Jérôme, a senior executive, has just left his company. Determined to never work for nobody else ever again, he attempts to set up his own company, come what may, even ignoring the reluctance of his wife Laura. Ugo, their 11-year-old son, is a tennis player and a promising champion. To reach his goal, he must make it into the Roland Garros national training centre. Just like his dad, he’s willing to do whatever it takes to make it. Together, Ugo and Jérôme will realize that not all rules can be bent in the quest for success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1yUqdn03zHBrzZV1nLYZQVn8kMD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290829'),
  ('54543530223433385', '400 Against 1: A History of Organized Crime', 2010, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Caco Souza', 'Victor Navas', 'Daniel de Oliveira, Daniela Escobar, Fabrício Boliveira, Negra Li, Jefferson Brasil, Jonathan Azevedo, Lui Mendes, Lui Brites', null, 'The story of William da Silva Lima, the last survivor of the group that founded the Comando Vermelho at the end of the 1970s. It shows him living together with the political prisoners incurred under the same National Security Law and his leadership in the Ilha Grande Prison creating a type of unheard of conduct and solidarity in the Brazilian prisons. The film goes on to tell of the group''s actions on the streets of Rio de Janeiro during the beginning of the 80s when they irritated the police with their daring robberies, as well as portraying the surprising love story between William and Tereza. The narrative weaves its way between the intimate conflict and the spectacular assaults and escapes.', 'The story of William da Silva Lima, the last survivor of the group that founded the Comando Vermelho at the end of the 1970s. It shows him living together with the political prisoners incurred under the same National Security Law and his leadership in the Ilha Grande Prison creating a type of unheard of conduct and solidarity in the Brazilian prisons. The film goes on to tell of the group''s actions on the streets of Rio de Janeiro during the beginning of the 80s when they irritated the police with their daring robberies, as well as portraying the surprising love story between William and Tereza. The narrative weaves its way between the intimate conflict and the spectacular assaults and escapes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYjpX0uLBCtjJBf42zJk4OxepPx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49821'),
  ('106935664816392461', '400 Bullets', 2021, 'Action, War, Mystery', 'Tom Paton', 'Tom Paton', 'Jean-Paul Ly, Andrew-Lee Potts, James Warren, Adesuwa Oni, Steven Blades, Spencer Collings, Wayne Gordon, Adam Sina', null, 'One cold winter night in Afghanistan is about to get a whole lot worse for Rana Rae, a Gurkha soldier left to guard a British military outpost, when Captain Noah Brandt arrives looking for refuge from a group of rogue special ops and a cell of heavily armed Taliban. The two soldiers must fight for their lives as they attempt to call for backup before the rogue squad, led by the backstabbing Sergeant Bartlett, can hunt them down to retrieve a case of missile guidance chips that Noah intercepted. But Bartlett and his men do not count on Rana, whose ferocious Gurkha training makes him a force to be reckoned with.', 'One cold winter night in Afghanistan is about to get a whole lot worse for Rana Rae, a Gurkha soldier left to guard a British military outpost, when Captain Noah Brandt arrives looking for refuge from a group of rogue special ops and a cell of heavily armed Taliban. The two soldiers must fight for their lives as they attempt to call for backup before the rogue squad, led by the backstabbing Sergeant Bartlett, can hunt them down to retrieve a case of missile guidance chips that Noah intercepted. But Bartlett and his men do not count on Rana, whose ferocious Gurkha training makes him a force to be reckoned with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/burp795vripHCoq8VAT0Dm5SPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:788672'),
  ('361350153167552238', '400 Days', 2015, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Matt Osterman, Bo Hakala', 'Matt Osterman', 'Brandon Routh, Caity Lotz, Dane Cook, Ben Feldman, Tom Cavanagh, Grant Bowler, Sally Pressman, Mark Steger', null, '4 would be astronauts spend 400 days in a land locked space simulator to test the psychological effects of deep space travel but, when something goes terribly wrong and they are forced to leave the simulation, they discover that everything on earth has changed. Is this real or is the simulation on a higher level than they could have ever imagined?', '4 would be astronauts spend 400 days in a land locked space simulator to test the psychological effects of deep space travel but, when something goes terribly wrong and they are forced to leave the simulation, they discover that everything on earth has changed. Is this real or is the simulation on a higher level than they could have ever imagined?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJtZCACfHUttXf1A0jpYj6uIpgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332502'),
  ('841157111984495273', '404 Run Run', 2024, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Pichaya Jarusboonpracha, Maneerat Srinakarin, Wichaya Ratanachumnong', 'Pichaya Jarusboonpracha, Rerkchai Paungpetch, Wichaya Ratanachumnong', 'Chantavit Dhanasevi, Kanyawee Songmuang, Pittaya Saechua, Supathat Opas, Chookiat Iamsook, Paweenut Pangnakorn, Nantanat Thakadkul, Pongsatorn Jongwilas', null, 'Nakrob, a young real estate swindler, discovers an abandoned hillside hotel by the beach. Seeing an opportunity, he decides to turn it into a luxury hotel scam.', 'Nakrob, a young real estate swindler, discovers an abandoned hillside hotel by the beach. Seeing an opportunity, he decides to turn it into a luxury hotel scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z2TWhTRFzriygLygsjTbIHFYcQW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290213'),
  ('260370703315161857', '404: Error Not Found', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Prawaal Raman, Savita Singh', 'Prawaal Raman', 'Rajvvir Aroraa, Mukesh Bhatt, Amod Burande, Tisca Chopra, Nishikant Kamat, Sara Arjun', null, 'A brilliant student starts hallucinating after moving into a room that was occupied by another who committed suicide.', 'A brilliant student starts hallucinating after moving into a room that was occupied by another who committed suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1B1jyibEUknWeeoUc5OpsitQyAO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71481'),
  ('31545274005492210', '407 Dark Flight', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Isara Nadee, Thatchaphong Suphasri, Phanom Phromachat', 'Chanin Panthong, Nattamol Peanthanom, Nattapot Potchumnean', 'Marsha Vadhanapanich, Peter Knight, Patcharee Tubthong, Paramej Noiam, Unchalee Hassadeevichit, Namo Tongkumnerd, Thiti Vechabul, Sisangian Sihalath', null, 'Ten years ago, a young air hostess, New, miraculously survived a plane crash. New insists that a vengeful spirit caused that accident, but her belief unsettled those around her and she had to go through a psycho-therapy.', 'Ten years ago, a young air hostess, New, miraculously survived a plane crash. New insists that a vengeful spirit caused that accident, but her belief unsettled those around her and she had to go through a psycho-therapy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oI7m9ySMZSQoQfWMVMmylcpHk8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101419'),
  ('297121035995959006', '42', 2013, 'Drama', 'Brian Helgeland, Don Burgess, Aaron Haye', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Chadwick Boseman, Harrison Ford, Nicole Beharie, Christopher Meloni, Ryan Merriman, Lucas Black, André Holland, Alan Tudyk', 'PG-13', 'In 1947, Jackie Robinson becomes the first Black man to play in Major League Baseball facing unabashed racism from the public, the press and other players.', 'In 1947, Jackie Robinson becomes the first Black man to play in Major League Baseball facing unabashed racism from the public, the press and other players.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZ7jVGQWj3eBUdqwAPUlKk0BaS2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109410'),
  ('361461173611454088', '42 Up', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Michael Apted', null, 'Bruce Balden, Jacqueline Bassett, Symon Basterfield, Andrew Brackfield, John Brisby, Suzanne Dewey, Nicholas Hitchon, Neil Hughes', null, 'Director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born adults after a 7 year wait. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.', 'Director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born adults after a 7 year wait. The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fcOziYVE7iGW3H7tM4yLod4ExvK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20565'),
  ('639284379522950043', '42nd Street', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Sol Polito, Lloyd Bacon', 'James Seymour, Rian James', 'Warner Baxter, Bebe Daniels, George Brent, Ruby Keeler, Guy Kibbee, Una Merkel, Ginger Rogers, Ned Sparks', 'NR', 'A producer puts on what may be his last Broadway show, and at the last moment a chorus girl has to replace the star.', 'A producer puts on what may be his last Broadway show, and at the last moment a chorus girl has to replace the star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4UEd8BL74zVsOOaJkKVMLMmdTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3062'),
  ('328715589223599201', '42plus', 2007, 'Drama', 'Bernhard Pötscher, Sabine Derflinger', 'Mogens Rukov, Sabine Derflinger', 'Claudia Michelsen, Ulrich Tukur, Jacob Matschenz, Petra Morzé, Tobias Moretti, Vanessa Krüger, Ugo Conti, Michele Oliveri', null, 'When the beautiful, efficient and successful Christine, 42, arrives at their summer beach home with her husband and teenage daughter, a young hitchhiker catches her eye. What follows is the story of a woman who frees herself, tears her life into pieces and puts it back together in a different order.', 'When the beautiful, efficient and successful Christine, 42, arrives at their summer beach home with her husband and teenage daughter, a young hitchhiker catches her eye. What follows is the story of a woman who frees herself, tears her life into pieces and puts it back together in a different order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3J2ZrpoMazz28WdPS9bQXWkA3jN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12108'),
  ('571095054618706820', '438 Days', 2019, 'Drama, Thriller, History', 'Jesper Ganslandt, Sophia Olsson', 'Peter Birro', 'Gustaf Skarsgård, Matias Varela, Faysal Ahmed, Nathaniel Ramabulana, Fredrik Evers, Josefin Neldén, Philip Zandén, Jesper Ganslandt', null, 'On the eve of June 28th, 2011 Swedish journalists Martin Schibbye and Johan Persson put everything at stake by illegally crossing the border from Somalia into Ethiopia. After months of research, planning and failed attempts, they were finally on their way to report on how the ruthless hunt for oil effected the population of the isolated and conflict-ridden Ogaden region. Five days later they lay wounded in the desert sand, shot and captured by the Ethiopian army. But when their initial reportage died, another story began. A story about lawlessness, propaganda and global politics. After a Kafkaesque trial they were sentenced to eleven years in prison for terrorism. And they were far from alone. Their cellmates were journalists, writers and politicians persecuted for not bowing down to dictatorship. Their reportage about oil was transformed into a story about ink, and their daily lives turned into a fight for survival inside the notorious Kality prison in Addis Ababa.', 'On the eve of June 28th, 2011 Swedish journalists Martin Schibbye and Johan Persson put everything at stake by illegally crossing the border from Somalia into Ethiopia. After months of research, planning and failed attempts, they were finally on their way to report on how the ruthless hunt for oil effected the population of the isolated and conflict-ridden Ogaden region. Five days later they lay wounded in the desert sand, shot and captured by the Ethiopian army. But when their initial reportage died, another story began. A story about lawlessness, propaganda and global politics. After a Kafkaesque trial they were sentenced to eleven years in prison for terrorism. And they were far from alone. Their cellmates were journalists, writers and politicians persecuted for not bowing down to dictatorship. Their reportage about oil was transformed into a story about ink, and their daily lives turned into a fight for survival inside the notorious Kality prison in Addis Ababa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bueoM1GAldnch1MbLBUbzVkHUWg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582943'),
  ('581763213953325403', '44 Inch Chest', 2009, 'Drama, Crime', 'Malcolm Venville, Daniel Landin, Daryn McLaughlan', 'David Scinto, Louis Mellis', 'Ray Winstone, John Hurt, Ian McShane, Tom Wilkinson, Joanne Whalley, Melvil Poupaud, Steven Berkoff, Derek Lea', 'R', 'Colin is in agony, shattered by his wife’s infidelity, so his friends kidnap the wife''s lover so he can have his revenge.', 'Colin is in agony, shattered by his wife’s infidelity, so his friends kidnap the wife''s lover so he can have his revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKuW2TzCyNstKcAGnWLXsFJxmjM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29182'),
  ('858733767515292741', '44 Minutes: The North Hollywood Shoot-Out', 2003, 'Action, TV Movie', 'Yves Simoneau, David Franco', 'Tim Metcalfe', 'Michael Madsen, Ron Livingston, Ray Baker, Douglas Spain, Andrew Bryniarski, Oleg Taktarov, Mario Van Peebles, Jullian Dulce Vida', 'R', 'After a failed bank robbery, two heavily armed men hold the Los Angeles Police Department at bay for 44 minutes.', 'After a failed bank robbery, two heavily armed men hold the Los Angeles Police Department at bay for 44 minutes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcL30rZ71NfoCQtTwPlJiLI40qr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14842'),
