  ('24557598180160886', '45 Days Away from You', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Rafael Gomes, Dhyana Mai', 'Rafael Gomes', 'Rafael de Bona, Julia Correa, Fábio Lucindo, Mayara Constantino, Ícaro Silva, Cath Johnson, Orlando Seale, Klas Lagerlund', null, 'After having broken up with his boyfriend of 8 years and having his heart broken by his rebound guy, Rafael decided to get away and meet three friends in different countries: Julia in England, Fábio in Portugal and Mayara in Argentina. They all hold a special place in his life and will provide comfort.', 'After having broken up with his boyfriend of 8 years and having his heart broken by his rebound guy, Rafael decided to get away and meet three friends in different countries: Julia in England, Fábio in Portugal and Mayara in Argentina. They all hold a special place in his life and will provide comfort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8LQ1XxacMsosNe8MbfJsBh3kYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563091'),
  ('556195443897089792', '45 Minutes from Hollywood', 1926, 'Comedy', 'Fred Guiol', null, 'Glenn Tryon, Charlotte Mineau, Theda Bara, Oliver Hardy, Stan Laurel, Jack Rube Clifford, Sally O''Neil, Edna Murphy', 'G', 'A young man visiting Hollywood on family business gets into trouble when he sees a bank robbery in progress, and thinks it is a movie scene.', 'A young man visiting Hollywood on family business gets into trouble when he sees a bank robbery in progress, and thinks it is a movie scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/66qR1eciQj7zcSqlgaCREtoitnZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50854'),
  ('376582247159776964', '45 Years', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Haigh, Lol Crawley, Gareth Tandy', 'Andrew Haigh', 'Charlotte Rampling, Tom Courtenay, Geraldine James, Dolly Wells, David Sibley, Sam Alexander, Richard Cunningham, Hannah Chalmers', 'R', 'There is just one week until Kate Mercer''s 45th wedding anniversary and the planning for the party is going well. But then a letter arrives for her husband. The body of his first love has been discovered, frozen and preserved in the icy glaciers of the Swiss Alps. By the time the party is upon them, five days later, there may not be a marriage left to celebrate.', 'There is just one week until Kate Mercer''s 45th wedding anniversary and the planning for the party is going well. But then a letter arrives for her husband. The body of his first love has been discovered, frozen and preserved in the icy glaciers of the Swiss Alps. By the time the party is upon them, five days later, there may not be a marriage left to celebrate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8elIJYYXWq2HpcZ6TgVMC9EwTnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311291'),
  ('737687970507216165', '47 Bombs', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Patryk Vega, Łukasz Łukasik, Fryderyk Kegler', 'Patryk Vega', 'Andrzej Grabowski, Przemysław Bluszcz, Jan Błachowicz, Tomasz Dedek, Sebastian Dela, Jan Hrynkiewicz, Justyna Karłowska, Michał Karmowski', null, 'When an explosion at a gas station kills a policeman, "Gebbels" from homicide is assigned to the case. The investigation leads him to the trail of a bomb maker and kidnapper, behind dozens of attacks in Poland initiating a confrontation and all-out war.', 'When an explosion at a gas station kills a policeman, "Gebbels" from homicide is assigned to the case. The investigation leads him to the trail of a bomb maker and kidnapper, behind dozens of attacks in Poland initiating a confrontation and all-out war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2VxX6vGKaObhiCm3F1Z32Scq8K6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:857700'),
  ('535764889780055241', '47 Hours to Live', 2019, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Patrick Johnson', null, 'Allie Marie Evans, Annie Hamilton, Jim Blumetti, Jordan Hopf, Alexandria DeBerry, Natalie Dickinson, Sydney Cope, Ashley Amos', null, 'Two socially awkward teenage girls, are bored one night and turn to the internet for scary stories. They find a game on a creepy website that claims you can use your phone to summon the supernatural...and if you lose the game...you lose your life.', 'Two socially awkward teenage girls, are bored one night and turn to the internet for scary stories. They find a game on a creepy website that claims you can use your phone to summon the supernatural...and if you lose the game...you lose your life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qeOoky7Xj7EevC7SGiJcIft0Ids.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615017'),
  ('449249682354098458', '47 Meters Down', 2017, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Johannes Roberts, Mark Silk, Ivanna Bolonotto', 'Ernest Riera, Johannes Roberts', 'Mandy Moore, Claire Holt, Matthew Modine, Chris Johnson, Yani Gellman, Santiago Segura, Mayra Juárez, Axel Mansilla', 'PG-13', 'Two sisters on Mexican vacation are trapped in a shark observation cage at the bottom of the ocean, with oxygen running low and great whites circling nearby, they have less than an hour of air left to figure out how to get to the surface.', 'Two sisters on Mexican vacation are trapped in a shark observation cage at the bottom of the ocean, with oxygen running low and great whites circling nearby, they have less than an hour of air left to figure out how to get to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IgdRUTdHyoI3nFORcnnYEKOGIH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403119'),
  ('1089835986279232954', '47 Meters Down: Uncaged', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Johannes Roberts, Mark Silk, Colin Jones', 'Johannes Roberts, Ernest Riera', 'Sophie Nélisse, Corinne Foxx, Brianne Tju, Sistine Rose Stallone, Brec Bassinger, John Corbett, Nia Long, Davi Santos', 'PG-13', 'Four teenage girls go on a diving adventure to explore a submerged Mayan city. Once inside, their rush of excitement turns into a jolt of terror as they discover the sunken ruins are a hunting ground for deadly great white sharks. With their air supply steadily dwindling, the friends must navigate the underwater labyrinth of claustrophobic caves and eerie tunnels in search of a way out of their watery hell.', 'Four teenage girls go on a diving adventure to explore a submerged Mayan city. Once inside, their rush of excitement turns into a jolt of terror as they discover the sunken ruins are a hunting ground for deadly great white sharks. With their air supply steadily dwindling, the friends must navigate the underwater labyrinth of claustrophobic caves and eerie tunnels in search of a way out of their watery hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4z7mDmJmx23vsVg6XNWcnXb6gc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480105'),
  ('577600325315858602', '47 Ronin', 1994, 'Action, Drama', 'Kon Ichikawa, Toshimasa Miyamura, Yukio Isohata', 'Kaneo Ikegami, Yo Takeyama, Kon Ichikawa', 'Ken Takakura, Kiichi Nakai, Rie Miyazawa, Koji Ishizaka, Ruriko Asaoka, Hisaya Morishige, Ryudo Uzaki, Tatsuo Matsumura', null, 'Kon Ichikawa''s retelling of the classic true story of Samurai honor. When a young clan lord is forced to commit seppuku (ritual suicide), his loyal followers (now Ronin, masterless Samurai) dedicate their lives to avenging his death.', 'Kon Ichikawa''s retelling of the classic true story of Samurai honor. When a young clan lord is forced to commit seppuku (ritual suicide), his loyal followers (now Ronin, masterless Samurai) dedicate their lives to avenging his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CHVXUBROZEyZjVuQ5cUAFyITKw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31334'),
  ('302993632740645516', '47 Ronin', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Fantasy', 'Carl Rinsch, Guy Bradley, Gary Jopling', 'Chris Morgan, Hossein Amini', 'Keanu Reeves, Hiroyuki Sanada, Ko Shibasaki, Tadanobu Asano, Min Tanaka, Rinko Kikuchi, Jin Akanishi, Masayoshi Haneda', 'PG-13', 'Kai—an outcast—joins Oishi, the leader of 47 outcast samurai. Together they seek vengeance upon the treacherous overlord who killed their master and banished their kind. To restore honour to their homeland, the warriors embark upon a quest that challenges them with a series of trials that would destroy ordinary warriors.', 'Kai—an outcast—joins Oishi, the leader of 47 outcast samurai. Together they seek vengeance upon the treacherous overlord who killed their master and banished their kind. To restore honour to their homeland, the warriors embark upon a quest that challenges them with a series of trials that would destroy ordinary warriors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDHnmcroujCRG0ysYQaiswjbyHd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64686'),
  ('466248103150597993', '47 Talking Corpses', 1950, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Ludovico Bragaglia, Mario Mariani, Roberto Cinquini', 'Vittorio Metz, Marcello Marchesi, Furio Scarpelli', 'Totò, Silvana Pampanini, Adriana Benetti, Dante Maggio, Tina Lattanzi, Aldo Bufi Landi, Eduardo Passarelli, Arturo Bragaglia', null, 'Greedy Baron Antonio Peletti refuses to give to his town the heredity left by his father, a box full of precious jewels, which he keeps for himself. The major and the rest of the townspeople therefore organize a trick at his expense: they''ll make him believe he is dead, and, in a fake "afterlife", they''ll try to convince him to finally show them where the money is hidden to save his soul.', 'Greedy Baron Antonio Peletti refuses to give to his town the heredity left by his father, a box full of precious jewels, which he keeps for himself. The major and the rest of the townspeople therefore organize a trick at his expense: they''ll make him believe he is dead, and, in a fake "afterlife", they''ll try to convince him to finally show them where the money is hidden to save his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCG3yIGAvxWMAIg2Wa8SPtXI2TG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57522'),
  ('921279872601266253', '48 Christmas Wishes', 2017, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Martin Buzora, Justin G. Dyck, Marco Deufemia', 'Neale Kimmel', 'Madeline Leon, Liam MacDonald, Clara Kushnir, Elizabeth Ellsworth, Maya Franzoi, Matt Schichter, Ethan Yang, Adam Crew', null, 'Holiday magic has never gleamed brighter as Santa’s Elves head out on an adventure to bring every boy and girl their Christmas wish while also bringing a family back together in this heartfelt Christmas movie from Gaumont. After accidentally destroying a bag of Christmas wishes from a small town on the eve of Christmas Eve, two junior elves learn that if even one wish goes unfulfilled, Christmas could be extinguished forever. For the first time in their lives, the elves Mindy and Cam venture out of the North Pole and sneak into Minnedoza to collect the lost wishes. Along the way they enlist the help of young Blake, whose family has a difficult time celebrating Christmas since his father died. With their deadline fast approaching, Mindy and Cam have only one more wish to find…but whose could it be? It’s up to Mindy and Cam to find out and save Christmas!', 'Holiday magic has never gleamed brighter as Santa’s Elves head out on an adventure to bring every boy and girl their Christmas wish while also bringing a family back together in this heartfelt Christmas movie from Gaumont. After accidentally destroying a bag of Christmas wishes from a small town on the eve of Christmas Eve, two junior elves learn that if even one wish goes unfulfilled, Christmas could be extinguished forever. For the first time in their lives, the elves Mindy and Cam venture out of the North Pole and sneak into Minnedoza to collect the lost wishes. Along the way they enlist the help of young Blake, whose family has a difficult time celebrating Christmas since his father died. With their deadline fast approaching, Mindy and Cam have only one more wish to find…but whose could it be? It’s up to Mindy and Cam to find out and save Christmas!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz3BdtQuWxBvjyXqhwLCdzbTxj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490410'),
  ('292615297429978903', '48 Hours a Day', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Catherine Castel', 'Serge Adam', 'Aure Atika, Antoine de Caunes, Victoria Abril, Aurore Clément, Catherine Jacob, Bernadette Lafont, Yves Jacques, Jean-Yves Chatelais', null, 'A young professional woman takes radical action to force her husband''s help with the household chores.', 'A young professional woman takes radical action to force her husband''s help with the household chores.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ksiVY99p2IXqsI6RGZgNLJrqhS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16675'),
  ('565045331482279034', '48 Hours in Purgatory', 2026, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Jason Armstrong, Nick Matthews, Mike Klassen', 'Jason Armstrong', 'Emily Alatalo, Andrew Roth, Stephanie Christiaens, Jaclyn Scobie, Jenna Jade Rain', null, 'Controversial New York filmmaker Brody Hawkins and his team launch a voyeuristic project aimed at using isolation and to push film subjects to their limit and face their inner demons, on camera. When tragedy strikes and the team begins to fray, examiners become the tested and their own ghosts begin to surface.', 'Controversial New York filmmaker Brody Hawkins and his team launch a voyeuristic project aimed at using isolation and to push film subjects to their limit and face their inner demons, on camera. When tragedy strikes and the team begins to fray, examiners become the tested and their own ghosts begin to surface.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FsSMuL7cRSl90KTkilMoTTwM9xP6.jpg', 'plex:movie:48-hours-in-purgatory'),
  ('268370675794193860', '48 Hrs.', 1982, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Walter Hill, Ric Waite', 'Walter Hill, Roger Spottiswoode, Larry Gross', 'Nick Nolte, Eddie Murphy, Annette O''Toole, Frank McRae, James Remar, David Patrick Kelly, Sonny Landham, Brion James', 'R', 'A hard-nosed cop reluctantly teams up with a wise-cracking criminal temporarily paroled to him, in order to track down a killer.', 'A hard-nosed cop reluctantly teams up with a wise-cracking criminal temporarily paroled to him, in order to track down a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvvjXHzEDBIvIVDBHNOwHS7hVPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150'),
  ('181049710156147899', '49', 2023, 'Drama, Action', 'Hakan İnan, Feza Çaldıran', 'Barış Erdoğan, İlker Arslan', 'İsmail Hacıoğlu, Hande Doğandemir, Kerem Alışık, Hasan Küçükçetin, Doğukan Polat, Sinan Tuzcu, Bade Arazlı', null, 'Following ISIS''s occupation of Mosul in 2014, members of the Turkish National Intelligence Organization (MİT) engaged in a difficult struggle to rescue 49 personnel taken captive at the Turkish Consulate General.', 'Following ISIS''s occupation of Mosul in 2014, members of the Turkish National Intelligence Organization (MİT) engaged in a difficult struggle to rescue 49 personnel taken captive at the Turkish Consulate General.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJNbyUFUt3c14CoIjLSn8ZxPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1060456'),
  ('408288593358900793', '49 Up', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Michael Apted', null, 'Bruce Balden, Jacqueline Bassett, Symon Basterfield, Andrew Brackfield, Neil Hughes, John Brisby, Paul Kligerman, Susan Sullivan', null, '49 Up is the seventh film in a series of landmark documentaries that began 42 years ago when UK-based Granada''s World in Action team, inspired by the Jesuit maxim "Give me the child until he is seven and I will give you the man," interviewed a diverse group of seven-year-old children from all over England, asking them about their lives and their dreams for the future. Michael Apted, a researcher for the original film, has returned to interview the "children" every seven years since, at ages 14, 21, 28, 35, 42 and now again at age 49.In this latest chapter, more life-changing decisions are revealed, more shocking announcements made and more of the original group take part than ever before, speaking out on a variety of subjects including love, marriage, career, class and prejudice.', '49 Up is the seventh film in a series of landmark documentaries that began 42 years ago when UK-based Granada''s World in Action team, inspired by the Jesuit maxim "Give me the child until he is seven and I will give you the man," interviewed a diverse group of seven-year-old children from all over England, asking them about their lives and their dreams for the future. Michael Apted, a researcher for the original film, has returned to interview the "children" every seven years since, at ages 14, 21, 28, 35, 42 and now again at age 49.In this latest chapter, more life-changing decisions are revealed, more shocking announcements made and more of the original group take part than ever before, speaking out on a variety of subjects including love, marriage, career, class and prejudice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRxAWWblTqTHUVNFRcEIpKpbiAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13365'),
  ('190599307172571614', '491', 1964, 'Drama', 'Vilgot Sjöman, Raymond Lundberg, Georg Riedel', 'Lars Görling', 'Lars Lind, Leif Nymark, Stig Törnblom, Lars Hansson, Sven Algotsson, Torleif Cederstrand, Bo Andersson, Lena Nyman', 'NR', 'A study in forgiveness as oppression and goodness as provocation. Six youth criminals are chosen to participate in a social experiment where they are assigned to live together in a rundown apartment in the heart of Stockholm, Sweden. The six boys are being supervised by two forgiving and uneasy social workers. Their need to continue to commit petty crimes escalates out of boredom with the situation. One night they run into a young girl in trouble.', 'A study in forgiveness as oppression and goodness as provocation. Six youth criminals are chosen to participate in a social experiment where they are assigned to live together in a rundown apartment in the heart of Stockholm, Sweden. The six boys are being supervised by two forgiving and uneasy social workers. Their need to continue to commit petty crimes escalates out of boredom with the situation. One night they run into a young girl in trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8eOGkaNjcFtLcVoiL4fnEqW0ZYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83704'),
  ('325281842375334774', '492: A Man Called Death', 2017, 'Drama, Crime', 'Henrique Goldman, Priscila Doro, Marcela Lordy', 'Henrique Goldman, Vitor Leite, George Moura', 'Marco Pigossi, Fabiula Nascimento, André Mattos, Matheus Nachtergaele, Martha Nowill, Tony Tornado, Augusto Madeira, Gillray Coutinho', 'PG-13', 'The story of Júlio Santana, a professional killer who was responsible for almost 500 hundred murders in Brazil.', 'The story of Júlio Santana, a professional killer who was responsible for almost 500 hundred murders in Brazil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zuWq18b966YUhGf47jS9YjlZqOS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480420'),
  ('39908047183390349', '49th Parallel', 1941, 'War, Thriller', 'Michael Powell, Muir Mathieson, Freddie Young', 'Rodney Ackland, Emeric Pressburger', 'Leslie Howard, Laurence Olivier, Raymond Massey, Anton Walbrook, Eric Portman, Raymond Lovell, Richard George, Niall MacGinnis', 'NR', 'In the early days of World War II, a German U-boat is sunk in Canada''s Hudson Bay. Hoping to evade capture, a small band of German soldiers led by commanding officer Lieutenant Hirth attempts to cross the border into the United States, which has not yet entered the war and is officially neutral. Along the way, the German soldiers encounter brave men such as a French-Canadian fur trapper, Johnnie, a leader of a Hutterite farming community, Peter, an author, Philip and a soldier, Andy Brock.', 'In the early days of World War II, a German U-boat is sunk in Canada''s Hudson Bay. Hoping to evade capture, a small band of German soldiers led by commanding officer Lieutenant Hirth attempts to cross the border into the United States, which has not yet entered the war and is officially neutral. Along the way, the German soldiers encounter brave men such as a French-Canadian fur trapper, Johnnie, a leader of a Hutterite farming community, Peter, an author, Philip and a soldier, Andy Brock.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4YTQv9fHYB2nZ7M2Al6wzOmrYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21735'),
  ('117534360352446540', '4bia', 2008, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Yongyoot Thongkongtoon, Banjong Pisanthanakun, Paween Purijitpanya', 'Yongyoot Thongkongtoon, Vanridee Pongsittisak, Amornthep Waewsang', 'Maneerat Kam-Uan, Witawat Singlampong, Apinya Sakuljaroensuk, Chon Wachananon, Nattapong Chatpong, Kantapat Permpoonpatcharasuk, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Attharut Kongrasri', null, 'Four directors create short films based on unique fears involving a lonely woman, a princess''s corpse, a haunted camping trip and a cursed manuscript.', 'Four directors create short films based on unique fears involving a lonely woman, a princess''s corpse, a haunted camping trip and a cursed manuscript.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lhfLZazFFNuZ2BdPdPGRhrt3qty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39111'),
  ('729762748630814053', '4D Man', 1959, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Irvin S. Yeaworth Jr., Theodore J. Pahle', 'Theodore Simonson, Cy Chermak', 'Robert Lansing, Lee Meriwether, James Congdon, Robert Strauss, Edgar Stehli, Patty Duke, Guy Raymond, Chic James', 'NR', 'Two brothers, scientists Scott and Tony Nelson, develop an amplifier which enables a person to enter a 4th dimensional state, allowing him to pass through any object. Scott experiments on himself and discovers that each time he passes through something he ages rapidly. He begins killing people, sucking out their life energies and regaining his youth as a result.', 'Two brothers, scientists Scott and Tony Nelson, develop an amplifier which enables a person to enter a 4th dimensional state, allowing him to pass through any object. Scott experiments on himself and discovers that each time he passes through something he ages rapidly. He begins killing people, sucking out their life energies and regaining his youth as a result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2i5VFcrWVDVD7dgzou2YS9Fchk7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26854'),
  ('64392648395999256', '4Got10', 2015, 'Action', 'Josh Tessier, Timothy Woodward Jr., Pablo Díez', 'Sean Ryan', 'Dolph Lundgren, Danny Trejo, Johnny Messner, Vivica A. Fox, Michael Paré, Stefania Spampinato, Erin O''Brien, Natassia Malthe', 'PG-13', 'Brian Barnes (Johnny Messner) wakes up in the desert wounded and with no memory and no idea why he''s surrounded by eight bodies, a van with four million in cash and a van full of cocaine. Brian is pursued by not only notorious drug lord Danny Perez (Danny Trejo) who desperately want his money back, and DEA Agent Rooker (Dolph Lundgren), but also a by the corrupt Sheriff Olson (Michael Pare) who will stop at nothing to get his hand on the new found fortune. On the run, Brian discovers the more he remembers the less he wants to know about who he really is.', 'Brian Barnes (Johnny Messner) wakes up in the desert wounded and with no memory and no idea why he''s surrounded by eight bodies, a van with four million in cash and a van full of cocaine. Brian is pursued by not only notorious drug lord Danny Perez (Danny Trejo) who desperately want his money back, and DEA Agent Rooker (Dolph Lundgren), but also a by the corrupt Sheriff Olson (Michael Pare) who will stop at nothing to get his hand on the new found fortune. On the run, Brian discovers the more he remembers the less he wants to know about who he really is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A8UEl6UEg8ZgXJ5ZJpPcjfzggkz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362046'),
  ('225337936046602604', '4L', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gerardo Olivares, Rafael Alvarado, Jorge Calvo', 'Chema Rodríguez, Gerardo Olivares, María Jesús Petrement', 'Jean Reno, Hovik Keuchkerian, Susana Abaitua, Arturo Valls, Enrique San Francisco, Juan Dos Santos, Francesc Garrido', null, 'To find Joseba, a dying friend, and see him reunite with his daughter Ely, two old friends, Jean Pierre and Tocho, embark with her on a road trip through the Sahara desert, from Spain to Mali.', 'To find Joseba, a dying friend, and see him reunite with his daughter Ely, two old friends, Jean Pierre and Tocho, embark with her on a road trip through the Sahara desert, from Spain to Mali.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxtvnvWdeibiDc6mU5ftAUPGofe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584427'),
  ('34797974804564634', '4N1K', 2017, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Deniz Coşkun, Mehmet Başbaran', 'Deniz Coşkun', 'Gözde Mutluer, Burak Yörük, Hasan Denizyaran, Sina Özer, Cemrehan Karakaş, Cihan Şimşek, Berke Bük, Buse Narcı', null, 'A teen tomboy has to choose between her best friends and the new boy in her life, but what happens when one of the dudes fall for her?', 'A teen tomboy has to choose between her best friends and the new boy in her life, but what happens when one of the dudes fall for her?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JXu42i7Dv4Gu6Gql8GMA6Ecpkd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459914'),
  ('721273206272852341', '4th Man Out', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Andrew Nackman, Damian Horan, Brian Papworth', 'Aaron Dancik', 'Evan Todd, Parker Young, Chord Overstreet, Jon Gabrus, Jennifer Damiano, Jordan Lane Price, Kate Flannery, Laura Harrier', 'NR', 'After a night of drinking, Adam Hutcherson stumbles out of the closet to his three straight buddies. A disruption to their dynamic which they now must try and overcome through alcohol, Tinder dates and forgiveness.', 'After a night of drinking, Adam Hutcherson stumbles out of the closet to his three straight buddies. A disruption to their dynamic which they now must try and overcome through alcohol, Tinder dates and forgiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yeDDUCQ7VUjvwsjDBFtoYDrXyvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342672'),
  ('80572078261325340', '4th Period Mystery', 2009, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Action', 'Sang-yong Lee', 'Shin Jai-ho', 'Yoo Seung-ho, Kang So-ra, Sang-geun Jo, Jeong Seok-yong, Jeon Jun-hong, Rie Young-zin, Kim Dong-beom, Jo Yun-hei', null, 'During fourth period, high schooler Da-jeong finds her classmate Tae-gyu dead in a classroom and Jeong-hun standing in front of him with blood on his clothes. In order to stop Jeong-hun from becoming the prime suspect, Da-jeong must help him find the real murderer, who is still inside the school building, under 40 minutes before period four ends.', 'During fourth period, high schooler Da-jeong finds her classmate Tae-gyu dead in a classroom and Jeong-hun standing in front of him with blood on his clothes. In order to stop Jeong-hun from becoming the prime suspect, Da-jeong must help him find the real murderer, who is still inside the school building, under 40 minutes before period four ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzTRXixblnloMJKhmt08sNhWDCn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45079'),
  ('983656844310378987', '4x4', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Mariano Cohn, Kiko de la Rica', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', 'Peter Lanzani, Dady Brieva, Luis Brandoni, Noelia Castaño, Valeria Mitidieri, Irina Matozza, Alejo Ramírez Borella, Lucas Pose', null, 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. A luxurious van is parked on the sidewalk. A man enters with the purpose of stealing whatever he can find, but when he wants to leave, he cannot. The doors do not open, the control panel does not respond: the van has become an armored box and he is trapped like a mouse.', 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. A luxurious van is parked on the sidewalk. A man enters with the purpose of stealing whatever he can find, but when he wants to leave, he cannot. The doors do not open, the control panel does not respond: the van has become an armored box and he is trapped like a mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4o3Wr0zrYot5Q3rVS7c3YlFOpYJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575769'),
