  ('790145272329126280', '5-Headed Shark Attack', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Rafael Leyva, Nico De Leon', 'Jacob Cooney, Bill Hanstock', 'Chris Bruno, Nikki Alexis Howard, Lindsay Sawyer, Jeffrey Holsman, Chris Costanzo, Amanda Méndez, Ian Daryk, Jorge Navarro', null, 'A beautiful island is home to thousands of species of aquatic life. Now there is a new species: the 5-Headed Shark is all heads and teeth. Shaped like a demented starfish, this monster terrorizes the open ocean before invading the beaches of Puerto Rico, endangering the once peaceful island paradise.', 'A beautiful island is home to thousands of species of aquatic life. Now there is a new species: the 5-Headed Shark is all heads and teeth. Shaped like a demented starfish, this monster terrorizes the open ocean before invading the beaches of Puerto Rico, endangering the once peaceful island paradise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh1zWtaScdbseIzzuiDld9Aw917.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460218'),
  ('253974820447399220', '50 First Dates', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Peter Segal, Jack N. Green, Donald B. Woodruff', 'George Wing', 'Adam Sandler, Drew Barrymore, Rob Schneider, Sean Astin, Lusia Strus, Dan Aykroyd, Amy Hill, Allen Covert', 'PG-13', 'Henry is a player skilled at seducing women. But when this veterinarian meets Lucy, a girl with a quirky problem when it comes to total recall, he realizes it''s possible to fall in love all over again…and again, and again. That''s because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.', 'Henry is a player skilled at seducing women. But when this veterinarian meets Lucy, a girl with a quirky problem when it comes to total recall, he realizes it''s possible to fall in love all over again…and again, and again. That''s because the delightful Lucy has no short-term memory, so Henry must woo her day after day until he finally sweeps her off her feet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzUI2Cg7OMfcUNv3f7MywYNBjs6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1824'),
  ('238865422318916632', '50 First Kisses', 2018, 'Romance', 'Yuichi Fukuda, Margie W. Jenkins, Yasuyuki Suzuki', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Takayuki Yamada, Masami Nagasawa, Tsuyoshi Muro, Jiro Sato, Katsuya, Taiga Nakano, Hirona Yamazaki, Shin''ya Ohwada', null, 'Daisuke Yuge works as a tour guide in Oahu, Hawaii and also studies astronomy. He meets Rui Fujishima at a cafe and falls in love with her at first sight, but Rui Fujishima suffers from memory loss due to a past accident.', 'Daisuke Yuge works as a tour guide in Oahu, Hawaii and also studies astronomy. He meets Rui Fujishima at a cafe and falls in love with her at first sight, but Rui Fujishima suffers from memory loss due to a past accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz2Ssxtx4bNiXvNluJK0loyqND9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520951'),
