  ('976179165985589902', '50 km/h', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Simone Moglie, Fabio De Luigi', 'Oliver Ziegenbalg', 'Fabio De Luigi, Stefano Accorsi, Elisa Di Eusanio, Giorgia Arena, Barbara Abbondanza, Miriam Previati, Beatrice Schiros, Vito', null, 'Two brothers reunite at their father’s funeral after many years apart. Between bitterness from the past and forgotten affection they will embark on a trip onboard their motorbikes which they built when they were children.', 'Two brothers reunite at their father’s funeral after many years apart. Between bitterness from the past and forgotten affection they will embark on a trip onboard their motorbikes which they built when they were children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y8tbZ6MP4kAyGFkgFxjwcj8VHHI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096804'),
  ('74227060558673280', '50 to 1', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jim Wilson, Tim Suhrstedt', 'Jim Wilson, Faith Conro', 'Skeet Ulrich, Christian Kane, William Devane, Madelyn Deutch, Todd Lowe, David Atkinson, Calvin Borel, Bruce Wayne Eckelman', 'PG-13', 'A misfit group of New Mexico cowboys find themselves on the journey of a lifetime when they learn their crooked-footed racehorse qualifies to run in the Kentucky Derby. Based on the true story of Mine That Bird, the cowboys must overcome impossible odds even before they reach Churchill Downs and the land of Kentucky''s blue bloods.', 'A misfit group of New Mexico cowboys find themselves on the journey of a lifetime when they learn their crooked-footed racehorse qualifies to run in the Kentucky Derby. Based on the true story of Mine That Bird, the cowboys must overcome impossible odds even before they reach Churchill Downs and the land of Kentucky''s blue bloods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIbniwxSlHyvGECiBMkTeWI0pib.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197583'),
  ('980380249870933960', '50/50', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jonathan Levine, Terry Stacey, Iris Torres', 'Will Reiser', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Seth Rogen, Anna Kendrick, Bryce Dallas Howard, Anjelica Huston, Serge Houde, Philip Baker Hall, Matt Frewer', 'R', 'Inspired by a true story, a comedy centered on a 27-year-old guy who learns of his cancer diagnosis and his subsequent struggle to beat the disease.', 'Inspired by a true story, a comedy centered on a 27-year-old guy who learns of his cancer diagnosis and his subsequent struggle to beat the disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8f9tM9JVB4ETBhxlQcXIjLckArl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40807'),
