  ('132895964990657326', '500 MPH Storm', 2013, 'Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Adventure, Drama, Thriller', 'Daniel Lusko, Richard J. Vialet', 'Hank Woon Jr, Kuang Lee', 'Casper Van Dien, Sarah Lieving, Michael Beach, Keith Meriweather, Alex Knight, Dale O´Malley, Hayley Derryberry, Bryan Head', 'PG', 'When an energy experiment goes haywire, a rash of massive hurricanes rips across North America. A high school science teacher must get his family to safety before the hurricanes merge, creating a "hypercane" with the power to wipe the US off the map.', 'When an energy experiment goes haywire, a rash of massive hurricanes rips across North America. A high school science teacher must get his family to safety before the hurricanes merge, creating a "hypercane" with the power to wipe the US off the map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/268rvZNZD7DM4D3dbE0pQQB18rT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172767'),
