  ('124286944758147220', '54', 1998, 'Drama, Music', 'Alexander Gruszynski, Mark Christopher', 'Mark Christopher', 'Ryan Phillippe, Mike Myers, Salma Hayek Pinault, Breckin Meyer, Neve Campbell, Sela Ward, Sherry Stringfield, Ellen Albertini Dow', 'R', 'When the mastermind behind New York''s infamous Studio 54 disco plucks young Shane from the sea of faces clamoring to get inside his club, he not only gets his foot in the door, but lands a coveted job behind the bar — and a front-row ticket to the most legendary party on the planet!', 'When the mastermind behind New York''s infamous Studio 54 disco plucks young Shane from the sea of faces clamoring to get inside his club, he not only gets his foot in the door, but lands a coveted job behind the bar — and a front-row ticket to the most legendary party on the planet!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLjt54vow8CEOHdgRkQCyXwbq52.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3682'),
  ('124886284524695047', '55 Days at Peking', 1963, 'History, War, Drama', 'Nicholas Ray, Jack Hildyard, Noël Howard', 'Bernard Gordon, Philip Yordan', 'Charlton Heston, Ava Gardner, David Niven, Flora Robson, John Ireland, Harry Andrews, Leo Genn, Robert Helpmann', 'NR', 'Diplomats, soldiers and other representatives of a dozen nations fend off the siege of the International Compound in Peking during the 1900 Boxer Rebellion. The disparate interests unite for survival despite competing factions, overwhelming odds, delayed relief and tacit support of the Boxers by the Empress of China and her generals.', 'Diplomats, soldiers and other representatives of a dozen nations fend off the siege of the International Compound in Peking during the 1900 Boxer Rebellion. The disparate interests unite for survival despite competing factions, overwhelming odds, delayed relief and tacit support of the Boxers by the Empress of China and her generals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uR0xaqmqlbhatf9014mHuwV1Uly.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27759'),
  ('1103610628440230643', '55 Steps', 2018, 'Drama', 'Bille August, Hilton Jamal Day, Andi Lang', 'Mark Rosin', 'Helena Bonham Carter, Hilary Swank, Jeffrey Tambor, Johan Heldenbergh, Michael Culkin, Tim Plester, Jonathan Kerrigan, Vincent Riotta', 'PG-13', 'The inspiring true story of Eleanor Riese, a mental illness patient herself, who brings a class action suit to give competent mental patients the right to have a say in their medication while they''re in a hospital, and Colette Hughes, the lawyer appointed to her case.', 'The inspiring true story of Eleanor Riese, a mental illness patient herself, who brings a class action suit to give competent mental patients the right to have a say in their medication while they''re in a hospital, and Colette Hughes, the lawyer appointed to her case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lZOzJBELeg0c24msieggqWVvjB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:445456'),
  ('1092163747993584197', '555', 1988, 'Horror', 'Wally Koz, Lamar ''Larry'' Bloodworth, Eric Toline', 'Roy Koz, Wally Koz', 'Greg Kerouac, B.K. Smith, Mara Lynn Bastian, Charles Fuller, Greg Neilson, Bob Grabill, Temple Mead, Ricardo Alverez', 'R', 'A spate of killings of teenagers by a maniac dressed like a hippie causes a detective to check the records for similar killings. He discovers that every five years, in the fifth month of the year, for five consecutive days, the same type of killings have occurred, and the few descriptions of the suspect always match: he''s dressed like a hippie. As the detective searches for the killer, he begins to have suspicions about his superior, an older man who is haunted by memories of his military service in Vietnam.', 'A spate of killings of teenagers by a maniac dressed like a hippie causes a detective to check the records for similar killings. He discovers that every five years, in the fifth month of the year, for five consecutive days, the same type of killings have occurred, and the few descriptions of the suspect always match: he''s dressed like a hippie. As the detective searches for the killer, he begins to have suspicions about his superior, an older man who is haunted by memories of his military service in Vietnam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoflFrZMsUemoc0ykP1Df94icEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82118'),
  ('684964946192789159', '56 Up', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Michael Apted, Kathryn Milliss, George Jesse Turner', null, 'Peter Davies, Neil Hughes, Tony Walker, Lynn Johnson, Susan Sullivan, Jacqueline Bassett, Paul Kligerman, Symon Basterfield', null, 'When a cross-section of seven-year-olds were interviewed for 7 Up in 1964 it was immediately evident that their social backgrounds influenced their attitudes towards life. While the upper class children were confident and self-assured, those from middle and working class backgrounds were resigned to a challenging life of hard work. This premise was put to the test every seven years when the same group were interviewed about the progression of their lives. 49 years in the making, the changes that occurred to the original 14 make for fascinating television and are in many ways the stories of all our lives. From success and disappointment, marriage and childbirth, to poverty and illness, nearly every facet of life has been captured on film. Now, at the age of 56, the group are once more brought together and, with the benefit of hindsight, assess whether their lives have been ruled by circumstance or self-determination.', 'When a cross-section of seven-year-olds were interviewed for 7 Up in 1964 it was immediately evident that their social backgrounds influenced their attitudes towards life. While the upper class children were confident and self-assured, those from middle and working class backgrounds were resigned to a challenging life of hard work. This premise was put to the test every seven years when the same group were interviewed about the progression of their lives. 49 years in the making, the changes that occurred to the original 14 make for fascinating television and are in many ways the stories of all our lives. From success and disappointment, marriage and childbirth, to poverty and illness, nearly every facet of life has been captured on film. Now, at the age of 56, the group are once more brought together and, with the benefit of hindsight, assess whether their lives have been ruled by circumstance or self-determination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1u6gxtTvaYszNRdmVNOVmMyxOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116167'),
  ('756026505264467674', '57 Seconds', 2023, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Action', 'Rusty Cundieff, Chelsea Donison, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Rusty Cundieff, Macon Blair', 'Josh Hutcherson, Morgan Freeman, Lovie Simone, Greg Germann, Bevin Bru, Sammi Rotibi, Mark Jacobson, Griff Furst', 'R', 'When a tech blogger lands an interview with a tech guru and stops an attack on him, he finds a mysterious ring that takes him back 57 seconds into the past.', 'When a tech blogger lands an interview with a tech guru and stops an attack on him, he finds a mysterious ring that takes him back 57 seconds into the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfS5qHWFuXyZQnwYREwb7N4qU5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937249'),
  ('518460315600722468', '578: Magnum', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lương Đình Dũng, Morgan Schmidt', 'Lương Đình Dũng', 'Alexandre Nguyen, Thanh Thảo, H''Hen Niê, Hoàng Phúc, Ngọc Tình, Tuấn Hạc, Jessica Minh Anh, Nguyễn Lâm Thảo Tâm', null, 'A container truck driver, Hùng, lives an idyllic life with his little daughter, An. The father and daughter become the closest companions in every journey with their orange container truck. Life goes on like that until An has to leave her father to go to school. One day, Hùng is informed that An is suffering from severe depression. Relying on his old skills in the past and finding out the truth, Hùng becomes enraged and painful to know that his little girl was kidnapped by a male stranger. Starting his lone and intense journey looking for and chasing after the unknown abuser, Hùng realizes that to hunt down that psychopath he has to counter the massive underground forces behind him.', 'A container truck driver, Hùng, lives an idyllic life with his little daughter, An. The father and daughter become the closest companions in every journey with their orange container truck. Life goes on like that until An has to leave her father to go to school. One day, Hùng is informed that An is suffering from severe depression. Relying on his old skills in the past and finding out the truth, Hùng becomes enraged and painful to know that his little girl was kidnapped by a male stranger. Starting his lone and intense journey looking for and chasing after the unknown abuser, Hùng realizes that to hunt down that psychopath he has to counter the massive underground forces behind him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Nw5v7wPfa2FwbKyx61K2nIBcKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821937'),
