  ('993957508395970719', '6 Years', 2015, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hannah Fidell, Andrew Droz Palermo, Malina Panovich', 'Hannah Fidell', 'Taissa Farmiga, Ben Rosenfield, Lindsay Burdge, Joshua Leonard, Jennifer Lafleur, Peter Vack, Dana Wheeler-Nicholson, Molly McMichael', null, 'A young couple bound by a seemingly ideal love, begins to unravel as unexpected opportunities spin them down a volatile and violent path and threaten the future they had always imagined.', 'A young couple bound by a seemingly ideal love, begins to unravel as unexpected opportunities spin them down a volatile and violent path and threaten the future they had always imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dE9kVpWI2F5jI8LGWby5t7iFwXe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323674'),
  ('916700154287340781', '6-Headed Shark Attack', 2018, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Mark Atkins, Mark Atkins, Laszlo Bene', 'Mark Atkins, Koichi Petetsky', 'Brandon Auret, Thandi Sebe, Cord Newman, Naima Sebe, Tapiwa Musvosvi, Meghan Oberholzer, Jonathan Pienaar, Nikita Faber', null, 'What is supposed to be a marriage boot camp on a remote island turns into the ultimate test for survival when a 6-headed shark starts attacking the beach. Trapped with minimal weapons they try to fight off the shark, but quickly discover that no one is safe in the water or on land.', 'What is supposed to be a marriage boot camp on a remote island turns into the ultimate test for survival when a 6-headed shark starts attacking the beach. Trapped with minimal weapons they try to fight off the shark, but quickly discover that no one is safe in the water or on land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFUBy1KaIcIs49NtThthYA6EKIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522438'),
  ('1118423165900521439', '6:3, Play It Again Tutti', 1999, null, 'Péter Tímár', 'Péter Tímár', 'Károly Eperjes, Kriszta Szalay, Tamás Cseh, András Kern, Ferenc Kállai, László Gálffi, Székely B. Miklós, Gábor Reviczky', null, 'The makers, especially Péter Tímár wanted to invoke the atmosphere of the communist dictatorship of Rákosi era lasted from 1947 to 1956. I think they''ve managed to reconstruct it very much: if you read the history books about the era and newspapers from that times, if you listened to your parents'' and grandparents'' tales, you will experience the similarities are shocking. The main character (Tutti - Károly Eperjes) is excellent, Eperjes, acting an eccentric, but likable crank is in his royal spirits.', 'The makers, especially Péter Tímár wanted to invoke the atmosphere of the communist dictatorship of Rákosi era lasted from 1947 to 1956. I think they''ve managed to reconstruct it very much: if you read the history books about the era and newspapers from that times, if you listened to your parents'' and grandparents'' tales, you will experience the similarities are shocking. The main character (Tutti - Károly Eperjes) is excellent, Eperjes, acting an eccentric, but likable crank is in his royal spirits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ji2acEgaWGMTyYAhRGC2R3TLUjU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131271'),
  ('567090592759327351', '6:45', 2021, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Craig Singer, Gabriel Gálvez, Allie Marshall', 'Robert Dean Klein', 'Michael Reed, Augie Duke, Thomas G. Waites, Sabina Friedman-Seitz, Armen Garo, Allie Marshall, Sasha K. Gordon, Remy Ma', 'R', 'A couple embarks on a weekend getaway only to find the island curiously deserted. After stumbling upon the town’s dark secret, they trigger a time loop, forcing them to relive a demented cycle of terror with seemingly no means of escape.', 'A couple embarks on a weekend getaway only to find the island curiously deserted. After stumbling upon the town’s dark secret, they trigger a time loop, forcing them to relive a demented cycle of terror with seemingly no means of escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Anqtr1Q6JuzcpZ2ZdEWeHoI4Ve6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:755135'),
  ('257362068754645234', '6/45', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Park Gyu-tae, Hong Myeong-su, Lee Si-yeon', 'Park Gyu-tae', 'Go Kyung-pyo, Lee Yi-kyung, Um Mun-suk, Park Se-wan, Kwak Dong-yeon, Lee Soon-won, Kim Min-ho, Yoon Byung-hee', null, 'A comical encounter between South and North Korean soldiers over the 5.7 billions won lottery that crossed the military demarcation line on the wind.', 'A comical encounter between South and North Korean soldiers over the 5.7 billions won lottery that crossed the military demarcation line on the wind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AifHZptVzkzLLfk2tedIQixqrgV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821153'),
  ('633796355939954263', '6/64: Mom and Dad (An Otto Mühl Happening)', 1964, null, 'Kurt Kren', null, 'Otto Muehl', null, 'In the first action he filmed, 6/64 Mama und Papa, Kren’s editing leads to many interlocking continuous shots; central takes recur like a leitmotif, circular motion and networking can be observed throughout the film. Kren painstakingly weaves the fury in front of his camera lens into dense geometrical figures. Shot/countershot sequences alternate, lumping back and forth between single (!) frames, they turn the Actionist turmoil into ornaments, rigid geometrical patterns, the equivalent in time to what Mondrian used to distill on canvas in space. (Peter Tscherkassky)', 'In the first action he filmed, 6/64 Mama und Papa, Kren’s editing leads to many interlocking continuous shots; central takes recur like a leitmotif, circular motion and networking can be observed throughout the film. Kren painstakingly weaves the fury in front of his camera lens into dense geometrical figures. Shot/countershot sequences alternate, lumping back and forth between single (!) frames, they turn the Actionist turmoil into ornaments, rigid geometrical patterns, the equivalent in time to what Mondrian used to distill on canvas in space. (Peter Tscherkassky)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zDb1f070XHz9Qrbxtt4zu3R1gCg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147748'),
  ('233539511826077053', '60 Going On 12', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Proust, Denis Gaubert', 'Frédéric Proust', 'François Berléand, Patrick Chesnais, Anne Consigny, Florence Thomassin, Élise Lhomeau, Aymen Saïdi, Guilaine Londez', null, 'Charles and Pierrot are inseparable. When Charles takes early retirement, it seems the world is their oyster. They can spend even more time together. Their motto is simple: "Make the most of life and have fun!». They fill their days with abundant imagination, under the tender and sometimes worried gaze of the women in their lives…', 'Charles and Pierrot are inseparable. When Charles takes early retirement, it seems the world is their oyster. They can spend even more time together. Their motto is simple: "Make the most of life and have fun!». They fill their days with abundant imagination, under the tender and sometimes worried gaze of the women in their lives…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ncvlKofZOTwLtqUwaiWBWv0R971.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197783'),
  ('914105474255850372', '600 Miles', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Gabriel Ripstein, Alain Marcoen, Bill Garber', 'Gabriel Ripstein, Issa López', 'Tim Roth, Kristyan Ferrer, Harrison C. Thomas, Mónica del Carmen, Craig Hensley, Julian Sedgwick, Tad Sallee, Noé Hernández', 'R', 'Arnulfo Rubio smuggles weapons from Arizona to Mexico for a drug cartel, but he is being investigated by agent Harris. When agent Harris blows his covers, he and Arnulfo end up in a journey where he will be the hostage of this young criminal.', 'Arnulfo Rubio smuggles weapons from Arizona to Mexico for a drug cartel, but he is being investigated by agent Harris. When agent Harris blows his covers, he and Arnulfo end up in a journey where he will be the hostage of this young criminal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7fUBYTaRIg6fjWiBqiDGwzToYH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:321666'),
  ('670557105459196971', '61*', 2001, 'TV Movie, Drama, History', 'Billy Crystal, Haskell Wexler', 'Hank Steinberg', 'Barry Pepper, Thomas Jane, Anthony Michael Hall, Richard Masur, Bruce McGill, Chris Bauer, Jennifer Crystal Foley, Christopher McDonald', 'R', 'In 1961, Roger Maris and Mickey Mantle played for the New York Yankees. One, Mantle, was universally loved, while the other, Maris, was universally hated. Both men started off with a bang, and both were nearing Babe Ruth''s 60 home run record. Which man would reach it?', 'In 1961, Roger Maris and Mickey Mantle played for the New York Yankees. One, Mantle, was universally loved, while the other, Maris, was universally hated. Both men started off with a bang, and both were nearing Babe Ruth''s 60 home run record. Which man would reach it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hAbxkPCC8pWYZy4kcftS3H3oku7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20536'),
  ('788938275680008846', '633 Squadron', 1964, 'Drama, War', 'Walter Grauman, Edward Scaife, Ted Sturgis', 'James Clavell, Howard Koch', 'Cliff Robertson, George Chakiris, Maria Perschy, Harry Andrews, Donald Houston, Michael Goodliffe, John Meillon, John Bonney', 'PG', 'When Norwegian resistance leader Lieutenant Erik Bergman reports the location of a German V-2 rocket fuel plant, the Royal Air Force''s 633 Squadron is assigned the mission to destroy it. The plant is in a seemingly-impregnable location beneath an overhanging cliff at the end of a long, narrow fjord lined with anti-aircraft guns. The only way to destroy the plant is by collapsing the cliff on top of it.', 'When Norwegian resistance leader Lieutenant Erik Bergman reports the location of a German V-2 rocket fuel plant, the Royal Air Force''s 633 Squadron is assigned the mission to destroy it. The plant is in a seemingly-impregnable location beneath an overhanging cliff at the end of a long, narrow fjord lined with anti-aircraft guns. The only way to destroy the plant is by collapsing the cliff on top of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3q2hKa7h1xuXYlXX0IYCWD8V90a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15925'),
  ('524302899485846497', '64: Part 1', 2016, 'Mystery', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kōichi Saitō, Atsushi Unno', 'Shinichi Hisamatsu, Takahisa Zeze', 'Koichi Sato, Go Ayano, Nana Eikura, Yui Natsukawa, Naoto Ogata, Masataka Kubota, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Michitaka Tsutsui', null, '1989: 64th and last year of the Showa era. A girl is kidnapped and killed. The unsolved case is called Case 64 (''rokuyon''). 2002: Yoshinobu Mikami, who was the detective in charge of the Case 64, moves as a Public Relations Officer in the Police Affairs Department. His relation with the reporters is conflicted and his own daughter is missing. The statute of limitations for the Case 64 will expire in one year. Then a kidnapping case, similar to the Case 64, takes place. The rift between the criminal investigation department and police administration department deepens. Mikami challenges the case as a public relations secretary.', '1989: 64th and last year of the Showa era. A girl is kidnapped and killed. The unsolved case is called Case 64 (''rokuyon''). 2002: Yoshinobu Mikami, who was the detective in charge of the Case 64, moves as a Public Relations Officer in the Police Affairs Department. His relation with the reporters is conflicted and his own daughter is missing. The statute of limitations for the Case 64 will expire in one year. Then a kidnapping case, similar to the Case 64, takes place. The rift between the criminal investigation department and police administration department deepens. Mikami challenges the case as a public relations secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySjUW04IbJdWhgFc3X5ArZTnMhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408842'),
  ('783571377780804785', '64: Part 2', 2016, 'Mystery', 'Takahisa Zeze, Kōichi Saitō, Atsushi Unno', 'Shinichi Hisamatsu, Takahisa Zeze', 'Koichi Sato, Go Ayano, Nana Eikura, Yui Natsukawa, Naoto Ogata, Masataka Kubota, Kentaro Sakaguchi, Michitaka Tsutsui', null, '1989: 64th and last year of the Showa era. A girl is kidnapped and killed. The unsolved case is called Case 64 (''rokuyon''). 2002: Yoshinobu Mikami, who was the detective in charge of the Case 64, moves as a Public Relations Officer in the Police Affairs Department. His relation with the reporters is conflicted and his own daughter is missing. The statute of limitations for the Case 64 will expire in one year. Then a kidnapping case, similar to the Case 64, takes place. The rift between the criminal investigation department and police administration department deepens. Mikami challenges the case as a public relations secretary.', '1989: 64th and last year of the Showa era. A girl is kidnapped and killed. The unsolved case is called Case 64 (''rokuyon''). 2002: Yoshinobu Mikami, who was the detective in charge of the Case 64, moves as a Public Relations Officer in the Police Affairs Department. His relation with the reporters is conflicted and his own daughter is missing. The statute of limitations for the Case 64 will expire in one year. Then a kidnapping case, similar to the Case 64, takes place. The rift between the criminal investigation department and police administration department deepens. Mikami challenges the case as a public relations secretary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jaZPU1NiDb6mIdooT5d8jTfqooa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408843'),
  ('581813752125956024', '65', 2023, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Salvatore Totino, Kelly Curley, Chris Craine', 'Bryan Woods, Scott Beck', 'Adam Driver, Ariana Greenblatt, Chloe Coleman, Nika King, Brian Dare', 'PG-13', '65 million years ago, the only 2 survivors of a spaceship from Somaris that crash-landed on Earth, must fend off dinosaurs to reach the escape vessel in time before an imminent asteroid strike threatens to destroy the planet.', '65 million years ago, the only 2 survivors of a spaceship from Somaris that crash-landed on Earth, must fend off dinosaurs to reach the escape vessel in time before an imminent asteroid strike threatens to destroy the planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rzRb63TldOKdKydCvWJM8B6EkPM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:700391'),
  ('323847657963247676', '66 Scenes from America', 1982, 'Documentary', 'Jørgen Leth, Dan Holmberg', 'Ole John', 'Jørgen Leth, Andy Warhol, Kim Larsen', null, 'As a visual narrative it is reminiscent of a pile of postcards from a journey, which indeed is what the film is. It consists of a series of lengthy shots of a tableau nature, each appearing to be a more or less random cross section of American reality, but which in total invoke a highly emblematic picture of the USA.', 'As a visual narrative it is reminiscent of a pile of postcards from a journey, which indeed is what the film is. It consists of a series of lengthy shots of a tableau nature, each appearing to be a more or less random cross section of American reality, but which in total invoke a highly emblematic picture of the USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVXGdi27vR46ecBZyvKoRT1AP7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83909'),
  ('78716179378156073', '666: In Bed with the Devil', 2002, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Rainer Matsutani, Hans-Günther Bücking', 'Rainer Matsutani', 'Jan Josef Liefers, Armin Rohde, Sonsee Neu, Ralf Bauer, Thure Riefenstein, Mariella Ahrens, Hanns Zischler, Wolfgang Maria Bauer', null, 'Frank Faust is a born loser. At some point it even becomes too much for his great love, Jennifer, who leaves him and flees to Munich. Frank''s desperation is the best reason for Mephisto to show up and offer a suitable pact: reconciliation with Jennifer in exchange for Frank''s soul. Shaken by his predicament, Frank finds it easy to agree to the hellish proposal. In order to win back his renegade lover, Mephisto transforms himself into a wide variety of prominent contemporaries who appear at Frank''s side and publicly praise his qualities - especially for Jennifer to hear. The plan seems to be working perfectly, unless Mephisto suddenly reveals a completely new side to his personality...', 'Frank Faust is a born loser. At some point it even becomes too much for his great love, Jennifer, who leaves him and flees to Munich. Frank''s desperation is the best reason for Mephisto to show up and offer a suitable pact: reconciliation with Jennifer in exchange for Frank''s soul. Shaken by his predicament, Frank finds it easy to agree to the hellish proposal. In order to win back his renegade lover, Mephisto transforms himself into a wide variety of prominent contemporaries who appear at Frank''s side and publicly praise his qualities - especially for Jennifer to hear. The plan seems to be working perfectly, unless Mephisto suddenly reveals a completely new side to his personality...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxJ2foBwKrz5FAekGFmyudfHrma.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11714'),
  ('94328318428391933', '666: The Child', 2006, 'Horror', 'Jack Perez, Lucia Diaz Sas', null, 'Robert Pike Daniel, Sarah Lieving, Kim Little, Booboo Stewart, Adam Vincent, Rodney Bowman, Nora J. Novak, Bob McEwen', 'NR', 'A jet liner plummets from the sky and crashes into the earth. From the burning embers rises one lone survivor - a small boy! But the childless couple that adopts him will soon discover he is no helpless child, but rather something very powerful, something very dark. This small boy is the Beast and with him he carries the Beginning of the End.', 'A jet liner plummets from the sky and crashes into the earth. From the burning embers rises one lone survivor - a small boy! But the childless couple that adopts him will soon discover he is no helpless child, but rather something very powerful, something very dark. This small boy is the Beast and with him he carries the Beginning of the End.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nwT0Mq5qAaXIYLLqy4T1yhq7n7Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42289'),
  ('934691038641473152', '68 Kill', 2017, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Matthew Sewell, Trent Haaga, Needham B. Smith', 'Trent Haaga', 'Matthew Gray Gubler, AnnaLynne McCord, Alisha Boe, Sheila Vand, Sam Eidson, Lucy Faust, Eric Podnar, Hallie Grace Bradley', null, 'Chip''s problem is that he can''t say no to beautiful women. This weakness gets him into a world of trouble when he agrees to help his girlfriend steal $68,000.', 'Chip''s problem is that he can''t say no to beautiful women. This weakness gets him into a world of trouble when he agrees to help his girlfriend steal $68,000.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80ifMmWcNMQ8uD4DTyMFEuJbEJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367462'),
  ('389942132077577204', '69', 2004, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Sang-il Lee, Kōzō Shibazaki', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Masanobu Ando, Yuta Kanai, Asami Mizukawa, Rina Ohta, Yoko Mitsuya, Hirofumi Arai, Hideko Hara', null, 'Hoping to catch a girl''s attention, high school students Ken and Adama cook up an ambitious plan. They plan a festival that combines film, theater, and rock music, and develop their project into a school road block. This plan however catches the attention of television stations and newspapers, and soon even the cops became involved in this teenage adventure.', 'Hoping to catch a girl''s attention, high school students Ken and Adama cook up an ambitious plan. They plan a festival that combines film, theater, and rock music, and develop their project into a school road block. This plan however catches the attention of television stations and newspapers, and soon even the cops became involved in this teenage adventure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gwEo6SJ1ZUAqx9htDsGnwK4Vadf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119776'),
  ('846381405735943159', '69', 2025, 'Drama', 'Bel Paquiz, Rosswil Hilario, Roni S. Benaid', 'King Abalos', 'Aliya Raymundo, Ashley Lopez, Mhack Morales, Queenie De Mesa, Juan Calma, Paula Santos, Rufina Gelstone, Phoebe Nicole Laru-an', null, 'Five lives. One city. In the heart of Manila, their stories intertwine through desire, heartbreak, and the rawness of life.', 'Five lives. One city. In the heart of Manila, their stories intertwine through desire, heartbreak, and the rawness of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7s0S70dwEOhrIGMV2nowoN9eqCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1523667'),
  ('79331596146068055', '6ixtynin9', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang, Chankit Chamnivikaipong, Chedpong Laoyant', 'Pen-Ek Ratanaruang', 'Lalita Panyopas, Black Phomtong, Aroon Wanasbodeewong, Tasanawalai Ongartittichai, Sirisin Siripornsmathikul, Jaran Petcharoen, Wiwat Thongprasertsom, Surapol Mekpongsatorn', 'R', 'A woman, fired from a financial corporation during the Asia crisis, returns home with no money. However, she finds a box with a fortune in front of her door, and decides to keep it. However, the people that left it there soon want it back.', 'A woman, fired from a financial corporation during the Asia crisis, returns home with no money. However, she finds a box with a fortune in front of her door, and decides to keep it. However, the people that left it there soon want it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9hHVuHQX3yTDDUtuIezDz3YC34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33253'),
  ('438277182850035620', '7 and 8', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Giambattista Avellino, Filippo Orobello, Roberto Forza', 'Fabrizio Testini', 'Salvatore Ficarra, Valentino Picone, Eleonora Abbagnato, Barbara Tabita, Arnoldo Foà, Andrea Tidona, Tony Sperandeo, Lucia Sardo', null, '6th January 1975, in an infant nursery in Palermo (Italy), for a mysterious reason, a male nurse exchanges the labels of baby number 7 and 8. Thirty-one years later Tommaso (7) and Daniele (8) meet each other by accident.', '6th January 1975, in an infant nursery in Palermo (Italy), for a mysterious reason, a male nurse exchanges the labels of baby number 7 and 8. Thirty-one years later Tommaso (7) and Daniele (8) meet each other by accident.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bI6iauRIdIHQMrKTa34Vn6UuGre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48175'),
  ('245154108739569590', '7 años de matrimonio', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Joel Núñez, Juan Hernández', 'Natalia Armienta', 'Roberto Palazuelos, Ximena Herrera, Ximena Herrera, Cristián de la Fuente, Fernando Becerril, Alex Sirvent, María Sorté, Alejandra Procuna', null, 'Ana and Alberto get married. Their best friends warn them about the seven year itch: the usual time when a couple starts experiencing big problems in their relationship. We will follow Ana and Alberto on their marriage until they reach their seven year itch.', 'Ana and Alberto get married. Their best friends warn them about the seven year itch: the usual time when a couple starts experiencing big problems in their relationship. We will follow Ana and Alberto on their marriage until they reach their seven year itch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vvjGcr40mSJa8gz1i5x4YPstp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164300'),
  ('666483022337403771', '7 Assassins', 2013, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, History', 'Xiong Xinxin', 'Zhang Xinyue, Wilson Mak Yiu-Kuen, Xiong Xinxin', 'Felix Wong Yat-Wah, Max Mok Siu-Chung, Xiong Xinxin, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Michael Tong Man-Lung, Power Chan Kwok-Pong, Ray Lui, Michael Wong', 'R', 'When social unrest plagues a Kingdom in ancient China, the Imperial Court collects stockpiles of gold from local governments to expand the royal army. However, the gold is robbed while in transport. In a desperate move to retrieve the stolen treasure, elite royal guards are sent on a mission to go after the gold but soon find out they are not the only ones in pursuit of it.', 'When social unrest plagues a Kingdom in ancient China, the Imperial Court collects stockpiles of gold from local governments to expand the royal army. However, the gold is robbed while in transport. In a desperate move to retrieve the stolen treasure, elite royal guards are sent on a mission to go after the gold but soon find out they are not the only ones in pursuit of it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nSglRjCNh6BIYZ0HPlN5QKRquzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241375'),
  ('360352385485294962', '7 Below', 2012, 'Horror', 'Kevin Carraway', 'Kevin Carraway, Lawrence Sara', 'Val Kilmer, Ving Rhames, Luke Goss, Bonnie Somerville, Matt Barr, Christian Baha, Brianna Lee Johnson, Rebecca Da Costa', 'R', 'A group of strangers is trapped in a time warp house where a terrible event transpired exactly 100 years prior.', 'A group of strangers is trapped in a time warp house where a terrible event transpired exactly 100 years prior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qP7tRnSpuQngVD7MPnHH3yqewiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84577'),
  ('806561433473051601', '7 Boxes', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Tana Schémbori, Juan Carlos Maneglia, Richard Careaga', 'Tito Chamorro, Tana Schémbori', 'Celso Franco, Lali González, Víctor Sosa, Nico García, Paletita, Manu Portillo, Mario Toñánez, Nelly Davalos', null, 'It’s Friday night in Asunción and the temperature is 40ºC. Víctor, a 17-year-old wheelbarrow-boy, dreams of becoming famous and covets a cell phone in Mercado 4. He is offered the chance to deliver seven boxes with unknown contents in exchange for $100. This sounds like an easy job but it soon gets complicated. Something in the boxes is highly coveted. Víctor and his persecutors find themselves caught up in a crime they know nothing about.', 'It’s Friday night in Asunción and the temperature is 40ºC. Víctor, a 17-year-old wheelbarrow-boy, dreams of becoming famous and covets a cell phone in Mercado 4. He is offered the chance to deliver seven boxes with unknown contents in exchange for $100. This sounds like an easy job but it soon gets complicated. Something in the boxes is highly coveted. Víctor and his persecutors find themselves caught up in a crime they know nothing about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8RjbBaeMaMpdBZIzd6FWYxW7xHv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127847'),
  ('101100792981210729', '7 Days', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Fernando Kalife, Gonzalo Amat', 'Fernando Kalife', 'Jaime Camil, Martha Higareda, Eduardo Arroyuelo, Julio Bracho, Lumi Cavazos, José Sefami, Beto Cuevas, Sofía Vergara', null, 'Claudio Caballero decides to gamble $500,000 dollars in a desperate attempt to raise the cash necessary to bring the world''s biggest band (U2) to Mexico.', 'Claudio Caballero decides to gamble $500,000 dollars in a desperate attempt to raise the cash necessary to bring the world''s biggest band (U2) to Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9lbmZOn3duALZJ3jpEhp0oppgA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34320'),
  ('834970651448107599', '7 Days', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rolando Colla', 'Heloïse Adam, Nicole Borgeat, Rolando Colla', 'Alessia Barela, Bruno Todeschini, Gianfelice Imparato, Marc Barbé, Aurora Quattrocchi, Linda Olsansky, Fabrizio Pizzuto, Benedetto Raneli', null, 'Ivan and Chiara meet on a Sicilian island to prepare the wedding for Ivan’s brother and Chiara’s best friend. Despite the fact that Ivan is determined not to repeat the failure of his last relationship and Chiara does not want to jeopardise her marriage, the two fall in love with each other. They resolve to live their relationship for only a few days and then break it off when the wedding guests arrive on the island. But can love be controlled? Or is it love that controls us?', 'Ivan and Chiara meet on a Sicilian island to prepare the wedding for Ivan’s brother and Chiara’s best friend. Despite the fact that Ivan is determined not to repeat the failure of his last relationship and Chiara does not want to jeopardise her marriage, the two fall in love with each other. They resolve to live their relationship for only a few days and then break it off when the wedding guests arrive on the island. But can love be controlled? Or is it love that controls us?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6joXDbqWqwRqUrEDhOGk7NL0mAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419314'),
  ('351837277212186506', '7 Days', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Roshan Sethi, Jeremy Mackie', 'Roshan Sethi, Karan Soni', 'Karan Soni, Geraldine Viswanathan, Zenobia Shroff, Gita Reddy, Vinny Chhibber, Asif Ali, Mark Duplass, Deborah Baker Jr.', null, 'As if their pre-arranged date, organized by their traditional Indian parents, wasn’t uncomfortable enough, Ravi and Rita are forced to shelter in place together as COVID-19’s reach intensifies. Hopefully for their sake, opposites do indeed attract.', 'As if their pre-arranged date, organized by their traditional Indian parents, wasn’t uncomfortable enough, Ravi and Rita are forced to shelter in place together as COVID-19’s reach intensifies. Hopefully for their sake, opposites do indeed attract.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fyryw1EQxm5FNuLfo7Q8ytfey3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821046'),
  ('229391707452671594', '7 Days in Entebbe', 2018, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Fraser Fennell-Ball, Richard Selway, Richard Graysmark', 'Gregory Burke', 'Rosamund Pike, Daniel Brühl, Eddie Marsan, Lior Ashkenazi, Nonso Anozie, Ben Schnetzer, Andrea Deck, Denis Ménochet', 'PG-13', 'In 1976, four hijackers take over an Air France airplane en route from Tel Aviv to Paris and force it to land in Entebbe, Uganda. With 248 passengers on board, one of the most daring rescue missions ever is set in motion.', 'In 1976, four hijackers take over an Air France airplane en route from Tel Aviv to Paris and force it to land in Entebbe, Uganda. With 248 passengers on board, one of the most daring rescue missions ever is set in motion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrC63ikbK4jDp3knvBqxPoWYEMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:433627'),
  ('160348620694848454', '7 Days in Havana', 2012, 'Drama', 'Laurent Cantet, Benicio del Toro, Julio Medem', 'Leonardo Padura', 'Josh Hutcherson, Daniel Brühl, Emir Kusturica, Elia Suleiman, Sebastián Barriuso, Rebeca Proenza, Vladimir Cruz, Daisy Granados', null, 'A lesbian, an aspiring actor, an aspiring singer, a low-class marriage, a neighborhood community and 2 renowned directors have memorable less-than-24-hour-long experiences while living in/visiting the capital of Cuba.', 'A lesbian, an aspiring actor, an aspiring singer, a low-class marriage, a neighborhood community and 2 renowned directors have memorable less-than-24-hour-long experiences while living in/visiting the capital of Cuba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5ljh9Oaxjd3nqJVW8IcppoVW9U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94904'),
  ('432927800146677098', '7 Days in Heaven', 2010, 'Family, Drama', 'Essay Liu, Wang Yu-lin', 'Essay Liu', 'Garance Wang, Wu Pong-fong, Tai Bo, Winnie Chang, Chen Tai-Hua, Jia-Xiang Chen', null, '"Seven Days in Heaven" covers the 7 days of the Taoist morning ritual after the death of Lin Guo Yuan (Po Tai). The movie examines the effects of his death on his children, nephew, and sister-in-law ...', '"Seven Days in Heaven" covers the 7 days of the Taoist morning ritual after the death of Lin Guo Yuan (Po Tai). The movie examines the effects of his death on his children, nephew, and sister-in-law ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ppenquDx3OgMslJSQ9QORP718tj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183410'),
