  ('265477211315513444', '7 Days of Himawari & Her Puppies', 2013, 'Drama', 'Emiko Hiramatsu, Katsumi Ishikawa, Masashi Chikamori', 'Emiko Hiramatsu', 'Masato Sakai, Miki Nakatani, Rei Dan, Kanata Fujimoto, Denden, Masayasu Wakabayashi', null, 'Set within an animal shelter, where if the owner of an animal doesn''t claim their pet in 7 days, the animal is put to sleep. Himawari, is a female dog and a mother. She tries to desperately save her baby dogs.', 'Set within an animal shelter, where if the owner of an animal doesn''t claim their pet in 7 days, the animal is put to sleep. Himawari, is a female dog and a mother. She tries to desperately save her baby dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9rSJaSUEQbiMEcr9zNWo0SQPUEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223391'),
  ('25245156106381430', '7 Days to Live', 2000, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Sebastian Niemann, Gerhard Schirlo', 'Dirk Ahner', 'Nick Brimble, Renee Ackermann, Zdeněk Maryška, Rich Gold, Amanda Plummer, Sean Pertwee, Sean Chapman, Chris Barnes', null, 'A grieving woman suffers terrifying visions of her own demise after she and her husband move into a country mansion.', 'A grieving woman suffers terrifying visions of her own demise after she and her husband move into a country mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lalEkaTYF87Srr1KHXVUaHCTBkw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10558'),
  ('264041127851641374', '7 Dogs', 2026, 'Action, Comedy', 'Adil El Arbi, Bilall Fallah, Andrew Banwell', 'Mohamed El Dabbah', 'Karim Abdel Aziz, Ahmed Ezz, Menna Shalabi, Hana Al Zahed, Tara Emad, Nasser Al Qasabi, Sayed Ragab, Salman Khan', null, 'Interpol agent Khalid Al-Azzazi joins forces with Ghali Abu Dawood from the 7 Dogs crime syndicate to fight drug trafficking.', 'Interpol agent Khalid Al-Azzazi joins forces with Ghali Abu Dawood from the 7 Dogs crime syndicate to fight drug trafficking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIzQNTfPdS8vRjhzXnqr2Xbh5AV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1316427'),
  ('338833890188981769', '7 Dwarves: The Forest Is Not Enough', 2006, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Peter von Haller', 'Bernd Eilert, Otto Waalkes, Sven Unterwaldt Jr.', 'Otto Waalkes, Mirco Nontschew, Boris Aljinovic, Ralf Schmitz, Gustav Peter Wöhler, Martin Schneider, Norbert Heisterkamp, Axel Neumann', null, 'Snow White asks the seven dwarfs for help, because if they don''t manage to find out the name of a little boy (Rumpelstiltskin) within two days, her newborn child will be taken away from her. The journey takes the dwarves to a depressive, rhyming Pinocchio and the omniscient wizard Helge, among others, and all the way to the world of humans.', 'Snow White asks the seven dwarfs for help, because if they don''t manage to find out the name of a little boy (Rumpelstiltskin) within two days, her newborn child will be taken away from her. The journey takes the dwarves to a depressive, rhyming Pinocchio and the omniscient wizard Helge, among others, and all the way to the world of humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x9fLyw1ihuyLodGnHvfFoKWq2su.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10036'),
  ('261721935732153254', '7 Emotions', 2018, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Marek Koterski, Jerzy Zieliński', 'Marek Koterski', 'Michał Koterski, Marcin Dorociński, Katarzyna Figura, Małgorzata Bogdańska, Gabriela Muskała, Maria Ciunelis, Andrzej Mastalerz, Tomasz Karolak', null, 'Fear, anger, sadness, joy, disgust, envy, shame. Adaś Miauczyński goes back to his childhood days when, like most of us, he used to find it problematic to name the emotions that accompanied him. To improve the quality of his adult life, he decides to return to that time – which proves not so carefree after all – to learn how to experience the seven basic emotions. This extremely unpredictable journey into the past features an abundance of hilarious, even comical, situations but is also filled with lots of touching moments and food for thought.', 'Fear, anger, sadness, joy, disgust, envy, shame. Adaś Miauczyński goes back to his childhood days when, like most of us, he used to find it problematic to name the emotions that accompanied him. To improve the quality of his adult life, he decides to return to that time – which proves not so carefree after all – to learn how to experience the seven basic emotions. This extremely unpredictable journey into the past features an abundance of hilarious, even comical, situations but is also filled with lots of touching moments and food for thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ac1DIjgHV8ogmuXvDqO2wsG2XLq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548762'),
  ('601788488557826022', '7 Faces of Dr. Lao', 1964, 'Fantasy, Family, Western, Comedy', 'Robert J. Bronner, Al Shenberg, George Pal', 'Charles Beaumont', 'Tony Randall, Barbara Eden, Arthur O''Connell, John Ericson, Noah Beery Jr., Lee Patrick, Minerva Urecal, John Qualen', 'NR', 'An old Chinese man rides into the town of Abalone, Arizona and changes it forever, as the citizens see themselves reflected in the mirror of Lao''s mysterious circus of mythical beasts.', 'An old Chinese man rides into the town of Abalone, Arizona and changes it forever, as the citizens see themselves reflected in the mirror of Lao''s mysterious circus of mythical beasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dwUTdtGUDmCb3Tiz6iTzBuONGTQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14241'),
  ('562379991747898379', '7 Guardians of the Tomb', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Kimble Rendall, Brad Shield, John Andersen', 'Kimble Rendall, Paul Staheli', 'Li Bingbing, Kellan Lutz, Kelsey Grammer, Wu Chun, Stef Dawson, Shane Jacobson, Ryan Johnson, Jason Chong', 'PG-13', 'An innocent discovery of a well-preserved mummified Emperor from 200 BC China unearths a 2000 year old nightmare - a secret that should have remained buried.', 'An innocent discovery of a well-preserved mummified Emperor from 200 BC China unearths a 2000 year old nightmare - a secret that should have remained buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ca799tQJwj4lkkQpBdXohlvEtuQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409582'),
  ('744067428145502216', '‎7 Hours to Win Your Heart', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Raffaele Verzillo, Gianluca Ansanelli, Giampaolo Morelli', 'Gianluca Ansanelli, Giampaolo Morelli', 'Giampaolo Morelli, Serena Rossi, Diana Del Bufalo, Massimiliano Gallo, Gianni Ferreri, Fabio Balsamo, Gigio Morra, Salvatore Misticone', null, 'When his girlfriend Giorgia leaves him for his boss, journalist Giulio suddenly finds himself without a woman and with no job. Determined to win back his ex, he attends Valeria''s classes, who teaches single men the art of seduction, convinced that relationships between people are motivated by simple biological stimuli.', 'When his girlfriend Giorgia leaves him for his boss, journalist Giulio suddenly finds himself without a woman and with no job. Determined to win back his ex, he attends Valeria''s classes, who teaches single men the art of seduction, convinced that relationships between people are motivated by simple biological stimuli.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhho6s14PwqceHXEx6D4D4uBEHw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:614418'),
  ('1010607480156124563', '7 Husbands for Hurmuz', 2009, 'Comedy, History, Romance, Music', 'Ezel Akay, Doğu Kaan Can, Fizuli Caferoğlu', 'Gürsel Korat Sağlamöz', 'Nurgül Yeşilçay, Gülse Birsel, Haluk Bilginer, Erkan Can, Memet Ali Alabora, Sarp Apak, Cengiz Küçükayvaz, Öner Erkan', null, 'Remake of a well-known Turkish musical comedy loved by generations, the film is about the adventures of flirtatious Hurmuz in late 1800''s Istanbul. Hurmuz who lives in Taskasap, Istanbul has six husbands in a plot to solve her economic problems. She arranges to meet each of her husbands one day of the week. However, suddenly, she falls in love with the town''s doctor whom she meets at her husband''s barber shop. The doctor falls in love with her too... But, one night all six husbands come home at the same time, and Hurmuz and Safinaz - Hurmuz''s "go-between/accomplice/friend" - find themselves in a series of very awkward yet funny situations.', 'Remake of a well-known Turkish musical comedy loved by generations, the film is about the adventures of flirtatious Hurmuz in late 1800''s Istanbul. Hurmuz who lives in Taskasap, Istanbul has six husbands in a plot to solve her economic problems. She arranges to meet each of her husbands one day of the week. However, suddenly, she falls in love with the town''s doctor whom she meets at her husband''s barber shop. The doctor falls in love with her too... But, one night all six husbands come home at the same time, and Hurmuz and Safinaz - Hurmuz''s "go-between/accomplice/friend" - find themselves in a series of very awkward yet funny situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLgQO8D6oPfZCnQSs6kmHVmIkBw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38547'),
  ('961999977075421733', '7 Khoon Maaf', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Vishal Bhardwaj, Manjari Makijany, Ranjan Palit', 'Matthew Robbins, Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Vivaan Shah, Konkona Sen Sharma, Neil Nitin Mukesh, Usha Uthup, Harish Khanna, Ayush Tandon, John Abraham', null, 'Susanna is hungry for love and will go to any extent to find it in its purest form. In her quest for the perfect man, she gets married a number of times as each of her husband''s die mysteriously.', 'Susanna is hungry for love and will go to any extent to find it in its purest form. In her quest for the perfect man, she gets married a number of times as each of her husband''s die mysteriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aLJEqWXMqdboAOee3C4zGl6UFf1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56338'),
  ('375960941438626697', '7 Kilos in 7 Days', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Luca Verdone, Filippo Ascione, Mimì Sansone', 'Leonardo Benvenuti, Piero De Bernardi, Luca Verdone', 'Renato Pozzetto, Carlo Verdone, Silvia Annichiarico, Tiziana Pini, Elena Fabrizi, Franco Diogene, Franco Adducci, Annabella Schiavone', null, 'Two not very clever young doctors open a fitness center and promise to let people lose seven kilos in seven days. When the enterprise fails they open a gourmet restaurant.', 'Two not very clever young doctors open a fitness center and promise to let people lose seven kilos in seven days. When the enterprise fails they open a gourmet restaurant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cDrT8Jt5LXmEPVfb4YN2Qm33I5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43211'),
