  ('556056136948383889', '7 Mummies', 2006, 'Horror, Action', 'Nick Quested, Patrick Loungway', 'Thadd Turner', 'Cerina Vincent, Billy Wirth, Billy Drago, Andrew Bryniarski, Danny Trejo, James Intveld, Martin Kove, Noel Gugliemi', 'NR', 'Six escaped convicts and their female hostage make a desperate run for the Mexican border, where they stumble across a lost treasure of untold wealth, and find certain death instead on the Arizona desert.', 'Six escaped convicts and their female hostage make a desperate run for the Mexican border, where they stumble across a lost treasure of untold wealth, and find certain death instead on the Arizona desert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLDID7iNxhOZtf6AZEMWAQAbdoG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7292'),
  ('322782153171306346', '7 Pecados Rurais', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Miguel Sales Lopes, Nicolau Breyner', 'Henrique Cardoso Dias, Frederico Pombares', 'Pedro Alves, João Paulo Rodrigues, Alda Gomes, Melânia Gomes, Patrícia Tavares, José Raposo, Nicolau Breyner, Quim Barreiros', null, 'In "7 Pecados Rurais", Quim and Zé go to Lisbon to collect two distant cousins ​​who want to revive a crazy last summer in Curral de Moinas. Along the way they bump into a flock of sheep and die.', 'In "7 Pecados Rurais", Quim and Zé go to Lisbon to collect two distant cousins ​​who want to revive a crazy last summer in Curral de Moinas. Along the way they bump into a flock of sheep and die.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgbYWBAVmKkxC7WzIWktV5ekvgH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210070'),
  ('50934400610238419', '7 Plus Seven', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Michael Apted', null, 'Lynn Johnson, Tony Walker, Jacqueline Bassett, Charles Furneaux, Bruce Balden, Andrew Brackfield, Neil Hughes, Nicholas Hitchon', null, 'After a 7 year wait, director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born children from Seven Up! The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.', 'After a 7 year wait, director Michael Apted revisits the same group of British-born children from Seven Up! The subjects are interviewed as to the changes that have occurred in their lives during the last seven years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vS9ONmc4V4Hoi02WNnSGHnOyGg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50754'),
  ('236927247187694665', '7 Prisoners', 2021, 'Drama, Crime', 'João Gabriel de Queiroz, Alexandre Moratto', 'Thayná Mantesso, Alexandre Moratto', 'Christian Malheiros, Rodrigo Santoro, Bruno Rocha, Lucas Oranmian, Vitor Julian, Cecília Homem de Mello, André Abujamra, Josias Duarte', null, 'An impoverished teen seeking to escape the clutches of a human trafficker must weigh living up to his moral code against his struggle to survive.', 'An impoverished teen seeking to escape the clutches of a human trafficker must weigh living up to his moral code against his struggle to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5svMKCGnR6Yvj8wxldvDvgUi0Jk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:785538'),
  ('79316979187949090', '7 Seconds', 2005, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Simon Fellows, Michael Slovis, Fotea Alex', 'Martin Wheeler', 'Wesley Snipes, Tamzin Outhwaite, Deobia Oparei, Georgina Rylance, Pete Lee-Wilson, Adrian Lukis, Stephen Boxer, Adrian Pintea', 'R', 'When an experienced thief accidentally makes off with a Van Gogh, his partner is kidnapped by gangsters in pursuit of the painting, forcing the criminal to hatch a rescue plan.', 'When an experienced thief accidentally makes off with a Van Gogh, his partner is kidnapped by gangsters in pursuit of the painting, forcing the criminal to hatch a rescue plan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/VMEpy6MrnTN8rPeIQkyOxebmlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9721'),
  ('142645666445604615', '7 Suns', 2009, 'Drama', 'Pedro Ultreras, Vladimir Van Maule', null, 'Luis Ávila, Evangelina Sosa, Thais Durazo, Silvia Seleny, Ella Quintero, Ricardo Chilaca, Rafael Chilaca, Jorge Rojas', null, 'A man called "The Black" is hired to smuggle a group of undocumented migrants into the United States. He wants to quit the smuggling business and claims this is his last trip. His superiors, now suspicious, send Gavilan, a younger smuggler, to keep an eye on him. During the troubled crossing, the smugglers fight and eventually lose part of their human cargo. "The Black" escapes from his former associates but also needs to ecape from the Border Patrol.', 'A man called "The Black" is hired to smuggle a group of undocumented migrants into the United States. He wants to quit the smuggling business and claims this is his last trip. His superiors, now suspicious, send Gavilan, a younger smuggler, to keep an eye on him. During the troubled crossing, the smugglers fight and eventually lose part of their human cargo. "The Black" escapes from his former associates but also needs to ecape from the Border Patrol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kNnueRDVHV4OMtMfTSZXMiuPext.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68127'),
  ('679415532056025019', '7 Virgins', 2005, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alberto Rodríguez, Álex Catalán, Adán Barajas', 'Rafael Cobos, Alberto Rodríguez', 'Juan José Ballesta, Jesús Carroza, Vicente Romero Sánchez, Alba Rodríguez, Julián Villagrán, Ana Wagener, Maite Sandoval, Manolo Solo', null, 'It is summertime in a blue-collar, marginal district of a city in the South of Spain. Tano, a teenager currently serving a sentence in a juvenile reform center, is given a 48-hour leave to attend his brother’s wedding.', 'It is summertime in a blue-collar, marginal district of a city in the South of Spain. Tano, a teenager currently serving a sentence in a juvenile reform center, is given a 48-hour leave to attend his brother’s wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIGNKsJFfaxIOtxjcLT0uy1HBLU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:481'),
  ('833487085489015876', '7 Wise Dwarfs', 1941, 'Animation', 'Ford Beebe, Richard Lyford', 'Dick Kinney, Harry Reeves, Al Bertino', 'Pinto Colvig', 'NR', '7 Wise Dwarfs is an educational short animated film commissioned by the National Film Board of Canada as a short film for educating the Canadian public about war bonds during World War II. The short features the seven dwarfs from Disney''s Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs, four years after the characters made their screen debut.', '7 Wise Dwarfs is an educational short animated film commissioned by the National Film Board of Canada as a short film for educating the Canadian public about war bonds during World War II. The short features the seven dwarfs from Disney''s Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs, four years after the characters made their screen debut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dEvaURpwujoge6nY6SRh8xZZ827.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64593'),
  ('857370805382609803', '7 Women', 1965, 'Drama, History', 'John Ford, Wingate Smith, Joseph LaShelle', 'Janet Green, John McCormick', 'Anne Bancroft, Sue Lyon, Margaret Leighton, Flora Robson, Mildred Dunnock, Betty Field, Anna Lee, Eddie Albert', 'NR', 'In a mission in China in 1935, a group of women are preyed on by Mongolian bandits, led by Warlord chief Tunga Khan.', 'In a mission in China in 1935, a group of women are preyed on by Mongolian bandits, led by Warlord chief Tunga Khan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cD4SUHUBDpJgFc63UjANsy1cPhl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68692'),
  ('981499845405174456', '7 Women and a Murder', 2021, 'Comedy, Mystery, Crime', 'Alessandro Genovesi, Federico Masiero, Federica Ciciarelli', 'François Ozon, Marina de Van', 'Margherita Buy, Diana Del Bufalo, Sabrina Impacciatore, Benedetta Porcaroli, Micaela Ramazzotti, Luisa Ranieri, Ornella Vanoni, Marco Rossetti', 'R', 'When the family patriarch is murdered, seven women find themselves trapped together in his mansion to solve the mystery.', 'When the family patriarch is murdered, seven women find themselves trapped together in his mansion to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fzAammsmgfwseHTC4VosPyKLntj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890541'),
  ('910120002293996066', '7 Zwerge - Männer allein im Wald', 2004, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Jo Heim', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Bernd Eilert, Otto Waalkes', 'Otto Waalkes, Heinz Hoenig, Mirco Nontschew, Boris Aljinovic, Markus Majowski, Martin Schneider, Ralf Schmitz, Cosma Shiva Hagen', null, 'The Seven Dwarves live deep within a female-free-zone of the Enchanted Forest, but they cannot resist the innocent charms of Snow White when she enters their world. So when the evil queen abducts her, it is up to the dwarves to save her life.', 'The Seven Dwarves live deep within a female-free-zone of the Enchanted Forest, but they cannot resist the innocent charms of Snow White when she enters their world. So when the evil queen abducts her, it is up to the dwarves to save her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7cfDQirLJbOryFB0VfpQJHwTIx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9803'),
  ('1092304661905045210', '7-Man Army', 1976, 'War, Action, Drama', 'Chang Cheh, Wu Ma, Hsiung Ting-Wu', 'Ni Kuang, Chang Cheh', 'David Chiang Da-Wei, Ti Lung, Alexander Fu Sheng, Chen Kuan-Tai, Li Yi-Min, Chi Kuan-Chun, Pai Ying, Ting Wa-Chung', null, 'In 1933, 20,000 Japanese soldiers and 50 tanks invaded the Pa Tou Lou Tzu, a strategic key point of the Great Wall. With only seven men stationing, these heroes took on the entire army for five days before succumbing. Director Chang Cheh recreated this epic battle with his favorite cast including Ti Lung, David Chiang, Alexander Fu Sheng and Chen Kuan-tai, as a celluloid tribute to these nameless souls.', 'In 1933, 20,000 Japanese soldiers and 50 tanks invaded the Pa Tou Lou Tzu, a strategic key point of the Great Wall. With only seven men stationing, these heroes took on the entire army for five days before succumbing. Director Chang Cheh recreated this epic battle with his favorite cast including Ti Lung, David Chiang, Alexander Fu Sheng and Chen Kuan-tai, as a celluloid tribute to these nameless souls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14m34nSW25YuIj1vKDghBGMm3Fi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65194'),
  ('41071794510320298', '7:19', 2016, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Jorge Michel Grau, Juan Pablo Ramírez', 'Jorge Michel Grau, Alberto Chimal', 'Demián Bichir, Héctor Bonilla, Carmen Beato, Octavio Michel, Azalia Ortiz, Oscar Serrano, Verónica Langer, Fátima Molina', null, 'At 7:19 a.m., on September 19th of 1985, the most destructive earthquake hit Mexico City. Inside what''s left of a building, a group of survivors fight for their lives waiting for rescue.', 'At 7:19 a.m., on September 19th of 1985, the most destructive earthquake hit Mexico City. Inside what''s left of a building, a group of survivors fight for their lives waiting for rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7vhjD2FmBUrnEWyKRb1LI0XCRz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:387805'),
  ('73540388478851097', '7:20 Once a Week', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Matías Bize, Arnaldo Rodríguez, María Victoria Hernández', 'Julio Rojas', 'Eva Arias, Josue Guerrero', null, 'Two strangers have an intense casual encounter but later, both will realize that what has emerged is superior to pure physics, understanding that human relationships are more complex than a simple exchange of caresses.', 'Two strangers have an intense casual encounter but later, both will realize that what has emerged is superior to pure physics, understanding that human relationships are more complex than a simple exchange of caresses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5dRTrNj5h2Kiq9tWh2CMrpuCB00.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525107'),
  ('941863897078844724', '7:35 in the Morning', 2003, 'Music, Romance', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Jon D. Domínguez', 'Nacho Vigalondo', 'Nacho Vigalondo, Marta Belenguer, Antonio Tato, Borja Cobeaga, Javier Reguilón, Alejandro Garrido, Velasco Broca', null, 'A woman enters a restaurant one morning – only to be met with silence instead of people talking.', 'A woman enters a restaurant one morning – only to be met with silence instead of people talking.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o20955As4odatWA8WQGHdqH0EKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152611'),
  ('111512707916946825', '70', 1970, 'Animation', 'Robert Breer', null, null, null, '"Made with spray paint and hand-cut stencils, this film was an attempt at maximum plastic intensity… Places Breer for the first time among the major colorists of the avant-garde." – P. Adams Sitney', '"Made with spray paint and hand-cut stencils, this film was an attempt at maximum plastic intensity… Places Breer for the first time among the major colorists of the avant-garde." – P. Adams Sitney', null, 'tmdb:movie:209754'),
  ('147454857743042840', '70 Big Ones', 2019, 'Crime, Action', 'Koldo Serra, Emilio Pérez, Unax Mendia', 'Javier Echániz, Juan Antonio Gil Bengoa, Asier Guerricaechevarría', 'Emma Suárez, Nathalie Poza, Hugo Silva, Bárbara Goenaga, Daniel Pérez Prada, Kandido Uranga, Richard Sahagún, Juan Viadas', null, 'Raquel is desperate: a series of unfortunate events have led to her daughter being taken and she needs a large amount of money to get her back, and fast. After a desperate plea to the bank, she manages to secure the loan she needs. The problem is that precisely at that moment, a peculiar couple of robbers enter the branch: the drug-addicted Jonan and his partner Lola, who is a deadly combination of smart and psychotic. But Raquel’s stakes are too high, and she knows she must think carefully to outsmart them, save herself and get her money.', 'Raquel is desperate: a series of unfortunate events have led to her daughter being taken and she needs a large amount of money to get her back, and fast. After a desperate plea to the bank, she manages to secure the loan she needs. The problem is that precisely at that moment, a peculiar couple of robbers enter the branch: the drug-addicted Jonan and his partner Lola, who is a deadly combination of smart and psychotic. But Raquel’s stakes are too high, and she knows she must think carefully to outsmart them, save herself and get her money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gcLReyZd83sPuEPvW6JJwEaaYt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551499'),
  ('93163559886769960', '700 Days of Battle: Us vs. the Police', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Renpei Tsukamoto, Ryu Segawa, Hironori Kubota', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Hayato Ichihara, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Kumiko Aso, Maki Sakai, Kana Kurashina, Naoto Takenaka, Tamae Ando, Nobue Iketani', null, 'After one of their group is caught for speeding a group of trouble-making teenagers decide to prank the local police officer. It starts with simple speeding pranks but gradually moves to more elaborate and bizarre pranks.', 'After one of their group is caught for speeding a group of trouble-making teenagers decide to prank the local police officer. It starts with simple speeding pranks but gradually moves to more elaborate and bizarre pranks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mrkxavT2L85l0mzBSR1lAjUGeOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38958'),
  ('131215059409759147', '700 Sharks', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Luc Marescot, Séverine Cappa, Marie Mora Chevais', 'Émilie Dumond, Luc Marescot, Laurent Ballesta', 'Laurent Ballesta, Yannis Papastamatiou, Charlie Huveneers, Frédéric Bertucci, Éric Parmentier, Damien Sony, Johann Mourier, Orphal Colleye', null, 'Gombessa Expedition 4 Laurent Ballesta went to observe a gathering of thousands of groupers during the full moon of June 2014 (Le mystère mérou) in the southern pass of the Polynesian atoll of Fakarava, where he discovered a pack of over seven hundred grey sharks. How can this unprecedented density be explained? Could it be that social behaviors govern this wild horde? During three years of preparation, he and the other divers on his international scientific team tamed their fear by abandoning the defensive reflexes that provoke shark aggression, with the aim of slipping into the heart of the raging pack to study and film it from the inside. Sharks fitted with microchips, receiving antennas, hydrophones, an ark of 32 synchronized cameras...: a whole technological arsenal is mobilized for the project. As the groupers approach for their annual spawning, what battle plan will the sharks deploy?', 'Gombessa Expedition 4 Laurent Ballesta went to observe a gathering of thousands of groupers during the full moon of June 2014 (Le mystère mérou) in the southern pass of the Polynesian atoll of Fakarava, where he discovered a pack of over seven hundred grey sharks. How can this unprecedented density be explained? Could it be that social behaviors govern this wild horde? During three years of preparation, he and the other divers on his international scientific team tamed their fear by abandoning the defensive reflexes that provoke shark aggression, with the aim of slipping into the heart of the raging pack to study and film it from the inside. Sharks fitted with microchips, receiving antennas, hydrophones, an ark of 32 synchronized cameras...: a whole technological arsenal is mobilized for the project. As the groupers approach for their annual spawning, what battle plan will the sharks deploy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wH1DOLpx1S6QXIc3ehDIPEOVBdV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530838'),
  ('742388757739106923', '706', 2019, 'Thriller', 'Shravan Kumar', 'Shravan Kumar', 'Atul Kulkarni, Mohan Agashe, Raayo S. Bakhirta, Anupam Shyam, Divya Dutta', null, 'Dr.Suman Asthana is a doctor, whose husband Anil Asthana is missing since last 11 days and investigating officer DCP Shekhawat is unable to find him. A psychic child patient revels the whereabouts of Dr.Anil and opens the doors of secrets.', 'Dr.Suman Asthana is a doctor, whose husband Anil Asthana is missing since last 11 days and investigating officer DCP Shekhawat is unable to find him. A psychic child patient revels the whereabouts of Dr.Anil and opens the doors of secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kEVYsAQJifaE07lwE7M0LQABfg2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:582352'),
  ('427150280653786835', '71 Fragments of a Chronology of Chance', 1995, 'Drama', 'Michael Haneke, Christian Berger, Ramses Ramsauer', 'Michael Haneke', 'Gabriel Cosmin Urdes, Lukas Miko, Otto Grünmandl, Anne Bennent, Udo Samel, Dorothee Hartinger, Branko Samarovski, Claudia Martini', 'NR', '71 scenes revolving around multiple Viennese residents who are by chance involved with a senseless gun slaughter on Christmas Eve.', '71 scenes revolving around multiple Viennese residents who are by chance involved with a senseless gun slaughter on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcITctg9JiW32EnNz9vYmDlvaKx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32764'),
  ('788734625594653248', '71: Into the Fire', 2010, 'War', 'John H. Lee, Yu Yeong-jong, Choi Chan-min', 'Chung Tae-won', 'Kwon Sang-woo, T.O.P, Kim Seung-woo, Cha Seung-won, Kim Hye-seong, Ku Sung-hwan, Shin Hyun-tak, Mun Jae-won', null, 'In August 1950, waiting for UN troops to arrive, the South Korean army assembled to protect Nakdong River. Only 71 student-soldiers are left behind to guard the city of Pohang. Now they are on a mission to defend the country from North Korean troops.', 'In August 1950, waiting for UN troops to arrive, the South Korean army assembled to protect Nakdong River. Only 71 student-soldiers are left behind to guard the city of Pohang. Now they are on a mission to defend the country from North Korean troops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3p8nZAGiw8LT8TFpYOn7uoTUdvI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51200'),
  ('391293886387635795', '711 Ocean Drive', 1950, 'Crime', 'Joseph M. Newman, Franz Planer, Charles L. Smith', 'Richard English, Francis Swann', 'Edmond O''Brien, Joanne Dru, Otto Kruger, Barry Kelley, Dorothy Patrick, Don Porter, Howard St. John, Robert Osterloh', 'NR', 'A telephone repairman in Los Angeles uses his knowledge of electronics to help a bookie set up a betting operation. After the bookie is murdered, the greedy technician takes over his business. He ruthlessly climbs his way to the top of the local crime syndicate, but then gangsters from a big East Coast mob show up wanting a piece of his action.', 'A telephone repairman in Los Angeles uses his knowledge of electronics to help a bookie set up a betting operation. After the bookie is murdered, the greedy technician takes over his business. He ruthlessly climbs his way to the top of the local crime syndicate, but then gangsters from a big East Coast mob show up wanting a piece of his action.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRTfhyRPFW2f3RPi8PgjQE9t3Pt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37087'),
  ('782378686383459859', '713th Asks for Landing', 1961, 'Action, Drama', 'Grigori Nikulin, Veniamin Levitin, Grigori Elbert', 'Andrey Donatov, Aleksey Leontyev', 'Vladimir Vysotsky, Eve Kivi, Efim Kopelyan, Otar Koberidze, Vladimir Chestnokov, Zana Zanoni, Nonna Ten, Lyudmila Abramova', null, 'Transatlantic flight 713 is in trouble because the pilot and crew are poisoned while flying above the ocean. Now the passengers have to take control to save their lives.', 'Transatlantic flight 713 is in trouble because the pilot and crew are poisoned while flying above the ocean. Now the passengers have to take control to save their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xDHBNauTRxchx2C1kQTqHfYVwxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207696'),
  ('919837270659426216', '72 Meters', 2004, 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Vladimir Khotinenko, Igor Votintsev, Sergey Sashnin', 'Vladimir Khotinenko', 'Sergey Makovetskiy, Marat Basharov, Andrey Krasko, Dmitri Ulyanov, Chulpan Khamatova, Stanislav Nikolski, Sergey Garmash, Vladislav Galkin', null, 'The film begins in the 1980s Soviet Union. Two best friends, Orlov and Muravyev, are serving at the Black Sea Navy Base in Sevastopol, Crimea. Both fall in love with one beautiful girl Nelly, and their friendship suffers a first blow. Because she picks Muravyev, his friend Orlov struggles with an inferiority complex and becomes a secretive alcoholic. After the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991, both friends are transferred to the Northern Fleet on the Polar Ocean. One day their sub is performing a routine training. A disturbed WWII mine slowly moves on a collision course with the sub. A mighty blast knocks down everyone inside the wrecked sub, 72 meters below the sea level. Then ensues a nerve-racking struggle for survival.', 'The film begins in the 1980s Soviet Union. Two best friends, Orlov and Muravyev, are serving at the Black Sea Navy Base in Sevastopol, Crimea. Both fall in love with one beautiful girl Nelly, and their friendship suffers a first blow. Because she picks Muravyev, his friend Orlov struggles with an inferiority complex and becomes a secretive alcoholic. After the collapse of the Soviet Union in 1991, both friends are transferred to the Northern Fleet on the Polar Ocean. One day their sub is performing a routine training. A disturbed WWII mine slowly moves on a collision course with the sub. A mighty blast knocks down everyone inside the wrecked sub, 72 meters below the sea level. Then ensues a nerve-racking struggle for survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bT2SXcsgIBcN3hSOeZyxa4knUON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42952'),
  ('456040679591357871', '731', 2025, 'Drama, War', 'Zhao Linshan, Tao Yang, Bruce Law Lai-Yin', 'Zhao Linshan', 'Jiang Wu, Wang Zhiwen, Li Naiwen, Sun Qian, Joyce Feng, Lin Ziye, Irene Wan, Li Shanyu', 'NR', 'Based on true events set during WWII in Northeast China, an ordinary man is thrust into a turbulent fate against the backdrop of the inhumane bacterial experiments conducted by the Japanese Imperial Army''s notorious Unit 731.', 'Based on true events set during WWII in Northeast China, an ordinary man is thrust into a turbulent fate against the backdrop of the inhumane bacterial experiments conducted by the Japanese Imperial Army''s notorious Unit 731.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tVky8NXtugNIREeCMqq9IkU4dQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1321624'),
  ('1024196617834098405', '7500', 2019, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Friedrich Noltmann, Patrick Vollrath, Sebastian Thaler', 'Patrick Vollrath, Senad Halilbasic', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Omid Memar, Aylin Tezel, Carlo Kitzlinger, Murathan Muslu, Paul Wollin, Aurélie Thépaut, Max Schimmelpfennig', 'R', 'When terrorists try to seize control of a Berlin-Paris flight, a soft-spoken young American co-pilot struggles to save the lives of the passengers and crew while forging a surprising connection with one of the hijackers.', 'When terrorists try to seize control of a Berlin-Paris flight, a soft-spoken young American co-pilot struggles to save the lives of the passengers and crew while forging a surprising connection with one of the hijackers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hL2uecLh2rTTbuVbOriXP0PhqIJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509585'),
