  ('690474199723259071', '777 Charlie', 2022, 'Drama, Adventure, Comedy', 'Nimisha Kannath, Rakshit Kaup, Nitin Ramachandra', 'Kiranraj K.', 'Rakshit Shetty, Raj B Shetty, Bobby Simha, Sangeetha Sringeri, Bhargavi Narayan, Danish Sait, Harini Shreekanth, Mime Ramdas', null, 'Dharma is stuck in a rut with his negative and lonely lifestyle and spends each day in the comfort of his loneliness. A pup named Charlie who is naughty and energetic which is a complete contrast with the Dharma’s character enters his life and gives him a new perspective towards it.', 'Dharma is stuck in a rut with his negative and lonely lifestyle and spends each day in the comfort of his loneliness. A pup named Charlie who is naughty and energetic which is a complete contrast with the Dharma’s character enters his life and gives him a new perspective towards it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qArPmXH0aWsT3SEtYl8XrU2Oz48.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:634120'),
