  ('821515139832066560', '791 km', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tobi Baumann, Philipp Kirsamer', 'Gernot Gricksch', 'Joachim Król, Iris Berben, Nilam Farooq, Ben Münchow, Lena Urzendowsky, Alexander Beyer, Götz Otto, Denis Ölmez', null, '5 people of different personalities have to take a taxi from Munich to Hamburg, as the train service is canceled. The strangers discover that every one of them has their own cross to bear, but to overcome trouble they have to work together as a group.', '5 people of different personalities have to take a taxi from Munich to Hamburg, as the train service is canceled. The strangers discover that every one of them has their own cross to bear, but to overcome trouble they have to work together as a group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65mWTuHvs6oYZLHzetNNov5nNmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1178876'),
