  ('526671649552526278', '7th Floor', 2013, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Luis Bernárdez, Pola Zito, Marcello Pozzo', 'Patxi Amezcua, Alejo Flah', 'Ricardo Darín, Belén Rueda, Luis Ziembrowski, Osvaldo Santoro, Jorge D''Elía, Guillermo Arengo, Abel Dolz Doval, Charo Dolz Doval', null, 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. Sebastián, a successful lawyer, leaves his ex-wife''s condo, located on the seventh floor of an apartment building, to take his two children to school. While they run down the stairs, he uses the elevator. Once on the ground floor, Sebastián awaits the arrival of the children.', 'Buenos Aires, Argentina. Sebastián, a successful lawyer, leaves his ex-wife''s condo, located on the seventh floor of an apartment building, to take his two children to school. While they run down the stairs, he uses the elevator. Once on the ground floor, Sebastián awaits the arrival of the children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dTSJHOcV8adoDYEx7IYdRwlV3D3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214761'),
