  ('1088898846099779953', '8', 2025, 'Drama', 'Julio Medem, Rafael Reparaz, Mamen Tortosa', 'Julio Medem', 'Ana Rujas, Javier Rey, Tamar Novas, Loreto Mauleón, Carla Díaz, María Isasi, Mateo Medina, Oriol Riera', null, 'Octavio and Adela were born on the same day, April 14th, 1931. During the following 8 decades, their lives will intertwine through intense encounters and misunderstandings in 8 episodes. A passionate love story between a brave and fighting woman and a man confronted with his contradictions. They will have to face coming from families on opposing sides of a country slowly heading towards a Civil War, along with the history of Spain and Europe as a background.', 'Octavio and Adela were born on the same day, April 14th, 1931. During the following 8 decades, their lives will intertwine through intense encounters and misunderstandings in 8 episodes. A passionate love story between a brave and fighting woman and a man confronted with his contradictions. They will have to face coming from families on opposing sides of a country slowly heading towards a Civil War, along with the history of Spain and Europe as a background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8kbvp90eiFd5eCqN3w3hYwcVRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1053583'),
  ('947615465805066938', '8 ½ $', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Grigory Konstantinopolsky, Nikolai Mosin, Pavel Drozdov', 'Avdotya Smirnova, Sergey Krylov', 'Ivan Okhlobystin, Fyodor Bondarchuk, Olesya Potashinskaya, Vladimir Menshov, Natalya Andreychenko, Vladimir Shainskiy, Igor Vernik, Vyacheslav Razbegaev', null, 'Gera, a respected director of TV commercials, thinks he''s capable of creating a fiction movie masterpiece. Predictably, he ends up with owning money to a mafia and no film to show for. To make his life even crazier he falls in love with a girl who belongs to the boss of mafia.', 'Gera, a respected director of TV commercials, thinks he''s capable of creating a fiction movie masterpiece. Predictably, he ends up with owning money to a mafia and no film to show for. To make his life even crazier he falls in love with a girl who belongs to the boss of mafia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kLnvqQjPu3GEcRnhSENRHrTDiZu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96530'),
  ('421233552499075534', '8 ½ Women', 1999, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Peter Greenaway, Sacha Vierny, Reinier van Brummelen', 'Peter Greenaway', 'John Standing, Matthew Delamere, Vivian Wu, Annie Shizuka Inoh, Toni Collette, Claire Johnston, Polly Walker, Amanda Plummer', 'R', 'After his wife dies, middle-aged businessman Philip Emmenthal, at the prompting of his playboy son Storey, populates his Geneva villa with eight-and-a-half concubines. Three are from Kyoto, where Storey manages Pachinco palaces. Each has a distinctive personality: a nun, a child bearer, a gambler, a student of Kabuki, a horsewoman with a pet pig, a maid. As a year passes, the women begin asserting their own power.', 'After his wife dies, middle-aged businessman Philip Emmenthal, at the prompting of his playboy son Storey, populates his Geneva villa with eight-and-a-half concubines. Three are from Kyoto, where Storey manages Pachinco palaces. Each has a distinctive personality: a nun, a child bearer, a gambler, a student of Kabuki, a horsewoman with a pet pig, a maid. As a year passes, the women begin asserting their own power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7G0SA8cqrsu7XzzTL0ge54aw7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11332'),
  ('509092023669342573', '8 Ball Bunny', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Dave Barry', 'NR', 'Bugs helps a penguin return home.', 'Bugs helps a penguin return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/71WEqPrI52Zf7uxqla1Gf7M3uAQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74914'),
  ('484737713063430122', '8 Dates', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Peris Romano, Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Juan Hernández', 'Rodrigo Sorogoyen, Peris Romano', 'Fernando Tejero, José Luis García Pérez, Belén López, Cecilia Freire, Raúl Arévalo, Javier Rey, Marta Nieto, Alicia Rubio', null, 'Men and women deal with different stages of love. Desire, jealousy, longing and melancholy are part of the romantic story of each of the characters, including a teacher, a middle-aged couple and a jealous boyfriend.', 'Men and women deal with different stages of love. Desire, jealousy, longing and melancholy are part of the romantic story of each of the characters, including a teacher, a middle-aged couple and a jealous boyfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72GJrAcO1ktIXusioMntAhkJsFQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26969'),
  ('1091597714691189833', '8 First Dates', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Dodson, Sasha Malarevsky, Anna Kevorkova', 'Yurii Kostiuk, Mikhail Savin, Dmitriy Grigorenko', 'Oksana Akinshina, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, Denis Nikiforov, Yekaterina Varnava, Olesya Zheleznyak, Sabina Akhmedova, Yevhen Koshovyi, Viktor Vasilyev', null, 'Vera is a famous TV personality who wakes up with Nikita in bed after a hard day of partying. The next day, when she wakes up, the same thing happens.', 'Vera is a famous TV personality who wakes up with Nikita in bed after a hard day of partying. The next day, when she wakes up, the same thing happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zmaNdGIKSPx6NhrTLTE2tSdqJ8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98581'),
  ('1021860097343994931', '8 Heads in a Duffel Bag', 1997, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure, Mystery', 'Tom Schulman, Jane Jenkins, Adam Holender', 'Tom Schulman', 'Joe Pesci, Andy Comeau, Kristy Swanson, George Hamilton, Dyan Cannon, David Spade, Todd Louiso, Anthony Mangano', 'R', 'Mafia hitman Tommy Spinelli is flying to San Diego with a bag that holds eight severed heads, which he''s bringing to his superiors to prove that some troublesome rival mobsters are permanently out of the picture. When his bag gets accidentally switched at the airport, Tommy must track down his duffel bag and the 8 heads it contains.', 'Mafia hitman Tommy Spinelli is flying to San Diego with a bag that holds eight severed heads, which he''s bringing to his superiors to prove that some troublesome rival mobsters are permanently out of the picture. When his bag gets accidentally switched at the airport, Tommy must track down his duffel bag and the 8 heads it contains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbjS5UH7JvsQwSLMYMY5GQOSwv1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13982'),
  ('582235680711474588', '8 Mile', 2002, 'Drama, Music', 'Rodrigo Prieto, Eric Heffron, Michael J. Moore', 'Scott Silver', 'Eminem, Kim Basinger, Mekhi Phifer, Brittany Murphy, Evan Jones, Omar Benson Miller, De''Angelo Wilson, Eugene Byrd', 'R', 'For Jimmy Smith, Jr., life is a daily fight just to keep hope alive. Feeding his dreams in Detroit''s vibrant music scene, Jimmy wages an extraordinary personal struggle to find his own voice - and earn a place in a world where rhymes rule, legends are born and every moment… is another chance.', 'For Jimmy Smith, Jr., life is a daily fight just to keep hope alive. Feeding his dreams in Detroit''s vibrant music scene, Jimmy wages an extraordinary personal struggle to find his own voice - and earn a place in a world where rhymes rule, legends are born and every moment… is another chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BmQj8qE1FLuLTf7Xjf9sdIHzoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65'),
  ('1091214496758984327', '8 Million Ways to Die', 1986, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Hal Ashby, Stephen H. Burum, L. Andrew Stone', 'Robert Towne', 'Jeff Bridges, Rosanna Arquette, Randy Brooks, Alexandra Paul, Andy Garcia, Tommy Lister Jr., Vyto Ruginis, Gene Ross', 'R', 'Scudder is a detective with the Sheriff''s Department who is forced to shoot a violent suspect during a narcotics raid. The ensuing psychological aftermath of this shooting worsens his drinking problem and this alcoholism causes him to lose his job, as well as his marriage.', 'Scudder is a detective with the Sheriff''s Department who is forced to shoot a violent suspect during a narcotics raid. The ensuing psychological aftermath of this shooting worsens his drinking problem and this alcoholism causes him to lose his job, as well as his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/anxyPdDX3I0vtSwL68qQmpLqp05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20858'),
  ('692714663322307390', '8 Seconds', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Western', 'John G. Avildsen, Victor Hammer', 'Monte Merrick', 'Luke Perry, Stephen Baldwin, Red Mitchell, Cynthia Geary, James Rebhorn, Carrie Snodgress, Linden Ashby, Ronnie Claire Edwards', 'PG-13', 'This film chronicles the life of Lane Frost, 1987 PRCA Bull Riding World Champion, his marriage and his friendships with Tuff Hedeman (three-time World Champion) and Cody Lambert.', 'This film chronicles the life of Lane Frost, 1987 PRCA Bull Riding World Champion, his marriage and his friendships with Tuff Hedeman (three-time World Champion) and Cody Lambert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqKVkOveZrK6zwfrptGLVPmnMpR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18069'),
  ('7304433880877575', '8 Seconds', 2015, 'Drama', 'Ömer Faruk Sorak, Emmanuel Kadosh', 'Esra İnal, Nuran Evren Şit', 'Esra İnal, Fahri Yardım, Fırat Çelik, Mehmet Kurtuluş, Salih Kalyon, Sema Poyraz, Şiir Eloğlu, Ceylin Adıyaman', null, 'Esra leads two parallel lives. In her daily life the vivacious and spirited Esra adores her family but feels caged in her relationships. In her dream life, she yearns to discover the identity of the man who visits her dreams. While in waking life she struggles in vain, in her dream life she evolves in secret. But what if waking and dreaming were never separate and the real secret is shored by all?', 'Esra leads two parallel lives. In her daily life the vivacious and spirited Esra adores her family but feels caged in her relationships. In her dream life, she yearns to discover the identity of the man who visits her dreams. While in waking life she struggles in vain, in her dream life she evolves in secret. But what if waking and dreaming were never separate and the real secret is shored by all?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBihBbfxwozeD1sEz7O5aBFmmA1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348750'),
  ('170064633812023209', '8 Times Up', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Xabi Molia, Martin De Chabaneix', 'Xabi Molia', 'Julie Gayet, Denis Podalydès, Mathieu Busson, Kevyn Frachon, Frédéric Bocquet, Françoise Miquelis, Constance Dollé, Alix Poisson', null, 'Elsa makes a living from little jobs, struggling to gain custody of his son. Mathieu, who lives next door, also keeps getting job interviews only to polish his art of failure. Their situation is increasingly precarious, but both are trying to bounce back in a world that seems not to fit them.', 'Elsa makes a living from little jobs, struggling to gain custody of his son. Mathieu, who lives next door, also keeps getting job interviews only to polish his art of failure. Their situation is increasingly precarious, but both are trying to bounce back in a world that seems not to fit them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/83zhbsbq7xVlV8ixXzZ6xSXaJlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61374'),
  ('874590086989648802', '8 Women', 2002, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery', 'François Ozon, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'François Ozon, Marina de Van', 'Catherine Deneuve, Isabelle Huppert, Fanny Ardant, Firmine Richard, Emmanuelle Béart, Virginie Ledoyen, Ludivine Sagnier, Danielle Darrieux', 'R', 'Eight women gather to celebrate Christmas in a snowbound cottage, only to find the family patriarch dead with a knife in his back. Trapped in the house, every woman becomes a suspect, each having her own motive and secret.', 'Eight women gather to celebrate Christmas in a snowbound cottage, only to find the family patriarch dead with a knife in his back. Trapped in the house, every woman becomes a suspect, each having her own motive and secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJu4Gm7NQb2woPiIovrPD5jNWzf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1958'),
  ('1097166426632898146', '8 x 10 Tasveer', 2009, 'Thriller, Action, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Nagesh Kukunoor', 'Nagesh Kukunoor', 'Akshay Kumar, Ayesha Takia, Sharmila Tagore, Girish Karnad', 'NR', '8X10 Tasveer is a story about young man named Jai Puri, (Akshay Kumar), who possesses supernatural powers. Jai is of Indian origin who works as a forest ranger in Canada. His life is shattered by a loss of a very important person in his life. This personal tragedy leads him to use his unique supernatural power to unravel the mystery behind the murder.', '8X10 Tasveer is a story about young man named Jai Puri, (Akshay Kumar), who possesses supernatural powers. Jai is of Indian origin who works as a forest ranger in Canada. His life is shattered by a loss of a very important person in his life. This personal tragedy leads him to use his unique supernatural power to unravel the mystery behind the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rnUpyQ8Wqfy2Zb9SM4S8lJ0B5qD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18673'),
  ('1105633765313209873', '8 x 8: A Chess-Sonata in 8 Movements', 1957, 'Fantasy', 'Hans Richter, Marcel Duchamp, Jean Cocteau', 'Hans Richter', 'Hans Arp, Paul Bowles, Jean Cocteau, Marcel Duchamp, Max Ernst, Man Ray, Frederick Kiesler, Dorothea Ernst', null, '8 x 8: A Chess-Sonata in 8 Movements is an American experimental film directed by Hans Richter, Marcel Duchamp, and Jean Cocteau. Described by Richter as "part Freud, part Lewis Carroll" and filmed partially on the lawn of Duchamp''s summer house in Southbury, Connecticut.', '8 x 8: A Chess-Sonata in 8 Movements is an American experimental film directed by Hans Richter, Marcel Duchamp, and Jean Cocteau. Described by Richter as "part Freud, part Lewis Carroll" and filmed partially on the lawn of Duchamp''s summer house in Southbury, Connecticut.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/FQuPszsHHWgHHEBUISrAUOJ6Qj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132006'),
  ('979548343949125224', '8-Bit Christmas', 2021, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Samy Inayeh, Michael Dowse', 'Kevin Jakubowski', 'Neil Patrick Harris, Winslow Fegley, Steve Zahn, June Diane Raphael, Bellaluna Resnick, Sophia Reid-Gantzert, Che Tafari, Santino Barnard', 'PG', 'In suburban Chicago during the late 1980s, ten-year-old Jake Doyle embarks on a herculean quest to get the latest and greatest video game system for Christmas.', 'In suburban Chicago during the late 1980s, ten-year-old Jake Doyle embarks on a herculean quest to get the latest and greatest video game system for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YwaISdOwp8Zu6O7kwBeUn8a7Pu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802217'),
  ('828562409828706757', '8:17pm, Darling Street', 2003, 'Drama', 'Bernard Émond, Jean-Pierre Saint-Louis', 'Bernard Émond', 'Luc Picard, Guylaine Tremblay, Diane Lavallée, Markita Boies, Zhenhu Han, Michel Mongeau, Micheline Bernard, Louis Bélanger', null, 'This is the story of Gerard, an man who miraculy survived to an explosion that destroyed his appartment and killed a lot of people. During the next days, he tries to find out why he survived and why others died.', 'This is the story of Gerard, an man who miraculy survived to an explosion that destroyed his appartment and killed a lot of people. During the next days, he tries to find out why he survived and why others died.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eB2eitRCaXhXJTz2sXo7afhrVVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61258'),
  ('28680939499317635', '8:28 AM', 2010, 'Romance, Drama', 'Christian Alvart, The Chau Ngo', 'Sebastian Schubert', 'Nadeshda Brennicke, Mehdi Nebbou, Mark Waschke, Naomi Krauss, Edita Malovčić, Asia Luna Mohmand, Christine Schorn, Michael Brennicke', null, 'A married woman runs a successful gallery and falls for a man she met accidentally.', 'A married woman runs a successful gallery and falls for a man she met accidentally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAuNlZkBpfWUDZTTeJzLIFj8uPc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142712'),
