  ('495931619385763805', '8/64: Ana - Action Brus', 1964, null, 'Kurt Kren', null, 'Günter Brus', null, 'This three-minute film was far more akin to the American-style "happening" in that the content was not particularly extreme. It was built up from items such as broken bicycle parts, a nude model, pieces of furniture, and these elements were then obscured or transformed by having a layer of paint thrown on them.', 'This three-minute film was far more akin to the American-style "happening" in that the content was not particularly extreme. It was built up from items such as broken bicycle parts, a nude model, pieces of furniture, and these elements were then obscured or transformed by having a layer of paint thrown on them.', null, 'tmdb:movie:263195'),
  ('1064246230297096053', '80 Blocks from Tiffany''s', 1980, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Gary Weis, Joan Churchill', 'John Bradshaw', 'Louis Gigante', null, 'This 1979 documentary depicts the daily life of gangs in the South Bronx. It deals primarily with two African American and Puerto Rican gangs known as the "Savage Skulls" and the "Savage Nomads".', 'This 1979 documentary depicts the daily life of gangs in the South Bronx. It deals primarily with two African American and Puerto Rican gangs known as the "Savage Skulls" and the "Savage Nomads".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5LZpHcnhoeYHbTK6KVOVagt7ofH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84246'),
  ('510101934523611011', '80 for Brady', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Kyle Marvin, John Toll, Jonathan McGarry', 'Emily Halpern, Sarah Haskins', 'Lily Tomlin, Jane Fonda, Rita Moreno, Sally Field, Tom Brady, Billy Porter, Harry Hamlin, Guy Fieri', 'PG-13', 'Four lifelong friends set out on an unforgettable journey to see their hero Tom Brady play in Super Bowl LI and witness one of the greatest comebacks in sports history, discovering that it''s never too late to live life to the fullest. Inspired by a true story.', 'Four lifelong friends set out on an unforgettable journey to see their hero Tom Brady play in Super Bowl LI and witness one of the greatest comebacks in sports history, discovering that it''s never too late to live life to the fullest. Inspired by a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qhSFHOS9CeXTqGgmbCi5pteIc6k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942922'),
  ('343060500173770714', '800 Bullets', 2002, 'Comedy, Action, Western', 'Flavio Martínez Labiano, Álex de la Iglesia', 'Álex de la Iglesia, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Sancho Gracia, Ángel de Andrés López, Carmen Maura, Eusebio Poncela, Luis Castro, Manuel Tallafé, Enrique Martínez, Luciano Federico', 'PG-13', 'Almería, Tabernas desert, Spain, 2002. Texas Hollywood is a dilapidated and dusty town where Western movies have not been shot for decades. Julián Torralba and his partners, veteran film stuntmen, survive there, recreating pathetic action scenes for the pleasure of the few foreign tourists who visit the isolated region.', 'Almería, Tabernas desert, Spain, 2002. Texas Hollywood is a dilapidated and dusty town where Western movies have not been shot for decades. Julián Torralba and his partners, veteran film stuntmen, survive there, recreating pathetic action scenes for the pleasure of the few foreign tourists who visit the isolated region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8tqwtxk0xUJA8fHaKqxZ0G8ey4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37748'),
  ('763074689525106677', '8213: Gacy House', 2010, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Anthony Fankhauser, Matt Hoefler', 'Anthony Fankhauser', 'Rachel Riley, James Arthur Lewis, Matthew Temple, Michael Gaglio, Brett A. Newton, Diana Terranova, Sylvia Panacione', null, 'A group of paranormal investigators enter the abandoned home of paedophile and serial killer John Gacy, hoping to find evidence of paranormal activity. Upon entering the house they set-up cameras throughout the abandoned house while going room to room with hand-held cameras, performing séance''s and asking for John Gacy to come forward. As the evening progresses it seems the investigators are not prepared for the horror still within the house.', 'A group of paranormal investigators enter the abandoned home of paedophile and serial killer John Gacy, hoping to find evidence of paranormal activity. Upon entering the house they set-up cameras throughout the abandoned house while going room to room with hand-held cameras, performing séance''s and asking for John Gacy to come forward. As the evening progresses it seems the investigators are not prepared for the horror still within the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cyXzvGMAMJzQqCp13oRt3BG1vYx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57313'),
  ('571851330822643677', '825 Forest Road', 2025, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Stephen Cognetti, Jessie Roland', 'Stephen Cognetti', 'Elizabeth Vermilyea, Kathryn Miller, Joe Falcone, Diomire Keane, Darin F. Earl II, Monica Fleurette, Lorenzo Beronilla, Joe Bandelli', null, 'After a family tragedy, Chuck Wilson hopes to start a new life in Ashland Falls with his wife Maria and little sister Elizabeth, but he quickly discovers that the town has a dark history of being haunted by a ghostly woman who drives residents to suicide.', 'After a family tragedy, Chuck Wilson hopes to start a new life in Ashland Falls with his wife Maria and little sister Elizabeth, but he quickly discovers that the town has a dark history of being haunted by a ghostly woman who drives residents to suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mxvRZxq6ACTeJYJZKsHQAhz76yF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1282980'),
  ('535928574612315896', '83', 2021, 'Drama, History', 'Aseem Mishra, Kabir Khan, Sakshi Mehta', 'Sanjay Puran Singh Chauhan, Kabir Khan, Vasan Bala', 'Ranveer Singh, Pankaj Tripathi, Tahir Raj Bhasin, Jiiva, Saqib Saleem, Ammy Virk, Sahil Khattar, Harrdy Sandhu', null, 'On the 25th of June 1983, the Lord’s Cricket Ground witnessed one of the biggest underdog stories in the history of sports. Fourteen inspired players - led by a man''s self-belief and conviction - fought against all odds and orchestrated India’s greatest sporting triumph by beating the two-time World Champions West Indies.', 'On the 25th of June 1983, the Lord’s Cricket Ground witnessed one of the biggest underdog stories in the history of sports. Fourteen inspired players - led by a man''s self-belief and conviction - fought against all odds and orchestrated India’s greatest sporting triumph by beating the two-time World Champions West Indies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTOMTFUbMxSApPRTuECMrl5RyQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:601337'),
  ('1148150253500723241', '83 Hours ''Til Dawn', 1990, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Crime, Drama', 'Donald Wrye, Randall Badger, Jeff Okabayashi', null, 'Peter Strauss, Robert Urich, Paul Winfield, Elizabeth Gracen, Kevin Kilner, Shannon Wilcox, R. Lee Ermey, Samantha Mathis', 'NR', 'A wealthy man''s daughter is kidnapped and placed in a box with air for only 83 hours.', 'A wealthy man''s daughter is kidnapped and placed in a box with air for only 83 hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aGDYQ9n0l8EV0Yv2h1AdVoZ1kaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75553'),
  ('305819034572238439', '83rd Golden Globe Awards', 2026, null, 'Glenn Weiss, Margaux Lapresle, Scott Gairdner', 'Nikki Glaser, Barry Adelman, Meggie McFadden, Bob Castrone, Mike Gibbons, Bonnie McFarland, Jon Macks, Alex Baze, Chris Convy, Matt Whitaker, Lauren Greenberg, Rob Zappulla, Ian Karmel, Andrew Law, Mike Lawrence, Sean O''Connor, Marina Cockenberg, Brian Frange, Dicky Eagan, Anna Drezen, Albertina Rizzo, Jess Dweck, J.P. McDade', 'Pamela Anderson, Paul Thomas Anderson, Judd Apatow, Chris Appelhans, Will Arnett', null, 'Hosted by Nikki Glaser, the 83rd Golden Globe Awards honors the best across film and television from 2025. Nominees contending across film and television include One Battle After Another (2025), Frankenstein (2025), The White Lotus (2021) and Adolescence (2025).', 'Hosted by Nikki Glaser, the 83rd Golden Globe Awards honors the best across film and television from 2025. Nominees contending across film and television include One Battle After Another (2025), Frankenstein (2025), The White Lotus (2021) and Adolescence (2025).', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BZWM0NTMyYjYtYzNjOC00ZTYwLThhZTQtYzgyNzMwMGI3ZWNjXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:83rd-golden-globe-awards'),
  ('958496850095407809', '84 Charing Cross Road', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'David Hugh Jones, Brian West', 'James Roose-Evans, Hugh Whitemore', 'Anne Bancroft, Anthony Hopkins, Judi Dench, Jean De Baer, Maurice Denham, Eleanor David, Mercedes Ruehl, Daniel Gerroll', 'PG', 'When a humorous script-reader in her New York apartment sees an ad in the Saturday Review of Literature for a bookstore in London that does mail order, she begins a very special correspondence and friendship with Frank Doel, the bookseller who works at Marks & Co., 84 Charing Cross Road.', 'When a humorous script-reader in her New York apartment sees an ad in the Saturday Review of Literature for a bookstore in London that does mail order, she begins a very special correspondence and friendship with Frank Doel, the bookseller who works at Marks & Co., 84 Charing Cross Road.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sbImaHsRP9TpCNIi4xMizaphZhk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15677'),
  ('698460812930112035', '84C MoPic', 1989, 'War', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan, Alan Caso', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan', 'Jonathan Emerson, Nicholas Cascone, Jason Tomlins, Christopher Burgard, Glenn Morshower, Sonny Carl Davis, Byron Thames, Richard Brooks', 'R', 'An Army cameraman is embedded with a reconnaissance patrol and charts their mission across territory controlled by the North Vietnamese.', 'An Army cameraman is embedded with a reconnaissance patrol and charts their mission across territory controlled by the North Vietnamese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vu5zyYcQlUJmGJzzUnrrXKsxnKd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55149'),
  ('680016654681693462', '88', 2015, 'Thriller, Action', 'Jeremy Doiron, Michael Doiron, April Mullen', 'Tim Doiron', 'Katharine Isabelle, Christopher Lloyd, Kyle Schmid, Tim Doiron, Jesse McCartney, Michael Ironside, April Mullen, Anthony Ulc', 'NR', 'A young woman comes to in a roadside diner with no idea where she is or how she got there. Split between two timelines, she gets taken on a violent journey as she seeks out the person responsible for her lover''s death.', 'A young woman comes to in a roadside diner with no idea where she is or how she got there. Split between two timelines, she gets taken on a violent journey as she seeks out the person responsible for her lover''s death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kbCZDINnj4rHhoZZUeXTsviYUkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307479'),
  ('323368849505571485', '88 Minutes', 2007, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Denis Lenoir, Jon Avnet, Linda Montanti', 'Gary Scott Thompson', 'Al Pacino, Alicia Witt, Leelee Sobieski, Amy Brenneman, William Forsythe, Deborah Kara Unger, Ben McKenzie, Neal McDonough', 'R', 'Famed forensic psychiatrist Dr. Jack Gramm enjoys a reputation as one of the most sought-after profilers around. His expert testimony has resulted in the conviction of many criminals, including serial killer Jon Forster. On the eve of Forster''s execution, one of Gramm''s students is murdered in a vicious copycat crime, and Gramm himself receives an ominous message informing him that he has less than 90 minutes to live.', 'Famed forensic psychiatrist Dr. Jack Gramm enjoys a reputation as one of the most sought-after profilers around. His expert testimony has resulted in the conviction of many criminals, including serial killer Jon Forster. On the eve of Forster''s execution, one of Gramm''s students is murdered in a vicious copycat crime, and Gramm himself receives an ominous message informing him that he has less than 90 minutes to live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSrmBJ2Png69Qnb5L1KHYZMsDP7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3489'),
  ('334981414391777495', '881', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Royston Tan', 'Royston Tan', 'Qi Yuwu, Mindee Ong, Yeo Yann Yann, Liu Ling Ling, May Wan Teh, Choy Wan Teh, Royston Tan, Johnny Ng', null, 'Two Singaporean girls join together to form the Papaya Sisters, a getai group that sings at performances during the seventh lunar month. Big Papaya is estranged from her mother, who disapproves of her performances, whilst Little Papaya is an orphan who suffers from terminal cancer. The two are assisted by Auntie Ling and her son, Guan Yin. The two soon rise to the top of the Singaporean getai scene singing traditional Hokkien songs, but their fame brings along with it the enmity of the Durian Sisters, a rival group of techno-singing Eurasian girls.', 'Two Singaporean girls join together to form the Papaya Sisters, a getai group that sings at performances during the seventh lunar month. Big Papaya is estranged from her mother, who disapproves of her performances, whilst Little Papaya is an orphan who suffers from terminal cancer. The two are assisted by Auntie Ling and her son, Guan Yin. The two soon rise to the top of the Singaporean getai scene singing traditional Hokkien songs, but their fame brings along with it the enmity of the Durian Sisters, a rival group of techno-singing Eurasian girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lDLgSuR4JuI66bFOTjDUY039iWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44423'),
  ('918758143889335182', '89 mm from Europe', 1993, 'Documentary', 'Marcel Łoziński, Artur Reinhart, Jacek Petrycki', 'Marcel Łoziński', null, null, 'This movie shows the simplest difference between Europe and former Soviet Union. It is the eponymous 89 mm - Russian train tracks are 89 mm wider than tracks in European countries. And because of this fact, it is not easy to go through the Soviet border by train in Brest as the passengers in the film do.', 'This movie shows the simplest difference between Europe and former Soviet Union. It is the eponymous 89 mm - Russian train tracks are 89 mm wider than tracks in European countries. And because of this fact, it is not easy to go through the Soviet border by train in Brest as the passengers in the film do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odZzCHItKfp3lED1Ielp52WUyRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244883'),
  ('794570020807029985', '8MM', 1999, 'Thriller, Crime, Mystery', 'Joel Schumacher, Robert Elswit, Jason Weil', 'Andrew Kevin Walker', 'Nicolas Cage, Joaquin Phoenix, James Gandolfini, Peter Stormare, Anthony Heald, Chris Bauer, Catherine Keener, Myra Carter', 'R', 'A small, seemingly innocuous plastic reel of film leads surveillance specialist Tom Welles down an increasingly dark and frightening path. With the help of the streetwise Max, he relentlessly follows a bizarre trail of evidence to determine the fate of a complete stranger. As his work turns into obsession, he drifts farther and farther away from his wife, family and simple life as a small-town PI.', 'A small, seemingly innocuous plastic reel of film leads surveillance specialist Tom Welles down an increasingly dark and frightening path. With the help of the streetwise Max, he relentlessly follows a bizarre trail of evidence to determine the fate of a complete stranger. As his work turns into obsession, he drifts farther and farther away from his wife, family and simple life as a small-town PI.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhr9xRpjOBqlBjgDwtiOx6FsLvV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8224'),
  ('874729344255026594', '8MM 2', 2005, 'Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'J.S. Cardone, Darko Šuvak, Sholto J. Roeg', 'Robert Sullivan', 'Johnathon Schaech, Lori Heuring, Julie Benz, Valentine Pelka, Zita Görög, Robert Cavanah, Alex Scarlis, Jane How', 'R', 'Entering a seamy underground world of peep shows, nude clubs, and live Internet sex is David Huxley, an aspiring politician who has everything to lose. Secretly filmed in a steamy three-way with his fiancée Tish and a gorgeous young model, David is desperate to find the extortionist who''s demanding an exorbitant amount of money for the negatives. But when the blackmail trail ends in murder and David is kidnapped, Tish must come up with $5 million ransom or her fiancé''s once-promising career, and life, may come to a dead end.', 'Entering a seamy underground world of peep shows, nude clubs, and live Internet sex is David Huxley, an aspiring politician who has everything to lose. Secretly filmed in a steamy three-way with his fiancée Tish and a gorgeous young model, David is desperate to find the extortionist who''s demanding an exorbitant amount of money for the negatives. But when the blackmail trail ends in murder and David is kidnapped, Tish must come up with $5 million ransom or her fiancé''s once-promising career, and life, may come to a dead end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSikt4O0ZrR8xVrsP8wliGybZwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7295'),
  ('133023377107095711', '8th Wonderland', 2008, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Nicolas Alberny, Jean Mach, Antoine Marteau', 'Nicolas Alberny, Jean Mach', 'Matthew Géczy, Robert William Bradford, Alain Azerot, Eloïssa Florez, Ahlima Mhamdi, Melanie Molnar, Nikos Aliagas, Antony Hickling', null, 'A website where people can virtually live in a true democracy becomes so popular that its leading members take questionable actions to improve the real world as well. This backfires and various governments brand them terrorists.', 'A website where people can virtually live in a true democracy becomes so popular that its leading members take questionable actions to improve the real world as well. This backfires and various governments brand them terrorists.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEYS2EqKJMTBCnIiX5yHf7DctA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57816'),
  ('981287319574629427', '9', 2002, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Ümit Ünal, Aydın Sarıoğlu', 'Ümit Ünal', 'Ali Poyrazoğlu, Cezmi Baskın, Fikret Kuşkan, Ozan Güven, Rafa Radomisli, Serra Yılmaz, Esin Pervane, Fuat Onan', null, 'In a poor neighbourhood of Istanbul, a young homeless girl has been found dead. Six people from the neighbourhood are being interrogated. While the police camera is recording, these six witnesses find themselves caught in manipulation and abuse, forcing them to give away their innermost secrets.', 'In a poor neighbourhood of Istanbul, a young homeless girl has been found dead. Six people from the neighbourhood are being interrogated. While the police camera is recording, these six witnesses find themselves caught in manipulation and abuse, forcing them to give away their innermost secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8mQbcOIp1n9V5LFEU2Wb5Jd97L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61812'),
  ('739413419978264895', '9', 2005, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Shane Acker', 'Shane Acker', null, null, 'A rag doll fights a monster that has been stealing the souls of his people.', 'A rag doll fights a monster that has been stealing the souls of his people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2wFHOqAkR50O8AZmztNMLjiy8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98622'),
  ('840602526965402508', '9', 2009, 'Action, Adventure, Animation, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Shane Acker, Joe Ksander, Kevin R. Adams', 'Pamela Pettler', 'Elijah Wood, Christopher Plummer, Martin Landau, John C. Reilly, Crispin Glover, Jennifer Connelly, Fred Tatasciore, Alan Oppenheimer', 'PG-13', 'When 9 first comes to life, he finds himself in a post-apocalyptic world. All humans are gone, and it is only by chance that he discovers a small community of others like him taking refuge from fearsome machines that roam the earth intent on their extinction. Despite being the neophyte of the group, 9 convinces the others that hiding will do them no good.', 'When 9 first comes to life, he finds himself in a post-apocalyptic world. All humans are gone, and it is only by chance that he discovers a small community of others like him taking refuge from fearsome machines that roam the earth intent on their extinction. Despite being the neophyte of the group, 9 convinces the others that hiding will do them no good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uqXGOH4BQ2CLJWkDJZ0PzbUzOn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12244'),
  ('394856451129973259', '9 Bullets', 2022, 'Action, Thriller', 'Byron Werner, Gigi Gaston', 'Gigi Gaston', 'Lena Headey, Dean Scott Vazquez, Sam Worthington, Barbara Hershey, La La Anthony, Cam Gigandet, Marc Menchaca, Marlene Forte', null, 'A former burlesque dancer turned author discovers a second chance at life and redemption when she risks everything to rescue her young neighbor after he witnesses his parents’ murder. Now on the run from the local crime boss, who happens to be her longtime ex, she makes a desperate attempt to get the boy to safety.', 'A former burlesque dancer turned author discovers a second chance at life and redemption when she risks everything to rescue her young neighbor after he witnesses his parents’ murder. Now on the run from the local crime boss, who happens to be her longtime ex, she makes a desperate attempt to get the boy to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8h8R2D6AVTZCCA6NIvioObkhXsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777831'),
  ('962439906607741549', '9 Days Awake', 2020, 'Drama', 'Damián John Harper', 'Fabian Wiemker, Damián John Harper, Eric Stehfest', 'Benno Fürmann, Peri Baumeister, Jannik Schümann, Heike Makatsch, Martin Brambach, Gitta Schweighöfer, Jürgen Heinrich, Rana Farahani', null, '“9 Days Awake”, the film adaptation of the eponymous novel by Eric Stehfest. Jannik Schümann plays Eric, a junkie who lives to party. He is addicted to the one drug that makes him feel invincible- "like Jesus and the terminator at the same time." When he is accepted to an acting school in Berlin, he tries to reconnect with his great love Anja (Peri Baumeister), change his life, and strive to be better. But numerous conflicts and issues follow him, leaving him to retreat back to his old ways as other situations escalate.', '“9 Days Awake”, the film adaptation of the eponymous novel by Eric Stehfest. Jannik Schümann plays Eric, a junkie who lives to party. He is addicted to the one drug that makes him feel invincible- "like Jesus and the terminator at the same time." When he is accepted to an acting school in Berlin, he tries to reconnect with his great love Anja (Peri Baumeister), change his life, and strive to be better. But numerous conflicts and issues follow him, leaving him to retreat back to his old ways as other situations escalate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tMCH3MVjwiGdSu3IyO0Jao3K4dM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683020'),
  ('253064671133660916', '9 Dead Gay Guys', 2002, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Lab Ky Mo, Rachael Jones, Damien Elliott', 'Lab Ky Mo', 'Glen Mulhern, Brendan Mackey, Karen Sharman, Simon Godley, Raymond Griffiths, Steven Berkoff, Michael Praed, Vas Blackwood', null, 'The story of two lads from Belfast as they stumble their way through the London gay underworld in search of ''gainful employment''. This being the offering of sexual favours to older gay men in order to subsidise their respective giros. 9 Dead Gay Guys is a high-camp send-up of gay stereotypes.', 'The story of two lads from Belfast as they stumble their way through the London gay underworld in search of ''gainful employment''. This being the offering of sexual favours to older gay men in order to subsidise their respective giros. 9 Dead Gay Guys is a high-camp send-up of gay stereotypes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnpzlpZdarzNAYfe718NXPNBQMH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19555'),
  ('588545785695583837', '9 Deaths of the Ninja', 1985, 'Action', 'Emmett Alston, Roy H. Wagner', 'Emmett Alston', 'Sho Kosugi, Brent Huff, Emilia Crow, Blackie Dammett, Regina Richardson, Lisa Friedman, Kane Kosugi, Shane Kosugi', 'R', 'A trio of specialized soldiers is called in to stop a group of drug traffickers who have hijacked a busload of tourists in the Philippines and threaten to kill them all if one of their companions is not released from jail and the government does not stop its anti-drug policies.', 'A trio of specialized soldiers is called in to stop a group of drug traffickers who have hijacked a busload of tourists in the Philippines and threaten to kill them all if one of their companions is not released from jail and the government does not stop its anti-drug policies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2eXzrLX6nWZhHDvVHQjJ2qO2Z2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51878'),
  ('633882751201664678', '9 Fingers', 2018, 'Crime, Mystery', 'F.J. Ossang, Simon Roca', 'F.J. Ossang', 'Paul Hamy, Damien Bonnard, Pascal Greggory, Gaspard Ulliel, Lisa Hartmann, Lionel Tua, Elvire, Alexis Manenti', null, 'In the middle of the night, Magloire is smoking a cigarette in an abandoned train station when the police shows up for an ID check. He starts running with no luggage, no future until he meets a dying man from whom he inherits a fortune. Magloire is now pursued by a gang. He becomes their hostage, but accomplice too. As he doesn’t anything to lose. Like someone who gets away with everything, someone with no expectations…', 'In the middle of the night, Magloire is smoking a cigarette in an abandoned train station when the police shows up for an ID check. He starts running with no luggage, no future until he meets a dying man from whom he inherits a fortune. Magloire is now pursued by a gang. He becomes their hostage, but accomplice too. As he doesn’t anything to lose. Like someone who gets away with everything, someone with no expectations…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdIV17FN14fPcnuqQn4jw1XaalQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467241'),
  ('379118835758601753', '9 millimeter', 1997, 'Crime, Drama', 'Peter Lindmark', 'Frank Ågren, Peter Lindmark, Steve Aalam', 'Paolo Roberto, Rebecca Facey, Steve Aalam, Camilo Alanis, Annika Aschberg, Kasra Ashhami, Astrid Assefa, Kerim Chatty', null, 'The suburb that is a society within a society, a place where young guys do anything for respect. A place where criminality and violence is a part of life. This movie centralizes around Malik, a guy without family and land of origin, and who has made crime and violence a part of his life. Both to win respect, and to support himself.', 'The suburb that is a society within a society, a place where young guys do anything for respect. A place where criminality and violence is a part of life. This movie centralizes around Malik, a guy without family and land of origin, and who has made crime and violence a part of his life. Both to win respect, and to support himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9UiHs0t6LBlxiCaO2eamINXp4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83083'),
  ('76483900513739198', '9 Month Stretch', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Albert Dupontel, Vincent Mathias', 'Albert Dupontel', 'Sandrine Kiberlain, Albert Dupontel, Nicolas Marié, Philippe Uchan, Philippe Duquesne, Bouli Lanners, Christian Hecq, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus', 'PG-13', 'Ariane Felder is pregnant! This is surprising with her being a young hardened judge with strict morals. But what is more surprising is that, according to paternity testing, the child''s father is none other than Bob, a criminal from the prosecution charged with an atrocious attack! Ariane doesn''t remember any of what has happened, so she has no idea what to expect...', 'Ariane Felder is pregnant! This is surprising with her being a young hardened judge with strict morals. But what is more surprising is that, according to paternity testing, the child''s father is none other than Bob, a criminal from the prosecution charged with an atrocious attack! Ariane doesn''t remember any of what has happened, so she has no idea what to expect...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vCLklvrl7ogr6DywSV3v5XyKk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200713'),
  ('963012164459655355', '9 Songs', 2004, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Michael Winterbottom, Marcel Zyskind', 'Michael Winterbottom', 'Kieran O''Brien, Margo Stilley, Courtney Taylor-Taylor, Alex Kapranos, Guy Garvey, Robert Levon Been, Peter Hayes, Gruff Rhys', 'NR', 'Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London''s Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night''s end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.', 'Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London''s Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night''s end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27'),
  ('401320602993885447', '9 Souls', 2003, 'Crime, Comedy, Drama', 'Toshiaki Toyoda, Akira Ono, Junichi Fujisawa', 'Toshiaki Toyoda', 'Yoshio Harada, Ryuhei Matsuda, Junior Chihara, Onimaru, Itsuji Itao, Kiyohiko Shibukawa, Mame Yamada, Takuji Suzuki', null, 'After discovering a hole in their crowded cell, nine prisoners escape their confinement to track down the key of the universe, which a fellow prisoner known as the Counterfeit King said he had hidden.', 'After discovering a hole in their crowded cell, nine prisoners escape their confinement to track down the key of the universe, which a fellow prisoner known as the Counterfeit King said he had hidden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQXbOoBPOn7QvePAgAdnoUtmXxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16976'),
  ('985644530128095157', '9 Variations on a Dance Theme', 1967, 'Documentary', 'Hilary Harris', null, 'Bettie Jong', null, 'Bettie de Jong performs the same dance nine times, starting and ending in a reclined position. As the film proceeds the camera becomes more and more adventurous.', 'Bettie de Jong performs the same dance nine times, starting and ending in a reclined position. As the film proceeds the camera becomes more and more adventurous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/csqrNNKTFJwWwQnT5VtuY4HFfKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244228'),
  ('89939376005528213', '9-9-81', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Suthat Phawilairat, Kiattisak Wibunchat, Siriphon Prasatthong', null, 'Patitta Attayatamavitaya, Supachai Girdsuwan, Setsit Limkasitdej, Thiti Vechabul', null, 'A bride-to-be jumps to her death after becoming convinced that a tragic accident has claimed the life of her groom-to-be. But, the end of her life is the beginning of the story when her groom-to-be is alive and his false death turns out to be his and her best friend''s plan to get rid of her. Distraught by the betrayal, the spirit of the bride-to-be is craving for vengeance. This production is unusual in that it is a collaboration among twelve different Thai film directors.', 'A bride-to-be jumps to her death after becoming convinced that a tragic accident has claimed the life of her groom-to-be. But, the end of her life is the beginning of the story when her groom-to-be is alive and his false death turns out to be his and her best friend''s plan to get rid of her. Distraught by the betrayal, the spirit of the bride-to-be is craving for vengeance. This production is unusual in that it is a collaboration among twelve different Thai film directors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jShYbTMc2AuQhSVeCzA4JFiesJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152025'),
  ('1006187402589414776', '9/11', 2002, 'Documentary', 'Gédéon Naudet, Jules Naudet, James Hanlon', 'Tom Forman, Greg Kandra', 'Tony Benatatos, Jamal Braithwaite, Joseph Casaliggi, James Hanlon, Joseph Pfeifer, Tom Spinard, Dennis Tardio, Steve Buscemi', 'NR', 'An on-the-scene documentary following the events of September 11, 2001 from an insider''s view, through the lens of two French filmmakers who simply set out to make a movie about a rookie NYC fireman and ended up filming the tragic event that changed our lives forever.', 'An on-the-scene documentary following the events of September 11, 2001 from an insider''s view, through the lens of two French filmmakers who simply set out to make a movie about a rookie NYC fireman and ended up filming the tragic event that changed our lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k4Cs8h56Q1zpvWQMNSCi67uAqEe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11304'),
  ('729937450295591578', '9/11', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Martin Guigui, Massimo Zeri', 'Martin Guigui, Patrick Carson, Steven James Golebiowski', 'Charlie Sheen, Whoopi Goldberg, Luis Guzmán, Gina Gershon, Wood Harris, Bruce Davison, Dahlia Waingort, Faune Chambers Watkins', 'R', 'Five random strangers find themselves trapped in an elevator in the World Trade Center''s North Tower on 9/11. They work together, never giving up hope, to try to escape before the unthinkable happens.', 'Five random strangers find themselves trapped in an elevator in the World Trade Center''s North Tower on 9/11. They work together, never giving up hope, to try to escape before the unthinkable happens.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pGkjEL7RkMogMI6aznsKmZOhd8I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455558'),
  ('273567247405033452', '9/11: Inside the President''s War Room', 2021, 'Documentary, History', 'Adam Wishart', null, 'George W. Bush, Dick Cheney, Condoleezza Rice, Colin Powell, Norman Mineta, Ari Fleischer, Joshua Bolten, Theodore Olson', 'PG-13', 'Experience the events of September 11, 2001 through the eyes of President Bush and his closest advisors as they personally detail the crucial hours and key decisions from that historic day.', 'Experience the events of September 11, 2001 through the eyes of President Bush and his closest advisors as they personally detail the crucial hours and key decisions from that historic day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t9otj0gqMwum9AzWslKNWhnQ5Mn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:848981'),
  ('1150686378907771927', '9/11: The Falling Man', 2006, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Henry Singer, Richard Numeroff', null, 'Steven Mackintosh', null, 'An examination of an image - a falling man from the North Tower, frozen in mid air - circulated by the press immediately after the September 11 attacks, the public''s reaction, and why it was later deemed un-newsworthy.', 'An examination of an image - a falling man from the North Tower, frozen in mid air - circulated by the press immediately after the September 11 attacks, the public''s reaction, and why it was later deemed un-newsworthy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gxBt6Vt9Xx8Pal1oZeKPlpm2Px.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76040'),
  ('468104163063855218', '90 Day Wondering', 1956, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Chuck Jones, Michael Maltese', 'Mel Blanc, Daws Butler, June Foray', 'NR', 'Ralph Phillips is overjoyed when he runs out of Fort Itude, because he''s a civilian again. Things, however, don''t go well for him when he gets home, and two pixies named Pete and Re-Pete convince him to stay in civilian life or go back to the army. At the end, Ralph chooses to go back to the army', 'Ralph Phillips is overjoyed when he runs out of Fort Itude, because he''s a civilian again. Things, however, don''t go well for him when he gets home, and two pixies named Pete and Re-Pete convince him to stay in civilian life or go back to the army. At the end, Ralph chooses to go back to the army', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQlMsQWimo74RTI31299NXOWLIN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83669'),
  ('417768491249397968', '90 Minutes in Heaven', 2015, 'Drama', 'Michael Polish, M. David Mullen', 'Don Piper', 'Kate Bosworth, Hayden Christensen, Hudson Meek, Bobby Batson, Elizabeth Hunter, David Clyde Carr, Catherine Carlen, Dwight Yoakam', 'PG-13', 'A man involved in a horrific car crash is pronounced dead, only to come back to life an hour and a half later, claiming to have seen Heaven.', 'A man involved in a horrific car crash is pronounced dead, only to come back to life an hour and a half later, claiming to have seen Heaven.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e3LKk8UdDyXDkov9k8iP2JJNChi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343795'),
  ('769298384205777310', '90° in the Shade', 1965, 'Crime, Drama', 'Hynek Bočan, Miloš Kohout, Stanislava Hutková', 'Jiří Mucha, Jiří Weiss, David Mercer', 'Anne Heywood, James Booth, Rudolf Hrušínský, Donald Wolfit, Ann Todd, Jiří Sovák, Jiřina Jirásková, Walter Taub', null, 'In a Prague shop, an assistant has been carrying on an affair with the dishonest, married manager. An emotionally repressed auditor with domestic problems of his own uncovers serious stock discrepancies. A test of loyalties and a questioning of values concludes in tragedy.', 'In a Prague shop, an assistant has been carrying on an affair with the dishonest, married manager. An emotionally repressed auditor with domestic problems of his own uncovers serious stock discrepancies. A test of loyalties and a questioning of values concludes in tragedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J2ignvZEUMOV7eEpdR5qs4a9PG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83926'),
  ('543389381892650657', '93, rue Lauriston', 2004, 'Crime, Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Denys Granier-Deferre, Sylvie Brocheré, Guillaume Schiffman', 'Jean-Claude Grumberg', 'Michel Blanc, Samuel Le Bihan, Gérald Laroche, Daniel Russo, Christian Charmetant, Manuel Le Lièvre, Eric Prat, Hervé Briaux', null, '93, rue Lauriston, in the 16th arrondissement de Paris, is an address of bleak memory. It was indeed the headquarter of the French Gestapo, which was active between 1941 and 1944 and was headed by Henri Lafont and Pierre Loutrel, two wanted criminals. On the day of 1940 he was demobilized, little did well-meaning Léon Jabinet know that he would be associated with such disreputable characters. And yet, some time later, Odile Panzer, the Jewish girl he has been hiding at his parents''place, is arrested by the Gestapo. On this occasion Léon is offered a deal for her release: collaborating with the Carlingue (another name for the French auxiliaries of the Nazi police) and Odile will be free. Or else... What should he do?', '93, rue Lauriston, in the 16th arrondissement de Paris, is an address of bleak memory. It was indeed the headquarter of the French Gestapo, which was active between 1941 and 1944 and was headed by Henri Lafont and Pierre Loutrel, two wanted criminals. On the day of 1940 he was demobilized, little did well-meaning Léon Jabinet know that he would be associated with such disreputable characters. And yet, some time later, Odile Panzer, the Jewish girl he has been hiding at his parents''place, is arrested by the Gestapo. On this occasion Léon is offered a deal for her release: collaborating with the Carlingue (another name for the French auxiliaries of the Nazi police) and Odile will be free. Or else... What should he do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5skmFwuZj9Q7cpd4hZreoaIbGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:292351'),
  ('1000413572048878560', '96', 2018, 'Romance', 'C. Prem Kumar, N. Shanmuga Sundaram, Mahendiran Jayaraju', 'C. Prem Kumar', 'Vijay Sethupathi, Trisha Krishnan, Aditya Baskar, Gouri G Kishan, Devadarshini, Bagavathi Perumal, Janagaraj, Aadukalam Murugadoss', null, 'Ram is a photographer and nature lover who travels all around India capturing moments. On a chance visit to his hometown Tanjavur, he goes into his school and begins to walk down memory lane to 1994 when he was a student harboring feelings for his classmate Janu.', 'Ram is a photographer and nature lover who travels all around India capturing moments. On a chance visit to his hometown Tanjavur, he goes into his school and begins to walk down memory lane to 1994 when he was a student harboring feelings for his classmate Janu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrVloCa2hCFOztRF1DZU2jnWIiQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441717'),
