  ('391752965287929004', '96 Minutes', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Aimee Lagos, Michael Fimognari, Gene Michael Smith', 'Aimee Lagos', 'Brittany Snow, Christian Serratos, David Oyelowo, Evan Ross, Anna Enger Ritch, Sylvia Jefferies, Sharon Conley, Hosea Chanchez', 'R', 'The story of 4 lives slammed together in a shocking moment. Intercutting between a carjacking and the separate stories of the 4 kids, we watch as they hurtle toward a life-changing end.', 'The story of 4 lives slammed together in a shocking moment. Intercutting between a carjacking and the separate stories of the 4 kids, we watch as they hurtle toward a life-changing end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39FwN8IVp8y46KJ6VjA8oFY8e1o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89326'),
  ('1057371237553091073', '96 Minutes', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Romance', 'Hung Tzu-hsuan, Abba Tong, Jimmy Wong', 'Yang Wan-ju, Hung Tzu-hsuan, Chen Yi-fang', 'Austin Lin, Vivian Sung, Edison Wang, Lee Lee-zen, Eleven Yao, Kent Tsai, Frederick Lee, Ng Ki-pin', null, 'Former bomb disposal expert, Song Kang-Ren, and his fiancée, Huang Xin, board a high-speed train that contains a bomb. At the same time, Liu Kai, a well-known physics teacher who was involved in an affair scandal, also boards this same train in order to win back his wife, Ting Juan, who took the prior high-speed rail to return home in frustration… After all, can the bomb be successfully defused this time? and resolve the crisis?', 'Former bomb disposal expert, Song Kang-Ren, and his fiancée, Huang Xin, board a high-speed train that contains a bomb. At the same time, Liu Kai, a well-known physics teacher who was involved in an affair scandal, also boards this same train in order to win back his wife, Ting Juan, who took the prior high-speed rail to return home in frustration… After all, can the bomb be successfully defused this time? and resolve the crisis?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gWKZ1iLhukvLoh8XY2N4tMvRQ2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1271895'),
  ('695407992481990154', '96 Pounds of Dynamite', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Loren Goldfarb, Ed Coughlin, Duane Codrington, John Gunn, Lynn Kessler', 'Loren Goldfarb', 'Chad McDaniel, Joe Tucker, Josephine Miller, Rich Johnson, Jensie Magee', null, 'Diagnosed at birth with a rare condition that was expected to kill him, Chad "Shorty" McDaniel embraces humor, grit, and a competitive spirit to live the life others said he would never have and shatter assumptions about disability.', 'Diagnosed at birth with a rare condition that was expected to kill him, Chad "Shorty" McDaniel embraces humor, grit, and a competitive spirit to live the life others said he would never have and shatter assumptions about disability.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FxEua5z9LMILLFS8sVddyipivAfU.jpg', 'plex:movie:96-pounds-of-dynamite'),
