  ('513511450164513379', 'A ''90s Christmas', 2024, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Marni Banack, Gayle Ye, Aaron Duncan', 'Ryan Peckinpaugh', 'Eva Bourne, Chandler Massey, Katherine Barrell, Alex Hook, Kate Drummond, Jenny Raven, Peter MacNeill, Barbara Gordon', null, 'Workaholic lawyer Lucy Clark is celebrating her promotion alone on Christmas Eve when a mysterious rideshare experience transports her back to 1999. Reliving the holiday with her mom, sister and best friend - not to mention her high school crush - Lucy gets a second chance to understand where her relationships went wrong. Will this magical journey help her rewrite her future or leave her destined to be alone?', 'Workaholic lawyer Lucy Clark is celebrating her promotion alone on Christmas Eve when a mysterious rideshare experience transports her back to 1999. Reliving the holiday with her mom, sister and best friend - not to mention her high school crush - Lucy gets a second chance to understand where her relationships went wrong. Will this magical journey help her rewrite her future or leave her destined to be alone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eUX70TC2xgEMz8uCoYVZeukxtZA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361210'),
  ('893090996290737510', 'À 10 minutes de la plage', 2010, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Stéphane Kappes', 'Laurent Junca', 'Laurent Gamelon, Catherine Marchal, Michel Vuillermoz, Guilaine Londez, François Morel, Pierre Palmade, Liane Foly, Anne Duverneuil', null, 'Every summer, Charles Lemoulec, director of an insurance company, takes his family to the Île de Ré. But this year, the vacation is in jeopardy because the family business is facing bankruptcy. To avoid disappointing his loved ones, who are unaware of the situation, Charles decides to swap his residence in Saint Germain en Laye for a superb hacienda in the South of France...', 'Every summer, Charles Lemoulec, director of an insurance company, takes his family to the Île de Ré. But this year, the vacation is in jeopardy because the family business is facing bankruptcy. To avoid disappointing his loved ones, who are unaware of the situation, Charles decides to swap his residence in Saint Germain en Laye for a superb hacienda in the South of France...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/thsncMiK8iT2xXeNstugtxzYfMt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113511'),
  ('276662945538845326', 'A 3 Minute Hug', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Everardo González, Emilio Valdés', null, null, null, 'As daylight breaks between the border cities of El Paso, Texas, and Juarez, Mexico, undocumented migrants and their relatives, divided by a wall, prepare to participate in an activist event. For three minutes, they’ll embrace in no man’s land for the briefest and sweetest of reunions.', 'As daylight breaks between the border cities of El Paso, Texas, and Juarez, Mexico, undocumented migrants and their relatives, divided by a wall, prepare to participate in an activist event. For three minutes, they’ll embrace in no man’s land for the briefest and sweetest of reunions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9V1ijGKFwcho4M2PfFlIWvHgxp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617331'),
