  ('608204607272359241', 'A Better Tomorrow', 2018, 'Action', 'Ding Sheng, Ding Yu', 'Xu Yang, Ding Sheng', 'Wang Kai, Ma Tianyu, Darren Wang, Yu Ailei, Lam Suet, Wu Yue, Li Meng, Zhang Yishang', 'NR', 'A former smuggler attempts to start his life anew and repair his relationship with his estranged brother after his release from prison.', 'A former smuggler attempts to start his life anew and repair his relationship with his estranged brother after his release from prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8qGa6DfvqRMbTTEwgFzGEDEk6r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497768'),
  ('333419266939747424', 'A Better Tomorrow II', 1987, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'John Woo, Frank Prinzi, Bob Thompson', 'John Woo, Chan Hing-Kai, Leung Suk-Wah', 'Ti Lung, Leslie Cheung, Dean Shek Tin, Chow Yun-Fat, Guan Shan, Emily Chu Bo-Yee, Kenneth Tsang, Shing Fui-On', null, 'A restauranteur teams up with a police officer and his ex-con brother to avenge the death of a friend''s daughter.', 'A restauranteur teams up with a police officer and his ex-con brother to avenge the death of a friend''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e8352Dw1SeM4rNAGYDZVkQ0aenz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18305'),
  ('221392670698123256', 'A Better Tomorrow III: Love and Death in Saigon', 1989, 'Action, Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Tsui Hark, Horace Wong Wing-Hang, William Leung Chi-Ming', 'Tsui Hark', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Anita Mui Yim-Fong, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Saburo Tokito, Sek Kin, Foo Wang-Tat, Cheng Wai-Lun, Maggie Cheung Ho-Yee', null, 'During the Vietnam War, Mark ''Gor'' Lee heads to Saigon to bring home his uncle and cousin. However, the task gets dangerous when a well-known criminal tries to help him.', 'During the Vietnam War, Mark ''Gor'' Lee heads to Saigon to bring home his uncle and cousin. However, the task gets dangerous when a well-known criminal tries to help him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cKvP5yunS8HxA66qlxw6AhFuAbN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41244'),
  ('710275657303004893', 'A Better Way to Die', 2001, 'Action, Thriller', 'Scott Wiper, Lawrence Sher', 'Scott Wiper', 'Scott Wiper, Natasha Henstridge, Andre Braugher, Lou Diamond Phillips, Joe Pantoliano, Jack Conley, Carmen Argenziano, Richard Haje', 'R', 'Boomer is a rookie cop based in the urban hellhole that is downtown Chicago. After his involvement in a drug bust operation which results in the death of Carlos, his mentor and father figure, Boomer becomes disillusioned with the brutal and inhumane nature of his job. Consequently, he decides to hand in his resignation to the Chicago Police Department and return to his home town of Joliet, where his fiancé, Kelly, awaits. While en route back to Joliet, however, Boomer makes a grievous error in judgment when he stops for, and assists, an unfortunate motorist whose vehicle appears to have broken down; the naive ex-cop is swiftly attacked and rendered unconscious. Boomer awakes to find that his car and wallet have been stolen, and that he has become involved in a dangerous game of mistaken identity.', 'Boomer is a rookie cop based in the urban hellhole that is downtown Chicago. After his involvement in a drug bust operation which results in the death of Carlos, his mentor and father figure, Boomer becomes disillusioned with the brutal and inhumane nature of his job. Consequently, he decides to hand in his resignation to the Chicago Police Department and return to his home town of Joliet, where his fiancé, Kelly, awaits. While en route back to Joliet, however, Boomer makes a grievous error in judgment when he stops for, and assists, an unfortunate motorist whose vehicle appears to have broken down; the naive ex-cop is swiftly attacked and rendered unconscious. Boomer awakes to find that his car and wallet have been stolen, and that he has become involved in a dangerous game of mistaken identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHqAEpjlj7msZ24zArfWgYrGTuz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23705'),
  ('675135680410678220', 'A Big Bold Beautiful Journey', 2025, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama', 'Kogonada, Benjamin Loeb, Rachel Jensen', 'Seth Reiss', 'Colin Farrell, Margot Robbie, Kevin Kline, Phoebe Waller-Bridge, Lily Rabe, Hamish Linklater, Jodie Turner-Smith, Chloe East', 'R', 'Sarah and David are single strangers who meet at a mutual friend’s wedding and soon, through a surprising twist of fate, find themselves on a funny, fantastical, sweeping adventure together where they get to re-live important moments from their respective pasts, illuminating how they got to where they are in the present... and possibly getting a chance to alter their futures.', 'Sarah and David are single strangers who meet at a mutual friend’s wedding and soon, through a surprising twist of fate, find themselves on a funny, fantastical, sweeping adventure together where they get to re-live important moments from their respective pasts, illuminating how they got to where they are in the present... and possibly getting a chance to alter their futures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uMAkmQlKthQpTMiyPAKOYK3JnMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1241921'),
  ('998919086522368050', 'A Big Gay Hairy Hit! Where the Bears Are: The Documentary', 2023, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Eduardo Aquino', 'Eduardo Aquino', 'Scott Beauchemin, Karamo Brown, Marcus Butron Jr., Kevin Chamberlin, Margaret Cho, Rick Copp, Coley Cummiskey, Joe Dietl', null, 'This hilarious and touching documentary tells the story of how three older, gay, "bears" working in Hollywood, tired of having their gay-themed ideas rejected by the mainstream, decided to self-produce their own web series. Against all odds, the comedy featuring three bear roommates like "The Golden Girls" solving crimes a la "Murder, She Wrote," became a sensation online and one of the most successful web shows of all time. The documentary examines ageism, body-shaming, sex-positivity, the creative process and how friendship and community can ultimately create something beloved all over the world.', 'This hilarious and touching documentary tells the story of how three older, gay, "bears" working in Hollywood, tired of having their gay-themed ideas rejected by the mainstream, decided to self-produce their own web series. Against all odds, the comedy featuring three bear roommates like "The Golden Girls" solving crimes a la "Murder, She Wrote," became a sensation online and one of the most successful web shows of all time. The documentary examines ageism, body-shaming, sex-positivity, the creative process and how friendship and community can ultimately create something beloved all over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gqkKWCfIGYvrdRWBVXn5Uy8jDiO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158166'),
  ('335184518852259746', 'A Big Hand for the Little Lady', 1966, 'Western', 'Lee Garmes, Fielder Cook, Joseph E. Kenney', 'Sidney Carroll', 'Henry Fonda, Joanne Woodward, Jason Robards, Paul Ford, Charles Bickford, Burgess Meredith, Kevin McCarthy, Robert Middleton', 'NR', 'A naive traveler in Laredo gets involved in a poker game between the richest men in the area, jeopardizing all the money he has saved for the purpose of settling with his wife and child in San Antonio.', 'A naive traveler in Laredo gets involved in a poker game between the richest men in the area, jeopardizing all the money he has saved for the purpose of settling with his wife and child in San Antonio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cfLpJPfcg1XQtfymoiM2me4PScm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37301'),
  ('206558026048542936', 'A Bigger Splash', 1973, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Jack Hazan, Jack Hazan', 'Jack Hazan, David Mingay', 'David Hockney, Celia Birtwell, Mo McDermott, Henry Geldzahler, John Kasmin, Ossie Clark, Patrick Procktor, Edward Kalinski', 'NR', 'After a difficult break-up, Hockney is left unable to paint, much to the concern of his friends.', 'After a difficult break-up, Hockney is left unable to paint, much to the concern of his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yQ5Sx1cNTnRQUjDeMZdbOuTIIP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142195'),
  ('834382689569086315', 'A Bigger Splash', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Luca Guadagnino, Yorick Le Saux, Zsuzsa Kismarty-Lechner', 'Alain Page', 'Tilda Swinton, Matthias Schoenaerts, Ralph Fiennes, Dakota Johnson, Corrado Guzzanti, Alessandro Ferrara, David Maddalena, Salvatore Gabriele', 'R', 'An American couple, Paul and Marianne, spend their vacation in Italy and experience trouble when Marianne invites a former lover and his teenage daughter to visit, which leads to jealousy and dangerous sexual scenarios.', 'An American couple, Paul and Marianne, spend their vacation in Italy and experience trouble when Marianne invites a former lover and his teenage daughter to visit, which leads to jealousy and dangerous sexual scenarios.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9ca2L41R43Lg1hpSzJHwtDTvYU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324807'),
  ('1107952669677407470', 'A Bigger World', 2019, 'Drama', 'Fabienne Berthaud, Nathalie Durand, Céline Bailbled', 'Claire Barré, Fabienne Berthaud', 'Cécile de France, Arieh Worthalter, Tserendarizav Dashnyam, Ludivine Sagnier, Narantsetseg Dash, Catherine Salée, Thomas Coumans, Steven Laureys', null, 'In an attempt to move on from the death of Paul, the love of her life, Korine leaves Paris to undertake a project in Mongolia. But after meeting the shaman, Oyun, her trip takes a different direction. Korine has a rare gift that Oyun intends to unveil. She agrees to initiate herself in the practice of Shamanism, leading her to discover an ancient and forgotten culture, but most importantly herself.', 'In an attempt to move on from the death of Paul, the love of her life, Korine leaves Paris to undertake a project in Mongolia. But after meeting the shaman, Oyun, her trip takes a different direction. Korine has a rare gift that Oyun intends to unveil. She agrees to initiate herself in the practice of Shamanism, leading her to discover an ancient and forgotten culture, but most importantly herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMCIwZyltraw1TTyZfSKo3H4ehh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490462'),
  ('596815029226848151', 'A Bill of Divorcement', 1932, 'Drama', 'George Cukor, Sidney Hickox, Dewey Starkey', 'Howard Estabrook, Harry Wagstaff Gribble', 'John Barrymore, Billie Burke, David Manners, Katharine Hepburn, Paul Cavanagh, Henry Stephenson, Gayle Evers, Elizabeth Patterson', 'NR', 'A World War I veteran returns home after fifteen years in an asylum and finds that everything has changed — his daughter is grown and about to marry.', 'A World War I veteran returns home after fifteen years in an asylum and finds that everything has changed — his daughter is grown and about to marry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHop0zEy6bdhmar8xckZWxWLXlc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73125'),
  ('164772017675411847', 'A Biltmore Christmas', 2023, 'Romance, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Andrew Rawson, A. Brooks Medoff, John Putch', 'Marcy Holland', 'Bethany Joy Lenz, Kristoffer Polaha, Colton Little, A.K. Benninghofen, Annabelle Borke, Jennifer Cortese, Jonathan Frakes, David Alexander', 'G', 'Contemporary screenwriter Lucy Hardgrove is hired to pen the remake of the holiday classic His Merry Wife!, which was shot at the renowned Biltmore Estate. Taking a tour of the grounds, she accidentally knocks over an hourglass, transporting her back in time to 1946, right when His Merry Wife! is being filmed.', 'Contemporary screenwriter Lucy Hardgrove is hired to pen the remake of the holiday classic His Merry Wife!, which was shot at the renowned Biltmore Estate. Taking a tour of the grounds, she accidentally knocks over an hourglass, transporting her back in time to 1946, right when His Merry Wife! is being filmed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwlauOMw8cqRrl8CFbJ0a4KG38i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064137'),
  ('126277695879516037', 'A Bird in a Bonnet', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray, Daws Butler', null, 'The chase continues between Tweety Bird and that persistant puddy tat, Sylvester. Tweety hides in a millinery store (where Granny happens to be shopping) and hides on a hat.', 'The chase continues between Tweety Bird and that persistant puddy tat, Sylvester. Tweety hides in a millinery store (where Granny happens to be shopping) and hides on a hat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wkEKJAo3UhK8KNQgL9P4Jm1FJdK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234975'),
  ('1109909038434577092', 'A Bird in a Guilty Cage', 1952, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Sylvester Cat spots Tweety Bird in a display window of an after-hours department store and sneaks inside through a mail server chute. Tweety flees Sylvester by hiding in a hat pile and a doll house, evades the shots from a rifle Sylvester uses, and escapes in a vacuum tube. Tweety sends a dynamite stick through another tube, and Sylvester swallows it, thinking it is Tweety. The dynamite blows up inside Sylvester after the cat leaves the store and walks down the street.', 'Sylvester Cat spots Tweety Bird in a display window of an after-hours department store and sneaks inside through a mail server chute. Tweety flees Sylvester by hiding in a hat pile and a doll house, evades the shots from a rifle Sylvester uses, and escapes in a vacuum tube. Tweety sends a dynamite stick through another tube, and Sylvester swallows it, thinking it is Tweety. The dynamite blows up inside Sylvester after the cat leaves the store and walks down the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5BgT9mtKRM9pFZ7vxJJUGq1r6Jm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34711'),
  ('96104551875042329', 'A Birder''s Guide to Everything', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Rob Meyer, Tom Richmond', 'Luke Matheny, Rob Meyer', 'Kodi Smit-McPhee, James Le Gros, Daniela Lavender, Katie Chang, Alex Wolff, Michael Chen, Tobias Campbell, Joel Van Liew', 'PG-13', 'David Portnoy, a 15-year-old birding fanatic, thinks that he''s made the discovery of a lifetime. So, on the eve of his father''s remarriage, he escapes on an epic road trip with his best friends to solidify their place in birding history.', 'David Portnoy, a 15-year-old birding fanatic, thinks that he''s made the discovery of a lifetime. So, on the eve of his father''s remarriage, he escapes on an epic road trip with his best friends to solidify their place in birding history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o30xzZyqVvTTv4qsDkHUdyJFd4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174326'),
  ('272560717858811643', 'A Birthday to Remember', 2003, 'Drama', 'Bella Halben, Hans Steinbichler', 'Hans Steinbichler', 'Johanna Wokalek, Barbara Sukowa, Josef Bierbichler, Peter Simonischek, Frank Giering, Alexander Beyer, Ditte Schupp, Julia Gschnitzer', null, 'Lene Thurner is standing on a train platform in Munich. She has to decide: back to Berlin where she lives, or toward the south, where at the foot of the Alps her family lives on the lonely farm “Hierankl”.', 'Lene Thurner is standing on a train platform in Munich. She has to decide: back to Berlin where she lives, or toward the south, where at the foot of the Alps her family lives on the lonely farm “Hierankl”.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/duGboCtympSQBkkuKzvwQ4aAYRO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12696'),
  ('239048915380587890', 'A Bittersweet Life', 2005, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Kim Ji-yong, Shin Sang-yeul, Kim Jee-woon', 'Kim Jee-woon', 'Lee Byung-hun, Kim Yeong-cheol, Shin Min-a, Kim Roi-ha, Lee Ki-young, Hwang Jung-min, Eric Mun, Oh Dal-su', null, 'Kim Sun-woo is an enforcer and manager for a hotel owned by a cold, calculative crime boss, Kang who assigns Sun-woo to a simple errand while he is away on a business trip; to shadow his young mistress, Hee-soo, for fear that she may be cheating on him with a younger man with the mandate that he must kill them both if he discovers their affair.', 'Kim Sun-woo is an enforcer and manager for a hotel owned by a cold, calculative crime boss, Kang who assigns Sun-woo to a simple errand while he is away on a business trip; to shadow his young mistress, Hee-soo, for fear that she may be cheating on him with a younger man with the mandate that he must kill them both if he discovers their affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqUGAIQqHMMscatykpR6hVBxezA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11344'),
  ('389050260760583481', 'A Black Rose Is an Emblem of Sorrow, a Red Rose an Emblem of Love', 1990, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Sergey Solovyov, Valeriy Reizes, Yuri Senkevich', 'Sergey Solovyov', 'Tatyana Drubich, Aleksandr Abdulov, Aleksandr Zbruev, Ludmila Savelyeva, Aleksandr Bashirov, Mikhail Danilov, Yuriy Shumilo, Ilya Ivanov', null, 'The story happens mainly around "The Old Arbat Street" in the center of Moscow, where always concentrate vendors, poor young artists and musicians. The hero of this film is a boy named Mitiya,who lives with eccentric elder friend in an apartment house on "The Old Arbat". In fact, people who then appear around Mitiya are all unique, eccentric and the space of the apartment house begins to have an unrealistic character as a miniature of unstable society in the end of Soviet Union.', 'The story happens mainly around "The Old Arbat Street" in the center of Moscow, where always concentrate vendors, poor young artists and musicians. The hero of this film is a boy named Mitiya,who lives with eccentric elder friend in an apartment house on "The Old Arbat". In fact, people who then appear around Mitiya are all unique, eccentric and the space of the apartment house begins to have an unrealistic character as a miniature of unstable society in the end of Soviet Union.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3gpUtylwVqe7H0TaoxkF5dQxr2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143117'),
  ('424747313907777120', 'A Black Veil for Lisa', 1968, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Massimo Dallamano, Monica Venturini, Angelo Lotti', 'Massimo Dallamano, Vittoriano Petrilli, Giuseppe Belli', 'John Mills, Luciana Paluzzi, Robert Hoffmann, Renate Kasché, Tullio Altamura, Enzo Fiermonte, Loris Bazzocchi, Jimmy il Fenomeno', null, 'Franz Bulon is a police inspector intent on bringing down a major drug ring operating in Hamburg. Thwarted at every turn by an assassin who is systematically killing informants, jealous of his beautiful, younger wife, Lisa, and suspecting her of having an affair (is it real or imagined?), Bulon can scarcely focus on his work. With jealousy nearing the boiling point, Bulon hires Max, the assassin he has arrested for the recent informant murders, to kill his wife...', 'Franz Bulon is a police inspector intent on bringing down a major drug ring operating in Hamburg. Thwarted at every turn by an assassin who is systematically killing informants, jealous of his beautiful, younger wife, Lisa, and suspecting her of having an affair (is it real or imagined?), Bulon can scarcely focus on his work. With jealousy nearing the boiling point, Bulon hires Max, the assassin he has arrested for the recent informant murders, to kill his wife...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fM18u4PZbASgrbWMOIKLc3wObwW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104935'),
  ('359052209287762756', 'A Blade in the Dark', 1983, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lamberto Bava, Gianlorenzo Battaglia, Michele Soavi', 'Elisa Briganti, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Andrea Occhipinti, Anny Papa, Fabiola Toledo, Michele Soavi, Valéria Cavalli, Stanko Molnar, Lara Lamberti, Giovanni Frezza', null, 'Bruno, an up and coming film composer, has been hired to write the score to a new horror movie. After moving into a secluded villa, life begins to imitate art as a vicious killer starts bumping off anyone and everyone who happens to pay him a visit.', 'Bruno, an up and coming film composer, has been hired to write the score to a new horror movie. After moving into a secluded villa, life begins to imitate art as a vicious killer starts bumping off anyone and everyone who happens to pay him a visit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmrG8GLjiQmrvIQxylEwPXhVgsG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39991'),
  ('981671547227855730', 'A Blood Pledge', 2009, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Lee Jong-yong, Kang Seung-gi', 'Lee Jong-yong', 'Oh Yeon-seo, Jang Kyoung-ah, Son Eun-seo, Song Chae-yun, Yoo Dam-hee, Park Ga-hee, Park Jung-yoon, Kang Byul', null, 'Four friends pledge to commit suicide together but while standing on the ledge, only one of them actually jumps. Her ghost begins to haunt the remaining friends until the pledge is fulfilled.', 'Four friends pledge to commit suicide together but while standing on the ledge, only one of them actually jumps. Her ghost begins to haunt the remaining friends until the pledge is fulfilled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QiG9avZTuvuALNtXalG2dg135U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52413'),
  ('724174829959070740', 'A Bloody Aria', 2006, 'Thriller, Comedy, Crime', 'Kwon Young-rak, Won Shin-yun', 'Won Shin-yun', 'Han Suk-kyu, Lee Moon-sik, Cha Ye-ryun, Oh Dal-su, Lee Byung-joon, Jung Kyung-ho, Shin Hyun-tak, Kim Si-hoo', null, 'A student and her teacher go to a secluded area in the middle of nowhere to practice open-air singing. There they run into a gang of local thugs who initially seem friendly but slowly reveal their sinister side.', 'A student and her teacher go to a secluded area in the middle of nowhere to practice open-air singing. There they run into a gang of local thugs who initially seem friendly but slowly reveal their sinister side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RR0bnpaQ3LnNVHDvB1GWsIl2GQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57270'),
  ('4215910423313508', 'A Bluebird in My Heart', 2018, 'Thriller', 'Jérémie Guez, Dimitri Karakatsanis', 'Jérémie Guez', 'Roland Møller, Veerle Baetens, Lola Le Lann, Lubna Azabal', null, 'An ex-con''s attempts to live a quiet life are derailed when the daughter of the woman sheltering him is the victim of a vicious attack.', 'An ex-con''s attempts to live a quiet life are derailed when the daughter of the woman sheltering him is the victim of a vicious attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M5P2XCmEkXVPZ58J4g4Yh0aSlW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:478308'),
  ('1098700875285122489', 'A Blueprint for Murder', 1953, 'Mystery, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew L. Stone, Leo Tover, Ad Schaumer', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Joseph Cotten, Jean Peters, Gary Merrill, Catherine McLeod, Jack Kruschen, Barney Phillips, Freddy Ridgeway, Harry Carter', 'NR', 'Whitney Cameron is in a quandary: he''s attracted to his beautiful sister-in-law, Lynn, but also harbors serious suspicions about her. Her husband, Cameron''s brother, died under mysterious circumstances, and now that the death of her stepchild, Polly, has been attributed to poisoning, he suspects that Lynn is after his late brother''s estate, and killing everyone in her way.', 'Whitney Cameron is in a quandary: he''s attracted to his beautiful sister-in-law, Lynn, but also harbors serious suspicions about her. Her husband, Cameron''s brother, died under mysterious circumstances, and now that the death of her stepchild, Polly, has been attributed to poisoning, he suspects that Lynn is after his late brother''s estate, and killing everyone in her way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YmRhrJoYoDR323X4Racm8s7dnd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31560'),
  ('328179658050414772', 'A Boat in the Garden', 2025, 'Animation, Drama, Family', 'Jean-François Laguionie', 'Jean-François Laguionie, Anik Leray', 'Elias Hauter, Grégory Gadebois, Coraly Zahonero, André Marcon, Mathilde La Musse, Jérémy Prévost', null, 'I can tell you about my father''s voyage on his boat, because I was with him all the time. It was a rather strange voyage, with no ocean or sea crossing, not even a lock to pass through... The boat stayed at home and so did my father. But that does not mean there was no adventure...', 'I can tell you about my father''s voyage on his boat, because I was with him all the time. It was a rather strange voyage, with no ocean or sea crossing, not even a lock to pass through... The boat stayed at home and so did my father. But that does not mean there was no adventure...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rvOxmytad13dZPCxV0PYbhA0cwm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587391'),
  ('876590389161940055', 'A Body in the Woods', 1996, 'Thriller', 'Joaquín Jordá', 'Joaquín Jordá', 'Rossy de Palma, Ricard Borràs, Pep Molina, Núria Prims, Mingo Ràfols, Jaume Valls, Julieta Serrano, Pep Tosar', null, 'A hard-hitting police investigation with Rossy de Palma taking the lead as the police officer responsible for solving the murder of a young woman whose mutilated body is found in the woods by local hunters.', 'A hard-hitting police investigation with Rossy de Palma taking the lead as the police officer responsible for solving the murder of a young woman whose mutilated body is found in the woods by local hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OVHIEdro8UP5Z2Yr447T04vVep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175371'),
  ('831150314181253217', 'À boire', 2004, 'Comedy', 'Marion Vernoux, Dominique Colin', 'Marion Vernoux, Thomas Bidegain, Frédéric Jardin', 'Emmanuelle Béart, Édouard Baer, Atmen Kelif, Yves Verhoeven, Jean-Michel Tinivelli, Claude Perron, Jackie Berroyer, Marina Foïs', null, 'Three disparate people meet in a bizarre skiing accident: an alcoholic doctor who has just been left by his wife, a beautiful but directionless woman, and the bumbling Algerian man who caused the accident. They become fond of each other, and of liquor.', 'Three disparate people meet in a bizarre skiing accident: an alcoholic doctor who has just been left by his wife, a beautiful but directionless woman, and the bumbling Algerian man who caused the accident. They become fond of each other, and of liquor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jx1EuMn4JtLpjvj3Q1KQ6Gt5737.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45829'),
  ('800179946801335094', 'A Bomb Was Stolen', 1962, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ion Popescu-Gopo', 'Ion Popescu-Gopo', 'Iurie Darie, Liliana Tomescu, Emil Botta, Draga Olteanu Matei, Florin Piersic, Geo Saizescu, Haralambie Boroş, Eugenia Balaure', null, 'A dialogue free Romanian science-fiction spy-comedy that draws upon farce, satire and surrealism as it subversively deconstructs the spy thriller with the protagonist''s accidental discovery of a nuclear suitcase bomb and the subsequent fight over ownership between the rival powers of the criminals and the military.', 'A dialogue free Romanian science-fiction spy-comedy that draws upon farce, satire and surrealism as it subversively deconstructs the spy thriller with the protagonist''s accidental discovery of a nuclear suitcase bomb and the subsequent fight over ownership between the rival powers of the criminals and the military.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rDWNXbEMrGL8V81tUGw3UbdOi7N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155820'),
  ('563604555539421657', 'A Bone to Pick: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2015, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'Brad Medhurst, Shane Erron West, Martin Wood', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Lexa Doig, Marilu Henner, Peter Benson, Miranda Frigon, Bruce Dawson, Sonya Salomaa, Stephen Huszar', null, 'A librarian with a sharp mind for murder, Aurora Teagarden is known around her small town as a master sleuth. When her friend Jane unexpectedly dies and leaves Aurora everything in her will, she also leaves a troubling murder mystery haunting her neighborhood. It is up to Aurora to piece together the clues—including a skull, its missing skeleton and a suspicious group of neighbors—and solve the murder before she becomes the unlikely killer’s next victim.', 'A librarian with a sharp mind for murder, Aurora Teagarden is known around her small town as a master sleuth. When her friend Jane unexpectedly dies and leaves Aurora everything in her will, she also leaves a troubling murder mystery haunting her neighborhood. It is up to Aurora to piece together the clues—including a skull, its missing skeleton and a suspicious group of neighbors—and solve the murder before she becomes the unlikely killer’s next victim.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqpbgbIlErLBO39Y2kpYCi39Xxa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325078'),
  ('326426139451173520', 'A Bookshop in Paris', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sergio Castellitto, Italo Petriccione', 'Margaret Mazzantini', 'Sergio Castellitto, Bérénice Bejo, Matilda De Angelis, Clementino, Sandra Milo, Alex Lutz, Marie-Philomène Nga, Nassim Lyes', null, 'Vincenzo dedicates his life to the bookshop he owns in Paris and to his daughter Albertine, forced to stay home because of an accident occurred to her a few years earlier. One day Yolande, an exuberant, eccentric, funny and beautiful girl, bursts into Vincenzo’s shop. Charmed by her vital energy, the man starts feeling again emotions he’s been chocking-off for too long, and which will make him question his melancholic and somehow suspended way of facing life.', 'Vincenzo dedicates his life to the bookshop he owns in Paris and to his daughter Albertine, forced to stay home because of an accident occurred to her a few years earlier. One day Yolande, an exuberant, eccentric, funny and beautiful girl, bursts into Vincenzo’s shop. Charmed by her vital energy, the man starts feeling again emotions he’s been chocking-off for too long, and which will make him question his melancholic and somehow suspended way of facing life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/btm4w3DHIOx6o3VVEFX2MN4OD5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:654344'),
  ('391222323449415891', 'A Boring Afternoon', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ivan Passer, Květa Ondráková, Zdenka Petřková', 'Bohumil Hrabal, Ivan Passer', 'Kamila Turková, Leopold Smolík, Josef Vaništa, Jan Tožička, Miloš Končický, Ota Hurych, Bohumil Hrabal', null, 'Several parties—a prostitute, aging football players, working girls, two men playing pool, and a hedonistic young man—each coalesce in a tavern.', 'Several parties—a prostitute, aging football players, working girls, two men playing pool, and a hedonistic young man—each coalesce in a tavern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEmsbD5spkfsVsgyoWIdCy1LL8T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55743'),
  ('535576716932877319', 'A Borrowed Life', 1995, 'Drama', 'Wu Nien-jen, Liu Cheng-Chuan', 'Wu Nien-jen', 'Tsai Chen-nan, Jun Fu, Ing-How Tan, Akio Chen, Lee Yung-Feng', null, 'Sega''s children, born into post-war Chinese rule, can''t relate to their father''s love for Japanese culture, having grown up under Japanese rule before WWII.', 'Sega''s children, born into post-war Chinese rule, can''t relate to their father''s love for Japanese culture, having grown up under Japanese rule before WWII.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kjIg6GM1D2p16gWq4isNj4fSggp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163202'),
  ('792534080557569449', 'A Boss in the Living Room', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Chantal Toesca, Giuseppe Tedeschi, Federico Angelucci', 'Luca Miniero', 'Paola Cortellesi, Rocco Papaleo, Luca Argentero, Angela Finocchiaro, Ale, Franz, Massimo De Lorenzo, Lavinia De'' Cocci', null, 'Cristina lives a peaceful life until her older brother Ciro, who has to attend a trial, asks to spend house arrests at Cristina’s home.', 'Cristina lives a peaceful life until her older brother Ciro, who has to attend a trial, asks to spend house arrests at Cristina’s home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bBb7H7LMycRYb3omVbzlEoxihR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247218'),
  ('694478962736353913', 'A Bottle in the Gaza Sea', 2011, 'Drama', 'Thierry Binisti, Laurent Brunet', 'Valerie Zenatti, Thierry Binisti', 'Hiam Abbass, Abraham Belaga, Agathe Bonitzer, Reef Cohen, François Loriquet, Loai Nofi, Mahmoud Shalaby', null, 'Tai is 17 years old. Naim is 20. She''s Israeli. He''s Palestinian. She lives in Jerusalem. He lives in Gaza. They were born in a land of scorched earth, where fathers bury their children. They must endure an explosive situation that is not of their choosing at an age where young people are falling in love and taking their place in adult life. A bottle thrown in the sea and a correspondence by email nurture the slender hope that their relationship might give them the strength to confront this harsh reality to grapple with it, and thereby ever so slightly change it. Only 60 miles separate them but how many bombings, check-points, sleepless nights and bloodstained days stand between them?', 'Tai is 17 years old. Naim is 20. She''s Israeli. He''s Palestinian. She lives in Jerusalem. He lives in Gaza. They were born in a land of scorched earth, where fathers bury their children. They must endure an explosive situation that is not of their choosing at an age where young people are falling in love and taking their place in adult life. A bottle thrown in the sea and a correspondence by email nurture the slender hope that their relationship might give them the strength to confront this harsh reality to grapple with it, and thereby ever so slightly change it. Only 60 miles separate them but how many bombings, check-points, sleepless nights and bloodstained days stand between them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9W12xfX5rHUhF8kvr1kciDOyjA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102292'),
  ('897956258647992293', 'A Box With Secret', 1976, 'Animation', 'Valeriy Ugarov, Mikhail Druyan, I. Peterson', 'Evgeniy Agranovich', 'Vladimir Martynov, Andrey Gorin, Viktor Gusev', null, 'It is a musical imagination on the theme of the fairy tale of V.Odoevsky "Small town in a snuffbox". The film represents an original tiny rock opera. Source : www.animator.ru', 'It is a musical imagination on the theme of the fairy tale of V.Odoevsky "Small town in a snuffbox". The film represents an original tiny rock opera. Source : www.animator.ru', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mIdtPoBNoqbW96tLQUo9duY2HY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90259'),
  ('542598710574318620', 'A Boy and a Girl', 1984, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Marco Risi, Claudio Risi, Giuseppe Maccari', 'Furio Scarpelli, Marco Risi', 'Jerry Calà, Marina Suma, Sandro Ghiani, Monica Scattini, Francesca Ventura, Elena Cantarone, Anna Cardini, Serena Grandi', null, 'Anna and Calogero are in love and living together in a low-scale apartment while going to the University of Milan. When Anna discovers she is pregnant, Calogero handles the situation like the moral coward he is.', 'Anna and Calogero are in love and living together in a low-scale apartment while going to the University of Milan. When Anna discovers she is pregnant, Calogero handles the situation like the moral coward he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9q0m1b8AN04llDSdjZaYnXk0TYa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210612'),
  ('907734799088483862', 'A Boy and His Dog', 1946, 'Drama, Family', 'LeRoy Prinz, Charles P. Boyle', 'Saul Elkins', 'Billy Sheffield, Harry Davenport, Dorothy Adams, Russell Simpson, Eddy Waller, Truman Bradley, Heinie Conklin, Morgan Flowers', null, '11 year old Davy discovers that a chained gentle dog, Buck, is badly wounded around the neck because of the thick, tight collar he is made to constantly wear by his unfeeling owner. When Buck comes through the fence and becomes stuck, Davy removes the collar. Even though the boy tells him to stay in his owner''s yard, the dog follows him home.', '11 year old Davy discovers that a chained gentle dog, Buck, is badly wounded around the neck because of the thick, tight collar he is made to constantly wear by his unfeeling owner. When Buck comes through the fence and becomes stuck, Davy removes the collar. Even though the boy tells him to stay in his owner''s yard, the dog follows him home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gakF7BVSwYK4IPJDqPaRfjhlYGj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240406'),
  ('720668019518624586', 'A Boy and His Dog', 1975, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Comedy', 'L.Q. Jones, John Arthur Morrill', 'L.Q. Jones', 'Don Johnson, Susanne Benton, Jason Robards, Tim McIntire, Alvy Moore, Helene Winston, Charles McGraw, Hal Baylor', 'R', 'Set in the year 2024 in post-apocalyptic America, 18-year old Vic and his telepathic dog, Blood, are scavengers in the desolate wilderness ravaged by World War IV, where survivors must battle for food and shelter in the desert-like wasteland. Vic and Blood eke out a meager existence, foraging for food and fighting gangs of cutthroats.', 'Set in the year 2024 in post-apocalyptic America, 18-year old Vic and his telepathic dog, Blood, are scavengers in the desolate wilderness ravaged by World War IV, where survivors must battle for food and shelter in the desert-like wasteland. Vic and Blood eke out a meager existence, foraging for food and fighting gangs of cutthroats.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMbkoFzD5sEQvEaqRsIh4pTBJVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4917'),
  ('668357126565601289', 'A Boy and His Samurai', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura, Gen Kobayashi', 'Yoshihiro Nakamura', 'Ryo Nishikido, Rie Tomosaka, Fuku Suzuki, Hiroki Konno, Keisuke Horibe, Hitomi Sato, Shioli Kutsuna, Jun Inoue', null, 'A samurai from the Edo Period time travels to present day Japan where he meets a divorcee and her son. Soon, he discovers a passion for making pastries.', 'A samurai from the Edo Period time travels to present day Japan where he meets a divorcee and her son. Soon, he discovers a passion for making pastries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hIwFkTKpcn9KmQrsnHNEl6yX4M9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61682'),
  ('673216893921312215', 'A Boy Called Christmas', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'James Price, Kevin Woodhouse, Laura Gurney', 'Ol Parker, Gil Kenan', 'Henry Lawfull, Michiel Huisman, Stephen Merchant, Maggie Smith, Sally Hawkins, Jim Broadbent, Toby Jones, Kristen Wiig', 'PG', 'An ordinary young boy called Nikolas sets out on an extraordinary adventure into the snowy north in search of his father who is on a quest to discover the fabled village of the elves, Elfhelm. Taking with him a headstrong reindeer called Blitzen and a loyal pet mouse, Nikolas soon meets his destiny in this magical and endearing story that proves nothing is impossible…', 'An ordinary young boy called Nikolas sets out on an extraordinary adventure into the snowy north in search of his father who is on a quest to discover the fabled village of the elves, Elfhelm. Taking with him a headstrong reindeer called Blitzen and a loyal pet mouse, Nikolas soon meets his destiny in this magical and endearing story that proves nothing is impossible…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1sRejtiHOZGggZd9RcmdqbapLM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615666'),
  ('578528409938120999', 'A Boy from Calabria', 1987, 'Drama', 'Luigi Comencini, Letizia Picone, Maurizio Sciarra', 'Ugo Pirro, Luigi Comencini, Francesca Comencini', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Diego Abatantuono, Thérèse Liotard, Santo Polimeno, Giada Desideri, Enzo Ruoti, Jacques Peyrac, Jean-René Masrevery', null, 'Set in 1960, the year of the Rome Olympics, a 13 year-old boy with aspirations to become an athlete befriends an ageing, disabled bus driver who understands his ambitions.', 'Set in 1960, the year of the Rome Olympics, a 13 year-old boy with aspirations to become an athlete befriends an ageing, disabled bus driver who understands his ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksz91zuYTowIJm2Xju6BVvVTmrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57914'),
  ('629123263914402715', 'A Boy Named Charlie Brown', 1969, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Peter Robbins, Pamelyn Ferdin, Glenn Gilger, Andy Pforsich, Sally Dryer, Bill Melendez, Ann Altieri, Erin Sullivan', 'G', 'Poor Charlie Brown. He can''t fly a kite, and he always loses in baseball. Having his faults projected onto a screen by Lucy doesn''t help him much either. Against the sage advice and taunting of the girls in his class, he volunteers for the class spelling bee.', 'Poor Charlie Brown. He can''t fly a kite, and he always loses in baseball. Having his faults projected onto a screen by Lucy doesn''t help him much either. Against the sage advice and taunting of the girls in his class, he volunteers for the class spelling bee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/whBPKLOJnFhuPxxLKmGstqxY3fP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15374'),
  ('876478339131073164', 'A Boyfriend for Christmas', 2004, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Kevin Connor, Amit Bhattacharya', 'Roger Schroeder', 'Kelli Williams, Charles Durning, Patrick Muldoon, Bruce Thomas, Shannon Wilcox, Martin Mull, Bridget White, David Starzyk', null, 'Holly Grant has learned a long time ago not to rely on Santa Claus leaving Mr. Right in her Christmas stocking. But Holly is in for a surprise when a handsome man arrives on her doorstep with a twinkle in his eye and Yuletide tree in tow.', 'Holly Grant has learned a long time ago not to rely on Santa Claus leaving Mr. Right in her Christmas stocking. But Holly is in for a surprise when a handsome man arrives on her doorstep with a twinkle in his eye and Yuletide tree in tow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nj4Dg2xsHzTpSvgwxRrs6uyHHjh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26463'),
  ('120034067970987833', 'A Boyfriend for My Wife', 2008, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Taratuto, Agustín Arévalo, Luciana de Vincenzo', 'Pablo Solarz', 'Adrián Suar, Valeria Bertuccelli, Gabriel Goity, Marcelo Xicarte, Luis Herrera, Martín Salazar, Oscar Núñez, Benjamín Amadeo', null, 'El Tenso does not know how to face his ill-tempered wife, Tana, to tell her that he wants to separate. Carlos, a friend of Tenso, suggests him to invert the situation and cause Tana to leave him by hiring Cuervo Flores, an irresistible seducer, to try and charm his wife until she falls in love with him.', 'El Tenso does not know how to face his ill-tempered wife, Tana, to tell her that he wants to separate. Carlos, a friend of Tenso, suggests him to invert the situation and cause Tana to leave him by hiring Cuervo Flores, an irresistible seducer, to try and charm his wife until she falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybMKaNMoBie2ebXf4TIz1Sh70Iq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16916'),
  ('1128687395027399052', 'A Boyfriend for My Wife', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Julia Rezende, Dante Belluti, Raissa Drumond', 'Pablo Solarz, Julia Rezende, Lusa Silvestre', 'Ingrid Guimarães, Caco Ciocler, Domingos Montagner, Paulo Vilhena, Marcos Veras, Miá Mello, Antônio Petrin, Letícia Colin', null, 'Chico is tired of the relationship and his wife Nena''s complaints. After spending 15 years together Chico has zero corauge to ask for a divorce. He decides to follow his friend''s advice and hire a lover for his wife, in hopes that she gets involved with him and ends their marriage.', 'Chico is tired of the relationship and his wife Nena''s complaints. After spending 15 years together Chico has zero corauge to ask for a divorce. He decides to follow his friend''s advice and hire a lover for his wife, in hopes that she gets involved with him and ends their marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teQSBVgy689tFFBlUzESl59UXLu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355950'),
  ('359726777133437570', 'A Bramble House Christmas', 2017, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Ron Stannett, Steven R. Monroe', 'Jamie Pachino', 'Autumn Reeser, David Haydn-Jones, Teryl Rothery, Liam Hughes, Hilary Jardine, Julia Benson, Andrew Airlie, Bruce Dawson', null, 'While settling his father’s estate, Finn Conrad becomes suspicious as to why the man left a nurse $100,000. His dad knew her for less than two months before he died. Just before Christmas, Finn wants what to reclaim what he considers his family’s money, going undercover to investigate the bed and breakfast the nurse has recently taken over. When Finn meets Willa, he discovers she’s not a conniving gold digger at all, but a woman in need who put the money to good use. When she discovers his true identity, will it keep Willa from ever trusting him again?', 'While settling his father’s estate, Finn Conrad becomes suspicious as to why the man left a nurse $100,000. His dad knew her for less than two months before he died. Just before Christmas, Finn wants what to reclaim what he considers his family’s money, going undercover to investigate the bed and breakfast the nurse has recently taken over. When Finn meets Willa, he discovers she’s not a conniving gold digger at all, but a woman in need who put the money to good use. When she discovers his true identity, will it keep Willa from ever trusting him again?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dosP338nILsuFDfJuKjNMvaDcbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:479606'),
  ('901809234990510938', 'A Brand New Life', 2009, 'Drama', 'Ounie Lecomte, Kim Min-jae, Kim Hyun-seok', 'Ounie Lecomte, Lee Chang-dong, Lee Jung-hwa', 'Kim Sae-ron, Park Do-yeon, Ko A-sung, Sul Kyung-gu, Moon Sung-keun, Jung Ye-jin, Oh Man-seok, Shin Young-sik', null, 'Young Jin-hee is taken by her father to an orphanage near Seoul. He leaves her there never to return, and she struggles to come to grips with her fate. Jin-hee desperately believes her father will come back for her and take her on a trip.', 'Young Jin-hee is taken by her father to an orphanage near Seoul. He leaves her there never to return, and she struggles to come to grips with her fate. Jin-hee desperately believes her father will come back for her and take her on a trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8A4ER897Wgm6b4pRBjyHf5waaq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48508'),
  ('820612141339119169', 'A Breath of Fresh Air', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luca Nervegna, Alessio Lauria, Manuel Carlucci', 'Aldo Baglio, Alessio Lauria, Valerio Bariletti', 'Aldo Baglio, Lucia Ocone, Giovanni Calcagno, Ludovica Martino, Davide Calgaro, Manuela Ventura, Tony Sperandeo, Sergio Vespertino', null, 'Two proud and estranged brothers, a disputed inheritance and a past that comes back. When he hears about the passing of his father - whom he has not seen in many years - Salvo returns to his native Sicily. He intends to convince his brother Lillo to sell the family farm and save his pizzeria, which is about to go bankrupt - a secret that he has kept even from his wife and children. But things will not be easy and Salvo will have to come to terms with his choices. A bittersweet comedy about family relations and how one never stops growing up, not even at fifty.', 'Two proud and estranged brothers, a disputed inheritance and a past that comes back. When he hears about the passing of his father - whom he has not seen in many years - Salvo returns to his native Sicily. He intends to convince his brother Lillo to sell the family farm and save his pizzeria, which is about to go bankrupt - a secret that he has kept even from his wife and children. But things will not be easy and Salvo will have to come to terms with his choices. A bittersweet comedy about family relations and how one never stops growing up, not even at fifty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tECOEWgWfvR1fhteCvYLupYwN9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:970423'),
  ('754443023086542900', 'A Breath of Scandal', 1960, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Michael Curtiz, Mario Montuori, Mario Russo', 'Sidney Howard, Ring Lardner, Jr., Karl Schneider', 'Sophia Loren, Maurice Chevalier, John Gavin, Angela Lansbury, Isabel Jeans, Tullio Carminati, Milly Vitale, Carlo Hintermann', 'NR', 'A European princess jeopardizes her crown when she falls for an American millionaire.', 'A European princess jeopardizes her crown when she falls for an American millionaire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7SGZGMxFhaHU0gu6RDWtFlFgkif.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52003'),
  ('695386633683832314', 'A Breed Apart', 1984, 'Action, Romance', 'Philippe Mora, Geoffrey Stephenson', 'Paul Wheeler', 'Rutger Hauer, Powers Boothe, Kathleen Turner, Donald Pleasence, Brion James, John Dennis Johnston, Jayne Bentzen, Andy Fenwick', 'R', 'A conservationist and a widow meet a mountain climber hired to steal bald-eagle eggs.', 'A conservationist and a widow meet a mountain climber hired to steal bald-eagle eggs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhHIn8F1SDPCN7vRELiUF5fG4Tr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96404'),
  ('1035705258179951849', 'A Breed Apart', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery, Action', 'Nathan Furst, Griff Furst, Jon Keng', 'Griff Furst, Nathan Furst', 'Grace Caroline Currey, Virginia Gardner, Riele Downs, Zak Steiner, Page Kennedy, Joey Bragg, Troy Gentile, Hayden Panettiere', 'R', 'When Violet accepts an invitation to a private island with some of the world''s most famous social influencers, she expects a weekend of unrivaled viral opportunity. She soon becomes part of her own horrific reality show when the guests are pitted against each other to capture the island''s legendary man-eating dogs before they become victims of the monstrous canines.', 'When Violet accepts an invitation to a private island with some of the world''s most famous social influencers, she expects a weekend of unrivaled viral opportunity. She soon becomes part of her own horrific reality show when the guests are pitted against each other to capture the island''s legendary man-eating dogs before they become victims of the monstrous canines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6IiNUUV6H2W1wUc8e1w4GfuQCOE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1303055'),
  ('533639547954015043', 'A Bride for Christmas', 2012, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Brenton Spencer, Gary Yates', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Arielle Kebbel, Sage Brocklebank, Peter Benson, Jordana Largy, Chelsey Reist, Andrew W. Walker, Kimberley Sustad, Julian Bailey', null, 'Bride-to-be Jessie Patterson calls off her third engagement - during the ceremony! She swears off serious relationships, until she meets and is pursued by Aiden MacTiernan. Aiden, on the other hand, has bet his friends he is marriage material, and can find a fiancé in the four weeks leading up to Christmas. When Jessie and Aiden begin to fall for each other, Jessie must decide if she is ready for serious love, and Aiden must decide if his bet is worth risking his relationship with Jessie.', 'Bride-to-be Jessie Patterson calls off her third engagement - during the ceremony! She swears off serious relationships, until she meets and is pursued by Aiden MacTiernan. Aiden, on the other hand, has bet his friends he is marriage material, and can find a fiancé in the four weeks leading up to Christmas. When Jessie and Aiden begin to fall for each other, Jessie must decide if she is ready for serious love, and Aiden must decide if his bet is worth risking his relationship with Jessie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d5oFtJZI0PREMTft27lgW4nr7JV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147132'),
  ('688466797812431843', 'A Bride for Rip Van Winkle', 2016, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shunji Iwai, Chigi Kanbe, Kôichi Izumihara', 'Shunji Iwai', 'Haru Kuroki, Go Ayano, Cocco, Hideko Hara, Go Jibiki, Soko Wada, Tomoko Mariya, Yugo Saso', null, 'A woman hires actors and strangers to pretend to be her friends and family at her wedding.', 'A woman hires actors and strangers to pretend to be her friends and family at her wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vBg6R0XcrpsECIThvRmuOdjg1Mi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382170'),
  ('333659251013438088', 'A Bridge Too Far', 1977, 'Drama, History, War', 'Richard Attenborough, Geoffrey Unsworth, Steve Lanning', 'William Goldman', 'Dirk Bogarde, James Caan, Michael Caine, Sean Connery, Edward Fox, Robert Redford, Elliott Gould, Anthony Hopkins', 'PG', 'The story of Operation Market Garden—a failed attempt by the allies in the latter stages of WWII to end the war quickly by securing three bridges in Holland allowing access over the Rhine into Germany. A combination of poor allied intelligence and the presence of two crack German panzer divisions meant that the final part of this operation (the bridge in Arnhem over the Rhine) was doomed to failure.', 'The story of Operation Market Garden—a failed attempt by the allies in the latter stages of WWII to end the war quickly by securing three bridges in Holland allowing access over the Rhine into Germany. A combination of poor allied intelligence and the presence of two crack German panzer divisions meant that the final part of this operation (the bridge in Arnhem over the Rhine) was doomed to failure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lszOk3Xmh7qpLaM9J4K9E6ADLk1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5902'),
  ('931414690565983647', 'A Brief Affair', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Gian Enrico Bianchi, Ludovica Rampoldi', 'Ludovica Rampoldi', 'Pilar Fogliati, Adriano Giannini, Andrea Carpenzano, Valeria Golino, Selene Caramazza, Massimo De Lorenzo, Giulia Maenza, Cristian Stelluti', null, 'Lea and Rocco meet by chance in a bar and an instant attraction ignites between them. From that moment, a secret affair begins, consisting of fleeting, clandestine meetings in a hotel room. However, as time passes, Lea''s obsession with Rocco intensifies, leading her to intrude more and more into his life. The story soon takes an unexpected and unsettling turn.', 'Lea and Rocco meet by chance in a bar and an instant attraction ignites between them. From that moment, a secret affair begins, consisting of fleeting, clandestine meetings in a hotel room. However, as time passes, Lea''s obsession with Rocco intensifies, leading her to intrude more and more into his life. The story soon takes an unexpected and unsettling turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/avqBTEK53Zqyr5sWIi6EuE51UaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1299382'),
  ('620986229213886334', 'A Brief History of Time', 1991, 'Documentary', 'Errol Morris, John Bailey, Nick Heckstall-Smith', null, 'Stephen Hawking, Isobel Hawking, Janet Humphrey, Mary Hawking, Basil King, Derek Powney, Norman Dix, Robert Berman', 'G', 'This shows physicist Stephen Hawking''s life as he deals with the ALS that renders him immobile and unable to speak without the use of a computer. Hawking''s friends, family, classmates, and peers are interviewed not only about his theories but the man himself.', 'This shows physicist Stephen Hawking''s life as he deals with the ALS that renders him immobile and unable to speak without the use of a computer. Hawking''s friends, family, classmates, and peers are interviewed not only about his theories but the man himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3sVrDThz8Xthfq2EglWoypKEfU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358'),
  ('232484618882165306', 'A Brief Vacation', 1973, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vittorio De Sica, Ennio Guarnieri, Luisa Alessandri', 'Cesare Zavattini, Rafael J. Salvia', 'Florinda Bolkan, Renato Salvatori, Daniel Quenaud, José María Prada, Teresa Gimpera, Hugo Blanco, Julia Peña, Miranda Campa', 'PG', 'Forced to support herself, her children, her physically incapacitated husband and her obtrusive brother and mother, a downtrodden working woman contracts tuberculosis. She is granted a brief vacation at a health spa, where a whole new world — and potential new life — is opened up to her.', 'Forced to support herself, her children, her physically incapacitated husband and her obtrusive brother and mother, a downtrodden working woman contracts tuberculosis. She is granted a brief vacation at a health spa, where a whole new world — and potential new life — is opened up to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qFwfvPHsZJGL4zCDxegbARQFgVq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76452'),
  ('140358605261481777', 'A Bright Lawyer', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Ale McHaddo, Paulo de Tarso Disca, Pedro Corder', 'Luiz Felipe Mazzoni, Ale McHaddo, Cristiane Wersom', 'Leandro Hassum, Claudia Campolina, Bruno Garcia, Marcelo Mansfield , Olivia Lopes, Felipe Torres, Cristiane Wersom, Fernando Alves Pinto', null, 'In the film, actor Leandro Hassum plays lawyer Michelle Barbieri, known as Mike. The company where he works is bought by an office that decides to keep only women in its positions. However, the character is not fired, since, due to her name, the HR department believes that she is a woman. The character then starts dressing in women''s clothing to stay in his job.', 'In the film, actor Leandro Hassum plays lawyer Michelle Barbieri, known as Mike. The company where he works is bought by an office that decides to keep only women in its positions. However, the character is not fired, since, due to her name, the HR department believes that she is a woman. The character then starts dressing in women''s clothing to stay in his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1O1GV6UhiWW7uRG8m92VApsi96V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1251875'),
  ('562317004523150378', 'A Bright Shining Lie', 1998, 'Drama, War, TV Movie', 'Terry George, Jack Conroy', null, 'Bill Paxton, Amy Madigan, Donal Logue, Robert John Burke, Vivian Wu, Ed Lauter, Kurtwood Smith, Eric Bogosian', null, 'Something in his past keeps career Army man John Paul Vann from advancing past colonel. He views being sent to Vietnam as part of the US military advisory force a stepping stone to promotion. However, he disagrees vocally (and on the record) with the way the war is being run and is forced to leave the military. Returning to Vietnam as a civilian working with the Army, he comes to despise some South Vietnamese officers while he takes charge of some of the U.S. forces and continues his liaisons with Vietnamese women.', 'Something in his past keeps career Army man John Paul Vann from advancing past colonel. He views being sent to Vietnam as part of the US military advisory force a stepping stone to promotion. However, he disagrees vocally (and on the record) with the way the war is being run and is forced to leave the military. Returning to Vietnam as a civilian working with the Army, he comes to despise some South Vietnamese officers while he takes charge of some of the U.S. forces and continues his liaisons with Vietnamese women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/M23xbNgYsUEOYMgH48K72rXsi4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13923'),
  ('411489749191041530', 'A Brighter Summer Day', 1991, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Edward Yang, Longyu Zhang, Chang Hui-kung', 'Mingtang Lai, Edward Yang, Yen Hung-ya', 'Chang Chen, Lisa Yang, Chang Kuo-Chu, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Wang Chuan, Chang Han, Chiang Hsiu-Chiung, Stephanie Lai', 'NR', 'A boy experiences first love, friendships and injustices growing up in 1960s Taiwan.', 'A boy experiences first love, friendships and injustices growing up in 1960s Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3l8fOAwiN3N5n3hHnZ51eog7Zu2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15804'),
  ('654973936369961474', 'A Brighter Tomorrow', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yassine Qnia', 'Yassine Qnia', 'Soufiane Guerrab, Souheila Yacoub, Thibault Cathalifaud, M''Barek Belkouk, Jamil McCraven, Tassadit Mandi, Inès Melab, Maya Racha', null, 'Thirty-something Mehdi is a safecracker. He and his mates are just trying to get by, but robbery isn’t paying like it used to. Day to day Mehdi tries to be a good son to his mother, and a good father to his 1-year-old son to win back his ex, Sarah.', 'Thirty-something Mehdi is a safecracker. He and his mates are just trying to get by, but robbery isn’t paying like it used to. Day to day Mehdi tries to be a good son to his mother, and a good father to his 1-year-old son to win back his ex, Sarah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haqxFMNp0ImmqFFzHvQTnx8WmSo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:783555'),
  ('661022335903761645', 'A Brighter Tomorrow', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Nanni Moretti, Michele D''Attanasio, Ciro Scognamiglio', 'Nanni Moretti, Valia Santella, Francesca Marciano', 'Nanni Moretti, Margherita Buy, Silvio Orlando, Barbora Bobuľová, Mathieu Amalric, Jerzy Stuhr, Zsolt Anger, Teco Celio', null, 'An old film director, unhappy with the movie he''s shooting about a Hungarian circus stranded in Rome during the 1956 anti-Soviet uprising, faces divorce from his producer wife and other problems.', 'An old film director, unhappy with the movie he''s shooting about a Hungarian circus stranded in Rome during the 1956 anti-Soviet uprising, faces divorce from his producer wife and other problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rN5ExiIpjHGAcm5mN4RsVzi0y1e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:925263'),
  ('910270510388589749', 'A Broken Leghorn', 1959, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray', null, 'On Old MacDonald''s farm, an egg hatches in slow-witted hen Miss Prissy''s nest, and out of the shell comes a baby rooster. Fearing he will be replaced by the new arrival and sent to be slaughtered, Foghorn Leghorn plots to do away with the tyke.', 'On Old MacDonald''s farm, an egg hatches in slow-witted hen Miss Prissy''s nest, and out of the shell comes a baby rooster. Fearing he will be replaced by the new arrival and sent to be slaughtered, Foghorn Leghorn plots to do away with the tyke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyHcn7zETKbeptBy7W4oPjTDI3s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146466'),
  ('708443438967241816', 'A Broken Love Story', 1982, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ömer Kavur, Aslı Selçuk, Mehmet İnhan', 'Ömer Kavur', 'Hümeyra, Kadir İnanır, Halil Ergün, Güler Ökten, Orhan Çağman, Özlem Onursal, Reha Kıral, Kamran Usluer', null, 'Fuat is forced into an "advantegeous" marriage to a rich girl due to his family financial lowness. He, however loves another, Aysel. After he loses his best friend, Bedri, to suicide, he rebels against the system with heartbreaking results.', 'Fuat is forced into an "advantegeous" marriage to a rich girl due to his family financial lowness. He, however loves another, Aysel. After he loses his best friend, Bedri, to suicide, he rebels against the system with heartbreaking results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i85g153YWtfcUTxCORGwoxKlJ1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281895'),
  ('25587698339299106', 'A Bronx Morning', 1931, 'Documentary', 'Jay Leyda', null, null, null, 'Arrival in the Bronx is shown with a view from an elevated train as it enters the city. Then follows a montage of sights from the Bronx. Many typical neighborhood activities are shown, along with scenes from many local businesses.', 'Arrival in the Bronx is shown with a view from an elevated train as it enters the city. Then follows a montage of sights from the Bronx. Many typical neighborhood activities are shown, along with scenes from many local businesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67Xlwm5nfxVQjY1FdOJ9J470N35.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144811'),
  ('1135085006418584207', 'A Bronx Tale', 1993, 'Drama, Crime', 'Robert De Niro, Reynaldo Villalobos, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Chazz Palminteri', 'Robert De Niro, Chazz Palminteri, Lillo Brancato, Francis Capra, Taral Hicks, Kathrine Narducci, Clem Caserta, Alfred Sauchelli, Jr.', 'R', 'Set in the Bronx during the tumultuous 1960s, an adolescent boy is torn between his honest, working-class father and a violent yet charismatic crime boss. Complicating matters is the youngster''s growing attraction - forbidden in his neighborhood - for a beautiful black girl.', 'Set in the Bronx during the tumultuous 1960s, an adolescent boy is torn between his honest, working-class father and a violent yet charismatic crime boss. Complicating matters is the youngster''s growing attraction - forbidden in his neighborhood - for a beautiful black girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sDbO6LmLYtyqAoFTPpRcMgPSCEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1607'),
  ('1038275076909429280', 'A Brother', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Victor Habchy, Martin Escoffier', 'Martin Escoffier, Victor Habchy', 'Simon Royer, Marin Lafitte, Oriane Barbaza, Iris Gastellu, Ambre Rambaud, Simon Escoffier, Thomas Judes', null, '15-year-old Tom is going to spend another calm summer with his parents and younger sister at their summer house. But by fate, another family comes to spend some time with them, with their 17-year-old son Félix. In the unforgettable summer, Félix will introduce Tom to new things...', '15-year-old Tom is going to spend another calm summer with his parents and younger sister at their summer house. But by fate, another family comes to spend some time with them, with their 17-year-old son Félix. In the unforgettable summer, Félix will introduce Tom to new things...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbcOBz0R9TrYnAuRbU3EGagnmBz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:565492'),
  ('323820153465245886', 'A Brother and 7 Siblings', 2025, 'Drama, Family', 'Yandy Laurens, Nanda Giri, Dimas Bagus Triatma Yoga', 'Yandy Laurens', 'Chicco Kurniawan, Amanda Rawles, Fatih Unru, Freya Jayawardana, Ahmad Nadif, Kawai Labiba, Niken Anjani, Ringgo Agus Rahman', null, 'After the untimely death of his older sister and her husband, a struggling young architect suddenly becomes a "single parent" for his nieces and nephews. When the opportunity for a better life arises, he must choose between his love life, career, or his family.', 'After the untimely death of his older sister and her husband, a struggling young architect suddenly becomes a "single parent" for his nieces and nephews. When the opportunity for a better life arises, he must choose between his love life, career, or his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d8iIVE9KmkSITslMYD6WvHvbRFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1310741'),
  ('555322710477949840', 'A Brother’s Love', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Monia Chokri, Josée Deshaies', 'Monia Chokri', 'Anne-Élisabeth Bossé, Patrick Hivon, Evelyne Brochu, Sasson Gabai, Micheline Bernard, Mani Soleymanlou, Magalie Lépine-Blondeau, Niels Schneider', null, 'Sophia, a brilliant doctoral student, has always maintained a symbiotic relationship with her brother Karim. The arrival of a new lover in Karim’s life significantly alters their dynamic.', 'Sophia, a brilliant doctoral student, has always maintained a symbiotic relationship with her brother Karim. The arrival of a new lover in Karim’s life significantly alters their dynamic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8okx3lSA4Fe3F0zuKpVbYnfDysH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592800'),
  ('541965904857331396', 'A Bruddah''s Mind', 2021, 'Drama', 'Déo Cardoso, Maurício Macêdo, Roberto Iuri', 'Déo Cardoso', 'Lucas Limeira, Nicoly Mota, José Ilton Rodrigues Neto, Jeff Pereira, Renan Capivara, Mateus Honori, Mayara Braga, Souma', null, 'Leader of the student union, Saulo is the target of racist curses inside the classroom. When he retaliates, he is called to the principal''s office, but refuses to suffer the consequences of the attack alone, since the aggressor is not responsible for his speech. Inspired by readings about the Black Panthers, the boy decides to stay in school until justice is done. Meanwhile, he exposes the neglect of the establishment''s structure with his cell phone. Gradually, colleagues, teachers, directors and even politicians get involved in the conflict that is highlighted in the media.', 'Leader of the student union, Saulo is the target of racist curses inside the classroom. When he retaliates, he is called to the principal''s office, but refuses to suffer the consequences of the attack alone, since the aggressor is not responsible for his speech. Inspired by readings about the Black Panthers, the boy decides to stay in school until justice is done. Meanwhile, he exposes the neglect of the establishment''s structure with his cell phone. Gradually, colleagues, teachers, directors and even politicians get involved in the conflict that is highlighted in the media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbU8viY4tzm0oO7EJWLaArWHIXz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667241'),
  ('790924562175608490', 'A Brush with Christmas', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Robin Dunne, David Franceschetti', 'Scott Atkins', 'Jillian Murray, Joseph Cannata, Jan Skene, Farrah Aviva, Paul Essiembre, Michael Strickland', 'G', 'Over the week leading up to Christmas in the town of Bayside, Charlotte tries to capture her own unique style in the local art scene while also helping her mother, run the family restaurant. Disheartened and struggling to find time for her art, Charlotte throws out her latest painting, only to discover that it has been anonymously submitted to the Christmas art festival. It turns out that Wyatt, a visiting artist, stumbled upon her discarded work and is now using the festival’s exposure to find its mysterious creator.', 'Over the week leading up to Christmas in the town of Bayside, Charlotte tries to capture her own unique style in the local art scene while also helping her mother, run the family restaurant. Disheartened and struggling to find time for her art, Charlotte throws out her latest painting, only to discover that it has been anonymously submitted to the Christmas art festival. It turns out that Wyatt, a visiting artist, stumbled upon her discarded work and is now using the festival’s exposure to find its mysterious creator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yAX42kvKyEpKHK1unTdWpPz3y9I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032591'),
  ('282501595754701261', 'A Brush with Love', 2019, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Christopher Charles Kempinski, Paul Turner, Jason Rody', 'Joie Botkin, Katherine S. Chang, Robin Karfo', 'Arielle Kebbel, Nick Bateman, Arran Henn, Hilary Jardine, James Rha, Matthew James Dowden, Adil Zaidi, Daryl Shuttleworth', 'G', 'As she considers giving up on her artistic dreams, Jamie paints a vision board that brings her success and love—only to discover that the mystery man in her painting isn''t who she thinks.', 'As she considers giving up on her artistic dreams, Jamie paints a vision board that brings her success and love—only to discover that the mystery man in her painting isn''t who she thinks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5XYvU5WyFPIf0RPEgPRzZ4HFiL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:586653'),
  ('133597257760941314', 'A Brutal Game', 1983, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Bernard Lutic', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Bruno Cremer, Emmanuelle Debever, María Luisa García, Albert Pigot, Lucien Plazanet, Humbert Balsan, Jean Douchet, Liliane Gaudet', null, 'A strict father imposes impossible guidelines on his disabled daughter which reflect his secret and tortured life.', 'A strict father imposes impossible guidelines on his disabled daughter which reflect his secret and tortured life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmyix1Ze8TfMVn2D25FajvL2gA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80307'),
  ('76463811489016500', 'A Bucket of Blood', 1959, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Roger Corman, Jacques R. Marquette, Paul Rapp', 'Charles B. Griffith', 'Dick Miller, Barboura Morris, Antony Carbone, Julian Burton, Ed Nelson, John Brinkley, John Herman Shaner, Judy Bamber', 'NR', 'Nerdy Walter Paisley, a maladroit busboy at a beatnik café who doesn''t fit in with the cool scene around him, attempts to woo his beautiful co-worker, Carla, by making a bust of her. When his klutziness results in the death of his landlady''s cat, he panics and hides its body under a layer of plaster. But when Carla and her friends enthuse over the resulting artwork, Walter decides to create some bigger and more elaborate pieces using the same artistic process.', 'Nerdy Walter Paisley, a maladroit busboy at a beatnik café who doesn''t fit in with the cool scene around him, attempts to woo his beautiful co-worker, Carla, by making a bust of her. When his klutziness results in the death of his landlady''s cat, he panics and hides its body under a layer of plaster. But when Carla and her friends enthuse over the resulting artwork, Walter decides to create some bigger and more elaborate pieces using the same artistic process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fUZqTNinLruI6ZE7GQprY8t0Uwg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22642'),
  ('994587501374254617', 'A Bucket of Blood', 1995, 'Thriller, Comedy, Horror, TV Movie', 'Michael McDonald, Christopher Baffa', 'Brendan Broderick, Michael McDonald', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Justine Bateman, Shadoe Stevens, Sam Lloyd, Jesse D. Goins, Kin Shriner, David Cross, Patrick Bristow', null, 'Walter Paisley, a busboy at a cappuccino bar called the Jabberjaw, is praised as a genius after he kills his landlady''s cat and covers it in plaster. Pressured to produce more work, he goes after bigger subjects.', 'Walter Paisley, a busboy at a cappuccino bar called the Jabberjaw, is praised as a genius after he kills his landlady''s cat and covers it in plaster. Pressured to produce more work, he goes after bigger subjects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xYVBj6YkuKsALTf8nbrB2A6gnC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222858'),
  ('11505805949517162', 'A Buddha', 2005, 'Drama', 'Diego Rafecas', null, 'Carolina Fal, Diego Rafecas, Luis Ziembrowski, Agustín markert, Julieta Cardinali, Nelly Prince, Tina Serrano, Boy Olmi', null, 'Un Buda follows two brothers orphaned as children when their parents were taken by the military during the "Dirty Wars" of the 1970s in Argentina. Tomas is now a drifting and withdrawn young man who experiments with ascetic practices and has an instinctive compassion for others. His older brother Rafael is a university philosophy professor, detached and alone. Their struggles with each other and the world around them in Buenos Aires take a dramatic turn when they find themselves at a rural Zen center.', 'Un Buda follows two brothers orphaned as children when their parents were taken by the military during the "Dirty Wars" of the 1970s in Argentina. Tomas is now a drifting and withdrawn young man who experiments with ascetic practices and has an instinctive compassion for others. His older brother Rafael is a university philosophy professor, detached and alone. Their struggles with each other and the world around them in Buenos Aires take a dramatic turn when they find themselves at a rural Zen center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKGe9keBb9UdhDd6TFyMUxGCjW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75193'),
  ('497060627152094895', 'A Bug''s Life', 1998, 'Family, Animation, Adventure, Comedy', 'John Lasseter, Sharon Calahan, William Reeves', 'Bob Shaw, Don McEnery, Andrew Stanton', 'Dave Foley, Kevin Spacey, Julia Louis-Dreyfus, Hayden Panettiere, Phyllis Diller, Richard Kind, David Hyde Pierce, Joe Ranft', 'G', 'On behalf of "oppressed bugs everywhere," an inventive ant named Flik hires a troupe of warrior bugs to defend his bustling colony from a horde of freeloading grasshoppers led by the evil-minded Hopper.', 'On behalf of "oppressed bugs everywhere," an inventive ant named Flik hires a troupe of warrior bugs to defend his bustling colony from a horde of freeloading grasshoppers led by the evil-minded Hopper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ah3J9OJVc2CNCuH2zMydXy9fmIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9487'),
  ('613087076689246834', 'A Bullet for Joey', 1955, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Lewis Allen, Bert Glazer, Harry Neumann', 'Daniel Mainwaring, A.I. Bezzerides', 'Edward G. Robinson, George Raft, Audrey Totter, George Dolenz, Peter van Eyck, Toni Gerry, William Bryant, John Cliff', 'NR', 'Raoul Leduc is a police inspector trailing a spy who plots to kidnap an important American atomic scientist. Joe Victor a gangster who is hired to carry out the abduction, balks when he learns what is at stake and helps Leduc out instead.', 'Raoul Leduc is a police inspector trailing a spy who plots to kidnap an important American atomic scientist. Joe Victor a gangster who is hired to carry out the abduction, balks when he learns what is at stake and helps Leduc out instead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiZ1sTbtNlTMv0q7gaxDfSGqCep.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27212'),
  ('71438463830802965', 'A Bullet for Sandoval', 1969, 'Action, Western', 'Julio Buchs, Francisco Sempere', 'Ugo Guerra', 'Ernest Borgnine, George Hilton, Annabella Incontrera, Alberto de Mendoza, Leo Anchóriz, Gustavo Rojo, Manuel de Blas, Manuel Miranda', 'PG-13', 'After his girlfriend dies in childbirth, Confederate deserter John Warner travels to Mexico, where the woman''s father, Don Pedro Sandoval, grudgingly hands over his child. But with no locals willing to provide milk, the baby dies. Rounding up a group of rebels, Warner goes on a rampage through northern Mexico, with the ultimate goal of taking down Sandoval in this gritty Western.', 'After his girlfriend dies in childbirth, Confederate deserter John Warner travels to Mexico, where the woman''s father, Don Pedro Sandoval, grudgingly hands over his child. But with no locals willing to provide milk, the baby dies. Rounding up a group of rebels, Warner goes on a rampage through northern Mexico, with the ultimate goal of taking down Sandoval in this gritty Western.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mhPYLkCHESTbEt1j2QySx3KhDu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88949'),
  ('899676813726748602', 'A Bullet for the General', 1967, 'Western', 'Damiano Damiani, Enrico Bergier, Antonio Secchi', 'Franco Solinas', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Klaus Kinski, Martine Beswick, Lou Castel, Aldo Sambrell, José Manuel Martín, Jaime Fernández, Andrea Checchi', null, 'El Chuncho''s bandits rob arms from a train, intending to sell the weapons to Elias'' revolutionaries. They are helped by one of the passengers, Bill Tate, and allow him to join them, unware of his true intentions.', 'El Chuncho''s bandits rob arms from a train, intending to sell the weapons to Elias'' revolutionaries. They are helped by one of the passengers, Bill Tate, and allow him to join them, unware of his true intentions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKJtHftfsLwz8y8XMb8gPdxoBKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37316'),
  ('694658513359769401', 'A Bullet in the Gun Barrel', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michel Deville, Charles Gérard, Claude Lecomte', 'Albert Simonin, Charles Gérard, Michel Deville', 'Roger Hanin, Paul Frankeur, Pierre Vaneck, Mijanou Bardot, Hazel Scott, Gérard Buhr, Colette Duval, Don Ziegler', null, 'Back from Indochina, Tony and Dick, two French soldiers, are now in possession of more than 20 million, entrusted by a trafficker. They buy a nightclub in the district of Montparnasse but are soon hunted by the thug who wants to recover his money.', 'Back from Indochina, Tony and Dick, two French soldiers, are now in possession of more than 20 million, entrusted by a trafficker. They buy a nightclub in the district of Montparnasse but are soon hunted by the thug who wants to recover his money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1C2BcbMug0YPcBSya9sYKPfjdP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192336'),
  ('980193056695587128', 'A Bullet Is Waiting', 1954, 'Drama, Crime', 'John Farrow, Franz Planer, Emmett Emerson', 'Casey Robinson', 'Rory Calhoun, Jean Simmons, Stephen McNally, Brian Aherne', null, 'A plane carrying a sheriff and a man indicted for manslaughter is wrecked on a lonely California beach and the prisoner manages to escape, after a struggle, only to be taken in hand by the female manager of a remote sheep ranch.', 'A plane carrying a sheriff and a man indicted for manslaughter is wrecked on a lonely California beach and the prisoner manages to escape, after a struggle, only to be taken in hand by the female manager of a remote sheep ranch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9lVtsmgNivlQuTPUKBG5gUmmEYN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44867'),
  ('687976717083315509', 'A Bun in the Oven', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Nadège Loiseau', 'Nadège Loiseau, Fanny Burdino, Mazarine Pingeot', 'Karin Viard, Philippe Rebbot, Hélène Vincent, Manon Kneusé, Antoine Bertrand, Stella Fenouillet, Raphaël Ferret, Côme Levin', null, 'There is one thing that Nicole, who is soon turning fifty, would have loved to be spared, is to learn that the symptoms that have been ruining her life for some time are not those of a latent menopause, but those of a real pregnancy! What a drag…', 'There is one thing that Nicole, who is soon turning fifty, would have loved to be spared, is to learn that the symptoms that have been ruining her life for some time are not those of a latent menopause, but those of a real pregnancy! What a drag…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jF6zaUBS8HDdXMDbsCOUtnZGE0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416854'),
  ('342038606716742977', 'A Bundle of Trouble: An Aurora Teagarden Mystery', 2017, 'Mystery, TV Movie, Drama, Crime', 'Ron Stannett, Kevin Fair, Natalie Fiteni', 'Teena Booth', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Yannick Bisson, Marilu Henner, Lexa Doig, Miranda Frigon, Peter Benson, Bruce Dawson, Ellie Harvie', 'G', 'Aurora Teagarden and her boyfriend Martin are thrilled when they get an unexpected visit from his niece and her new baby. Their excitement is short lived when his niece disappears and the baby is left behind. Once again, Aurora finds herself drawn into a deadly investigation as she risks it all to help Martin reunite with his family.', 'Aurora Teagarden and her boyfriend Martin are thrilled when they get an unexpected visit from his niece and her new baby. Their excitement is short lived when his niece disappears and the baby is left behind. Once again, Aurora finds herself drawn into a deadly investigation as she risks it all to help Martin reunite with his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5855wwOnhlfK2cBHwA46KCwVFva.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455034'),
  ('433388512523769694', 'A Burning Desire', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Bernard Jeanjean, Axel Cosnefroy', 'Martine Fontaine, Bernard Jeanjean', 'Clovis Cornillac, Olivia Bonamy, Marianne Denicourt, François Vincentelli, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Elise Larnicol, Philippe Harel, Martin Lamotte', null, 'Yann and Rose are young, they love and want to have a child. Nine months later ... still no baby in sight. They then show great imagination and try everything ... no matter what it is. But they wish so hardly to be three that, is not likely they finish all alone?', 'Yann and Rose are young, they love and want to have a child. Nine months later ... still no baby in sight. They then show great imagination and try everything ... no matter what it is. But they wish so hardly to be three that, is not likely they finish all alone?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veBhK7eOCKC6BfBPYg7OR1dt5WO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68639'),
  ('556947038269565434', 'A Burning Hot Summer', 2011, 'Drama', 'Philippe Garrel, Willy Kurant, Paolo Trotta', 'Philippe Garrel, Marc Cholodenko, Caroline Deruas', 'Monica Bellucci, Louis Garrel, Céline Sallette, Jérôme Robart, Vladislav Galard, Vincent Macaigne, Maurice Garrel', 'NR', 'Paul reflects on the summer he met Angèle and Frédéric as he watches his friend being laid to rest.', 'Paul reflects on the summer he met Angèle and Frédéric as he watches his friend being laid to rest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CUsoDkhrR85fFIT7EIsDFjimbx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80440'),
  ('880820086957433024', 'A Business Affair', 1994, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charlotte Brändström, Willy Kurant', 'William Stadiem', 'Carole Bouquet, Christopher Walken, Jonathan Pryce, Geraldine Somerville, Beth Goddard, Sheila Hancock, Anna Manahan, Fernando Guillén Cuervo', null, 'This is the story of the lovely Kate Swallow and the loves of her life. At the start she is with Alec Bolton, a noted author, who discourages her when she wants to write a novel. Later she is swept off her feet by Alecs publisher, Vanni Corso, and leaves Alec for Vanni. She writes another novel and Vanni tells her he doesn''t think the book will sell. Both of their actions are an indication of their vanity and fear of losing her.', 'This is the story of the lovely Kate Swallow and the loves of her life. At the start she is with Alec Bolton, a noted author, who discourages her when she wants to write a novel. Later she is swept off her feet by Alecs publisher, Vanni Corso, and leaves Alec for Vanni. She writes another novel and Vanni tells her he doesn''t think the book will sell. Both of their actions are an indication of their vanity and fear of losing her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a1iFfVEvVdsDXTCKoS440YPjcnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51804'),
  ('139215120283779219', 'A Business of Men', 1981, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jean-Paul Schwartz, Nicolas Ribowski', 'Georges Conchon', 'Claude Brasseur, Jean-Louis Trintignant, Jean-Paul Roussillon, Patrice Kerbrat, Éva Darlan, Béatrice Camurat, Jean-Pierre Bernard, Peter Bonke', null, 'Two friends, Commissioner Servolle and real estate developer Faguet, see their friendship tested by the investigation carried out following the murder of Faguet''s wife.', 'Two friends, Commissioner Servolle and real estate developer Faguet, see their friendship tested by the investigation carried out following the murder of Faguet''s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/748vVxYth26BFFwMc5Cz4bbb28G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12214'),
  ('113985171171088692', 'A Butterfly Kiss', 2011, 'Drama', 'Karine Silla, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Karine Silla', 'Valeria Golino, Elsa Zylberstein, Vincent Perez, Jalil Lespert, Nicolas Giraud, Cécile de France, Roxane Depardieu, Iman Perez', null, 'Billie and Louis have the good fortune of loving each other passionately and of having a family. But then one day terrible news turns their existence and that of their friends'' upside down. Marie, a famous actress who is Billie''s friend and confidant, redoubles her determination to give life, while Alice, her nurse, fighting for freedom, maintains that life ''is here and now and in the moment.'' A film about love, hope, and the conviction that the force of life, despite the toughest tests, will always gain the upper hand.', 'Billie and Louis have the good fortune of loving each other passionately and of having a family. But then one day terrible news turns their existence and that of their friends'' upside down. Marie, a famous actress who is Billie''s friend and confidant, redoubles her determination to give life, while Alice, her nurse, fighting for freedom, maintains that life ''is here and now and in the moment.'' A film about love, hope, and the conviction that the force of life, despite the toughest tests, will always gain the upper hand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p08HK2gozPxOFDxMqHeMuU656i9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77697'),
  ('560045416247664113', 'A Cab for Three', 2001, 'Drama, Crime', 'Orlando Lübbert, Eugenio Gutiérrez, Patricio Riquelme Fagerström', 'Orlando Lübbert', 'Alejandro Trejo, Fernando Gómez-Rovira, Daniel Muñoz, Elena Milea, Roberto Matamala, Juan Rodríguez, Maya Mora, Ivonne Becerra', null, 'A taxi driver is given a difficult choice from 2 small time crooks: drive them around while they rob, or get locked up in the trunk.', 'A taxi driver is given a difficult choice from 2 small time crooks: drive them around while they rob, or get locked up in the trunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1mIk07uUalwivNQ6FOvmaMmHQhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86126'),
