  ('368462548422688784', 'A California Christmas', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Shaun Paul Piccinino, Brad Rushing', 'Lauren Swickard', 'Lauren Swickard, Josh Swickard, Ali Afshar, David Del Rio, Natalia Mann, Katelyn Epperly, Gunnar Anderson, Julie Lancaster', 'PG-13', 'With his carefree lifestyle on the line, a wealthy charmer poses as a ranch hand to get a hardworking farmer to sell her family’s land before Christmas.', 'With his carefree lifestyle on the line, a wealthy charmer poses as a ranch hand to get a hardworking farmer to sell her family’s land before Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/caCbdsdGHDJNMjSiA5X4mgIfe61.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:768520'),
