  ('113725379675817988', 'A Call to Spy', 2020, 'History, Crime, Drama', 'Anthony Keating, Lydia Dean Pilcher, Robby Baumgartner', 'Sarah Megan Thomas', 'Sarah Megan Thomas, Stana Katic, Radhika Apte, Linus Roache, Rossif Sutherland, Samuel Roukin, Laila Robins, Marc Rissmann', 'PG-13', 'The story of Vera Atkins, a crafty spy recruiter, and two of the first women she selects for Churchill''s "secret army": Virginia Hall, a daring American undaunted by a disability and Noor Inayat Khan, a pacifist. These civilian women form an unlikely sisterhood while entangled in dangerous missions to turn the tide of the war.', 'The story of Vera Atkins, a crafty spy recruiter, and two of the first women she selects for Churchill''s "secret army": Virginia Hall, a daring American undaunted by a disability and Noor Inayat Khan, a pacifist. These civilian women form an unlikely sisterhood while entangled in dangerous missions to turn the tide of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cK5D0ss2LLSZtOZKvgOVTcCdXIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:589612'),
  ('130135986704666633', 'A Canary Cage', 1983, 'Drama', 'Pavel Chukhray, Mikhail Bits, Semyon Litvinov', 'Pavel Chukhray, Anatolij Sergeev', 'Evgeniya Dobrovolskaya, Vyacheslav Baranov, Alisa Freyndlikh, Semyon Farada, Valentina Ananina', null, 'The film follows the chance encounter between two teenagers in crisis - Olesya and Victor. They both feel trapped and are looking for their way out. Olesya ran away from home and is waiting for her father to step off the train from Riga, while Victor desperately wants to get to Riga, or to some other place where people are truly good.', 'The film follows the chance encounter between two teenagers in crisis - Olesya and Victor. They both feel trapped and are looking for their way out. Olesya ran away from home and is waiting for her father to step off the train from Riga, while Victor desperately wants to get to Riga, or to some other place where people are truly good.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2sJUZAMN0X3lCQRSNNNOn7OmTBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285397'),
  ('533918056837025180', 'A Candle for the Devil', 1973, 'Horror', 'Eugenio Martín, Gil Carretero, José F. Aguayo', 'Antonio Fos, Eugenio Martín', 'Judy Geeson, Aurora Bautista, Esperanza Roy, Víctor Barrera, Lone Fleming, Blanca Estrada, Charley Pineiro, Loreta Tovar', 'PG', 'Two sisters running a small hotel in Spain kill female tourists whose morals do not meet their strict religious standards.', 'Two sisters running a small hotel in Spain kill female tourists whose morals do not meet their strict religious standards.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sqaw7yZXGRimiJExPqhFB1LzqCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87495'),
  ('71202804334359766', 'A Canterbury Tale', 1944, 'Mystery, War, Drama', 'Emeric Pressburger, Michael Powell, Erwin Hillier', 'Emeric Pressburger, Michael Powell', 'Eric Portman, Sheila Sim, Dennis Price, John Sweet, Charles Hawtrey, Esmond Knight, Hay Petrie, George Merritt', 'NR', 'Three modern-day pilgrims investigate a bizarre crime in a small town while on their way to Canterbury.', 'Three modern-day pilgrims investigate a bizarre crime in a small town while on their way to Canterbury.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhqTQo0NN7Zm6cIzTapZ568WMpN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15696'),
  ('85947767281108421', 'A Capodanno tutti da me', 2025, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Andrea Maia, Antonio Fornari, Simone Zampagni', 'Antonio Fornari, Andrea Maia, Vincenzo Sinopoli', 'Massimo Boldi, Nancy Brilli, Massimo Ceccherini, Paolo Conticini, Francesca Manzini, Giucas Casella, Augusto Fornari, Simone Montedoro', null, 'On New Year''s Eve, everyone at Minister Colombo''s house! And what could go wrong? Practically everything, because of a "paragnost" magician.', 'On New Year''s Eve, everyone at Minister Colombo''s house! And what could go wrong? Practically everything, because of a "paragnost" magician.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cnXY9zDQcwbPHZzhhOZHbHYhBmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1315621'),
  ('605757557240183454', 'A Cappella', 2016, 'Romance, Drama', 'Hitoshi Yazaki, Isao Ishii', 'Chiai Takeda, Masa Asanishi', 'Riko Narumi, Sosuke Ikematsu, Takumi Saitoh, Nina Endo, Wakana Matsumoto, Tomoko Fujita, Ken Mitsuishi, Tomoko Saitō', null, 'Set in the year 1969 in Sendai, Miyagi Prefecture, Japan. Kyoko Noma is a loving female high school student who takes part in campus protests. One day, she meets university student Wataru Domoto in the tea cafe Mubansou ("A Cappella"). Kyoko falls in love with him, but they get involved in an incident that leads to a shocking ending.', 'Set in the year 1969 in Sendai, Miyagi Prefecture, Japan. Kyoko Noma is a loving female high school student who takes part in campus protests. One day, she meets university student Wataru Domoto in the tea cafe Mubansou ("A Cappella"). Kyoko falls in love with him, but they get involved in an incident that leads to a shocking ending.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocQbjW5Ic5Flpqln1EAhB3UFPIQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382204'),
  ('916895574813098254', 'A Captain''s Honor', 1982, 'Drama, History, War', 'Pierre Schoendoerffer, Bernard Lutic', null, 'Nicole Garcia, Jacques Perrin, Claude Jade, Charles Denner, Georges Wilson, Georges Marchal, Robert Etcheverry, Christophe Malavoy', null, 'During a televised debate on the Algerian war in the early 1980s, Professor Paulet denounced the methods of Captain Caron, killed in action in 1957. The widow of the captain, Patricia, decided to file a defamation suit.', 'During a televised debate on the Algerian war in the early 1980s, Professor Paulet denounced the methods of Captain Caron, killed in action in 1957. The widow of the captain, Patricia, decided to file a defamation suit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vC8Jbphkzph5cRcjMbgJAfpm11k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2391'),
  ('211444789341325824', 'A Caribbean Mystery', 1983, 'TV Movie, Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Drama', 'Robert Michael Lewis, Ted Voigtlander, Michele Ader', 'Sue Grafton, Steve Humphrey', 'Helen Hayes, Jameson Parker, Season Hubley, Cassie Yates, Zakes Mokae, Stephen Macht, Beth Howland, Lynne Moody', null, 'Aging Major Palgrave, an idiosyncratic but charming mystery writer, reveals to Miss Jane Marple that one of the guests at a luxurious Caribbean resort they''re staying at is a Bluebeard-type wife murderer. Unfortunately, the Major succumbs to an apparently accidental overdose of alcohol and blood pressure medication before revealing the killer''s identity. When it''s discovered that the medicine belonged to another guest and the revealing photograph the Major was carrying is missing, Miss Marple realizes that the serial killer has struck again and more murders will follow.', 'Aging Major Palgrave, an idiosyncratic but charming mystery writer, reveals to Miss Jane Marple that one of the guests at a luxurious Caribbean resort they''re staying at is a Bluebeard-type wife murderer. Unfortunately, the Major succumbs to an apparently accidental overdose of alcohol and blood pressure medication before revealing the killer''s identity. When it''s discovered that the medicine belonged to another guest and the revealing photograph the Major was carrying is missing, Miss Marple realizes that the serial killer has struck again and more murders will follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d2csb2Qc9dgG9eYTOeXPlEfidOC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6030'),
  ('1089584381576313633', 'A Cartomante', 2004, 'Drama', 'Pablo Uranga, Wagner de Assis, Rodrigo Monte', 'Wagner de Assis', 'Sílvia Pfeifer, Luigi Baricelli, Deborah Secco, Ilya São Paulo, Giovanna Antonelli, Mel Lisboa, Sílvio Guindane, Cristiane Alves', null, 'Rita is about to marry a wealthy physician, Dr. Augusto Vilela. One night, Vilela''s best friend, Camilo, is brought to the hospital, dying from an overdose. Vilela saves his life and introduces him to his fiancée. Rita and Camilo fall in love and, confused about what to do, the girl goes to a fortuneteller to seek for advic', 'Rita is about to marry a wealthy physician, Dr. Augusto Vilela. One night, Vilela''s best friend, Camilo, is brought to the hospital, dying from an overdose. Vilela saves his life and introduces him to his fiancée. Rita and Camilo fall in love and, confused about what to do, the girl goes to a fortuneteller to seek for advic', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slNJke5A0xQU70gTJCdrRBTMdmE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77085'),
  ('815184133114210970', 'A Cartoonist''s Nightmare', 1935, 'Animation, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Billy Bletcher, Tommy Bond, Jack Carr, Harry Stanton', null, 'A cartoonist falls asleep at the drawing board and into the clutches of his own villains, until Beans the Cat comes to the rescue.', 'A cartoonist falls asleep at the drawing board and into the clutches of his own villains, until Beans the Cat comes to the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99dlzARuO9IOqd73fg4GGlHp3Jw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174822'),
  ('701994511136826593', 'A Case for a Rookie Hangman', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Pavel Juráček, Boris Adamec, Tomáš Svoboda', 'Pavel Juráček', 'Lubomír Kostelka, Pavel Landovský, Klára Jerneková, Milena Zahrynowská, Luděk Kopřiva, Slávka Budínová, Pavel Bošek, František Holar', null, 'Lemuel Gulliver has had a car accident and continues his journey across the unknown countryside on foot. On the road he finds a dead rabbit dressed like a man and takes a watch from its waistcoat breast pocket. The half-ruined house that he enters reminds Lemuel of his childhood and brings up a painful memory of a dearly loved girl Markéta who was drowned years ago. Gulliver finds himself in Balnibarbi, a country where he doesn''t understand the laws and habits and so continually offends against public decency. It is a day when people are ordered to keep their mouths shut and they force their visitor to follow suit. He faces harsh interrogation and finds it difficult to explain that he is not the rabbit Oscar whose watch has been found in his possession.', 'Lemuel Gulliver has had a car accident and continues his journey across the unknown countryside on foot. On the road he finds a dead rabbit dressed like a man and takes a watch from its waistcoat breast pocket. The half-ruined house that he enters reminds Lemuel of his childhood and brings up a painful memory of a dearly loved girl Markéta who was drowned years ago. Gulliver finds himself in Balnibarbi, a country where he doesn''t understand the laws and habits and so continually offends against public decency. It is a day when people are ordered to keep their mouths shut and they force their visitor to follow suit. He faces harsh interrogation and finds it difficult to explain that he is not the rabbit Oscar whose watch has been found in his possession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tY4oTAlTBdVT3IToqHOb0WKQAn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:212761'),
  ('11512638476016240', 'A Case of Rape', 1974, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'James A. Westman, Boris Sagal, Terry K. Meade', null, 'Elizabeth Montgomery, William Daniels, Cliff Potts, Rosemary Murphy, Ronny Cox, Patricia Smith, Ken Swofford, Jonathan Lippe', null, 'When she was raped, Ellen thought it was the worst thing to ever happen to her. What was worse, was the treatment by the hospital staff, police and the court system, when she reported it, and the man was caught.', 'When she was raped, Ellen thought it was the worst thing to ever happen to her. What was worse, was the treatment by the hospital staff, police and the court system, when she reported it, and the man was caught.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n9bk5pfkwAH4EDLguHa9S93YpAm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208930'),
  ('1096729630335264983', 'A Case of Spring Fever', 1940, 'Animation, Documentary', 'James Tyer, Frank Goldman', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Edward Nugent', 'NR', 'Advertising short for Chevrolet combining live action and animation. The film relates the story of Gilbert Willoughby, who, exasperated by his stubborn boxspring mattress, imprudently wishes for the disappearance of springs. Coily, the animated spring sprite, grants his wish, and Gilbert is bedeviled by once-familar appliances that no longer function. Apolo­gizing to Coily, Gilbert acknowledges the contribution of springs to daily life, especially in the Chevrolet.', 'Advertising short for Chevrolet combining live action and animation. The film relates the story of Gilbert Willoughby, who, exasperated by his stubborn boxspring mattress, imprudently wishes for the disappearance of springs. Coily, the animated spring sprite, grants his wish, and Gilbert is bedeviled by once-familar appliances that no longer function. Apolo­gizing to Coily, Gilbert acknowledges the contribution of springs to daily life, especially in the Chevrolet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rEeuJZqwuHKpdH6dqchzP9A5NXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324247'),
  ('674130917103279064', 'A Case of You', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kat Coiro, Doug Chamberlain, Scott Lazar', 'Christian Long, Justin Long, Keir O''Donnell', 'Justin Long, Evan Rachel Wood, Keir O''Donnell, Busy Philipps, Sienna Miller, Mizuo Peck, Peter Dinklage, Sam Rockwell', 'R', 'Young writer Sam has a crush on Birdie, the cute and quirky barista at his local coffee shop. When his conventional attempts to woo her crash and burn, he takes his efforts online, creating an Internet profile embellished with all of the details that would make him Birdie’s dream guy. When the harebrained scheme is a surprise success and Birdie falls for his exaggerated alter ego, Sam must keep up the act or lose his dream girl forever.', 'Young writer Sam has a crush on Birdie, the cute and quirky barista at his local coffee shop. When his conventional attempts to woo her crash and burn, he takes his efforts online, creating an Internet profile embellished with all of the details that would make him Birdie’s dream guy. When the harebrained scheme is a surprise success and Birdie falls for his exaggerated alter ego, Sam must keep up the act or lose his dream girl forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qP6X7K5BWtQv28leIpxJNmq1deB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174316'),
  ('654344883117181375', 'A Castle for Christmas', 2021, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Joel Morales, Michael Coulter, Mary Lambert', 'Ally Carter, Kim Beyer-Johnson', 'Brooke Shields, Cary Elwes, Lee Ross, Andi Osho, Tina Gray, Eilidh Loan, Stephen Oswald, Vanessa Grasse', 'G', 'To escape a scandal, a bestselling author journeys to Scotland, where she falls in love with a castle -- and faces off with the grumpy duke who owns it.', 'To escape a scandal, a bestselling author journeys to Scotland, where she falls in love with a castle -- and faces off with the grumpy duke who owns it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xhRbfdGRcEv6RUiAfWnER2pOCcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758879'),
  ('529962554003606254', 'A Castle in Italy', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Noémie Lvovsky, Agnès de Sacy', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Louis Garrel, Filippo Timi, Marisa Borini, Xavier Beauvois, Céline Sallette, Pippo Delbono, André Wilms', null, 'Louise meets Nathan, her dreams resurface. It''s also the story of her ailing brother, their mother, and the destiny of a leading family of wealthy Italian industrialists. The story of a family falling apart, a world coming to an end and love beginning.', 'Louise meets Nathan, her dreams resurface. It''s also the story of her ailing brother, their mother, and the destiny of a leading family of wealthy Italian industrialists. The story of a family falling apart, a world coming to an end and love beginning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRfj3J1BEqYsPFMKB1p4nvtFCpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197089'),
  ('559718170099148898', 'A Castle Within a Castle', 1954, 'Documentary', 'Jørgen Roos, Paul Solbjerghøj, Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Carl Theodor Dreyer', 'Sven Ludvigsen', null, 'The castle of Krogen, built c. 1420, is inside the later castle of Kronborg. Reconstruction of Kronborg gave a chance to study early castles. Models of both are shown.', 'The castle of Krogen, built c. 1420, is inside the later castle of Kronborg. Reconstruction of Kronborg gave a chance to study early castles. Models of both are shown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fLVNMmw8oKCgxeKwdWORTu2qvy7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:163364'),
  ('1040573870022571651', 'A Cat in Paris', 2010, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jean-Loup Felicioli, Alain Gagnol', 'Alain Gagnol', 'Dominique Blanc, Bruno Salomone, Jean Benguigui, Bernadette Lafont, Oriane Zani, Patrick Ridremont, Jacques Ramade, Jean-Pierre Yvars', 'PG', 'A thrilling mystery that unfurls in the alleys and on the rooftops of the French capital, Paris, over the course of one adventurous evening.', 'A thrilling mystery that unfurls in the alleys and on the rooftops of the French capital, Paris, over the course of one adventurous evening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTAC9Htd7rAZuxrmkgTMIihtqMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52264'),
  ('1118863993435628689', 'A Cat in the Brain', 1990, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Roberto Lucidi, Alessandro Grossi', 'Giovanni Simonelli, Antonio Tentori, Lucio Fulci', 'Lucio Fulci, David L. Thompson, Jeoffrey Kennedy, Malisa Longo, Paola Cozzo, Shillett Angel, Brett Halsey, Robert Egon', 'R', 'The master of Italian horror, Lucio Fulci, stars as... Lucio Fulci, a filmmaker with a reputation for gruesome horror films. His body of work has started to plague his mental state, and he is haunted by the grotesque set-pieces his mind has conjured up during his career. His psychiatrist, Egon Schwarz, uses a hypnotised Fulci as an avatar to carry out his own disturbed fantasies, in hopes of ruining the master’s reputation once and for all.', 'The master of Italian horror, Lucio Fulci, stars as... Lucio Fulci, a filmmaker with a reputation for gruesome horror films. His body of work has started to plague his mental state, and he is haunted by the grotesque set-pieces his mind has conjured up during his career. His psychiatrist, Egon Schwarz, uses a hypnotised Fulci as an avatar to carry out his own disturbed fantasies, in hopes of ruining the master’s reputation once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7slcRVlqFthzjTbnXFLoQ7LE053.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30870'),
  ('108054336174297351', 'A Cat''s Life', 2023, 'Adventure, Family, Drama, Fantasy', 'Guillaume Maidatchevsky, Daniel Meyer', 'Guillaume Maidatchevsky, Michaël Souhaité', 'Capucine Sainson-Fabresse, Corinne Masiero, Nicolas Umbdenstock, Lucie Laurent, Juliette Gillis', 'PG', 'The story of a lively and curious kitten who is bored in his life as a domestic cat in Paris. His fate changes when ten-year-old Clémence takes him to her country house at the heart of the Vosges. Thus begins an extraordinary adventure through the wilderness for Clémence and Rroû...', 'The story of a lively and curious kitten who is bored in his life as a domestic cat in Paris. His fate changes when ten-year-old Clémence takes him to her country house at the heart of the Vosges. Thus begins an extraordinary adventure through the wilderness for Clémence and Rroû...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eY2C7N1hFUaUjPCZiHECgKm1k1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977337'),
  ('333657020764623253', 'À cause des filles…?', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Thomas, Jean-Marc Fabre, Stéphane Le Parc', 'Nathalie Lafaurie, Pascal Thomas', 'Marie-Josée Croze, Audrey Fleurot, Marie-Agnès Gillot, Irène Jacob, Victoria Olloqui, Rossy de Palma, Barbara Schulz, Alexandra Stewart', null, 'At a wedding where the husband runs away, everyone has his own story to tell about the trivial misfortune of a person in love with someone that slips away. The guests paint a full picture of clumsiness, lies, and bad luck, that makes impossible, whatever the age, all attempts of seduction... or close enough !', 'At a wedding where the husband runs away, everyone has his own story to tell about the trivial misfortune of a person in love with someone that slips away. The guests paint a full picture of clumsiness, lies, and bad luck, that makes impossible, whatever the age, all attempts of seduction... or close enough !', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A616vCYceU7wDAwyNwf6fNkmk6P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568406'),
  ('767695142922653305', 'A Cause for Alarm', 2026, 'Drama', 'Doug Sebastian', 'Roy Kirkland', 'Tomasz Drankowski, Domenick DeFrank, Tyler Onassis, Isaac King, Henry Tisdale', 'Not Rated', 'Christopher wrongly suspects his husband Allen and doctor Ryan of an affair and murder plot. After making Allen mail his letter to authorities about it, he threatens Allen and dies. Allen must recover the letter.', 'Christopher wrongly suspects his husband Allen and doctor Ryan of an affair and murder plot. After making Allen mail his letter to authorities about it, he threatens Allen and dies. Allen must recover the letter.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYzY4NWUxMTMtMGY3Ni00YzUxLTk1MjktMzIzM2M3NmMxOGE5XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-cause-for-alarm'),
  ('1087554355858506343', 'A Certain Killer', 1967, 'Drama, Crime', 'Hitoshi Ôsu, Kazuo Mori, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Yasuzō Masumura, Yoshihiro Ishimatsu', 'Raizō Ichikawa, Yumiko Nogawa, Mikio Narita, Mayumi Nagisa, Jōtarō Senba, Tatsuo Matsushita, Sachiko Kobayashi, Asao Koike', null, 'A former soldier, reduced to working at a restaurant post-war, becomes a contract killer for the yakuza gangs he''s in contact with.', 'A former soldier, reduced to working at a restaurant post-war, becomes a contract killer for the yakuza gangs he''s in contact with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65PwPqUclUQYFY4lvYg17IWVZRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86374'),
  ('1106415549325751561', 'A Certain Kind of Death', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Grover Babcock, Blue Hadaegh', null, 'Fred Corral, Sherwood Dixson, Betsy Magdaleno, Emil Moldovan, David Smith, Luis Suarez, Julie Wilson, Mel Graham', null, 'Unblinking and unsettling, this documentary lays bare a mysterious process that goes on all around us - what happens to people who die with no next of kin.', 'Unblinking and unsettling, this documentary lays bare a mysterious process that goes on all around us - what happens to people who die with no next of kin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1VjGXQBLvyGnkcsAhKIuFfd1UFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45115'),
  ('834216924361162735', 'A Certain Magical Index: The Miracle of Endymion', 2013, 'Animation, Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Music', 'Hiroshi Nishikiori', 'Hiroyuki Yoshino', 'Atsushi Abe, Rina Sato, Sachika Misawa, Yoko Hikasa, Nobuhiko Okamoto, Ayane Sakura, Nozomi Sasaki, Satomi Arai', null, 'On the day Touma Kamijou and Index see Academy City''s space elevator, Endymion in the distance, they meet a Level 0 girl with an amazing singing voice, Arisa Meigo. As the three enjoy their time together after school, magic-user Stiyl Magnus suddenly attacks them. His target: Arisa. Why would a girl from the science side be targeted by someone from the magic side, Touma wonders. In the chaos of Stiyl''s attack, he tells Touma, Index and Arisa that she might cause a war between the magic side and the science side.', 'On the day Touma Kamijou and Index see Academy City''s space elevator, Endymion in the distance, they meet a Level 0 girl with an amazing singing voice, Arisa Meigo. As the three enjoy their time together after school, magic-user Stiyl Magnus suddenly attacks them. His target: Arisa. Why would a girl from the science side be targeted by someone from the magic side, Touma wonders. In the chaos of Stiyl''s attack, he tells Touma, Index and Arisa that she might cause a war between the magic side and the science side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vYfuVYLjVCgf09QdJIognRmGH6Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219250'),
  ('996307923663775659', 'A Certain Sacrifice', 1985, 'Crime, Drama', 'Stephen Jon Lewicki, Stephen Jon Lewicki', 'Jeremy Pattnosh, Stephen Jon Lewicki', 'Madonna, Jeremy Pattnosh, Charles Kurtz, Kate Magill, Timmy Leight, Michael Dane, Russell O. Lome, Angi Smit', 'NR', 'A street-wise teen gets herself in a series of circumstances and mishaps in her meaningless existence.', 'A street-wise teen gets herself in a series of circumstances and mishaps in her meaningless existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cdTTEu1WSbrDejYdn0akKl1Xvr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:169308'),
