  ('93837260133312515', 'A Challenge for Robin Hood', 1967, 'Adventure', 'C.M. Pennington-Richards, Arthur Grant', 'Peter Bryan', 'Barrie Ingham, Peter Blythe, Gay Hamilton, John Arnatt, John Gugolka, James Hayter, Eric Flynn, Reg Lye', null, 'After being falsely accused of murder, Sir Robin of Loxley takes refuge in the untamed wilderness of Sherwood Forest where he stumbles across a group of outlaws. Although initially suspicious of the aristocrat''s motives, the men are soon won over by his integrity and prowess and Robin transforms them into a formidable fighting force, stealing from the rich and giving to the poor. As word of his fame and valour spreads, a legend is born.', 'After being falsely accused of murder, Sir Robin of Loxley takes refuge in the untamed wilderness of Sherwood Forest where he stumbles across a group of outlaws. Although initially suspicious of the aristocrat''s motives, the men are soon won over by his integrity and prowess and Robin transforms them into a formidable fighting force, stealing from the rich and giving to the poor. As word of his fame and valour spreads, a legend is born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NbJWuuNROAwYCwzVnm5YEOpbNo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83355'),
  ('787966200900118016', 'A Chance of Snow', 1998, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Jeff Rafner, Peter E. Hirsch, Bing Sokolsky', 'Michele Cook', 'JoBeth Williams, Michael Ontkean, Barbara Barrie, Dey Young, Peter Syvertsen, Dina Merrill, Charles Durning, Angelica Rose Torres', null, 'After signing her divorce papers, a woman heads out to her Minnesota airport with her sister and daughters for a flight to her mother''s home. At the airport, her sportswriter husband shows up to catch a flight to Miami to visit his father. When a blizzard hits, the two suddenly find they have time to re-evaluate their relationship with assistance from an older couple.', 'After signing her divorce papers, a woman heads out to her Minnesota airport with her sister and daughters for a flight to her mother''s home. At the airport, her sportswriter husband shows up to catch a flight to Miami to visit his father. When a blizzard hits, the two suddenly find they have time to re-evaluate their relationship with assistance from an older couple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8j1rkq1tg3AF79667SXpnzYTadp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149762'),
  ('505520993572610996', 'A Chance To Win', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Guillard, Alain Braconnier, Aurore Taddei', 'Éric Fourniols, Philippe Guillard', 'Olivier Marchal, Olivia Bonamy, Philippe Duquesne, Mathieu Madénian, Lucie Fagedet, Solène Hébert, Geoffroy Thiébaut, Tom Villa', null, 'Two villages in the south of France have always been bitter rivals, but when a group of asylum seekers arrive in the community, the life of both villages is shaken up and age-old disagreements escalate. Their antagonism reaches its peak with the annual rugby derby played between the two village teams, but this time, with the new outsiders joining as unexpected recruits, the result of the 100th match will be more unpredictable than ever.', 'Two villages in the south of France have always been bitter rivals, but when a group of asylum seekers arrive in the community, the life of both villages is shaken up and age-old disagreements escalate. Their antagonism reaches its peak with the annual rugby derby played between the two village teams, but this time, with the new outsiders joining as unexpected recruits, the result of the 100th match will be more unpredictable than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1glQIcVYkfAbQLc3N60RnMIVYio.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000073'),
  ('746098495792894177', 'A Change of Heart', 2022, 'Drama', 'Jeanne Lapoirie, Jérémie Elkaïm', 'Arthur Cahn, Gilles Marchand, Jérémie Elkaïm', 'Marina Foïs, Laetitia Dosch, Seear Kohi, Jan Hammenecker, Mira Rogliano, Catherine Salée, Olivier Séror, Saadia Bentaïeb', null, 'Beatrice, recently widowed by a far right sympathetic policeman, lives with her son & mother. She doesn’t like migrant and foreigners. When she meets Mokhtar, an Iranian entered illegally in France, her world crumbles. This is the beginning of a passionate love story leading Beatrice to defy her racist entourage and the law so that he can cross the Channel.', 'Beatrice, recently widowed by a far right sympathetic policeman, lives with her son & mother. She doesn’t like migrant and foreigners. When she meets Mokhtar, an Iranian entered illegally in France, her world crumbles. This is the beginning of a passionate love story leading Beatrice to defy her racist entourage and the law so that he can cross the Channel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7x2XvNSptvDld2kVAlf846fTBbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669402'),
  ('1105138807253331763', 'A Change of Seasons', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Richard Lang, Philip H. Lathrop, Sig Tingloff', 'Erich Segal, Fred Segal, Ronni Kern', 'Shirley MacLaine, Anthony Hopkins, Bo Derek, Michael Brandon, Mary Beth Hurt, Edward Winter, Paul Regina, K Callan', 'R', 'Marriage takes a sour turn when a middle-aged husband falls for a young and sexy woman. Things get even more complicated when his wife starts a hot affair with a younger lover of her own.', 'Marriage takes a sour turn when a middle-aged husband falls for a young and sexy woman. Things get even more complicated when his wife starts a hot affair with a younger lover of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFjpzGCbb02D7lvpre1hNOLJ0Wm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60816'),
  ('40888774317807497', 'A Charlie Brown Celebration', 1982, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Casey Carlson, Shannon Cohn, Christopher Donohoe, Kristen Fullerton, Brent Hauer, Michael Mandy, Cindi Reilly, Rocky Reilly', 'NR', 'Several new different Peanuts sketches are featured in this TV special, adapted from the comic strip, including Peppermint Patty''s stint at dog training school and Charlie Brown spending time in the hospital.', 'Several new different Peanuts sketches are featured in this TV special, adapted from the comic strip, including Peppermint Patty''s stint at dog training school and Charlie Brown spending time in the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2FJLTvWErabgabH6Z7jibqMj5jq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102973'),
  ('87250719054432010', 'A Charlie Brown Thanksgiving', 1973, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Bill Melendez, Phil Roman', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Todd Barbee, Robin Kohn, Stephen Shea, Hilary Momberger-Powers, Christopher DeFaria, Jimmy Ahrens, Bill Melendez, Robin Reed', 'G', 'Turkey, cranberries, pumpkin pie... and the Peanuts gang to share them with. This is going to be the greatest Thanksgiving ever! The fun begins when Peppermint Patty invites herself and her pals to Charlie Brown''s house for a REALLY big turkey party. Good grief! All our hero can cook is cold cereal and maybe toast. Is Charlie Brown doomed? Not when Linus, Snoopy and Woodstock chip in to save the (Thanksgiving) Day. With such good friends, Charlie Brown - and all of us - have so many reasons to be thankful.', 'Turkey, cranberries, pumpkin pie... and the Peanuts gang to share them with. This is going to be the greatest Thanksgiving ever! The fun begins when Peppermint Patty invites herself and her pals to Charlie Brown''s house for a REALLY big turkey party. Good grief! All our hero can cook is cold cereal and maybe toast. Is Charlie Brown doomed? Not when Linus, Snoopy and Woodstock chip in to save the (Thanksgiving) Day. With such good friends, Charlie Brown - and all of us - have so many reasons to be thankful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xmtGJz3uMqYmA6pEpZgDWMzbX2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13479'),
  ('685625910366236549', 'A Charlie Brown Valentine', 2002, 'Family, Animation, Romance, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Bill Melendez', 'Charles M. Schulz', 'Wesley Singerman, Lauren Schaffel, Corey Padnos, Emily Lalande, Jessica D. Stone, Nicolette Little, Christopher Johnson, Bill Melendez', null, 'Lovesick Charlie Brown hopes – still – to get a valentine from the Little Red-Haired Girl, as does Sally from Linus, Lucy from Schroeder and Peppermint Patty from Charlie Brown.', 'Lovesick Charlie Brown hopes – still – to get a valentine from the Little Red-Haired Girl, as does Sally from Linus, Lucy from Schroeder and Peppermint Patty from Charlie Brown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1k4R64qhezeMhfr6Lxq61WHSFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28069'),
  ('100235659089783261', 'A Chaster Marriage', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Umut Kırca, Cengiz Uzun', 'Ömer Pınar, Yaşar Arak', 'Emre Karayel, Ceren Moray, Begüm Kütük, Ececan Gümeci, Ümit Erdim, Cem Kılıç, Haldun Boysan, Ferdi Akarnur', null, 'In love with Duygu, as well as with his favorite football team, Zafer is one of those grown-up men who never really grow up. One day, he finds himself forced into a marriage by his father, and despite his many funny attempts to get out of the marriage, Zafer’s plans yield no result. Can Zafer understand the meaning of true love before the final whistle blows?', 'In love with Duygu, as well as with his favorite football team, Zafer is one of those grown-up men who never really grow up. One day, he finds himself forced into a marriage by his father, and despite his many funny attempts to get out of the marriage, Zafer’s plans yield no result. Can Zafer understand the meaning of true love before the final whistle blows?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8lIt33IKoLfyiGfBeaJf2GPhInf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:435792'),
  ('830002633563278534', 'A Cheerful Gang Turns the Earth', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Tetsu Maeda, Hideo Yamamoto, Kimiyoshi Adachi', 'Kentaro Ushio, Takashi Hasegawa, Tetsu Maeda', 'Takao Osawa, Kyoka Suzuki, Koichi Sato, Shota Matsuda, Koji Ohkura, Arata Furuta, Rosa Kato, Houka Kinoshita', null, 'Four strangers (a verbose romantic, a human lie detector, an expert pickpocket, and a woman with a preternaturally precise sense of time) are brought together by chance when they inadvertently team up to thwart a bank robbery. Recognizing the potential of their combined talents, they decide to form a bank-robbing gang themselves, just for the fun and romance of it. Their heists are played out swiftly and coolly, less like robberies than performance art. Eventually, the foursome''s good-natured crime streak is interrupted when a man from one of their pasts creates a whirlwind of extortion and double crossing.', 'Four strangers (a verbose romantic, a human lie detector, an expert pickpocket, and a woman with a preternaturally precise sense of time) are brought together by chance when they inadvertently team up to thwart a bank robbery. Recognizing the potential of their combined talents, they decide to form a bank-robbing gang themselves, just for the fun and romance of it. Their heists are played out swiftly and coolly, less like robberies than performance art. Eventually, the foursome''s good-natured crime streak is interrupted when a man from one of their pasts creates a whirlwind of extortion and double crossing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eRSulH9QhoJ3oglvJlrOTS8hltA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44767'),
  ('819178556375049899', 'A Chef in Love', 1996, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Nana Jorjadze, Grégory Kourilsky, Marc Barbault', 'Irakli Kvirikadze', 'Pierre Richard, Micheline Presle, Nino Kirtadzé, Jean-Yves Gautier, Temuri Kamkhadze, Ramaz Chkhikvadze, Guram Pirtskhalava, Kakhi Kavsadze', null, 'The story of Pascal Ichak, a larger-than-life French traveller, bon vivant, and chef, who falls in love with Georgia and a Georgian princess in the early 1920s. All is well until the arrival of the Red Army of the Caucasus, as the Soviet revolution that has swept Russian comes to Georgia. Told as a flashback from the present, as a French-Georgian man whose mother was Pascal''s lover translates his memoirs for Pascal''s niece.', 'The story of Pascal Ichak, a larger-than-life French traveller, bon vivant, and chef, who falls in love with Georgia and a Georgian princess in the early 1920s. All is well until the arrival of the Red Army of the Caucasus, as the Soviet revolution that has swept Russian comes to Georgia. Told as a flashback from the present, as a French-Georgian man whose mother was Pascal''s lover translates his memoirs for Pascal''s niece.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7DjoYUwHgzDUPK96bahLBxdkKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105763'),
  ('137467175365951128', 'A Chiara', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jonas Carpignano, Tim Curtin', 'Jonas Carpignano', 'Swamy Rotolo, Claudio Rotolo, Grecia Rotolo, Carmela Fumo, Giorgia Rotolo, Antonio Rotolo, Vincenzo Rotolo', null, 'Chiara feels that there is something wrong. She has a strange feeling she cannot explain to her mother or sister. During the night, after overhearing a heated argument between her parents and witnessing something shocking, her world is overturned and her safety net crumbles. Reality and dreams start to blur and Chiara’s life will never be the same.', 'Chiara feels that there is something wrong. She has a strange feeling she cannot explain to her mother or sister. During the night, after overhearing a heated argument between her parents and witnessing something shocking, her world is overturned and her safety net crumbles. Reality and dreams start to blur and Chiara’s life will never be the same.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQQWrtXldZtRPfoLEI11TvCEPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854698'),
  ('623140494596354759', 'A Child Called Jesus', 1987, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Franco Rossi', 'Vittorio Bonicelli', 'Matteo Bellina, Bekim Fehmiu, María del Carmen San Martín, Irene Papas, Alessandro Gassmann, Franco Interlenghi, Maurizio Donadoni, Hichem Rostom', null, 'The film attempts to fill in the "missing years" of Jesus, from ages 3 through 12. When King Herod fearing that the Messiah has indeed been born, orders that all Hebrew male children under the age of three be slain, Joseph moves his family near Egypt. Here, Jesus, sensing His divinity, expresses a desire to return to Nazareth. Travelling homeward with His mother Mary, Jesus flashes forward to events that will unfold in his adult life.', 'The film attempts to fill in the "missing years" of Jesus, from ages 3 through 12. When King Herod fearing that the Messiah has indeed been born, orders that all Hebrew male children under the age of three be slain, Joseph moves his family near Egypt. Here, Jesus, sensing His divinity, expresses a desire to return to Nazareth. Travelling homeward with His mother Mary, Jesus flashes forward to events that will unfold in his adult life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1YjpOv7wQrqgEudz9skDLeg89k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248811'),
  ('20957843451517468', 'A Child in the Crowd', 1976, 'Drama', 'Gérard Blain, Emmanuel Machuel', 'Gérard Blain, Michel Pérez', 'Jean François Cimino, César Chauveau, Annie Kovaks, Cécile Cousseau, Claude Treille, Jean Bertal, Gabrielle Sassoum, Raymonde Badé-Mauffroy', null, 'Deserted by his father, and dislocated by the Second World War, Paul is a boy who wants affection and attention and cannot find it at home. For a while, he becomes the pet of some German soldiers, running errands for them. Later, he helps the Resistance, and when the Americans come to stay, he is really in his element with them.', 'Deserted by his father, and dislocated by the Second World War, Paul is a boy who wants affection and attention and cannot find it at home. For a while, he becomes the pet of some German soldiers, running errands for them. Later, he helps the Resistance, and when the Americans come to stay, he is really in his element with them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rkOTFuhwTBLQ6jCUlk3cels0zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108574'),
  ('271211765967801296', 'A Child Is Waiting', 1963, 'Drama', 'John Cassavetes, Lindsley Parsons Jr., Douglas Green', 'Abby Mann', 'Burt Lancaster, Judy Garland, Gena Rowlands, Steven Hill, Paul Stewart, Gloria McGehee, Lawrence Tierney, Bruce Ritchey', 'PG', 'Dr. Matthew Clark is the head of a state institution for intellectually disabled children. Jean Hansen, a former music teacher anxious to give her life some meaning, joins the staff of the hospital. Jean, who tries to shelter the children with her love, suspiciously regards Dr. Clark''s stern training methods. She becomes emotionally involved with 12-year-old Reuben Widdicombe, who has been abandoned by his divorced parents.', 'Dr. Matthew Clark is the head of a state institution for intellectually disabled children. Jean Hansen, a former music teacher anxious to give her life some meaning, joins the staff of the hospital. Jean, who tries to shelter the children with her love, suspiciously regards Dr. Clark''s stern training methods. She becomes emotionally involved with 12-year-old Reuben Widdicombe, who has been abandoned by his divorced parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4T7rPZRgvE96ZT9qJuyNnGm0No.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88912'),
  ('841511746546094725', 'A Childhood', 2015, 'Drama', 'Philippe Claudel, Hugo Le Gourrierec', 'Philippe Claudel', 'Pierre Deladonchamps, Jules Gauzelin, Patrick d''Assumçao, Alexi Mathieu, Angelica Sarre, Fayssal Benhamed, Catherine Matisse, Lola Dubois', null, 'As summer drags by, 13-year-old Jimmy, forced by circumstance to become an adult too soon, runs up against the limits of his small hometown and his turbulent life, caught between a mother on the slide and a stepfather who keeps her down.', 'As summer drags by, 13-year-old Jimmy, forced by circumstance to become an adult too soon, runs up against the limits of his small hometown and his turbulent life, caught between a mother on the slide and a stepfather who keeps her down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/glpDV8dCWFbFpgkiDSCckMI2Qna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360287'),
  ('841786368957354790', 'A Children''s Story', 2004, 'Crime, Drama', 'Andrea Frazzi, Antonio Frazzi, Paolo Carnera', 'Ferdinando Vicentini Orgnani, Andrea Frazzi, Antonio Frazzi', 'Gianluca Di Gennaro, Carmine Recano, Arturo Paglia, Nuccia Fumo, Rolando Ravello, Sergio Solli, Francesco Di Leva, Carlo Caracciolo', null, 'Rosario is 11 years old, he lives in the suburbs with his grandmother, a sick woman who spends time watching TV. He is the leader of a small group who spends his days between games rooms, small crimes and dangerous challenges.', 'Rosario is 11 years old, he lives in the suburbs with his grandmother, a sick woman who spends time watching TV. He is the leader of a small group who spends his days between games rooms, small crimes and dangerous challenges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AvBzax7SkRqyc6kVGKiFpsu3BPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58014'),
  ('590146706929160136', 'A Chinese Ghost Story', 1987, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Sander Lee, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Yuen Kai-Chi', 'Leslie Cheung, Joey Wong, Wu Ma, Lau Siu-Ming, David Lam Wai, Fanny Sit Chi-Lun, David Wu, Wong Jing', 'NR', 'A naïve young tax collector for the imperial government winds up spending the night in a haunted temple. There he falls in love with a beautiful woman who, unfortunately, is dead. With the aid of a powerful Daoist Swordsman, he must defeat undead hordes, overcome a sinister Tree Demoness, and descend to the pits of hell, to fight for the spirit he loves.', 'A naïve young tax collector for the imperial government winds up spending the night in a haunted temple. There he falls in love with a beautiful woman who, unfortunately, is dead. With the aid of a powerful Daoist Swordsman, he must defeat undead hordes, overcome a sinister Tree Demoness, and descend to the pits of hell, to fight for the spirit he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZitiEjIm1jjsB4bTIEZkawhMpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30421'),
  ('987490385228134511', 'A Chinese Ghost Story', 2011, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Wilson Yip, Ma Yuk-Sing, Alan Chui Chung-San', 'Charcoal Tan', 'Louis Koo, Liu Yifei, Yu Shaoqun, Louis Fan Siu-Wong, Wang Danyi Li, Kara Hui Ying-Hung, Gong Xinliang, Lin Peng', null, 'Government official Ling Choi Sin journeys to the parched Black Mountain Village, to help its inhabitants find water. As he leads a group of volunteers up the haunted mountain, he encounters a bevy of sexy demons as well as a lovely girl named Siu Sin. After wooing her with some candy, he falls for her... and then realises that he is caught in a deadly triangle; another guy, a demon-hunter named Yan Chek Ha is also in love with Siu Sin. However, before the two men can settle their differences, they have to contend with the evil Tree Demon as well as a one-armed demon hunter who is determined to kill all the supernatural beings.', 'Government official Ling Choi Sin journeys to the parched Black Mountain Village, to help its inhabitants find water. As he leads a group of volunteers up the haunted mountain, he encounters a bevy of sexy demons as well as a lovely girl named Siu Sin. After wooing her with some candy, he falls for her... and then realises that he is caught in a deadly triangle; another guy, a demon-hunter named Yan Chek Ha is also in love with Siu Sin. However, before the two men can settle their differences, they have to contend with the evil Tree Demon as well as a one-armed demon hunter who is determined to kill all the supernatural beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKigVU0hX69Nzf2GyDF1O9tZpEJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70530'),
  ('977870612933736475', 'A Chinese Ghost Story II', 1990, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai', 'Edward Leung Yiu-Ming, Jason Lam Kee-To, Lau Tai-Muk', 'Leslie Cheung, Joey Wong, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Wu Ma, Waise Lee Chi-Hung, Michele Reis, Lau Shun, Lau Siu-Ming', null, 'After escaping false imprisonment, Ling Choi-San crosses paths with a pair of rebellious women. Though mourning the loss of his ghostly love, his broken heart must heal in a hurry in order to face a new series of paranormal encounters and adventures.', 'After escaping false imprisonment, Ling Choi-San crosses paths with a pair of rebellious women. Though mourning the loss of his ghostly love, his broken heart must heal in a hurry in order to face a new series of paranormal encounters and adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uh9xhW3OX77fisjYNhhy4hrUtRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9050'),
  ('457805004832119214', 'A Chinese Ghost Story III', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Tony Ching Siu-Tung, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Roy Szeto Wai-Cheuk, Tsui Hark', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Joey Wong, Nina Li Chi, Lau Siu-Ming, Lau Shun, Tiffany Lau Yuk-Ting, Tommy Wong', null, '100 years after the events of the first film, Buddhist Bai Yun and his disciple Fong journey through a small town to transport a golden idol of Buddha. However, local thieves thwart their journey, forcing them to take shelter at the ghostly Orchid Temple.', '100 years after the events of the first film, Buddhist Bai Yun and his disciple Fong journey through a small town to transport a golden idol of Buddha. However, local thieves thwart their journey, forcing them to take shelter at the ghostly Orchid Temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3WKqrzr0wpudTkN1nCjedl1BnCe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9048'),
  ('338407931717916812', 'A Chinese Ghost Story: The Tsui Hark Animation', 1997, 'Fantasy, Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Andrew Chen Wei-Wen, Kazuo Komatsubara, Manabu Ohashi', 'Tsui Hark', 'Jan Lam Hoi-Fung, Anita Yuen Wing-Yee, Vivian Lai Shui-Yan, Tsui Hark, James Wong Jim, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Wong Yuk-Man, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei', null, 'A young man falls in love with a ghost and must avoid a variety of ghostbusters out to eliminate her and each other.', 'A young man falls in love with a ghost and must avoid a variety of ghostbusters out to eliminate her and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGUlnzLZLXYWrJY3gZp7siHAcBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44424'),
  ('340742562477841888', 'A Chinese Odyssey Part One: Pandora''s Box', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Law Kar-Ying, Yammie Lam Kit-Ying, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Johnnie Kong, Lu Shuming, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', null, 'When the Goddess of Happiness tosses the Longevity Monk and his disciples out of heaven (because the Monkey King tried to attain immortality), the Monkey King is reincarnated as the Joker. He now spends his time chasing two jealous women. When one of them is dying, the Joker goes back in time in an attempt to save her.', 'When the Goddess of Happiness tosses the Longevity Monk and his disciples out of heaven (because the Monkey King tried to attain immortality), the Monkey King is reincarnated as the Joker. He now spends his time chasing two jealous women. When one of them is dying, the Joker goes back in time in an attempt to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIDDJ3FXPmVnNpxVoZOvjjcKVqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13345'),
  ('1077105540376610813', 'A Chinese Odyssey Part Three', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Han Geng, Tang Yan, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Wu Jing, Gillian Chung, Iola Xie, Wang Yibo, Hu Jing', 'PG-13', 'The third chapter of the cult-classic fantasy saga: A Chinese Odyssey. At the end of ''A Chinese Odyssey 2'', Zixia managed to see in advance the outcome of the battle. Now, in order to prevent the unfortunate tragedy, she travels back to the past and make sure that Monkey does not fall in love with her. Monkey is then reincarnated and continues to wait for Bak Jing-jing.', 'The third chapter of the cult-classic fantasy saga: A Chinese Odyssey. At the end of ''A Chinese Odyssey 2'', Zixia managed to see in advance the outcome of the battle. Now, in order to prevent the unfortunate tragedy, she travels back to the past and make sure that Monkey does not fall in love with her. Monkey is then reincarnated and continues to wait for Bak Jing-jing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xxJ4k1SJY3J1NxwO21S6PwTmth.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:389201'),
  ('54496535191967858', 'A Chinese Odyssey Part Two: Cinderella', 1995, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Qiuyuan Tian, Xiaoguang Li', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Shu-Chen Tang', 'Stephen Chow, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Athena Chu Yan, Ada Choi Siu-Fan, Yammie Lam Kit-Ying, Karen Mok Man-Wai, Law Kar-Ying, Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', null, 'This sequel to "Pandora''s Box" continues director Jeffrey Lau''s adaptation of the Buddhism saga "Journey to the West". Stranded five centuries in the past, Joker Monkey King must battle a variety of monsters, seductive women and super-powered villains to save the dying Pak Jing-Jing.', 'This sequel to "Pandora''s Box" continues director Jeffrey Lau''s adaptation of the Buddhism saga "Journey to the West". Stranded five centuries in the past, Joker Monkey King must battle a variety of monsters, seductive women and super-powered villains to save the dying Pak Jing-Jing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksloRonL1kOq4yErf9LOJ5qDhem.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21835'),
  ('661983128510861390', 'A Chinese Tall Story', 2005, 'Action, Comedy, Fantasy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Peter Ngor Chi-Kwan', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai', 'Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Fan Bingbing, Chen Bolin, Kenny Kwan, Steven Cheung Chi-Hang, Isabella Leong Lok-Sze, Yuen Wah', null, 'The young monk Taka and his three disciples are captured by a demonic tree. Taka manages to escape thanks to the magic stick of Monkey King and decided to go free his companions. En route, he encounters a strange ally called Meiyan, a girl who is half-human and half monster. As Taka and his new friend set off on a fantastic adventure they will face many hardships and battles and may very well decide the fate of humanity and the entire universe...', 'The young monk Taka and his three disciples are captured by a demonic tree. Taka manages to escape thanks to the magic stick of Monkey King and decided to go free his companions. En route, he encounters a strange ally called Meiyan, a girl who is half-human and half monster. As Taka and his new friend set off on a fantastic adventure they will face many hardships and battles and may very well decide the fate of humanity and the entire universe...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vrPMnBs7DRJBXcr60Z8Ql7BzVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45912'),
  ('45458963974145896', 'A Chinese Torture Chamber Story', 1994, 'Horror, Comedy, Drama', 'Bosco Lam Tsz-Ho, Tony Miu Kin-Fai, Poon Kin-Kwan', 'Cheuk Bing, Jobic Tsui Tat-Chor', 'Yvonne Yung Hung, Lawrence Ng Kai-Wah, Tommy Wong, Kenny Wong Tak-Ban, Kingdom Yuen King-Tan, Lam Yuk-Chi, Lin Pei-Jun, Elvis Tsui Kam-Kong', null, 'A corrupt magistrate subjects an innocent young bride to inconceivable physical punishments after convicting her of killing her husband.', 'A corrupt magistrate subjects an innocent young bride to inconceivable physical punishments after convicting her of killing her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbMoB0gCTA9oKz75YuE8szcCjfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32629'),
  ('869700717948913952', 'A Chinese Torture Chamber Story II', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dick Cho, Chan Chung-Yuen, Chan Bik-Chan', 'Dik Sang', 'Mark Cheng Ho-Nam, Yolinda Yan Chor-Sin, Oscar Lam Wai-Kin, Yeung Fan, Yang Hsiung, Chu Ben-Ke, Lam Ting-Sang, Yau Chi-Mei', null, 'A pair of country thieves make friends with a general rising within the imperial army. After the general finds himself falling in love with the beautiful sister of one of the thieves (who is the fiancee of the other) he decides to do whatever it takes to get rid of the competition and have her for himself.', 'A pair of country thieves make friends with a general rising within the imperial army. After the general finds himself falling in love with the beautiful sister of one of the thieves (who is the fiancee of the other) he decides to do whatever it takes to get rid of the competition and have her for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zevw4iX8BVvLbNHPsf7A85j5aIi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39390'),
  ('208754257134853156', 'A Chipmunk Christmas', 1981, 'Animation, Family', 'Phil Monroe', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Janice Karman', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Janice Karman, Frank Welker, Charles Berendt, R.J. Williams, June Foray', 'G', 'Alvin learns the true meaning of Christmas.', 'Alvin learns the true meaning of Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gIXY4hzgOimIwnvE4n8XX1LrqWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21767'),
  ('111576738943739042', 'A Chipmunk Reunion', 1985, 'Animation', 'Charles August Nichols', 'Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., Elana Lesser, Cliff Ruby', 'Janice Karman, Ross Bagdasarian, Jr., June Foray', 'G', 'The Chipmunks are discussing when they were born and began to argue. They wanted to go and find their mother but Dave doesn''t let them. The Chipettes are invited round while the Chipmunks go and look for their mother but Dave finds out and gets worried...', 'The Chipmunks are discussing when they were born and began to argue. They wanted to go and find their mother but Dave doesn''t let them. The Chipettes are invited round while the Chipmunks go and look for their mother but Dave finds out and gets worried...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wglcqEHFemZbGtfCaKKLyk53Y5n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367956'),
  ('247835679763624837', 'A Choo', 2020, 'Action, Comedy, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Peter Tsi, Kevin Ko, Randy Che', 'Angie Chai', 'Kai Ko, Ariel Lin, Darren Wang, Kate Tsui Tsz-Shan, Zhang Xiaolong, Vanness Wu, Liu Kuan-ting, Anna Kay', null, 'Even when they were orphans, Wang Yizhi has always been in love with Xinxin. Now older, Yizhi decides to train as a boxer before he allows himself to profess his love, but only for her to fall for a geeky computer engineer who is secretly a popular superhero. When Xinxin gets kidnapped, Yizhi must prove his love and his fighting skills to get the girl of his dreams.', 'Even when they were orphans, Wang Yizhi has always been in love with Xinxin. Now older, Yizhi decides to train as a boxer before he allows himself to profess his love, but only for her to fall for a geeky computer engineer who is secretly a popular superhero. When Xinxin gets kidnapped, Yizhi must prove his love and his fighting skills to get the girl of his dreams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ekhUMW90LKjIXN3zbNEQhbswJIV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288287'),
  ('401195951752350869', 'A Chorus Line', 1985, 'Drama, Music', 'Richard Attenborough, Ronnie Taylor', 'Arnold Schulman', 'Michael Douglas, Alyson Reed, Terrence Mann, Gregg Burge, Vicki Frederick, Michelle Johnston, Audrey Landers, Janet Jones', 'PG-13', 'A group of dancers congregate on the stage of a Broadway theatre to audition for a new musical production directed by Zach. After the initial eliminations, seventeen hopefuls remain, among them Cassie, who once had a tempestuous romantic relationship with Zach. She is desperate enough for work to humble herself and audition for him; whether he''s willing to let professionalism overcome his personal feelings about their past remains to be seen.', 'A group of dancers congregate on the stage of a Broadway theatre to audition for a new musical production directed by Zach. After the initial eliminations, seventeen hopefuls remain, among them Cassie, who once had a tempestuous romantic relationship with Zach. She is desperate enough for work to humble herself and audition for him; whether he''s willing to let professionalism overcome his personal feelings about their past remains to be seen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bQzbO6y6gxePrEcU57Su8HJ9UdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1816'),
  ('696087489249796315', 'A Chorus of Angels', 2012, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Junji Sakamoto, Daisaku Kimura, Goro Yasukawa', 'Machiko Nasu', 'Sayuri Yoshinaga, Kyôhei Shibata, Toru Nakamura, Mirai Moriyama, Hikari Mitsushima, Ryo Katsuji, Aoi Miyazaki, Eiko Koike', null, 'Teacher Kawashima Haru takes a position on a remote island off the coast of Hokkaido, where she takes charge of six students. However, she is later forced to leave after an accident occurs. 20 years later, Haru learns that one of her former students has committed a crime, and eventually returns to the island once more.', 'Teacher Kawashima Haru takes a position on a remote island off the coast of Hokkaido, where she takes charge of six students. However, she is later forced to leave after an accident occurs. 20 years later, Haru learns that one of her former students has committed a crime, and eventually returns to the island once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/urWOlQOxwk6vNsg04DoYuhgOalg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175040'),
  ('682801281396931899', 'A Chorus of Disapproval', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Winner, Alan Jones', 'Alan Ayckbourn', 'Anthony Hopkins, Jeremy Irons, Prunella Scales, Lionel Jeffries, Richard Briers, Sylvia Syms, Patsy Kensit, Jenny Seagrove', null, 'Guy Jones (Irons) moves to a small British town and joins the local amateur dramatics society as a way to meet people. However he soon finds the drama offstage far outweighs those onstage.', 'Guy Jones (Irons) moves to a small British town and joins the local amateur dramatics society as a way to meet people. However he soon finds the drama offstage far outweighs those onstage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cvcxVKsHfFHTizsWOSmLStowqWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114266'),
