  ('922265873153536204', 'A Christmas Carousel', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Don McCutcheon', null, 'Rachel Boston, Neal Bledsoe, Jennifer Vallance, Kathryn Davis, Lisa Michelle Cornelius, Tessa Kozma, Stuart Hughes, Michael Spencer-Davis', null, 'When Lila is hired by the Royal Family of Ancadia to repair a carousel, she must work with the Prince to complete it by Christmas.', 'When Lila is hired by the Royal Family of Ancadia to repair a carousel, she must work with the Prince to complete it by Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1oqqPncrRREzk5D63YUL9CLbqVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746061'),
  ('983276513668023191', 'A Christmas Cookie Catastrophe', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jeff Beesley, Brad Crawford', 'Robin Gadsby', 'Rachel Boston, Victor Webster, Averie Peters, Dylan McEwan, Stephanie Sy, John B. Lowe, Erik Athavale, Brandon McEwan', 'G', 'Annie Cooper has big shoes to fill when she takes over as CEO of her late grandmother’s small-town cookie company and is doing her best to help their struggling business get back on track. That task gets more daunting when her grandmother’s secret recipe is stolen during the Christmas party. As Annie tries to crack the case and uncover the culprit she works with Sam, the owner of a local bakery, to recreate the recipe in the hope of saving the company and her job. As Annie and Sam bake batch after batch in pursuit of the perfect one, they begin to learn that their lives go together like milk and cookies.', 'Annie Cooper has big shoes to fill when she takes over as CEO of her late grandmother’s small-town cookie company and is doing her best to help their struggling business get back on track. That task gets more daunting when her grandmother’s secret recipe is stolen during the Christmas party. As Annie tries to crack the case and uncover the culprit she works with Sam, the owner of a local bakery, to recreate the recipe in the hope of saving the company and her job. As Annie and Sam bake batch after batch in pursuit of the perfect one, they begin to learn that their lives go together like milk and cookies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uKow4E46OiKD70nyQLn0KgkGfxN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028552'),
  ('894421849132592040', 'A Christmas Detour', 2015, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Ron Oliver', 'Mark Amato', 'Candace Cameron Bure, Paul Greene, Sarah Strange, David James Lewis, Marcus Rosner, Kaj-Erik Eriksen, Mackenzie Mowat, Nelson Wong', 'G', 'A bubbly bride-to-be’s Christmas plans take an unexpected turn when her holiday flight to New York is detoured and she encounters a cynical bar manager who has lost his faith in love. As she scrambles to make it back east for Christmas—and plan her upcoming wedding—she begins wondering if she’s marrying the right man, and learns a surprising lesson about love.', 'A bubbly bride-to-be’s Christmas plans take an unexpected turn when her holiday flight to New York is detoured and she encounters a cynical bar manager who has lost his faith in love. As she scrambles to make it back east for Christmas—and plan her upcoming wedding—she begins wondering if she’s marrying the right man, and learns a surprising lesson about love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogBVg6Bowu3Y5zagUX4z8x2q4OL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348634'),
  ('326455536293154562', 'A Christmas Dream', 1945, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Bořivoj Zeman, Karel Zeman, Pavel Hrdlička', 'Bořivoj Zeman', 'Jana Hrdličková, Eduard Dubský', null, 'Christmas has arrived. As a little girl and her parents enter the room, the little girl finds all kinds of toys under the Christmas Tree. She immediately throws her old doll aside and starts playing with her new dolls. But that night she has a dream. Or maybe it isn''t a dream?', 'Christmas has arrived. As a little girl and her parents enter the room, the little girl finds all kinds of toys under the Christmas Tree. She immediately throws her old doll aside and starts playing with her new dolls. But that night she has a dream. Or maybe it isn''t a dream?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nIKtN98iQy1715kT82AXO06Hyn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:364608'),
  ('733784293429055323', 'A Christmas Gift from Bob', 2020, 'Family, Drama', 'David Connell, Charles Martin Smith', 'Garry Jenkins', 'Luke Treadaway, Kristina Tonteri-Young, Phaldut Sharma, Nina Wadia, Celyn Jones, Stefan Race, Pepter Lunkuse, Tim Plester', null, 'James Bowen finds himself the target of an animal welfare investigation that threatens to take away his beloved cat, Bob, at Christmas.', 'James Bowen finds himself the target of an animal welfare investigation that threatens to take away his beloved cat, Bob, at Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwM2BBxG4XLGvkCX7GbVDt8hjaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673737'),
  ('801162571224443437', 'A Christmas Horror Story', 2015, 'Horror, Fantasy', 'Steven Hoban, Grant Harvey, Brett Sullivan', 'Pascal Trottier, Doug Taylor, Sarah Larsen', 'William Shatner, George Buza, Rob Archer, Zoé De Grand Maison, Alex Ozerov-Meyer, Shannon Kook, Amy Forsyth, Jeff Clarke', 'NR', 'Christmas is supposed to be a time of joy, peace and goodwill. But for some folks in the small town of Bailey Downs, it turns into something much less festive.', 'Christmas is supposed to be a time of joy, peace and goodwill. But for some folks in the small town of Bailey Downs, it turns into something much less festive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7GkDorZgmD090U4Uhf0g6gng05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311539'),
  ('202887533843590988', 'A Christmas Kiss', 2011, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family, Drama', 'John Stimpson, Brian Crane', 'Joany Kane', 'Elisabeth Röhm, Laura Breckenridge, Brendan Fehr, Jerrika Hinton, Laura Spencer, Mark Joy, Mark DeAngelis, Karla Brown', 'PG', 'Wendy Walton is the best designer in Boston... but no one knows it yet. Hoping to kick-start her career, Wendy has left work with the local theatre to take a job as an assistant to Priscilla Hall, the most prestigious designer in the city. Ms. Hall works Wendy around the clock, which is how Wendy finds herself trapped in an elevator late one night with an incredibly handsome stranger. Wendy and the mystery man share an impulsive, romantic, life changing kiss before the doors open and Wendy runs out, leaving him behind. The next day at work, Wendy answers the door to find the handsome gentleman standing in front of her.', 'Wendy Walton is the best designer in Boston... but no one knows it yet. Hoping to kick-start her career, Wendy has left work with the local theatre to take a job as an assistant to Priscilla Hall, the most prestigious designer in the city. Ms. Hall works Wendy around the clock, which is how Wendy finds herself trapped in an elevator late one night with an incredibly handsome stranger. Wendy and the mystery man share an impulsive, romantic, life changing kiss before the doors open and Wendy runs out, leaving him behind. The next day at work, Wendy answers the door to find the handsome gentleman standing in front of her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecgrk0VsqzMMTUg5VsfqJADgaeM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81332'),
  ('800663178205240146', 'A Christmas Kiss II', 2014, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Kevin Conner, Theo Angell', 'Joany Kane', 'Elisabeth Harnois, Adam Mayfield, Lola Glaudini, Jonathan Bennett, Elisabeth Röhm, Steven Schub, Ray Laska, Celesta Hodge', null, 'At a Christmastime event, Jenna shares an impromptu, unforgettable kiss with the dashing billionaire, Cooper Montgomery. Unaware of his intentions and fearful of getting hurt in another relationship, Jenna vows to resist his charms, but begins to realize his affection is real as the two spend more time together.', 'At a Christmastime event, Jenna shares an impromptu, unforgettable kiss with the dashing billionaire, Cooper Montgomery. Unaware of his intentions and fearful of getting hurt in another relationship, Jenna vows to resist his charms, but begins to realize his affection is real as the two spend more time together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUhwBavwK7h1dfXJi470Iya5ofK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:311093'),
  ('7206056049774649', 'A Christmas Melody', 2015, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Mariah Carey', 'Jennifer Notas Shapiro', 'Lacey Chabert, Brennan Elliott, Kathy Najimy, Mariah Carey, Kevin Chamberlin, Fina Strazza, Lea Lachey, Katie Eichler', 'G', 'Kristin has just had to close her small Manhattan clothing boutique to return to her Ohio home town and live in her parents'' former home. It''s an adjustment for Kristin and her young daughter— especially when she runs into her former high school rival. Kristen and Emily struggle to find their new normal with the help of the hunky local music teacher.', 'Kristin has just had to close her small Manhattan clothing boutique to return to her Ohio home town and live in her parents'' former home. It''s an adjustment for Kristin and her young daughter— especially when she runs into her former high school rival. Kristen and Emily struggle to find their new normal with the help of the hunky local music teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uetNOoUIwmeavHYnimc8B9tnDOq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366018'),
  ('398432879190362951', 'A Christmas Memory', 1997, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Glenn Jordan, Neil Roach', null, 'Patty Duke, Piper Laurie, Jeffrey DeMunn, Anita Gillette, Julia McIlvaine, Esther Scott, Eric Lloyd, Jimmie F. Skaggs', null, 'A new version of Truman Capote''s 1956 tale based on his own bittersweet upbringing in Alabama. The story deals with a seven-year-old who forms a special friendship with his simple, older cousin whose two sisters and bachelor brother feel he needs better influences and role models and decide to send him to military school after the Christmas holidays.', 'A new version of Truman Capote''s 1956 tale based on his own bittersweet upbringing in Alabama. The story deals with a seven-year-old who forms a special friendship with his simple, older cousin whose two sisters and bachelor brother feel he needs better influences and role models and decide to send him to military school after the Christmas holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HJem5FxbZ7nUpgcHRvqvED6yTz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79818'),
  ('508377356659209961', 'A Christmas Miracle for Daisy', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Mike Rohl', null, 'Jill Wagner, Nick Bateman, Tegan Moss, Rubi Tupper, Joe Costa, Andrew Francis, Heather-Claire Nortey, Terence Kelly', 'G', 'Whitney Alder owns interior design firm Marietta Designs, which she runs with her friend Andi in the small town of Marietta, Montana. Whitney is designing Santa’s float for the annual Marietta Christmas Parade when a potential job opportunity comes her way: the full redesign of a landmark home by Christmas Eve.', 'Whitney Alder owns interior design firm Marietta Designs, which she runs with her friend Andi in the small town of Marietta, Montana. Whitney is designing Santa’s float for the annual Marietta Christmas Parade when a potential job opportunity comes her way: the full redesign of a landmark home by Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iatxP43TMVqSFpCFM4JybepGg0I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881500'),
  ('281264731003182441', 'A Christmas Mystery', 2022, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, Mystery', 'Alex Ranarivelo, Reuben Steinberg', 'Alex Ranarivelo, John Ducey', 'Violet McGraw, Eddie Cibrian, Christoph Sanders, Drew Powell, Lauren Lindsey Donzis, Santino Barnard, Leonardo Cecchi, Beau Bridges', 'PG', 'When her best friend''s father is falsely accused of stealing the town''s prized jingle bells, a young amateur sleuth and her friends must find the real thief before Christmas.', 'When her best friend''s father is falsely accused of stealing the town''s prized jingle bells, a young amateur sleuth and her friends must find the real thief before Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ROhQeFIRCDadpIe4C7fVi5mV1Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987919'),
  ('662612259560764908', 'A Christmas Number One', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Chris Cottam, Catherine Derry', 'Giles New, Keiron Self, Robert Chandler', 'Freida Pinto, Iwan Rheon, Helena Zengel, Alfie Boe, Debi Mazar, Richard Fleeshman, Georgia Small, Joe Lycett', null, 'Meg, a music manager, travels from New York to London to manage a boy band, Five Together, and find them a Christmas number one to bolster their flagging career. She finds a song on the internet posted by an ailing thirteen-year-old girl, Nina, and tries to obtain permission to have the song re-recorded by Five Together, but she discovers she has competition from the songwriter, Nina’s uncle Blake. What follows is a romantic comedy about two worlds colliding – with a young woman at the centre who desperately wants her uncle to find love and for his song to hit the number one spot by Christmas Day.', 'Meg, a music manager, travels from New York to London to manage a boy band, Five Together, and find them a Christmas number one to bolster their flagging career. She finds a song on the internet posted by an ailing thirteen-year-old girl, Nina, and tries to obtain permission to have the song re-recorded by Five Together, but she discovers she has competition from the songwriter, Nina’s uncle Blake. What follows is a romantic comedy about two worlds colliding – with a young woman at the centre who desperately wants her uncle to find love and for his song to hit the number one spot by Christmas Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878111'),
  ('813617786143363319', 'A Christmas Prince', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Alex Zamm, Viorel Sergovici, Joel Morales', 'Karen Schaler, Nate Atkins', 'Rose McIver, Ben Lamb, Alice Krige, Honor Kneafsey, Theo Devaney, Sarah Douglas, Emma Louise Saunders, Tom Knight', 'PG', 'When a reporter goes undercover as a nanny to get the inside scoop on a playboy prince, she gets tangled in some royal intrigue and ends up finding love - but will she be able to keep up her lie?', 'When a reporter goes undercover as a nanny to get the inside scoop on a playboy prince, she gets tangled in some royal intrigue and ends up finding love - but will she be able to keep up her lie?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x0IGQsMzVbsF7noj5cCfEk1GU7s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483104'),
  ('629137910634689644', 'A Christmas Prince: The Royal Baby', 2019, 'Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'John Schultz, Viorel Sergovici', 'Nate Atkins', 'Rose McIver, Ben Lamb, Alice Krige, Honor Kneafsey, Theo Devaney, Kevin Shen, Momo Yeung, Sarah Douglas', null, 'Christmas brings the ultimate gift to Aldovia: a royal baby. But first, Queen Amber must help her family and kingdom by finding a missing peace treaty.', 'Christmas brings the ultimate gift to Aldovia: a royal baby. But first, Queen Amber must help her family and kingdom by finding a missing peace treaty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RErLw0APt8qQiee0d8VCKasWwl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:587693'),
  ('559667253667343481', 'A Christmas Prince: The Royal Wedding', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'John Schultz, Viorel Sergovici, Joel Morales', 'Nate Atkins', 'Rose McIver, Ben Lamb, Alice Krige, Honor Kneafsey, Theo Devaney, Sarah Douglas, John Guerrasio, Andy Lucas', 'PG', 'A year after Amber helped Richard secure the crown. The two are set to tie the knot in a royal Christmas wedding — but their plans are jeopardized when Amber finds herself second-guessing whether or not she''s cut out to be queen, and Richard is faced with a political crisis that threatens to tarnish not only the holiday season but the future of the kingdom.', 'A year after Amber helped Richard secure the crown. The two are set to tie the knot in a royal Christmas wedding — but their plans are jeopardized when Amber finds herself second-guessing whether or not she''s cut out to be queen, and Richard is faced with a political crisis that threatens to tarnish not only the holiday season but the future of the kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bLQTbFWrsunSVQsvOWZAAGACbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:525041'),
  ('352383878554349534', 'A Christmas Proposal', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Joe Gold, Martin Wood', 'Mark Amato', 'Adam Rodriguez, Jessica Camacho, Luisa d''Oliveira, Bianca Caroca, Andres Soto, Claudia Ferri, Juan Chioran, Jaime M. Callica', 'NR', 'A chef agrees to pose as a Seattle attorney''s girlfriend to help him impress his family during Christmas. Their business arrangement gets complicated as real feelings develop while they work together to help him secure a promotion at the family firm.', 'A chef agrees to pose as a Seattle attorney''s girlfriend to help him impress his family during Christmas. Their business arrangement gets complicated as real feelings develop while they work together to help him secure a promotion at the family firm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XzORktcHQOuNPT68SjfnFbWljy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890757'),
  ('1080937595269847635', 'A Christmas Reunion', 2015, 'Comedy, TV Movie, Family, Romance', 'Joseph M. Setele, Sean Olson', 'Sam Irvin, Margaret Base, Peter Sullivan', 'Denise Richards, Patrick Muldoon, Jake Busey, Catherine Hicks, Parker Stevenson, Brody Fitzgerald, Patricia De Leon', 'G', 'A Madison Avenue executive, Amy, discovers an unusual Christmas surprise when she inherits her Aunt’s hometown bakery. The real surprise comes when she learns the other half of the bakery was left to her long-ago boyfriend, Jack. Unresolved personal issues resurface between them, as the exes return home to co-manage the store, along with its traditional holiday cookie bake-off.', 'A Madison Avenue executive, Amy, discovers an unusual Christmas surprise when she inherits her Aunt’s hometown bakery. The real surprise comes when she learns the other half of the bakery was left to her long-ago boyfriend, Jack. Unresolved personal issues resurface between them, as the exes return home to co-manage the store, along with its traditional holiday cookie bake-off.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/MsAh9o8r0Gvjb3D0aNBjgiPaY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369061'),
  ('259058135765586840', 'A Christmas Romance', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'Sheldon Larry', 'Maggie Davis, Darrah Cloud', 'Olivia Newton-John, Gregory Harrison, Chloe Lattanzi, Stephanie Sawyer, Tom Heaton, Stephen E. Miller, Brent Stait, Susan Astley', 'G', 'A widowed mother with financial woes comes to the aid of a bill collector who crashes his car in a snowstorm.', 'A widowed mother with financial woes comes to the aid of a bill collector who crashes his car in a snowstorm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AaosgmKIW7FWtq9DiRbHKfhyD65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51592'),
  ('71430638648295936', 'A Christmas Star', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Justin Sebastian, Jessica Harmon', 'Amyn Kaderali', 'Sara Canning, Daniel Lissing, Claudia Chan, Mercedes De La Cruz, Juliette Hawk, Joanne Wilson', 'G', 'Madeline Baggett is an astronomer who searches for life beyond Earth, and when she believes she has found it. With refractors, telescopes, and a small film crew in tow, Madeline arrives and sets up in Summit Ridge where she meets widowed National Park Ranger Ryan Sparks and his young daughter, Celeste. With Ryan’s help, Madeline begins to chart the celestial event which brings the pair closer to finding love under the stars.', 'Madeline Baggett is an astronomer who searches for life beyond Earth, and when she believes she has found it. With refractors, telescopes, and a small film crew in tow, Madeline arrives and sets up in Summit Ridge where she meets widowed National Park Ranger Ryan Sparks and his young daughter, Celeste. With Ryan’s help, Madeline begins to chart the celestial event which brings the pair closer to finding love under the stars.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8Fo2xWyiSpP5JizJjkHRTFYtas.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:883876'),
  ('823519896997958785', 'A Christmas Story', 1983, 'Comedy, Family', 'Bob Clark, Reginald H. Morris, Carmi Gallo', 'Bob Clark, Leigh Brown, Jean Shepherd', 'Melinda Dillon, Darren McGavin, Peter Billingsley, Jean Shepherd, Ian Petrella, Scott Schwartz, R.D. Robb, Tedde Moore', 'PG', 'The comic mishaps and adventures of a young boy named Ralph, trying to convince his parents, teachers, and Santa that a Red Ryder B.B. gun really is the perfect Christmas gift for the 1940s.', 'The comic mishaps and adventures of a young boy named Ralph, trying to convince his parents, teachers, and Santa that a Red Ryder B.B. gun really is the perfect Christmas gift for the 1940s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/34nSHYqmb7222tiqiuKqKJmZiQa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:850'),
  ('461489614150764629', 'A Christmas Story 2', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Brian Levant, Jan Kiesser', null, 'Daniel Stern, Braeden Lemasters, Stacey Travis, Valin Shinyei, Gerard Plunkett, David Michael Paul, David Thompson, Tiera Skovbye', 'PG', 'The original traditional one-hundred-percent red-blooded two-fisted all-American Christmas continues five years later with Ralphie, Randy, mom and the old man. This time Ralphie has his eyes fixed on a car. But trouble is sure to follow.', 'The original traditional one-hundred-percent red-blooded two-fisted all-American Christmas continues five years later with Ralphie, Randy, mom and the old man. This time Ralphie has his eyes fixed on a car. But trouble is sure to follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBm9Yi8YRxdcIg7mbOiKTdX0G28.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125504'),
  ('212467359260094989', 'A Christmas Story Christmas', 2022, 'Comedy, Family', 'Matthew Clark, Clay Kaytis, Myron Hoffert', 'Clay Kaytis, Nick Schenk', 'Peter Billingsley, Erinn Hayes, Julie Hagerty, Ian Petrella, Scott Schwartz, R.D. Robb, Zack Ward, River Drosche', 'PG', 'Follows Ralphie, now adult, who returns to the house on Cleveland Street to give his kids a magical Christmas like the one he had as a child, reconnecting with childhood friends, and reconciling the passing of his Old Man.', 'Follows Ralphie, now adult, who returns to the house on Cleveland Street to give his kids a magical Christmas like the one he had as a child, reconnecting with childhood friends, and reconciling the passing of his Old Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5QeoDiiIFY9VF87Rm79WpCFZbwf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929340'),
  ('91149459120556511', 'A Christmas Tale', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Paco Plaza, Oriol Maymó, Sergi Ruiz', 'Luiso Berdejo', 'Maru Valdivielso, Christian Casas, Roger Babià, Pau Poch, Daniel Casadellà, Ivana Baquero, Elsa Pataky, José Torija', 'PG-13', 'Cubelles, Tarragona, Spain, Christmas 1985. Five friends make an unexpected discovery in the forest: a woman disguised as Santa Claus trapped in a deep hole dug in the middle of nowhere.', 'Cubelles, Tarragona, Spain, Christmas 1985. Five friends make an unexpected discovery in the forest: a woman disguised as Santa Claus trapped in a deep hole dug in the middle of nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vB5dmtGyfsNQzTfmigrjtoCzTmL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75725'),
  ('609424599756185958', 'A Christmas Tale', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Éric Gautier, Arnaud Desplechin', 'Emmanuel Bourdieu, Arnaud Desplechin', 'Catherine Deneuve, Jean-Paul Roussillon, Anne Consigny, Mathieu Amalric, Chiara Mastroianni, Melvil Poupaud, Emmanuelle Devos, Hippolyte Girardot', 'NR', 'When their regal matriarch falls ill, the troubled Vuillard family come together for a hesitant Christmastime reunion. Among them is rebellious ne''er-do-well Henri and the uptight Elizabeth. Together under the same roof for the first time in many years, their intricate, long denied resentments and yearnings emerge again.', 'When their regal matriarch falls ill, the troubled Vuillard family come together for a hesitant Christmastime reunion. Among them is rebellious ne''er-do-well Henri and the uptight Elizabeth. Together under the same roof for the first time in many years, their intricate, long denied resentments and yearnings emerge again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXXFkHSU62sBUsAmuAJC3n7XGac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8892'),
  ('637467620625561136', 'A Christmas Tale', 2021, 'Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Göran Hallberg, Hannes Holm', 'Johan Kindblom, Michael Hjorth, Hannes Holm', 'Jonas Karlsson, Simon Larson, Jennie Silfverhjelm, Vanna Rosenberg, Filip Berg, Ingela Olsson, Claes Månsson, Adam Pålsson', null, 'A tale of a boy from a wealthy family who during his work at the post office steals Christmas gifts from the wealthy to give to the poor people of Stockholm.', 'A tale of a boy from a wealthy family who during his work at the post office steals Christmas gifts from the wealthy to give to the poor people of Stockholm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/105kVP54fB2mxIdtirFUML4I9xF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779775'),
  ('982302989298743317', 'A Christmas to Remember', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Mitchnick, David Weaver', 'Dorie Barton, Jay Lowi', 'Mira Sorvino, Cameron Mathison, Jesse Filkow, Brenda Crichlow, Elle McKinnon, Ona Grauer, Latonya Williams, Steve Bacic', null, 'A harsh TV personality, Jennifer, needs a break from her own life, so she hops into a car and drives to a small town mountain retreat. On her way there a blizzard veers off the road and she crashes. When she comes to she has complete amnesia and a friendly passerby takes her in. As time passes she still doesn’t remember who she is and the friendly passerby, a widower himself with three kids, assimilates her into his family. But as she slowly starts remembering who she is, she prefers the new life she’s built in the small town.', 'A harsh TV personality, Jennifer, needs a break from her own life, so she hops into a car and drives to a small town mountain retreat. On her way there a blizzard veers off the road and she crashes. When she comes to she has complete amnesia and a friendly passerby takes her in. As time passes she still doesn’t remember who she is and the friendly passerby, a widower himself with three kids, assimilates her into his family. But as she slowly starts remembering who she is, she prefers the new life she’s built in the small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpOZBdq1bFf6nBSilkfLrtjhNL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:423893'),
  ('303785220585098243', 'A Christmas Together With You', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Drama', 'Justin Sebastian, Kevin Fair', 'Graham Locke', 'Laura Vandervoort, Niall Matter, Harry Lennix, Liza Huget, Adil Zaidi, Michele Scarabelli, Jim Ewens, Ava Julien', 'G', 'During the Christmas season, Megan and her father-figure Frank head out on a road trip to find his long-lost love. Along the way, Megan finds the love of her own life.', 'During the Christmas season, Megan and her father-figure Frank head out on a road trip to find his long-lost love. Along the way, Megan finds the love of her own life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bDlKgyTZtd5T7sZidwndSxUAjgY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:876103'),
  ('895667871703633519', 'A Christmas Wedding', 2006, 'Comedy, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Michael Zinberg', 'Matt Dorff', 'Sarah Paulson, Richard Blackburn, Eric Mabius, Dean Cain, Reagan Pasternak, Bill McFadden', null, 'Emily (Sarah Paulson) and Ben (Eric Mabius) find their plans to marry on Christmas day coming apart at the seams when Ben is left to plan the wedding details after Emily is forced to go on a business trip. Though Emily, a perfectionist, is determined to have a fairytale wedding, she realizes that love is all that really matters when a freak storm threatens to keep her from making it home in time for the big day.', 'Emily (Sarah Paulson) and Ben (Eric Mabius) find their plans to marry on Christmas day coming apart at the seams when Ben is left to plan the wedding details after Emily is forced to go on a business trip. Though Emily, a perfectionist, is determined to have a fairytale wedding, she realizes that love is all that really matters when a freak storm threatens to keep her from making it home in time for the big day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ntLh3CTvte6TSk0Y3gkb58EqdkG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42559'),
  ('695080240975615389', 'A Christmas Wish', 2011, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Craig Clyde', 'Craig Clyde', 'Kristy Swanson, Edward Herrmann, K.C. Clyde, Aline Andrade, Danielle Chuchran, Tess Harper, Kirstin Dorn, Kevin Herring III', null, 'A broke single mother lands a job at a small town diner where the kindly patrons and staff help her family to have a happy holiday.', 'A broke single mother lands a job at a small town diner where the kindly patrons and staff help her family to have a happy holiday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vr6j28yj9kfl7TOO3J0BWoaUSEX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80544'),
  ('790994337410943889', 'A Christmas Without Snow', 1980, 'Drama, Romance, Family, TV Movie', 'John Korty, Mike Fash, Vance Lorenzini', null, 'Michael Learned, John Houseman, Ramon Bieri, James Cromwell, Valerie Curtin, David Knell, Calvin Levels, Ruth Nelson', null, 'Leaving her son behind at her parents'' home in Omaha, Nebraska, recent divorcée Zoe attempts to start her life anew by moving to San Francisco. Seeking something to fill her lonely hours, she begins singing with a church choir. When new choirmaster Ephraim Adams is hired, Zoe finds his attitudes and ideas difficult to tolerate. Faced with the challenging task of satisfying Adams'' unrelenting perfectionism, Zoe is tempted once more to run away from her problems.', 'Leaving her son behind at her parents'' home in Omaha, Nebraska, recent divorcée Zoe attempts to start her life anew by moving to San Francisco. Seeking something to fill her lonely hours, she begins singing with a church choir. When new choirmaster Ephraim Adams is hired, Zoe finds his attitudes and ideas difficult to tolerate. Faced with the challenging task of satisfying Adams'' unrelenting perfectionism, Zoe is tempted once more to run away from her problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bllvtTpyNfuJci2JGCTICnObkwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46465'),
  ('399560618955891673', 'A Christmoose Carol', 2005, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ben Verbong', 'Andreas Steinhöfel', 'Mario Adorf, Armin Rohde, Anja Kling, Jürgen Tarrach, Christine Neubauer, Gilbert von Sohlern, Joachim Bißmeier, Dirk Galuba', null, 'A bullied young boy befriends a flying, talking moose that crashed through his ceiling after a test-flight with Santa went terribly awry in this holiday film for the whole family. But later, just as Mr. Moose and Beril strike up a friendship, the young boy''s nefarious landlord Mr. Pannecke decides a mounted moose head would make a fine new addition to his trophy wall. But Santa has other plans for Mr. Moose, and when he turns up looking for his lost pal, Beril is faced with the prospect of losing his one and only friend.', 'A bullied young boy befriends a flying, talking moose that crashed through his ceiling after a test-flight with Santa went terribly awry in this holiday film for the whole family. But later, just as Mr. Moose and Beril strike up a friendship, the young boy''s nefarious landlord Mr. Pannecke decides a mounted moose head would make a fine new addition to his trophy wall. But Santa has other plans for Mr. Moose, and when he turns up looking for his lost pal, Beril is faced with the prospect of losing his one and only friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3fXmQh34Y5QP6R09UqWpbB9oiRp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84379'),
  ('123756846986096798', 'A Chump at Oxford', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Alfred J. Goulding', 'Felix Adler, Charley Rogers, Harry Langdon', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Forrester Harvey, Wilfred Lucas, Forbes Murray, Frank Baker, Eddie Borden, Gerald Rogers', 'NR', 'The boys get jobs as a butler and maid-- Stan in drag-- for a dinner party. When that ends in disaster, they resort to sweeping streets and accidentally capture a bank robber. The grateful bank president sends them to Oxford, at their request, and higher-education hijinks ensue.', 'The boys get jobs as a butler and maid-- Stan in drag-- for a dinner party. When that ends in disaster, they resort to sweeping streets and accidentally capture a bank robber. The grateful bank president sends them to Oxford, at their request, and higher-education hijinks ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m88sC2iclgDCyJR4EKgoWQ3ujob.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33810'),
  ('879583282939165440', 'A Cinderella Christmas', 2016, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Tosca Musk, Don E. FauntLeRoy', 'Kelly Goodner', 'Emma Rigby, Peter Porte, Sarah Stouffer, Leland B. Martin, Lesley-Anne Down, Michael Dempsey, Mindy Cohn, Lucy DeVito', 'G', 'Angie works hard to run her uncle’s events business while her cousin Candace takes the credit. When Angie takes a night off to have fun at the Christmasquerade Ball, the mask and gown allow her to let loose, and she quickly catches the eye of Nicholas, a wealthy local bachelor. But then Angie has to go before revealing her identity, leaving Nicholas searching for his mystery woman in this modern take on the classic fairy tale.', 'Angie works hard to run her uncle’s events business while her cousin Candace takes the credit. When Angie takes a night off to have fun at the Christmasquerade Ball, the mask and gown allow her to let loose, and she quickly catches the eye of Nicholas, a wealthy local bachelor. But then Angie has to go before revealing her identity, leaving Nicholas searching for his mystery woman in this modern take on the classic fairy tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yD4SvhjDKi7ppsceMbxXKgMBtUi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426808'),
  ('861028828691176380', 'A Cinderella Christmas Ball', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Jonathan Yapp, Robert Glover, Don McBrearty', 'Marcy Holland', 'Danica McKellar, Oliver Rice, Sarah Orenstein, Mark Caven, Niamh Carolan, Hailey Summer, Michaela May, Allan James Cooke', null, 'Chelsea Jones, a Chicago-based dance instructor whose adoptive parents have long since passed, travels to the small European country of Havenshire over Christmas break in search of her heritage… and maybe even family. Discovering that the only way to get access to information she needs on her quest is via the royal family, she accepts an offer to teach a very reluctant Prince a special Waltz for the traditional Royal Christmas Ball.', 'Chelsea Jones, a Chicago-based dance instructor whose adoptive parents have long since passed, travels to the small European country of Havenshire over Christmas break in search of her heritage… and maybe even family. Discovering that the only way to get access to information she needs on her quest is via the royal family, she accepts an offer to teach a very reluctant Prince a special Waltz for the traditional Royal Christmas Ball.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iS4MXjwNEhA5pqfQDz0cP43zRul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087092'),
  ('1113778358982304822', 'A Cinderella Story', 2004, 'Comedy, Family, Romance', 'Mark Rosman, Anthony B. Richmond', 'Leigh Dunlap', 'Hilary Duff, Chad Michael Murray, Jennifer Coolidge, Dan Byrd, Regina King, Julie Gonzalo, Lin Shaye, Madeline Zima', 'PG', 'Routinely exploited by her wicked stepmother, the downtrodden Samantha Montgomery is excited about the prospect of meeting her Internet beau at the school''s Halloween dance.', 'Routinely exploited by her wicked stepmother, the downtrodden Samantha Montgomery is excited about the prospect of meeting her Internet beau at the school''s Halloween dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukwP7gDPWxj1R1dW5iN3mnxkL3D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11247'),
  ('766983115612625840', 'A Cinderella Story: Christmas Wish', 2019, 'Romance, Music, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Robert Brinkmann, Tammy Tsang, Kate Weiss', 'Michelle Johnston', 'Laura Marano, Gregg Sulkin, Isabella Gómez, Johannah Newmarch, Lillian Doucet-Roche, Chanelle Peloso, Barclay Hope, Garfield Wilson', 'PG', 'Kat is an aspiring singer-songwriter who dreams of making it big. However, her dreams are stalled by her reality: a conniving and cruel stepfamily and a demoralizing job working as a singing elf at billionaire Terrence Wintergarden’s Santa Land.', 'Kat is an aspiring singer-songwriter who dreams of making it big. However, her dreams are stalled by her reality: a conniving and cruel stepfamily and a demoralizing job working as a singing elf at billionaire Terrence Wintergarden’s Santa Land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozBX0u5caaJFli9AssqJmARb5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:606117'),
  ('979795967484358691', 'A Cinderella Story: If the Shoe Fits', 2016, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy, Music', 'Robert Brinkmann, Michelle Johnston', 'Elena Song', 'Sofia Carson, Thomas Law, Jennifer Tilly, Jazzara Jaslyn, Nicole Fortuin, Amy Louise Wilson, Ashley de Lange, David Ury', 'PG', 'A contemporary musical version of the classic Cinderella story in which the servant step daughter hope to compete in a musical competition for a famous pop star.', 'A contemporary musical version of the classic Cinderella story in which the servant step daughter hope to compete in a musical competition for a famous pop star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtxOA6Sb8lK1PfRiwduxYVuzaEv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407655'),
  ('40478663268779348', 'A Cinderella Story: Once Upon a Song', 2011, 'Comedy, Family, Romance, Drama', 'Damon Santostefano', 'Jessica Scott, Erik Patterson', 'Lucy Hale, Freddie Stroma, Missi Pyle, Megan Park, Matt Lintz, Jessalyn Wanlim, Titus Makin Jr., Alyson Stoner', 'PG', 'In this modern telling of the classic tale, aspiring singer Katie Gibbs falls for the new boy at her performing arts high school. But Katie''s wicked stepmother and stepsister are scheming to crush her dream before she can sing her way into his heart.', 'In this modern telling of the classic tale, aspiring singer Katie Gibbs falls for the new boy at her performing arts high school. But Katie''s wicked stepmother and stepsister are scheming to crush her dream before she can sing her way into his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/awuuwPA8Hy9c5EH04xwkEXOSYiL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74018'),
  ('449673836188311379', 'A Cinderella Story: Starstruck', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Michelle Johnston, Geoff Wallace', 'Michelle Johnston', 'Bailee Madison, Michael Evans Behling, April Telek, Lillian Doucet-Roche, Richard Harmon, Matty Finochio, Karen Holness, Ricky He', 'PG', 'Finley Tremaine, a small-town farm girl, longs to spread her wings and soar as an aspiring performer. When a Hollywood film crew arrives in her sleepy town, she is determined to land a role in the production and capture the attention of handsome lead actor Jackson Stone. Unfortunately, a botched audition forces her to change course. Now, disguised as cowboy “Huck,” Finley finally gets her big break. But can she keep the charade a secret from everyone, including her evil stepmother and devious step-siblings?', 'Finley Tremaine, a small-town farm girl, longs to spread her wings and soar as an aspiring performer. When a Hollywood film crew arrives in her sleepy town, she is determined to land a role in the production and capture the attention of handsome lead actor Jackson Stone. Unfortunately, a botched audition forces her to change course. Now, disguised as cowboy “Huck,” Finley finally gets her big break. But can she keep the charade a secret from everyone, including her evil stepmother and devious step-siblings?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXIqSUpO84PMNt9JclXzCbPBslT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:818809'),
  ('1039133334178611087', 'A City of Sadness', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Hou Hsiao-hsien, Chen Hwai-En, Chang Tso-chi', 'Wu Nien-jen, Chu Tien-Wen', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Hsin Shu-Fen, Chan Chung-Yung, Jack Kao, Tai Bo, Li Tian-Lu, Grace Chen, Wu Nien-jen', 'NR', 'The story of a family embroiled in the "White Terror," the Kuomintang government''s anti-communist political repression that was wrought on the Taiwanese people from 1947-1987.', 'The story of a family embroiled in the "White Terror," the Kuomintang government''s anti-communist political repression that was wrought on the Taiwanese people from 1947-1987.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1aIYLgnrlsUrh77G2OdQT9NV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49982'),
  ('833249352462903861', 'A Civil Action', 1998, 'Drama', 'Steven Zaillian, Conrad Hall', 'Steven Zaillian', 'John Travolta, Robert Duvall, Tony Shalhoub, William H. Macy, Željko Ivanek, Bruce Norris, John Lithgow, Kathleen Quinlan', 'PG-13', 'Jan Schlickmann is a cynical lawyer who goes out to ''get rid of'' a case, only to find out it is potentially worth millions. The case becomes his obsession, to the extent that he is willing to give up everything—including his career and his clients'' goals—in order to continue the case against all odds.', 'Jan Schlickmann is a cynical lawyer who goes out to ''get rid of'' a case, only to find out it is potentially worth millions. The case becomes his obsession, to the extent that he is willing to give up everything—including his career and his clients'' goals—in order to continue the case against all odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AVF1cjRGOfaB4oteSzxvHiQ3hR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9422'),
  ('428763671893824384', 'A Clear Felling', 2020, 'Thriller', 'Max Gleschinski, Jean-Pierre Meyer-Gehrke, Moritz Busch', 'Max Gleschinski', 'Florian Bartholomäi, Bernhard Conrad, Maike Johanna Reuter, Arne Fuhrmann, Jan Gorkow, Petra Nadolny, Ulrike Reinhold, Christoph Gottschalch', null, 'Martin and Eric grew up in a small village in Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. They have been friends since they were little boys and met when they were fishing, and from then on went to the lake together every Sunday. But their friendship is also marked by rivalry, because on one of their trips together they also met Frenni, who both fell in love with. The three of them roamed the woods and fields as children and remained friends when they grew up and Frenni got together with Eric. The couple is inseparable and very much in love, and this great love and the friendship of the threesome is only repeatedly tested by the drunken attacks by Eric’s unpredictable, aggressive twin brother Basti.', 'Martin and Eric grew up in a small village in Mecklenburg-Vorpommern. They have been friends since they were little boys and met when they were fishing, and from then on went to the lake together every Sunday. But their friendship is also marked by rivalry, because on one of their trips together they also met Frenni, who both fell in love with. The three of them roamed the woods and fields as children and remained friends when they grew up and Frenni got together with Eric. The couple is inseparable and very much in love, and this great love and the friendship of the threesome is only repeatedly tested by the drunken attacks by Eric’s unpredictable, aggressive twin brother Basti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zvH8PBQr6duVN2A7k6yI088zJRW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:503335'),
  ('1037105863515869631', 'A Clever Crook', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Alexandre Léglise, Lucas Bernard', 'Lucas Bernard', 'Swann Arlaud, Charles Berling, Antoine Levannier, Victor Pontecorvo, Jennifer Decker, Jean-Quentin Châtelain, Anne Loiret, Satya Dusaugey', null, 'Commissioner Beffrois waits for retirement with mixed enthusiasm when a theft of paintings catches his attention.', 'Commissioner Beffrois waits for retirement with mixed enthusiasm when a theft of paintings catches his attention.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fvAZ5vObXLqzQv6mWRnyP2Mplqj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:552982'),
  ('501532961638602306', 'A Close Embrace', 2009, 'Romance', 'Alexander Kott', 'Alexander Kott', null, null, 'About the relationship of a man and a woman who, despite the trials that fell to their lot, even in adulthood managed to maintain a taste for life and faith in love. Their feelings have survived the pain of loss and separation, but still have not lost their strength. And although at first the characters try to hide their emotions and experiences, deceive not only each other, but also themselves, as a result, love wins and puts everything in its place...', 'About the relationship of a man and a woman who, despite the trials that fell to their lot, even in adulthood managed to maintain a taste for life and faith in love. Their feelings have survived the pain of loss and separation, but still have not lost their strength. And although at first the characters try to hide their emotions and experiences, deceive not only each other, but also themselves, as a result, love wins and puts everything in its place...', null, 'tmdb:movie:938173'),
  ('587126639327304242', 'A Close Shave', 1996, 'Family, Animation, Comedy', 'Nick Park, Dave Alex Riddett, Trisha Budd', 'Bob Baker, Nick Park', 'Peter Sallis, Anne Reid', 'NR', 'Wallace''s whirlwind romance with the proprietor of the local wool shop puts his head in a spin, and Gromit is framed for sheep-rustling in a fiendish criminal plot.', 'Wallace''s whirlwind romance with the proprietor of the local wool shop puts his head in a spin, and Gromit is framed for sheep-rustling in a fiendish criminal plot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdIR27trLyrlJ5nmkbcG3Bomah6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532'),
