  ('224488283755200160', 'A Comédia Divina', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Toni Venturi, Carlos André Zalasik', 'José Roberto Torero, Toni Venturi, Caroline Fioratti', 'Murilo Rosa, Monica Iozzi, Thiago Mendonça, Dalton Vigh, Debora Duboc, Thogun Teixeira, Zezé Motta, Juliana Alves', null, 'The Devil himself comes to Earth to open his own church and the world becomes a pandemonium of delights and confusions. Based on a short story by Machado de Assis, the most famous realistic Brazilian writer of the XIX century.', 'The Devil himself comes to Earth to open his own church and the world becomes a pandemonium of delights and confusions. Based on a short story by Machado de Assis, the most famous realistic Brazilian writer of the XIX century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2DONIzSRchXPhgVCBEp628Lq1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411764'),
