  ('299899764795490068', 'A Complete History of My Sexual Failures', 2008, 'Documentary, Romance', 'Chris Waitt, Steven Mochrie', 'Chris Waitt', 'Chris Waitt, Alexandra Boyarskaya, Danielle McLeod', null, 'The egocentric documentary-maker Chris Waitt traces his romantic ineptitude and sexual impotence through awkward interviews with irate ex-girlfriends and stunts involving S&amp;M parlours, Harley Street doctors and Viagra overdoses. The results are often hilarious, sometimes moving and speak directly to the hapless paramour in all of us.', 'The egocentric documentary-maker Chris Waitt traces his romantic ineptitude and sexual impotence through awkward interviews with irate ex-girlfriends and stunts involving S&amp;M parlours, Harley Street doctors and Viagra overdoses. The results are often hilarious, sometimes moving and speak directly to the hapless paramour in all of us.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XQU7DCErsWjVN9Fs4Tdiv9H90c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13206'),
  ('676417327804705239', 'A Complete Unknown', 2024, 'Drama, Music', 'Phedon Papamichael, James Mangold, Christopher J. Morris', 'Jay Cocks, James Mangold', 'Timothée Chalamet, Edward Norton, Elle Fanning, Monica Barbaro, Scoot McNairy, Dan Fogler, Boyd Holbrook, Will Harrison', 'R', 'New York, early 1960s. Against the backdrop of a vibrant music scene and tumultuous cultural upheaval, an enigmatic 19-year-old from Minnesota arrives in the West Village with his guitar and revolutionary talent, destined to change the course of American music.', 'New York, early 1960s. Against the backdrop of a vibrant music scene and tumultuous cultural upheaval, an enigmatic 19-year-old from Minnesota arrives in the West Village with his guitar and revolutionary talent, destined to change the course of American music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/llWl3GtNoXosbvYboelmoT459NM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661539'),
  ('152849714231866576', 'A Computer Animated Hand', 1972, 'Documentary, Animation', 'Edwin Catmull, Fred Parke', null, null, null, 'Archive film showing possibly the first example of digital rendering, made by Pixar co-founders Ed Catmull and Fred Parke in 1972, was stumbled upon by the son of Robert B Ingebretsen, who also set up the world-famous U.S. studio. A six minute version shows additional CGI animation of an artificial heart valve, and human heads.', 'Archive film showing possibly the first example of digital rendering, made by Pixar co-founders Ed Catmull and Fred Parke in 1972, was stumbled upon by the son of Robert B Ingebretsen, who also set up the world-famous U.S. studio. A six minute version shows additional CGI animation of an artificial heart valve, and human heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mG0nom0S0z8CrkdhVToDfsmVvJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146698'),
  ('494501644909526126', 'A Comrade from the Village', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Piro Milkani', 'Ruzhdi Pulaha', 'Violeta Manushi, Rajmonda Bulku, Robert Ndrenika, Elvira Diamanti, Sotiraq Bratko, Pandi Raidhi, Stavri Shkurti, Mirush Kabashi', null, 'It is a cine comedy following "The Lady from the town". Olga is getting ready to go to a meeting of the district women activists, where she will relate her own experience in the struggle against conservative concepts. During a warm atmosphere, Olga sings the first lullaby to her newborn nephew: "Once upon a time there was an Olga who posed as a lady.Time passed by and the lady has become one of us, a comrade from the country"', 'It is a cine comedy following "The Lady from the town". Olga is getting ready to go to a meeting of the district women activists, where she will relate her own experience in the struggle against conservative concepts. During a warm atmosphere, Olga sings the first lullaby to her newborn nephew: "Once upon a time there was an Olga who posed as a lady.Time passed by and the lady has become one of us, a comrade from the country"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znwpsFH7llB8ZiBZsH01ZrgwfTl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393163'),
  ('535382062356059448', 'A Concerto Is a Conversation', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Brandon Somerhalder, David Bolen, Ben Proudfoot', 'Ben Proudfoot', 'Kris Bowers, Horace Bowers, Sr.', null, 'A virtuoso jazz pianist and film composer tracks his family''s lineage through his 91-year-old grandfather from Jim Crow Florida to the Walt Disney Concert Hall.', 'A virtuoso jazz pianist and film composer tracks his family''s lineage through his 91-year-old grandfather from Jim Crow Florida to the Walt Disney Concert Hall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beZ7Es8mXCqOPV9iGVeudQmhmLJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776751'),
