  ('721883412441122558', 'A Connecticut Yankee in King Arthur''s Court', 1949, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Music, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Ralph Axness', 'Edmund Beloin', 'Bing Crosby, Rhonda Fleming, Cedric Hardwicke, William Bendix, Murvyn Vye, Virginia Field, Joseph Vitale, Henry Wilcoxon', 'NR', 'A bump on the head sends Hank Martin, 1905 auto mechanic, to Arthurian England, 528 A.D., where he is befriended by Sir Sagramore le Desirous and gains power by judicious use of technology. He and Alisande, the King''s niece, fall in love at first sight, which draws unwelcome attention from her fiancée Sir Lancelot; but worse trouble befalls when Hank meddles in the kingdom''s politics.', 'A bump on the head sends Hank Martin, 1905 auto mechanic, to Arthurian England, 528 A.D., where he is befriended by Sir Sagramore le Desirous and gains power by judicious use of technology. He and Alisande, the King''s niece, fall in love at first sight, which draws unwelcome attention from her fiancée Sir Lancelot; but worse trouble befalls when Hank meddles in the kingdom''s politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2LYlMNGXmes2tMlMn6KgSNwUpCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36848'),
  ('33202398968831128', 'A Conspiracy of Faith', 2016, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Hans Petter Moland, John Andreas Andersen, Sebastian Fahr-Brix', 'Jussi Adler-Olsen, Nikolaj Arcel', 'Nikolaj Lie Kaas, Fares Fares, Pål Sverre Hagen, Jacob Lohmann, Amanda Collin, Johanne Louise Schmidt, Jakob Oftebro, Signe Anastassia Mannov', 'NR', 'Denmark, 2016. A blurred note is found in a bottle that has traveled across the ocean for a long time. After deciphering the cryptic note, Department Q follow a sinister trail that leads them to investigate a case that occurred in 2008. At the same time, new tragic events take place that test their faith and deepest beliefs.', 'Denmark, 2016. A blurred note is found in a bottle that has traveled across the ocean for a long time. After deciphering the cryptic note, Department Q follow a sinister trail that leads them to investigate a case that occurred in 2008. At the same time, new tragic events take place that test their faith and deepest beliefs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/72T8HXXAHEkhM46t63PAtDUndof.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348668'),
