  ('461872433255133165', 'A Countess from Hong Kong', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Arthur Ibbetson, Charlie Chaplin, Jim Brennan', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Marlon Brando, Sophia Loren, Sydney Chaplin, Tippi Hedren, Patrick Cargill, Michael Medwin, Oliver Johnston, John Paul', 'G', 'A Russian countess stows away in the stateroom of a married U.S. diplomat bound for New York.', 'A Russian countess stows away in the stateroom of a married U.S. diplomat bound for New York.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dquOunnHxQXBVOOiqkdtGWIK1lP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2984'),
  ('302926458358558891', 'A Country Encore', 2025, null, null, null, 'Amanda Jordan, Connor McMahon, Andrew Bushell, Richard Waugh, Lisa Michelle Cornelius, Kimberly-Sue Murray, Will Bowes, Myles Erlick', null, 'A corporate jingle writer is on the verge of abandoning her songwriting dreams for good when she mistakenly hands over an old love song to the man who broke her heart, a famous country singer is looking for his next hit.', 'A corporate jingle writer is on the verge of abandoning her songwriting dreams for good when she mistakenly hands over an old love song to the man who broke her heart, a famous country singer is looking for his next hit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQaCESBIhH0HsgIvfgqtAUPAdGd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1304600'),
  ('367969441401067252', 'A Country Wedding', 2015, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Adam Sliwinski, Paul Turner, Shaun Moskie', 'Nancey Silvers', 'Autumn Reeser, Jesse Metcalfe, Laura Mennell, Lauren Holly, Aaron Craven, Hrothgar Mathews, Peter Bryant, Joseph Allan Sutherland', null, 'A famous country singer set to marry a glamorous Hollywood actress returns to his small town roots. When he crosses paths with his childhood sweetheart and finally feels inspired to write songs again he reevaluates his life, his values and his opinion of true love. As his wedding day approaches, he must decide if he has chosen the right woman to be his wife.', 'A famous country singer set to marry a glamorous Hollywood actress returns to his small town roots. When he crosses paths with his childhood sweetheart and finally feels inspired to write songs again he reevaluates his life, his values and his opinion of true love. As his wedding day approaches, he must decide if he has chosen the right woman to be his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/df63EX5PPlq9UDuXUteU9rIg2up.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:346489'),
  ('447221644073351277', 'A Courtesan with Flowered Skin', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Keisuke Toyoshima, Osamu Fujiishi, Masanori Kita', 'Yoshinobu Kamo', 'Yumi Adachi, Yasushi Fuchikami, Ena Koshino, Tomochika, Saki Takaoka, Kanji Tsuda, Yoko Mitsuya, Hanako Takigawa', null, 'Japan around 1860: popular courtesan Asagiri will be freed soon from her service, yet she cannot imagine any other existence. Until one day at a local festival, Asagiri meets the young artisan Hanjiro by chance – an encounter that changes her destiny. With a strong performance by leading actress Yumi ADACHI and exquisite camerawork and production design, A COURTESAN WITH FLOWERED SKIN succeeds in recalling the golden age of Japanese erotic film.', 'Japan around 1860: popular courtesan Asagiri will be freed soon from her service, yet she cannot imagine any other existence. Until one day at a local festival, Asagiri meets the young artisan Hanjiro by chance – an encounter that changes her destiny. With a strong performance by leading actress Yumi ADACHI and exquisite camerawork and production design, A COURTESAN WITH FLOWERED SKIN succeeds in recalling the golden age of Japanese erotic film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKkeMZr2ZqQlwunpFdtId7tXRzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342437'),
  ('116117558402657736', 'A Covenant with Death', 1967, 'Drama', 'Lamont Johnson', 'Lawrence B. Marcus, Saul Levitt', 'George Maharis, Earl Holliman, Laura Devon, Katy Jurado, Gene Hackman, Arthur O''Connell, Sidney Blackmer, John Anderson', null, 'An innocent man is found guilty of murder and sentenced to death, but as he''s about to be hanged he accidentally kills his executioner. He now faces a new trial, presided over by a young and inexperienced judge.', 'An innocent man is found guilty of murder and sentenced to death, but as he''s about to be hanged he accidentally kills his executioner. He now faces a new trial, presided over by a young and inexperienced judge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nmAaDECRQfnke7XXvvScsBL2G99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241797'),
  ('127196107732240638', 'A Cowboy Needs a Horse', 1956, 'Animation, Western', 'Bill Justice', null, null, 'NR', 'A young boy dreams of being a cowboy. After he gets the basics, as outlined in the title song, he''s attacked by Indians. He runs out of bullets and manages to lasso them. He smokes the peace pipe with their chief. A robber is holding up a stagecoach and he rides to the rescue, refusing the reward. He also saves a train from a dynamited bridge, and a girl tied to a cactus, before riding into the sunset (and back to his suburban bed).', 'A young boy dreams of being a cowboy. After he gets the basics, as outlined in the title song, he''s attacked by Indians. He runs out of bullets and manages to lasso them. He smokes the peace pipe with their chief. A robber is holding up a stagecoach and he rides to the rescue, refusing the reward. He also saves a train from a dynamited bridge, and a girl tied to a cactus, before riding into the sunset (and back to his suburban bed).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHUERsWdDOW5n2Dx3w4qEzr0Pjb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53768'),
  ('1065619550782816362', 'A Coy Decoy', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Characters on book covers come to life, including Porky and Daffy. The "Wolf of Wall Street" chases Daffy through "The Hurricane," "The Storm" and across "The Bridge of San Luis Rey" before expiring in "For Whom the Bell Tolls."', 'Characters on book covers come to life, including Porky and Daffy. The "Wolf of Wall Street" chases Daffy through "The Hurricane," "The Storm" and across "The Bridge of San Luis Rey" before expiring in "For Whom the Bell Tolls."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yHAHMWbPgNpxi65cSDmMik7MJvL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236519'),
  ('126013503989816885', 'A Crafty Christmas Romance', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'John Lyde, Brian Brough', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Nicola Posener, Brad Johnson, Anne Sward, Ben Lokey, Renny Grames, Wuta Beta, Carter Brough, Xander Brough', null, 'Mandy, the owner of a craft and hobby store, discovers an old copy of “A Christmas Carol” among donations for a book drive. In the book is a letter to Santa from 70 years ago along with a valuable coin. Mandy sets out to find the owner of the book, letter and coin with the help of Jonah, a contractor who first came upon and donated the book. Along the way, they find clues that lead them closer to the author, and to each other, but can Mandy return everything to the book owner in time for Christmas and make her own Christmas wish come true?', 'Mandy, the owner of a craft and hobby store, discovers an old copy of “A Christmas Carol” among donations for a book drive. In the book is a letter to Santa from 70 years ago along with a valuable coin. Mandy sets out to find the owner of the book, letter and coin with the help of Jonah, a contractor who first came upon and donated the book. Along the way, they find clues that lead them closer to the author, and to each other, but can Mandy return everything to the book owner in time for Christmas and make her own Christmas wish come true?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubmNveioByrMjjruXTORxOr2H3e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:744927'),
  ('1020794690669499436', 'A Crazy Composer', 1905, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A silly-looking composer attempts to compose. He then falls asleep, and dreams of all manner of bizarre nonsense.', 'A silly-looking composer attempts to compose. He then falls asleep, and dreams of all manner of bizarre nonsense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q43JBrXkQZurxo14ZGTdxsK8hWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:196293'),
  ('211246519568019178', 'A Crazy Crazy Family', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Dinos Dimopoulos, Lakis Antonakos', 'Nikos Tsiforos, Polyvios Vasileiadis', 'Jenny Karezi, Alekos Alexandrakis, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Mary Aroni, Lili Papayanni, Alekos Tzanetakos, Katerina Gogou, Nitsa Marouda', null, 'Mika is a young woman living in a crazy ... family. Her mother, Pasta Flora, is alienated, her little sister is uncontrollable, and her father is a good, but cowardly, man. She''s engaged to Mikis but the day before their wedding she goes to Venice and marries Andreas, who, after meeting her family, he undertakes to make sense of them.', 'Mika is a young woman living in a crazy ... family. Her mother, Pasta Flora, is alienated, her little sister is uncontrollable, and her father is a good, but cowardly, man. She''s engaged to Mikis but the day before their wedding she goes to Venice and marries Andreas, who, after meeting her family, he undertakes to make sense of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1TR7L5HS2WlOQVp7hGLJfTKtciv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183388'),
  ('570329229351495708', 'A Crazy... Crazy... 40-Year-Old Woman', 1970, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Dinos Mavroeidis', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Rena Vlahopoulou, Andreas Barkoulis, Giannis Michalopoulos, Melpo Zarokosta, Tasso Kavadia, Popi Alva, Giorgos Gavriilidis, Dimitris Kalivokas', null, 'A rich widow tries to pursue a relationship with a younger violinist despite the objections of her older brother and his wife.', 'A rich widow tries to pursue a relationship with a younger violinist despite the objections of her older brother and his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nYhiw6t9k8CxVuPmTVajdvDHccN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365786'),
