  ('269301563752503063', 'A Creepshow Animated Special', 2020, 'Animation, Horror', 'Greg Nicotero, Eben Matthews, Adam Martin', null, 'Joey King, Fayna Sanchez, Kiefer Sutherland, Mason Pike', null, 'Two animated tales of terror: “Survivor Type,” a man determined to stay alive alone on a deserted island no matter what the cost. “Twittering from the Circus of the Dead,” a teen''s family road trip includes a visit to the gravest show on earth.', 'Two animated tales of terror: “Survivor Type,” a man determined to stay alive alone on a deserted island no matter what the cost. “Twittering from the Circus of the Dead,” a teen''s family road trip includes a visit to the gravest show on earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5xsjQkDqdNCkpT8HNgf5fiwfiFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756747'),
  ('175447317480630690', 'A Creepshow Holiday Special', 2020, 'Horror', 'Greg Nicotero, Robert Draper', 'Greg Nicotero, J. A. Konrath', 'Anna Camp, Adam Pally, Pete Burris, Frank Nicotero, Derek Russo, Candy McLellan, Tom Glynn, Keith Flippen', null, 'In the holiday themed, hour-long episode, “Shapeshifters Anonymous,” fearing he is a murderer, an anxious man searches for answers for his “unique condition” from an unusual support group.', 'In the holiday themed, hour-long episode, “Shapeshifters Anonymous,” fearing he is a murderer, an anxious man searches for answers for his “unique condition” from an unusual support group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/95EESJt65BJpdRzm0wcgcrzbf60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762921'),
  ('124523048640495665', 'A Crime', 1993, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jacques Deray, Robert Fraisse', 'Alain Delon, Jacques Deray, Jean Curtelin', 'Alain Delon, Manuel Blanc, Sophie Broustal, Francine Bergé, Maxime Leroux, Pierre Bianco, Jean-Marie Winling, Jean-Paul Comart', null, '"Un Crime" takes place over a single night, between 10pm and 6am. It takes place in a single setting - a millionaire''s apartment in Lyon. The film is about the conflict between two men, alone, face to face in the closed world of the apartment. The first man is a famous lawyer named Dunand. The second is Frédéric Chapelin-Tourvel, Dunand''s rich client, twenty years his junior. Throughout the night, Dunand tries to track down the truth. Did Frédéric kill his father and mother, in particularly barbarous circumstances ?', '"Un Crime" takes place over a single night, between 10pm and 6am. It takes place in a single setting - a millionaire''s apartment in Lyon. The film is about the conflict between two men, alone, face to face in the closed world of the apartment. The first man is a famous lawyer named Dunand. The second is Frédéric Chapelin-Tourvel, Dunand''s rich client, twenty years his junior. Throughout the night, Dunand tries to track down the truth. Did Frédéric kill his father and mother, in particularly barbarous circumstances ?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lP5e7TPEPzR72XeSyUAO9im6xH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124013'),
  ('4513312986297139', 'A Crime', 2006, 'Crime', 'Manuel Pradal, Giorgos Arvanitis', null, 'Harvey Keitel, Emmanuelle Béart, Norman Reedus, Joe Grifasi, Lily Rabe, Kim Director, Brian Tarantina, Patrick Collins', null, 'Vincent''s life is on hold until he finds his wife''s killer. Alice, his neighbor, is convinced she can make him happy. She decides to invent a culprit, so that Vincent can find revenge and leave the past behind. But there is no ideal culprit and no perfect crime.', 'Vincent''s life is on hold until he finds his wife''s killer. Alice, his neighbor, is convinced she can make him happy. She decides to invent a culprit, so that Vincent can find revenge and leave the past behind. But there is no ideal culprit and no perfect crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ms5tA7A2xc1EOqc2mVvcFrnH6gO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341'),
  ('1087227747359878481', 'A Crime in Paradise', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Jean Becker', 'Jean Becker, Sébastien Japrisot, Sacha Guitry', 'Jacques Villeret, Josiane Balasko, André Dussollier, Suzanne Flon, Gérard Hernandez, Roland Magdane, Jacques Dacqmine, Valérie Mairesse', null, 'In the 1980 French countryside, farmer Jojo and his ill-tempered wife Lulu hate each other, though their respective interests speak against divorce. The only thing that keeps the oppressed Jojo from murder is the threat of the guillotine...', 'In the 1980 French countryside, farmer Jojo and his ill-tempered wife Lulu hate each other, though their respective interests speak against divorce. The only thing that keeps the oppressed Jojo from murder is the threat of the guillotine...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y6IAUOnvctKcnSpVdJNhPb11OvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54544'),
