  ('383263022249084392', 'A Crude Awakening', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Basil Gelpke, Ray McCormack', null, 'Wade Adams', null, 'Basil Gelpke and Ray McCormack''s nonfiction treatise Crude Awakening joins Maxed Out, An Inconvenient Truth, and other recent documentaries devoted to unearthing and exploring forces that are untying the connective threads of contemporary society. The subject at hand is crude oil - specifically, the depletion of petroleum from the Earth, in an era when consumption threatens to exceed supply.', 'Basil Gelpke and Ray McCormack''s nonfiction treatise Crude Awakening joins Maxed Out, An Inconvenient Truth, and other recent documentaries devoted to unearthing and exploring forces that are untying the connective threads of contemporary society. The subject at hand is crude oil - specifically, the depletion of petroleum from the Earth, in an era when consumption threatens to exceed supply.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rQ16EIpBMQLSF95tDnGQoy3ncbA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13670'),
  ('509191174468814304', 'A Cruel Romance', 1984, 'Drama, Romance', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Vadim Alisov, Leonid Chertok', 'Eldar Ryazanov', 'Alisa Freyndlikh, Larisa Guzeeva, Nikita Mikhalkov, Andrey Myagkov, Aleksey Petrenko, Viktor Proskurin, Georgi Burkov, Tatyana Pankova', null, 'In the town of Bryakhimov, noble but poor widow Harita Ignatyevna Ogudalova seeks to arrange marriages for her three daughters. She maintains an “open house”, hoping to attract gentlemen well-off enough to marry a dowry-less girl for love.', 'In the town of Bryakhimov, noble but poor widow Harita Ignatyevna Ogudalova seeks to arrange marriages for her three daughters. She maintains an “open house”, hoping to attract gentlemen well-off enough to marry a dowry-less girl for love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1NJZbDujEc4ZEOMKbgcKOTh4Dl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66091'),
  ('580695854538919045', 'A Cry for Help: The Tracey Thurman Story', 1989, 'Drama, TV Movie', null, null, 'Nancy McKeon, Dale Midkiff, Graham Jarvis, Yvette Heyden, Terri Hanauer, Philip Baker Hall, David Wohl, Priscilla Pointer', null, 'Tracy Thurman was married to a man who abused her. But he continues to harass her after she gets a restraining order, and the police do little to help. When he brutally beats her and slashes her throat in front of police, she sues the city and the police department for failing to protect her.', 'Tracy Thurman was married to a man who abused her. But he continues to harass her after she gets a restraining order, and the police do little to help. When he brutally beats her and slashes her throat in front of police, she sues the city and the police department for failing to protect her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WoVIk4ND6PzI9eD3uLLKqry4ug.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107244'),
  ('971844625893798778', 'A Cry in the Night', 1956, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Frank Tuttle, John F. Seitz, C.M. Florance', 'David Dortort', 'Edmond O''Brien, Brian Donlevy, Natalie Wood, Raymond Burr, Richard Anderson, Irene Hervey, Carol Veazie, Mary Lawrence', null, 'A police captain''s emotions get in the way when his daughter is kidnapped.', 'A police captain''s emotions get in the way when his daughter is kidnapped.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAsaVv214lomIOEP9sd5tn7b0ch.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35895'),
  ('198129325963537826', 'A Cry in the Wild', 1990, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Gregg Heschong, Mark Griffiths', 'Gary Paulsen, Catherine Cyran', 'Jared Rushton, Pamela Sue Martin, Stephen Meadows, Ned Beatty, Terence H. Winkless, Louise Baker, Deke Anderson, John Jakes', 'PG', '13-year-old Brian is the sole survivor of an unreported plane crash. Alone in the Yukon wilderness, Brian must learn to survive by his wits, find food and shelter, and brave wild, hungry animals until or if he is found.', '13-year-old Brian is the sole survivor of an unreported plane crash. Alone in the Yukon wilderness, Brian must learn to survive by his wits, find food and shelter, and brave wild, hungry animals until or if he is found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2xNHWOk6jXmwm1Cqbv1HAjByWf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25373'),
  ('655878099007018972', 'A Cultural Film', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Moustafa Ezz Al-Dein, Mohamed Amin', 'Mohamed Amin', 'Ahmed Eid, Ahmed Rizq, Fathy Abdel Wahab, Tarek Abdelaziz, Ibrahim Yousri, Ahmed Azmy, Ahmed Akl, Mohamed Sharaf', null, 'Three sexually-frustrated friends are determined to watch a porno video but have no private place, no VCR, and no TV, so they go on a misadventure in which their group constantly increases, taking on more and more sexually-frustrated people and falling into one mishap after another, all because of the restrictions of society.', 'Three sexually-frustrated friends are determined to watch a porno video but have no private place, no VCR, and no TV, so they go on a misadventure in which their group constantly increases, taking on more and more sexually-frustrated people and falling into one mishap after another, all because of the restrictions of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17pQ1n3cPA1xXkEJHoRDkPjVvDY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193457'),
  ('127654957609793826', 'A Cure for Love', 1966, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jan Batory, Barbara Chęcińska, Aleksander Sajkow', 'Joanna Chmielewska, Jan Batory', 'Kalina Jędrusik, Krystyna Sienkiewicz, Wieńczysław Gliński, Andrzej Łapicki, Mieczysław Czechowicz, Jacek Fedorowicz, Ryszard Ronczewski, Henryk Staszewski', null, 'An architect Joanna tells her friend Halina on the telephone about her love troubles and suddenly hears a nice man''s voice: "The best cure for love is another love." Then she becomes a forgers dispatcher mistaken for Honorata by telephone and decides to work out a forgers secret and the secret of her new love Andrzej.', 'An architect Joanna tells her friend Halina on the telephone about her love troubles and suddenly hears a nice man''s voice: "The best cure for love is another love." Then she becomes a forgers dispatcher mistaken for Honorata by telephone and decides to work out a forgers secret and the secret of her new love Andrzej.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8W4AU7BiHImeBUWzXoNweUX3Ex8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101362'),
  ('264737554131736297', 'A Cure for Wellness', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Gore Verbinski, Bojan Bazelli, Grant Armstrong', 'Justin Haythe', 'Dane DeHaan, Jason Isaacs, Mia Goth, Harry Groener, Celia Imrie, Adrian Schiller, Ivo Nandi, Tomas Norström', 'R', 'An ambitious young executive is sent to retrieve his company''s CEO from an idyllic but mysterious "wellness center" at a remote location in the Swiss Alps but soon suspects that the spa''s miraculous treatments are not what they seem.', 'An ambitious young executive is sent to retrieve his company''s CEO from an idyllic but mysterious "wellness center" at a remote location in the Swiss Alps but soon suspects that the spa''s miraculous treatments are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8QWJtne0pTsNoJ86KE993aQYTLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:340837'),
  ('127195490263834963', 'A Curtain Raiser', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yorick Le Saux, François Ozon', 'François Ozon', 'Louis Garrel, Vahina Giocante, Mathieu Amalric', null, 'Bruno, a young Frenchman, is frustrated by his girlfriend''s constant lack of punctuality. He decides to end their relationship the next time she is late again.', 'Bruno, a young Frenchman, is frustrated by his girlfriend''s constant lack of punctuality. He decides to end their relationship the next time she is late again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yz7DRONA0RQ6Q2d6QHyzLkWNjpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27208'),
  ('347137685557120711', 'A Cut Above', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rodrigo França, Leticia Prisco', 'Anderson França, Marcelo Andrade, Sílvio Guindane', 'Lucas Penteado, Solange Couto, Jeniffer Dias, Rebecca, Yuri Marçal, Juliana Alves, Serjão Loroza, Neusa Borges', 'R', 'With his mom''s salon on the brink of bankruptcy, a dedicated son rolls up his sleeves to help and discovers himself as the coolest barber on the block.', 'With his mom''s salon on the brink of bankruptcy, a dedicated son rolls up his sleeves to help and discovers himself as the coolest barber on the block.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exoAst6FMT7vCxumMmhJxVHbtnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:997023'),
  ('446764101198819509', 'A Damsel in Distress', 1937, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'George Stevens, Carroll Clark, Joseph H. August', 'P.G. Wodehouse, Ernest Pagano, S.K. Lauren', 'Fred Astaire, George Burns, Gracie Allen, Joan Fontaine, Reginald Gardiner, Ray Noble, Constance Collier, Montagu Love', 'PG', 'Lady Alyce Marshmorton must marry soon, and the staff of Tottney Castle have laid bets on who she''ll choose, with young Albert wagering on ''Mr. X''. After Alyce goes to London to meet a beau she is restricted to the castle to curb her scandalous behavior. Albert then summons Jerry to Alyce''s aid in order to ''protect his investment''.', 'Lady Alyce Marshmorton must marry soon, and the staff of Tottney Castle have laid bets on who she''ll choose, with young Albert wagering on ''Mr. X''. After Alyce goes to London to meet a beau she is restricted to the castle to curb her scandalous behavior. Albert then summons Jerry to Alyce''s aid in order to ''protect his investment''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uqRcVA1JCbpPngcXu68Gzm8qR7I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66473'),
  ('133671946105192509', 'A Dancer''s World', 1957, 'Documentary, Music', 'Peter Glushanok, Peter Glushanok', 'Martha Graham, LeRoy Leatherman', 'Martha Graham, Lillian Biersteker, Robert Cohan, Miriam Cole, Mary Hinkson, Gene McDonald, Helen McGehee, Bertram Ross', null, 'A glimpse into the world and methodology of dancer Martha Graham.', 'A glimpse into the world and methodology of dancer Martha Graham.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQQ1nIBv3UicZwfu63TRRG89qAf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151381'),
  ('216154925551158905', 'A Dandy in Aspic', 1968, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Anthony Mann, Laurence Harvey, Austin Dempster', 'Derek Marlowe', 'Laurence Harvey, Tom Courtenay, Mia Farrow, Harry Andrews, Peter Cook, Lionel Stander, Per Oscarsson, Barbara Murray', 'R', 'Double-agent Alexander Eberlin is assigned by the British to hunt out a Russian spy, known to them as Krasnevin. Only Eberlin knows that Krasnevin is none other than himself! Accompanying him on his mission is a ruthless partner, who gradually discovers his secret as Eberlin tries to maneuver himself out of a desperate situation.', 'Double-agent Alexander Eberlin is assigned by the British to hunt out a Russian spy, known to them as Krasnevin. Only Eberlin knows that Krasnevin is none other than himself! Accompanying him on his mission is a ruthless partner, who gradually discovers his secret as Eberlin tries to maneuver himself out of a desperate situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5MxaHR8EOtftUbhm1wqqdJIiUNS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84844'),
  ('842555403347879466', 'A Dangerous Man', 2009, 'Crime, Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Keoni Waxman, Lauro David Chartrand-DelValle', 'Keoni Waxman', 'Steven Seagal, Mike Dopud, Hugo Steele, Byron Mann, Jesse Hutch, Marlaina Mah, Terry Chen, Byron Lawson', 'NR', 'After serving 6 years for a crime he didn''t commit, Shane Daniels is released from jail with an apology from the State of Arizona. Within hours of his freedom, he unluckily bears witness to a cop killing by Chinese mafia, who have a kidnapped girl and a bag of drug money.', 'After serving 6 years for a crime he didn''t commit, Shane Daniels is released from jail with an apology from the State of Arizona. Within hours of his freedom, he unluckily bears witness to a cop killing by Chinese mafia, who have a kidnapped girl and a bag of drug money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMzkiVFAqFnh01xjfwyivzTF69M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28465'),
  ('870337435496106788', 'A Dangerous Man: Lawrence After Arabia', 1992, 'Drama, History, TV Movie', 'Christopher Menaul, Witold Stok', 'Tim Rose Price', 'Ralph Fiennes, Denis Quilley, Alexander Siddig, Nicholas Jones, Roger Hammond, Peter Copley, Paul Freeman, Polly Walker', null, 'In 1919, the great English military man T. E. Lawrence tries to help Emir Feisal, ruler of Arabia, retain his political power during the Conference of Peace in Paris.', 'In 1919, the great English military man T. E. Lawrence tries to help Emir Feisal, ruler of Arabia, retain his political power during the Conference of Peace in Paris.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8usVC5NHTyufTn6Q1vG2CudHOUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124902'),
  ('529115639421411805', 'A Dangerous Method', 2011, 'Drama', 'Peter Suschitzky, David Cronenberg, Sebastian Soukup', 'Christopher Hampton', 'Keira Knightley, Viggo Mortensen, Michael Fassbender, Sarah Gadon, Vincent Cassel, André Hennicke, Arndt Schwering-Sohnrey, Mignon Remé', 'R', 'Seduced by the challenge of an impossible case, the driven Dr. Carl Jung takes the unbalanced yet beautiful Sabina Spielrein as his patient. Jung’s weapon is the method of his master, the renowned Sigmund Freud. Both men fall under Sabina’s spell.', 'Seduced by the challenge of an impossible case, the driven Dr. Carl Jung takes the unbalanced yet beautiful Sabina Spielrein as his patient. Jung’s weapon is the method of his master, the renowned Sigmund Freud. Both men fall under Sabina’s spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7TPYtzq9ABkfED1JB0tRASamL4z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48231'),
  ('889672818186691259', 'A Dangerous Place', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jerry P. Jacobs, Ken Blakey', 'Sean Dash', 'Ted Jan Roberts, Corey Feldman, Mako, Erin Gray, Marshall R. Teague, Dick Van Patten, Tricia Vessey, Jeannie Epper', 'R', 'When Ethan''s older brother Greg is found dead, the police rule the case a suicide, but Ethan suspects foul play stemming from Greg''s recent involvement with a martial arts team called the Scorpions. Ethan is also accomplished at martial arts, and he determines to join the Scorpions as a means of learning what really happened to Greg. - Written by Michelle Sturges', 'When Ethan''s older brother Greg is found dead, the police rule the case a suicide, but Ethan suspects foul play stemming from Greg''s recent involvement with a martial arts team called the Scorpions. Ethan is also accomplished at martial arts, and he determines to join the Scorpions as a means of learning what really happened to Greg. - Written by Michelle Sturges', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hSWIz6utGnxna8obp3zg0uzog0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:229594'),
  ('950300475007717096', 'A Dangerous Profession', 1949, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ted Tetzlaff, Robert De Grasse', 'Warren Duff, Martin Rackin', 'George Raft, Ella Raines, Pat O''Brien, Bill Williams, Jim Backus, Roland Winters, Betty Underwood, Robert Gist', 'NR', 'A cop-turned-bail bondsman gets involved in a murder investigation involving a former flame.', 'A cop-turned-bail bondsman gets involved in a murder investigation involving a former flame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOlouL2rRsqO5MQmUj917qI5rM5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49503'),
  ('71124445335155506', 'A Dangerous Toy', 1979, 'Crime, Drama', 'Giuliano Montaldo, Ennio Guarnieri, Vera Pescarolo', 'Nino Manfredi, Sergio Donati, Giuliano Montaldo', 'Nino Manfredi, Marlène Jobert, Arnoldo Foà, Olga Karlatos, Vittorio Mezzogiorno, Pamela Villoresi, Carlo Bagno, Renato Scarpa', null, 'A meek accountant buys himself a gun and finds out he''s a natural marksman. After the friend who introduced him to shooting is killed by gangsters, he seeks revenge.', 'A meek accountant buys himself a gun and finds out he''s a natural marksman. After the friend who introduced him to shooting is killed by gangsters, he seeks revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2U7X3wUjNBhZic1mZbCOLpTrCOb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59156'),
  ('935482096587541438', 'A Dangerous Woman', 1993, 'Drama, Romance', 'Stephen Gyllenhaal, Robert Elswit, Jeff Rafner', 'Naomi Foner', 'Debra Winger, Barbara Hershey, Gabriel Byrne, David Strathairn, Chloe Webb, John Terry, Jan Hooks, Paul Dooley', 'R', 'Martha Horgan is a withdrawn, mentally disabled woman who lives with her aunt, Frances. One of Martha''s unusual traits is that she doesn''t lie, a quality that leads to her getting fired from a dry-cleaning shop thanks to the actions of the shifty Getso. Conflict seems to follow Martha, since she also becomes romantically involved with local fix-it man, Mackey, who is sleeping with Frances as well.', 'Martha Horgan is a withdrawn, mentally disabled woman who lives with her aunt, Frances. One of Martha''s unusual traits is that she doesn''t lie, a quality that leads to her getting fired from a dry-cleaning shop thanks to the actions of the shifty Getso. Conflict seems to follow Martha, since she also becomes romantically involved with local fix-it man, Mackey, who is sleeping with Frances as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wsRHmHgio3w5nR5W2brn5VQ2oe4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108021'),
  ('789767145101751236', 'A Dark Place', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Simon Fellows, Marcel Zyskind', 'Brendan Higgins', 'Andrew Scott, Bronagh Waugh, Denise Gough, Michael Rose, Sandra Ellis Lafferty, Christa Beth Campbell, Eric Mendenhall, Andrew Masset', 'NR', 'When a young boy turns up dead in a sleepy Pennsylvania town, a local sanitation truck driver, Donald, plays detective, embarking on a precarious and obsessive investigation to prove the boy was murdered.', 'When a young boy turns up dead in a sleepy Pennsylvania town, a local sanitation truck driver, Donald, plays detective, embarking on a precarious and obsessive investigation to prove the boy was murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7QqFn9UzuSnh1uOPeSfYL1MFjkB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412157'),
  ('997081152022404855', 'A Dark Song', 2016, 'Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Liam Gavin, Craig Kenny, Neil Guerin', 'Liam Gavin', 'Catherine Walker, Steve Oram, Mark Huberman, Susan Loughnane, Nathan Vos, Martina Nunvarova, Breffni O''Connor, Sheila Moloney', 'NR', 'A determined young woman and a damaged occultist risk their lives and souls to perform a dangerous ritual that will grant them what they want.', 'A determined young woman and a damaged occultist risk their lives and souls to perform a dangerous ritual that will grant them what they want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fguce8M1bZnWjVkRWCFh9P3kt6A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:409297'),
  ('511982329913852326', 'A Dark Story', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Leonardo D''Agostini, Michele Paradisi', 'Leonardo D''Agostini', 'Laetitia Casta, Andrea Carpenzano, Cristiana Dell''Anna, Lea Gavino, Mario Sgueglia, Giordano De Plano, Lidiya Liberman, Stefano Pesce', null, 'Vito and Carla have been separated for a long time, they have three children and used to love each other deeply before their love went sour. Now Vito has a new life and Carla has a partner. At a time when everyone feels tragedy can be avoided, fate is on their other side. One night, Vito disappeared. From that day on, no one ever heard from him again. His disappearance triggered an investigation involving all those involved. But is there really an irrefutable truth in these cases?', 'Vito and Carla have been separated for a long time, they have three children and used to love each other deeply before their love went sour. Now Vito has a new life and Carla has a partner. At a time when everyone feels tragedy can be avoided, fate is on their other side. One night, Vito disappeared. From that day on, no one ever heard from him again. His disappearance triggered an investigation involving all those involved. But is there really an irrefutable truth in these cases?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEMkV2Un6wy34y3UtRnzfE7yBOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200674'),
  ('625303300920499508', 'A Dark Truth', 2012, 'Action, Thriller', 'Lindsay King, Che Castellanos, Bruce Brenner', 'Damian Lee', 'Andy Garcia, Deborah Kara Unger, Eva Longoria, Forest Whitaker, Steven Bauer, Al Sapienza, Joel Harris, Lara Daans', 'R', 'In the jungles of Ecuador, blood taints the waters. A multinational conglomerate''s unholy alliance with a bloodthirsty military regime has resulted in a massacre. Only the rebel Francisco Franco and his determined wife Mia can prove the truth. To settle a personal debt, former CIA agent Jack Begosian takes on the freelance assignment to rescue Francisco and risks everything in a brutal battle to expose the cover-up.', 'In the jungles of Ecuador, blood taints the waters. A multinational conglomerate''s unholy alliance with a bloodthirsty military regime has resulted in a massacre. Only the rebel Francisco Franco and his determined wife Mia can prove the truth. To settle a personal debt, former CIA agent Jack Begosian takes on the freelance assignment to rescue Francisco and risks everything in a brutal battle to expose the cover-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/je93UwdBdhtHpp9YgaYGnJqnX8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138376'),
  ('658877343863359253', 'A Dark, Dark Man', 2020, 'Drama', 'Mariya Isitova, Kaysha Rakhimova, Ayagul Yerzhanova', 'Adilkhan Yerzhanov, Roelof Jan Minneboo', 'Daniyar Alshinov, Dinara Baktybayeva, Teoman Khos, Karim Kadyrbayev, Adema Yerzhanova, Yerken Gubashev, Nurbek Mukushev, Talgat Sydybekov', null, 'A boy is murdered in Kazakh village. Detective Bekzat wants to wrap up the inquiries quickly: after all, the perpetrator has already been found by local police officers. But when a journalist arrives from the city, everything falls to pieces. For the first time in his career, Bekzat must conduct a real investigation according to procedure.', 'A boy is murdered in Kazakh village. Detective Bekzat wants to wrap up the inquiries quickly: after all, the perpetrator has already been found by local police officers. But when a journalist arrives from the city, everything falls to pieces. For the first time in his career, Bekzat must conduct a real investigation according to procedure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOBtJaE5GEJbzKHq8lfi90SKU59.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:625046'),
  ('1058875672736649595', 'A Dash of Love', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Eric J. Goldstein, Shamess Shute, Chander Nag', null, 'Jen Lilley, Brendan Penny, Peri Gilpin, Kandyse McClure, Frances Flanagan, Eric Pollins, Antonio Cayonne, Benjamin Wilkinson', null, 'A young woman who dreams of opening her own restaurant lands a job at a prominent restaurant whose head chef becomes her unlikely ally when the restaurant''s unscrupulous owner, a Master Chef herself, plots to return the place to its former glory by presenting her new assistant''s recipes as her own.', 'A young woman who dreams of opening her own restaurant lands a job at a prominent restaurant whose head chef becomes her unlikely ally when the restaurant''s unscrupulous owner, a Master Chef herself, plots to return the place to its former glory by presenting her new assistant''s recipes as her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBuQPAO9RZmtrycr1n7ZI8ObsiH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437515'),
  ('132982397670175490', 'A Date for Mad Mary', 2016, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Darren Thornton, Ole Bratt Birkeland, Adrienne Greenhalgh', 'Colin Thornton, Darren Thornton', 'Seána Kerslake, Tara Lee, Charleigh Bailey, Denise McCormack, Siobhan Shanahan, Carolyn Bracken, Barbara Brennan, Stephen Cromwell', null, '"Mad" Mary McArdle returns to Drogheda after a short spell in prison for something she''d rather forget. Back home, everything and everyone has changed. Her best friend, Charlene, is about to get married and Mary is maid of honor. When Charlene refuses Mary a ''plus one'' on the grounds that she probably couldn''t find a date, Mary becomes determined to prove her wrong.', '"Mad" Mary McArdle returns to Drogheda after a short spell in prison for something she''d rather forget. Back home, everything and everyone has changed. Her best friend, Charlene, is about to get married and Mary is maid of honor. When Charlene refuses Mary a ''plus one'' on the grounds that she probably couldn''t find a date, Mary becomes determined to prove her wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAOkKIF8tJXdOOyHOIl6F8qDJgc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405473'),
  ('809317135877134429', 'A Date in Portland Street', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Zhang Zeming', 'John Chong, Zhang Zeming', 'Kelvin Wong Siu, Li Fengxu, To Yin-Gor', null, 'A couple from China, husband and wife, are estranged when the man relocates to Europe to pursue formal training in art. When they reunite some time later in Hong Kong during his summer vacation, they find that they''ve each grown emotionally, but in different ways. Will they be able to reconcile their differences?', 'A couple from China, husband and wife, are estranged when the man relocates to Europe to pursue formal training in art. When they reunite some time later in Hong Kong during his summer vacation, they find that they''ve each grown emotionally, but in different ways. Will they be able to reconcile their differences?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cqtKdOEgOTDTlE3rejTSritqCuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:695801'),
  ('670960682538762926', 'A Date to Skate', 1938, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer, Mae Questel', null, 'Popeye takes Olive roller skating in a rink. She''s never skated before, so he has to teach her, and she''s not a quick learner. Before long Olive ends up outside the rink, rolling wildly out of control.', 'Popeye takes Olive roller skating in a rink. She''s never skated before, so he has to teach her, and she''s not a quick learner. Before long Olive ends up outside the rink, rolling wildly out of control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jifc0WglHIC8Ui4eQqAMFOnr2Cl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205191'),
  ('776744576572036628', 'A Date with Judy', 1948, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, George Stoll, Stanley Donen', 'Dorothy Cooper, Dorothy Kingsley', 'Wallace Beery, Jane Powell, Elizabeth Taylor, Carmen Miranda, Xavier Cugat, Robert Stack, Scotty Beckett, Selena Royle', 'NR', 'Best friends Judy and Carol compete for the affection of an older man during their high school dance. As Carol tries to rekindle Judy''s relationship with Carol''s bumbling brother, Oogie, Judy suspects that her father is having an affair with a beautiful dance instructor. The two girls team up to expose Judy''s father -- who is only taking innocent dance lessons.', 'Best friends Judy and Carol compete for the affection of an older man during their high school dance. As Carol tries to rekindle Judy''s relationship with Carol''s bumbling brother, Oogie, Judy suspects that her father is having an affair with a beautiful dance instructor. The two girls team up to expose Judy''s father -- who is only taking innocent dance lessons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3xhQjcPwFwWzOVC0kDcPZb2QOMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96252'),
  ('95127617813570175', 'A Date with the Falcon', 1942, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Irving Reis, Robert De Grasse, William Dorfman', 'Frank Fenton, Lynn Root', 'George Sanders, Wendy Barrie, James Gleason, Allen Jenkins, Mona Maris, Fred Aldrich, Bobby Barber, Roxanne Barkley', 'NR', 'In the second film of the series (and not a second part of anything), Gay Lawrence, aka The Falcon, is about to depart the city to marry his fiancée, Helen Reed, when a mystery girl, Rita Mara, asks for his aid in disposing of a secret formula for making synthetic diamonds. He deliberately allows himself to be kidnapped by the gang for which Rita works. His aide, "Goldy" Locke, trails the kidnappers and brings the police. But the head of the gang escapes, and the Falcon continues the pursuit.', 'In the second film of the series (and not a second part of anything), Gay Lawrence, aka The Falcon, is about to depart the city to marry his fiancée, Helen Reed, when a mystery girl, Rita Mara, asks for his aid in disposing of a secret formula for making synthetic diamonds. He deliberately allows himself to be kidnapped by the gang for which Rita works. His aide, "Goldy" Locke, trails the kidnappers and brings the police. But the head of the gang escapes, and the Falcon continues the pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aK9a0wN4vAvKh9qLLxqtYsGgo2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43551'),
  ('391650848718499237', 'A Daughter', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ivano De Matteo, Giuseppe Maio, Armando Pizzuti', 'Ivano De Matteo, Valentina Ferlan', 'Stefano Accorsi, Ginevra Francesconi, Michela Cescon, Thony, Antonio Fornari, Barbara Chiesa, Beatrice Puccilli', null, 'A middle-aged man, Pietro, becomes a widower and must take care of his daughter. He will never have the time to delve into his own pain, committing himself to raising his daughter with love and dedication, in an all-encompassing relationship in which one heals the other''s wounds through his own. When, after a few years, he tries to start a new life with a new partner, not everything will go as hoped: his daughter''s reaction will be exaggerated and Pietro will be put to the test. He will find himself struggling between anger and paternal instinct.', 'A middle-aged man, Pietro, becomes a widower and must take care of his daughter. He will never have the time to delve into his own pain, committing himself to raising his daughter with love and dedication, in an all-encompassing relationship in which one heals the other''s wounds through his own. When, after a few years, he tries to start a new life with a new partner, not everything will go as hoped: his daughter''s reaction will be exaggerated and Pietro will be put to the test. He will find himself struggling between anger and paternal instinct.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRf1629G8Y5RiX10YuT29k8bpRA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1309584'),
  ('438032329594174521', 'A Daughter Of Destiny', 1928, 'Drama, Fantasy, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Henrik Galeen, Franz Planer', 'Henrik Galeen', 'Brigitte Helm, Paul Wegener, Iván Petrovich, Mia Pankau, Valeska Gert, Wolfgang Zilzer, Louis Ralph, Hans Trautner', null, 'Hanns Heinz Ewers'' grim science-fiction novel Alraune has already been filmed twice when this version was assembled in 1928. In another of his "mad doctor" roles, Paul Wegener plays Professor Brinken, sociopathic scientist who combines the genes of an executed murderer with those of a prostitute. The result is a beautiful young woman named Alraune (Brigitte Helm), who is incapable of feeling any real emotions -- least of all guilt or regret. Upon attaining adulthood, Alraune sets about to seduce and destroy every male who crosses her path. Ultimately, Professor Brinken is hoist on his own petard when he falls hopelessly in love with Alraune himself. Alraune was remade in 1930, with Brigitte Helm repeating her role, and again in 1951, with Hildegarde Knef as the "heroine" and Erich von Stroheim as her misguided mentor.', 'Hanns Heinz Ewers'' grim science-fiction novel Alraune has already been filmed twice when this version was assembled in 1928. In another of his "mad doctor" roles, Paul Wegener plays Professor Brinken, sociopathic scientist who combines the genes of an executed murderer with those of a prostitute. The result is a beautiful young woman named Alraune (Brigitte Helm), who is incapable of feeling any real emotions -- least of all guilt or regret. Upon attaining adulthood, Alraune sets about to seduce and destroy every male who crosses her path. Ultimately, Professor Brinken is hoist on his own petard when he falls hopelessly in love with Alraune himself. Alraune was remade in 1930, with Brigitte Helm repeating her role, and again in 1951, with Hildegarde Knef as the "heroine" and Erich von Stroheim as her misguided mentor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8AXrCFJ0BSTMx7tNy4ecu7xEvd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2969'),
  ('419697050183181563', 'A Day', 2017, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Kim Ji-yong, Cho Sun-ho, Lee Yang-jun', 'Cho Sun-ho', 'Kim Myung-min, Byun Yo-han, You Chea-myung, Jo Eun-hyung, Shin Hye-sun, Im Ji-gyu, Jang Dae-woong, Kim Ye-joon', null, 'Three years ago, a father saved his daughter''s life. After she''s involved in a car accident, it looks like he''ll have to do it again, no matter how many attempts it takes.', 'Three years ago, a father saved his daughter''s life. After she''s involved in a car accident, it looks like he''ll have to do it again, no matter how many attempts it takes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Tgtamqk3Kp9iwflrDWRRTjGjXB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459073'),
  ('463876644278767659', 'A Day and a Half', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Fares Fares, Marianne Bakke', 'Peter Smirnakos, Fares Fares', 'Alexej Manvelov, Alma Pöysti, Fares Fares, Stina Ekblad, Annika Hallin, Annica Liljeblad, Richard Forsgren, Daniel Guldstrand', 'R', 'In a desperate bid to reunite with his daughter, an armed man bursts into the medical center where his estranged wife works and kidnaps her.', 'In a desperate bid to reunite with his daughter, an armed man bursts into the medical center where his estranged wife works and kidnaps her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9xkkrxSY1t4FUtMKKFXalVo3cmt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978783'),
  ('139502427419107670', 'A Day at the Beach', 1970, 'Drama', 'Simon Hesera, Gilbert Taylor', 'Roman Polanski', 'Mark Burns, Beatie Edney, Peter Sellers, Graham Stark, Fiona Lewis, Jack MacGowran, Maurice Roëves, Joanna Dunham', null, 'Bernie is a silver tongued wanderer with a fondness for drink and no clear goal in life. What was supposed to be a day of fun at the seaside turns to dust as he drinks his way through a seaside resort community, trailing his little niece Winnie.', 'Bernie is a silver tongued wanderer with a fondness for drink and no clear goal in life. What was supposed to be a day of fun at the seaside turns to dust as he drinks his way through a seaside resort community, trailing his little niece Winnie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vFU48kwWXDOHEaLTr0JXYZGJonE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99802'),
  ('421415390961331695', 'A Day at the Museum', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Michel Ribes, Pascal Ridao', 'Jean-Michel Ribes', 'Michel Blanc, Victoria Abril, Pierre Arditi, Josiane Balasko, Jean-Damien Barbin, Urbain Cancelier, Isabelle Carré, Loïc Corbery', null, 'Un conservateur terrorisé par les plantes vertes, une mère plastifiée pour être exposée, un ballet de Saintes Vierges, des gardiens épuisés par Rodin, un ministre perdu dans une exposition de sexes, une voiture disparue au parking Rembrandt, des provinciaux amoureux des Impressionnistes, touristes galopins galopant d''une salle à l''autre, passager clandestin dans l''art premier, Picasso, Gauguin, Warhol, ils sont tous là dans ce petit monde qui ressemble au grand, dans ce musée pas si imaginaire que ça, valsant la comédie humaine jusqu''au burlesque.', 'Un conservateur terrorisé par les plantes vertes, une mère plastifiée pour être exposée, un ballet de Saintes Vierges, des gardiens épuisés par Rodin, un ministre perdu dans une exposition de sexes, une voiture disparue au parking Rembrandt, des provinciaux amoureux des Impressionnistes, touristes galopins galopant d''une salle à l''autre, passager clandestin dans l''art premier, Picasso, Gauguin, Warhol, ils sont tous là dans ce petit monde qui ressemble au grand, dans ce musée pas si imaginaire que ça, valsant la comédie humaine jusqu''au burlesque.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NUXp9JS3w7QxQzMZq1r7XZtLkf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18906'),
  ('571061999122197205', 'A Day at the Races', 1937, 'Comedy, Music', 'Sam Wood, Joseph Ruttenberg, Leonard Smith', 'Robert Pirosh, George Seaton, George Oppenheimer', 'Groucho Marx, Chico Marx, Harpo Marx, Allan Jones, Maureen O''Sullivan, Margaret Dumont, Sig Ruman, Leonard Ceeley', 'NR', 'Doctor Hugo Hackenbush, Tony, and Stuffy try and save Judy''s sanitarium by winning a big race with a finicky horse owned by Judy''s boyfriend Gil. There are a few problems. Hackenbush, who was recently put in charge of the sanitarium, isn''t really a doctor, he''s a veterinarian.', 'Doctor Hugo Hackenbush, Tony, and Stuffy try and save Judy''s sanitarium by winning a big race with a finicky horse owned by Judy''s boyfriend Gil. There are a few problems. Hackenbush, who was recently put in charge of the sanitarium, isn''t really a doctor, he''s a veterinarian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euRUaKhI73JusmSw9VFvUHtbL3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11939'),
  ('253735664195086445', 'A Day at the Zoo', 1939, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Tex Avery, Mel Blanc, Robert C. Bruce', null, 'A tour of the zoo, in typical Tex Avery style: a series of one-liners and sight gags, punctuated by Egghead teasing a lion at intervals, despite the admonishments of the narrator.', 'A tour of the zoo, in typical Tex Avery style: a series of one-liners and sight gags, punctuated by Egghead teasing a lion at intervals, despite the admonishments of the narrator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFpZbWVbEbKqN1uTeoTNUp2MKRZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:207421'),
  ('369297214782191328', 'A Day in a Life', 2021, 'Drama', 'Larry Clark, Jonathan Velasquez', 'Larry Clark, Jonathan Velasquez', 'Gabrielle Sonier, Enzo Camellini, Vincent Macaigne, Ana Neborac, Violette Edgard-Rosa, Jules Daguerressar, Victor Kamir', null, 'Paris. Gabrielle and Enzo, two teenagers from the same gang, meet in front of the school. Cigarettes, the affirmation of sexual desire and the discovery of new drugs punctuate their day. Each one, in his own way, celebrates or laments childhood that is slipping away.', 'Paris. Gabrielle and Enzo, two teenagers from the same gang, meet in front of the school. Cigarettes, the affirmation of sexual desire and the discovery of new drugs punctuate their day. Each one, in his own way, celebrates or laments childhood that is slipping away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFIASVXj9BkhQAo7vfiOk9hveCR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:804973'),
  ('150225119094822096', 'A Day in Barbagia', 1958, 'Documentary', 'Vittorio De Seta, Vittorio De Seta, Vera Gherarducci', 'Vittorio De Seta', null, null, 'Against the background of flocks of sheep at pasture, mules walking down unpaved roads, tractors in the fields, and isolated figures in a deserted village, a caption explains that Barbagia is a vast region in Sardinia; Orgosolo, Oliena and Mamoiada are villages of shepherds and the men spend most of the year far away, with their flocks. This is why the houses and the children are entrusted to the women, who cut the wood, work the fields and prepare bread, shepherds’ bread.', 'Against the background of flocks of sheep at pasture, mules walking down unpaved roads, tractors in the fields, and isolated figures in a deserted village, a caption explains that Barbagia is a vast region in Sardinia; Orgosolo, Oliena and Mamoiada are villages of shepherds and the men spend most of the year far away, with their flocks. This is why the houses and the children are entrusted to the women, who cut the wood, work the fields and prepare bread, shepherds’ bread.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEd28bl59G4eOelqWOxB3x60xbb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227289'),
  ('809810997135409339', 'A Day in Court', 1954, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Steno, Lucio Fulci, Paolo Heusch', 'Lucio Fulci, Steno, Giancarlo Viganotti', 'Peppino De Filippo, Silvana Pampanini, Alberto Sordi, Sophia Loren, Tania Weber, Leopoldo Trieste, Walter Chiari, Armenia Balducci', null, 'A day at an Italian trial court, where a magistrate judges a full array of peculiar petty crimes and characters.', 'A day at an Italian trial court, where a magistrate judges a full array of peculiar petty crimes and characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oIUivGL18V5DZbipgZ8zAxEKVac.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82113'),
  ('431576913676880750', 'A Day in the Country', 1946, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Jean Renoir, Claude Renoir, Jacques Becker', 'Jean Renoir', 'Sylvia Bataille, Jane Marken, Georges D''Arnoux, Jacques Brunius, André Gabriello, Gabrielle Fontan, Jean Renoir, Marguerite Renoir', null, 'The family of a Parisian shop-owner spends a day in the country. The daughter falls in love with a man at the inn, where they spend the day.', 'The family of a Parisian shop-owner spends a day in the country. The daughter falls in love with a man at the inn, where they spend the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r490HjrQJrYXJp1zkzbflwEIegT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43878'),
  ('1090714330993287141', 'A Day in the Death of Joe Egg', 1972, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Peter Medak, Ken Hodges', 'Peter Nichols', 'Alan Bates, Janet Suzman, Peter Bowles, Joan Hickson, Sheila Gish, Elizabeth Robillard, Murray Melvin, Constance Chapman', null, 'A couple uses extremely black comedy to survive taking care of a daughter who is nearly completely brain dead. They take turns doing the daughter''s voice and stare into the eyes of death and emotional trauma with a humour that hides their pain.', 'A couple uses extremely black comedy to survive taking care of a daughter who is nearly completely brain dead. They take turns doing the daughter''s voice and stare into the eyes of death and emotional trauma with a humour that hides their pain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmC76yweJHqKrc3FHij6IaJLvmi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106618'),
  ('1061016898500105697', 'A Day Late and a Dollar Short', 2014, 'Drama', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Shernold Edwards', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Ving Rhames, Mekhi Phifer, Tichina Arnold, Anika Noni Rose, Kimberly Elise, Vinessa Antoine, Asha Bromfield', null, 'When irascible matriarch Viola Price learns that her next asthma attack will likely kill her, she is determined to fix her fractured family before she leaves this world.', 'When irascible matriarch Viola Price learns that her next asthma attack will likely kill her, she is determined to fix her fractured family before she leaves this world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lrFImJ56Gd7bDoKmBrdRxZCuQvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266313'),
  ('396907177442579107', 'A Day of Fury', 1956, 'Western', 'Harmon Jones, Ellis W. Carter, Joseph E. Kenney', 'James Edmiston, Oscar Brodney', 'Dale Robertson, Mara Corday, Jock Mahoney, Carl Benton Reid, Jan Merlin, John Dehner, Dee Carroll, Sheila Bromley', 'NR', 'Town marshal Alan Burnett life is saved by a stranger he meets on the trail. His rescuer turns out to be Jagade, a gunslinger just returned after years away, who finds when he gets into town that he can''t abide the peace that has been settled between "his" people (i.e. the saloon-keepers, gamblers, etc.) and the righteous, "respectable" folk.', 'Town marshal Alan Burnett life is saved by a stranger he meets on the trail. His rescuer turns out to be Jagade, a gunslinger just returned after years away, who finds when he gets into town that he can''t abide the peace that has been settled between "his" people (i.e. the saloon-keepers, gamblers, etc.) and the righteous, "respectable" folk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss23X1FTS3zXc735tIkqBQTZ6TH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132930'),
  ('55553817371040610', 'A Day of Judgment', 1981, 'Horror', 'Charles Reynolds, Irl Dixon', 'Tom McIntyre', 'William T. Hicks, Harris Bloodworth, Brownlee Davis, Careyanne Sutton, Toby Wallace, Helene Tryon, Carlton Bortell, Larry Sprinkle', 'R', 'In a 1930s small town rife with lust, corruption and sin, a mysterious figure wielding a scythe arrives to cut an unholy swath of murder, madness, and moralizing that may lead straight to Hell.', 'In a 1930s small town rife with lust, corruption and sin, a mysterious figure wielding a scythe arrives to cut an unholy swath of murder, madness, and moralizing that may lead straight to Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7PSmB65UPv4sUDCcK9eLrFwVSEg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85187'),
  ('892705338292068593', 'A Day Off', 1968, 'Drama', 'Lee Man-hee, Lee Seok-gi, Seo Yu-jeok', 'Lee Man-hee', 'Shin Seong-il, Ji Yun-seong, Kim Sun-cheol, Kim Seong-ok, An Eun-suk, Kim Kyeong-ran, Kim Ki-beom, Kim Kwang-il', null, 'One Sunday, a penniless unmarried young South Korean couple meet, as they do every Sunday; while the pregnant young woman believes they are not ready to bring a child into the world, the young man decides to go visit his friends to borrow money for delivery.', 'One Sunday, a penniless unmarried young South Korean couple meet, as they do every Sunday; while the pregnant young woman believes they are not ready to bring a child into the world, the young man decides to go visit his friends to borrow money for delivery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5udZmgmpYi35HBKqjlbzwWJcryt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:267874'),
  ('994747227484317042', 'A Day to Die', 2022, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Kieran Gallagher, Michael Brouphy, Wes Miller', 'Scott Mallace, Rab Berry, Wes Miller', 'Kevin Dillon, Bruce Willis, Leon, Frank Grillo, Gianni Capaldi, Brooke Serene Butler, Johnny Messner, Vernon Davis', 'R', 'A disgraced parole officer is indebted to a local gang leader and forced to pull off a series of dangerous drug heists within twelve hours in order to pay the $2 million dollars he owes, rescue his kidnapped pregnant wife, and settle a score with the city''s corrupt police chief, who is working with the gang leader and double-crossed him years ago.', 'A disgraced parole officer is indebted to a local gang leader and forced to pull off a series of dangerous drug heists within twelve hours in order to pay the $2 million dollars he owes, rescue his kidnapped pregnant wife, and settle a score with the city''s corrupt police chief, who is working with the gang leader and double-crossed him years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Kce1utfytAG5m1PbtVoDzmDZJH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864116'),
  ('515492184840115437', 'A Day with the Boys', 1969, 'Drama', 'Clu Gulager, László Kovács', 'Clu Gulager', 'Mike Hertel, Jack Grindle, John McCaffrey, William Elliott, Craig Williams, Mark Spirtos, John Gulager, Artie Conkling', null, 'A group of elementary school boys goes for a walk on the outskirts of a big city. The ominous atmosphere of fun begins when they pull in a man they met by chance.', 'A group of elementary school boys goes for a walk on the outskirts of a big city. The ominous atmosphere of fun begins when they pull in a man they met by chance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PLgVyazA78dzWzC3cGWnGPo4IP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180963'),
  ('707254662698513481', 'A Day Without a Mexican', 2004, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Sergio Arau, Johnny Haddad, Penny Ludford', 'Yareli Arizmendi, Sergio Arau, Sergio Guerrero', 'Melinda Allen, Frankie J. Allison, Caroline Aaron, Yeniffer Behrens, Maria Beck, Eduardo Palomo, Elpidia Carrillo, Tony Abatemarco', 'R', 'When a mysterious fog surrounds the boundaries of California, there is a communication breakdown and all the Mexicans disappear, affecting the economy and the state stops working missing the Mexican workers and dwellers.', 'When a mysterious fog surrounds the boundaries of California, there is a communication breakdown and all the Mexicans disappear, affecting the economy and the state stops working missing the Mexican workers and dwellers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3vyKh5kdYw1attsNOX21Ru433Ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16427'),
  ('395349645530185219', 'A Day''s Pleasure', 1919, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Edna Purviance, Jackie Coogan, Babe London, Loyal Underwood, Jessalyn Van Trump, Tom Wilson, Toraichi Kono', 'NR', 'A father takes his family for an outing, which turns out to be a ridiculous trial.', 'A father takes his family for an outing, which turns out to be a ridiculous trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTkuRaOiDyDPg7W6XSE0OoMx39I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53425'),
  ('706263862305088525', 'A Dead Man Cannot Live', 2021, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Ezekiel Montes, Mónica Sánchez, Ezekiel Montes', 'Ezekiel Montes', 'Antonio Dechent, Rubén Ochandiano, Jesús Castro, Paco Tous, Nancho Novo, Juanma Lara, Roberto García Ruiz, Manolo Caro', null, 'Tano works for Manuel, a businessman who’s made his fortune in the construction sector and who has a tight network of friends in local government who help him carry out his business safely, in exchange for making sure that the drugs enter and leave the city without causing any violence or making any noise. Tano knows that the golden era is long gone. Now, he’s 54 and struggling to make ends meet. His mission is to keep the drug-trafficking business from Morocco under control and to make sure the money keeps flowing, but someone has brought some samples of a new drug into the city and its effects are devastating, causing the local junkies to go completely crazy. Angel, Manuel’s son and heir to his business empire, is convinced that if they start dealing this new drug, they could go back to making the millions they were before the economic crash.', 'Tano works for Manuel, a businessman who’s made his fortune in the construction sector and who has a tight network of friends in local government who help him carry out his business safely, in exchange for making sure that the drugs enter and leave the city without causing any violence or making any noise. Tano knows that the golden era is long gone. Now, he’s 54 and struggling to make ends meet. His mission is to keep the drug-trafficking business from Morocco under control and to make sure the money keeps flowing, but someone has brought some samples of a new drug into the city and its effects are devastating, causing the local junkies to go completely crazy. Angel, Manuel’s son and heir to his business empire, is convinced that if they start dealing this new drug, they could go back to making the millions they were before the economic crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bWk5O4DeSPHuiq9pjFk7TIb5nn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793156'),
  ('1087268702517482404', 'A Deadly Adoption', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Rachel Lee Goldenberg, Adam Silver, Matt McKinnon', 'Harper Steele', 'Will Ferrell, Kristen Wiig, Jessica Lowndes, Alyvia Alyn Lind, Jake Weary, Erik Palladino, Bryan Safi, Debra Christofferson', null, 'Things go awry when an author and his wife welcome a pregnant woman into their home, with plans to adopt her baby.', 'Things go awry when an author and his wife welcome a pregnant woman into their home, with plans to adopt her baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfMoNq0nYec5RImmCiW0Guj3Bcg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343921'),
  ('740138461885114304', 'A Deadly American Marriage', 2025, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Jessica Burgess, Jenny Popplewell', null, 'Jason Corbett, Jack Corbett Lynch, Sarah Corbett Lynch, Molly Martens Corbett, Tom Martens, Tracey Lynch, David Lynch, Wanda Thompson', 'R', 'A chilling 911 call. A gruesome scene. What really happened inside a family''s quiet suburban home? Murder or self-defense? Told from both sides, this documentary explores Jason Corbett''s brutal death.', 'A chilling 911 call. A gruesome scene. What really happened inside a family''s quiet suburban home? Murder or self-defense? Told from both sides, this documentary explores Jason Corbett''s brutal death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yzPpsg2HX6BcavbE43NzpgDig9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1466938'),
  ('255553094468791109', 'A Deadly Invitation', 2023, 'Comedy, Mystery', 'Fidel Cuevas, Julio Bárcenas, Edison Paz Trejo', 'Antón de Goenechea, Javier Durán Pérez', 'Regina Blandón, Maribel Verdú, Juan Pablo de Santiago, Manolo Cardona, Aarón Díaz, José María de Tavira, Juan Manuel Pernas, Stephanie Cayo', null, 'Eccentric millionaire Olivia sends her half sister Agatha, and a group of old acquaintances, a mysterious invitation for a weekend on her yacht, where they will discover the true motive behind this invitation: the celebration of… a murder?', 'Eccentric millionaire Olivia sends her half sister Agatha, and a group of old acquaintances, a mysterious invitation for a weekend on her yacht, where they will discover the true motive behind this invitation: the celebration of… a murder?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3DZN9QD2IDwG6YMuk0NvJRNbeJP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1179664'),
  ('811360081788527485', 'A Deadly Weekend', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Cătălin Dascălu', 'Ionut Rusu', 'Andreea Balan, Iuliana Beregoi, Cristian Porcari', null, 'Lia and Denis, a young and carefree couple, devise a plan to kill their boss. They go through a series of borderline situations, but with a lot of humor included, to carry out their criminal idea. But how do you stop a perfect plan once you''ve already set it in motion?', 'Lia and Denis, a young and carefree couple, devise a plan to kill their boss. They go through a series of borderline situations, but with a lot of humor included, to carry out their criminal idea. But how do you stop a perfect plan once you''ve already set it in motion?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlpVPvyCnOFYqhpuVm94BsDttTUZ.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-deadly-weekend'),
  ('355186613948647014', 'A Death in the Gunj', 2017, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Konkona Sen Sharma, Sirsha Ray', 'Konkona Sen Sharma', 'Vikrant Massey, Ranvir Shorey, Kalki Koechlin, Tillotama Shome, Gulshan Devaiah, Tanuja Samarth, Om Puri, Jim Sarbh', null, 'Life for a shy young Indian student slowly falls to pieces during a family road trip.', 'Life for a shy young Indian student slowly falls to pieces during a family road trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vXSnbVgCJpsa3xQV93ol94eiXV0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:408624'),
  ('723967747752023471', 'A Decade Under the Influence', 2003, 'Documentary', 'Ted Demme, Clyde W. Smith, Anthony Jannelli', null, 'Julie Christie, Sydney Pollack, Francis Ford Coppola, Robert Altman, Paul Schrader, Pam Grier, Polly Platt, Jon Voight', 'R', 'A documentary examining the decade of the 1970s as a turning point in American cinema. Some of today''s best filmmakers interview the influential directors of that time.', 'A documentary examining the decade of the 1970s as a turning point in American cinema. Some of today''s best filmmakers interview the influential directors of that time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzt9AkMIxm84IStnjU1hB4o3bWG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38868'),
  ('965125232245949228', 'A December Bride', 2016, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'David Winning', 'David Winning, Karen Berger', 'Daniel Lissing, Jessica Lowndes, April Telek, Karen Kruper, Pauline Egan, Casey Manderson, Keith MacKechnie, Jay Hindle', 'PG', 'Aspiring interior designer Layla is dreading the Christmastime wedding of her cousin who’s marrying Layla’s ex-fiancé. Although Seth is the one responsible for introducing the bride and groom, she begrudgingly accepts his offer to be her date as she’s out of options. Seth gets carried away at the reception and announces they’re engaged, forcing a mortified Layla to keep up the pretense.', 'Aspiring interior designer Layla is dreading the Christmastime wedding of her cousin who’s marrying Layla’s ex-fiancé. Although Seth is the one responsible for introducing the bride and groom, she begrudgingly accepts his offer to be her date as she’s out of options. Seth gets carried away at the reception and announces they’re engaged, forcing a mortified Layla to keep up the pretense.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSMbRlQkMrHyB71B4gA5oEK5Uh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427045'),
  ('52631417620970211', 'A Decent Man', 2016, 'Drama', 'Alexis Kavyrchine, Emmanuel Finkiel, Isabelle Dagnac', 'Emmanuel Finkiel, Julie Peyr', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Driss Ramdi, Mélanie Thierry, Maryne Cayon, Johann Soulé, Nicolas Bridet, Antoine Gouy, Maryne Bertieaux', null, 'Eddie is no longer living with his wife and their son Noam. One night, he gets mugged and badly injured, and consequently becomes a hero to his son and the victim of a vicious crime to his wife. But when Ahmed, the perfect scapegoat for the attack, is charged, the gravitas of his accusation sucks Eddie into an infernal spiral of self-doubt and lies, marking the start of a dangerous freefall.', 'Eddie is no longer living with his wife and their son Noam. One night, he gets mugged and badly injured, and consequently becomes a hero to his son and the victim of a vicious crime to his wife. But when Ahmed, the perfect scapegoat for the attack, is charged, the gravitas of his accusation sucks Eddie into an infernal spiral of self-doubt and lies, marking the start of a dangerous freefall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hdk4WveRRmzJS91RArYIoGwxRAr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366104'),
  ('645610539272806964', 'A Decent Woman', 2016, 'Drama', 'Lukas Valenta Rinner, Roman Kasseroller', 'Lukas Valenta Rinner, Ariel Gurevich, Martín Shanly', 'Iride Mockert, Ivo Colonna Olsen, Mariano Sayavedra, Pablo Seijo, Martín Shanly, Andrea Strenitz', null, 'A housemaid, working in an exclusive gated community in the outskirts of Buenos Aires, embarks on a journey of sexual and mental liberation in a nudist swinger-club boarding the high security walls.', 'A housemaid, working in an exclusive gated community in the outskirts of Buenos Aires, embarks on a journey of sexual and mental liberation in a nudist swinger-club boarding the high security walls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ei8hui2aB2vqVID3UxxAu4lulaI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411730'),
  ('508440071331410995', 'A Delicate Balance', 1973, 'Drama', 'David Watkin, Tony Richardson', 'Edward Albee', 'Katharine Hepburn, Paul Scofield, Lee Remick, Kate Reid, Joseph Cotten, Betsy Blair', 'PG', 'In their finely appointed Connecticut home, Agnes and Tobias have grown used to the imperfection and fragility of their marriage. Quietly nursing their grief over the death of their son, they get by well enough together. Agnes'' boozy sister wanders in and out, and they allow anxiety-stricken friends to move into an upstairs room. But, when their daughter, Julia, shows up announcing her fourth divorce, long-repressed emotions come to the surface.', 'In their finely appointed Connecticut home, Agnes and Tobias have grown used to the imperfection and fragility of their marriage. Quietly nursing their grief over the death of their son, they get by well enough together. Agnes'' boozy sister wanders in and out, and they allow anxiety-stricken friends to move into an upstairs room. But, when their daughter, Julia, shows up announcing her fourth divorce, long-repressed emotions come to the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGUzZ8DQAW4Je7W0xmRuLbzNYTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38729'),
