  ('496502809551016115', 'A Dickens of a Holiday!', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Ziller, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe, Mark Hefti', 'Brooke D''Orsay, Kristoffer Polaha, Max Archibald, Chad Willett, Nathan Lynn, Greg Rogers, Cheyenne Rouleau, Jovanna Huguet', 'G', 'To make the 100th anniversary of her hometown''s Victorian festival a success, Cassie invites action movie star and former high school classmate Jake to play Scrooge in A Christmas Carol.', 'To make the 100th anniversary of her hometown''s Victorian festival a success, Cassie invites action movie star and former high school classmate Jake to play Scrooge in A Christmas Carol.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqm52nuyi19lxFEHz4DCVsCmA6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877828'),
  ('595348709834100125', 'A Different Loyalty', 2004, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Marek Kanievska, Isabelle Guay, Jean Lépine', 'Jim Piddock', 'Sharon Stone, Rupert Everett, Julian Wadham, Michael Cochrane, Anne Lambton, Richard McMillan, Mimi Kuzyk, Emily VanCamp', null, 'In January 1963, British journalist Leo Cauffield suddenly disappears from his home in Beirut. His wife Sally knew that he was working part-time for British intelligence, but was not prepared to be told by the British embassy that they suspect he has defected to Communist Russia. As his wife puts together the pieces of the mysterious jigsaw of the past, tracking her passionate relationship with her husband and his history as former head of MI6’s counter-espionage section, her relentless search for the truth takes her to London, New York and finally Moscow.', 'In January 1963, British journalist Leo Cauffield suddenly disappears from his home in Beirut. His wife Sally knew that he was working part-time for British intelligence, but was not prepared to be told by the British embassy that they suspect he has defected to Communist Russia. As his wife puts together the pieces of the mysterious jigsaw of the past, tracking her passionate relationship with her husband and his history as former head of MI6’s counter-espionage section, her relentless search for the truth takes her to London, New York and finally Moscow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fbJwFcXT6tvIVHMzXmN7FnJgQxW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19180'),
