  ('161523428267717202', 'A Difficult Year', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache, Mélodie Preel', 'Éric Toledano, Olivier Nakache', 'Pio Marmaï, Jonathan Cohen, Noémie Merlant, Mathieu Amalric, Grégoire Leprince-Ringuet, Luàna Bajrami, Sandrine Briard, Oussama Kheddam', null, 'Compulsive spenders Albert and Bruno are in debt up to their necks. While seeking help from community workers to get their lives back on track, they run into a group of young green activists. Lured by the free beer and snacks rather than by the ideals of eco-activists, Albert and Bruno find themselves joining the movement without much conviction.', 'Compulsive spenders Albert and Bruno are in debt up to their necks. While seeking help from community workers to get their lives back on track, they run into a group of young green activists. Lured by the free beer and snacks rather than by the ideals of eco-activists, Albert and Bruno find themselves joining the movement without much conviction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teTTgwreGDfroU1A6VJWqoUpJBt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965791'),
  ('1125817574467292211', 'A Dinner Date', 1981, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mohamed Khan, Mostafa Gamal Eldein, Mohsen Nasr', 'Bashir El Deek', 'Soad Hosny, Ahmed Zaki, Hussein Fahmy, Ragaa Al-Giddawy, Zouzou Mady, Khairy Beshara, Marwa ElKhatib, Hafez Amin', null, 'This movie revolves around the story of an innocent girl (Nawal) who was married to a rich and possessive man who still wants her back after their divorce; however she meets a hair stylist (Shoukry) and falls in love with him. They get married but her first husband starts torturing Shoukry so he can leave Nawal but he refuses. Eventually, acts of revenge begins from both Nawal and her ex-husband.', 'This movie revolves around the story of an innocent girl (Nawal) who was married to a rich and possessive man who still wants her back after their divorce; however she meets a hair stylist (Shoukry) and falls in love with him. They get married but her first husband starts torturing Shoukry so he can leave Nawal but he refuses. Eventually, acts of revenge begins from both Nawal and her ex-husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n57kpuqyPB5ltUIOFYuTE0wZobd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258778'),
