  ('57260704454814406', 'A Dirty Story', 1977, 'Documentary, Comedy, Drama', 'Jean Eustache, Jacques Renard, Pierre Lhomme', null, 'Michael Lonsdale, Laurie Zimmer, Jean-Noël Picq, Douchka, Laura Fanning, Jean Douchet, Virginie Thévenet, Josée Yanne', null, 'A group of friends listen as one man tells them a story about a time when, in a small cafe, he discovered a peephole into the ladies'' bathroom and became addicted to looking through it at female genitals. They ask him questions and come to conclusions about sex. This is a filmed, scripted version. Then, the actual person who this happened to relates the same story; this time, however, it is an unscripted documentary, in which the same things occur as in the scripted one.', 'A group of friends listen as one man tells them a story about a time when, in a small cafe, he discovered a peephole into the ladies'' bathroom and became addicted to looking through it at female genitals. They ask him questions and come to conclusions about sex. This is a filmed, scripted version. Then, the actual person who this happened to relates the same story; this time, however, it is an unscripted documentary, in which the same things occur as in the scripted one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fNuUYOyUDuMvfyHLkvCtjnquUlJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117488'),
