  ('481334886276033630', 'À double tour', 1959, 'Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Claude Chabrol, Henri Decaë', null, 'Madeleine Robinson, Antonella Lualdi, Jean-Paul Belmondo, Jeanne Valérie, Jacques Dacqmine, Bernadette Lafont, André Jocelyn, László Szabó', null, 'The mistress of the wealthy Henri Marcoux is murdered and the family accuses the milkman of committing the crime. But Marcoux''s daughter''s fiancé suspects that she may have been murdered by someone else.', 'The mistress of the wealthy Henri Marcoux is murdered and the family accuses the milkman of committing the crime. But Marcoux''s daughter''s fiancé suspects that she may have been murdered by someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/87jBHEVRI0GyYvD5avFpWPPKTtR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45348'),
  ('544875242665021693', 'A Dragonfly for Each Corpse', 1975, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller, Horror', 'León Klimovsky, Zacarías Urbiola, Miguel Fernández Mila', null, 'Paul Naschy, María Kosty, Erika Blanc, Ángel Aranda, Ricardo Merino, Susana Mayo, Eduardo Calvo, Mariano Vidal Molina', null, 'A killer is cleaning up the streets of Milan by murdering those considered as deviant. An ornamental dragonfly, soaked in the blood of the victim, is left on each body.', 'A killer is cleaning up the streets of Milan by murdering those considered as deviant. An ornamental dragonfly, soaked in the blood of the victim, is left on each body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hJEbP5mZry0lXBe8iJntwe4FWqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27393'),
  ('762794511200125670', 'A Drama of Jealousy (and other things)', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Giorgio Scotton, Ettore Scola, Carlo Di Palma', 'Agenore Incrocci, Furio Scarpelli, Ettore Scola', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Monica Vitti, Giancarlo Giannini, Manuel Zarzo, Marisa Merlini, Juan Diego, Fernando Sánchez Polack, Hércules Cortés', null, 'Construction worker Oreste and young fiancee Adelaide meet Nello, a cook in a pizzeria. This love triangle often goes to communist rallies, and enjoys the filthy beaches of Ostia. Will the hostile environment pave a way to jealousy?', 'Construction worker Oreste and young fiancee Adelaide meet Nello, a cook in a pizzeria. This love triangle often goes to communist rallies, and enjoys the filthy beaches of Ostia. Will the hostile environment pave a way to jealousy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFVREOJXd010ngszEkA7smK778n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56366'),
  ('1127737700409600927', 'A Dramatic Film', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Claire Mathon, Eric Baudelaire, Alan Guichaoua', null, 'Anida Ait Abdesselam, David Pop, Fatimata Sarr', null, 'Artist and filmmaker Eric Baudelaire spent four years interacting with the pupils of a film class, at a secondary school in the Parisian suburb of Saint-Denis. Keeping himself on the sidelines, he gives way to the children to express their thoughts and dreams. Their remarks are intuitive, inquisitive, yet passionate and surprisingly mature, concerning rocky and complicated issues, ranging from racism, immigration, and identity, all the way to the possibilities of film as a medium. As time flows almost unnoticed, it is evident that these children have not only become the co-directors of this film but also the heroes of their own lives.', 'Artist and filmmaker Eric Baudelaire spent four years interacting with the pupils of a film class, at a secondary school in the Parisian suburb of Saint-Denis. Keeping himself on the sidelines, he gives way to the children to express their thoughts and dreams. Their remarks are intuitive, inquisitive, yet passionate and surprisingly mature, concerning rocky and complicated issues, ranging from racism, immigration, and identity, all the way to the possibilities of film as a medium. As time flows almost unnoticed, it is evident that these children have not only become the co-directors of this film but also the heroes of their own lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fFj0XMUa565E5vdRrZqnr0CWaZF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617102'),
  ('1138459135110871881', 'A Dream House Nightmare', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Federico Zampaglione, Arnaldo Catinari, Inti Carboni', 'Federico Zampaglione, Rudolph Gentile', 'Claudia Gerini, Luca Lionello, Emilio De Marchi, Anna Marcello, Ernesto Mahieux, Yari Gugliucci, Cinzia Leone, Max Giusti', 'PG-13', 'A couple''s pleasant new life in the country is threatened by the mysterious new next door neighbors.', 'A couple''s pleasant new life in the country is threatened by the mysterious new next door neighbors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHyJtsjP4KLIBamMgQf8pR959aM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52074'),
  ('556707861514408562', 'A Dream of Christmas', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Gary Yates, Paul Suderman, Suzan Derkson', 'Gary Yates', 'Nikki DeLoach, Andrew W. Walker, Lisa Durupt, Cindy Williams, Zoe Fish', null, 'When a restless young married woman is granted a wish by a Christmas Angel to be single again, she soon discovers her new life isn''t what she bargained for, and embarks on a quest to win her husband back.', 'When a restless young married woman is granted a wish by a Christmas Angel to be single again, she soon discovers her new life isn''t what she bargained for, and embarks on a quest to win her husband back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zArq5FAPcaMPe1xv6b0ZmDEyK9a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421761'),
  ('962929207597255546', 'A Dream Walking', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dave Fleischer, Seymour Kneitel', null, 'William ''Billy'' Costello, William Pennell, Mae Questel', null, 'Popeye and Bluto each wants to save Olive as she sleepwalks onto a construction site. But most of their efforts go into preventing each other from being the hero.', 'Popeye and Bluto each wants to save Olive as she sleepwalks onto a construction site. But most of their efforts go into preventing each other from being the hero.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ilti4UfNdy1kTfuCjpfpuPHr7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174270'),
  ('930949081461068720', 'A Driver for Vera', 2004, 'Drama', 'Pavel Chukhray, Igor Klebanov, Nikolay Podzemelny', 'Pavel Chukhray', 'Igor Petrenko, Alyona Babenko, Bohdan Stupka, Andrei Panin, Marina Golub, Valeriy Barinov, Alisa Grebenshchikova, Natalya Gudkova', null, 'The film is set during 1962 in Sevastopol, Crimea, then a secret Navy Base in the Soviet Union. General Serov hires Viktor, a cadet from the Kremlin Guard to work as his private chauffeur. In a jet-black "ZIM" limo, Viktor is chauffeuring the General''s disabled daughter Vera. Viktor is oblivious to the hidden agenda of the KGB agent Saveliev, who manipulates everyone behind the scenes in the old rivalry between the Army and KGB.', 'The film is set during 1962 in Sevastopol, Crimea, then a secret Navy Base in the Soviet Union. General Serov hires Viktor, a cadet from the Kremlin Guard to work as his private chauffeur. In a jet-black "ZIM" limo, Viktor is chauffeuring the General''s disabled daughter Vera. Viktor is oblivious to the hidden agenda of the KGB agent Saveliev, who manipulates everyone behind the scenes in the old rivalry between the Army and KGB.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mDjCHnnZrFSbDXc1ogdzmMZ0h2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64483'),
  ('940974875281896642', 'A Drop of Gold', 2013, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Christophe Peladan', 'Christophe Peladan', null, null, 'As a pirate enters the Kingdom of the Dead he encounters its beautiful Queen. She captures his heart, but hers is not so easily won.', 'As a pirate enters the Kingdom of the Dead he encounters its beautiful Queen. She captures his heart, but hers is not so easily won.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXQwVdmJBW5mvtds1pYsOb5n0A9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366919'),
  ('386263909175222180', 'A Dry White Season', 1989, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Euzhan Palcy, Kelvin Pike, Alan Tomkins', 'Colin Welland, Euzhan Palcy', 'Donald Sutherland, Janet Suzman, Zakes Mokae, Jürgen Prochnow, Susan Sarandon, Marlon Brando, Winston Ntshona, Thoko Ntshinga', 'R', 'During the 1976 Soweto uprising, a white school teacher''s life and values are threatened when he asks questions about the death of a young black boy who died in police custody.', 'During the 1976 Soweto uprising, a white school teacher''s life and values are threatened when he asks questions about the death of a young black boy who died in police custody.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Wx9oZ7WUoootNLv70EDq6nyDqW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32075'),
  ('551879173880926973', 'A Ducking They Did Go', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Andrew Bennison', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Lynton Brent, Jack Gardner, Bud Jamison, Cy Schindell, Vernon Dent', 'NR', 'The stooges, tricked by some con men into selling memberships to a phony duck hunting club, sell all the memberships to the police department. When the crooks skip town, the stooges are stranded at a duck-less lake with a lodge full of cops.', 'The stooges, tricked by some con men into selling memberships to a phony duck hunting club, sell all the memberships to the police department. When the crooks skip town, the stooges are stranded at a duck-less lake with a lodge full of cops.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc2z9hHjl8efX7PKuC8rNJUj1ww.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50207'),
  ('458701809863004557', 'A Dysfunctional Cat', 2018, 'Drama', 'Susan Gordanshekan, Julian Krubasik', 'Susan Gordanshekan', 'Pegah Ferydoni, Hadi Khanjanpour, Henrike von Kuick, Constantin von Jascheroff, Arash Marandi, Kianoosh Sadigh, Anton Algrang, Marzieh Alivirdi', null, 'Mina’s family has introduced her to few potential husbands in Iran. She has rejected them all until she meets Kian, a surgeon who has travelled from Germany in search of a wife.', 'Mina’s family has introduced her to few potential husbands in Iran. She has rejected them all until she meets Kian, a surgeon who has travelled from Germany in search of a wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/36Al2b6suzfdqukVP9FCZXVUScT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:498052'),
  ('714772196683213393', 'A E I O U – A Quick Alphabet of Love', 2022, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Nicolette Krebitz, Claudia Beewen, Reinhold Vorschneider', 'Nicolette Krebitz', 'Sophie Rois, Milan Herms, Udo Kier, Nicolas Bridet, Lilith Stangenberg, Adrien Lamande, Oskar Melzer, Laura Tonke', null, 'Anna is 60 and her acting heyday is now behind her. She lives on her own but has a friend and confidant in her downstairs neighbour Michel, who is also single. Reluctantly, Anna accepts a job as a language coach for 17-year-old Adrian who has a speech impediment and is something of a misfit. She recognises him as the boy who recently snatched her handbag in the street.', 'Anna is 60 and her acting heyday is now behind her. She lives on her own but has a friend and confidant in her downstairs neighbour Michel, who is also single. Reluctantly, Anna accepts a job as a language coach for 17-year-old Adrian who has a speech impediment and is something of a misfit. She recognises him as the boy who recently snatched her handbag in the street.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2vDlbs0hYiQKAqzVW2MpsVBIy7W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:928709'),
  ('366105654094597012', 'A Esperança É a Última que Morre', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Calvito Leal, Gustavo Hadba, Daniel Lentini', 'Eduardo Albuquerque, Patrícia Andrade, José de Carvalho', 'Dani Calabresa, Danton Mello, Rodrigo Sant''anna, Katiuscia Canoro, Augusto Madeira, Adriana Garambone, Thelmo Fernandes, Mary Sheila', null, 'Hortência is a dedicated, dreamy TV reporter, who hopes to stop doing boring reports and become an anchor of the local news. When she learns that the newspaper''s anchor is about to be fired, she is excited about the big opportunity, but Vanessa also wants the job. Needing to find a way to secure her new post, Hortência invents a serial killer and starts "investigating" the case.', 'Hortência is a dedicated, dreamy TV reporter, who hopes to stop doing boring reports and become an anchor of the local news. When she learns that the newspaper''s anchor is about to be fired, she is excited about the big opportunity, but Vanessa also wants the job. Needing to find a way to secure her new post, Hortência invents a serial killer and starts "investigating" the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkmYjmADOIn6knfYZUebn0zqqw1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227964'),
  ('645186974972034374', 'A Esperança Está Onde Menos Se Espera', 2009, null, 'Joaquim Leitão', 'Manuel Arouca, Tino Navarro', 'Alcides, Alex, Angi Almeida, Vanessa Almeida, Jorge Chança, Humberto Bernardo, Sandra Alves, Alexandra Amaro', null, 'Lourenço is the son of Francisco Figueiredo, a soccer coach in the beginning of a very promising career. Everything goes well: Francisco''s team is in the Portuguese Cup final and Lourenço is going to be class valedictorian in a very prestigious private high school. But everything starts to collapse. Francisco is fired and Lourenço must transfer to a public high school whose students are predominantly from a ghetto near Lisbon. While Lourenço is fighting to fit into a new and harsh reality, he also helps his father find his lost dignity. Hope is a strange place.', 'Lourenço is the son of Francisco Figueiredo, a soccer coach in the beginning of a very promising career. Everything goes well: Francisco''s team is in the Portuguese Cup final and Lourenço is going to be class valedictorian in a very prestigious private high school. But everything starts to collapse. Francisco is fired and Lourenço must transfer to a public high school whose students are predominantly from a ghetto near Lisbon. While Lourenço is fighting to fit into a new and harsh reality, he also helps his father find his lost dignity. Hope is a strange place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VszNKSGTe2VK9twfo3aRzBzwaa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105745'),
  ('921831380313470038', 'A Fabled Holiday', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ruby J. Munro, Brian Whittred', 'E.S. Dolan Dix', 'Brooke D''Orsay, Ryan Paevey, Jake Guy, Daphne Hoskins, Rochelle Greenwood, John Prowse, Benjamin Jacobson, Carmel Amit', 'G', 'Talia and her childhood best friend Anderson unexpectedly reunite in a curiously familiar looking town full of Christmas spirit that restores its visitors when they need it most.', 'Talia and her childhood best friend Anderson unexpectedly reunite in a curiously familiar looking town full of Christmas spirit that restores its visitors when they need it most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oB84nCDF6vxdgSxlmvyFfEqZ9SS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028548'),
  ('847804574021653225', 'A Face in the Crowd', 1957, 'Drama', 'Elia Kazan, Gayne Rescher, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Budd Schulberg', 'Andy Griffith, Patricia Neal, Anthony Franciosa, Walter Matthau, Lee Remick, Percy Waram, Paul McGrath, Rod Brasfield', 'NR', 'The rise of a raucous hayseed named Lonesome Rhodes from itinerant Ozark guitar picker to local media rabble-rouser to TV superstar and political king-maker. Marcia Jeffries is the innocent Sarah Lawrence girl who discovers the great man in a back-country jail and is the first to fall under his spell.', 'The rise of a raucous hayseed named Lonesome Rhodes from itinerant Ozark guitar picker to local media rabble-rouser to TV superstar and political king-maker. Marcia Jeffries is the innocent Sarah Lawrence girl who discovers the great man in a back-country jail and is the first to fall under his spell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dkl9CDynHbIHDkIiPzKPFqnwFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21849'),
  ('20718032381053389', 'A Face to Die For', 1996, 'Drama', 'Jack Bender, Eagle Egilsson', 'Duane Poole', 'Yasmine Bleeth, James Wilder, Robin Givens, Richard Beymer, Ricky Paull Goldin, Chandra West, Mitchell Ryan, Mary Ellen Trainor', null, 'A scarred, unattractive young woman is conned into helping with a robbery of her employer. As a result, she is sent to prison, gets plastic surgery, and returns to seek revenge on those who wronged her.', 'A scarred, unattractive young woman is conned into helping with a robbery of her employer. As a result, she is sent to prison, gets plastic surgery, and returns to seek revenge on those who wronged her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwSCboQrfRvOTo0NvkYppnxI7gI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23416'),
  ('199641290946100920', 'A Fairly Odd Christmas', 2013, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Savage Steve Holland', null, 'Drake Bell, Daniella Monet, David James Lewis, Daran Norris, Teryl Rothery, Devyn Dalton, Tony Cox, Donavon Stinson', 'G', 'After Timmy Turner causes Santa amnesia he must become the new Santa in order to save Christmas.', 'After Timmy Turner causes Santa amnesia he must become the new Santa in order to save Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3ipMyRyXv5WKUXxYWNNqkeHTEO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146712'),
  ('399356237877428836', 'A Fairly Odd Movie: Grow Up, Timmy Turner!', 2011, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Savage Steve Holland, Jon Joffin, Ken Rabehl', 'Butch Hartman, Scott Fellows', 'Drake Bell, Daniella Monet, Tara Strong, Jason Alexander, Daran Norris, Cheryl Hines, Susanne Blakeslee, Teryl Rothery', null, 'The television movie is set in the city of Dimmsdale and centers on the series'' main protagonist Timmy Turner with his fairy godparents Cosmo and Wanda and his fairy godbrother Poof. In the movie, Timmy is now 23 years old but is still in fifth grade with his fairy-obsessed fifth grade teacher Mr. Crocker. Despite being grown up, Timmy finds a loophole in the fairy rulebook Da Rules: if he continues to act like a kid, he will still get to keep his fairies. However, the dilemma rises when Tootie, who was once a dorky girl when she was 10 years old, returns to Dimmsdale as an attractive woman. Timmy falls in love with her, a sign that he is growing up to an adult, which means he is closer to losing his fairies. Meanwhile, an oil business tycoon named Hugh J. Magnate, Jr., who teams up with Mr. Crocker, plans to use Timmy''s fairies'' magic in order to promote his oil business.', 'The television movie is set in the city of Dimmsdale and centers on the series'' main protagonist Timmy Turner with his fairy godparents Cosmo and Wanda and his fairy godbrother Poof. In the movie, Timmy is now 23 years old but is still in fifth grade with his fairy-obsessed fifth grade teacher Mr. Crocker. Despite being grown up, Timmy finds a loophole in the fairy rulebook Da Rules: if he continues to act like a kid, he will still get to keep his fairies. However, the dilemma rises when Tootie, who was once a dorky girl when she was 10 years old, returns to Dimmsdale as an attractive woman. Timmy falls in love with her, a sign that he is growing up to an adult, which means he is closer to losing his fairies. Meanwhile, an oil business tycoon named Hugh J. Magnate, Jr., who teams up with Mr. Crocker, plans to use Timmy''s fairies'' magic in order to promote his oil business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h94rbv7xBNJUgweD5pMK7cpqwMO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70338'),
  ('927483720414265886', 'A Fairly Odd Summer', 2014, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Savage Steve Holland, Thomas M. Harting', null, 'Drake Bell, Daniella Monet, Tara Strong, Scott Baio, Susanne Blakeslee, Daran Norris, Teryl Rothery, Ali Liebert', 'G', 'Get ready for the oddest summer yet! Timmy Turner and his fairies are going on a summer vacation to Hawaii. But, unfortunately for Timmy, something tells us this won’t be a very relaxing holiday. With all the magic in Fairy World at stake and villains like Vicky , Foop and Crocker on his tail, there’s no way he’ll be able to enjoy himself…', 'Get ready for the oddest summer yet! Timmy Turner and his fairies are going on a summer vacation to Hawaii. But, unfortunately for Timmy, something tells us this won’t be a very relaxing holiday. With all the magic in Fairy World at stake and villains like Vicky , Foop and Crocker on his tail, there’s no way he’ll be able to enjoy himself…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tqBWqnFJnbCqDDjOsGREeiAPf0E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:282728'),
  ('933336642638502590', 'A Fairy Tale After All', 2022, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Family', 'Erik Peter Carlson', 'Erik Peter Carlson', 'Emily Shenaut, Brian Hull, Bridget Winder, Timothy N. Kopacz, Lucie Jones, Anna Brisbin, Gabriel Burrafato, Chelsi Hardcastle', null, 'A stubborn teenage girl finds herself confronted by whimsical characters when she is transported into a world of fantasy and fairy tales while attending a school marionette show.', 'A stubborn teenage girl finds herself confronted by whimsical characters when she is transported into a world of fantasy and fairy tales while attending a school marionette show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uXq56XNfgRgBdCW65K6goiMUr3o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:830027'),
  ('1105204482384472204', 'A Fairy Tale Wedding', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Melidoni, Giuseppe Tedeschi', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina, Edoardo Falcone', 'Stefania Rocca, Emilio Solfrizzi, Adriano Giannini, Giorgio Pasotti, Ricky Memphis, Paola Minaccioni, Max Tortora, Luca Angeletti', null, 'After twenty years, five high school classmates meet again at Daniele''s wedding, the only one who has built a career for himself. During a long weekend in Switzerland, the five friends rediscover the affection and complicity of the past, and they get a chance to straighten out their destinies. A whirlwind of misunderstandings will bring down their shaky balances, and they''ll all find the courage to put themselves on the line and start their lives afresh', 'After twenty years, five high school classmates meet again at Daniele''s wedding, the only one who has built a career for himself. During a long weekend in Switzerland, the five friends rediscover the affection and complicity of the past, and they get a chance to straighten out their destinies. A whirlwind of misunderstandings will bring down their shaky balances, and they''ll all find the courage to put themselves on the line and start their lives afresh', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4qhQL8DgUArAK21PrtjAS4N1F8Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264001'),
  ('947028265931412007', 'A Faithful Man', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Louis Garrel, Irina Lubtchansky, Valérie Roucher', 'Louis Garrel, Jean-Claude Carrière, Florence Seyvos', 'Louis Garrel, Laetitia Casta, Lily-Rose Depp, Joseph Engel, Dali Benssalah, Diane Courseille, Vladislav Galard, Bakary Sangaré', null, 'Marianne leaves Abel for Paul, his best friend and the father of her unborn child. Eight years later, Paul dies and Marianne returns to Abel. However, things have changed for the both of them and feelings of jealousy surround their new relationship.', 'Marianne leaves Abel for Paul, his best friend and the father of her unborn child. Eight years later, Paul dies and Marianne returns to Abel. However, things have changed for the both of them and feelings of jealousy surround their new relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3alEKg6RcMnUF8r7OAJFYYMY9AH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:529784'),
  ('973896739491922585', 'A Fall from Grace', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Derrick Doose, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Crystal R. Fox, Phylicia Rashād, Bresha Webb, Mehcad Brooks, Cicely Tyson, Tyler Perry, Donovan Christie Jr., Walter Fauntleroy', 'NR', 'When a law-abiding woman gets indicted for murdering her husband, her lawyer soon realizes that a larger conspiracy may be at work.', 'When a law-abiding woman gets indicted for murdering her husband, her lawyer soon realizes that a larger conspiracy may be at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h47JJZ015VF4neia33AFwTU37Yb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:651070'),
  ('634109583414449548', 'A Family', 2004, 'Drama, Family', 'Lee Jeong-chul, Choi Sang-muk, Lee Sung-jae', 'Lee Jeong-chul', 'Soo Ae, Joo Hyun, Park Ji-bin, Park Hee-soon, Uhm Tae-woong, Jeon Kuk-hwan, Kim Se-dong', null, 'A pickpocket Jeong-eun comes back home after being in prison for 2 years. Her family consists of her father, Joo-suk, who lost one of his eyesight and 8-year-old brother. Joo-suk loves his daughter but he is very reluctant to show it. Joo-suk is worried about Jeong-eun being close with the local gangster - Chang-won and makes a deal with him that ends in tragedy?', 'A pickpocket Jeong-eun comes back home after being in prison for 2 years. Her family consists of her father, Joo-suk, who lost one of his eyesight and 8-year-old brother. Joo-suk loves his daughter but he is very reluctant to show it. Joo-suk is worried about Jeong-eun being close with the local gangster - Chang-won and makes a deal with him that ends in tragedy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wdP3QmETTMeOC1s4XeIXskh778n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55313'),
  ('354728719289829660', 'A Family', 2017, 'Drama', 'Levi Riso, Piero Basso, Orazio Sagone', 'Stefano Grasso, Levi Riso, Andrea Cedrola', 'Micaela Ramazzotti, Patrick Bruel, Pippo Delbono, Fortunato Cerlino, Marco Leonardi, Matilda De Angelis, Ennio Fantastichini, Sebastian Gimelli Morosini', null, 'Vincent was born near Paris, but has cut off every link with his roots. Maria, fifteen years younger, grew up in Ostia, but no longer sees her family. Together they form a couple that does not seem to need anyone. They lead a secluded life in contemporary Rome, indolent and distracted. Furthermore, Vincent and Maria are good at blending in with their environment. When they return home, they make love with the passion of young lovers in a suburban apartment that she has carefully furnished. Yet, on closer inspection, their everyday life betrays what lies behind their seemingly normal appearance: a project carried out by him with a clear determination and accepted by her only by virtue of unconditional love. A plan to help couples who cannot have children. Maria decides that it is time to create a real family. This choice has an inevitable consequence: the rebellion against Vincent, the man of her life.', 'Vincent was born near Paris, but has cut off every link with his roots. Maria, fifteen years younger, grew up in Ostia, but no longer sees her family. Together they form a couple that does not seem to need anyone. They lead a secluded life in contemporary Rome, indolent and distracted. Furthermore, Vincent and Maria are good at blending in with their environment. When they return home, they make love with the passion of young lovers in a suburban apartment that she has carefully furnished. Yet, on closer inspection, their everyday life betrays what lies behind their seemingly normal appearance: a project carried out by him with a clear determination and accepted by her only by virtue of unconditional love. A plan to help couples who cannot have children. Maria decides that it is time to create a real family. This choice has an inevitable consequence: the rebellion against Vincent, the man of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94S1RcilGRqlYQoYMaHnkcf2Hrg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:460060'),
  ('176910705890039109', 'A Family', 2021, 'Crime, Drama', 'Michihito Fujii, Keisuke Imamura, Gen Osaka', 'Michihito Fujii', 'Go Ayano, Hiroshi Tachi, Machiko Ono, Yukiya Kitamura, Hayato Ichihara, Hayato Isomura, Shinobu Terajima, Ryutaro Ninomiya', 'R', 'Taken in by the yakuza at a young age, Kenji swears allegiance to his old-school boss, pledging to adhere to the family code amid ever-changing times.', 'Taken in by the yakuza at a young age, Kenji swears allegiance to his old-school boss, pledging to adhere to the family code amid ever-changing times.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tglfGYH372S7Pft0hUyYLsO8M2B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:736146'),
  ('147492395996355859', 'A Family', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Christine Angot, Caroline Champetier, Inês Tagarin', 'Christine Angot', 'Christine Angot', null, 'Award-winning French writer Christine Angot goes on a business trip to Strasbourg where her father lived before dying several years ago. It is the city where she met him for the first time at the age of 13, and where he sexually abused her over the following years. His wife and children still live there. Angot takes a camera and knocks on the doors of her family to push them to clarify their attitudes to her father’s crime that stretched over so many years. A cinematographic journey that challenges social norms and family perspectives in dealing with incest.', 'Award-winning French writer Christine Angot goes on a business trip to Strasbourg where her father lived before dying several years ago. It is the city where she met him for the first time at the age of 13, and where he sexually abused her over the following years. His wife and children still live there. Angot takes a camera and knocks on the doors of her family to push them to clarify their attitudes to her father’s crime that stretched over so many years. A cinematographic journey that challenges social norms and family perspectives in dealing with incest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHAAyDoy3RjoEOPblq7n0SuWpLY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201056'),
  ('834996427134697139', 'A Family', 2026, 'Drama', 'Mees Peijnenburg, Jasper Wolf', 'Mees Peijnenburg, Bastiaan Kroeger', 'Pieter Embrechts, Finn Vogels, Celeste Holsheimer, Carice van Houten', null, 'Caught in the crossfire of their parents’ divorce, Nina and Eli are torn between loyalty, anger and a longing to be seen. Through their mirrored perspectives the same story unfolds, revealing how love can fracture and still find its way.', 'Caught in the crossfire of their parents’ divorce, Nina and Eli are torn between loyalty, anger and a longing to be seen. Through their mirrored perspectives the same story unfolds, revealing how love can fracture and still find its way.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaO5uVJzFRv7soqJR5nSyT8Q8HYO.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-family-2026'),
  ('352449616527490299', 'A Family Affair', 1937, 'Comedy', 'John S. Detlie, Edwin B. Willis, Douglas Shearer', 'Kay Van Riper', 'Lionel Barrymore, Cecilia Parker, Eric Linden, Mickey Rooney, Charley Grapewin, Spring Byington, Julie Haydon, Sara Haden', 'NR', 'Judge Hardy faces problems at work and at home. Powerful men in town are upset with his decisions and want to see him impeached; his daughters, Joan and Marion, have romantic problems; and his son, Andy discovers Polly Benedict. As usual, Judge Hardy is concerned with everyone in the family and lends wisdom and calmness to all.', 'Judge Hardy faces problems at work and at home. Powerful men in town are upset with his decisions and want to see him impeached; his daughters, Joan and Marion, have romantic problems; and his son, Andy discovers Polly Benedict. As usual, Judge Hardy is concerned with everyone in the family and lends wisdom and calmness to all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u3MxoeLXlnPX6xQNL5QVXn24Pjp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155751'),
  ('510028211786975185', 'A Family Affair', 1984, 'Drama', 'Dean Shek Tin', 'Lee Chun', 'Sam Hui, Olivia Cheng Man-Nga, Dean Shek Tin, Melvin Wong, Bin Bin, Helen Chan Nga-Han, Jenny Tseng, Yu Miu-Lin', null, 'To get their parents back together, two clever siblings team up with their grandpa in a series of mischievous antics.', 'To get their parents back together, two clever siblings team up with their grandpa in a series of mischievous antics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGxtZfSTQm4vW1xOZwyHO0WALpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449349'),
  ('1120238404905133836', 'A Family Affair', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Richard LaGravenese, Don Burgess', 'Carrie Solomon', 'Nicole Kidman, Zac Efron, Joey King, Kathy Bates, Liza Koshy, Wes Jetton, Ian Gregg, Sarah Baskin', 'PG-13', 'The only thing worse than being the assistant to a high-maintenance movie star who doesn''t take you seriously? Finding out he''s smitten with your mom.', 'The only thing worse than being the assistant to a high-maintenance movie star who doesn''t take you seriously? Finding out he''s smitten with your mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0CaVyqnTsWwNd4hWsrLNEk1Wjd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:987686'),
  ('371794581898836037', 'A Family Like Many Others', 1949, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Galindo, Zacarías Gómez Urquiza, José Ortiz Ramos', 'Alejandro Galindo', 'Fernando Soler, David Silva, Martha Roth, Eugenia Galindo, Felipe de Alba, Isabel del Puerto, Alma Delia Fuentes, Carlos Riquelme', null, 'The dynamics of a typical middle-class family are shaken up after the introduction of an enthusiastic door-to-door vacuum salesman.', 'The dynamics of a typical middle-class family are shaken up after the introduction of an enthusiastic door-to-door vacuum salesman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8YGRZGsMK7ydbpcJ8PpnL7PFomq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115107'),
  ('293597688427969915', 'A Family Man', 2016, 'Drama', 'Pierre Henry, Penny Charter, Aleksandra Marinkovich', 'Bill Dubuque', 'Gerard Butler, Gretchen Mol, Maxwell Jenkins, Alison Brie, Anupam Kher, Willem Dafoe, Alfred Molina, David Koechner', 'R', 'Dane Jensen is a driven, Chicago-based headhunter, working at a cut-throat job placement firm. When his boss pits Dane against Lynn Vogel, Dane''s equally driven but polar-opposite rival at the firm, in a battle for control over the company. When his young son is then given a harrowing diagnosis, Dane is suddenly pulled between achieving his professional dream and spending time with the family that needs him now more than ever.', 'Dane Jensen is a driven, Chicago-based headhunter, working at a cut-throat job placement firm. When his boss pits Dane against Lynn Vogel, Dane''s equally driven but polar-opposite rival at the firm, in a battle for control over the company. When his young son is then given a harrowing diagnosis, Dane is suddenly pulled between achieving his professional dream and spending time with the family that needs him now more than ever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCUrI8v523NQDJNKoDxGq2nvbvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375183'),
  ('567172066302394702', 'A Family Submerged', 2018, 'Drama', 'Victoria Comune, María Alché, Hélène Louvart', 'María Alché', 'Mercedes Morán, Laura López Moyano, Federico Sack, Ia Arteta, Marcelo Subiotto, Laila Maltz, Osqui Ferrero, Manuela Martínez', null, 'Marcela’s world becomes strange and unfamiliar after her sister Rina dies. She feels lost in her own house, and her relationship with her husband and children seems to suffer. But when Nacho, a young friend of her daughter’s, unexpectedly drops by, she starts to talk and walk with him. Gradually Marcela begins to have conversations with relatives from another dimension.', 'Marcela’s world becomes strange and unfamiliar after her sister Rina dies. She feels lost in her own house, and her relationship with her husband and children seems to suffer. But when Nacho, a young friend of her daughter’s, unexpectedly drops by, she starts to talk and walk with him. Gradually Marcela begins to have conversations with relatives from another dimension.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9wGnDlfJ0Ta8656O7Grg5tWuYUj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537869'),
  ('471499408582372503', 'A Family Thing', 1996, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Richard Pearce, Craig Huston, Aiman A. Humaideh', 'Billy Bob Thornton, Tom Epperson', 'Robert Duvall, James Earl Jones, Michael Beach, Irma P. Hall, Grace Zabriskie, Regina Taylor, David Keith, Xander Berkeley', 'PG-13', 'Earl Pilcher Jr. runs an equipment rental outfit in Arkansas, lives with his wife and kids and parents, and rarely takes off his gimme cap. His mother dies, leaving a letter explaining he''s not her natural son, but the son of a Black woman who died in childbirth; plus, he has a half brother Ray, in Chicago, she wants him to visit. Earl makes the trip, initially receiving a cold welcome from Ray and Ray''s son, Virgil. His birth mother''s sister, Aunt T., an aged and blind matriarch, takes Earl in tow and insists that the family open up to him.', 'Earl Pilcher Jr. runs an equipment rental outfit in Arkansas, lives with his wife and kids and parents, and rarely takes off his gimme cap. His mother dies, leaving a letter explaining he''s not her natural son, but the son of a Black woman who died in childbirth; plus, he has a half brother Ray, in Chicago, she wants him to visit. Earl makes the trip, initially receiving a cold welcome from Ray and Ray''s son, Virgil. His birth mother''s sister, Aunt T., an aged and blind matriarch, takes Earl in tow and insists that the family open up to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1IHxwmguaeytGo6m0wZaS0s3fP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41852'),
  ('993794078366018204', 'A Family Tour', 2018, 'Drama', 'Ying Liang, Ryuji Otsuka', 'Shan Peng, Ying Liang, Chan Wai', 'Gong Zhe, Nai An, Pete Teo, Tham Xin Yue, Shan Peng, Siao-Bai Yu, Joe Cheung Tung-Cho, Lin Chih-ju', null, 'A mainland Chinese filmmaker, exiled to Hong Kong for her politically-charged work, reunites with her mother on a trip to Taiwan.', 'A mainland Chinese filmmaker, exiled to Hong Kong for her politically-charged work, reunites with her mother on a trip to Taiwan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edh2y22bd9yetkV1bKXgaE53GQn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536541'),
  ('116202539879533638', 'A Family''s Secret', 2022, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'Penelope Buitenhuis, Christoph Benfey, Lauren Vesterdal', 'David Goulet', 'Maia Alvina, Stuart Constable, Ayan Elmi, Zaahira Joseph, Piret Jõgeda, Louise Lambert, Ann MacDonald, Robert Notman', null, 'While trying to save up for nursing school, Ana takes a remote post as a personal care worker for a wealthy woman with early onset dementia. But as she grows close to her new client, Joan, Ana becomes concerned that Joan''s spoiled daughter, Carla, is trying to murder her to get her hands on her inheritance. Ana strikes up a romance with Joan''s other adult child, Jason, who assures her Carla doesn''t mean any harm, but Ana comes to realize he''s deceiving her as well. Can Ana protect Joan, or will she get caught in the crossfire?', 'While trying to save up for nursing school, Ana takes a remote post as a personal care worker for a wealthy woman with early onset dementia. But as she grows close to her new client, Joan, Ana becomes concerned that Joan''s spoiled daughter, Carla, is trying to murder her to get her hands on her inheritance. Ana strikes up a romance with Joan''s other adult child, Jason, who assures her Carla doesn''t mean any harm, but Ana comes to realize he''s deceiving her as well. Can Ana protect Joan, or will she get caught in the crossfire?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2cQV3RzYRanfLQH3XLA2hNuj2or.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1044885'),
  ('1111824254463148591', 'A Fan''s Guide to Ms. Marvel', 2022, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Iman Vellani, Sana Amanat, Kevin Feige, Adil El Arbi, Bilall Fallah, Matt Lintz, Meera Menon, Sharmeen Obaid-Chinoy', 'PG', 'A documentary short that gives you an exclusive look behind the groundbreaking original series, "Ms. Marvel", from its comic book origins to its development and production as Marvel Studios’ next hit series on Disney+. It features interviews with its award winning filmmaking team and the show’s captivating star, newcomer Iman Vellani.', 'A documentary short that gives you an exclusive look behind the groundbreaking original series, "Ms. Marvel", from its comic book origins to its development and production as Marvel Studios’ next hit series on Disney+. It features interviews with its award winning filmmaking team and the show’s captivating star, newcomer Iman Vellani.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aolMYjs6QWonQFlnRGvU3o5zeQH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979160'),
  ('808967602879438750', 'A Fantastic Back and Forth', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Emanuele Imbucci, Federico Boldrini Parravicini', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Paolo Genovese', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Serena Autieri, Maurizio Battista, Marco Marzocca, Marianna Di Martino, Chiara Mastalli, Giuseppe Maggio, David Sef', null, 'Middle-aged family man Arnaldo is kicked out by his wife because of a misunderstanding. Instead of despairing, Arnaldo takes advantage of the situation to turn around his unsatisfying adult life by going to live in a flat shared with four university students.', 'Middle-aged family man Arnaldo is kicked out by his wife because of a misunderstanding. Instead of despairing, Arnaldo takes advantage of the situation to turn around his unsatisfying adult life by going to live in a flat shared with four university students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUAabAY6cPvFDbtZ5tD8WJjvpQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243442'),
  ('964853091710043790', 'A Fantastic Fear of Everything', 2012, 'Comedy, Thriller, Horror', 'Crispian Mills, Simon Chaudoir, Chris Hopewell', 'Crispian Mills', 'Simon Pegg, Paul Freeman, Clare Higgins, Amara Karan, Alan Drake, Michael Feast, Mo Idriss, Elliot Greene', 'R', 'Jack is a children''s author turned crime novelist whose detailed research into the lives of Victorian serial killers has turned him into a paranoid wreck, persecuted by the irrational fear of being murdered. When Jack is thrown a life-line by his long-suffering agent and a mysterious Hollywood executive takes a sudden and inexplicable interest in his script, what should be his big break rapidly turns into his big breakdown, as Jack is forced to confront his worst demons; among them his love life, his laundry and the origin of all fear.', 'Jack is a children''s author turned crime novelist whose detailed research into the lives of Victorian serial killers has turned him into a paranoid wreck, persecuted by the irrational fear of being murdered. When Jack is thrown a life-line by his long-suffering agent and a mysterious Hollywood executive takes a sudden and inexplicable interest in his script, what should be his big break rapidly turns into his big breakdown, as Jack is forced to confront his worst demons; among them his love life, his laundry and the origin of all fear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMZyKSo8b47VW1h2zjjGUZIefV1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101519'),
  ('490415705536779079', 'A Fantastic Woman', 2017, 'Drama', 'Sebastián Lelio, Benjamín Echazarreta, Daniel Matesanz', 'Sebastián Lelio, Gonzalo Maza', 'Daniela Vega, Francisco Reyes, Luis Gnecco, Aline Küppenheim, Nicolás Saavedra, Amparo Noguera, Néstor Cantillana, Alejandro Goic', 'R', 'Marina''s life is thrown into turmoil following the death of her partner. Mourning the loss of the man she loved, she finds herself under intense scrutiny from those with no regard for her privacy.', 'Marina''s life is thrown into turmoil following the death of her partner. Mourning the loss of the man she loved, she finds herself under intense scrutiny from those with no regard for her privacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2yNruMR8bAJOIQ3wd7HR9qWjW3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:429191'),
  ('685120106699527547', 'A Fantastical Meal', 1900, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Georges Méliès', null, 'Georges Méliès', null, 'A family sits down to enjoy a meal that ends up being fraught with complications.', 'A family sits down to enjoy a meal that ends up being fraught with complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xrsNTX1R1dFeneKLTZt5iBqbwYE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106808'),
  ('549382414648786963', 'A Far Off Place', 1993, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Mikael Salomon, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Jennifer Allen', 'Robert Caswell, Jonathan Hensleigh, Sally Robinson', 'Reese Witherspoon, Ethan Embry, Jack Thompson, Sarel Bok, Robert John Burke, Patricia Kalember, Daniel Gerroll, Maximilian Schell', 'PG', 'Thrown together under incredible circumstances, two strangers must discover courage and strength when they begin a journey across the treacherous African desert! Equipped only with their wits and the expertise of a native bushman who befriends them, they are determined to triumph over impossible odds and reach their destination. But along the way, the trio face a primitive desert wilderness.', 'Thrown together under incredible circumstances, two strangers must discover courage and strength when they begin a journey across the treacherous African desert! Equipped only with their wits and the expertise of a native bushman who befriends them, they are determined to triumph over impossible odds and reach their destination. But along the way, the trio face a primitive desert wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uVTs2cUYgeGkdiPoszBOjFXqvNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24736'),
  ('149241242287282870', 'A Farewell to Arms', 1932, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Frank Borzage, Charles Lang, Lew Borzage', 'Benjamin Glazer, Oliver H.P. Garrett', 'Helen Hayes, Gary Cooper, Adolphe Menjou, Mary Philips, Jack La Rue, Blanche Friderici, Mary Forbes, Gilbert Emery', 'NR', 'A tale of the World War I love affair, begun in Italy, between American ambulance driver Lt. Frederic Henry and British nurse Catherine Barkley. Eventually separated by Frederic''s transfer, tremendous challenges and difficult decisions face each as the war rages on.', 'A tale of the World War I love affair, begun in Italy, between American ambulance driver Lt. Frederic Henry and British nurse Catherine Barkley. Eventually separated by Frederic''s transfer, tremendous challenges and difficult decisions face each as the war rages on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eNmPByGZJqlp60nCZRhsAlVAb3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22649'),
