  ('995736491265840370', 'A Farewell to Memory', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Nicolás Prividera', 'Nicolás Prividera', 'Nicolás Prividera', null, 'A father who has lost his memory. A son looking for home movies that his father filmed. And among them, the impossible memory of the missing mother', 'A father who has lost his memory. A son looking for home movies that his father filmed. And among them, the impossible memory of the missing mother', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ay3QCgGHdGukpChKqbPqsHnTZEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763673'),
