  ('895702469127583099', 'A Farmer in Montfaucon', 1968, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Éric Rohmer, Néstor Almendros', null, 'Monique Sendron', null, 'In just a few simple lines, a picture of the French countryside in the 1960s: the last moments of a disappearing, changing world. The simplest documentary images are there to make us aware of the raison d’être of agriculture, harvesting the fruits of a cyclical and repetitive nature.', 'In just a few simple lines, a picture of the French countryside in the 1960s: the last moments of a disappearing, changing world. The simplest documentary images are there to make us aware of the raison d’être of agriculture, harvesting the fruits of a cyclical and repetitive nature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/io3f3kktgnmdFxnwVF1peZeJ6nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323974'),
  ('814855620748848840', 'A Father''s Choice', 2000, 'Drama', 'Christopher Cain', 'Richard Leder', 'Peter Strauss, Mary McDonnell, Michelle Trachtenberg, Yvonne Zima, Susan Hogan, Roger Cross, Eddie Velez, J. Winston Carroll', null, 'The fast-paced city life of two sisters is turned upside down when they are sent to live in the country with their father after their mother is killed.', 'The fast-paced city life of two sisters is turned upside down when they are sent to live in the country with their father after their mother is killed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tz0vajDKqlp6DBIng3wEnwUyTy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206053'),
  ('16217676686976785', 'A Father''s Legacy', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jason Mac', 'Jason Mac', 'Tobin Bell, Jason Mac, Gregory Alan Williams, Rebeca Robles, Michael Aaron Milligan, Kurt Yue, Isaiah Stratton, Alphie Hyorth', null, 'On the run and bleeding a young man ends up at a pond house where he meets an old man (Tobin Bell) and holds him hostage in his own home. As the days pass and the secrets about their past are revealed, they learn that they might not have been looking for each other...but they may have been brought together for a reason.', 'On the run and bleeding a young man ends up at a pond house where he meets an old man (Tobin Bell) and holds him hostage in his own home. As the days pass and the secrets about their past are revealed, they learn that they might not have been looking for each other...but they may have been brought together for a reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVH01Dm84Nam5q15tIdIaA3LcYi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:603170'),
  ('308752647186987259', 'A Father''s Miracle', 2025, 'Drama', 'Ana Lorena Pérez Ríos, Paulo Perez, Paulina Hernandez', 'Patricio Saiz', 'Omar Chaparro, Mariana Calderón, Natalia Reyes, Gustavo Sánchez Parra, Jorge A. Jimenez, Sofía Álvarez, Juan Pablo de Santiago, Marco Antonio Treviño', null, 'After being falsely accused of a terrible crime, Hector, a man with a neurological disability, goes to a secret prison. His goodness conquers the prisoners, who plan to prove their innocence.', 'After being falsely accused of a terrible crime, Hector, a man with a neurological disability, goes to a secret prison. His goodness conquers the prisoners, who plan to prove their innocence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heC13pt4SV7y3HF5lWNzf0u729j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1600028'),
