  ('379570249117141625', 'A Female Employee''s Taste', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Choi Woo-seong', null, 'Lee Soo, Ha Jin, Seo Won, Lee Jae-sik, Jang In-hyuk, Min Do-yoon, Sang Woo', null, 'Chief Park imagines going wild with Ga-hee while she thinks he''s weird. One day, Chief Park leaves early and she has sex with Woo-jin, a colleague she''s secretly seeing. A while later, Chief Park opens the door...', 'Chief Park imagines going wild with Ga-hee while she thinks he''s weird. One day, Chief Park leaves early and she has sex with Woo-jin, a colleague she''s secretly seeing. A while later, Chief Park opens the door...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sf5l6ZsSgzgxZ3IicFfkOXp8AZy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554447'),
  ('506546965525377251', 'A Feral World', 2020, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'David Liban, Jessica McGaugh', 'David Liban', 'Caleb Liban, Danielle Prall, Vivienne Bersin, Timothy McCracken, Kaden Hinkle', null, 'An orphaned boy in a post-apocalyptic world, meets a grieving woman who is trying to find her lost daughter. Their journey leads them face-to-face with a despot who may have the daughter held captive.', 'An orphaned boy in a post-apocalyptic world, meets a grieving woman who is trying to find her lost daughter. Their journey leads them face-to-face with a despot who may have the daughter held captive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sUiHLQrIeEjExIqhn4sFNxDvY6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:680295'),
  ('493240904845757050', 'A Few Best Men', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Stephan Elliott, Stephen F. Windon', 'Dean Craig', 'Xavier Samuel, Kris Marshall, Kevin Bishop, Tim Draxl, Laura Brent, Olivia Newton-John, Rebel Wilson, Solveig Walking', null, 'A groom and his three best men travel to the Australian outback for a wedding.', 'A groom and his three best men travel to the Australian outback for a wedding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4GUeDoAykxWNOLe5yah7AQQa6c9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85435'),
  ('559987674730002464', 'A Few Days in September', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Santiago Amigorena, Christophe Beaucarne', 'Santiago Amigorena', 'Juliette Binoche, John Turturro, Sara Forestier, Tom Riley, Nick Nolte, Mathieu Demy, Saïd Amadis, Magne-Håvard Brekke', null, '1 September 2001. Elliot, an American C.I.A. agent holding top secret information on the immediate future of the world, disappears. His sole aim was to meet his daughter Orlando, whom he abandoned ten years before. Irène, a French agent who used to work with him, and David, his adoptive son, will help him and lead the girl to her father. Chased by William Pound, a strangely poetic psycho, they will defy the dangers of international espionage from Paris to Venice and finally get to Elliot on 11 September 2001.', '1 September 2001. Elliot, an American C.I.A. agent holding top secret information on the immediate future of the world, disappears. His sole aim was to meet his daughter Orlando, whom he abandoned ten years before. Irène, a French agent who used to work with him, and David, his adoptive son, will help him and lead the girl to her father. Chased by William Pound, a strangely poetic psycho, they will defy the dangers of international espionage from Paris to Venice and finally get to Elliot on 11 September 2001.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VoTZBbfHTu2Mp9ELkVk3H0p9by.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38848'),
  ('788203218729426126', 'A Few Days with Me', 1988, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean-François Robin, Claude Sautet', 'Claude Sautet, Jacques Fieschi, Jérôme Tonnerre', 'Daniel Auteuil, Sandrine Bonnaire, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Dominique Lavanant, Danielle Darrieux, Vincent Lindon, Thérèse Liotard, Gérard Ismaël', 'PG-13', 'After being discharged from a mental institution, a man is tasked by his mother to revive a struggling supermarket in Limoges. He must navigate unexpected responsibilities and the challenges of managing the store''s staff.', 'After being discharged from a mental institution, a man is tasked by his mother to revive a struggling supermarket in Limoges. He must navigate unexpected responsibilities and the challenges of managing the store''s staff.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDSVwVnXZGlI5g8RbqMWb36jOf2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2025'),
  ('246234322856129233', 'A Few Dollars for Django', 1966, 'Western', 'León Klimovsky, Mariano Canales, Enzo G. Castellari', 'Tito Carpi, Manuel Sebares', 'Anthony Steffen, Frank Wolff, Gloria Fernán Osuna, Ennio Girolami, Joe Kamel, José Luis Lluch, Tomás Zalde, Alfonso Rojas', null, 'Django, bounty killer, hunter and repentant bandit wants to start a new life. No more bullets and blood, after years of killing and horror. Django wants to replace the sherrif and restore law and order to lawless land, but faces the history and bloodshed of his own past. Helped by the love of the daughter of a bandit Django can finally bring his life of violence to and end and spend his days in peace... If he can live that long!', 'Django, bounty killer, hunter and repentant bandit wants to start a new life. No more bullets and blood, after years of killing and horror. Django wants to replace the sherrif and restore law and order to lawless land, but faces the history and bloodshed of his own past. Helped by the love of the daughter of a bandit Django can finally bring his life of violence to and end and spend his days in peace... If he can live that long!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pg6vE9KAcF5wBJrOZmwxGa4w3CD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129577'),
  ('521777268354899862', 'A Few Good Men', 1992, 'Drama', 'Robert Richardson, Rob Reiner, Gary B. Kibbe', 'Aaron Sorkin', 'Tom Cruise, Jack Nicholson, Demi Moore, Kevin Bacon, Kiefer Sutherland, Kevin Pollak, James Marshall, J.T. Walsh', 'R', 'When cocky military lawyer Lt. Daniel Kaffee and his co-counsel, Lt. Cmdr. JoAnne Galloway, are assigned to a murder case, they uncover a hazing ritual that could implicate high-ranking officials such as shady Col. Nathan Jessep.', 'When cocky military lawyer Lt. Daniel Kaffee and his co-counsel, Lt. Cmdr. JoAnne Galloway, are assigned to a murder case, they uncover a hazing ritual that could implicate high-ranking officials such as shady Col. Nathan Jessep.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLOk4z9zL1tTukIYV56P94aZXKk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:881'),
  ('23144880466121924', 'A Few Hours of Spring', 2012, 'Drama', 'Stéphane Brizé, Antoine Héberlé', 'Florence Vignon, Stéphane Brizé', 'Vincent Lindon, Hélène Vincent, Emmanuelle Seigner, Olivier Perrier, Sylvie Jobert, Ludovic Berthillot, Silvia Kahn, Jean-Luc Borgeat', null, 'Forty-eight-year-old Alain Evrard is obliged to return home to live with his mother. This situation causes all the violence of their past relationship to rise to the surface. Alain then discovers that his mother has a fatal illness. In the last months of her life, will they finally be capable of taking a step toward each other?', 'Forty-eight-year-old Alain Evrard is obliged to return home to live with his mother. This situation causes all the violence of their past relationship to rise to the surface. Alain then discovers that his mother has a fatal illness. In the last months of her life, will they finally be capable of taking a step toward each other?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dXOy8sUDdgatIvkpYk1eYNiin3E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121702'),
  ('593467508914934595', 'A Few Less Men', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Mark Lamprell', 'Dean Craig', 'Xavier Samuel, Kris Marshall, Kevin Bishop, Sacha Horler, James Helm, Alison Van Reelen, Ryan Corr, Elizabeth Caiacob', null, 'Travel plans for three men go horribly wrong with a race against time to return Luke home.', 'Travel plans for three men go horribly wrong with a race against time to return Luke home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1FR3KCSLB6b9WMrZPir0JioMvcQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413391'),
  ('925289589975915364', 'A Field in England', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Laurie Rose, Ben Wheatley, James Sharpe', 'Amy Jump, Ben Wheatley', 'Reece Shearsmith, Michael Smiley, Richard Glover, Peter Ferdinando, Ryan Pope, Julian Barratt, Laura Obiols, Sara Dee', 'NR', 'During the Civil War in 17th-Century England, a small group of deserters flee from a raging battle through an overgrown field. They are captured by an alchemist, who forces the group to aid him in his search to find a hidden treasure that he believes is buried in the field. Crossing a vast mushroom circle, which provides their first meal, the group quickly descend into a chaos of arguments, fighting and paranoia, and, as it becomes clear that the treasure might be something other than gold, they slowly become victim to the terrifying energies trapped inside the field.', 'During the Civil War in 17th-Century England, a small group of deserters flee from a raging battle through an overgrown field. They are captured by an alchemist, who forces the group to aid him in his search to find a hidden treasure that he believes is buried in the field. Crossing a vast mushroom circle, which provides their first meal, the group quickly descend into a chaos of arguments, fighting and paranoia, and, as it becomes clear that the treasure might be something other than gold, they slowly become victim to the terrifying energies trapped inside the field.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKhMJr8yoHVyvxyUiAeIn2hKVdL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179111'),
  ('568836985116485188', 'A Film Like Any Other', 1968, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Jean-Luc Godard, William Lubtchansky', 'Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'NR', 'An analysis of the social upheaval of May 1968, made in the immediate wake of the workers’ and students’ protests. The picture consists of two parts, each with with identical image tracks, and differing narration.', 'An analysis of the social upheaval of May 1968, made in the immediate wake of the workers’ and students’ protests. The picture consists of two parts, each with with identical image tracks, and differing narration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2boHuRxuALzSJxMzd0eQFdDp63Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47617'),
  ('669604937738936188', 'A Film with Me in It', 2008, 'Comedy, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ian Fitzgibbon, Seamus Deasy', 'Mark Doherty', 'Dylan Moran, Mark Doherty, Amy Huberman, Keith Allen, Aisling O''Sullivan, David O''Doherty, Neil Jordan, Jonathan Rhys Meyers', 'NR', 'A dissolute scriptwriter and a dejected actor become unwittingly drawn into a labyrinthine mess when several people experience bizarre accidental deaths in their flat. Though the men didn''t deliberately cause any of the incidents, they fear that they will be unfairly pegged as murderers if they relay information to the cops, and promptly set about disposing of the corpses in gruesome ways.', 'A dissolute scriptwriter and a dejected actor become unwittingly drawn into a labyrinthine mess when several people experience bizarre accidental deaths in their flat. Though the men didn''t deliberately cause any of the incidents, they fear that they will be unfairly pegged as murderers if they relay information to the cops, and promptly set about disposing of the corpses in gruesome ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57GQHC3i251zv1efn85wTxYSykb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33035'),
  ('1123121447279239597', 'A Fine Day', 2001, 'Drama', 'Thomas Arslan, Michael Wiesweg', 'Thomas Arslan', 'Serpil Turhan, Bilge Bingul, Florian Stetter, Selda Kaya, Hafize Uner, Hanns Zischler, Elke Schmitter', null, 'A day in the life of the 21 years old Deniz, who aims to become an actress and makes her living by dubbing movies. After she has split with her old boyfriend she gets to know Diego and spends the evening with him.', 'A day in the life of the 21 years old Deniz, who aims to become an actress and makes her living by dubbing movies. After she has split with her old boyfriend she gets to know Diego and spends the evening with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9x51j5FixbelLuLTZf857GY77xl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117234'),
  ('894047332329196918', 'A Fine Madness', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Irvin Kershner, Ted D. McCord, Russell Llewellyn', 'Elliott Baker', 'Sean Connery, Joanne Woodward, Jean Seberg, Colleen Dewhurst, Jackie Coogan, Patrick O''Neal, Clive Revill, Werner Peters', null, 'A womanizing poet falls into the hands of a psychiatrist with a straying wife.', 'A womanizing poet falls into the hands of a psychiatrist with a straying wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rBLOhciaodPoG4yOulsaCjlWbWM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70498'),
  ('577816014342669769', 'A Fine Mess', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Blake Edwards, Joe Dunne, Mickey McCardle', 'Blake Edwards', 'Ted Danson, Howie Mandel, Richard Mulligan, Stuart Margolin, María Conchita Alonso, Jennifer Edwards, Paul Sorvino, Vic Polizos', 'PG', 'Two friends discover a plot to fix a horse race and try to capitalize on it, but soon have to deal with the two men who fixed it, the police investigating it, and the mob boss whose amorous wife is mixed up in it.', 'Two friends discover a plot to fix a horse race and try to capitalize on it, but soon have to deal with the two men who fixed it, the police investigating it, and the mob boss whose amorous wife is mixed up in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cjIPWHHX92WrnmCVh05rlkdmnOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48609'),
  ('213425470890558535', 'A Fire in the Sky', 1978, 'Drama, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Jerry Jameson, Matthew F. Leonetti', 'Michael Blankfort, Dennis Nemec', 'Richard Crenna, Elizabeth Ashley, David Dukes, Joanna Miles, Lloyd Bochner, Merlin Olsen, Andrew Duggan, Maggie Wellman', 'PG', 'Astronomers discover a comet that they believe will crash into Phoenix, Arizona. They attempt to warn officials, but without 100% certainty, the governor of Arizona is reticent to cause a panic. Even after a television news reporter discovers the truth and threatens to go live with it, the response is understated enough to doom some residents of Phoenix to certain death.', 'Astronomers discover a comet that they believe will crash into Phoenix, Arizona. They attempt to warn officials, but without 100% certainty, the governor of Arizona is reticent to cause a panic. Even after a television news reporter discovers the truth and threatens to go live with it, the response is understated enough to doom some residents of Phoenix to certain death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xw7kitDv19Zsgh25naFrQiQYJsV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:337883'),
  ('83415559404824414', 'A Fish Called Wanda', 1988, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Charles Crichton, Alan Hume, Melvin Lind', 'John Cleese', 'Jamie Lee Curtis, John Cleese, Kevin Kline, Michael Palin, Maria Aitken, Tom Georgeson, Cynthia Cleese, Patricia Hayes', 'R', 'While a diamond advocate attempts to steal a collection of diamonds, troubles arise when he realises he’s not the only one after the collection.', 'While a diamond advocate attempts to steal a collection of diamonds, troubles arise when he realises he’s not the only one after the collection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkSGFNVfEEUXFCxRZDITFHVhUlu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623'),
  ('225287868542137346', 'A Fish in Love', 1999, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gaia Gorrini, Marco Limberti, Federico Nuti', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Giovanni Veronesi', 'Leonardo Pieraccioni, Yamila Diaz, Paolo Hendel, Patrizia Loreti, Gabriella Pession, Angelo Russo, Rodolfo Corsato, Rosanna Susini', null, 'Carpenter Arturo becomes a literary sensation when the children''s stories he writes in his spare time get published, but he comes to resent success and the spotlight that comes with it. During a press tour he falls in love with beautiful married woman, Matilde.', 'Carpenter Arturo becomes a literary sensation when the children''s stories he writes in his spare time get published, but he comes to resent success and the spotlight that comes with it. During a press tour he falls in love with beautiful married woman, Matilde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJcdQeK3TjDStQ4M8BO2pULA7KN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60203'),
  ('581190174569293572', 'A Fish Swimming Upside Down', 2020, 'Drama', 'Constanze Schmitt, Eliza Petkova', 'Eliza Petkova', 'Nina Schwabe, Theo Trebs, Henning Kober, Anna Manolova, Márton Nagy, Leon Ullrich, Henning Mosselman', null, 'Andrea, a woman without a past, is the object of both Philipp’s and his son’s desire. A love triangle filled with expectations, longing and fears leaves open the speculation of who knows what about whom.', 'Andrea, a woman without a past, is the object of both Philipp’s and his son’s desire. A love triangle filled with expectations, longing and fears leaves open the speculation of who knows what about whom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLw5qllFwwZRPjEKf66IpSukqEL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656292'),
