  ('150033425539606621', 'A Funny Thing Happened on the Way to the Forum', 1966, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Lester, Bob Simmons, José López Rodero', 'Melvin Frank, Michael Pertwee', 'Zero Mostel, Jack Gilford, Phil Silvers, Buster Keaton, Michael Crawford, Annette Andre, Michael Hordern, Leon Greene', null, 'A wily slave must unite a virgin courtesan and his young smitten master to earn his freedom.', 'A wily slave must unite a virgin courtesan and his young smitten master to earn his freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3S9DZMUZNsAqd8ZNBed7ttPWXk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17768'),
  ('912394648515725498', 'A Further Gesture', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Romance', 'Zoran Đorđević, Robert Dornhelm, Andrzej Sekula', 'Ronan Bennett', 'Stephen Rea, Alfred Molina, Rosana Pastor, Brendan Gleeson, Jorge Sanz, Pruitt Taylor Vince, Frankie McCafferty, Sean McGinley', null, 'Dowd, an IRA prisoner in the H-blocks, is gloomily facing his sentence, until he joins a comrade in a risky escape. Dowd begins a new life in New York, but he might as well be in prison again - until he strikes up a friendship with co-worker Tulio and gets to know his close group of Guatemalan exiles.', 'Dowd, an IRA prisoner in the H-blocks, is gloomily facing his sentence, until he joins a comrade in a risky escape. Dowd begins a new life in New York, but he might as well be in prison again - until he strikes up a friendship with co-worker Tulio and gets to know his close group of Guatemalan exiles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ldoeypXkLwIOhCVvak72GWJqFWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47112'),
  ('246302194772096537', 'A Futile and Stupid Gesture', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Wain, Kevin Atkinson, Amanda Carrara', 'John Aboud, Michael Colton', 'Will Forte, Domhnall Gleeson, Martin Mull, Neil Casey, Jon Daly, Nelson Franklin, John Gemberling, Rick Glassman', 'R', 'In a life full of triumph and failure, "National Lampoon" co-founder Doug Kenney built a comedy empire, molding pop culture in the 1970s.', 'In a life full of triumph and failure, "National Lampoon" co-founder Doug Kenney built a comedy empire, molding pop culture in the 1970s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kyHBeRgbbhs7kVrZYblVj9u2Xbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391710'),
  ('409954848381622540', 'A Game for Six Lovers', 1960, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jacques Doniol-Valcroze, Jean-José Richer, Roger Fellous', 'Jean-José Richer, Jacques Doniol-Valcroze', 'Françoise Brion, Bernadette Lafont, Alexandra Stewart, Michel Galabru, Jacques Riberolles, Gérard Barray, Paul Guers, Florence Loinod', null, 'Miléna is living in her grandmother''s baroque château when the rich lady dies. The lawyer Miguel, who had a previous relationship with Miléna, insists the other two grandchildren, Fifine and her brother Jean-Paul, visit the château for the reading of the will, even though they have been estranged from the family at an early age. However Robert, who had been living with Fifine in an open relationship, arrives and impersonates Jean-Paul. Robert falls for Fifine''s cousin Miléna while Fifine has designs on Miguel. In the meantime, the butler César is focusing his lecherous intentions on Prudence, the maid he had just hired.', 'Miléna is living in her grandmother''s baroque château when the rich lady dies. The lawyer Miguel, who had a previous relationship with Miléna, insists the other two grandchildren, Fifine and her brother Jean-Paul, visit the château for the reading of the will, even though they have been estranged from the family at an early age. However Robert, who had been living with Fifine in an open relationship, arrives and impersonates Jean-Paul. Robert falls for Fifine''s cousin Miléna while Fifine has designs on Miguel. In the meantime, the butler César is focusing his lecherous intentions on Prudence, the maid he had just hired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXTdUk6FtJqraUIBoRUBDlykScE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63682'),
  ('411688578950971991', 'A Game with Stones', 1965, 'Animation', 'Jan Švankmajer, Eva Dvořáková, Peter Puluj', 'Jan Švankmajer', null, null, 'A device consisting of a clock, a pendulum, a faucet and a bucket enacts a series of events whenever the clock chimes.', 'A device consisting of a clock, a pendulum, a faucet and a bucket enacts a series of events whenever the clock chimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ukq42rnMxht2r3JPqYLP7YC00zR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18950'),
  ('514272927023581215', 'A Gang Story', 2011, 'Crime, Drama', 'Olivier Marchal, Denis Rouden, Ivan Fegyveres', 'Olivier Marchal, Edgar Marie', 'Gérard Lanvin, Tchéky Karyo, Daniel Duval, Dimitri Storoge, Patrick Catalifo, François Levantal, Francis Renaud, Lionnel Astier', null, 'After growing up in a poor gypsy camp, Edmond Vidal, aka Momon, has retained a sense of family, unfailing loyalty and pride in his origins. Most of all, he has remained friends with Serge Suttel, with whom he first discovered prison life - for stealing cherries. The two of them inevitably got involved in organized crime. The team they formed, the Ganf Des Lyonnais, made them the most notorious armed robbers of the early 1970s. Their irresistible rise ended in 1974 with a spectacular arrest. Today, as he nears 60, Momon would like to forget that part of his life. He has found peace by retiring from the "business". He tends to his wife Janou, who suffered so in the past, and to his children and grandchildren, all of whom have great respect for this man of simple and universal values, so clear-headed and full of kindness. But then Serge Suttel, who has disowned nothing of his past, comes back into the picture.', 'After growing up in a poor gypsy camp, Edmond Vidal, aka Momon, has retained a sense of family, unfailing loyalty and pride in his origins. Most of all, he has remained friends with Serge Suttel, with whom he first discovered prison life - for stealing cherries. The two of them inevitably got involved in organized crime. The team they formed, the Ganf Des Lyonnais, made them the most notorious armed robbers of the early 1970s. Their irresistible rise ended in 1974 with a spectacular arrest. Today, as he nears 60, Momon would like to forget that part of his life. He has found peace by retiring from the "business". He tends to his wife Janou, who suffered so in the past, and to his children and grandchildren, all of whom have great respect for this man of simple and universal values, so clear-headed and full of kindness. But then Serge Suttel, who has disowned nothing of his past, comes back into the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nN3osmlYWNZZtg8vtXrt8c5t8ET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56415'),
  ('594975851060097799', 'A Gangster''s Life', 2026, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Zak Fenning', 'Roy Rivett', 'Tony Cook, Jonny Weldon, Rina Lipa, Christina Gkioka, Tomi May', null, 'When two low-level criminals scam a vicious London mob and are in over their heads, they flee to rural Greece to avoid the bloody repercussions. But escape isn''t that simple.', 'When two low-level criminals scam a vicious London mob and are in over their heads, they flee to rural Greece to avoid the bloody repercussions. But escape isn''t that simple.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fe%2Fgracenote%2Fe65e5ed52bb0c4a54d686ed30825ddc3.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-gangsters-life'),
  ('274003588160903245', 'A Garden Without Birds', 1992, 'Horror', 'Akira Nobi', 'Akira Nobi', 'Hino Harumi, Somiya Daisuke, Takayuki Harada, Yosuke Nikaidou, Sham-Tear, Yasuyo Takami', null, 'Four friends arrange a kinky sex party at the top of a luxury hotel, where a dominatrix and her gimp await for the guests. Once they start using drugs to spice things up, the party takes a bloody turn.', 'Four friends arrange a kinky sex party at the top of a luxury hotel, where a dominatrix and her gimp await for the guests. Once they start using drugs to spice things up, the party takes a bloody turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7BkL7rz9cyVZAlvxKmeMLAnNvd9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104894'),
  ('1012324273413151318', 'A Garfield Christmas', 1987, 'Animation, Family, Comedy, TV Movie, Music, Adventure', 'Phil Roman, George Singer', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Thom Huge, Gregg Berger, Pat Carroll, Pat Harrington Jr., David L. Lander, Julie Payne', 'G', 'Garfield, Jon and Odie go to Jon''s family farm for Christmas, where Garfield finds a present for Grandma.', 'Garfield, Jon and Odie go to Jon''s family farm for Christmas, where Garfield finds a present for Grandma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQD2VdPntQxHAWap3KMUXGsUTcw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13246'),
  ('654375276541114220', 'A Garibaldian in the Convent', 1942, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Vittorio De Sica, Alberto Fusi, Michele Gandin', 'Giuseppe Zucca, Margherita Maglione, Adolfo Franci', 'Leonardo Cortese, María Mercader, Carla Del Poggio, Fausto Guerzoni, Elvira Betrone, Dina Romano, Clara Auteri Pepe, Olga Vittoria Gentilli', null, 'An old woman''s poignant reminiscence of her youth in a convent school, the happy moments and the sad, and her tragic love for a Garibaldian.', 'An old woman''s poignant reminiscence of her youth in a convent school, the happy moments and the sad, and her tragic love for a Garibaldian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nR222YDDiJ3iInieen1ajToD62K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278122'),
  ('888264658976202288', 'A Gathering of Eagles', 1963, 'Drama, Romance', 'Delbert Mann, Russell Harlan, Robert D. Webb', 'Robert Pirosh', 'Rock Hudson, Rod Taylor, Mary Peach, Barry Sullivan, Kevin McCarthy, Henry Silva, Leora Dana, Robert Lansing', 'NR', 'A B-52 commander must prepare his men to pass a grueling inspection.', 'A B-52 commander must prepare his men to pass a grueling inspection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMhdBWKwRKdfrx5OJ0mXIc5mwHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124058'),
  ('1132342758342328809', 'A Gathering of Old Men', 1987, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Volker Schlöndorff, Edward Lachman', 'Charles Fuller', 'Louis Gossett Jr., Richard Widmark, Holly Hunter, Will Patton, Joe Seneca, Woody Strode, Tiger Haynes, Papa John Creach', 'PG', 'A group of elderly Black men on a Louisiana plantation gather to claim responsibility for the murder of a violent white farmer to protect the young Black man who actually killed him.', 'A group of elderly Black men on a Louisiana plantation gather to claim responsibility for the murder of a violent white farmer to protect the young Black man who actually killed him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zB617itwYfcfhm8Ny6dz30C9f8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78143'),
  ('279851748050596254', 'A Geisha', 1953, 'Drama', 'Kenji Mizoguchi, Kazuo Miyagawa, Mitsuo Hirotsu', 'Yoshikata Yoda, Matsutarô Kawaguchi', 'Michiyo Kogure, Ayako Wakao, Seizaburō Kawazu, Eitarō Shindō, Ichirō Sugai, Kanji Koshiba, Sumao Ishihara, Chieko Naniwa', null, 'Fleeing a distressing family situation, Eiko, a very young girl, becomes an apprentice to Miyoharu, a veteran geisha. Both, determined to preserve their professional integrity, must face the selfishness and ambition of several petty people.', 'Fleeing a distressing family situation, Eiko, a very young girl, becomes an apprentice to Miyoharu, a veteran geisha. Both, determined to preserve their professional integrity, must face the selfishness and ambition of several petty people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fQelo0Z5vhVHATqUmdNrXVoUEcv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45991'),
  ('602122971651735604', 'A Geisha''s Diary', 1961, 'Drama', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Noriaki Yuasa, Hiroshi Murai', 'Yūzō Kawashima, Toshiro Ide', 'Ayako Wakao, Jun Fujimaki, Frankie Sakai, So Yamamura, Kyū Sazanka, Hisano Yamaoka, Mayumi Kurata, Chieko Murata', null, 'A young girl is rigorously trained in the feminine arts so that she can become a geisha. As she struggles through life, she learns to live not just as a woman but as a complete person.', 'A young girl is rigorously trained in the feminine arts so that she can become a geisha. As she struggles through life, she learns to live not just as a woman but as a complete person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umwlWVeNJRkc69QpdZbn4N4U4KQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:489552'),
  ('563979256368643989', 'A Generation', 1955, 'War, Drama', 'Andrzej Wajda, Jerzy Lipman, Kazimierz Kutz', 'Bohdan Czeszko', 'Tadeusz Łomnicki, Urszula Modrzyńska, Tadeusz Janczar, Janusz Paluszkiewicz, Ryszard Kotys, Roman Polanski, Ludwik Benoit, Zofia Czerwińska', null, 'Stach is a wayward teen living in squalor on the outskirts of Nazi-occupied Warsaw. Guided by an avuncular Communist organizer, he is introduced to the underground resistance—and to the beautiful Dorota. Soon he is engaged in dangerous efforts to fight oppression and indignity, maturing as he assumes responsibility for others’ lives. A coming-of-age story of survival and shattering loss, A Generation delivers a brutal portrait of the human cost of war.', 'Stach is a wayward teen living in squalor on the outskirts of Nazi-occupied Warsaw. Guided by an avuncular Communist organizer, he is introduced to the underground resistance—and to the beautiful Dorota. Soon he is engaged in dangerous efforts to fight oppression and indignity, maturing as he assumes responsibility for others’ lives. A coming-of-age story of survival and shattering loss, A Generation delivers a brutal portrait of the human cost of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zUQKN61bjCxSgubchybgzExMCNR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43322'),
  ('491733986735950765', 'A Genius, Two Friends, and an Idiot', 1975, 'Comedy, Western', 'Damiano Damiani, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Sergio Leone', 'Damiano Damiani, Ernesto Gastaldi, Fulvio Morsella', 'Terence Hill, Miou-Miou, Robert Charlebois, Patrick McGoohan, Raimund Harmstorf, Piero Vida, Rik Battaglia, Mario Valgoi', null, 'Expert conman Joe Thanks teams up with half-breed Bill and naive Lucy to steal $300,000 from the Indian-hating Major Cabot. Their elaborate plan is full of disguises, double-crosses, and chases, but Joe always seems to know what he''s doing.', 'Expert conman Joe Thanks teams up with half-breed Bill and naive Lucy to steal $300,000 from the Indian-hating Major Cabot. Their elaborate plan is full of disguises, double-crosses, and chases, but Joe always seems to know what he''s doing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVo9IIAmIPWztrmR2C25X31QHAk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10915'),
  ('831456975707726470', 'A Gentle Breeze in the Village', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nobuhiro Yamashita, Ryuto Kondo', 'Aya Watanabe', 'Kaho, Masaki Okada, Elisa Yanagi, Shoko Fujimura, Yui Natsukawa, Koichi Sato, Satoru Saito, Daisuke Kuroda', null, 'When eighth-grade cool guy Hiromi transfers from Tokyo to a small elementary/middle school with only six kids enrolled, wholesome and honest Soyo becomes enthralled with his sophisticated world.', 'When eighth-grade cool guy Hiromi transfers from Tokyo to a small elementary/middle school with only six kids enrolled, wholesome and honest Soyo becomes enthralled with his sophisticated world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2bm9KgW7o4vDXl7FyGc0WtgdmS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83214'),
  ('746610982664085166', 'A Gentle Creature', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Sergei Loznitsa, Oleg Mutu', 'Sergei Loznitsa', 'Vasilina Makovtseva, Sergey Kolesov, Liya Akhedzhakova, Sergey Fedorov, Roza Khairullina, Dmitriy Bykovskiy-Romashov, Alisa Kravtsova, Alexander Zamuraev', null, 'A woman lives in a small village in Russia. One day she receives the parcel she sent to her husband, serving a sentence in prison. Confused and angered, she sets out to find why her package was returned to sender.', 'A woman lives in a small village in Russia. One day she receives the parcel she sent to her husband, serving a sentence in prison. Confused and angered, she sets out to find why her package was returned to sender.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rGQ5owiGxmY7J2drGNdDKxUFlmy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442947'),
  ('780173573815116275', 'A Gentle Night', 2018, 'Drama', 'Qiu Yang', 'Qiu Yang', 'Shuxian Li, Frank Sun, Yaning Ding, Yun Xu, Zhang Zhijian, Yirun Liang, Wendi Zhao, Lei Wang', null, 'In a nameless small Chinese city, a regular mother tries to find her missing daughter, in this gentle night.', 'In a nameless small Chinese city, a regular mother tries to find her missing daughter, in this gentle night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iV18bxEj54UpmPP6RaO9lte8E8u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:457221'),
  ('194503977743585041', 'A Gentle Spirit', 1985, 'Animation, Drama', 'Piotr Dumała', 'Piotr Dumała', 'Józef Duriasz', null, 'A man seated next to the body of his young wife thinks about their brief life together. Suicide has been the only escape for her... Dumala''s technique creates a dark, claustrophobic atmosphere, entirely suitable for Dostoyevski''s novel "A Gentle Spirit" on which it is based.', 'A man seated next to the body of his young wife thinks about their brief life together. Suicide has been the only escape for her... Dumala''s technique creates a dark, claustrophobic atmosphere, entirely suitable for Dostoyevski''s novel "A Gentle Spirit" on which it is based.', null, 'tmdb:movie:352024'),
  ('447837455967909531', 'A Gentle Woman', 1969, 'Romance, Drama', 'Robert Bresson, Jacques Kébadian, Ghislain Cloquet', 'Robert Bresson', 'Dominique Sanda, Guy Frangin, Jeanne Lobre, Claude Ollier, Jacques Kébadian, Gilles Sandier, Dorothée Blanck', null, 'When his young wife commits suicide with no explanation, an introspective pawnbroker looks back on their life together.', 'When his young wife commits suicide with no explanation, an introspective pawnbroker looks back on their life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lIH2qU6m25a7PBAm0AeEdAzRFSz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55836'),
  ('55574389924439230', 'A Gentleman', 2017, 'Action, Comedy', 'Roman Jakobi, Raj Nidimoru, Krishna D.K.', 'Krishna D.K., Raj Nidimoru', 'Sidharth Malhotra, Jacqueline Fernandez, Suniel Shetty, Darshan Kumaar, Kushal Punjabi, Rajit Kapoor, Amit Mistry, Hussain Dalal', null, 'Gaurav dreams of settling down with Kavya, the woman of his dreams, but she prefers a man who''s more adventurous and willing to take risks. He soon stands to lose everything when a case of mistaken identity rocks his once-happy life.', 'Gaurav dreams of settling down with Kavya, the woman of his dreams, but she prefers a man who''s more adventurous and willing to take risks. He soon stands to lose everything when a case of mistaken identity rocks his once-happy life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wvztxVw5OJolodYLFldqMJVOt75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469872'),
  ('420007840154040833', 'A Gentleman''s Gentleman', 1941, 'Animation', 'Clyde Geronimi, Don A. Duckwall', null, 'Walt Disney, Lee Millar', 'NR', 'Mickey Mouse lies in bed like a lord, getting served breakfast by man''s (and mouse''s?) best friend Pluto as gentleman''s gentleman. Next duty is to fetch the paper, but also pay for it with a coin for the vending machine, and those round things have a nasty habit of escaping a dog''s teeth and bouncing over the pavement till they end up in the gutter. After enough attempts to fish and spend the penny, Pluto has a newspaper to carry the same way. The wind has a nasty way to get a better grip on page after page then the dog, so by the time he delivers the daily dose of printed news it''s an embarrassingly muddy mess.', 'Mickey Mouse lies in bed like a lord, getting served breakfast by man''s (and mouse''s?) best friend Pluto as gentleman''s gentleman. Next duty is to fetch the paper, but also pay for it with a coin for the vending machine, and those round things have a nasty habit of escaping a dog''s teeth and bouncing over the pavement till they end up in the gutter. After enough attempts to fish and spend the penny, Pluto has a newspaper to carry the same way. The wind has a nasty way to get a better grip on page after page then the dog, so by the time he delivers the daily dose of printed news it''s an embarrassingly muddy mess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6dzYiBHIUJgM6qb8N3eJVf2ftpZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68486'),
  ('431343983842929428', 'A German Life', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Florian Weigensamer, Christian Krönes, Roland Schrotthofer', 'Florian Weigensamer, Christian Krönes, Olaf S. Müller', 'Brunhilde Pomsel', null, 'Brunhilde Pomsel was a stenographer for Nazi Propaganda Minister Joseph Goebbels. Many people think that the dangers of fascism have been overcome, but she makes it clear that this is not the case.', 'Brunhilde Pomsel was a stenographer for Nazi Propaganda Minister Joseph Goebbels. Many people think that the dangers of fascism have been overcome, but she makes it clear that this is not the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8jJexYyjuDP2TvrmWlvXcmBVJ0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411516'),
  ('282246138367012557', 'A German Youth', 2015, 'Documentary, History', 'Jean-Gabriel Périot', null, 'Harun Farocki, Philip W. Sauber, Holger Meins, Helke Sander, Jean-Luc Godard, Andreas Baader, Gudrun Ensslin, Ulrike Meinhof', null, 'At the end of the 1960s the post-war generation began to revolt against their parents. This was a generation disillusioned by anti-communist capitalism and a state apparatus in which they believed they saw fascist tendencies. This generation included journalist Ulrike Meinhof, lawyer Horst Mahler, filmmaker Holger Meins as well as students Gudrun Ensslin and Andreas Baader.', 'At the end of the 1960s the post-war generation began to revolt against their parents. This was a generation disillusioned by anti-communist capitalism and a state apparatus in which they believed they saw fascist tendencies. This generation included journalist Ulrike Meinhof, lawyer Horst Mahler, filmmaker Holger Meins as well as students Gudrun Ensslin and Andreas Baader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oZKJwuSNipMbpWU5jd9Lv7THxK8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:324184'),
  ('207775811976827928', 'A Ghost of a Chance', 2011, 'Mystery, Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Koki Mitani, Hideo Yamamoto, Shozo Katashima', 'Koki Mitani', 'Eri Fukatsu, Toshiyuki Nishida, Hiroshi Abe, Yuko Takeuchi, Kiichi Nakai, Kyoko Fukada, Koichi Sato, Kazuyuki Asano', null, 'Defence lawyer Emi is assigned to a particularly unusual case: a man is suspected of murdering his wealthy wife, and his only alibi is a 421-year old ghost, Rokubei. At first Emi is hesitant, but when she pursues her lead she is visited by the ghost herself. And so the fun begins in the courtroom when Prosecutor Osano starts to cross examine.', 'Defence lawyer Emi is assigned to a particularly unusual case: a man is suspected of murdering his wealthy wife, and his only alibi is a 421-year old ghost, Rokubei. At first Emi is hesitant, but when she pursues her lead she is visited by the ghost herself. And so the fun begins in the courtroom when Prosecutor Osano starts to cross examine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qCHdSABO9BXPWoAYxmkHVQpva5Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130023'),
  ('193891472511110057', 'A Ghost Story', 2017, 'Drama, Fantasy, Mystery, Romance', 'Angie Meyer, LouAnn Wu, David Lowery', 'David Lowery', 'Casey Affleck, Rooney Mara, McColm Cephas Jr., Kenneisha Thompson, Grover Coulson, Liz Cardenas, Barlow Jacobs, Richard Krause', 'R', 'Recently deceased, a white-sheeted ghost returns to his suburban home to console his bereft wife, only to find that in his spectral state he has become unstuck in time, forced to watch passively as the life he knew and the woman he loves slowly slip away.', 'Recently deceased, a white-sheeted ghost returns to his suburban home to console his bereft wife, only to find that in his spectral state he has become unstuck in time, forced to watch passively as the life he knew and the woman he loves slowly slip away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rp5JPIyZi9sMob15l46zNQLe5cO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428449'),
  ('578082170576638505', 'A Ghost Waits', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Romance', 'Michael C. Potter, Adam Stovall', 'MacLeod Andrews, Adam Stovall', 'MacLeod Andrews, Sydney Vollmer, Amanda Miller, Nicholas Thurkettle, Adam Stovall, Natalie Walker', null, 'Jack''s job is to fix up the house. Spectral agent Muriel''s eternal task is to haunt it. They should be enemies, but they become fascinated by one another and eventually smitten, leading them to question everything about their work, lives, and decisions. But as pressure mounts for them to fulfil their duties, something’s got to give for them to have the time together they both so desperately want.', 'Jack''s job is to fix up the house. Spectral agent Muriel''s eternal task is to haunt it. They should be enemies, but they become fascinated by one another and eventually smitten, leading them to question everything about their work, lives, and decisions. But as pressure mounts for them to fulfil their duties, something’s got to give for them to have the time together they both so desperately want.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPxTfepSqLgwBFqzqfksTG2Ncwy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665109'),
  ('842247060943216799', 'A Gift', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Naruphol Chokanapitak, Kriangkrai Vachiratamporn, Jira Maligool', 'Kriangkrai Vachiratamporn, Jira Maligool, Chayanop Bunprakob', 'Chantavit Dhanasevi, Nuengthida Sophon, Sunny Suwanmethanon, Nittha Jirayungyurn, Naphat Siangsomboon, Violette Wautier, Paoon Jansiri, Narinthorn Na Bangchang', null, 'Featuring musical compositions of the late King Bhumibol Adulyadej, three love stories tackle unique challenges on romantic, soul-searching journeys.', 'Featuring musical compositions of the late King Bhumibol Adulyadej, three love stories tackle unique challenges on romantic, soul-searching journeys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2b6wewSq7fQwB11S0llmpYjEH2b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:432534'),
  ('365786228569862924', 'A Gift from Heaven', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Lê Thanh Sơn', 'Tran Khanh Hoang', 'Tuan Tran, Phuong Anh Dao, Ngoc Ngoan Quách, Mi Goi, Trung Dan', null, 'A six-year-old boy from a single-parent family finds his "god-given father," revealing secrets and ironic fates that ask: what is the true treasure in life?', 'A six-year-old boy from a single-parent family finds his "god-given father," revealing secrets and ironic fates that ask: what is the true treasure in life?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMzE2MWEyMWEtZTQ0Yi00MzI1LWJhNWMtZjhhZmFhMTNiMGY0XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-gift-from-heaven-2026-1'),
  ('920325667798720372', 'A Gift to Remember', 2017, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Kevin Fair, Toby Gorman', 'Dean Orion, Topher Payne', 'Ali Liebert, Peter Porte, Tina Lifford, Brandi Alexander, Jennifer Koenig, Ricky He, Mark Milburn, Emma Flemington', null, 'After colliding with a pedestrian on her bicycle who loses his memory following the accident, Darcy Archer becomes determined to help the handsome guy figure out who he is. In the process, she finds out a lot more about who she is, what she wants from life, and how this too-good-to-be-true guy might just be the man she’s been waiting to bump into all her life.', 'After colliding with a pedestrian on her bicycle who loses his memory following the accident, Darcy Archer becomes determined to help the handsome guy figure out who he is. In the process, she finds out a lot more about who she is, what she wants from life, and how this too-good-to-be-true guy might just be the man she’s been waiting to bump into all her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l0XPQ2aOAEKpfuVF1Q56vzktlFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480614'),
  ('1074039044307911789', 'A Gift Wrapped Christmas', 2015, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Lee Friedlander, Anthony C. Metchie', 'Barbara Kymlicka', 'Meredith Hagner, Travis Milne, Beverley Mitchell, Anna Van Hooft, Anthony Bolognese, Nicole Oliver, Elfina Luk, Dave Collette', null, 'Personal shopper Gwen''s newest client, Charlie, is a high-rolling, workaholic, single father. When Gwen meets his 8-year-old son, Owen, during a package drop, she is saddened to see just how little time Charlie spends with him. Determined to get Charlie to appreciate his family, Gwen makes it her Christmas mission to get him into the festive spirit.', 'Personal shopper Gwen''s newest client, Charlie, is a high-rolling, workaholic, single father. When Gwen meets his 8-year-old son, Owen, during a package drop, she is saddened to see just how little time Charlie spends with him. Determined to get Charlie to appreciate his family, Gwen makes it her Christmas mission to get him into the festive spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMhcB2v3dO7zuufueCuFDDlschC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:367536'),
  ('883431788388203747', 'A Gilded Game', 2025, 'Drama', 'Herman Yau, Joe Chan Kwong-Hung, Derek Siu Hing-Wa', 'Herman Yau, Erica Li', 'Ou Hao, Andy Lau, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Crystal Huang Yi, Jiang Mengjie, Jasper Liu, Ni Ni, Andrew Lin Hoi', null, 'A gifted but underprivileged finance student, Gao Han, lands a rare internship at a top international investment bank, Bluestone, while helping his friend''s family business prepare for a public listing. Surrounded by elite peers with powerful connections, Gao Han stands out for his integrity and raw talent. With the support of a seasoned mentor, he quickly adapts to the high-stakes world of investment banking, but soon discovers that success in this industry comes with hidden costs and fierce competition.', 'A gifted but underprivileged finance student, Gao Han, lands a rare internship at a top international investment bank, Bluestone, while helping his friend''s family business prepare for a public listing. Surrounded by elite peers with powerful connections, Gao Han stands out for his integrity and raw talent. With the support of a seasoned mentor, he quickly adapts to the high-stakes world of investment banking, but soon discovers that success in this industry comes with hidden costs and fierce competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w0WpSIv7ta6Cc4yRfTCkmEbAolW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1200063'),
  ('30627785930294226', 'A Gingerbread Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Family, Drama', 'Pat Kiely, Serge Desrosiers', 'Carley Smale, Blaine Chiappetta', 'Tiya Sircar, Marc Bendavid, Sugith Varughese, Karen Glave, Kyana Teresa, Fereshteh Samimi, Maja Vujicic, Duff Goldman', 'G', 'Follows Hazel, who goes to spend the holidays in her home town, where a romance begins to bloom with a local contractor who has been helping her father with their family bakery, but some misunderstandings threaten to tear them apart.', 'Follows Hazel, who goes to spend the holidays in her home town, where a romance begins to bloom with a local contractor who has been helping her father with their family bakery, but some misunderstandings threaten to tear them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ingOTjbDkqHwsXVoOXwNWGaSK7T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1015190'),
  ('30872184676037046', 'A Girl at My Door', 2014, 'Drama', 'July Jung, Lee Ho-hyun, Kim Hyun-seok', 'July Jung', 'Bae Doona, Kim Sae-ron, Song Sae-byuk, Kim Jin-goo, Son Jong-hak, Na Jong-min, Gong Myoung, Kim Jong-goo', null, 'Sent from Seoul to serve in a remote coastal village, a policewoman gets involved in the life of a mysterious teenage girl who is abused by both her father and her grandmother.', 'Sent from Seoul to serve in a remote coastal village, a policewoman gets involved in the life of a mysterious teenage girl who is abused by both her father and her grandmother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/clsf4ahm1KYucXxTZBEOZ3YJUyp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:266058'),
  ('146933898954897237', 'A Girl Called Jules', 1970, 'Drama', 'Tonino Valerii, Stelvio Massi', 'Marcello Coscia, Tonino Valerii, Francesco Mazzei', 'Silvia Dionisio, Gianni Macchia, John Steiner, Esmeralda Ruspoli, Maurizio Degli Esposti, Livio Barbo, Roberto Chevalier, Riccardo Garrone', null, 'After his Western triumphs, Valerii stepped out of the shadow of Sergio Leone with this distinctly Bergmanesque sexual melodrama.Dionisio is perfect in the title role and this remains her best film, Valerii turns up along the way too. Just when the film hits a period of auto pilot John Steiner turns up in the final reel for a climax that is quite unforgettable. A bit difficult to trace but well worth the effort.', 'After his Western triumphs, Valerii stepped out of the shadow of Sergio Leone with this distinctly Bergmanesque sexual melodrama.Dionisio is perfect in the title role and this remains her best film, Valerii turns up along the way too. Just when the film hits a period of auto pilot John Steiner turns up in the final reel for a climax that is quite unforgettable. A bit difficult to trace but well worth the effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eW9KoW8qcwvfa6fYex1nluKWEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205555'),
  ('254825567448355295', 'A Girl Called Rosemarie', 1996, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bernd Eichinger, Gernot Roll, Stephan Puchner', 'Uwe Wilhelm, Bernd Eichinger', 'Nina Hoss, Heiner Lauterbach, Mathieu Carrière, Hannelore Elsner, Katja Flint, Horst Krause, Til Schweiger, Heinrich Schafmeister', null, 'Katja Flint, Hannelore Elsner and Heiner Lauterbach star in this German film about a woman who climbs the social ladder by sleeping with those she encounters on her way to the top. When she''s discovered dead in her apartment in 1957, the police try to piece together the clues to find out who murdered her … but to no avail.', 'Katja Flint, Hannelore Elsner and Heiner Lauterbach star in this German film about a woman who climbs the social ladder by sleeping with those she encounters on her way to the top. When she''s discovered dead in her apartment in 1957, the police try to piece together the clues to find out who murdered her … but to no avail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX6lDW0Th84291UbsKqa6tyJEFO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4387'),
  ('936208066090638689', 'A Girl Cut in Two', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Thriller', 'Claude Chabrol, Eduardo Serra', 'Claude Chabrol, Cécile Maistre-Chabrol', 'Ludivine Sagnier, Benoît Magimel, François Berléand, Mathilda May, Caroline Silhol, Marie Bunel, Valéria Cavalli, Etienne Chicot', 'NR', 'A TV weather girl is torn between an older man, a famous married author whom she loves but who won''t leave his wife, and a semi-deranged young heir to an industrial fortune who loves her.', 'A TV weather girl is torn between an older man, a famous married author whom she loves but who won''t leave his wife, and a semi-deranged young heir to an industrial fortune who loves her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z4WMZsWINlXbZmGZDgAoVa8Cd69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5592'),
  ('660973123638458311', 'A Girl in Australia', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Luigi Zampa, Tony Brandt, Aldo Tonti', 'Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Claudia Cardinale, Riccardo Garrone, Corrado Olmi, Tano Cimarosa, Nick Buttaro, Riccardo Garrone, Angelo Infanti', null, 'The film is about an old fashioned Italian with moral values of the 1930/40''s , who has to find a wife in the modern, woman''s liberated society of Australia of the 1960/70''s.', 'The film is about an old fashioned Italian with moral values of the 1930/40''s , who has to find a wife in the modern, woman''s liberated society of Australia of the 1960/70''s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCofiNBGNtJLgHDe9ig7e3abgwK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61799'),
  ('1097334539435640570', 'A Girl in Black', 1956, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Anis Nohra, Anis Nohra', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Ellie Lambeti, Dimitris Horn, Eleni Zafeiriou, Stephanos Stratigos, Notis Peryalis, Nikos Fermas, Anestis Vlahos, Maria Thalassinou', null, 'Against the backdrop of a cloudless summer, love''s unforeseen complications will entwine an Athenian writer, a morosely beautiful daughter, and a scorned local suitor. And then, calamity strikes. Can love redeem the sad girl in black?', 'Against the backdrop of a cloudless summer, love''s unforeseen complications will entwine an Athenian writer, a morosely beautiful daughter, and a scorned local suitor. And then, calamity strikes. Can love redeem the sad girl in black?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAmHzdte0jYvHWgeid1d0zlftG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98184'),
  ('1037009608533235262', 'A Girl in Every Port', 1928, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Howard Hawks', 'Reggie Morris, Seton I. Miller, James Kevin McGuinness', 'Victor McLaglen, Louise Brooks, Robert Armstrong, Maria Alba, Francis McDonald, Leila Hyams, Natalie Joyce, Eileen Sedgwick', 'NR', 'Two sailors with a rivalry over chasing women become friends. But when one decides to finally settle down, will this mysterious young woman come between them?', 'Two sailors with a rivalry over chasing women become friends. But when one decides to finally settle down, will this mysterious young woman come between them?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kaIyUSHMimpUGXfTtMlif22Giwa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110887'),
  ('750263022736343317', 'A Girl Like Her', 2015, 'Drama', 'Amy S. Weber, Samuel Brownfield, Glenn Miller', 'Amy S. Weber', 'Hunter King, Lexi Ainsworth, Jimmy Bennett, Amy S. Weber, Stephanie Cotton, Mark Boyd, Christy Engle-McGuckin, Jon W. Martin', 'PG-13', 'Sophomore year has been a nightmare for Jessica Burns. Relentlessly harassed by her former friend Avery Keller, Jessica doesn''t know what she did to deserve the abuse from one of South Brookdale High''s most popular and beautiful students. But when a shocking event changes both of their lives, a documentary film crew, a hidden digital camera, and the attention of a reeling community begin to reveal the powerful truth about A Girl Like Her.', 'Sophomore year has been a nightmare for Jessica Burns. Relentlessly harassed by her former friend Avery Keller, Jessica doesn''t know what she did to deserve the abuse from one of South Brookdale High''s most popular and beautiful students. But when a shocking event changes both of their lives, a documentary film crew, a hidden digital camera, and the attention of a reeling community begin to reveal the powerful truth about A Girl Like Her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jLewqKtMcoGaWHbxdRwUl9ND1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325113'),
  ('80903155610887502', 'A Girl Missing', 2019, 'Drama', 'Koji Fukada, Kenichi Negishi', 'Koji Fukada', 'Mariko Tsutsui, Mikako Ichikawa, Sosuke Ikematsu, Ren Sudo, Miyu Ogawa, Mitsuru Fukikoshi, Hisako Ôkata, Nahoko Kawasumi', null, 'Ichiko works as a private nurse for a family she almost became a part of. While Ichiko cares for the grandmother, she is also a confidant to Motoko, the eldest sister. But one day, Motoko’s younger sister disappears. And the media soon reveal the kidnapper to be Ichiko’s own nephew.', 'Ichiko works as a private nurse for a family she almost became a part of. While Ichiko cares for the grandmother, she is also a confidant to Motoko, the eldest sister. But one day, Motoko’s younger sister disappears. And the media soon reveal the kidnapper to be Ichiko’s own nephew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UaVGB8vmevfZiZu3mE1HeeIbCD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:584253'),
  ('1138125778012062004', 'A Girl Named Ann', 2024, 'Drama', 'Yū Irie, Tetsuya Okabe, Hideho Urata', 'Yū Irie', 'Yuumi Kawai, Jiro Sato, Goro Inagaki, Aoba Kawai, Yuriko Hirooka, Akari Hayami', null, 'A drug-addicted girl from an abusive family finds hope through kind people but her grim reality strikes back just as she sees a glimmer of light.', 'A drug-addicted girl from an abusive family finds hope through kind people but her grim reality strikes back just as she sees a glimmer of light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxkAkd2zsUOZOvUO7931bz3f3zU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1219439'),
  ('170807659921591543', 'A Girl Named Willow', 2025, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Mike Marzuk, Gwendolyn Clayton, Matthias Pötsch', 'Gesa Scheibner', 'Ava Petsch, Cora Trube, Anna von Seld, Mary Tölle, Golo Euler, Diana Amft, Melika Foroutan, Michael Ostrowski', null, 'What could Willow do with an entire forest? That''s exactly what she asks herself when she inherits this forest from her aunt Alwina. That''s not all, though - Alwina has also left her a small, crooked cabin and, most importantly, her witchcraft. But the question remains: Will Willow even accept this unexpected inheritance, with all the consequences it entails?', 'What could Willow do with an entire forest? That''s exactly what she asks herself when she inherits this forest from her aunt Alwina. That''s not all, though - Alwina has also left her a small, crooked cabin and, most importantly, her witchcraft. But the question remains: Will Willow even accept this unexpected inheritance, with all the consequences it entails?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/91o854WcptbixlbqybQTzz5BeIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1176932'),
  ('610592949235309459', 'A Girl on the Shore', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Atsushi Ueda, Tatsuya Ishigaki, Wataru Hiranami', 'Atsushi Ueda', 'Ruka Ishikawa, Yuzu Aoki, Oshirō Maeda, Seina Nakata, Yuki Kura, Yu Miyazaki, Rion Takahashi, Amon Hirai', null, 'Keisuke Isobe and Koume Satou live a rather dull life. But when Koume''s crush breaks her heart, their situation becomes quite unordinary. She starts a "no-strings-attached" relationship with Keisuke, whom she had previously rejected, both finding solace in the other in order to fill the emotional voids in their lives.', 'Keisuke Isobe and Koume Satou live a rather dull life. But when Koume''s crush breaks her heart, their situation becomes quite unordinary. She starts a "no-strings-attached" relationship with Keisuke, whom she had previously rejected, both finding solace in the other in order to fill the emotional voids in their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t5hVMswn7bwc7pCqnpXAgfbtXjo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810674'),
  ('837384629023963590', 'A Girl Returned', 2021, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Bonito, Alfredo Betrò', 'Monica Zapelli', 'Sofia Fiore, Vanessa Scalera, Fabrizio Ferracane, Elena Lietti, Andrea Fuorto, Carlotta De Leonardis, Aurora Barulli, Davide Gagliardi', null, 'A 13 years old girl is forced to go living with another family for reasons unknown.', 'A 13 years old girl is forced to go living with another family for reasons unknown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8awEniT6lQt78FQNBhxk85Ipgvn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821859'),
  ('807159996077327818', 'A Girl Walks Home Alone at Night', 2014, 'Horror, Romance', 'Ana Lily Amirpour, Lyle Vincent, Daniel Lugo', 'Ana Lily Amirpour', 'Sheila Vand, Arash Marandi, Marshall Manesh, Mozhan Navabi, Dominic Rains, Rome Shadanloo, Milad Eghbali, Reza Sixo Safai', null, 'In the Iranian ghost-town Bad City, a place that reeks of death and loneliness, the townspeople are unaware they are being stalked by a lonesome vampire.', 'In the Iranian ghost-town Bad City, a place that reeks of death and loneliness, the townspeople are unaware they are being stalked by a lonesome vampire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cd2rCE1nun7CESjBI8PGNEof1tb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252171'),
  ('249592864380092904', 'A Girl, She Is 100%', 1983, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Naoto Yamakawa', null, 'Kissei Kumamoto, Shigeru Muroi, Kazunao Sakaguchi, Koji Yamaguchi', null, 'A man ran into a woman on a street. She was not attractive, but was a perfect girl for him. After missing the chance to talk to her, he contemplates on how he should have approached her.', 'A man ran into a woman on a street. She was not attractive, but was a perfect girl for him. After missing the chance to talk to her, he contemplates on how he should have approached her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWkibJP2h3vI3Irgln59XBfBAsZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258452'),
  ('614388896363216345', 'A Girl''s Own Story', 1984, 'Drama', 'Jane Campion, Sally Bongers', 'Jane Campion', 'Gabrielle Shornegg, Geraldine Haywood, Marina Knight, John Godden, Joanne Gabbe, Colleen Fitzpatrick, Paul Chubb, Jane Edwards', null, 'This early short from director Jane Campion concerns a group of teenage girls in the 1960s.', 'This early short from director Jane Campion concerns a group of teenage girls in the 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mG0A2rBbeDscodPcxHfSPmAVSWi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69906'),
  ('394113923992822697', 'A Girl''s Tears', 1980, 'Drama', 'Iosif Demian', null, 'Dorel Vișan, Dragoş Pâslaru, George Negoescu, Horia Baciu, Mihai Oroveanu, Luiza Orosz, George Bosun, Costel Rădulescu', null, 'A cinema-verite approach to this mystery story about the death of a young girl in a village adds credence to the story itself, it is as though the audience were following along with a real investigation instead of simply watching a narrative unfold. An inspector and his police team arrive to find out why the young girl drowned -- under suspicious circumstances -- and start to work interviewing the villagers. Shown in close-up and individually on the screen, each witness contributes to a growing knowledge that the girl was sexually assaulted and beaten before she died, and the real mystery is why no one reacted to the horror. As the interviews continue, the inspector realizes it will not be easy to extract the whole truth from any of the guarded, close-mouthed villagers.', 'A cinema-verite approach to this mystery story about the death of a young girl in a village adds credence to the story itself, it is as though the audience were following along with a real investigation instead of simply watching a narrative unfold. An inspector and his police team arrive to find out why the young girl drowned -- under suspicious circumstances -- and start to work interviewing the villagers. Shown in close-up and individually on the screen, each witness contributes to a growing knowledge that the girl was sexually assaulted and beaten before she died, and the real mystery is why no one reacted to the horror. As the interviews continue, the inspector realizes it will not be easy to extract the whole truth from any of the guarded, close-mouthed villagers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/19ZhvExXysjh6Pngkpb3VTTTHEu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390017'),
  ('72242651007978692', 'A Glass of Water', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Yuli Karasik, Vladimir Chukhnov, Maria Filimonova', 'Yury Saulsky', 'Kirill Lavrov, Natalya Belokhvostikova, Alla Demidova, Svetlana Smirnova, Peteris Gaudins, Nina Veselovskaya', null, 'When a small state is threatened with capture by a much stronger one, only one thing can save it: the emergence of a competitor comparable to the invader. In a graceful and witty play by Scribe, hostilities unfold around a young officer, in whom the modest saleswoman of a jewelry store, the omnipotent Duchess of Marlborough and the Queen of England herself fell in love at the same time.', 'When a small state is threatened with capture by a much stronger one, only one thing can save it: the emergence of a competitor comparable to the invader. In a graceful and witty play by Scribe, hostilities unfold around a young officer, in whom the modest saleswoman of a jewelry store, the omnipotent Duchess of Marlborough and the Queen of England herself fell in love at the same time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3GB4oPJa2KR1lIPawB4NyHxPhVf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143066'),
  ('466648037545540555', 'A Glenbrooke Christmas', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Eric J. Goldstein, David I. Strasser', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Autumn Reeser, Antonio Cupo, Camille Mitchell, Mark Brandon, Michael Denis, Tiffany Mo, Deborah Finkel, Jennifer Tong', 'G', 'As Christmas nears, heiress Jessica Morgan seizes what seems like her last chance to experience a relaxed Christmas and heads off to the small town of Glenbrooke, where she meets a handsome fireman.', 'As Christmas nears, heiress Jessica Morgan seizes what seems like her last chance to experience a relaxed Christmas and heads off to the small town of Glenbrooke, where she meets a handsome fireman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2Q7WtmhXlDp8rDwTdmKBxiIMTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746056'),
  ('620220214692270115', 'A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Roman Coppola, Nick Beal, Rod Smith', 'Roman Coppola', 'Charlie Sheen, Jason Schwartzman, Bill Murray, Katheryn Winnick, Patricia Arquette, Aubrey Plaza, Dermot Mulroney, Mary Elizabeth Winstead', 'R', 'Charles Swan III, a successful graphic designer, has it all: fame, money and devilish charm that have provided him with a seemingly perfect life. But when a perplexing beauty named Ivana suddenly ends their relationship, Charles is left heartbroken. With the support of his loyal intimates - Kirby, Saul, and his sister, Izzy – Charles begins a delirious journey of self-reflection to try and come to terms with a life without Ivana. "A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III" is an unconventional melodrama told in a bold and playful style.', 'Charles Swan III, a successful graphic designer, has it all: fame, money and devilish charm that have provided him with a seemingly perfect life. But when a perplexing beauty named Ivana suddenly ends their relationship, Charles is left heartbroken. With the support of his loyal intimates - Kirby, Saul, and his sister, Izzy – Charles begins a delirious journey of self-reflection to try and come to terms with a life without Ivana. "A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III" is an unconventional melodrama told in a bold and playful style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bFI9LR2Bw0R57aobRLiN08rWtpn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124461'),
  ('784817036905020379', 'A Glitch in the Matrix', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Rodney Ascher, George Feucht', 'Rodney Ascher', 'Nick Bostrom, Joshua Cooke, Erik Davis, Philip K. Dick, Paul Gude, Alex Levine, Laeo Mystwood, Jesse Orion', null, 'Are we in fact living in a simulation? This is the question postulated, wrestled with, and ultimately argued for through archival footage, compelling interviews with real people shrouded in digital avatars, and a collection of cases from some of our most iconoclastic figures in contemporary culture.', 'Are we in fact living in a simulation? This is the question postulated, wrestled with, and ultimately argued for through archival footage, compelling interviews with real people shrouded in digital avatars, and a collection of cases from some of our most iconoclastic figures in contemporary culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bn0BLVadmvzq6MmJ0n97MLxGpNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:696109'),
  ('319519575062221718', 'A Gnome Named Gnorm', 1991, 'Family, Fantasy, Comedy, Adventure', 'Stan Winston, Bojan Bazelli, Jack Gill', 'Pen Densham, John Watson', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Jerry Orbach, Claudia Christian, Eli Danker, Robert Z''Dar, Mark Harelik, Rob Paulsen, Mike Avery', 'PG', 'A young Los Angeles police officer and a mysterious gnome become unlikely partners as they track a killer. When a sting operation goes awry, officer Casey is blamed for the murder of his colleague and Gnorm the gnome is the only witness.', 'A young Los Angeles police officer and a mysterious gnome become unlikely partners as they track a killer. When a sting operation goes awry, officer Casey is blamed for the murder of his colleague and Gnorm the gnome is the only witness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vc9t3j1VHMsSGBhiYRF1fe56DIs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21357'),
  ('134933596915550494', 'A Go! Go! Cory Carson Christmas', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Stanley Moore, Alex Woo', 'Ying Hsuan Chen, Vincent Lau, David Ochs', 'Alan C. Lim, Taron C. Hensley, Maisie Benson, Kerry Gudjohnsen, Paul Killam, Smith Foreman, Ann Kendrick, Ella Joy Ballesteros', null, 'When a familiar-looking stranger crashes in without a memory, cory helps him remember the magic of Christmas to save the holiday for everyone', 'When a familiar-looking stranger crashes in without a memory, cory helps him remember the magic of Christmas to save the holiday for everyone', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fTsULguy08O7nRmkhifnGtAcDq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:766534'),
  ('598455466792397562', 'A Go! Go! Cory Carson Halloween', 2020, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie', 'Stanley Moore, Alex Woo, Kim Donovan', 'Tyler Hendrix, Vincent Lau, David Ochs', 'Alan C. Lim, Maisie Benson, Smith Foreman, Ann Kendrick, Kerry Gudjohnsen, Paul Killam, Stanley Moore, Tyler Hendrix', 'G', 'Cory, Chrissy and Freddie are on the hunt for king-sized candy bars this Halloween! But are all the treats worth the trek to the spooky side of town?', 'Cory, Chrissy and Freddie are on the hunt for king-sized candy bars this Halloween! But are all the treats worth the trek to the spooky side of town?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tEE93qOoF24wFaqNjd7fxyZz8Ni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:748440'),
  ('533499195288678817', 'A Godwink Christmas: Miracle of Love', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Heather Hawthorn-Doyle, Jesse D.E. Young', 'John Wierick, Jamie Pachino', 'Katherine Barrell, Alberto Frezza, Lauren Bradley, Christine Cattell, Calix Miguel, Lesley Mirza, Josh Ssettuba, Faith Wright', null, 'Brought together by community service, Eric and Joy find new purpose at Christmas. As they help a family rebuild their home, coincidences and a medical miracle lead them to believe in destiny.', 'Brought together by community service, Eric and Joy find new purpose at Christmas. As they help a family rebuild their home, coincidences and a medical miracle lead them to believe in destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xUkhzklFW3p5m3cNVO5Mqb7n5B3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888506'),
  ('585629320735168056', 'A Godwink Christmas: Second Chance, First Love', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie, Drama', 'Dana Barnaby, Heather Hawthorn-Doyle', 'John Tinker, Jamie Pachino', 'Brooke D''Orsay, Sam Page, Michele Scarabelli, Zahf Paroo, Samantha Schimmer, Cameron Paisley, Rhys Slack, Katrina Reynolds', null, 'After 15 years, Pat moves home from Hawaii with his two sons and through a series of coincidences, or Godwinks, ends up stuck in traffic next to his high school sweetheart, Margie, at Christmas.', 'After 15 years, Pat moves home from Hawaii with his two sons and through a series of coincidences, or Godwinks, ends up stuck in traffic next to his high school sweetheart, Margie, at Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl9hSMTOUQKhN50oMjJYcJd4uUd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746051'),
  ('583802686686509521', 'A Golden Boy', 2014, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Blasco Giurato, Pupi Avati', 'Pupi Avati, Tommaso Avati', 'Riccardo Scamarcio, Sharon Stone, Cristiana Capotondi, Giovanna Ralli, Ascanio Balbo, Lucia Rossi, Christian Stelluti, Osvaldo Ruggieri', null, 'A young copywriter moves to Rome in the wake of his screenwriter father''s death, where he meets a publisher who wants to release his dad''s autobiography.', 'A young copywriter moves to Rome in the wake of his screenwriter father''s death, where he meets a publisher who wants to release his dad''s autobiography.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLxxg1H1XF0YHPrjdwG5Zi1Y1Df.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293264'),
  ('737489544307642604', 'A Golden Christmas', 2009, 'Family, Romance, Comedy', 'John Murlowski, Roger Udwin, Athena Pesante', 'Jay Cipriani', 'Andrea Roth, Nicholas Brendon, Elisa Donovan, Bruce Davison, Alley Mills, Jason London, Daniel Zykov, Melody Hollis', null, 'After a magical summer together, a nine-year-old boy whispers his heart into the ear of a best friend. With a loyal, golden dog by their side, the boy and girl bury a time capsule of keepsakes and then go their separate ways. Years later, looking for a fresh start, a man and woman each return to the place they felt most at home as a child. But a comedic case of unknown identity has them competing for the same childhood memories and Christmas escapades ensue. For the sake of their happiness, they must discover their common past before they turn each other''s lives completely upside down. Can a golden dog lead them home?', 'After a magical summer together, a nine-year-old boy whispers his heart into the ear of a best friend. With a loyal, golden dog by their side, the boy and girl bury a time capsule of keepsakes and then go their separate ways. Years later, looking for a fresh start, a man and woman each return to the place they felt most at home as a child. But a comedic case of unknown identity has them competing for the same childhood memories and Christmas escapades ensue. For the sake of their happiness, they must discover their common past before they turn each other''s lives completely upside down. Can a golden dog lead them home?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/geJnEoVTWUFdDEiGziJNvP2m3ni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51848'),
  ('691316452768136586', 'A Golden Widow', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Michel Audiard', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Michel Audiard', 'Michèle Mercier, Claude Rich, Roger Carel, Jean Carmet, Daniel Ceccaldi, Jean-Pierre Darras, Mario David, Folco Lulli', null, 'A woman learns that she is sole legatee of her forgotten rich uncle, but there is a small problem: she''s got to be a widow to latch onto the dough or the fortune will go to a vague sect...', 'A woman learns that she is sole legatee of her forgotten rich uncle, but there is a small problem: she''s got to be a widow to latch onto the dough or the fortune will go to a vague sect...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dnxLv7UbtGhDQN6uepMFQIaFA4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:355096'),
  ('512140913548314515', 'A golpes', 2005, 'Drama', 'Juan Vicente Córdoba', 'Juan Vicente Córdoba, María Reyes Arias', 'Natalia Verbeke, Daniel Guzmán, María Vázquez, Marian Álvarez, Juana Acosta, María Reyes Arias', null, 'María, Juanita, Vicky, Mena and Nitzia (Zay Nuba) are 5 girls who live on the outskirts of Madrid without an encouraging future. Their only recourse to survive is by doing muggings. They know it''s wrong but can''t find another solution. Only love will ease their pain', 'María, Juanita, Vicky, Mena and Nitzia (Zay Nuba) are 5 girls who live on the outskirts of Madrid without an encouraging future. Their only recourse to survive is by doing muggings. They know it''s wrong but can''t find another solution. Only love will ease their pain', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSRLMM2W9oHzhVFFT3No29GzexS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81780'),
  ('16135889236963183', 'A Good Beer', 1892, 'Animation', 'Émile Reynaud', 'Émile Reynaud', null, null, 'One of the first animated short films. A wanderer enters a cabaret in the countryside and asks a waitress for a beer. She comes back with a pint, as the wanderer begins to court her. However, the kitchen boy comes, drinks the beer and vanishes. The wanderer, misunderstanding, asks for another beer. Then a traveler enters and has an argument with the wandered. During the argument, the kitchen boy appears, sips the second beer and runs away. As the traveler quits, the customer finds his glass empty again. He calls the waitress, expresses his disappointment and leaves. The kitchen boy comes in and explains to the waitress what he did with the two beers. They make fun together of the wanderer and leave. A lost film.', 'One of the first animated short films. A wanderer enters a cabaret in the countryside and asks a waitress for a beer. She comes back with a pint, as the wanderer begins to court her. However, the kitchen boy comes, drinks the beer and vanishes. The wanderer, misunderstanding, asks for another beer. Then a traveler enters and has an argument with the wandered. During the argument, the kitchen boy appears, sips the second beer and runs away. As the traveler quits, the customer finds his glass empty again. He calls the waitress, expresses his disappointment and leaves. The kitchen boy comes in and explains to the waitress what he did with the two beers. They make fun together of the wanderer and leave. A lost film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osv0TcCymlsOucqkZBssSuS4tD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16622'),
  ('948046096114383445', 'A Good Day', 2010, 'Drama', 'Nicolás del Boca, Joseph Angel Gallegos, Carlos Reza', 'Enrique Torres', 'Lucila Solá, Anibal Silveyra, Andrea Del Boca', null, 'A relationship develops between two lonely Argentines who meet by chance in a California cafe. They talk, feel and love like us. Except most of the time, we don''t realize that "A Good Day" can mean our entire life.', 'A relationship develops between two lonely Argentines who meet by chance in a California cafe. They talk, feel and love like us. Except most of the time, we don''t realize that "A Good Day" can mean our entire life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wSQNy5S7XGUPTIr4VJT1D425KSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424211'),
  ('129187436538916909', 'A Good Day to Die Hard', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'John Moore, László Szirmai, Jonathan Sela', 'Skip Woods', 'Bruce Willis, Jai Courtney, Sebastian Koch, Yuliya Snigir, Radivoje Bukvić, Cole Hauser, Sergey Kolesnikov, Amaury Nolasco', 'R', 'Iconoclastic, take-no-prisoners cop John McClane, finds himself for the first time on foreign soil after traveling to Moscow to help his wayward son Jack - unaware that Jack is really a highly-trained CIA operative out to stop a nuclear weapons heist. With the Russian underworld in pursuit, and battling a countdown to war, the two McClanes discover that their opposing methods make them unstoppable heroes.', 'Iconoclastic, take-no-prisoners cop John McClane, finds himself for the first time on foreign soil after traveling to Moscow to help his wayward son Jack - unaware that Jack is really a highly-trained CIA operative out to stop a nuclear weapons heist. With the Russian underworld in pursuit, and battling a countdown to war, the two McClanes discover that their opposing methods make them unstoppable heroes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qJ0csDXAVFMsNn0cRcjy6W6PxAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47964'),
  ('718027687211538418', 'A Good Day to Have an Affair', 2007, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jang Moon-il, Kim Yeong-ho, Kim Yeong-seok', 'Mun-il Jang, Chan-ok Joo', 'Kim Hye-soo, Yoon Jin-seo, Lee Jong-hyuk, Lee Min-ki, Park Hyuk-kwon, Hwang Jeong-min, Yoon Sul-hee, Park Sang-myeon', null, 'Two married women start to have an affair with men they met online. However, one of them gets caught, and the other feels disappointed at the man.', 'Two married women start to have an affair with men they met online. However, one of them gets caught, and the other feels disappointed at the man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qkstvvE3kpzQZlMStu06SBws92J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52578'),
  ('599657309223181614', 'A Good Doctor', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Frédéric Noirhomme, Elodie Gay, Tristan Séguéla', 'Jim Birmant, Tristan Séguéla', 'Michel Blanc, Hakim Jemili, Solène Rigot, Chantal Lauby, Franck Gastambide, Fadily Camara, Artus, Jacques Boudet', null, 'On Christmas eve, Serge is the only on-call emergency doctor available. Struck by a crippling back-ache, he gets help from a pizza delivery boy who will need to step in the doctor''s shoes.', 'On Christmas eve, Serge is the only on-call emergency doctor available. Struck by a crippling back-ache, he gets help from a pizza delivery boy who will need to step in the doctor''s shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7wx7VMj4eoJUXR4ZVdYVDzFStNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:613349'),
  ('1142323192661778014', 'A Good Fellow', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Ayhan Sonyürek, Barbaros Engin', 'Ayhan Sonyürek', 'Cengiz Bozkurt, Macit Sonkan, Asuman Çakır, Devrim Atmaca, Aysan Sümercan, Tulga Serim, Sevim Gelenbe, Ecren Can Serim', null, 'Mızrap is a 40-year old man who is deemed "no good". He lives in a small town in the province of Antakya. His father throws him out as a bluff, while scolding him, after Mizrap loses his job. But Mizrap, stung by his father''s words, calls him on his bluff and leaves his father, mother, sister and niece to go on a cross-country trip to stay with his old army buddy Salim, who lives in a village near Mersin. Across the hard way he meets a number of representatives of marginalized groups in Turkish society.', 'Mızrap is a 40-year old man who is deemed "no good". He lives in a small town in the province of Antakya. His father throws him out as a bluff, while scolding him, after Mizrap loses his job. But Mizrap, stung by his father''s words, calls him on his bluff and leaves his father, mother, sister and niece to go on a cross-country trip to stay with his old army buddy Salim, who lives in a village near Mersin. Across the hard way he meets a number of representatives of marginalized groups in Turkish society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ag5tjzzEYUZMJV9k0j1QNYjTaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:342792'),
  ('543822466425417249', 'A Good Lawyer''s Wife', 2003, 'Drama, Crime', 'Im Sang-soo, Kim Woo-hyung', 'Im Sang-soo', 'Moon So-ri, Hwang Jung-min, Youn Yuh-jung, Kim In-mun, Bong Tae-gyu, Baek Jeong-rim, Kim Eung-soo, Lee Bong-gyu', null, 'A woman, married and with a child but becoming increasingly distant from her husband who is already cheating on her, reluctantly enters a secret relationship with her neighbor, a teenage boy.', 'A woman, married and with a child but becoming increasingly distant from her husband who is already cheating on her, reluctantly enters a secret relationship with her neighbor, a teenage boy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1txTG5duqYDe4b9RAZTTlBJMYV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61952'),
  ('807577145882274520', 'A Good Man', 2014, 'Action', 'Keoni Waxman, Nathan Wilson, Gabriel Kosuth', 'Keoni Waxman', 'Steven Seagal, Victor Webster, Tzi Ma, Iulia Verdes, Massimo Dobrović, Elias Ferkin, Bogdan Farcaș, Ron Balicki', 'R', 'After an illustrious special ops career ends in disaster, Alexander goes off the grid and attempts to lead a quiet life as a handyman at an apartment complex. But when one of his tenants and her family fall under the thumb of a Russian gangster, Alexander is dragged into an all-out war between rival Chinese and Russian gangs; forcing him to not only defend the family, but bringing him face to face with an old foe, and giving him one more chance to reconcile his past.', 'After an illustrious special ops career ends in disaster, Alexander goes off the grid and attempts to lead a quiet life as a handyman at an apartment complex. But when one of his tenants and her family fall under the thumb of a Russian gangster, Alexander is dragged into an all-out war between rival Chinese and Russian gangs; forcing him to not only defend the family, but bringing him face to face with an old foe, and giving him one more chance to reconcile his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8ZAST0OBH6bSdZSdQbviQxh2CT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286668'),
  ('622588951338706937', 'A Good Man', 2021, 'Drama', 'Myriam Vinocour, Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar', 'Christian Sonderegger, Marie-Castille Mention-Schaar', 'Noémie Merlant, Soko, Vincent Dedienne, Gabriel Almaer, Alysson Paradis, Anne Loiret, Geneviève Mnich, Jonas Ben Ahmed', null, 'Benjamin and Aude have loved each other for 7 years. They live together on a small island in Brittany. Benjamin dreams of starting a family but the couple learns that Aude is sterile. So Benjamin has an idea. He is the one who will bear their child because before being Benjamin, his name was Sarah.', 'Benjamin and Aude have loved each other for 7 years. They live together on a small island in Brittany. Benjamin dreams of starting a family but the couple learns that Aude is sterile. So Benjamin has an idea. He is the one who will bear their child because before being Benjamin, his name was Sarah.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iFh6BFyIMxOy2mnuBZeNWILMdtQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712113'),
  ('269386542613229880', 'A Good Man in Africa', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Bruce Beresford', 'William Boyd', 'Colin Friels, Sean Connery, John Lithgow, Diana Rigg, Joanne Whalley, Louis Gossett Jr., Maynard Eziashi, Jeremy Crutchley', 'R', 'Morgan Leafy is a secretary to the British High Commissioner to an Africa nation. Leafy is a man that makes himself useful to his boss, the snobbish Arthur Fanshawe, who has no clue about what''s going on around him, but who wants to use his secretary to carry on his dirty work, which involves getting one of the most powerful men in the country to do business with his country.The young secretary has an eye for beautiful women around him, especially Hazel, a native beauty, with whom he is having an affair. Things get complicated because Sam Adekunle, a man running for president of the country, wants a favor from Leafy in return after he has accepted the invitation to visit London. The proposition involves swaying a prominent doctor''s opposition to a plan that will make Adenkule filthy rich.', 'Morgan Leafy is a secretary to the British High Commissioner to an Africa nation. Leafy is a man that makes himself useful to his boss, the snobbish Arthur Fanshawe, who has no clue about what''s going on around him, but who wants to use his secretary to carry on his dirty work, which involves getting one of the most powerful men in the country to do business with his country.The young secretary has an eye for beautiful women around him, especially Hazel, a native beauty, with whom he is having an affair. Things get complicated because Sam Adekunle, a man running for president of the country, wants a favor from Leafy in return after he has accepted the invitation to visit London. The proposition involves swaying a prominent doctor''s opposition to a plan that will make Adenkule filthy rich.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BBZLZVEANsnCVqIF9fgf0bshQD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41006'),
  ('570953487259732033', 'A Good Marriage', 1982, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Éric Rohmer, Bernard Lutic', 'Éric Rohmer', 'Béatrice Romand, André Dussollier, Arielle Dombasle, Thamila Mezbah, Féodor Atkine, Vincent Gauthier, Sophie Renoir, Hervé Duhamel', null, 'Sabine vows to give up married lovers, and is determined to find a good husband. Her best friend Clarisse introduces her to her cousin Edmond, a busy lawyer from Paris. Sabine pursues Edmond, with the encouragement of Clarisse, but Edmond does not seem very interested.', 'Sabine vows to give up married lovers, and is determined to find a good husband. Her best friend Clarisse introduces her to her cousin Edmond, a busy lawyer from Paris. Sabine pursues Edmond, with the encouragement of Clarisse, but Edmond does not seem very interested.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ny5UBhczFyJ2Nnp8CMIBFZ184jd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2861'),
  ('521623993252644387', 'A Good Marriage', 2014, 'Thriller', 'Peter Askin, Frankie DeMarco', 'Stephen King', 'Joan Allen, Anthony LaPaglia, Stephen Lang, Cara Buono, Kristen Connolly, Mike O''Malley, Theo Stockman, Will Rogers', 'R', 'After 25 years of a good marriage, what will Darcy do once she discovers her husband''s sinister secret?', 'After 25 years of a good marriage, what will Darcy do once she discovers her husband''s sinister secret?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8odAiCOM9qwzzGRW69aKfAvK85q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288281'),
  ('410609635051275436', 'A Good Old Fashioned Orgy', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Peter Huyck, John Thomas, Alex Gregory', 'Peter Huyck, Alex Gregory', 'Jason Sudeikis, Leslie Bibb, Lindsay Sloane, Lake Bell, Michelle Borth, Nick Kroll, Tyler Labine, Angela Sarafyan', 'R', 'A group of 30-year-olds who have been friends since high school attempt to throw an end-of-summer orgy.', 'A group of 30-year-olds who have been friends since high school attempt to throw an end-of-summer orgy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lyMNAAaKb3pZHoVXVDQExCmzVI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69778'),
  ('491968589551700169', 'A Good Person', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Neil Daly, Robert Levi, Mauro Fiore', 'Zach Braff', 'Florence Pugh, Morgan Freeman, Molly Shannon, Celeste O''Connor, Zoe Lister-Jones, Chinaza Uche, Toby Onwumere, Nichelle Hines', 'R', 'Allison''s life falls apart following her involvement in a fatal accident. The unlikely relationship she forms with her would-be father-in-law helps her live a life worth living.', 'Allison''s life falls apart following her involvement in a fatal accident. The unlikely relationship she forms with her would-be father-in-law helps her live a life worth living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dhejMQdsqPtTTCKIkyoJ5FLfC3F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:800787'),
  ('976327540029382339', 'A Good Time for a Dime', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Dick Lundy', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald visits a penny arcade where he sees a risque Daisy dancing in one of the nickelodeon shows and later has trouble with the airplane ride.', 'Donald visits a penny arcade where he sees a risque Daisy dancing in one of the nickelodeon shows and later has trouble with the airplane ride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/905Vf5rWw7yok2SPI8FFCi9iJVW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61441'),
  ('991945975096711487', 'A Good Woman', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mike Barker, Ben Seresin', 'Howard Himelstein', 'Helen Hunt, Scarlett Johansson, Tom Wilkinson, Stephen Campbell Moore, Mark Umbers, Milena Vukotić, Diana Hardcastle, Roger Hammond', 'PG', 'Fleeing 1930s New York and leaving behind a chequered past, the giltzy divorcee Mrs Stella Erlynne travels to Italy''s sun-dappled Amalfi coast. Mrs Erlynne''s appearance causes a stir amongst the visiting aristocracy. Based on the Oscar Wilde play "Lady Windemere''s Fan."', 'Fleeing 1930s New York and leaving behind a chequered past, the giltzy divorcee Mrs Stella Erlynne travels to Italy''s sun-dappled Amalfi coast. Mrs Erlynne''s appearance causes a stir amongst the visiting aristocracy. Based on the Oscar Wilde play "Lady Windemere''s Fan."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/C6D8RHgGtGsGnpMTpRIiVwhFAu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15184'),
  ('291584655099204007', 'A Good Woman Is Hard to Find', 2019, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Andrew Robinson, Virginia Apicella, Abner Pastoll', 'Ronan Blaney', 'Sarah Bolger, Edward Hogg, Andrew Simpson, Jane Brennan, Caolan Byrne, Packy Lee, Rudy Doherty, Macie McCauley', null, 'The recently widowed mother of two, Sarah, is desperate to know who murdered her husband in front of her young son, rendering him mute. Coerced into helping a low-life drug dealer stash narcotics stolen from the local Mr. Big, she''s forced into taking drastic action to protect her children, evolving from downtrodden submissive to take-charge vigilante.', 'The recently widowed mother of two, Sarah, is desperate to know who murdered her husband in front of her young son, rendering him mute. Coerced into helping a low-life drug dealer stash narcotics stolen from the local Mr. Big, she''s forced into taking drastic action to protect her children, evolving from downtrodden submissive to take-charge vigilante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r52hvxb75CL6HCD8Yndxk38ozY8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:500656'),
  ('725046263850217156', 'A Good Year', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Ridley Scott, Philippe Le Sourd, Darin Rivetti', 'Marc Klein', 'Russell Crowe, Albert Finney, Marion Cotillard, Abbie Cornish, Didier Bourdon, Tom Hollander, Freddie Highmore, Isabelle Candelier', 'PG-13', 'Failed London banker Max Skinner inherits his uncle''s vineyard in Provence, where he spent many childhood holidays. Upon his arrival, he meets a woman from California who tells Max she is his long-lost cousin and that the property is hers.', 'Failed London banker Max Skinner inherits his uncle''s vineyard in Provence, where he spent many childhood holidays. Upon his arrival, he meets a woman from California who tells Max she is his long-lost cousin and that the property is hers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/10ErazhJxfL68rWg2KLfwiRuIou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9726'),
  ('568437102230167632', 'A Goofy Movie', 1995, 'Adventure, Comedy, Romance, Animation, Family', 'Kevin Lima', 'Jymn Magon, Brian Pimental, Chris Matheson', 'Bill Farmer, Jason Marsden, Rob Paulsen, Jim Cummings, Kellie Martin, Kevin Lima, Jenna Von Oÿ, Joey Lawrence', 'G', 'Goofy’s teenage son Max is desperate to impress his crush and fit in at school. After well-meaning but ignorant Goofy suddenly whisks him away on a cross-country road trip—messing up Max’s first date plans in the process—Goofy’s old-school parenting and Max’s desire for independence lead to a vacation of hilarious mishaps, as they both learn to see eye to eye and listen to eachother.', 'Goofy’s teenage son Max is desperate to impress his crush and fit in at school. After well-meaning but ignorant Goofy suddenly whisks him away on a cross-country road trip—messing up Max’s first date plans in the process—Goofy’s old-school parenting and Max’s desire for independence lead to a vacation of hilarious mishaps, as they both learn to see eye to eye and listen to eachother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bycmMhO3iIoEDzP768sUjq2RV4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15789'),
  ('791231122220754935', 'A Gorgeous Girl Like Me', 1972, 'Comedy, Crime', 'François Truffaut, Pierre-William Glenn, Jean-François Stévenin', 'François Truffaut, Jean-Loup Dabadie', 'Bernadette Lafont, Claude Brasseur, Charles Denner, Guy Marchand, André Dussollier, Anne Kreis, Philippe Léotard, Gilberte Géniat', 'R', 'Young sociologist Stanislas Previne is writing a thesis on criminal women, so he visits Camille Bliss in prison for an interview. Accused of murdering her husband and her lover, Camille recounts her life and love affairs.', 'Young sociologist Stanislas Previne is writing a thesis on criminal women, so he visits Camille Bliss in prison for an interview. Accused of murdering her husband and her lover, Camille recounts her life and love affairs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b2WwhSb7Ia53Q1n4GehBIyPewAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4683'),
  ('643654075541814971', 'A Grand Day Out', 1990, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'Nick Park, Nick Park', 'Nick Park', 'Peter Sallis', 'G', 'Wallace and Gromit have run out of cheese, and this provides an excellent excuse for the duo to take their holiday to the moon, where, as everyone knows, there is ample cheese.', 'Wallace and Gromit have run out of cheese, and this provides an excellent excuse for the duo to take their holiday to the moon, where, as everyone knows, there is ample cheese.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5e3r12VwfUotN36fBr1DNeCD4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:530'),
  ('266965693983742763', 'A Grandpa for Christmas', 2007, 'Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Harvey Frost', 'David Alexander', 'Ernest Borgnine, Katherine Helmond, Juliette Goglia, Richard Libertini, Tracy Nelson, Jamie Farr, Quinn K. Redeker, Timilee Romolini', null, 'An old-time movie-star singer/ hoofer rebonds with his estranged daughter and 9-year-old granddaughter.', 'An old-time movie-star singer/ hoofer rebonds with his estranged daughter and 9-year-old granddaughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cc3TfpWlulbEfq8NJX2z5YI06rm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72140'),
  ('109300630924866492', 'A Great Awakening', 2026, 'Drama, History', 'Joshua Enck, Steve Buckwalter, Andrew Bolzman', 'Joshua Enck, Jonathan Blair, Jeff Bender', 'John Paul Sneed, Jonathan Blair, JT Schaeffer, Josh Bates, Joe Dignoti, Stephen Foster Harris, Zac Johnson, Matt Meyer', 'PG-13', 'A GREAT AWAKENING tells the true story of an unlikely friendship between the Reverend George Whitefield and Benjamin Franklin that resulted in one of the most defining moments in American history. With the colonies on the brink of collapse, the Reverend George Whitefield ignites the first Great Awakening, uniting an entire generation with his thundering and faithful sermons and proclamations of liberty. In a miraculous turn of events, one of Whitefield’s closest friends and greatest promoters becomes none other than Benjamin Franklin. With the nation’s freedom hanging in the balance, the founders discover true liberty cannot only be written into law - it must be awakened in the hearts of the people.', 'A GREAT AWAKENING tells the true story of an unlikely friendship between the Reverend George Whitefield and Benjamin Franklin that resulted in one of the most defining moments in American history. With the colonies on the brink of collapse, the Reverend George Whitefield ignites the first Great Awakening, uniting an entire generation with his thundering and faithful sermons and proclamations of liberty. In a miraculous turn of events, one of Whitefield’s closest friends and greatest promoters becomes none other than Benjamin Franklin. With the nation’s freedom hanging in the balance, the founders discover true liberty cannot only be written into law - it must be awakened in the hearts of the people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rd7BsFaHO7JaYlz3WHUvqHjgm60.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1341137'),
  ('1005527296080962544', 'A Great Big Bunch of You', 1932, 'Animation, Family', 'Rudolf Ising', null, 'Johnny Murray', null, 'A mannequin in the city dump improvises a working piano from junk, then plays and sings the title song. Various discarded items join in with song or dance.', 'A mannequin in the city dump improvises a working piano from junk, then plays and sings the title song. Various discarded items join in with song or dance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQcTX9kgvmzbKVH8cZiEWU2KsTF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161572'),
  ('264890342482135695', 'A Great Friend', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Éric Besnard, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Éric Besnard', 'Grégory Gadebois, Lambert Wilson, Marie Gillain, Betty Pierucci Berthoud, Magali Bonat, Antoine Gouy, Amandine Longeac, Déborah Lamy', null, 'Vincent is a famous successful entrepreneur. One day, a car breakdown on a mountain road temporarily interrupts his frantic lifestyle. Pierre, who lives apart from the modern world in the middle of sublime nature, comes to his aid and offers him his hospitality. The meeting between these two men, who are opposites will upset their respective beliefs and they will find themselves laughing. The question is...deep down, are they really each living the lives they want to live?', 'Vincent is a famous successful entrepreneur. One day, a car breakdown on a mountain road temporarily interrupts his frantic lifestyle. Pierre, who lives apart from the modern world in the middle of sublime nature, comes to his aid and offers him his hospitality. The meeting between these two men, who are opposites will upset their respective beliefs and they will find themselves laughing. The question is...deep down, are they really each living the lives they want to live?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/70GmOX3yhKETP4KzXmeH3OQOQ0h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000572'),
  ('393551891640365818', 'A Great Wall', 1986, 'Drama, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Wang, Robert Primes, Peter Stein', 'Peter Wang, Shirley Sun', 'Peter Wang, Kelvin Han Yee, Sharon Iwai, Li Qinqin, Hu Xiaoguang, Guanglan Shen, Kelvin Wong Siu, Xiu Jian', null, 'When computer programmer, Leo Fang, is passed up for promotion, he feels it is because he is Chinese, and quits. He takes his Chinese-American family to Mainland China to visit his relatives, the Chao''s for a vacation. The clash of cultures, between the men, wives, and teenagers, leads to some confusion, and misunderstanding.', 'When computer programmer, Leo Fang, is passed up for promotion, he feels it is because he is Chinese, and quits. He takes his Chinese-American family to Mainland China to visit his relatives, the Chao''s for a vacation. The clash of cultures, between the men, wives, and teenagers, leads to some confusion, and misunderstanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgGUTTo5AylBEkjnOfvT6iIFWQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216472'),
  ('901687455505505709', 'A Greek Tragedy', 1985, 'Animation', 'Nicole Van Goethem', null, null, null, 'Three scantily-clad female figures struggle to hold up the crumbling remains of an ancient Greek temple.', 'Three scantily-clad female figures struggle to hold up the crumbling remains of an ancient Greek temple.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9K7bz2DqgQXQ5IrV0yLFS7mXlJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48698'),
  ('949759021068838327', 'A Greek woman in a Harem', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Dinos Mavroeidis', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Rena Vlahopoulou, Hronis Exarhakos, Vagelis Seilinos, Maria Ioannidou, Giorgos Gavriilidis, Dimitris Kalivokas, Maria Bonelou, Veta Xanthopoulou', null, 'Poor Rena tries to find money to pay her lottery partner because she destroyed the wining lottery-ticket.She and her brothers who try to help her end up in harem.', 'Poor Rena tries to find money to pay her lottery partner because she destroyed the wining lottery-ticket.She and her brothers who try to help her end up in harem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWDUWGZLnFOzOYUcod9t121zVrx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329204'),
  ('799861965943637337', 'A Greyhound of a Girl', 2023, 'Animation, Drama, Family, Fantasy', 'Enzo D''Alò', 'Dave Ingham, Enzo D''Alò', 'Charlotte Infussi D''Amico, Maria Pia Di Meo, Maricla Affatato, Valentina Favazza, Franco Mannella, Alessandro Carloni, Alberto Vannini, Oreste Baldini', null, 'Mary is a 12-year-old girl with a passion for cooking, absorbing information from her grandmother, who is a wonderful cook. However, Mary and her family must come to terms with her grandmother''s illness.', 'Mary is a 12-year-old girl with a passion for cooking, absorbing information from her grandmother, who is a wonderful cook. However, Mary and her family must come to terms with her grandmother''s illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imHqX5wpta78Drj3KRSmHNoiSFV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:588564'),
  ('242157481024037531', 'A Grin Without a Cat', 1977, 'Documentary', 'Chris Marker, Pierre-William Glenn, Willy Kurant', 'Chris Marker', 'Laurence Guvillier, Davos Hanich, François Maspero, Yves Montand, François Périer, Sandra Scarnati, Jorge Semprún, Simone Signoret', null, 'Chris Marker’s A Grin Without a Cat is an epic political essay tracing the rise and decline of the global left from the 1960s to the 1970s. Through archival footage and commentary, the film examines revolutionary movements in France, Latin America, and beyond, reflecting on the ideals, failures, and fading hopes of a generation.', 'Chris Marker’s A Grin Without a Cat is an epic political essay tracing the rise and decline of the global left from the 1960s to the 1970s. Through archival footage and commentary, the film examines revolutionary movements in France, Latin America, and beyond, reflecting on the ideals, failures, and fading hopes of a generation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7KC692Zb0rKYOpXDujJQSHdTok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53197'),
  ('936598972816524791', 'A Groom from a Security Agency', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ahmed Abdel Aziz, Ahmad Al-Sayed, Nehad Kamal', 'Youssef Maaty', 'Adel Emam, Haala Shiha, Sherif Mounir, Lebleba, Ahmed Zaher, Riko, Ashraf Abdel Baky, Abd Allah Meshref', null, 'A businessman who loves his daughter very much, refuses every man who proposes for her in order not to leave him. But can he refuse a man from a security entity?', 'A businessman who loves his daughter very much, refuses every man who proposes for her in order not to leave him. But can he refuse a man from a security entity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JOrlF4qcxzdnzW7x3OuzKt3urn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87059'),
  ('488489322588346312', 'A Groom from the Right Society', 1958, 'Comedy', 'Leonid Gaidai, Valentina Kuznetsova, Leonid Kraynenkov', 'Vladimir Dykhovichnyy, Moris Slobodskoy', 'Rostislav Plyatt, Georgiy Vitsin, Vera Altayskaya, Rina Zelyonaya, Anastasiya Zuyeva, Mariya Kravchunovskaya, Vladimir Vladislavskiy, Zoya Fyodorova', null, 'Semyon Danilovich Petukhov was very surprised to found upon returning from vacation that he was declared dead and... buried.', 'Semyon Danilovich Petukhov was very surprised to found upon returning from vacation that he was declared dead and... buried.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vVnqcUeSnNIDF6q8EEco7DS3PcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92984'),
  ('749655277585375992', 'A Gruesome Twosome', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', 'Warren Foster', 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet', 'NR', 'Two cats (one a caricature of Jimmy Durante) battle violently for the affections of a pretty girl cat, who''ll dispense her favors on the one who brings her a little bird. Unfortunately for the lovestruck felines, the bird in question is a vicious little thing named Tweety.', 'Two cats (one a caricature of Jimmy Durante) battle violently for the affections of a pretty girl cat, who''ll dispense her favors on the one who brings her a little bird. Unfortunately for the lovestruck felines, the bird in question is a vicious little thing named Tweety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79qmzCSGksYG0hciEC9ENsPbF10.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100295'),
  ('1150708499399583710', 'A Guerra dos Rocha', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Jorge Fernando, Paulo de Souza, Guto Graça Melo', 'Maria Carmem Barbosa, Carolina Castro', 'Ary Fontoura, Nicette Bruno, Diogo Vilela, Marcello Antony, Giulia Gam, Lúcio Mauro Filho, Taís Araújo, Ludmila Dayer', null, 'Clumsy old lady Dina Rocha lives with her son Marcelo. After a series of incidents at home, she moves to her house in Santa Teresa. She meets her friend Nonô and she pays a visit to her old friend. Her sons do not know where she is and they go to the hospitals and morgues. Coincidently there is the body of an old lady smashed by a truck and they believe that she is their mother. Meanwhile two smalltime thieves break in Nonô''s house and keep the two old ladies locked in the bathroom. During the funeral of Dina Rocha, the dysfunctional families have a quarrel disputing their heritage.', 'Clumsy old lady Dina Rocha lives with her son Marcelo. After a series of incidents at home, she moves to her house in Santa Teresa. She meets her friend Nonô and she pays a visit to her old friend. Her sons do not know where she is and they go to the hospitals and morgues. Coincidently there is the body of an old lady smashed by a truck and they believe that she is their mother. Meanwhile two smalltime thieves break in Nonô''s house and keep the two old ladies locked in the bathroom. During the funeral of Dina Rocha, the dysfunctional families have a quarrel disputing their heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2f1VlpaUifhIPbAKD5RzRnpOeBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46720'),
  ('252212307718077379', 'A Guest Is Coming', 1947, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Arne Mattsson, Martin Bodin', 'Arne Mattsson, Stieg Trenter', 'Sture Lagerwall, Karl-Arne Holmsten, Erik ''Bullen'' Berglund, Naima Wifstrand, Gerd Hagman, Elsie Albiin, Anita Björk, Ivar Kåge', null, 'It''s Christmas. The owner of an old mansion decides to tell his family he''s going to sell it. The following morning he''s found murdered.', 'It''s Christmas. The owner of an old mansion decides to tell his family he''s going to sell it. The following morning he''s found murdered.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxif6M7hTjoDqSks3866YbIeYC6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258650'),
  ('815973199957674341', 'A Guiana Sumiu...', 2019, 'Comedy, Music', 'Gui Machado, Bianca Frossard, Rodrigo Van Der Put', 'Fábio Porchat', 'Fábio Porchat, Antonio Tabet, Noemia Oliveira, Estevam Nabote, Karina Ramil', null, 'The president of the United States is awakened in the middle of the night with an urgent news: The Guyana has suddenly disappeared from the map.', 'The president of the United States is awakened in the middle of the night with an urgent news: The Guyana has suddenly disappeared from the map.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/otpBfJQcjcKLjMkjc0HxiBlGGRi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:620745'),
  ('554145464822752135', 'A Guide for the Married Man', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gene Kelly, Joseph MacDonald, Paul Helmick', 'Frank Tarloff', 'Walter Matthau, Inger Stevens, Sue Ane Langdon, Jackie Russell, Robert Morse, Aline Towne, Claire Kelly, Eve Brent', 'NR', 'A man gives his friend a series of lessons on how to cheat on one''s wife without being caught.', 'A man gives his friend a series of lessons on how to cheat on one''s wife without being caught.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gAuFxWQwD74Z2huac9fkE3lCvhu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4932'),
  ('1049896998134458233', 'A Guide to Recognizing Your Saints', 2006, 'Crime, Drama', 'Dito Montiel, Éric Gautier', 'Dito Montiel', 'Shia LaBeouf, Channing Tatum, Robert Downey Jr., Rosario Dawson, Melonie Díaz, Chazz Palminteri, Dianne Wiest, Martin Compston', 'R', 'Dito Montiel, a successful author, receives a call from his long-suffering mother, asking him to return home and visit his ailing father. Dito recalls his childhood growing up in a violent neighborhood in Queens, N.Y., with friends Antonio, Giuseppe, Nerf and Mike.', 'Dito Montiel, a successful author, receives a call from his long-suffering mother, asking him to return home and visit his ailing father. Dito recalls his childhood growing up in a violent neighborhood in Queens, N.Y., with friends Antonio, Giuseppe, Nerf and Mike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bGmqGYglMDNN15uGPpeTMWNml1s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8194'),
  ('725323913354045311', 'A Guilty Conscience', 2023, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Chow Long Ting', 'Jack Ng Wai-Lun, Jay Cheung Wan-Ching', 'Dayo Wong Chi-Wah, Louise Wong Tan-Nei, Gardner Tse Kwan-Ho, Renci Yeung, DeeGor Ho, Fish Liew Chi-Yu, Michael Wong, Adam Pak Tin-Nam', null, 'After his negligence causes an innocent woman to go to jail, a lawyer and his colleagues work to clear her name.', 'After his negligence causes an innocent woman to go to jail, a lawyer and his colleagues work to clear her name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IUO7PyXLM3cSVoX4z9f6eIATiM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:990326'),
  ('1134275506882008833', 'A Gun for Jennifer', 1997, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Todd Morris, Eliot Rockett, Joe di Gennaro', 'Todd Morris, Deborah Twiss', 'Deborah Twiss, Benja Kay, Rene Alberta, Tracy Dillon, Veronica Cruz, Freida Hoops, Sheila Schmidt, Beth Dodye Bass', null, 'A woman comes to New York City from Ohio to escape an abusive husband and gets entangled with murderous female vigilantes who prey on abusive men.', 'A woman comes to New York City from Ohio to escape an abusive husband and gets entangled with murderous female vigilantes who prey on abusive men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1zcI84fQpoIPjahvGl0dxXsrGo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129311'),
  ('668173517864908245', 'A Gun for One Hundred Graves', 1968, 'Western', 'Umberto Lenzi, Francisco Ariza, Alejandro Ulloa', 'Marco Leto, Umberto Lenzi', 'Peter Lee Lawrence, John Ireland, Gloria Fernán Osuna, Eduardo Fajardo, Calisto Calisti, Luis de Tejada, Raf Baldassarre, Piero Lulli', null, 'At the end of the Civil War, Jim Slade, a young confederate soldier and conscientious objector, returns to his ranch to find his parents murdered and the ranch practically destroyed. He finds and kills three of the murderers and learns the name of the fourth, a certain Corbett. Finally he discovers Corbett as the leader of a gang that has plans to rob a local bank and is invited to help defend the town from the bandits. Teaming with a preacher, who has an agenda of his own, the two take a stand against Corbett.', 'At the end of the Civil War, Jim Slade, a young confederate soldier and conscientious objector, returns to his ranch to find his parents murdered and the ranch practically destroyed. He finds and kills three of the murderers and learns the name of the fourth, a certain Corbett. Finally he discovers Corbett as the leader of a gang that has plans to rob a local bank and is invited to help defend the town from the bandits. Teaming with a preacher, who has an agenda of his own, the two take a stand against Corbett.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/feoJo9ffsQTiAKHIZVi7KNlVm4R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145002'),
  ('1151746813658274310', 'A Gun in Each Hand', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cesc Gay, Andreu Rebés', 'Cesc Gay, Tomàs Aragay', 'Ricardo Darín, Luis Tosar, Javier Cámara, Eduardo Noriega, Leonor Watling, Candela Peña, Cayetana Guillén Cuervo, Eduard Fernández', null, 'J. is depressed. E. lives peacefully. S. tries to get back with his wife. G. resorts to anxiolytics. P. plays seduction games. María and Sara exchange their husbands. L. calls his lover in a peculiar way.', 'J. is depressed. E. lives peacefully. S. tries to get back with his wife. G. resorts to anxiolytics. P. plays seduction games. María and Sara exchange their husbands. L. calls his lover in a peculiar way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yLQGaOWSgCZ0o5UCL1WWUjicUPw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139808'),
  ('855086221007329577', 'A Gunfight', 1971, 'Western', 'Lamont Johnson, David M. Walsh, Bill Green', 'Harold Jack Bloom', 'Johnny Cash, Kirk Douglas, Jane Alexander, Karen Black, Dana Elcar, Robert J. Wilke, Keith Carradine, Eric Douglas', 'PG', 'Will Tenneray and Abe Cross are two aging, famous gunfighters, both in need of money. Tenneray comes up with the idea to stage a duel to the death in a bullfight arena, with the ticket proceeds going to the winner.', 'Will Tenneray and Abe Cross are two aging, famous gunfighters, both in need of money. Tenneray comes up with the idea to stage a duel to the death in a bullfight arena, with the ticket proceeds going to the winner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJBZPEGHKqHfpNoDlCImHDasNN7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71654'),
  ('354378250081265397', 'A Guy Named Joe', 1944, 'Drama, Romance, War, Fantasy', 'Victor Fleming, Horace Hough, Dolph Zimmer', 'Dalton Trumbo', 'Spencer Tracy, Irene Dunne, Van Johnson, Ward Bond, James Gleason, Lionel Barrymore, Barry Nelson, Esther Williams', 'NR', 'A cocky U.S. Army Air Force pilot stationed in England during World War II falls for a daring female flier. After he''s killed on a mission, he''s sent back to Earth by a heavenly General with a new assignment.', 'A cocky U.S. Army Air Force pilot stationed in England during World War II falls for a daring female flier. After he''s killed on a mission, he''s sent back to Earth by a heavenly General with a new assignment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrdaUol9hZEde4HloyVuG860OH7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43306'),
  ('1108494958704183394', 'A Guy Thing', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Koch, Robbie Greenberg, Bill Mizel', 'Greg Glienna, Pete Schwaba, Matt Tarses', 'Jason Lee, Selma Blair, Julia Stiles, Shawn Hatosy, Lochlyn Munro, James Brolin, Diana Scarwid, David Koechner', 'PG-13', 'Paul Morse is a good guy. When his friends throw him a wild bachelor party, he just wants to keep his conscience clean -- which is why he''s shocked when he wakes up in bed with a beautiful girl named Becky and can''t remember the night before. Desperate to keep his fiancée, Karen, from finding out what may or may not be the truth, he tells her a teensy lie. Soon his lies are spiraling out of control and his life is a series of comical misunderstandings.', 'Paul Morse is a good guy. When his friends throw him a wild bachelor party, he just wants to keep his conscience clean -- which is why he''s shocked when he wakes up in bed with a beautiful girl named Becky and can''t remember the night before. Desperate to keep his fiancée, Karen, from finding out what may or may not be the truth, he tells her a teensy lie. Soon his lies are spiraling out of control and his life is a series of comical misunderstandings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWiPuP1wMW32pjX8Q9TEj69TxWI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9582'),
  ('108412537973924168', 'A Ham in a Role', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'A dog decides to quit the slapstick comedy of cartoons and go to his country home to concentrate on Shakespeare, but two troublesome yet polite gophers foil his grand plans.', 'A dog decides to quit the slapstick comedy of cartoons and go to his country home to concentrate on Shakespeare, but two troublesome yet polite gophers foil his grand plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7uflt5RCy440SAsHN6lqCWwgtn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213875'),
  ('104807427969913740', 'A Handful of Dust', 1988, 'Romance, Drama', 'Charles Sturridge, Richard Hornsby, Tony Aherne', 'Charles Sturridge, Tim Sullivan, Derek Granger', 'James Wilby, Kristin Scott Thomas, Rupert Graves, Pip Torrens, Judi Dench, Alec Guinness, Beatie Edney, Christopher Godwin', 'PG', 'English aristocrat Tony Last welcomes tragedy into his life when he invites John Beaver to visit his vast estate. There Beaver makes the acquaintance of Tony''s wife, Brenda. Together, they continue their relationship in a series of bedroom assignations in London. Trusting to a fault, Tony is unaware that anything is amiss until his wife suddenly asks for a divorce. With his life in turmoil, Tony goes on a haphazard journey to South America.', 'English aristocrat Tony Last welcomes tragedy into his life when he invites John Beaver to visit his vast estate. There Beaver makes the acquaintance of Tony''s wife, Brenda. Together, they continue their relationship in a series of bedroom assignations in London. Trusting to a fault, Tony is unaware that anything is amiss until his wife suddenly asks for a divorce. With his life in turmoil, Tony goes on a haphazard journey to South America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rsXpH3r3PEmZGWE5CH4bKPkXMRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46021'),
  ('1076458262888089155', 'A Happening in Central Park', 1968, 'Music, TV Movie', 'Robert Scheerer', null, 'Barbra Streisand', 'G', 'A Happening in Central Park was performed and taped by video cameras on Saturday, June 17, 1967. The concert, sponsored by Rheingold Beer, and free to the public, was held in the Sheep Meadow section of New York City''s Central Park. Barbra''s television sponsor, Monsanto, captured the event on videotape for airing on CBS at a later date. Barbra took a weekend off from the filming of Funny Girl to perform the concert. On Friday night, June 16th, Barbra and crew rehearsed until very late. Many photos of Barbra in which she wears a headband were taken the evening of the dress rehearsal. (The cover of Barbra''s A Christmas Album is actually a photo from the Friday night dress rehearsal in Central Park.) On that evening she tried on different gowns and worked with hairdresser Fred Glaser on alternate hairstyles. Director Robert Scheerer also worked out some of his camera blocking at the Friday night rehearsal. He utilized seven color video cameras to capture the concert.', 'A Happening in Central Park was performed and taped by video cameras on Saturday, June 17, 1967. The concert, sponsored by Rheingold Beer, and free to the public, was held in the Sheep Meadow section of New York City''s Central Park. Barbra''s television sponsor, Monsanto, captured the event on videotape for airing on CBS at a later date. Barbra took a weekend off from the filming of Funny Girl to perform the concert. On Friday night, June 16th, Barbra and crew rehearsed until very late. Many photos of Barbra in which she wears a headband were taken the evening of the dress rehearsal. (The cover of Barbra''s A Christmas Album is actually a photo from the Friday night dress rehearsal in Central Park.) On that evening she tried on different gowns and worked with hairdresser Fred Glaser on alternate hairstyles. Director Robert Scheerer also worked out some of his camera blocking at the Friday night rehearsal. He utilized seven color video cameras to capture the concert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mOSvKyv2hHTQ9M6ZOKXAfkrhxls.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58612'),
  ('41182596723832209', 'A Happy Event', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Rémi Bezançon, Antoine Monod', 'Vanessa Portal, Rémi Bezançon', 'Louise Bourgoin, Pio Marmaï, Josiane Balasko, Thierry Frémont, Gabrielle Lazure, Firmine Richard, Anaïs Croze, Daphné Bürki', null, 'She drove me into a corner, then forced me to go beyond my limits. She made me confront the absolute: love, sacrifice, tenderness, abandonment. She dislocated me, transformed me. Why didn''t anyone warn me? Why doesn''t anyone ever talk about this?" Un heureux événement, or an intimate view of motherhood, sincere and with no taboos.', 'She drove me into a corner, then forced me to go beyond my limits. She made me confront the absolute: love, sacrifice, tenderness, abandonment. She dislocated me, transformed me. Why didn''t anyone warn me? Why doesn''t anyone ever talk about this?" Un heureux événement, or an intimate view of motherhood, sincere and with no taboos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qVUl6ktomxxkPu02LhFtiBsoFv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77462'),
  ('162618444951088459', 'A Happy Family', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'José Eduardo Belmonte, Raphael Montes, Kelly Bill', 'Raphael Montes, Ilana Casoy, Gustavo Bragança', 'Grazi Massafera, Reynaldo Gianecchini, Luiza Antunes, Juliana Bim, Guenia Lemos, Maureen Miranda, Ranieri Gonzalez, Yasmin Rossi', null, 'In a happy family perfectly protected in a gated community, a mother is harshly accused of hurting her twin daughters and newborn baby. However, the truth behind the high walls may reveal unexpected cruelty.', 'In a happy family perfectly protected in a gated community, a mother is harshly accused of hurting her twin daughters and newborn baby. However, the truth behind the high walls may reveal unexpected cruelty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTB3IeKVpJmjOzru2nCecq0B6zp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1148046'),
  ('116207476786109768', 'A Happy Man', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Robert Ménard, Pierre Mignot', 'Guy Bonnier, Robert Ménard', 'Pierre Richard, Sylvie Testud, Jean-Nicolas Verreault, Luc Proulx, Louise Portal, Gaston Lepage, Sylvie Lemay, André Lacoste', null, 'Pierre, a French professor of quantum physics, inherits an inn from his aunt Jeanne in the Lac St-Jean region. He arrives with his daughter and settles in the small village of Sainte-Simone-du-Nord, home to just 400 residents. The locals, however, greet these “strangers” with suspicion—especially the village mayor, who once had a falling-out with Jeanne, the Frenchwoman. He manages to rally the townspeople to make life difficult for these newcomers from across the Atlantic. Yet Pierre’s good humor is unshakable, and he refuses to be discouraged—even without electricity, heat, water, or a car.', 'Pierre, a French professor of quantum physics, inherits an inn from his aunt Jeanne in the Lac St-Jean region. He arrives with his daughter and settles in the small village of Sainte-Simone-du-Nord, home to just 400 residents. The locals, however, greet these “strangers” with suspicion—especially the village mayor, who once had a falling-out with Jeanne, the Frenchwoman. He manages to rally the townspeople to make life difficult for these newcomers from across the Atlantic. Yet Pierre’s good humor is unshakable, and he refuses to be discouraged—even without electricity, heat, water, or a car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lA7osyl01Gaa10akbcGmju1AScr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40175'),
  ('520507896354580248', 'A Hard Day', 2014, 'Crime, Thriller, Mystery, Action', 'Kim Tae-sung, Kim Seong-hun, Kim Gyeong-seok', 'Kim Seong-hun, Chang Hang-jun', 'Lee Sun-kyun, Cho Jin-woong, Jeong Man-sik, Shin Jung-keun, Shin Dong-mi, Heo Jung-eun, Kim Dong-young, Ju Seok-tae', 'PG-13', 'After trying to cover up a car accident that left a man dead, a crooked homicide detective is stalked by a mysterious man claiming to have witnessed the event.', 'After trying to cover up a car accident that left a man dead, a crooked homicide detective is stalked by a mysterious man claiming to have witnessed the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIkc5DwGPZIdImSudkUDQ799rq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269494'),
  ('233827136058029564', 'A Hard Day''s Night', 1964, 'Comedy, Music', 'Richard Lester, Gilbert Taylor, George Martin', 'Alun Owen', 'John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison, Ringo Starr, Wilfrid Brambell, Norman Rossington, John Junkin, Victor Spinetti', 'G', 'Capturing John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison and Ringo Starr in their electrifying element, ''A Hard Day''s Night'' is a wildly irreverent journey through this pastiche of a day in the life of The Beatles during 1964. The band have to use all their guile and wit to avoid the pursuing fans and press to reach their scheduled television performance, in spite of Paul''s troublemaking grandfather and Ringo''s arrest.', 'Capturing John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison and Ringo Starr in their electrifying element, ''A Hard Day''s Night'' is a wildly irreverent journey through this pastiche of a day in the life of The Beatles during 1964. The band have to use all their guile and wit to avoid the pursuing fans and press to reach their scheduled television performance, in spite of Paul''s troublemaking grandfather and Ringo''s arrest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Ulsccp2VkaVU5qbya3bxm9JG4x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:704'),
  ('876716728001225439', 'A Hare Grows in Manhattan', 1947, 'Animation, Comedy, Crime', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Bea Benaderet, Michael Maltese, Tedd Pierce', 'NR', 'Bugs Bunny relates his early life in the Manhattan tenements and spotlights his encounter with a gang of canine toughs.', 'Bugs Bunny relates his early life in the Manhattan tenements and spotlights his encounter with a gang of canine toughs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWOX8JJReqcPt8b5E668spzqIrX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74999'),
  ('599224154668062626', 'A Hatful of Rain', 1957, 'Drama', 'Fred Zinnemann, Joseph MacDonald', 'Michael V. Gazzo, Alfred Hayes, Carl Foreman', 'Eva Marie Saint, Don Murray, Anthony Franciosa, Lloyd Nolan, Henry Silva, Gerald S. O''Loughlin, William Hickey, Paul Kruger', null, 'A Korean War veteran''s morphine addiction wreaks havoc upon his family.', 'A Korean War veteran''s morphine addiction wreaks havoc upon his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2TE1JJSBaVf4zr9PpsWs1vpPEt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37086'),
  ('202561313885375704', 'A Haunted House', 2013, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Tiddes, Steve Gainer', 'Marlon Wayans, Rick Alvarez', 'Marlon Wayans, Essence Atkins, Nick Swardson, Cedric the Entertainer, David Koechner, Dave Sheridan, Liana Mendoza, Jamie Noel', 'R', 'Malcolm and Kisha move into their dream home, but soon learn a demon also resides there. When Kisha becomes possessed, Malcolm - determined to keep his sex life on track - turns to a priest, a psychic, and a team of ghost-busters for help in this spoof of all the "found-footage/documentary style" films released in recent years.', 'Malcolm and Kisha move into their dream home, but soon learn a demon also resides there. When Kisha becomes possessed, Malcolm - determined to keep his sex life on track - turns to a priest, a psychic, and a team of ghost-busters for help in this spoof of all the "found-footage/documentary style" films released in recent years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpw6kvuAJBo1CGRw1Bwdz1KU0hc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:139038'),
  ('703321196876446047', 'A Haunted House 2', 2014, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Michael Tiddes, David Ortkiese', 'Marlon Wayans, Rick Alvarez', 'Marlon Wayans, Jaime Pressly, Essence Atkins, Gabriel Iglesias, Missi Pyle, Ashley Rickards, Affion Crockett, Steele Stebbins', 'R', 'After exorcising the demons of his ex, Malcolm starts afresh with his new girlfriend and her two children. After moving into their dream home, Malcolm is once again plagued by bizarre paranormal events.', 'After exorcising the demons of his ex, Malcolm starts afresh with his new girlfriend and her two children. After moving into their dream home, Malcolm is once again plagued by bizarre paranormal events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oV7M00fPXy5P0nbdeMbSUjYv0vx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184345'),
  ('548539079249142832', 'A Haunted Turkish Bathhouse', 1975, 'Horror, Romance, Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Kazuhiko Yamaguchi, Masahiko Iimura', 'Masahiro Kakefuda, Nobuaki Nakajima', 'Naomi Tani, Ohara Misa, Tomoko Mayama, Miwako Onaya, Yumiko Tateno, Emi Jo, Kinue Futamatsu, Akira Ōizumi', null, 'A sly gangster hatches a plot against his own wife, who works at a brothel-cum-bathhouse, with the help of the bathhouse owner’s wife.', 'A sly gangster hatches a plot against his own wife, who works at a brothel-cum-bathhouse, with the help of the bathhouse owner’s wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sgDzbusWKzaqWdihRnRxujbWiYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235374'),
  ('147223471815955832', 'A Haunting at Silver Falls', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brett Donowho, Edd Lukas', 'Rachel Long, Brian Pittman, Cam Cannon', 'Steve Bacic, Tara Westwood, Tadhg Kelly, James Cavlo, Alix Elizabeth Gitter, Erick Avari, James C. Burns, Nikita Ramsey', 'NR', 'A small town is haunted by the twin daughters of a wrongfully convicted man. Young Jordan is sent down the path to who the real killer is only to find the killer is very close to her.', 'A small town is haunted by the twin daughters of a wrongfully convicted man. Young Jordan is sent down the path to who the real killer is only to find the killer is very close to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vD2PGnUZ9LkzfTbT8cpbcRWlUpO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:197919'),
  ('421530114184077468', 'A Haunting in Venice', 2023, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Kenneth Branagh, Emma Ryder, Richard Usher', 'Michael Green', 'Kenneth Branagh, Kyle Allen, Camille Cottin, Jamie Dornan, Tina Fey, Jude Hill, Ali Khan, Emma Laird', 'PG-13', 'Celebrated sleuth Hercule Poirot, now retired and living in self-imposed exile in Venice, reluctantly attends a Halloween séance at a decaying, haunted palazzo. When one of the guests is murdered, the detective is thrust into a sinister world of shadows and secrets.', 'Celebrated sleuth Hercule Poirot, now retired and living in self-imposed exile in Venice, reluctantly attends a Halloween séance at a decaying, haunted palazzo. When one of the guests is murdered, the detective is thrust into a sinister world of shadows and secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6iwxT0NbVw6QiF08YTIuTnXS82.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945729'),
  ('119597559186754277', 'A Hazard of Hearts', 1987, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'John Hough, Callum McDougall', 'Terence Feely', 'Diana Rigg, Edward Fox, Christopher Plummer, Helena Bonham Carter, Neil Dickson, Stewart Granger, Anna Massey, Eileen Atkins', null, 'When compulsive gambler Sir Giles Staverley has lost his estate and all his money playing dice, he realises that he only has one thing left of value: his daughter Serena. In a final game, he stakes his daughter''s hand in marriage, convinced that this time he will not lose. Unfortunately, however, he does lose; to the evil Lord Wrotham. Unable to return home and tell his daughter that he has lost her in a game of dice, Sir Giles kills himself there and then. Lord Vulcan, who has witnessed the events, takes pity on Serena Staverley, although they have never met. He challenges Lord Wrotham to a game of dice in which the winner takes both Staverley Court and Miss Serena.', 'When compulsive gambler Sir Giles Staverley has lost his estate and all his money playing dice, he realises that he only has one thing left of value: his daughter Serena. In a final game, he stakes his daughter''s hand in marriage, convinced that this time he will not lose. Unfortunately, however, he does lose; to the evil Lord Wrotham. Unable to return home and tell his daughter that he has lost her in a game of dice, Sir Giles kills himself there and then. Lord Vulcan, who has witnessed the events, takes pity on Serena Staverley, although they have never met. He challenges Lord Wrotham to a game of dice in which the winner takes both Staverley Court and Miss Serena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Atqiil78fDTMaMwVrdHqejHOpiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48406'),
  ('1598251907952795', 'A Heart in Winter', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Yves Angelo, Claude Sautet', 'Claude Sautet, Jérôme Tonnerre, Jacques Fieschi', 'Daniel Auteuil, Emmanuelle Béart, André Dussollier, Élisabeth Bourgine, Brigitte Catillon, Maurice Garrel, Myriam Boyer, Stanislas Carré de Malberg', null, 'Beautiful violin virtuoso Camille has two obsessions: the music of Ravel, and a friend of her husband''s who crafts violins. But his heart seems to be as cold as her playing is passionate.', 'Beautiful violin virtuoso Camille has two obsessions: the music of Ravel, and a friend of her husband''s who crafts violins. But his heart seems to be as cold as her playing is passionate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hR1NHf5tOAKbTO3KuJc6LliBGa3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48150'),
  ('91977337311326559', 'A Heartland Christmas', 2010, 'Family, TV Movie', 'Dean Bennett, Craig Wrobleski', 'Heather Conkie', 'Amber Marshall, Helene Joy, Nicholas Campbell, Cindy Busby, Chris Potter, Michelle Morgan, Graham Wardle, Shaun Johnston', null, 'Christmas comes to Heartland, along with an anonymous call about starving horses stranded by an avalanche in the Rocky Mountains, which send Amy and Ty to their rescue.', 'Christmas comes to Heartland, along with an anonymous call about starving horses stranded by an avalanche in the Rocky Mountains, which send Amy and Ty to their rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nnAs92tDIuf2oXcQF3XcwHd8LCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145132'),
  ('442261276429919250', 'A Hearty Response', 1986, 'Crime, Action, Comedy', 'Norman Law Man, Sung Kwong Wah, Luk Chuen', 'Lai Man-Cheuk', 'Chow Yun-Fat, Joey Wong, Lui Fong, Paul Chun Pui, Lee Heung-Kam, Shum Wai, Kent Cheng Jak-Si, Wong Wan-Sze', null, 'During their last (botched) operation, Hong Kong cops Ho Ting-Bon and Long Man accidentally cause the slight head injury of a pretty young woman. Because she has entered the country illegally and has no other place to live, she pretends that she has amnesia and that she thinks Ting-Bon is her husband. He feels guilty about her "condition", so he lets her stay in his house. But there is someone from her past stalking her, with bad intentions...', 'During their last (botched) operation, Hong Kong cops Ho Ting-Bon and Long Man accidentally cause the slight head injury of a pretty young woman. Because she has entered the country illegally and has no other place to live, she pretends that she has amnesia and that she thinks Ting-Bon is her husband. He feels guilty about her "condition", so he lets her stay in his house. But there is someone from her past stalking her, with bad intentions...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgXTGX3x5rsSrc46rqRQMo2xXuA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181757'),
  ('37601430612431621', 'A Heavenly Christmas', 2016, 'Drama, Romance, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Randal Platt, Paul Shapiro', 'Greg McBride', 'Kristin Davis, Eric McCormack, Shirley MacLaine, Jaeda Lily Miller, Robert Moloney, Karen Kruper, Gerard Plunkett, Vincent Gale', null, 'Upon her untimely death, a workaholic finds herself in training to be a Christmas Angel in Heaven. Despite being the worst recruit in the history of Christmas, she’s assigned a hard luck case. As she’s forced to help solve his problems, she’ll start to discover the meaning of Christmas and maybe even fall in love along the way.', 'Upon her untimely death, a workaholic finds herself in training to be a Christmas Angel in Heaven. Despite being the worst recruit in the history of Christmas, she’s assigned a hard luck case. As she’s forced to help solve his problems, she’ll start to discover the meaning of Christmas and maybe even fall in love along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tFXXlWKUaD1CRC4g2lpaBYJTkl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:421760'),
  ('333039520726040454', 'A Heavy Heart', 2016, 'Drama', 'Thomas Stuber, Karen Wendland, Matthias Börner', 'Clemens Meyer, Thomas Stuber, Paul Salisbury', 'Peter Kurth, Lina Wendel, Edin Hasanović, Lena Lauzemis, Reiner Schöne, Udo Kroschwald, Kida Khodr Ramadan, Lola Liefers', null, 'A former East German boxing champion reduced to working as a bouncer and debt collector is forced to reflect on his life when he is diagnosed with a fatal disease.', 'A former East German boxing champion reduced to working as a bouncer and debt collector is forced to reflect on his life when he is diagnosed with a fatal disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kHEkoCwSLVRTiZcZHQWmMSLNlRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356464'),
  ('251526124211965398', 'A Heidelberg Holiday', 2023, 'TV Movie, Romance, Family, Drama', 'Nađa Trajković, Viktor Klein, Maša Nešković', 'Maclain Nelson', 'Ginna Claire, Frédéric Brossier, Nick Wilder, Rebecca Immanuel, Zoe Moore, Alexander Schubert, Patricia Meeden, Anne Alexander Sieder', 'G', 'Heidi heads to the Heidelberg Christmas market to sell her hand-painted ornaments. While there, she falls for a local artisan who helps her reconnect with her lost heritage.', 'Heidi heads to the Heidelberg Christmas market to sell her hand-painted ornaments. While there, she falls for a local artisan who helps her reconnect with her lost heritage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zSjUQ5EpOf4ytijx5X1bQefYfwp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1074788'),
  ('884720013580879102', 'A Hell of a Day', 2001, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marion Vernoux, Ariel Sctrick, Dominique Colin', 'Marion Vernoux', 'Karin Viard, Hélène Fillières, Victor Lanoux, Jane Birkin, Sergi López, Clémentine Célarié, Gilbert Melki, Melvil Poupaud', null, 'Some days turn out to be simply unforgettable. For Marie, it all starts with a pregnancy test… that proves positive, a car accident and being fired from her job... For Hortense, mobile phone in hand, the frantic quest for sexual satisfaction begins in a traffic jam... For both Luis and Maurice, the unexpected appearance of a loved one pitches them into a world of dreams and nightmares. While some of the characters know each other, others come into contact by chance. One woman profits from all this, the other is shattered. One will have gone looking for trouble, the other will have asked for nothing. There''ll be no fatalities.', 'Some days turn out to be simply unforgettable. For Marie, it all starts with a pregnancy test… that proves positive, a car accident and being fired from her job... For Hortense, mobile phone in hand, the frantic quest for sexual satisfaction begins in a traffic jam... For both Luis and Maurice, the unexpected appearance of a loved one pitches them into a world of dreams and nightmares. While some of the characters know each other, others come into contact by chance. One woman profits from all this, the other is shattered. One will have gone looking for trouble, the other will have asked for nothing. There''ll be no fatalities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSxMPNFc0KtCKSrSzTKPzfNGW7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67384'),
  ('1118221116740259738', 'A Hen in the Wind', 1948, 'Drama', 'Yasujirō Ozu, Yûharu Atsuta, Yoshinobu Nakagawa', 'Ryōsuke Saitō, Yasujirō Ozu', 'Kinuyo Tanaka, Shūji Sano, Chieko Murata, Chishū Ryū, Hōhi Aoki, Chiyoko Ayatani, Reiko Minakami, Takeshi Sakamoto', null, 'Tokiko is a mother patiently waiting for her husband''s return from the war when her 4-year old son becomes ill. She takes him to the doctor for treatment but has no way of paying. She resorts to prostitution. One month later her husband returns from WWII to find his desperate wife, who tells him the truth. Together they must deal with the consequences.', 'Tokiko is a mother patiently waiting for her husband''s return from the war when her 4-year old son becomes ill. She takes him to the doctor for treatment but has no way of paying. She resorts to prostitution. One month later her husband returns from WWII to find his desperate wife, who tells him the truth. Together they must deal with the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvoiw4BjoN0npqXkgJGLZs3k7VM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126219'),
  ('163361795707897116', 'A Herb Alpert & the Tijuana Brass Double Feature', 1966, 'Comedy, Animation, Music', 'John Hubley', 'Faith Hubley, John Hubley', null, null, 'A prototype of modern music videos, this is an animated film set to the music of two popular tunes recorded by Herb Alpert and his Latin-flavored brass ensemble - "Spanish Flea" and "Tijuana Taxi". Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2003.', 'A prototype of modern music videos, this is an animated film set to the music of two popular tunes recorded by Herb Alpert and his Latin-flavored brass ensemble - "Spanish Flea" and "Tijuana Taxi". Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in 2003.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bUTeJ8e79Axe1n5el6ixEIypLKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209505'),
  ('992900832676512965', 'A Hero', 2021, 'Drama', 'Ali Ghazi, Arash Ramezani, Amin Khankal', 'Asghar Farhadi', 'Amir Jadidi, Mohsen Tanabandeh, Sahar Goldoost, Fereshteh Sadr Orafaee, Sarina Farhadi, Ehsan Goodarzi, Maryam Shahdaie, Ali Reza Jahandideh', 'PG-13', 'Rahim is in prison because of a debt he was unable to repay. During a two-day leave, he tries to convince his creditor to withdraw his complaint against the payment of part of the sum. But things don''t go as planned. Is he truly a hero?', 'Rahim is in prison because of a debt he was unable to repay. During a two-day leave, he tries to convince his creditor to withdraw his complaint against the payment of part of the sum. But things don''t go as planned. Is he truly a hero?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VBPRWW13OJoiLA6suLofnjLKou.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:672208'),
  ('79500212784353515', 'A Hero in His Slippers', 1958, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Stelios Zografakis', 'Christos Giannakopoulos', 'Vasilis Logothetidis, Ilia Livykou, Nitsa Tsaganea, Sonia Zoidou, Lavrentis Dianellos, Byron Pallis, Vagelis Protopapas, Giorgos Gavriilidis', null, 'A veteran general, living poorly but honestly with his wife and his daughter, is visited by his future son-in-law who informs him that he is going to immigrate to Australia. On the same day, his cousin Apostolos pays him a visit as well and tells him that the government intending to honor him has decided to construct his statue and place it at the small square in front of his house.', 'A veteran general, living poorly but honestly with his wife and his daughter, is visited by his future son-in-law who informs him that he is going to immigrate to Australia. On the same day, his cousin Apostolos pays him a visit as well and tells him that the government intending to honor him has decided to construct his statue and place it at the small square in front of his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oRjF4QNKknicONgdJuL8pQnheta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:405417'),
  ('72006755082621652', 'A Hero Never Dies', 1998, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Johnnie To, Cheng Siu-Keung', 'Yau Nai-Hoi, Szeto Kam-Yuen', 'Leon Lai Ming, Sean Lau Ching-wan, Fiona Leung Ngai-Ling, Yoyo Mung Ka-Wai, Lam Suet, Sato Keiji, Yuen Bun, Henry Fong Ping', null, 'Jack and Martin are gunmen who work for two rival kingpins. Jack and Martin have been fighting on their bosses behalf for close to a year. When a truce is made both Jack and Martin are cut loose. The two men then decide to join forces and take on the gangsters who used them.', 'Jack and Martin are gunmen who work for two rival kingpins. Jack and Martin have been fighting on their bosses behalf for close to a year. When a truce is made both Jack and Martin are cut loose. The two men then decide to join forces and take on the gangsters who used them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AuoQm14zQPL89WxpiTKb5VAoOxP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58776'),
  ('182929644552051914', 'A Hero of Our Times', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Mario Monicelli, Tino Santoni, Marco Leto', 'Mario Monicelli, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Franca Valeri, Giovanna Ralli, Tina Pica, Mario Carotenuto, Leopoldo Trieste, Alberto Lattuada, Bud Spencer', null, 'Alberto Menichetti lives with an aunt and an old housekeeper, Clotilde; he has a job in a firm and his boss is Mrs. De Ritis, a widow whose husband was killed during a wild boar hunt. She likes him but Alberto likes Marcella; she is under age and he is awaiting her birthday to declare his love. His greater traits are to be fearful of everything and to be selfish. This nature will get him into trouble..', 'Alberto Menichetti lives with an aunt and an old housekeeper, Clotilde; he has a job in a firm and his boss is Mrs. De Ritis, a widow whose husband was killed during a wild boar hunt. She likes him but Alberto likes Marcella; she is under age and he is awaiting her birthday to declare his love. His greater traits are to be fearful of everything and to be selfish. This nature will get him into trouble..', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4b7t3W1UchG36mqRb4lWILOMmGk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79025'),
  ('792489328556758357', 'A Hidden Life', 2019, 'History, Drama, War', 'Terrence Malick, Jörg Widmer, Steve Summersgill', 'Terrence Malick', 'August Diehl, Valerie Pachner, Maria Simon, Karin Neuhäuser, Tobias Moretti, Ulrich Matthes, Matthias Schoenaerts, Michael Nyqvist', 'PG-13', 'Austrian farmer Franz Jägerstätter faces the threat of execution for refusing to fight for the Nazis during World War II.', 'Austrian farmer Franz Jägerstätter faces the threat of execution for refusing to fight for the Nazis during World War II.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdG4jfH0rxkB2FgkYmjj9V4Q31M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:403300'),
  ('556687722859245219', 'A High Wind in Jamaica', 1965, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Alexander Mackendrick, Douglas Slocombe, Jim Brennan', 'Ronald Harwood, Stanley Mann, Denis Cannan', 'Anthony Quinn, James Coburn, Deborah Baxter, Gert Fröbe, Dennis Price, Lila Kedrova, Nigel Davenport, Isabel Dean', 'NR', 'In 1870, a Jamaican colonial family sends its children to Britain for proper schooling, but their ship is taken over by pirates, who become fond of the kids.', 'In 1870, a Jamaican colonial family sends its children to Britain for proper schooling, but their ship is taken over by pirates, who become fond of the kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/HJbD89cwclhExqQDvRKXVDSLNL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38340'),
