  ('515826420338179113', 'A Holiday for Love', 1996, 'Drama, Family, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jerry London, Frank Tidy', 'Darrah Cloud', 'Tim Matheson, Melissa Gilbert, Michelle Trachtenberg, Jayne Eastwood, Jack Jessop, Bernard Behrens, Chris Makepeace, Gordon Pinsent', null, 'A man is sent to a small town to assess which of the workers in the local factory that supplies the town with jobs should get the boot when the downsizing begins. He gets sidetracked when he falls in love with a local, a cute single mom.', 'A man is sent to a small town to assess which of the workers in the local factory that supplies the town with jobs should get the boot when the downsizing begins. He gets sidetracked when he falls in love with a local, a cute single mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8weK0sV1occqTKWUEVqD3pd9T1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82630'),
  ('454003507821386894', 'A Holiday Spectacular', 2022, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Fantasy', 'John Putch, Anthony Raymond', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Ginna Claire, Derek Klena, Torsten Johnson, Tiffany Denise Hobbs, Ann-Margret, Elle Graper, Carolyn McCormick, Eve Plumb', 'G', 'In 1958, Maggie is an heiress from Philadelphia who puts her high-society wedding plans on hold in order to sneak to New York City and make her secret dream of dancing live on stage in the Christmas Spectacular at Radio City Music Hall come true.', 'In 1958, Maggie is an heiress from Philadelphia who puts her high-society wedding plans on hold in order to sneak to New York City and make her secret dream of dancing live on stage in the Christmas Spectacular at Radio City Music Hall come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVMkBrL3jqu0COYqwGn2xLoEWV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:996767'),
  ('692799906064647889', 'A Hollywood Christmas', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Reuben Steinberg, Alex Ranarivelo, Dori Zuckerman', 'John Ducey', 'Jessika Van, Josh Swickard, Missi Pyle, Anissa Borrego, Riley Dandy, Zak Steiner, Tom Williamson, Brooke Dillman', 'PG', 'Jessica, a young, up-and-coming filmmaker in Hollywood has made a name for herself directing Christmas movies. But when handsome network executive Christopher shows up threatening to halt production on her latest movie, Jessica’s assistant, Reena, points out the irony: Jessica isn’t just trying to save her Christmas movie, she’s actually living in one. Jessica must now juggle all the classic tropes—her actors falling in and out of love, a wayward elf dog, and her own stirring romantic feelings for her perceived nemesis—in order to get her movie and her life to their happy endings.', 'Jessica, a young, up-and-coming filmmaker in Hollywood has made a name for herself directing Christmas movies. But when handsome network executive Christopher shows up threatening to halt production on her latest movie, Jessica’s assistant, Reena, points out the irony: Jessica isn’t just trying to save her Christmas movie, she’s actually living in one. Jessica must now juggle all the classic tropes—her actors falling in and out of love, a wayward elf dog, and her own stirring romantic feelings for her perceived nemesis—in order to get her movie and her life to their happy endings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8D6dobydMiuabqRDQi0598ghc4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028938'),
  ('74007149716601307', 'A Hologram for the King', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Tom Tykwer, Frank Griebe, Abdellah Baadil', 'Tom Tykwer', 'Tom Hanks, Sarita Choudhury, Sidse Babett Knudsen, Ben Whishaw, Tom Skerritt, Tracey Fairaway, David Menkin, Omar Elba', 'R', 'Alan Clay, a struggling American businessman, travels to Saudi Arabia to sell a new technology to the King, only to be challenged by endless Middle Eastern bureaucracy, a perpetually absent monarch, and a suspicious growth on his back.', 'Alan Clay, a struggling American businessman, travels to Saudi Arabia to sell a new technology to the King, only to be challenged by endless Middle Eastern bureaucracy, a perpetually absent monarch, and a suspicious growth on his back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wmjWGb2tqtOA4XPnK1tpIfzRtSQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:270010'),
  ('346919784182653589', 'A Holy Place', 1990, 'Horror, Drama', 'Đorđe Kadijević', 'Đorđe Kadijević', 'Dragan Jovanović, Branka Pujić, Aleksandar Berček, Mira Banjac, Danilo Lazović, Predrag Miletić, Maja Sabljić, Radoš Bajić', null, 'Strange love story between Toma, a reluctant theology student and Katarina, the beautiful daughter of a powerful feudal lord. After Katarina''s mysterious death, Toma is, according to her wishes, forced to read the prayers over her body for three nights in a row.', 'Strange love story between Toma, a reluctant theology student and Katarina, the beautiful daughter of a powerful feudal lord. After Katarina''s mysterious death, Toma is, according to her wishes, forced to read the prayers over her body for three nights in a row.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odBzLki7cSNldRRhEY8K2fnCyp5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144825'),
  ('697503056801999078', 'A Holy Venetian Family', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Pietro Parolin, Luca Coassin', 'Pietro Parolin', 'Neri Marcorè, Stefano Pesce, Anna Dalton, Aurora Ruffino, Piera Degli Esposti, Antonio Pennarella, Cristina D''Alberto, Pierpaolo Spollon', null, 'Gualtiero Cecchin, the son of an entrepreneur must find a new way to make money after squandering his huge family fortune. With an idea and a good dose of recklessness Gualtiero must find a way to fund his new business while navigating the shady world of the Neapolitan mob.', 'Gualtiero Cecchin, the son of an entrepreneur must find a new way to make money after squandering his huge family fortune. With an idea and a good dose of recklessness Gualtiero must find a way to fund his new business while navigating the shady world of the Neapolitan mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7an1KzWFr65i14j8zgtB6ZusFMB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323664'),
  ('1068354274370170174', 'A Home at the End of the World', 2004, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michael Mayer, Enrique Chediak, Darrin Brown', 'Michael Cunningham', 'Colin Farrell, Robin Wright, Dallas Roberts, Sissy Spacek, Ryan Donowho, Erik Smith, Harris Allan, Ron Lea', 'R', 'Three friends form a bond over the year, Johnathan is gay, Clare is straight and Bobby is neither, instead he loves the people he loves. As their lives go on there is tension and tears which culminate in a strong yet fragile friendship between the three.', 'Three friends form a bond over the year, Johnathan is gay, Clare is straight and Bobby is neither, instead he loves the people he loves. As their lives go on there is tension and tears which culminate in a strong yet fragile friendship between the three.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o1YC1V30LR0LJzGR6JtbzpDSTYy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18923'),
  ('1134904568455350629', 'A Home for Tanya', 1959, 'Drama', 'Lev Kulidzhanov, Pyotr Kataev, Anatoli Dikan', 'Budimir Metalnikov', 'Vera Kuznetsova, Lyudmila Marchenko, Nikolai Novlyansky, Valentin Zubkov, Nonna Mordyukova, Lyusyena Ovchinnikova, Pyotr Kiryutkin, Pyotr Aleynikov', null, 'The adopted daughter of Dr. Skvortsov, Tanya, having learned that her mother Natalya Avdeyevna is alive, who was considered dead during the bombing of World War II, decides to go to her in a distant village on vacation. She recognizes the woman who gave her life and lost her husband and sons due to the war, but cannot call her mother. Meetings on the collective farm with interesting people make Tanya think a lot and experience a lot. She discovers for herself a completely new, largely alien world to her. It does not immediately penetrate the sense of inner kinship with this world, its people, so unusual for her.', 'The adopted daughter of Dr. Skvortsov, Tanya, having learned that her mother Natalya Avdeyevna is alive, who was considered dead during the bombing of World War II, decides to go to her in a distant village on vacation. She recognizes the woman who gave her life and lost her husband and sons due to the war, but cannot call her mother. Meetings on the collective farm with interesting people make Tanya think a lot and experience a lot. She discovers for herself a completely new, largely alien world to her. It does not immediately penetrate the sense of inner kinship with this world, its people, so unusual for her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iOVUB2KwUaDcSIRSEMeF3RqM9Oc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369566'),
  ('691476237377972305', 'A Home of Our Own', 1993, 'Drama', 'Tony Bill, Jean Lépine', 'Patrick Sheane Duncan', 'Kathy Bates, Edward Furlong, Clarissa Lassig, Sarah Schaub, Miles Feulner, Amy Sakasitz, T.J. Lowther, Soon-Tek Oh', 'PG', 'In 1960s Los Angeles an energetic widow and her six children try to make a dream of theirs come true: to have a home of their own. They leave L.A. and head for the countryside, all the while facing numerous difficulties and obstacles during their journey.', 'In 1960s Los Angeles an energetic widow and her six children try to make a dream of theirs come true: to have a home of their own. They leave L.A. and head for the countryside, all the while facing numerous difficulties and obstacles during their journey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yN32TPLWWPo3dt1K9zydaFb3ItV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78133'),
  ('317473925546887504', 'A Hometown in Heart', 1949, 'Drama', 'Hae-jin Go, Im Yeon-su, Han Hyeong-mo', null, 'Yu Min, Choi Eun-hee, Byeon Gi-jong, Seok Geum-seong, Kim Sun-young, Choi Woon-bong, Nam Seung-min, Yeo Heon-yong', null, 'An orphan left in the care of a Buddhist temple becomes attached to a young widow who arrives there to mourn her recently deceased son.', 'An orphan left in the care of a Buddhist temple becomes attached to a young widow who arrives there to mourn her recently deceased son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iH8xT1Y0aOjNDARY5zEnsQuLsGa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179555'),
  ('655453138866080006', 'A Honeymoon to Remember', 2021, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Raivo Kruze, Trevor Cunningham, C. Damon Harper', 'Mark Valenti', 'Rebecca Dalton, Edward Ruttle, Spencer Lord, Jocelyn Gauthier, Brendan Taylor, Ryan Cowie, Brian Mack, Nick Preston', 'G', 'When a devastated Ava’s fiancé leaves her at the altar, she’s determined to enjoy her honeymoon without him. Time away in a beautiful setting helps her figure out what she truly wants from a partner, but when her fiancé shows up unannounced, she’s more confused than ever… Can Ava forgive the man who broke her heart?', 'When a devastated Ava’s fiancé leaves her at the altar, she’s determined to enjoy her honeymoon without him. Time away in a beautiful setting helps her figure out what she truly wants from a partner, but when her fiancé shows up unannounced, she’s more confused than ever… Can Ava forgive the man who broke her heart?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7POepMKLZWihltLO3EJgKJz3Lku.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793441'),
  ('524993742300810850', 'A Hoof Here, a Hoof There', 1989, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Věra Chytilová, Stanislava Hutková, Jiří Purchart', 'Pavel Škapík, Věra Chytilová', 'Tomáš Hanák, Milan Šteindler, David Vávra, Ivana Kuntová, Tereza Kučerová, Renata Becerrová, Bára Dlouhá, Chantal Poullain', null, 'A striking generational tragicomedy, A Hoof Here, a Hoof There is a caustic group portrait of pals who enjoy a tipple, all kinds of hi-jinks and no-strings sexual adventures. Auditor Pepe, vet Dědek and restaurant manager František are financially secure and enjoy life with their similarly fun-loving girlfriends—at least until the moment when the brash Pepe collapses and ends up in hospital.', 'A striking generational tragicomedy, A Hoof Here, a Hoof There is a caustic group portrait of pals who enjoy a tipple, all kinds of hi-jinks and no-strings sexual adventures. Auditor Pepe, vet Dědek and restaurant manager František are financially secure and enjoy life with their similarly fun-loving girlfriends—at least until the moment when the brash Pepe collapses and ends up in hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lNIDub8G5v0vNu5TCm5nmF6yNSP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157306'),
  ('1098620195055854177', 'A Horrible Way to Die', 2010, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adam Wingard, Chris Hilleke, Mark Shelhorse', 'Simon Barrett', 'Brandon Carroll, AJ Bowen, Amy Seimetz, Joe Swanberg, Lane Hughes, Whitney Moore, Simon Barrett, Kelsey Munger', 'R', 'An escaped murderer is in pursuit of his ex-girlfriend, who has fled to start a new life in a small town.', 'An escaped murderer is in pursuit of his ex-girlfriend, who has fled to start a new life in a small town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzAMpGbcIhPtJLD057BCkjYc022.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44950'),
  ('295274491019956659', 'A Horse Fly Fleas', 1947, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'A flea befriends a horsefly, who has hooves like those of a horse, and rides the horsefly into the hair of a dog. The flea chops down strands of the dog''s hair to use as "logs" with which to build a cabin, unaware that the dog''s coat is the sacred territory of a tribe of Indian fleas, who declare war on the interlopers. The Indians capture and are about to burn the flea and the horsefly when the dog jolts in pain from the fire. The flea and the horsefly free themselves and flee the Indians through the hairs on the dog''s carcass.', 'A flea befriends a horsefly, who has hooves like those of a horse, and rides the horsefly into the hair of a dog. The flea chops down strands of the dog''s hair to use as "logs" with which to build a cabin, unaware that the dog''s coat is the sacred territory of a tribe of Indian fleas, who declare war on the interlopers. The Indians capture and are about to burn the flea and the horsefly when the dog jolts in pain from the fire. The flea and the horsefly free themselves and flee the Indians through the hairs on the dog''s carcass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4JA4iHhMDZJKf3QpT7bXEirUTQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188782'),
  ('511164364019678017', 'A Horse for Danny', 1995, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Dick Lowry', null, 'Leelee Sobieski, Robert Urich, Ron Brice, Gary Basaraba, Erik Jensen, Ed Bruce, Karen Carlson, Brian Michael', null, 'Danny is a smart little girl. She lives at the track where her uncle is a horse trainer. She knows her uncle needs just one great horse to make his name.', 'Danny is a smart little girl. She lives at the track where her uncle is a horse trainer. She knows her uncle needs just one great horse to make his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b7R12Dw9BZqSFoif3ZnTSpRkgu5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35178'),
  ('801248157581063645', 'A House for Kuzka', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Aida Zyablikova', 'Valentin Berestov', 'Aleksandr Lenkov, Eleonora Prokhnitskaya, Svetlana Travkina, Georgiy Vitsin', null, 'An underage house spirit named Kuzka finds his way into a typical Soviet flat and turns the life of a little girl Natasha into a fairy tale.', 'An underage house spirit named Kuzka finds his way into a typical Soviet flat and turns the life of a little girl Natasha into a fairy tale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wTTEwMATzFHjcm4MHv6dxa6LkDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:469447'),
  ('43833714589290287', 'A House in the Hills', 1993, 'Thriller, Romance', 'Ken Wiederhorn, Josep M. Civit', 'Miguel Tejada-Flores, Ken Wiederhorn, David J. Greenberg', 'Michael Madsen, Helen Slater, Jeffrey Tambor, Elyssa Davalos, James Laurenson, Toni Barry, Taylor Lee', 'R', 'An aspiring actress gets a housesitting job and finds herself in a cat-and-mouse game with a deadly ex-con.', 'An aspiring actress gets a housesitting job and finds herself in a cat-and-mouse game with a deadly ex-con.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7rXD3TzhWNSjrQH3DgpYcg0V3bU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59481'),
  ('241661584473843819', 'A House Made of Splinters', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Azad Safarov, Simon Lereng Wilmont, Simon Lereng Wilmont', null, null, null, 'A temporary house for abandoned children near the front line in eastern Ukraine is run by a small group of social workers determined to provide comfort and safety. It may be humble and somewhat run-down, but this house is filled with love and offers up to nine months of refuge to kids whose fate will be determined by the system. During this short time, the caretakers try to nurture within them a sense of stability and normalcy.', 'A temporary house for abandoned children near the front line in eastern Ukraine is run by a small group of social workers determined to provide comfort and safety. It may be humble and somewhat run-down, but this house is filled with love and offers up to nine months of refuge to kids whose fate will be determined by the system. During this short time, the caretakers try to nurture within them a sense of stability and normalcy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eFYeFvco3Cgcrny99RCTFIaXMla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:913743'),
  ('236560391289560376', 'A House of Dynamite', 2025, 'Thriller', 'Kathryn Bigelow, George Cottle, Barry Ackroyd', 'Noah Oppenheim', 'Idris Elba, Rebecca Ferguson, Gabriel Basso, Jared Harris, Tracy Letts, Anthony Ramos, Moses Ingram, Jonah Hauer-King', 'R', 'When a single, unattributed missile is launched at the United States, a race begins to determine who is responsible and how to respond.', 'When a single, unattributed missile is launched at the United States, a race begins to determine who is responsible and how to respond.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AiJ8L90ftPAwVf3SDx7Fj9IMZoy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1290159'),
