  ('611942380471997672', 'A Hundred Flowers', 2022, 'Drama', 'Genki Kawamura, Kentaro Hirase, Yoichi Nakzato', 'Genki Kawamura, Kentaro Hirase', 'Masaki Suda, Mieko Harada, Masami Nagasawa, Masatoshi Nagase, Yukiya Kitamura, Amane Okayama, Yuumi Kawai, Keishi Nagatsuka', null, 'Diagnosed with dementia, Yuriko''s mind quickly begins to fade. Yet, for her son Izumi, memories of the mother feel as vivid as when he lived them. One in particular, when he believed she had disappeared, haunts him terribly.', 'Diagnosed with dementia, Yuriko''s mind quickly begins to fade. Yet, for her son Izumi, memories of the mother feel as vivid as when he lived them. One in particular, when he believed she had disappeared, haunts him terribly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/69og9H0itdCZHQzE4mKCxhWzr1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:936490'),
  ('626929083401349093', 'A Husband for Anna', 1953, 'Drama, Romance', 'Elio Petri, Aldo Trionfo, Giulio Petroni', 'Alfredo Giannetti, Giuseppe De Santis, Elio Petri', 'Silvana Pampanini, Amedeo Nazzari, Massimo Girotti, Umberto Spadaro, Monica Clay, Anna Galasso, Dora Scarpetta, Agostino Salvietti', null, 'Anna Zaccheo is a beautiful young woman from a working class Neapolitan family. Her main concern is to find herself a suitable husband. She meets a young sailor Andrea one day and gets engaged to him. But while she is waiting for Andrea to return from the navy she gets raped by her boss. Her life suddenly takes a downward spiral.', 'Anna Zaccheo is a beautiful young woman from a working class Neapolitan family. Her main concern is to find herself a suitable husband. She meets a young sailor Andrea one day and gets engaged to him. But while she is waiting for Andrea to return from the navy she gets raped by her boss. Her life suddenly takes a downward spiral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Hlat6ZsHvg4L0tSJT9XvPPLT68.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277524'),
  ('474364506157996934', 'A Hyena in the Safe', 1968, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Cesare Canevari', 'Alberto Penna, Cesare Canevari', 'Dimitri Nabokov, Maria Luisa Geisberger, Ben Salvador, Alex Morrison, Karina Kar, Cristina Gaïoni', null, 'Four notorious bank robbers meet up in an isolated castle to divide a large number of diamonds hidden there by their deceased former boss, whose Italian wife is hosting a party.', 'Four notorious bank robbers meet up in an isolated castle to divide a large number of diamonds hidden there by their deceased former boss, whose Italian wife is hosting a party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vG10XpuxRzddVJFj0jj5WaRSIE4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104902'),
  ('136284127830896913', 'A Hypnotic Television Experience', 1994, 'Documentary, Fantasy', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Gaspar Noé', 'Alain Ganas, Marie France', null, 'A shortfilm directed for Canal + TV Show "L''Œil du Cyclone", Episode 74. "What interests me is the hypnotic trance in which one can plunge a viewer. When you make a film and it works, you''re like a shaman, a hypnotist."', 'A shortfilm directed for Canal + TV Show "L''Œil du Cyclone", Episode 74. "What interests me is the hypnotic trance in which one can plunge a viewer. When you make a film and it works, you''re like a shaman, a hypnotist."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpjSA1MlM5HWvzA6GoPgyndfg6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185818'),
  ('638886339667919410', 'A Janitor', 2021, 'Drama, Action', 'Yugo Sakamoto, Tojiro Kurita, Kensuke Tsukuda', 'Shozen Matsudaira', 'Seiji Fukushi, Haruka Imou, Tomoya Maeno, Hannya, Kazuhiro Yamaji, Wataru Ichinose, Takashi Kitadai, Toru Nomaguchi', null, 'Fukami is a high school janitor whose father was a gangster. He works at the school as a janitor instead of belonging to the gang so he can watch out for Yui, the daughter of his deceased father''s brother Majima Yoshiki. One day, a gang feud erupts and Yoshiki is killed. Yui becomes the next target.', 'Fukami is a high school janitor whose father was a gangster. He works at the school as a janitor instead of belonging to the gang so he can watch out for Yui, the daughter of his deceased father''s brother Majima Yoshiki. One day, a gang feud erupts and Yoshiki is killed. Yui becomes the next target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gg4sRHFm5DuHArYrsCd5KPNZvft.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:854575'),
  ('416536189111935114', 'A Japanese Tragedy', 1953, 'Drama', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Yoshiro Kawazu, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Keisuke Kinoshita', 'Yūko Mochizuki, Keiji Sada, Teiji Takahashi, Yōko Katsuragi, Sanae Takasugi, Ken Uehara, Keiko Awaji, Shinichi Himori', null, 'At the close of the war in Japan, a widowed mother makes every possible sacrifice to bring up her ungrateful son and daughter who are unimpressed with their poor standard of living at home. They gradually reject her in search of the material comforts that working as a maid cannot provide. The mother''s despair becomes interminable.', 'At the close of the war in Japan, a widowed mother makes every possible sacrifice to bring up her ungrateful son and daughter who are unimpressed with their poor standard of living at home. They gradually reject her in search of the material comforts that working as a maid cannot provide. The mother''s despair becomes interminable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Q0yi0c8Ctdrxdjf0WGOVu2d2mE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50805'),
  ('1110363125373795420', 'A Jaula', 2022, 'Thriller', 'João Wainer, Leo Resende Ferreira, Lili Faria', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat', 'Chay Suede, Alexandre Nero, Mariana Lima, Astrid Fontenelle, Maurício de Barros, Marco Bravo, Ayomi Domenica, Felipe Calixto', null, 'It''s just another luxury car being stolen on a street in São Paulo... or not. A thief easily gets into the SUV parked on a quiet street, but when he tries to get out, he discovers he is trapped, without water or food.', 'It''s just another luxury car being stolen on a street in São Paulo... or not. A thief easily gets into the SUV parked on a quiet street, but when he tries to get out, he discovers he is trapped, without water or food.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bduCYiD05UZSfAASNQ0NVB3lPu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:884588'),
  ('454885633333898386', 'A Jazzman''s Blues', 2022, 'Drama, Romance, Mystery', 'Brett Pawlak, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Joshua Boone, Amirah Vann, Solea Pfeiffer, Ryan Eggold, Austin Scott, Milauna Jackson, Brent Antonello, Brad Benedict', 'R', 'A tale of forbidden love and family drama unravels 40 years of secrets and lies against a soundtrack of juke joint blues in the Deep South.', 'A tale of forbidden love and family drama unravels 40 years of secrets and lies against a soundtrack of juke joint blues in the Deep South.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3a6p9PnqD5ksDWiHkwWbkl6Jz7G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:921643'),
  ('876988512838562074', 'A Journal for Jordan', 2021, 'Drama, Romance', 'Allison Krumwiede, Maryse Alberti, Diem Hoang', 'Virgil Williams', 'Michael B. Jordan, Chanté Adams, Jalon Christian, Robert Wisdom, Tamara Tunie, Jasmine Batchelor, Marchánt Davis, Susan Pourfar', 'PG-13', 'Based on the true story of First Sergeant Charles Monroe King, a soldier deployed to Iraq begins to keep a journal of love and advice for his infant son. Back at home, senior New York Times editor Dana Canedy revisits the story of her unlikely, life-altering relationship with King and his enduring devotion to her and their child.', 'Based on the true story of First Sergeant Charles Monroe King, a soldier deployed to Iraq begins to keep a journal of love and advice for his infant son. Back at home, senior New York Times editor Dana Canedy revisits the story of her unlikely, life-altering relationship with King and his enduring devotion to her and their child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t8xX6kYZj6y0XIxniJdFmaFkvp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:501841'),
  ('564301246897733109', 'A Journey', 2024, 'Drama', 'RC Delos Reyes, Tom Redoble', 'Onay Sales-Camero', 'Kaye Abad, Paolo Contis, Patrick Garcia, Jimmy Santos, Ogie Alcasid, Desiree del Valle, Malou Crisologo, Ogie Diaz', null, 'Refusing treatment for her cancer, a woman goes on a road trip across Tasmania to check off items on her bucket list with her husband and best friend.', 'Refusing treatment for her cancer, a woman goes on a road trip across Tasmania to check off items on her bucket list with her husband and best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LbrDogBCM7BxUl5igUrY1CLUfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260916'),
  ('796174632926022865', 'A Journey Called Love', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Michele Placido, Luca Bigazzi', 'Michele Placido, Diego Ribon, Heidrun Schleef', 'Laura Morante, Stefano Accorsi, Alessandro Haber, Galatea Ranzi, Diego Ribon, Giorgio Colangeli, Emiliano Coltorti, Dario Bandiera', null, 'The life and loves of poet Sibilla Aleramo (Laura Morante), focusing on her relationship with Dino Campana (Stefano Accorsi).', 'The life and loves of poet Sibilla Aleramo (Laura Morante), focusing on her relationship with Dino Campana (Stefano Accorsi).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtUAncK6LLkxMnIboQr2gS48rE3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64389'),
  ('633431847239649215', 'A Journey to Avebury', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Derek Jarman', null, null, null, 'A silent short movie, is a literal journey that we can experience. We are being taken to Avebury and given the chance to admire it for 10 minutes. The shots are incredibly beautiful, as we see a huge stone or trees bathed in orange light of sunset.', 'A silent short movie, is a literal journey that we can experience. We are being taken to Avebury and given the chance to admire it for 10 minutes. The shots are incredibly beautiful, as we see a huge stone or trees bathed in orange light of sunset.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y91nNogjSwtu2QbT9mjCFpFwShv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121359'),
  ('951422882583696890', 'A Journey to the Fumigated Towns', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Nicolás Sulcic, Fernando E. Solanas, Fernando E. Solanas', 'Fernando E. Solanas', 'Eleuterio Basualdo, Don Juan, Jorge Rulli, Adolfo Boy', null, 'A Journey to the Fumigated Towns is the final episode made by Fernando Solanas in a series of 8 films dedicated to the Argentinian’s crisis in the 21st century. Based on testimonies, re-creations, archives and photos, this investigative documentary reveals not only the after-effects of the soya’s model and other GMO’s grain productions with agrochemicals, on the health of the Argentinian people, but also the global and environmental consequences.', 'A Journey to the Fumigated Towns is the final episode made by Fernando Solanas in a series of 8 films dedicated to the Argentinian’s crisis in the 21st century. Based on testimonies, re-creations, archives and photos, this investigative documentary reveals not only the after-effects of the soya’s model and other GMO’s grain productions with agrochemicals, on the health of the Argentinian people, but also the global and environmental consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8mLgPLuFRdnxrhRKBSYQPAKEy3U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:499161'),
  ('580009952063959187', 'A Judge of Honor', 2004, 'Drama', 'Gianluca Maria Tavarelli', 'Attilio Bolzoni, Leonardo Fasoli, Gianluca Maria Tavarelli', 'Giorgio Tirabassi, Ennio Fantastichini, Andrea Tidona, Antonino Bruschetta, Giulia Michelini, Daniela Giordano, Carmelo Galati, Cesare Apolito', null, 'In 1980 Paolo Borsellino was appointed with the preliminary investigations and the task of setting up a team which would later become the famous anti-mafia pool, investigating into the criminal activities of various mafia bands, in particular the gang headed up by Totò Riina.', 'In 1980 Paolo Borsellino was appointed with the preliminary investigations and the task of setting up a team which would later become the famous anti-mafia pool, investigating into the criminal activities of various mafia bands, in particular the gang headed up by Totò Riina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6V2owCPnvcWRA7mQ6icGVfIYre5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101280'),
  ('1115581269298554888', 'A Jungle Book of Regulations', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Stanisław Bareja, Andrzej Ramlau, Jerzy Owczaczyk', 'Jacek Fedorowicz, Stanisław Bareja', 'Jacek Fedorowicz, Mieczysław Czechowicz, Stanisława Celińska, Jerzy Dobrowolski, Wiesław Gołas, Halina Kowalska, Bronisław Pawlik, Stanisław Tym', null, 'Janek and Wanda live in a small room in a villa, while other rooms are occupied by offices of various institutions. Janek often stays at work after hours, just to avoid returning to the cramped apartment too early. One day, a man named Malinowski, who once lived in the same small room, visits the couple. He proposes to exchange their room for a new, two-room apartment that he has just received. Janek and Wanda are initially distrustful, but eventually, the exchange takes place. It turns out that Wanda''s ex-husband, Jerzy, already lives in the new apartment. Despite the divorce, as he is registered with Wanda, he has the right to continue living in her apartment. Janek tries to find a way to get rid of the intruder.', 'Janek and Wanda live in a small room in a villa, while other rooms are occupied by offices of various institutions. Janek often stays at work after hours, just to avoid returning to the cramped apartment too early. One day, a man named Malinowski, who once lived in the same small room, visits the couple. He proposes to exchange their room for a new, two-room apartment that he has just received. Janek and Wanda are initially distrustful, but eventually, the exchange takes place. It turns out that Wanda''s ex-husband, Jerzy, already lives in the new apartment. Despite the divorce, as he is registered with Wanda, he has the right to continue living in her apartment. Janek tries to find a way to get rid of the intruder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onwy4sFiUTfWMBNgjNw8QIQ7khG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173171'),
  ('1120132501410250155', 'A Kamikaze Cop', 1970, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yukio Noda, Yoshio Nakajima, Akihisa Okamoto', 'Fumio Kōnami, Yukio Noda', 'Sonny Chiba, Ryōhei Uchida, Ryōji Hayama, Rinichi Yamamoto, Toshiaki Minami, Asao Uchida, Nakajirō Tomita, Kōji Sekiyama', null, 'An undercover cop befriends a yakuza underling who through his contacts helps him infiltrate two rival Yakuza gangs. He pits the two rival gangs against each other in hopes that they will cross each other out.', 'An undercover cop befriends a yakuza underling who through his contacts helps him infiltrate two rival Yakuza gangs. He pits the two rival gangs against each other in hopes that they will cross each other out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9GgJ2DK2uBv4E3rZudoKuwqNLn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90354'),
  ('91198592399224804', 'A Kid', 2016, 'Drama', 'Philippe Guilbert, Philippe Lioret, Marc Larose', 'Natalie Carter, Philippe Lioret', 'Pierre Deladonchamps, Gabriel Arcand, Catherine de Léan, Marie-Thérèse Fortin, Patrick Hivon, Pierre-Yves Cardinal, Hortense Monsaingeon, Romane Portail', null, 'Matthieu is a 33 year old Parisian who finds out that the father he never knew has died and decides to go to his funeral in order to meet his two siblings in Quebec. But once in Montréal, he realizes that nobody is aware of his existence or even interested in it. He is alone, in hostile territory…', 'Matthieu is a 33 year old Parisian who finds out that the father he never knew has died and decides to go to his funeral in order to meet his two siblings in Quebec. But once in Montréal, he realizes that nobody is aware of his existence or even interested in it. He is alone, in hostile territory…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KKAzhmPBB3ApPOUfpSmoOyBIo3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382503'),
  ('667358174918046932', 'A Kid for Two Farthings', 1955, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Carol Reed, Edward Scaife, John Bremer', 'Wolf Mankowitz', 'Celia Johnson, Diana Dors, David Kossoff, Joe Robinson, Jonathan Ashmore, Brenda De Banzie, Primo Carnera, Lou Jacobi', 'NR', 'Joe is a young boy who lives with his mother, Joanna, in working-class London. The two reside above the tailor shop of Mr. Kandinsky, who likes to tell Joe stories. When Kandinsky informs Joe that a unicorn can grant wishes, the hopeful lad ends up buying a baby goat with one tiny horn, believing it to be a real unicorn. Undaunted by his rough surroundings, Joe sets about to prove that wishes can come true.', 'Joe is a young boy who lives with his mother, Joanna, in working-class London. The two reside above the tailor shop of Mr. Kandinsky, who likes to tell Joe stories. When Kandinsky informs Joe that a unicorn can grant wishes, the hopeful lad ends up buying a baby goat with one tiny horn, believing it to be a real unicorn. Undaunted by his rough surroundings, Joe sets about to prove that wishes can come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXwPTwhwkRtqQQbjIcqo7BvGDto.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151431'),
  ('659485403493988323', 'A Kid in Aladdin''s Palace', 1997, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Robert L. Levy, Wally Pfister', 'Michael Part', 'Thomas Ian Nicholas, Rhona Mitra, Nicholas Irons, James Faulkner, Taylor Negron, Aharon Ipalé, Diana Kent, Roger Ennals', 'PG', 'Calvin, a young pizza delivery boy, is mistaken for the "Great Deliverer" by Aladdin, an eighth century genie imprisoned in a lamp. Thinking that the boy is his only hope for deliverance, the genie lures him back to the eigth century where he must join forces with Ali Baba in order to save Aladdin from the evil hands of Luxor.', 'Calvin, a young pizza delivery boy, is mistaken for the "Great Deliverer" by Aladdin, an eighth century genie imprisoned in a lamp. Thinking that the boy is his only hope for deliverance, the genie lures him back to the eigth century where he must join forces with Ali Baba in order to save Aladdin from the evil hands of Luxor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnN7BprzPEqbxTBVoe1lKolES5a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22162'),
  ('353400436702915610', 'A Kid in King Arthur''s Court', 1995, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Michael Gottlieb, Elemér Ragályi', 'Robert L. Levy, Michael Part', 'Thomas Ian Nicholas, Joss Ackland, Art Malik, Daniel Craig, Kate Winslet, Paloma Baeza, David Tysall, Ron Moody', 'PG', 'A Southern California kid named Calvin Fuller is magically transported to the medieval kingdom of Camelot through a crack in the ground caused by an earthquake. Once there, he learns he was summoned by the wizard Merlin, who needs Calvin to save Camelot. Using dazzling modern inventions, can Calvin help King Arthur retain his crown and thwart the evil Lord Belasco?', 'A Southern California kid named Calvin Fuller is magically transported to the medieval kingdom of Camelot through a crack in the ground caused by an earthquake. Once there, he learns he was summoned by the wizard Merlin, who needs Calvin to save Camelot. Using dazzling modern inventions, can Calvin help King Arthur retain his crown and thwart the evil Lord Belasco?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y269Xj4nOi4YHOKT241c4xubgGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37108'),
  ('1145051994379689031', 'A Kid Like Jake', 2018, 'Drama', 'Silas Howard, Steven Capitano Calitri', 'Daniel Pearle', 'Claire Danes, Jim Parsons, Octavia Spencer, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Ann Dowd, Amy Landecker, Leo James Davis, Julia Chan', 'R', 'On the eve of the admissions cycle for New York City kindergartens, Alex and Greg Wheeler have high hopes for four-year-old Jake. The director of Jake''s preschool encourages them to accentuate Jake''s gender expansive behavior to help him stand out. As Alex and Greg navigate their roles as parents, a rift grows between them, one that forces them to confront their own concerns about what''s best for Jake, and each other.', 'On the eve of the admissions cycle for New York City kindergartens, Alex and Greg Wheeler have high hopes for four-year-old Jake. The director of Jake''s preschool encourages them to accentuate Jake''s gender expansive behavior to help him stand out. As Alex and Greg navigate their roles as parents, a rift grows between them, one that forces them to confront their own concerns about what''s best for Jake, and each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xb0lsEUyytspi7fo1ggDybRvZVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467917'),
  ('915604381867481024', 'A Killer Among Friends', 1992, 'TV Movie, Drama, Mystery', 'Charles Robert Carner, Richard Leiterman', 'John Miglis, Charles Robert Carner', 'Patty Duke, Margaret Welsh, Tiffani-Amber Thiessen, Angie Rae McKinney, David Cubitt, Janne Mortil, Loretta Swit, Debra Sharkey', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl disappears and later turns up drowned, with a log across her back. Three years later, a former friend comes forward with some answers.', 'A teenage girl disappears and later turns up drowned, with a log across her back. Three years later, a former friend comes forward with some answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prgjxNqjM9079DgIE4RWaY3tgYT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70104'),
