  ('756815459727343135', 'A Kind of Loving', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'John Schlesinger, Denys N. Coop, Frank Ernst', 'Willis Hall, Keith Waterhouse', 'Alan Bates, June Ritchie, Thora Hird, Bert Palmer, Pat Keen, James Bolam, Jack Smethurst, Gwen Nelson', null, 'As Vic Brown vacillates between infatuation and disinterest for his co-worker Ingrid Rothwell, she finds out that she is pregnant and Vic has to reconcile how he thought his life would go with what life actually has in store for him.', 'As Vic Brown vacillates between infatuation and disinterest for his co-worker Ingrid Rothwell, she finds out that she is pregnant and Vic has to reconcile how he thought his life would go with what life actually has in store for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zOmiMh7lkHbzWHwazcHFGYVnVHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33765'),
  ('993682861092588159', 'A Kind of Murder', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Chris Debenedetto, Roslyn Aronowitz, Jack Grimmett', 'Susan Boyd', 'Patrick Wilson, Jessica Biel, Haley Bennett, Eddie Marsan, Vincent Kartheiser, Lucas Bentley, Jon Osbeck, Radek Lord', null, 'In 1960s New York, Walter Stackhouse is a rich, successful architect and unhappily married to the beautiful but damaged Clara. His desire to be free of her feeds his obsession with Kimmel, a man suspected of brutally murdering his own wife. When Walter and Kimmel''s lives become dangerously intertwined, a ruthless police detective becomes convinced he has found the murderer. But as the lines blur between innocence and intent, who, in fact, is the real killer?', 'In 1960s New York, Walter Stackhouse is a rich, successful architect and unhappily married to the beautiful but damaged Clara. His desire to be free of her feeds his obsession with Kimmel, a man suspected of brutally murdering his own wife. When Walter and Kimmel''s lives become dangerously intertwined, a ruthless police detective becomes convinced he has found the murderer. But as the lines blur between innocence and intent, who, in fact, is the real killer?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hEeuCjUnGFCPdHbHFUUGGsCIrNt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:305943'),
  ('712433468122417617', 'A Kindhearted Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Alysse Leite-Rogers, Eric J. Goldstein', null, 'Jennie Garth, Cameron Mathison, Emily Tennant, Bronwen Smith, Blair Penner, Mark Brandon, Catherine Lough Haggquist, Nick Hunnings', 'G', 'Jamie owns a sightseeing and tour company in the small town of Cooperville, New York. Navigating the holidays with enthusiasm is trickier for Jamie since her husband Matt passed. Matt loved Christmas and found unparalleled joy in giving to others. While reminiscing with family, Jamie realizes the town desperately needs someone with Matt’s genius for thinking of the small gestures that bring genuine happiness to the holidays.', 'Jamie owns a sightseeing and tour company in the small town of Cooperville, New York. Navigating the holidays with enthusiasm is trickier for Jamie since her husband Matt passed. Matt loved Christmas and found unparalleled joy in giving to others. While reminiscing with family, Jamie realizes the town desperately needs someone with Matt’s genius for thinking of the small gestures that bring genuine happiness to the holidays.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNvfIcaYjQjczvW6o3qdB7W4vz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:878424'),
  ('1132121326239510809', 'A King and His Movie', 1986, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlos Sorin, Marina Valentini, José Luis Ambrosio', 'Carlos Sorin, Jorge Goldenberg', 'Ulises Dumont, Julio Chávez, Miguel Dedovich, Villanueva Cosse, David Llewellyn, Ana María Giunta, Roxana Berco, Marilia Paranhos', null, 'Buenos Aires movie director, very fond of the legend of the King of Patagonia and Araucania, decides to make a movie about it. Despite of financial troubles, technical problems, misfortune and desertions, he undertakes the journey to Patagonia for the film with a second-rate actor company. Neglected by the producer and shortly after by the company, he will make the movie alone, in a surreal landscape like mad.', 'Buenos Aires movie director, very fond of the legend of the King of Patagonia and Araucania, decides to make a movie about it. Despite of financial troubles, technical problems, misfortune and desertions, he undertakes the journey to Patagonia for the film with a second-rate actor company. Neglected by the producer and shortly after by the company, he will make the movie alone, in a surreal landscape like mad.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6Po2W3awctrZ8FQViT3IEj2K3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115316'),
  ('1132578074667184368', 'A King in Havana', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Alexis Valdés', 'Alexis Valdés', 'Alexis Valdés, Yoima Valdés, Alicia Bustamante, José Téllez, Carmen Machi, María Isabel Díaz Lago, Manuel Manquiña, Paulina Gálvez', null, 'Mr. Arturo, an old rich Spanishman who arrives to Havana to marry Yoli, dies suddenly in bed. Yoli''s family, afraid of losing all the money, convinces her ex-boyfriend Papito to go to Spain and get the money. Papito will have to be clever enough to deceive everybody and succeed in Spain', 'Mr. Arturo, an old rich Spanishman who arrives to Havana to marry Yoli, dies suddenly in bed. Yoli''s family, afraid of losing all the money, convinces her ex-boyfriend Papito to go to Spain and get the money. Papito will have to be clever enough to deceive everybody and succeed in Spain', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aHn4Ed0Q6w7uK1h6z5OJAFq8w49.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75473'),
  ('2427514649011787', 'A King in New York', 1957, 'Comedy', 'Charlie Chaplin, Georges Périnal, René Dupont', 'Charlie Chaplin', 'Charlie Chaplin, Maxine Audley, Jerry Desmonde, Oliver Johnston, Dawn Addams, Sidney James, Joan Ingram, Michael Chaplin', 'G', 'A recently-deposed "Estrovian" monarch seeks shelter in New York City, where he becomes an accidental television celebrity. Later, he''s wrongly accused of being a Communist and gets caught up in subsequent HUAC hearings.', 'A recently-deposed "Estrovian" monarch seeks shelter in New York City, where he becomes an accidental television celebrity. Later, he''s wrongly accused of being a Communist and gets caught up in subsequent HUAC hearings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6KtBoiXa5D3LLZtiMCkiqIDnZv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28973'),
  ('636514610815731704', 'A Kiss and a Promise', 2012, 'Drama', 'Phillip Guzman', 'Mick Rossi, Phillip Guzman', 'Mick Rossi, Natasha Gregson Wagner, Sean Power, Patrick Bergin, Robert Miano, Lisa Ciara, Samantha Farrow, Laura Adamo', 'R', 'In a quiet Ontario town, a small Bed and Breakfast dwells with a perverse secret. David Beck, a closet sociopath, but seemingly normal man, runs the B &amp; B with his wife Samantha, a fiery woman with masochistic tendencies. The harmony of the house is disrupted when a young girl''s body is found on the edge of town and veteran police Detective Anthony Dolan suspects David of the murder.', 'In a quiet Ontario town, a small Bed and Breakfast dwells with a perverse secret. David Beck, a closet sociopath, but seemingly normal man, runs the B &amp; B with his wife Samantha, a fiery woman with masochistic tendencies. The harmony of the house is disrupted when a young girl''s body is found on the edge of town and veteran police Detective Anthony Dolan suspects David of the murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZwgbEmz1U4EdJw5EtEshLyac9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104024'),
  ('1122426255471527896', 'A Kiss Before Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Jeff Beesley, Ken Krawczyk', 'Mark Amato, Tracy Andreen', 'Teri Hatcher, James Denton, Marilu Henner, Carson Kroeker, Sophia Elena Bachart, John B. Lowe, Rod Wilson, April Blackbird', 'G', 'Ethan, always the nice guy, wakes up in a new reality at Christmas. Initially, he is enthralled with his new life but soon realizes that it''s not what he thought it would be.', 'Ethan, always the nice guy, wakes up in a new reality at Christmas. Initially, he is enthralled with his new life but soon realizes that it''s not what he thought it would be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ma8NZSDDx7e7BnYS9Rca3oDknOd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874260'),
  ('841576032226098924', 'A Kiss Before Dying', 1956, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Gerd Oswald, Sid Sidman, Lucien Ballard', 'Lawrence Roman', 'Robert Wagner, Jeffrey Hunter, Virginia Leith, Joanne Woodward, Mary Astor, George Macready, Robert Quarry, Howard Petrie', 'NR', 'A college student tries to get rich quick by wooing two wealthy sisters.', 'A college student tries to get rich quick by wooing two wealthy sisters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uaTmtWGxiPStGEcMG5qn5eGBYh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53712'),
  ('281791988415175858', 'A Kiss Before Dying', 1991, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'James Dearden, Mike Southon, Patrick Clayton', 'James Dearden', 'Matt Dillon, Sean Young, Max von Sydow, Diane Ladd, James Russo, Adam Horovitz, Martha Gehman, Ben Browder', 'R', 'Infatuated with the idea of becoming rich, college student Jonathan Corliss secretly dates Dorothy Carlsson to gain the approval of her wealthy father. When Dorothy tells Jonathan that she is pregnant and that her father will deny her inheritance if he finds out, Jonathan murders her, but he stages her death as a suicide. As Jonathan works his way onto Mr. Carlsson''s payroll, Dorothy''s twin sister, Ellen, investigates the apparent suicide.', 'Infatuated with the idea of becoming rich, college student Jonathan Corliss secretly dates Dorothy Carlsson to gain the approval of her wealthy father. When Dorothy tells Jonathan that she is pregnant and that her father will deny her inheritance if he finds out, Jonathan murders her, but he stages her death as a suicide. As Jonathan works his way onto Mr. Carlsson''s payroll, Dorothy''s twin sister, Ellen, investigates the apparent suicide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n4aT62Y1kKBpAgmEk4FILZAJpPn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31696'),
  ('399277433353507873', 'A Kiss for a Killer', 1957, 'Drama, Crime', 'Henri Verneuil, Christian Matras', 'Henri Verneuil', 'Henri Vidal, Mylène Demongeot, Isa Miranda, Jean-Loup Philippe, Simone Bach, Antonin Berval, Jean Galland, Ky Duyen', null, 'In Nice, a wealthy widow is charmed by a young man who marries her and manages her finances. He soon starts an affair with her secretary, who proves to be even more ruthless than he is.', 'In Nice, a wealthy widow is charmed by a young man who marries her and manages her finances. He soon starts an affair with her secretary, who proves to be even more ruthless than he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/flhofD8KFyVfGCzTgQEJ3ljnfMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143370'),
  ('858908376247718585', 'A Kiss in the Snow', 1997, 'Drama', 'Frank Mosvold', null, 'Kristian Dale Hakkelberg, Stian Barsnes Simonsen, Silje Andresen', null, 'When a new boy moves into the area Cecilie and Peter''s friendship is changed.', 'When a new boy moves into the area Cecilie and Peter''s friendship is changed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ajjgM1qryEiyJDcwctzdc9LmHbf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:410042'),
  ('369303539249971175', 'A Kiss on the Mouth', 1987, 'Documentary', 'Jacira Melo', null, null, null, 'Made in the "Boca do Lixo" district in São Paulo, this work explores the world of women prostitutes in downtown São Paulo. The author allows the narrative to be led by the interviewees themselves, removing the reporter''s voice and intervening as little as possible in the editing of the testimonies. At a time when AIDS was primarily associated with gay men, most of the prostitutes say they don''t believe they can be infected and refuse to use condoms. One of them shares that she used to be a madam and a drug dealer, but now lives like an ordinary worker, working from 10 to 7 and raising her children. Another recalls her time as a domestic worker, earning in one month what she now makes in a single day as a prostitute. The soundtrack features songs by Milton Nascimento and Mutantes.', 'Made in the "Boca do Lixo" district in São Paulo, this work explores the world of women prostitutes in downtown São Paulo. The author allows the narrative to be led by the interviewees themselves, removing the reporter''s voice and intervening as little as possible in the editing of the testimonies. At a time when AIDS was primarily associated with gay men, most of the prostitutes say they don''t believe they can be infected and refuse to use condoms. One of them shares that she used to be a madam and a drug dealer, but now lives like an ordinary worker, working from 10 to 7 and raising her children. Another recalls her time as a domestic worker, earning in one month what she now makes in a single day as a prostitute. The soundtrack features songs by Milton Nascimento and Mutantes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGLcDXDX1yOICq7NKEKA1R3IJUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279431'),
  ('246076552219791922', 'A Kitten Named Woof', 1976, 'Animation', 'Lev Atamanov', 'Grigoriy Oster, Yukhym Chepovetskyi', 'Tatyana Reshetnikova, Mariya Vinogradova, Vasiliy Livanov, Aleksandr Baranov', null, 'The cartoon tells about the adventures of a kitten with the unusual name of Woof and his friend - the puppy of Sharik. Woof constantly gets into ridiculous situations and finds adventures as soon as he leaves the house. He is sure that it is necessary to go to meet the trouble, because the old cat told him: "You are waiting for some troubles!". He also knows how to properly share sausages, why a secret language is needed and why one should be afraid of thunderstorms together with a friend in the attic.', 'The cartoon tells about the adventures of a kitten with the unusual name of Woof and his friend - the puppy of Sharik. Woof constantly gets into ridiculous situations and finds adventures as soon as he leaves the house. He is sure that it is necessary to go to meet the trouble, because the old cat told him: "You are waiting for some troubles!". He also knows how to properly share sausages, why a secret language is needed and why one should be afraid of thunderstorms together with a friend in the attic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlUAhoHVD7Q8D1uglATVB3dz1xO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:306027'),
