  ('466032937602253010', 'A Knife for the Ladies', 1974, 'Horror, Western', 'Larry G. Spangler, Irving Lippman', 'George Arthur Bloom', 'Jack Elam, Ruth Roman, Jeff Cooper, John Kellogg, Gene Evans, Diana Ewing, Derek Sanderson, Jon Spangler', 'R', 'A mutilating knife-killer haunts the small Southwest-desert town of Mescal. Though most victims have been prostitutes, the first was none other than Travis Mescal, the only son of the town''s first family. When the Sheriff proves unable to solve the case, the town leaders invite Investigator Burns to unravel the mystery.', 'A mutilating knife-killer haunts the small Southwest-desert town of Mescal. Though most victims have been prostitutes, the first was none other than Travis Mescal, the only son of the town''s first family. When the Sheriff proves unable to solve the case, the town leaders invite Investigator Burns to unravel the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tHmqAgOmbPp5fkxgx5Y5JotvIuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:227603'),
  ('508930775701220733', 'A Knight for a Day', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher, June Foray, Arch Denison, Jack Mather', 'NR', 'By accident, Cedric (Goofy), replaces his master, Sir Loinsteak, in the armor just before the joust with champion Sir Cumference.', 'By accident, Cedric (Goofy), replaces his master, Sir Loinsteak, in the armor just before the joust with champion Sir Cumference.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6hC7WgkSVvIA6Z8tad39FrAINVK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66816'),
  ('225635705018339843', 'A Knight for Vasoula', 1968, 'Music, Comedy', 'Giannis Dalianidis, Dinos Mavroeidis, Pavlos Filippou', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Jenny Karezi, Faidon Georgitsis, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Giorgos Mihalakopoulos, Maria Foka, Maria Bonelou, Hronis Exarhakos, Anna Paitatzi', null, 'Vasoula is a poor girl who works as a secretary for a cranky older lady, Ms Kleio who loves novels with knights and lives secluded in her mansion with her butler Aristeidis. One day, in the absence of Ms Kleio, Vasoula is visited by a couple, Popi and Mitsos Bezestainis who ask if they can stay. The sudden return of Ms Kleio causes great upheaval kai Vasoula is forced to introduce Mitsos as her husband, who is a sailor and often away. When Ms Kleio dies, she leaves her entire estate to Vasoula whom she mentions in her will as "wife of Dimitrios Bezestainis". Now, the problems begin, and they can only be solved when Vasoula marries Mitsos.', 'Vasoula is a poor girl who works as a secretary for a cranky older lady, Ms Kleio who loves novels with knights and lives secluded in her mansion with her butler Aristeidis. One day, in the absence of Ms Kleio, Vasoula is visited by a couple, Popi and Mitsos Bezestainis who ask if they can stay. The sudden return of Ms Kleio causes great upheaval kai Vasoula is forced to introduce Mitsos as her husband, who is a sailor and often away. When Ms Kleio dies, she leaves her entire estate to Vasoula whom she mentions in her will as "wife of Dimitrios Bezestainis". Now, the problems begin, and they can only be solved when Vasoula marries Mitsos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bMicZo78naEJPpEvZEhvBouK6Pq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307702'),
  ('855182690647478042', 'A Knight in Camelot', 1998, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Roger Young, Elemér Ragályi, Sallie Hard', 'Joe Wiesenfeld', 'Whoopi Goldberg, Michael York, Paloma Baeza, Simon Fenton, James Coombes, Robert Addie, Ian Richardson, Amanda Donohoe', null, 'Yet another variation on Mark Twain''s "A Connecticut Yankee At King Arthur''s Court." Here, a computer malfunction causes a science researcher to be sent back in time with her laptop, which she uses to amaze the court.', 'Yet another variation on Mark Twain''s "A Connecticut Yankee At King Arthur''s Court." Here, a computer malfunction causes a science researcher to be sent back in time with her laptop, which she uses to amaze the court.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCJICpvo6Av27x9Lfu65iwlNfED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24793'),
  ('704865742463658872', 'A Knight''s Tale', 2001, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance, Action', 'Richard Greatrex, Brian Helgeland, Jez Oakley', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Heath Ledger, Rufus Sewell, Shannyn Sossamon, Paul Bettany, Laura Fraser, Mark Addy, Alan Tudyk, Bérénice Bejo', 'PG-13', 'William Thatcher, a knight''s peasant apprentice, gets a chance at glory when the knight dies suddenly mid-tournament. Posing as a knight himself, William won''t stop until he''s crowned tournament champion—assuming matters of the heart don''t get in the way.', 'William Thatcher, a knight''s peasant apprentice, gets a chance at glory when the knight dies suddenly mid-tournament. Posing as a knight himself, William won''t stop until he''s crowned tournament champion—assuming matters of the heart don''t get in the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srb1XnrlDZHcdpjBKqUu4qAzxKU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9476'),
  ('1087492952100453507', 'A Knight''s War', 2025, 'Horror, Action, Fantasy', 'Matthew Ninaber', 'Matthew Ninaber', 'Jeremy Ninaber, Kristen Kaster, Matthew Ninaber, Kristen MacCulloch, Sasha Ormond, Raechel Fisher, Ariel Gerard, Jeremy Dueck', null, 'A fearless knight braves a deadly realm to save the Chosen One’s soul. Facing witches, demons, and brutal foes, he discovers her return could ignite chaos and doom humanity.', 'A fearless knight braves a deadly realm to save the Chosen One’s soul. Facing witches, demons, and brutal foes, he discovers her return could ignite chaos and doom humanity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/janjdSMrTRGtPrI1p9uOX66jv7x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1312833'),
  ('616384232278828691', 'À l''aventure', 2009, 'Drama', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau, Wilfrid Sempé', 'Jean-Claude Brisseau', 'Carole Brana, Lise Bellynck, Jocelyn Quivrin, Arnaud Binard, Nadia Chibani, Etienne Chicot, Estelle Galarme, Frederic Aspisi', null, 'Fed up with her present lifestyle, and more particularly sexually unsatisfied by her boyfriend Fred, Sandrine decides to find a new way in life. Intrigued by her friend Sophie, who tells her about her sexual experimentations, she will find, through various encounters, new pleasures and new experiences, whether physical or spiritual.', 'Fed up with her present lifestyle, and more particularly sexually unsatisfied by her boyfriend Fred, Sandrine decides to find a new way in life. Intrigued by her friend Sophie, who tells her about her sexual experimentations, she will find, through various encounters, new pleasures and new experiences, whether physical or spiritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aoRutQ7FRrxgDZ7iNW9aZeJirzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64124'),
  ('902191813993849390', 'À la maison pour Noël', 2012, 'Comedy, Drama, TV Movie', 'Christian Merret-Palmair , Pascal Rabaud', 'Justin Sbresni, Kader Aoun, Mark Bussell', 'Virginie Efira, Adel Bencherif, Jonathan Lambert, Jackie Berroyer, Eythan Solomon, Didier Flamand, Claire Nadeau, Rachel Arditi', null, 'Sarah Moreau is a brilliant lawyer who controls everything in her life. Her business woman life does not allow her to leave anything to chance, especially on holidays. And now it''s Christmas. Everything seems to be under control. Anything but destiny - When Christmas became the longest day, how to keep the Christmas spirit?', 'Sarah Moreau is a brilliant lawyer who controls everything in her life. Her business woman life does not allow her to leave anything to chance, especially on holidays. And now it''s Christmas. Everything seems to be under control. Anything but destiny - When Christmas became the longest day, how to keep the Christmas spirit?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r4E2mCVbCVreZNbukmMFA9iXonJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:188936'),
  ('376763230451833291', 'A la mala', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Pablo Ibarra, Fido Pérez-Gavilán, Nadia Ayala Tabachnik', 'Issa López, Ari Rosen', 'Aislinn Derbez, Mauricio Ochmann, Luis Arrieta, Aurora Papile, Daniela Schmidt, Juan Diego Covarrubias, José Ron, Iván Sánchez', 'PG-13', 'Maria Laura "Mala" is an actress with little luck, but she is successful working for other women, seducing their boyfriends to know if they are faithful or not. But everything changes when her dream to perform in her acting career depends on a job to be performed with Santiago who breaks the pattern and shakes her professional convictions.', 'Maria Laura "Mala" is an actress with little luck, but she is successful working for other women, seducing their boyfriends to know if they are faithful or not. But everything changes when her dream to perform in her acting career depends on a job to be performed with Santiago who breaks the pattern and shakes her professional convictions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AinFWAtZFif4SociC1yRTqkk8WQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:317925'),
  ('88866137561617045', 'A La Mode', 1959, 'Animation', 'Stan VanDerBeek', 'Stan VanDerBeek', null, null, 'A short surreal animation created with fashion magazine clippings and sound collages.', 'A short surreal animation created with fashion magazine clippings and sound collages.', null, 'tmdb:movie:147795'),
  ('105573592431349123', 'À la Mode', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Yves Lafaye, Rémy Duchemin', 'Rémy Duchemin, Richard Morgiève', 'Jean Yanne, Ken Higelin, Florence Darel, François Hauteserre, Maurice Bénichou, Bruce Myers, Maïté Nahyr, François Chattot', null, 'Fausto enters an orphanage and is initially bullied, but then makes friends with a new bunkmate, Raymond. He is apprenticed to Mietek, a tailor in the Jewish quarter, who teaches him the trade. Fausto charms everyone in the quarter, and falls in love with Tonie, the mechanic''s daughter. He starts making outrageous suits for publicity and, after dressing Tonie, decides that he wants to be a famous couturier.', 'Fausto enters an orphanage and is initially bullied, but then makes friends with a new bunkmate, Raymond. He is apprenticed to Mietek, a tailor in the Jewish quarter, who teaches him the trade. Fausto charms everyone in the quarter, and falls in love with Tonie, the mechanic''s daughter. He starts making outrageous suits for publicity and, after dressing Tonie, decides that he wants to be a famous couturier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hx95nBuHwprvE6f3N0Ho26s4Rtg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349394'),
  ('174176869769501304', 'A Lady in Paris', 2012, 'Drama', 'Ilmar Raag, Laurent Brunet, Pierre Mertens', 'Ilmar Raag, Agnès Feuvre, Lise Macheboeuf', 'Jeanne Moreau, Laine Mägi, Patrick Pineau, Ita Ever, Piret Kalda, Ago Anderson, Roland Laos, Liis Remmel', null, 'Anne leaves Estonia to come to Paris as a caretaker for Frida, an elderly Estonian lady who emigrated to France long ago. Anne soon realizes that she is not wanted. All Frida wants from life is the attention of Stéphane, her younger former lover. Stéphane, however, is desperate for Anne to stay and look after Frida, even against the old lady''s will. In this conflict of strangers, Anne will find her own way…', 'Anne leaves Estonia to come to Paris as a caretaker for Frida, an elderly Estonian lady who emigrated to France long ago. Anne soon realizes that she is not wanted. All Frida wants from life is the attention of Stéphane, her younger former lover. Stéphane, however, is desperate for Anne to stay and look after Frida, even against the old lady''s will. In this conflict of strangers, Anne will find her own way…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iv7eVeQwAtAEQuhyVQBi6xjwQOs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136670'),
  ('50464224536874024', 'A Lady Takes a Chance', 1943, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Seiter, Frank Redman', 'Robert Ardrey', 'Jean Arthur, John Wayne, Phil Silvers, Charles Winninger, Mary Field, Don Costello, John Philliber, Grady Sutton', 'NR', 'A city girl on a bus tour of the West encounters a handsome rodeo cowboy who helps her forget her city suitors.', 'A city girl on a bus tour of the West encounters a handsome rodeo cowboy who helps her forget her city suitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4O4d4y1LXxN8wb0jcEVj01JPzr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65503'),
  ('21044062654385102', 'A Lady Without Passport', 1950, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Paul Vogel', 'Howard Dimsdale', 'Hedy Lamarr, John Hodiak, James Craig, George Macready, Steven Geray, Bruce Cowling, Nedrick Young, Steven Hill', 'NR', 'An undercover U.S. Immigration agent falls in love with an immigrant attempting to enter the United States through Havana, Cuba in an illegal smuggling ring.', 'An undercover U.S. Immigration agent falls in love with an immigrant attempting to enter the United States through Havana, Cuba in an illegal smuggling ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJfzpAglQhQLtUICju4A2cRmK77.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30195'),
  ('986467494489609892', 'A Lake', 2008, 'Drama', 'Philippe Grandrieux, Philippe Grandrieux', 'Philippe Grandrieux', 'Dmitriy Kubasov, Natálie Řehořová, Aleksey Solonchev, Simona Huelsemann, Arthur Semay, Vitaly Kishchenko', null, 'The action unfolds in a country about which we know nothing, a land of snow and forests, somewhere in the North. A family lives in an isolated house near a lake. Alexi, a young, pure-hearted man, is a woodcutter. Occasionally suffering from epileptic seizures and overcome by an ecstatic state, he is one with the nature around him. Alexi is very close to his younger sister, Hege. Their blind mother, father, and younger brother, silently observe this uncontrollable love. One day a stranger arrives, a young man slightly older than Alexi.', 'The action unfolds in a country about which we know nothing, a land of snow and forests, somewhere in the North. A family lives in an isolated house near a lake. Alexi, a young, pure-hearted man, is a woodcutter. Occasionally suffering from epileptic seizures and overcome by an ecstatic state, he is one with the nature around him. Alexi is very close to his younger sister, Hege. Their blind mother, father, and younger brother, silently observe this uncontrollable love. One day a stranger arrives, a young man slightly older than Alexi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEuQ9ODrkNhmjkYIuPkkKNa8h6b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37000'),
