  ('601227681693675935', 'A Late Quartet', 2012, 'Music, Drama', 'Yaron Zilberman, Nicholas Langholff, Frederick Elmes', 'Seth Grossman, Yaron Zilberman', 'Christopher Walken, Philip Seymour Hoffman, Mark Ivanir, Catherine Keener, Imogen Poots, Liraz Charhi, Madhur Jaffrey, Anne Sofie von Otter', 'R', 'When the beloved cellist of a world-renowned string quartet is diagnosed with a life threatening illness, the group''s future suddenly hangs in the balance as suppressed emotions, competing egos and uncontrollable passions threaten to derail years of friendship and collaboration. As they are about to play their 25th anniversary concert — quite possibly their last — only their intimate bond and the power of music can preserve their legacy.', 'When the beloved cellist of a world-renowned string quartet is diagnosed with a life threatening illness, the group''s future suddenly hangs in the balance as suppressed emotions, competing egos and uncontrollable passions threaten to derail years of friendship and collaboration. As they are about to play their 25th anniversary concert — quite possibly their last — only their intimate bond and the power of music can preserve their legacy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yuoVwE4CFDDqdQyHj3Ur8A6ViOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121879'),
  ('45681488151666625', 'A Lawless Street', 1955, 'Western', 'Joseph H. Lewis, Abby Singer, Ray Rennahan', 'Kenneth Gamet', 'Randolph Scott, Angela Lansbury, Warner Anderson, Jean Parker, Wallace Ford, John Emery, James Bell, Ruth Donnelly', 'NR', 'A Marshal must face unpleasant facts about his past when he attempts to run a criminal gang out of town.', 'A Marshal must face unpleasant facts about his past when he attempts to run a criminal gang out of town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fatP9UP4MqTjOh0TXrrUJ58zg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43314'),
  ('424912549796397520', 'A League of Their Own', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Penny Marshall, Miroslav Ondříček, Michael Haley', 'Kim Wilson, Kelly Candaele', 'Tom Hanks, Geena Davis, Lori Petty, Madonna, Rosie O''Donnell, Megan Cavanagh, Tracy Reiner, Bitty Schram', 'PG', 'As America''s stock of athletic young men is depleted during World War II, a professional all-female baseball league springs up in the Midwest, funded by publicity-hungry candy maker Walter Harvey. Competitive sisters Dottie Hinson and Kit Keller spar with each other, scout Ernie Capadino and grumpy has-been coach Jimmy Dugan on their way to fame.', 'As America''s stock of athletic young men is depleted during World War II, a professional all-female baseball league springs up in the Midwest, funded by publicity-hungry candy maker Walter Harvey. Competitive sisters Dottie Hinson and Kit Keller spar with each other, scout Ernie Capadino and grumpy has-been coach Jimmy Dugan on their way to fame.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9BtX6wYOwJUyfUr4vyeT3COz6m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11287'),
  ('1017049875412243467', 'A Leap in the Dark', 1980, 'Drama', 'Inigo Lezzi, Pino Venditti, Marco Bellocchio', 'Piero Natoli, Vincenzo Cerami, Marco Bellocchio', 'Michel Piccoli, Anouk Aimée, Michele Placido, Gisella Burinato, Antonio Piovanelli, Anna Orso, Giampaolo Saccarola, Adriana Pecorelli', null, 'Mauro, a judge, is worried about his older sister Marta, who took care of him since he was a boy, and now suffers from mental illness and suicidal thoughts. She seems to recover from her depression when Mauro acquaints her with Giovanni, a brilliant actor at the edge of legality. However, Mauro becomes unconsciously jealous of their relationship.', 'Mauro, a judge, is worried about his older sister Marta, who took care of him since he was a boy, and now suffers from mental illness and suicidal thoughts. She seems to recover from her depression when Mauro acquaints her with Giovanni, a brilliant actor at the edge of legality. However, Mauro becomes unconsciously jealous of their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ay1Z9W2byacCBDsZQJBa9pSMEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51882'),
  ('59623718928981471', 'A Legend', 2024, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai, He Jun, Chris Lee Chi-Wa', 'Stanley Tong Gwai-Lai', 'Jackie Chan, Zhang Yixing, Gulnezer Bextiyar, Aarif Rahman, Jerry Lee, Peng Xiaoran, Shawn Dou, Zheng Yecheng', 'NR', 'An archeologist noticed that the texture of the relics discovered during the excavation of a glacier closely resembled a jade pendant seen in one of his dreams. He and his team then embark on an expedition into the depths of the glacier.', 'An archeologist noticed that the texture of the relics discovered during the excavation of a glacier closely resembled a jade pendant seen in one of his dreams. He and his team then embark on an expedition into the depths of the glacier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7w1mmaUjZ2PL7rMj0DpKnENNrI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116465'),
