  ('670694345665830641', 'A Less Bad World', 2004, 'Drama', 'Alejandro Agresti, José Cajaraville, Natalia Smirnoff', 'Alejandro Agresti', 'Mónica Galán, Julieta Cardinali, Carlos Roffé, Ulises Dumont, Mex Urtizberea, Lidia Catalano, Rodrigo Noya, Agustina Noya', null, 'A woman reunites with her husband, who vanished on her years ago.', 'A woman reunites with her husband, who vanished on her years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zxoCdxlx9F551XdLy8wVaAtC0mJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116550'),
  ('989914909661761194', 'A Lesson Before Dying', 1999, 'Drama', 'Joseph Sargent', null, 'Don Cheadle, Cicely Tyson, Mekhi Phifer, Irma P. Hall, Brent Jennings, Lisa Arrindell, Dana Ivey, Frank Hoyt Taylor', 'PG-13', 'In the 1940s South, an African-American man is wrongly accused of the killing a a white store owner. In his defense, his white attorney equates him with a lowly hog, to indicate that he didn''t have the sense to know what he was doing. Nevertheless convicted, he is sentenced to die, but his godmother and the aunt of the local schoolteacher convince school teacher go to the convicted man''s cell each day to try to reaffirm to him that he is not an animal but a man with dignity.', 'In the 1940s South, an African-American man is wrongly accused of the killing a a white store owner. In his defense, his white attorney equates him with a lowly hog, to indicate that he didn''t have the sense to know what he was doing. Nevertheless convicted, he is sentenced to die, but his godmother and the aunt of the local schoolteacher convince school teacher go to the convicted man''s cell each day to try to reaffirm to him that he is not an animal but a man with dignity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYC3CxsXA5iL0ODInvmxJYtH5b0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50299'),
  ('753202581661132925', 'A Lesson in Love', 1954, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Martin Bodin, Ingmar Bergman, Rolf Carlsten', 'Ingmar Bergman', 'Eva Dahlbeck, Yvonne Lombard, Harriet Andersson, Olof Winnerstrand, Gunnar Björnstrand, Åke Grönberg, John Elfström, Renée Björling', null, 'After fifteen years of marriage and mutual infidelity, a couple on the brink of divorce unexpectedly confront their unresolved love during a journey to Copenhagen. Blending farce with emotional reflection, the film is Ingmar Bergman’s first sustained venture into marital comedy.', 'After fifteen years of marriage and mutual infidelity, a couple on the brink of divorce unexpectedly confront their unresolved love during a journey to Copenhagen. Blending farce with emotional reflection, the film is Ingmar Bergman’s first sustained venture into marital comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y2033AA89qdxgJMASAfmuZ17GoA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64782'),
  ('66508668438187462', 'A Letter From Mars', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kim Jeong-kwon', 'Jo Jung-hwa, Jang Jin', 'Shin Ha-kyun, Kim Hee-seon, Park So-hyun, Kim Min-jun, Kim In-kwon, Park Sung-woong, Lim Seung-dae', null, 'Little Seung-jae stays up all night and writes letters to So-hee, pretending to be her father in Mars. Leaving Seung-jae''s innocent heart behind, So-hee leaves for a big city. Both grown up to be adults, Seung-jae is a postman who writes letters to So-hee''s grandma - the letters that never came from So-hee. So-hee''s heart hardens after hardships in life and she comes back to her hometown and Seung-jae''s heart swells up again at seeing her again...', 'Little Seung-jae stays up all night and writes letters to So-hee, pretending to be her father in Mars. Leaving Seung-jae''s innocent heart behind, So-hee leaves for a big city. Both grown up to be adults, Seung-jae is a postman who writes letters to So-hee''s grandma - the letters that never came from So-hee. So-hee''s heart hardens after hardships in life and she comes back to her hometown and Seung-jae''s heart swells up again at seeing her again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytfiyewSCfzUBricRjRHzGv8p5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57753'),
  ('1069281889206280069', 'A Letter to Momo', 2012, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Animation, Drama, Family', 'Hiroyuki Okiura, Masashi Ando, Koji Tanaka', 'Hiroyuki Okiura', 'Karen Miyama, Yûka, Toshiyuki Nishida, Koichi Yamadera, Cho, Yoshisada Sakaguchi, Ikuko Tani, Takeo Ogawa', 'PG', 'A shy 11-year-old''s life takes a strange turn when she discovers three hungry goblins living in the attic of her new house. She misses her old life. She misses her father so very much. Until she makes some new ghoulish friends.', 'A shy 11-year-old''s life takes a strange turn when she discovers three hungry goblins living in the attic of her new house. She misses her old life. She misses her father so very much. Until she makes some new ghoulish friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uH4c5t3Wzzv41Wq9ws2Q47N1Dzo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100271'),
  ('120163438177261989', 'A Letter to My Youth', 2026, 'Drama', 'Sim F., Arief Pribadi', 'Daud Sumolang', 'Millo Taslim, Agus Wibowo, Cleo Haura, Aqila Herby, Jordan Omar, Halim Latuconsina, Diandra Salsabila Lubis, Fendy Chow', null, 'A rebellious teen and a reserved caretaker form an unlikely bond in an orphanage as they come to terms with their painful pasts.', 'A rebellious teen and a reserved caretaker form an unlikely bond in an orphanage as they come to terms with their painful pasts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iqrp25kOrskrFDOKkKQWhFkI69e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1602705'),
