  ('555464139993311223', 'A Life Less Ordinary', 1997, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Danny Boyle, Brian Tufano, Matias Alvarez', 'John Hodge', 'Ewan McGregor, Cameron Diaz, Holly Hunter, Delroy Lindo, Ian Holm, Maury Chaykin, Dan Hedaya, Stanley Tucci', 'R', 'A couple of angels, O''Reilly and Jackson, are sent to Earth to make sure that their next supervised love-connection succeeds. They follow Celine, a spoiled rich girl who has just accidentally shot a suitor and, due to a misunderstanding, is kidnapped by janitor Robert. Although Celine quickly frees herself, she stays with Robert for thrills. O''Reilly and Jackson pursue, hoping to unite the prospective lovers.', 'A couple of angels, O''Reilly and Jackson, are sent to Earth to make sure that their next supervised love-connection succeeds. They follow Celine, a spoiled rich girl who has just accidentally shot a suitor and, due to a misunderstanding, is kidnapped by janitor Robert. Although Celine quickly frees herself, she stays with Robert for thrills. O''Reilly and Jackson pursue, hoping to unite the prospective lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tk7WNEwLZepFU2yPIIkRuQOO0Q9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8067'),
  ('812104682406749036', 'A Life of Her Own', 1950, 'Drama', 'George Cukor, George J. Folsey', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Lana Turner, Ray Milland, Tom Ewell, Louis Calhern, Ann Dvorak, Barry Sullivan, Margaret Phillips, Jean Hagen', 'NR', 'A young woman from Kansas moves to New York City, becomes highly successful at a prestigious modeling agency, and falls in love with a married man.', 'A young woman from Kansas moves to New York City, becomes highly successful at a prestigious modeling agency, and falls in love with a married man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/msKQceHxcDhCUT88WHa4ajkd7w4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:176734'),
  ('103848227532806954', 'A Life of Speed: The Juan Manuel Fangio Story', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Francisco Macri, Daniel Ortega', 'Luciano Origlio, Rodrigo H. Vila', 'Juan Manuel Fangio, Fernando Alonso, Alain Prost, Jackie Stewart, Mika Häkkinen, Carlos Reutemann, Toto Wolff, Nico Rosberg', null, 'Juan Manuel Fangio was the Formula One king, winning five world championships in the early 1950s — before protective gear or safety features were used.', 'Juan Manuel Fangio was the Formula One king, winning five world championships in the early 1950s — before protective gear or safety features were used.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icVuchG6yFTPe5VM11HSFA7jmMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675598'),
  ('720465743830750987', 'A Life Too Short: The Isabella Nardoni Case', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Micael Langer, Cláudio Manoel, Criss Ghattas', 'Felipe Flexa, Micael Langer, Cláudio Manoel', 'Hebe Camargo, Márcio Campos, Marcos Carneiro, Ilana Casoy, Francisco Cembranelli, José Luiz Datena, Maria Lydia Flandoli, Rodrigo Hidalgo', null, 'When a 5-year-old girl falls from her father''s apartment, her mother embarks on a quest for justice — and is put under the national spotlight.', 'When a 5-year-old girl falls from her father''s apartment, her mother embarks on a quest for justice — and is put under the national spotlight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7KK4s4QOYemq1fC9stcdZbhIiVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1158959'),
  ('19805494920615220', 'A Light-Play in Black-White-Gray', 1930, 'Drama', 'László Moholy-Nagy', null, null, null, 'This short film made by László Moholy-Nagy is based on the shadow patterns created by his Light-Space Modulator, an early kinetic sculpture consisting of a variety of curved objects in a carefully choreographed cycle of movements. Created in 1930, the film was originally planned as the sixth and final part of a much longer work depicting the new space-time.', 'This short film made by László Moholy-Nagy is based on the shadow patterns created by his Light-Space Modulator, an early kinetic sculpture consisting of a variety of curved objects in a carefully choreographed cycle of movements. Created in 1930, the film was originally planned as the sixth and final part of a much longer work depicting the new space-time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/smb787BMItqC6J29lBZZfYZKetk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186164'),
  ('204923849683237068', 'A Limousine the Colour of Midsummer''s Eve', 1982, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Janis Streics, Gļebs Korotejevs, Harijs Kukels', 'Māra Svīre', 'Lilita Bērziņa, Olga Dreģe, Uldis Dumpis, Gundars Āboliņš, Baiba Indriksone, Boļeslavs Ružs, Diāna Zande, Līga Liepiņa', null, 'When old auntie Mirta succeeds in a lottery and wins a car which she cannot use herself, all sorts of family members suddenly appear by her side, hoping to get the car after their auntie''s death. Until then, they had never helped Mirta, it was only her neighbours who supported her in her old age. Now, her nephew Ēriks with his wife and son, and her ex-daughter-in-law Olita with her second husband and daughter, would all love to get their hands on the car that''s in the colour of Midsummer''s Eve.', 'When old auntie Mirta succeeds in a lottery and wins a car which she cannot use herself, all sorts of family members suddenly appear by her side, hoping to get the car after their auntie''s death. Until then, they had never helped Mirta, it was only her neighbours who supported her in her old age. Now, her nephew Ēriks with his wife and son, and her ex-daughter-in-law Olita with her second husband and daughter, would all love to get their hands on the car that''s in the colour of Midsummer''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nHQhJePRBxbsKNDtfOwIXeM1QS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116432'),
  ('59403712990366393', 'A Line of Fire', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Matt Shapira, Eitan Almagor', 'Matt Shapira, Chris Covell', 'David A.R. White, Cuba Gooding Jr., Katrina Bowden, Jason Patric, Scott Baio, Gabriel ''G-Rod'' Rodriguez, Eve Richards, Tommy Snider', 'R', 'After working as a secret agent in the FBI for ten years, Jack ''Cash'' Conry left it all behind after his wife passed in order to dedicate himself to his two daughters. Despite a fulfilling life at home, Cash misses the chance to make an impact and has been considering a return to the force. The decision is made for him when his old partner’s niece Jamie calls him for help, launching Cash right back into a world of danger, corruption and intrigue.', 'After working as a secret agent in the FBI for ten years, Jack ''Cash'' Conry left it all behind after his wife passed in order to dedicate himself to his two daughters. Despite a fulfilling life at home, Cash misses the chance to make an impact and has been considering a return to the force. The decision is made for him when his old partner’s niece Jamie calls him for help, launching Cash right back into a world of danger, corruption and intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jSG2mg1998DUAam6X9EA6SeJmqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1367575'),
  ('1009693257184466257', 'A Lion Is in the Streets', 1953, 'Drama', 'Raoul Walsh, William Kissell, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Luther Davis', 'James Cagney, Barbara Hale, Anne Francis, Warner Anderson, John McIntire, Jeanne Cagney, Lon Chaney Jr., Frank McHugh', 'NR', 'A charismatic peddler from the Bayous finds his true calling in politics. Is he a demagogue in the making?', 'A charismatic peddler from the Bayous finds his true calling in politics. Is he a demagogue in the making?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdAmb3wlIbTx0Y18ihx1aTTSUhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109332'),
  ('37004423044042116', 'A Little Bit of Freedom', 2003, 'Drama', 'Yüksel Yavuz', null, 'Çağdaş Bozkurt, Leroy Delmar, Nazmi Kırık, Necmettin Çobanoğlu, Susanna Rozkosny, Sunay Girisken, Turgay Aydın', null, 'In the metropolitan city of Hamburg, illegal immigrant Chernor, an openly gay African youth with blond hair, makes his money by dealing drugs and dreams of one day living in Australia. Baran, meanwhile, is a Kurdish bicycle delivery boy living in constant fear of deportation, who keeps his past in a video camera. The two form a bond when they meet, and their shared struggles to survive soon develop into a relationship that is threatened when Baran loses his job.', 'In the metropolitan city of Hamburg, illegal immigrant Chernor, an openly gay African youth with blond hair, makes his money by dealing drugs and dreams of one day living in Australia. Baran, meanwhile, is a Kurdish bicycle delivery boy living in constant fear of deportation, who keeps his past in a video camera. The two form a bond when they meet, and their shared struggles to survive soon develop into a relationship that is threatened when Baran loses his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SZUgDrvRbSxwTUen14S0toYsIL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214691'),
  ('28977526840873478', 'A Little Bit of Heaven', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Russell Carpenter, Jon Mallard, James Roque Jr.', 'Gren Wells', 'Kate Hudson, Gael García Bernal, Romany Malco, Kathy Bates, Lucy Punch, Whoopi Goldberg, Peter Dinklage, Rosemarie DeWitt', 'PG-13', 'A guarded woman finds out she''s dying of cancer but, when she meets her match, the threat of falling in love is scarier than death.', 'A guarded woman finds out she''s dying of cancer but, when she meets her match, the threat of falling in love is scarier than death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l6PPyobgVN4eVlD9pJZg2SIPJMT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45156'),
  ('947012100705616679', 'A Little Bit Zombie', 2012, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Horror', 'Casey Walker, Kevin C.W. Wong', 'Christopher Bond, Trevor Martin', 'Stephen McHattie, Kristopher Turner, Yan-Kay Crystal Lowe, Shawn Roberts, Emilie Ullerup, George Buza, Robert Maillet, Kristen Hager', 'R', 'Infected by a virus, a mild mannered HR manager attempts to fulfill his overwhelming desire for brains, all while trying to keep it together so as not to incur the wrath of his bridezilla-to-be.', 'Infected by a virus, a mild mannered HR manager attempts to fulfill his overwhelming desire for brains, all while trying to keep it together so as not to incur the wrath of his bridezilla-to-be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bNDx7PrxTuagvRlVcVxAIfwPXI4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90118'),
  ('898209323993364898', 'A Little Chaos', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jack Ravenscroft, David Hindle, Tamara King', 'Jeremy Brock, Alan Rickman', 'Kate Winslet, Matthias Schoenaerts, Alan Rickman, Stanley Tucci, Helen McCrory, Steven Waddington, Jennifer Ehle, Rupert Penry-Jones', 'R', 'A landscape gardener is hired by famous architect Le Nôtre to construct the grand gardens at the palace of Versailles. As the two work on the palace, they find themselves drawn to each other and are thrown into rivalries within the court of King Louis XIV.', 'A landscape gardener is hired by famous architect Le Nôtre to construct the grand gardens at the palace of Versailles. As the two work on the palace, they find themselves drawn to each other and are thrown into rivalries within the court of King Louis XIV.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFtSpvgTqQJC2IMaoKd7WsLPknN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283227'),
  ('101194974373040438', 'A Little Christmas Charm', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Anthony C. Metchie, Rich Newey', null, 'Ashley Greene, Brendan Penny, Britt Irvin, Barclay Hope, Françoise Yip, Anne Marie DeLuise, Chenier Hundal, Megan Leitch', null, 'Holly, a jewelry designer finds a lost charm bracelet and teams up with investigative reporter Greg in hopes of finding the owner and returning it by Christmas Eve.', 'Holly, a jewelry designer finds a lost charm bracelet and teams up with investigative reporter Greg in hopes of finding the owner and returning it by Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jt1wNBJ4RffAH46RmduatD3OUML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:746463'),
  ('32135851352474922', 'A Little Comfort', 2004, 'Drama', 'Armand Lameloise', 'Armand Lameloise', 'Arthur Moncla, Rémi Bresson, Élodie Bollée, Anna Mihalcea, Jonathan Reyes, Stanislas Forlani, Fabienne Babe, Manuel Blanc', 'NR', 'Arnaud and Guillaume are in their last year of high school. Summer is approaching and like any teenager, they''re thinking about cigarettes, alcohol and sex. But boys or girls? Future looks so blurry when you''re a teenager!', 'Arnaud and Guillaume are in their last year of high school. Summer is approaching and like any teenager, they''re thinking about cigarettes, alcohol and sex. But boys or girls? Future looks so blurry when you''re a teenager!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DBUc2GLVkuM2KtAiryfyFnp9Rf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56805'),
  ('306786059452393864', 'A Little Daytime Drama', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Heather Hawthorn-Doyle, Jesse D.E. Young, Jackie Lind', 'Judith Berg, Sandra Berg', 'Jen Lilley, Ryan Paevey, Serge Houde, Linda Dano, Brittany Mitchell, Jake Foy, Michele Scarabelli, Serge Houde', 'G', 'In order to save her daytime soap drama from cancellation, head writer Maggie must convince Darin, fan favorite actor and her real-life ex-boyfriend, to return to the show.', 'In order to save her daytime soap drama from cancellation, head writer Maggie must convince Darin, fan favorite actor and her real-life ex-boyfriend, to return to the show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLjWCYBcs8DYlscls7NI437d5Cc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849277'),
  ('134925637145297726', 'A Little Doll', 1988, 'Drama, Romance', 'Isaak Fridberg, Vladimir Nakhabtsev, Olga Burkova', 'Igor Ageev', 'Svetlana Zasypkina, Irina Metlitskaya, Igor Bugatko, Vladimir Menshov, Natalya Nazarova, Aleksey Polovichev, Dmitri Zubarev, Ervand Arzumanyan', null, 'A young Russian gymnast is forced to return to the life of an ordinary teenage girl after an injury prevents her from competing.', 'A young Russian gymnast is forced to return to the life of an ordinary teenage girl after an injury prevents her from competing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Fmoh3I0CUQz0g0HWr5jHcSjjra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254269'),
  ('651244044885647945', 'A Little Dream of Me', 2026, 'Drama, Musical, Romance', 'Chung Chi Cong, Anh La', 'Chung Chi Cong, Hanh, Nguyen Thanh Tu', 'Vo Phan Kim Khanh, Tran Doan Hoang, Huu Chau, Tran Phuong Nam, Chi Pham', null, 'An emotional journey of young people searching for the meaning of their dreams, only to discover that adulthood asks a deeper question: who they want to pursue those dreams with.', 'An emotional journey of young people searching for the meaning of their dreams, only to discover that adulthood asks a deeper question: who they want to pursue those dreams with.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BMzA0YWVkYzMtZjQ4NS00N2FkLTg1NWYtY2IyMjcyOGQ3Y2Y3XkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-little-dream-of-me-2026-1'),
  ('443974506487623362', 'A Little Help', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Michael J. Weithorn, Glen Trotiner, Thomas M. Harting', 'Michael J. Weithorn', 'Jenna Fischer, Chris O''Donnell, Kim Coates, Lesley Ann Warren, Sara Kapner, Brooke Smith, Daniel Yelsky, Jay Klaitz', 'R', 'It''s a movie for everyone whose life has been thrown off-course, out of whack, or simply not turned out the way they planned it. In other words, it''s a movie for everyone, period. Set in suburban Long Island in the summer of 2002, with the psychic wounds of 9/11 still fresh, A Little Help is a story that takes a comic, searching and profoundly empathetic look at a few pivotal months in the life of dental hygienist Laura Pehlke (Jenna Fischer)-an ordinary woman whose life suddenly flies off the rails-and her heroic efforts to re-establish a sense of security and normalcy for herself and her son.', 'It''s a movie for everyone whose life has been thrown off-course, out of whack, or simply not turned out the way they planned it. In other words, it''s a movie for everyone, period. Set in suburban Long Island in the summer of 2002, with the psychic wounds of 9/11 still fresh, A Little Help is a story that takes a comic, searching and profoundly empathetic look at a few pivotal months in the life of dental hygienist Laura Pehlke (Jenna Fischer)-an ordinary woman whose life suddenly flies off the rails-and her heroic efforts to re-establish a sense of security and normalcy for herself and her son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz5Dtx02nATmBskqAp1m8YJgSVR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65056'),
  ('582457498273671238', 'A Little Lesson in Love', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Lazare Pedron, Lucas Loubaresse, Clothilde Metral', 'Ève Deboise', 'Laetitia Dosch, Pierre Deladonchamps, Lorette Nyssen, Paul Kircher, Anouar Kardellas, Alizée Caugnies, Kim Truong, Aaron Kadouche', null, 'Julie and Mathieu, soon after meeting for the first time, embark in a quest across Paris to stop one of Mathieu’s pupil at school from doing anything stupid after finding a troubling love letter. Inside Mathieu’s old little car, the two characters mix like oil and water, with the math teacher’s carelessness for others not going so well with Julie’s larger than life personality. The more Mathieu discovers some fragility under Julie’s exuberance, the more the two become inseparable.', 'Julie and Mathieu, soon after meeting for the first time, embark in a quest across Paris to stop one of Mathieu’s pupil at school from doing anything stupid after finding a troubling love letter. Inside Mathieu’s old little car, the two characters mix like oil and water, with the math teacher’s carelessness for others not going so well with Julie’s larger than life personality. The more Mathieu discovers some fragility under Julie’s exuberance, the more the two become inseparable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ad7JsiX68eP4zHB7bXth3mV1zP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843733'),
  ('72173289877911959', 'A Little Lust', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Veronica Pivetti, Antonello Emidi', 'Giovanna Gra', 'Andrea Amato, Pia Engleberth, Corrado Invernizzi, Veronica Pivetti, Carolina Pavone, Francesco De Miranda, Sara Sartini', null, 'Sixteen year old Rocco''s two aims in life are to get laid and to see his favorite pop star in concert with his two best friends. When a bullying incident at school forces Rocco to come out to his divorced middle-class parents their liberal leanings are severely tested. Luckily his two friends stand by him and join him in running away from home (in his parents stolen car) to see their favorite singer in concert, followed hot on their heels by his neurotic mother and eccentric gran.', 'Sixteen year old Rocco''s two aims in life are to get laid and to see his favorite pop star in concert with his two best friends. When a bullying incident at school forces Rocco to come out to his divorced middle-class parents their liberal leanings are severely tested. Luckily his two friends stand by him and join him in running away from home (in his parents stolen car) to see their favorite singer in concert, followed hot on their heels by his neurotic mother and eccentric gran.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDkOsmzRToy1J999SDBW8gvYMYW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:368573'),
  ('1141030962673008995', 'A Little Monastery in Tuscany', 1988, 'Documentary', 'Otar Iosseliani, Lionel Cousin', null, 'André Forest, Etienne Roze, Olivier Nelle, Emmanuel Roze, Jean-Charles Leroy', null, 'It is a brief documentary which records the life of five Augustinian monks in the little monastery of Castelnuovo dell''Abate, a Tuscan village, as well as the everyday life of people in the small town, from farmers to meat-hackers, from wine-makers to wild boar hunters.', 'It is a brief documentary which records the life of five Augustinian monks in the little monastery of Castelnuovo dell''Abate, a Tuscan village, as well as the everyday life of people in the small town, from farmers to meat-hackers, from wine-makers to wild boar hunters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yEpdUPztMOnMjPwasl3YYYRKkr7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:216658'),
  ('292993321298116285', 'A Little Night Music', 1977, 'Romance, Music, Comedy', 'Hal Prince, Arthur Ibbetson, Claudio Schreiber', 'Hugh Wheeler', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Diana Rigg, Len Cariou, Lesley-Anne Down, Hermione Gingold, Laurence Guittard, Christopher Guard, Lesley Dunlop', 'PG', 'A tangled web of affairs is weaved around actress Desirée Armfeldt and the men who love her: lawyer Fredrik Egerman and Count Carl-Magnus Malcom. When Desirée''s show travels through Fredrik''s town, the estranged lovers'' passion rekindles.', 'A tangled web of affairs is weaved around actress Desirée Armfeldt and the men who love her: lawyer Fredrik Egerman and Count Carl-Magnus Malcom. When Desirée''s show travels through Fredrik''s town, the estranged lovers'' passion rekindles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ynpFczKWhvqP47OsIk5FIzUsK7X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77078'),
  ('25732582849909852', 'A Little Pond', 2010, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, War', 'Choi Jin-woong, Lee Sang-woo, Lee Jong-seok', 'Lee Sang-woo', 'Moon Sung-keun, Jeon Hye-jin, Shin Myeong-cheol, Kim Roi-ha, Kim Seung-wook, Lee Dae-yeon, Kang Shin-il, Song Kang-ho', null, 'The Korean war does not start well for the US. They are being routed by the North Koreans and In July 1950, the early stage of the Korean War, at the Jugok Village in the middle of the Korean Peninsula, Chang-yee and his friends grow excited over the amateur singing contest knowing nothing about what is going on around them. At the time, the US Army keeps losing and are pushed back to the village, evacuating all villagers to head south. The villagers took refuge like going on a picnic believing that the US Army is protecting them, they just follow their orders moving south bound.', 'The Korean war does not start well for the US. They are being routed by the North Koreans and In July 1950, the early stage of the Korean War, at the Jugok Village in the middle of the Korean Peninsula, Chang-yee and his friends grow excited over the amateur singing contest knowing nothing about what is going on around them. At the time, the US Army keeps losing and are pushed back to the village, evacuating all villagers to head south. The villagers took refuge like going on a picnic believing that the US Army is protecting them, they just follow their orders moving south bound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC6OPwxe1rt5PNT4SXrKdcl8DKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120247'),
  ('2127261269861081', 'A Little Princess', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Park Jun-gyu, Lee Hyung-seob, Heo In-moo', 'Im Hee-chul, Heo In-moo', 'Kim Su-an, Na Moon-hee, Im Han-bin, Kang Bo-kyung, Chun Woo-hee, Shim Wan-jun, Ko Kyu-pil, Choi Jung-yoon', null, 'Mal-soon is poor 72-years-old granny and enjoys her single life. One day, Gong-ju and her baby sister appear in front of Mal-soon. Gong-ju introduces herself as Mal-soon''s granddaughter. Since then, Mal-soon''s peaceful life changes.', 'Mal-soon is poor 72-years-old granny and enjoys her single life. One day, Gong-ju and her baby sister appear in front of Mal-soon. Gong-ju introduces herself as Mal-soon''s granddaughter. Since then, Mal-soon''s peaceful life changes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOdSsv38JgnimLfAvYR57DJqCOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575722'),
  ('848930769463674759', 'A Little Red Flower', 2020, 'Drama, Family', 'Rui Zhong, Han Yan', 'Han Yan, Jiawei Jia, Han Li', 'Jackson Yee, Liu Haocun, Gao Yalin, Zhu Yuanyuan, Xia Yu, Yue Yunpeng, Yu Shanchuan, Chen Zhixi', null, 'The film tells a warm and realistic story, thinking and facing the ultimate problem that every ordinary person will face-imagining that death may come at any time, the only thing we have to do is love and cherish.', 'The film tells a warm and realistic story, thinking and facing the ultimate problem that every ordinary person will face-imagining that death may come at any time, the only thing we have to do is love and cherish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dunj8LVbJBdUe7np3zlRFAncdTO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:716815'),
  ('884066293833621580', 'A Little Romance', 1979, 'Comedy, Romance', 'George Roy Hill, Pierre-William Glenn', 'Allan Burns', 'Laurence Olivier, Diane Lane, Thelonious Bernard, Arthur Hill, Sally Kellerman, Broderick Crawford, David Dukes, Andrew Duncan', 'PG', 'Intellectually precocious teenager Lauren King lives in Paris with her somewhat ditzy mother. On a movie set, she strikes up a friendship with teenage film buff Daniel Michon. After Lauren''s mother forbids her to date the outspoken Daniel, the young lovebirds team up with eccentric pickpocket Julius to run away to Venice, where, according to legend, a couple who kiss under the Bridge of Sighs will stay together forever.', 'Intellectually precocious teenager Lauren King lives in Paris with her somewhat ditzy mother. On a movie set, she strikes up a friendship with teenage film buff Daniel Michon. After Lauren''s mother forbids her to date the outspoken Daniel, the young lovebirds team up with eccentric pickpocket Julius to run away to Venice, where, according to legend, a couple who kiss under the Bridge of Sighs will stay together forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i6M3sxY2jHVey55qWmgTPomSuvc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20813'),
  ('554664675660235695', 'A Little Something Extra', 2024, 'Comedy, Family', 'Artus, Jean-Marc Gullino, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Milan Mauger, Artus, Clément Marchand', 'Artus, Clovis Cornillac, Alice Belaïdi, Marc Riso, Céline Groussard, Gad Abecassis, Ludovic Boul, Stanislas Carmont', null, 'To escape the police, a father and his son are forced to find refuge in a summer camp for young adults with mental disabilities, taking on the role of an educator and a boarder. The beginning of troubles and a wonderful human experience that will change them forever.', 'To escape the police, a father and his son are forced to find refuge in a summer camp for young adults with mental disabilities, taking on the role of an educator and a boarder. The beginning of troubles and a wonderful human experience that will change them forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhL8QC7O6fFfwgV6pDf1WSOxGcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1152014'),
  ('131185939933981249', 'A Little Thing Called Love', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Puttipong Promsaka Na Sakolnakorn, Wasin Pokpong, Ruengwit Ramasoota', 'Wasin Pokpong, Puttipong Promsaka Na Sakolnakorn, Samut Nuamsetti', 'Mario Maurer, Pimchanok Luevisadpaibul, Sudarat Butrprom, Pijittra Siriwetchapan, Peerawat Herabat, Akkaranat Ariyaritwikul, Paveena Rojjindangam, Nisa Boonsantia', null, 'An introverted young girl falls in love with a popular senior. However, as she begins to come out of her shell, she faces several new problems.', 'An introverted young girl falls in love with a popular senior. However, as she begins to come out of her shell, she faces several new problems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdm2vTbBuUo8lWcizGW48FzIelb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57627'),
  ('845148802858487077', 'A Little Trip to Heaven', 2005, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Baltasar Kormákur, Óttar Guðnason', 'Edward Martin Weinman', 'Forest Whitaker, Julia Stiles, Peter Coyote, Jeremy Renner, Iddo Goldberg, Joanna Scanlan, Philip Jackson, Alfred Harmsworth', 'R', 'Insurance investigator Abraham Holt travels to a tiny town in rural Minnesota to look into a particularly unusual insurance claim stemming from a horrific car accident. As Holt examines the scene of the wreck, it all seems a bit too perfect. And when he interviews Isold Mcbride and her shifty husband, Fred -- the impoverished beneficiaries of the massive, recently initiated life-insurance policy -- he begins to suspect that something is amiss.', 'Insurance investigator Abraham Holt travels to a tiny town in rural Minnesota to look into a particularly unusual insurance claim stemming from a horrific car accident. As Holt examines the scene of the wreck, it all seems a bit too perfect. And when he interviews Isold Mcbride and her shifty husband, Fred -- the impoverished beneficiaries of the massive, recently initiated life-insurance policy -- he begins to suspect that something is amiss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRfJgzVdPp77Zn3gvXFEFxkdtNT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15124'),
  ('998472960385015605', 'A Little White Lie', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Edd Lukas, Michael Maren', 'Michael Maren', 'Michael Shannon, Kate Hudson, Don Johnson, Da''Vine Joy Randolph, Mark Boone Junior, Zach Braff, Perry Mattfeld, Aja Naomi King', null, 'A handyman living in New York City is mistaken for a famous and famously reclusive writer and brought to a university where he is to deliver a keynote address.', 'A handyman living in New York City is mistaken for a famous and famously reclusive writer and brought to a university where he is to deliver a keynote address.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ne9ninjEnyaRkZQnNAZuPVYgpgu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:714964'),
