  ('155308110244751500', 'A Lonely Place to Die', 2011, 'Adventure, Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Julian Gilbey, Ali Asad, Scott Bates', 'Will Gilbey, Julian Gilbey', 'Melissa George, Ed Speleers, Eamonn Walker, Alec Newman, Karel Roden, Kate Magowan, Garry Sweeney, Stephen McCole', 'R', 'A group of five mountaineers are hiking and climbing in the Scottish Highlands when they discover a young Serbian girl buried in a small chamber in the wilderness. They become caught up in a terrifying game of cat and mouse with the kidnappers as they try to get the girl to safety.', 'A group of five mountaineers are hiking and climbing in the Scottish Highlands when they discover a young Serbian girl buried in a small chamber in the wilderness. They become caught up in a terrifying game of cat and mouse with the kidnappers as they try to get the girl to safety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xVYY1U5nYfx2PfJMs6knO8VZRk0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81390'),
