  ('473934067803824526', 'A Long Ride from Hell', 1968, 'Action, Western', 'Camillo Bazzoni, Enzo Barboni', 'Steve Reeves, Roberto Natale', 'Steve Reeves, Wayde Preston, Guido Lollobrigida, Mimmo Palmara, Silvana Venturelli, Nello Pazzafini, Franco Fantasia, Enzo Fiermonte', 'R', 'Mike Sturges and his younger brother, Roy, are sentenced to Yuma Penitentiary on a trumped-up train robbery charge. Both endure cruel treatment before Mike escapes to extract revenge on their enemies.', 'Mike Sturges and his younger brother, Roy, are sentenced to Yuma Penitentiary on a trumped-up train robbery charge. Both endure cruel treatment before Mike escapes to extract revenge on their enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pX8r2kjyi7fA5AWCCm8u1U3JYcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86472'),
