  ('997947542183148626', 'A Long Walk', 2006, 'Drama', 'Koichi Ishii, Eiji Okuda', 'Sakura Momoyama, Yukiko Yamamuro', 'Ken Ogata, Hana Sugiura, Saki Takaoka, Eiji Okuda, Shota Matsuda, Kiwako Harada, Midori Kiuchi, Masahiko Tsugawa', null, 'A lonely retired girl''s High School Principal who''s lost his wife to alcoholism moves to an old apartment in a country town. There he forms a relationship with a neglected little neighborhood girl.', 'A lonely retired girl''s High School Principal who''s lost his wife to alcoholism moves to an old apartment in a country town. There he forms a relationship with a neglected little neighborhood girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5F4Dm1r92l3QDIkjqADti5LG4hM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273311'),
  ('1029800399801129935', 'A Long Way Down', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Pascal Chaumeil, Ben Davis', 'Jack Thorne', 'Pierce Brosnan, Aaron Paul, Imogen Poots, Toni Collette, Sam Neill, Rosamund Pike, Tuppence Middleton, Joe Cole', 'R', 'Four lost souls—a disgraced TV presenter, a foul-mouthed teen, an isolated single mother, and a failed musician—decide to end their lives on the same night, New Year''s Eve. When this disillusioned quartet of strangers meet unintentionally at the same suicide hotspot, a London high-rise with the well-earned nickname Topper''s Tower, they mutually agree to call off their plans for six weeks, forming an unconventional, dysfunctional family. They become media sensations as the Topper House Four and search together for reasons to keep on living.', 'Four lost souls—a disgraced TV presenter, a foul-mouthed teen, an isolated single mother, and a failed musician—decide to end their lives on the same night, New Year''s Eve. When this disillusioned quartet of strangers meet unintentionally at the same suicide hotspot, a London high-rise with the well-earned nickname Topper''s Tower, they mutually agree to call off their plans for six weeks, forming an unconventional, dysfunctional family. They become media sensations as the Topper House Four and search together for reasons to keep on living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ibtYPDUQXKK2CIYzMEWgt1VNMlP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141043'),
  ('998745440485012184', 'A Long Way Home', 1981, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Robert Markowitz, Donald H. Birnkrant', 'Dennis Nemec', 'Timothy Hutton, Brenda Vaccaro, Rosanna Arquette, Paul Regina, George Dzundza, John Lehne, Bonnie Bartlett, Wil Wheaton', null, 'A married teenager sets out to find his long-lost brother and sister years after all three had been placed with different families following their abandonment by their migrant worker parents. Luckily, he finds a compassionate social worker who, at first reluctantly, decides to help him cut through the bureaucratic red tape.', 'A married teenager sets out to find his long-lost brother and sister years after all three had been placed with different families following their abandonment by their migrant worker parents. Luckily, he finds a compassionate social worker who, at first reluctantly, decides to help him cut through the bureaucratic red tape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dyw5UhGcjOZf62iLTYzdFzCURWq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151332'),
  ('317967672671748211', 'A Lost Lady', 1934, 'Drama', 'Alfred E. Green, Sidney Hickox, Frank Shaw', 'Gene Markey, Kathryn Scola', 'Barbara Stanwyck, Frank Morgan, Ricardo Cortez, Lyle Talbot, Phillip Reed, Hobart Cavanaugh, Henry Kolker, Rafaela Ottiano', 'NR', 'A bitter woman who thinks she''ll never love again marries, only to fall for a brash young man.', 'A bitter woman who thinks she''ll never love again marries, only to fall for a brash young man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lTiK8CYfa6GN5ILGo0U4kYlquyK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235678'),
  ('381178435749034291', 'A Lost Man', 2007, 'Drama', 'Danielle Arbid, Céline Bozon, Denis Imbert', 'Danielle Arbid', 'Melvil Poupaud, Alexander Siddig, Darina Al Joundi, Yasmine, Carole Ammoun, Takla Chamoun, Priska Farrel, Laudi Arbid', null, 'Inspired by the photographic travels of Antione d''Agata, Danielle Arbid''s worldly drama follows a French photographer who travels the globe to seek out the most extreme experiences imaginable. Thomas is a fearless shutterbug who''s always willing to put his life on the line for the sake of a good shot. Upon falling under the spell of an enigmatic old man named Fouad Saleh, the photographer travels to the Far East in hopes of uncovering the secrets of the man who can no longer recall his own past. As the photographer soon finds out, it''s often the most innocent endeavors that yield the most profound and transformative results.', 'Inspired by the photographic travels of Antione d''Agata, Danielle Arbid''s worldly drama follows a French photographer who travels the globe to seek out the most extreme experiences imaginable. Thomas is a fearless shutterbug who''s always willing to put his life on the line for the sake of a good shot. Upon falling under the spell of an enigmatic old man named Fouad Saleh, the photographer travels to the Far East in hopes of uncovering the secrets of the man who can no longer recall his own past. As the photographer soon finds out, it''s often the most innocent endeavors that yield the most profound and transformative results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qrdtdRk2uL5EeYTWHYlQoXSIpYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112411'),
  ('322971556401705364', 'A Lot Like Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Stacey N. Harding, Randal Platt', 'Amyn Kaderali', 'Maggie Lawson, Christopher Russell, Marlie Collins, Matt Visser, Frances Flanagan, Ian Collins, Luvia Petersen, Brenda Crichlow', 'G', 'Jessica Roberts owns the most popular Christmas Tree lot in the picturesque New England town of Hudson Springs. But when big-city marketing executive, Clay Moore moves a "Big Box" store into the area and starts selling trees, Jasmine finds her business in jeopardy. As their professional competition escalates, Jasmine and Clay run into another complication - they start falling for each other.', 'Jessica Roberts owns the most popular Christmas Tree lot in the picturesque New England town of Hudson Springs. But when big-city marketing executive, Clay Moore moves a "Big Box" store into the area and starts selling trees, Jasmine finds her business in jeopardy. As their professional competition escalates, Jasmine and Clay run into another complication - they start falling for each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nEiDoD653v8afwWsEkSG2r1TeAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:877819'),
  ('125225233389514835', 'A Lot Like Love', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Nigel Cole, John de Borman', 'Colin Patrick Lynch', 'Ashton Kutcher, Amanda Peet, Kathryn Hahn, Kal Penn, Ali Larter, Taryn Manning, Aimee Garcia, Jeremy Sisto', 'PG-13', 'On a flight from Los Angeles to New York, Oliver and Emily make a connection, only to decide that they are poorly suited to be together. Over the next seven years, however, they are reunited time and time again, they go from being acquaintances to close friends to... lovers?', 'On a flight from Los Angeles to New York, Oliver and Emily make a connection, only to decide that they are poorly suited to be together. Over the next seven years, however, they are reunited time and time again, they go from being acquaintances to close friends to... lovers?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6xrF9zwEbYiYBOalMO14RAWBLLj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8976'),
