  ('141307626262312212', 'A Loud House Christmas', 2021, 'Family, Comedy', 'Jonathan Judge, Jules Labarthe', 'Liz Maccie', 'Wolfgang Schaeffer, Jahzir Bruno, Lexi DiBenedetto, Dora Dolphin, Sophia Woodward, Catherine Ashmore Bradley, Morgan McGill, Aubin Bradley', null, 'Lincoln Loud gears up for the ultimate Christmas, until he finds out that most of his sisters have plans to be elsewhere for the big day. Determined to remind his family that they all need to be together, Lincoln and his best friend Clyde McBride embark on a mission to preserve the family’s holiday traditions.', 'Lincoln Loud gears up for the ultimate Christmas, until he finds out that most of his sisters have plans to be elsewhere for the big day. Determined to remind his family that they all need to be together, Lincoln and his best friend Clyde McBride embark on a mission to preserve the family’s holiday traditions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/572kONypScXTz8detAOarXGbijI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674610'),
  ('949605701299379622', 'A Love', 2007, 'Action, Drama', 'Kwak Kyung-taek, Kim Sang-chul, Ki Se-hun', 'Kwak Kyung-taek', 'Ju Jin-mo, Park Si-yeon, Joo Hyun, Kim Min-jun, Lim Hyun-sung, Cha Do Jin, Kwak Min-seok, Lee Hwi-hyang', null, 'In-ho is willing to do anything to protect his first love, Mi-ju, including murder. They cannot forget each other while In-ho is in prison, but their love does not go smoothly.', 'In-ho is willing to do anything to protect his first love, Mi-ju, including murder. They cannot forget each other while In-ho is in prison, but their love does not go smoothly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kISG5ljzXg34TwsqbToGPu8Ebqy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49093'),
