  ('807874938798273864', 'A Love Song for Latasha', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Sophia Nahli Allison, Sophia Nahli Allison', null, 'Brittany Hudson', null, 'A dreamlike conversation with the past and the present, reimagining Latasha Harlins'' story by excavating intimate memories shared by those who loved her.', 'A dreamlike conversation with the past and the present, reimagining Latasha Harlins'' story by excavating intimate memories shared by those who loved her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pZ3PHUoqfxJYyNgprIrQJs3HgWP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:631344'),
  ('298404074660710521', 'A Love Story', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marie Spencer, Alexis Michalik, Laetitia Martinoni', 'Alexis Michalik', 'Juliette Delacroix, Alexis Michalik, Pauline Bression, Manon Maindivide, Daniel Njo Lobé, Léontine d''Oncieu, Julian Cavé, Marie-Camille Soyer', null, 'Justine has never dated a woman, and Katia knows her life is hanging by a thread. But when they meet, it''s love at first sight. Katia and Justine decide to confront life living a love story, and giving birth to a baby girl, Jeanne. Twelve years later, Justine come to an orderly life and Katia, who kept the child, learn she is doomed. She has to find urgently a guardian for her daughter. Her only option : her brother William, a cynical and desillusioned writer...', 'Justine has never dated a woman, and Katia knows her life is hanging by a thread. But when they meet, it''s love at first sight. Katia and Justine decide to confront life living a love story, and giving birth to a baby girl, Jeanne. Twelve years later, Justine come to an orderly life and Katia, who kept the child, learn she is doomed. She has to find urgently a guardian for her daughter. Her only option : her brother William, a cynical and desillusioned writer...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cF3Uh5F4vybnyamwQxEyslbL6Vd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1009116'),
  ('917726955930491289', 'A Love to Hide', 2005, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Christian Faure', 'Pascal Fontanille, Samantha Mazéras', 'Jérémie Renier, Louise Monot, Bruno Todeschini, Nicolas Gob, Charlotte de Turckheim, Michel Jonasz, Olivier Saladin, Flannan Obé', null, 'A young Jewish girl, Sara, is looking to escape the clutches of the Third Reich after seeing her parents and sister brutally slain by a smuggler who betrayed them while attempting to escape to England. Terrified, she is sheltered by her childhood friend Jean, a homosexual in a clandestine relationship with his lover Philippe.', 'A young Jewish girl, Sara, is looking to escape the clutches of the Third Reich after seeing her parents and sister brutally slain by a smuggler who betrayed them while attempting to escape to England. Terrified, she is sheltered by her childhood friend Jean, a homosexual in a clandestine relationship with his lover Philippe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41ZFBfdWQsKbCiBBGitIp3Z6CgZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19521'),
  ('107700082359255506', 'A Love to Keep', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Juan Carlos Claver, Mireia Hidalgo, Javier Quintanilla', 'Juan Carlos Claver, Agustín Madariaga', 'Carme Elias, Susi Sánchez, Julieta Serrano, Juli Mira, Sergio Caballero, Álvaro Báguena, Toni Sevilla, Juan Fernández', null, 'Spain, the era of dictator Franco. Two female teachers are in love, but in those years and in that regime the love is not only forbidden but also a crime. To avoid their child been in prison, the parents of the one teacher, force her to be confined in a clinic for mental diseases, where she is heavily abused, the main treatment been electroshocks. After Franco''s fall, and the change of things, she is free to return to her home, under the surveillance of her mother. Her father, more compassionate, helps her escape and find her lover. But the years of been under electroshocks have damaged her health, and make it impossible to live a normal life.', 'Spain, the era of dictator Franco. Two female teachers are in love, but in those years and in that regime the love is not only forbidden but also a crime. To avoid their child been in prison, the parents of the one teacher, force her to be confined in a clinic for mental diseases, where she is heavily abused, the main treatment been electroshocks. After Franco''s fall, and the change of things, she is free to return to her home, under the surveillance of her mother. Her father, more compassionate, helps her escape and find her lover. But the years of been under electroshocks have damaged her health, and make it impossible to live a normal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8ZDB5Ldbpn9uKu5IcypuAC2kBeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109693'),
  ('906909360346828423', 'A Love to Remember', 2021, 'TV Movie, Romance', 'Michael Bishop, Kevin Royce, Corey MacGregor', 'Courtney Cilman', 'Rhiannon Fish, Edward Ruttle, Eileen Pedde, James Pizzinato, Havana Guppy, Tanya Jade, Quinn Hubscher, Megan Peta Hill', null, 'After a year of interacting exclusively online, Tenley, an eco-conscious horticulturist, finally works up the courage to meet her online crush, Jared. When Jared doesn’t show because of a bike accident, Tenley gets mistaken for his wife at the hospital. Soon, she’s forced to keep the lie up with Jared’s entire family and his annoyingly charming best friend, Everett in order to save Jared’s company… You’ve Got Mail meets While You Were Sleeping!', 'After a year of interacting exclusively online, Tenley, an eco-conscious horticulturist, finally works up the courage to meet her online crush, Jared. When Jared doesn’t show because of a bike accident, Tenley gets mistaken for his wife at the hospital. Soon, she’s forced to keep the lie up with Jared’s entire family and his annoyingly charming best friend, Everett in order to save Jared’s company… You’ve Got Mail meets While You Were Sleeping!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3uluurGLZ5oVBM4BNRA7kNgsAWb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779001'),
  ('1140510419741088950', 'A Love Too Captivating', 2025, 'Romance, Animation', null, null, 'Chiaki Kobayashi, Takeo Otsuka', null, 'Misuzu was branded a delinquent when a small incident left him isolated. But one day, he sees the top student, Kitahara, get surrounded by bullies and decides to help him out. That sparked Kitahara''s interest in the lonely boy, but Misuzu pushes Kitahara away. "If you get involved with me, you''ll get ostracized by everyone else too." But it won''t take long for Misuzu''s resolve to falter...', 'Misuzu was branded a delinquent when a small incident left him isolated. But one day, he sees the top student, Kitahara, get surrounded by bullies and decides to help him out. That sparked Kitahara''s interest in the lonely boy, but Misuzu pushes Kitahara away. "If you get involved with me, you''ll get ostracized by everyone else too." But it won''t take long for Misuzu''s resolve to falter...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zESBv0bTqtb4ICJ9oYn2HFec8JV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1445276'),
  ('1119725070115348797', 'A Love You', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Vincent Richard-Marquis, Paul Lefèvre', 'Paul Lefèvre', 'Antoine Gouy, Paul Lefèvre, Fanny Valette, Dominique Pinon, Vincent Leyris, Eddie Chignara, Déborah Krey, Alexandra Gentil', null, 'After a drunken evening and an unforgettable night with a total stranger, Manu wakes up alone to find a message on his arm giving him an appointment in Avignon. Convinced that the appointment is with the dreamy woman from the night before, he is ready to do anything to find her again.', 'After a drunken evening and an unforgettable night with a total stranger, Manu wakes up alone to find a message on his arm giving him an appointment in Avignon. Convinced that the appointment is with the dreamy woman from the night before, he is ready to do anything to find her again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kP2CKhWex9YAsI1hrdrr5W3ybe6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339186'),
  ('732968994977198526', 'A Lovely Way to Die', 1968, 'Mystery, Crime, Drama', 'David Lowell Rich, Peter R. Scoppa, Morris Hartzband', 'A.J. Russell', 'Kirk Douglas, Sylva Koscina, Eli Wallach, Kenneth Haigh, Martyn Green, Sharon Farrell, Ruth White, Philip Bosco', 'NR', 'A cop quits the force after too much disappointment in the system. He becomes a bodyguard of a rich recent widow. She is on trial for her husband''s murder. He decides to help her clear her name... and get over her husband.', 'A cop quits the force after too much disappointment in the system. He becomes a bodyguard of a rich recent widow. She is on trial for her husband''s murder. He decides to help her clear her name... and get over her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SC04D0n3Z4tQ5aGP6blSxgnApT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86302'),
  ('1006625167719888785', 'A Loving Father', 2002, 'Drama', 'Jacob Berger, Pascal Marti', 'Jacob Berger, Pascal Barollier, Ed Radtke', 'Gérard Depardieu, Guillaume Depardieu, Sylvie Testud, Julien Boisselier, Hiam Abbass, Frédéric Polier, Pierre-Alexandre Crevaux, Pippa Schallier', null, 'Writer Léo Shepherd lives in rural France together with his daughter Virginia, who manages his affairs. One day Virginia gets a call from the Swedish Academy. Léo has won the Nobel Prize for Literature. His estranged son Paul tries desperately to contact him, but is denied every time by his sister. When Léo starts traveling to the ceremony in Stockholm by motor bike, Paul decides to follow him and try to speak to him. Clearly Léo doesn''t want to be followed, starts speeding and gets involved in a accident, but isn''t badly hurt. The police confuse another motorist for Shepherd and announce his death. Paul, driven by his childhood experiences, decides to kidnap his father.', 'Writer Léo Shepherd lives in rural France together with his daughter Virginia, who manages his affairs. One day Virginia gets a call from the Swedish Academy. Léo has won the Nobel Prize for Literature. His estranged son Paul tries desperately to contact him, but is denied every time by his sister. When Léo starts traveling to the ceremony in Stockholm by motor bike, Paul decides to follow him and try to speak to him. Clearly Léo doesn''t want to be followed, starts speeding and gets involved in a accident, but isn''t badly hurt. The police confuse another motorist for Shepherd and announce his death. Paul, driven by his childhood experiences, decides to kidnap his father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iz0mPb7gJk3bNw7QspzA6G9ZBbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79031'),
  ('926988307379153209', 'A Loving Husband', 2016, 'Drama', 'Kazuhiko Yukawa', 'Kazuhiko Yukawa', 'Hiroshi Abe, Yuki Amami, Miho Kanno, Saki Aibu, Asuka Kudo, Akari Hayami, Kaoru Okunuki, Jiro Sato', null, 'Schoolteacher Yohei is married to Miyoko. For the first time in 25 years they begin to live by themselves when their son marries and moves out. Then Yohei discovers that all’s not well in his marriage.', 'Schoolteacher Yohei is married to Miyoko. For the first time in 25 years they begin to live by themselves when their son marries and moves out. Then Yohei discovers that all’s not well in his marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWp1UM9jsaXKa5mHrPoRpEtyMYd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411609'),
  ('190704354307548972', 'A Low Down Dirty Shame', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime, Action', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Matthew F. Leonetti, Charlie Picerni', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Keenen Ivory Wayans, Charles S. Dutton, Jada Pinkett Smith, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Andrew Divoff, Corwin Hawkins, Gary Carlos Cervantes, Gregory Sierra', 'R', 'A black detective becomes embroiled in a web of danger while searching for a fortune in missing drug money. During the course of his investigation, he encounters various old connections, ultimately confronting the criminal responsible for Shame''s expulsion from the force. He must also deal with two women, Angela, a beautiful old flame, and Peaches, his energetic but annoying sidekick.', 'A black detective becomes embroiled in a web of danger while searching for a fortune in missing drug money. During the course of his investigation, he encounters various old connections, ultimately confronting the criminal responsible for Shame''s expulsion from the force. He must also deal with two women, Angela, a beautiful old flame, and Peaches, his energetic but annoying sidekick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5XUfLrdoGfatObGXhqckYTNqFT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26352'),
  ('536542370467059553', 'A Lustful Mind', 1986, 'Drama', 'Joe D''Amato, Joe D''Amato', 'René Rivet', 'Lilli Carati, Al Cliver, Martin Philips, Noemie Chelkoff, Ursula Foti', null, 'Alessio, a young man from a well to do family, has been mute since the death of his mother two years ago. His father, who has subsequently remarried, sends him to his sister-in-law''s house in the country to recuperate. While staying there Alessio has erotic fantasies concerning his stepmother, his aunt and a young art restorer working on the estate, all of whom his father is sexually involved with.', 'Alessio, a young man from a well to do family, has been mute since the death of his mother two years ago. His father, who has subsequently remarried, sends him to his sister-in-law''s house in the country to recuperate. While staying there Alessio has erotic fantasies concerning his stepmother, his aunt and a young art restorer working on the estate, all of whom his father is sexually involved with.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p2UZPiQG4MihR3b81EGC54RgcY5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378882'),
  ('1050938987133330824', 'A Madder Red', 2021, 'Drama', 'Yuya Ishii, Yoichi Kamakari, Tetsuya Okabe', 'Yuya Ishii', 'Machiko Ono, Iori Wada, Yuki Katayama, Joe Odagiri, Masatoshi Nagase, Hirota Otsuka, Tateto Serizawa, Aki Maeda', null, '7 years ago, Yoichi died in a traffic accident. His wife Ryoko did not receive compensation from her husband''s death. She has since raised her son Junpei by herself. Junpei is now a middle school student. Ryoko also cares for her father-in-law, who lives in a nursing home and she also runs a cafe. Her care is in a difficult situation due to Covid-19, while Junpei experiences bullying at school.', '7 years ago, Yoichi died in a traffic accident. His wife Ryoko did not receive compensation from her husband''s death. She has since raised her son Junpei by herself. Junpei is now a middle school student. Ryoko also cares for her father-in-law, who lives in a nursing home and she also runs a cafe. Her care is in a difficult situation due to Covid-19, while Junpei experiences bullying at school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsvUprjHRCazAPnSgU4N9tQl8fg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824410'),
  ('1130396915369989143', 'A Madea Christmas', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alexander Gruszynski, Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Anna Maria Horsford, Tika Sumpter, Eric Lively, Kathy Najimy, Larry the Cable Guy, Chad Michael Murray, Alicia Witt', 'PG-13', 'Madea dispenses her unique form of holiday spirit on rural town when she''s coaxed into helping a friend pay her daughter a surprise visit in the country for Christmas.', 'Madea dispenses her unique form of holiday spirit on rural town when she''s coaxed into helping a friend pay her daughter a surprise visit in the country for Christmas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tbwm8GptynNoxbkC5AhjYMYfnn7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175555'),
  ('783843179635545647', 'A Madea Family Funeral', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Tyler Perry, Derrick Doose, Asante White', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Cassi Davis, Patrice Lovely, Jen Harper, Derek Morgan, Courtney Burrell, Ciera Payton, Rome Flynn', 'PG-13', 'A joyous family reunion becomes a hilarious nightmare as Madea and the crew travel to backwoods Georgia, where they find themselves unexpectedly planning a funeral that might unveil unpleasant family secrets.', 'A joyous family reunion becomes a hilarious nightmare as Madea and the crew travel to backwoods Georgia, where they find themselves unexpectedly planning a funeral that might unveil unpleasant family secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFvOTUlZrIxCLdmz1fC16wK0lme.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464504'),
  ('409726528410873030', 'A Madonna in Laleli', 1999, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Kudret Sabancı, Gökhan Atılmış, Ercan Durmuş', 'Serdar Akar, Önder Çakar, Kudret Sabancı', 'Güven Kıraç, İştar Gökseven, Cengiz Küçükayvaz, Ella Manea, Fikret Urucu, Ertan Vecdi, Emin Gümüşkaya, Erkan Can', null, 'Pimps want to expand and conquer the world, by abiding the greats and oppressing the losers, but they lose their prostitute to some sailors.', 'Pimps want to expand and conquer the world, by abiding the greats and oppressing the losers, but they lose their prostitute to some sailors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a3YECnPyFNUQwTkbQZMx8otB66g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61843'),
  ('902522053205312994', 'A Magical Christmas Village', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Jason Furukawa, Dave T. Nall, Lucas Zhou', 'Melissa Salmons', 'Alison Sweeney, Luke Macfarlane, Marlo Thomas, Maesa Nicholson, Maria Meadows, Kareem Malcolm, Madonna Gonzalez, Alaysia Jackson', 'G', 'When Summer’s mother Vivian moves in with her and her young daughter Chloe, her orderly existence is upended. Upon arrival, Vivian sets up an heirloom, miniature Christmas village resembling their town, and tells Chloe it grants Christmas wishes. As Chloe begins setting up the figurines, real-life events seem to mimic the scenes she creates. With a little help from the magic of the Christmas village, the family will be brought closer together and just maybe, Summer will learn to open her heart to love again.', 'When Summer’s mother Vivian moves in with her and her young daughter Chloe, her orderly existence is upended. Upon arrival, Vivian sets up an heirloom, miniature Christmas village resembling their town, and tells Chloe it grants Christmas wishes. As Chloe begins setting up the figurines, real-life events seem to mimic the scenes she creates. With a little help from the magic of the Christmas village, the family will be brought closer together and just maybe, Summer will learn to open her heart to love again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/reNCBGdwXnjSUDLFWpHmQFkCOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1026605'),
  ('719373669822956975', 'A Magnificent Haunting', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Maurizio Calvesi, Gianluca Mazzella', 'Ferzan Özpetek, Federica Pontremoli', 'Elio Germano, Margherita Buy, Vittoria Puccini, Giuseppe Fiorello, Paola Minaccioni, Cem Yılmaz, Andrea Bosca, Claudia Potenza', null, 'An aspiring actor discovers that his spacious new apartment comes complete with eight friendly ghosts.', 'An aspiring actor discovers that his spacious new apartment comes complete with eight friendly ghosts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgkbT5b0TNGRoRdVAww7mVTlkOo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97899'),
  ('464915150783713930', 'A Majority of One', 1961, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Harry Stradling Sr., Gil Kissel', 'Leonard Spigelgass', 'Rosalind Russell, Alec Guinness, Ray Danton, Madlyn Rhue, Mae Questel, Marc Marno, Gary Vinson, Sharon Hugueny', null, 'A gentle love story about a Japanese businessman and widower, and a Brooklyn widow. But before a happy ending can ensue, they must learn again the lessons of tolerance, kindness and forgiveness.', 'A gentle love story about a Japanese businessman and widower, and a Brooklyn widow. But before a happy ending can ensue, they must learn again the lessons of tolerance, kindness and forgiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHrC85LCp80Bug08VqSjwUC5jLB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158800'),
  ('72615792452022112', 'A Man', 2022, 'Drama, Thriller, Mystery', 'Kei Ishikawa, Kenjiro So, Ryuto Kondo', 'Kosuke Mukai', 'Satoshi Tsumabuki, Sakura Ando, Masataka Kubota, Nana Seino, Hidekazu Mashima, Kazutoyo Koyabu, Miyako Yamaguchi, Taiga Nakano', null, 'Akira works as a lawyer. One day, he meets with his former client Rie, who asks Akira to perform a background check on her late husband Daisuke.', 'Akira works as a lawyer. One day, he meets with his former client Rie, who asks Akira to perform a background check on her late husband Daisuke.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28BHeDbC0307Gzt467XLdVNJuag.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:869886'),
  ('413449534069156817', 'A Man Alone', 1955, 'Western, Romance', 'Ray Milland, Lionel Lindon', 'John Tucker Battle', 'Ray Milland, Mary Murphy, Ward Bond, Raymond Burr, Arthur Space, Lee Van Cleef, Alan Hale Jr., Douglas Spencer', 'NR', 'A gunfighter, stranded in the desert, comes across the aftermath of a stage robbery, in which all the passengers were killed. He takes one of the horses to ride to town to report the massacre, but finds himself accused of it. He also finds himself accused of the murder of the local banker, and winds up hiding in the basement of a house where the local sheriff, who is very sick, lives with his daughter.', 'A gunfighter, stranded in the desert, comes across the aftermath of a stage robbery, in which all the passengers were killed. He takes one of the horses to ride to town to report the massacre, but finds himself accused of it. He also finds himself accused of the murder of the local banker, and winds up hiding in the basement of a house where the local sheriff, who is very sick, lives with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbTxHtL23Bf6yKx8VOWiFUS0MJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43315'),
  ('646729997158758705', 'A Man Amidst Bees', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Fantasy', 'Ian SBF, Alexandre Ramos, Rebeca Diniz', 'Ian SBF, Fábio Porchat', 'Fábio Porchat, Irene Ravache, Marcos Veras, Luís Lobianco, Giovanna Lancellotti, Marcelo Valle, Silvio Matos, Letícia Lima', null, 'Bruno is a young film editor who has just broke up his marriage with Regina, and returned living in his mother''s house. Drowned in deep sorrow, something very weird happens in his life: people around him are gradually disappearing. But only for him. Some kind of blindness.', 'Bruno is a young film editor who has just broke up his marriage with Regina, and returned living in his mother''s house. Drowned in deep sorrow, something very weird happens in his life: people around him are gradually disappearing. But only for him. Some kind of blindness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGZNN70ffCyOsYqqMTYFeMySxjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271983'),
