  ('346766888642423953', 'A Man Apart', 2003, 'Action, Drama, Crime', 'Jack N. Green, F. Gary Gray, Dan Morski', 'Christian Gudegast, Paul T. Scheuring', 'Vin Diesel, Larenz Tate, Timothy Olyphant, Geno Silva, Jacqueline Obradors, Steve Eastin, Juan Fernández, Jeff Kober', 'R', 'When Vetter''s wife is killed in a botched hit organized by Diablo, he seeks revenge against those responsible. But in the process, Vetter and Hicks have to fight their way up the chain to get to Diablo but it''s easier said than done when all Vetter can focus on is revenge.', 'When Vetter''s wife is killed in a botched hit organized by Diablo, he seeks revenge against those responsible. But in the process, Vetter and Hicks have to fight their way up the chain to get to Diablo but it''s easier said than done when all Vetter can focus on is revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgcGj39KYcyPx6zDiICHsPQNAJQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8409'),
