  ('1029529306434724831', 'A Man Called Adam', 1966, 'Music, Drama', 'Leo Penn, Jack Priestley, Bernie Styles', 'Lester Pine, Tina Pine', 'Sammy Davis Jr., Ossie Davis, Cicely Tyson, Louis Armstrong, Frank Sinatra Jr., Peter Lawford, Mel Tormé, Lola Falana', 'NR', 'A famous jazz trumpeter finds himself unable to cope with the problems of everyday life.', 'A famous jazz trumpeter finds himself unable to cope with the problems of everyday life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQQnlbhgFRCBmtuh1Lq42oBE1im.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:151043'),
  ('272062078567311702', 'A Man Called Autumn Flower', 1978, 'Drama', 'Pedro Olea, Fernando Arribas, Martín Sacristán', 'José María Rodríguez Méndez, Rafael Azcona, Pedro Olea', 'José Sacristán, Francisco Algora, Carmen Carbonell, Roberto Camardiel, Carlos Piñeiro, Marisa Porcel, José Franco, Antonio Corencia', null, 'During the Primo de Rivera dictatorship, young, wealthy Lluis de Serracant leads a double life: by day he''s a lawyer, and by night he''s a transvestite performer known to his fans as "Flower of Autumn".', 'During the Primo de Rivera dictatorship, young, wealthy Lluis de Serracant leads a double life: by day he''s a lawyer, and by night he''s a transvestite performer known to his fans as "Flower of Autumn".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6nFhulkAbI84Cw6uAPBlJbsXqzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296286'),
  ('98430078212733048', 'A Man Called Blade', 1977, 'Western', 'Sergio Martino, Federico Zanni', 'Sergio Martino, Sauro Scavolini', 'Maurizio Merli, John Steiner, Philippe Leroy, Sonja Jeannine, Salvatore Puntillo, Enzo Fiermonte, Rik Battaglia, Donald O''Brien', null, 'Maurizio Merli stars as a hatchet-wielding bounty hunter with a dark past and an even more desperate future. But when he disrupts the balance of power in a corrupt mining town, he unleashes a firestorm of brutality, betrayal and cold-blooded murder. Now, one man stalks a savage land where justice walks a razor and no bullets slice deeper than vengeance. He is A MAN CALLED BLADE.', 'Maurizio Merli stars as a hatchet-wielding bounty hunter with a dark past and an even more desperate future. But when he disrupts the balance of power in a corrupt mining town, he unleashes a firestorm of brutality, betrayal and cold-blooded murder. Now, one man stalks a savage land where justice walks a razor and no bullets slice deeper than vengeance. He is A MAN CALLED BLADE.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9hX2IlU9trlVThCV5fe0n3fBvcU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19946'),
  ('434327105587453271', 'A Man Called Hero', 1999, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Andrew Lau Wai-Keung, Andrew Lau Wai-Keung', 'Manfred Wong Man-Chun', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Shu Qi, Kristy Yang Rongru, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Yuen Biao, Jerry Lamb Hiu-Fung, Dion Lam, Anthony Wong Chau-Sang', null, 'After Hero Hua marries Jade and leaves her in China, he goes to America to work as a servant and rebels against cruel labour conditions. Jade soon joins him in New York, where they build a family.', 'After Hero Hua marries Jade and leaves her in China, he goes to America to work as a servant and rebels against cruel labour conditions. Jade soon joins him in New York, where they build a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYeRnmIpuJwatUIKz1XzNPJUqL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44554'),
  ('712820446398386032', 'A Man Called Horse', 1970, 'Western, Drama', 'Robert B. Hauser, Elliot Silverstein', 'Jack DeWitt', 'Richard Harris, Jean Gascon, Judith Anderson, Corinna Tsopei, Manu Tupou, Dub Taylor, James Gammon, William Jordan', 'R', 'In 1825, English peer Lord John Morgan is cast adrift in the American West. Captured by Sioux Indians, Morgan is at first targeted for quick extinction, but the tribesmen sense that he is worthy of survival. He eventually passes the many necessary tests that will permit him to become a member of the tribe.', 'In 1825, English peer Lord John Morgan is cast adrift in the American West. Captured by Sioux Indians, Morgan is at first targeted for quick extinction, but the tribesmen sense that he is worthy of survival. He eventually passes the many necessary tests that will permit him to become a member of the tribe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gvo0LMk5EWwsypsXl2i25D83ztm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14676'),
  ('594905308885619767', 'A Man Called Magnum', 1977, 'Crime, Action', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Massimo Manasse, Sergio Rubini', 'Michele Massimo Tarantini, Dardano Sacchetti', 'Luc Merenda, Enzo Cannavale, Adolfo Lastretti, Mattia Machiavelli, Ferdinando Murolo, Giancarlo Badessi, Claudio Gora, Marianne Comtell', null, 'A drug deal goes bad and the heroin is stolen. One mob boss doesn''t have his drugs and the other doesn''t get his money. People are going to die until they discover who double-crossed them. Into this backdrop, Inspector Dario Mauri arrives from Milan to help clean-up Naples. His mission – find the drugs and stop the killing.', 'A drug deal goes bad and the heroin is stolen. One mob boss doesn''t have his drugs and the other doesn''t get his money. People are going to die until they discover who double-crossed them. Into this backdrop, Inspector Dario Mauri arrives from Milan to help clean-up Naples. His mission – find the drugs and stop the killing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kt799XoN28L8y17TlyhSPYzAK0P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105906'),
  ('1010061451384228939', 'A Man Called Otto', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Matthias Koenigswieser, Marc Forster', 'Hannes Holm', 'Tom Hanks, Mariana Treviño, Cameron Britton, Mack Bayda, Manuel Garcia-Rulfo, Juanita Jennings, Peter Lawson Jones, Truman Hanks', 'PG-13', 'When a lively young family moves in next door, grumpy widower Otto Anderson meets his match in a quick-witted, pregnant woman named Marisol, leading to an unlikely friendship that turns his world upside down.', 'When a lively young family moves in next door, grumpy widower Otto Anderson meets his match in a quick-witted, pregnant woman named Marisol, leading to an unlikely friendship that turns his world upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/130H1gap9lFfiTF9iDrqNIkFvC9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:937278'),
  ('1079688982473402049', 'A Man Called Ove', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hannes Holm, Göran Hallberg', 'Hannes Holm', 'Rolf Lassgård, Bahar Pars, Filip Berg, Ida Engvoll, Tobias Almborg, Klas Wiljergård, Chatarina Larsson, Börje Lundberg', 'PG-13', 'Despite being deposed as president of his condominium association, grumpy 59-year-old Ove continues to watch over his neighbourhood with an iron fist. When pregnant Parvaneh and her family move into the terraced house opposite Ove and she accidentally back into Ove’s mailbox, it sets off a series of unexpected changes in his life.', 'Despite being deposed as president of his condominium association, grumpy 59-year-old Ove continues to watch over his neighbourhood with an iron fist. When pregnant Parvaneh and her family move into the terraced house opposite Ove and she accidentally back into Ove’s mailbox, it sets off a series of unexpected changes in his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a41uvFqze4PI7N3E9jPNwN9ypV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:348678'),
  ('381526577787408650', 'A Man Called Peter', 1955, 'Drama, Family', 'Henry Koster, Harold Lipstein, Bernard Freericks', 'Eleanore Griffin', 'Richard Todd, Jean Peters, Marjorie Rambeau, Jill Esmond, Les Tremayne, Robert Burton, Gladys Hurlbut, Richard Garrick', 'G', 'Based on the true story of a young Scottish lad, Peter Marshall, who dreams of only going to sea but finds out there is a different future for him when he receives a "calling" from God to be a minister. He leaves Scotland and goes to America where after a few small congregations he lands the position of pastor of the Church of the Presidents in Washington, D.C. and eventually he becomes Chaplain of the U.S. Senate.', 'Based on the true story of a young Scottish lad, Peter Marshall, who dreams of only going to sea but finds out there is a different future for him when he receives a "calling" from God to be a minister. He leaves Scotland and goes to America where after a few small congregations he lands the position of pastor of the Church of the Presidents in Washington, D.C. and eventually he becomes Chaplain of the U.S. Senate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xYVloXNC5oSatw7qfrdDy5NgRe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45136'),
  ('592765106316175318', 'A Man Called Sledge', 1970, 'Western', 'Giorgio Gentili, Vic Morrow, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Vic Morrow, Frank Kowalski, Massimo D''Avak', 'James Garner, Dennis Weaver, Claude Akins, John Marley, Laura Antonelli, Wayde Preston, Ken Clark, Tony Young', 'R', 'James Garner is Luther Sledge, the leader of a pack of rebels who are planning to steal a stash of gold. But after the thieves actually manage to get away with the bounty, they soon discover that the enemy lies within their midst. As they begin to bicker over who should get the biggest cut, the stage is set for a deadly showdown. Claude Akins and John Marley co-star in this Italian Western directed by Vic Morrow.', 'James Garner is Luther Sledge, the leader of a pack of rebels who are planning to steal a stash of gold. But after the thieves actually manage to get away with the bounty, they soon discover that the enemy lies within their midst. As they begin to bicker over who should get the biggest cut, the stage is set for a deadly showdown. Claude Akins and John Marley co-star in this Italian Western directed by Vic Morrow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RqnEBkdOjSF1E8NsQQmtQATXgW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70387'),
  ('525600343794568494', 'A Man for All Seasons', 1966, 'Drama, History', 'Fred Zinnemann, Ted Moore, Patrick Carey', 'Robert Bolt', 'Paul Scofield, Wendy Hiller, Leo McKern, Robert Shaw, Orson Welles, Susannah York, Nigel Davenport, John Hurt', 'G', 'A depiction of the conflict between King Henry VIII of England and his Lord Chancellor, Sir Thomas More, who refuses to swear the Oath of Supremacy declaring Henry Supreme Head of the Church in England.', 'A depiction of the conflict between King Henry VIII of England and his Lord Chancellor, Sir Thomas More, who refuses to swear the Oath of Supremacy declaring Henry Supreme Head of the Church in England.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kcwcqMitcnRO1SySlX1HKVn7yUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:874'),
  ('720329427136419925', 'A Man for All Seasons', 1988, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Charlton Heston, Alan Hall', 'Robert Bolt', 'Charlton Heston, Vanessa Redgrave, John Gielgud, Richard Johnson, Roy Kinnear, Benjamin Whitrow', null, 'Story of Sir Thomas More, who refused to accept the spiritual leadership of Henry VIII, and faces death as he struggles to remain loyal to his integrity.', 'Story of Sir Thomas More, who refused to accept the spiritual leadership of Henry VIII, and faces death as he struggles to remain loyal to his integrity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6TlEBiAA61YX4JuG6k3dOqEWbVP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118091'),
  ('512747141206699545', 'A Man from the Boulevard des Capucines', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance, Western, Music', 'Alla Surikova, Grigoriy Belenkiy, Oleg Zilbershteyn', 'Eduard Akopov', 'Andrey Mironov, Aleksandra Yakovleva-Aasmyae, Mikhail Boyarskiy, Oleg Tabakov, Nikolai Karachentsov, Igor Kvasha, Lev Durov, Galina Polskikh', null, 'Mr. Johnny First goes to the Wild West to present the art of the Cinematograph, and the lives of everyone in the frontier town of Santa Carolina change as a result of this.', 'Mr. Johnny First goes to the Wild West to present the art of the Cinematograph, and the lives of everyone in the frontier town of Santa Carolina change as a result of this.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oj501hxty4iZCUUiV6GLPCdYw3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45227'),
  ('52272021533112463', 'A Man in a Hurry', 2018, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hervé Mimran, Jérôme Alméras', 'Hervé Mimran, Hélène Fillières', 'Leïla Bekhti, Fabrice Luchini, Igor Gotesman, Fatima Adoum, Olivier Rosemberg, Rebecca Marder, Baya Rehaz, Clémence Massart-Weit', null, 'The story revolves around Alain, a busy businessman who is always in a rush. In his life, there is no room for spare time or family. But one day, he suffers a stroke, which makes him lose his grasp of language and use one word in place of another.', 'The story revolves around Alain, a busy businessman who is always in a rush. In his life, there is no room for spare time or family. But one day, he suffers a stroke, which makes him lose his grasp of language and use one word in place of another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzQHGId6xMUCtpz9UXykbue8SHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467482'),
  ('1036947967715416220', 'A Man in Love', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Diane Kurys, Bernard Zitzermann', 'Diane Kurys, Olivier Schatzky', 'Peter Coyote, Greta Scacchi, Jamie Lee Curtis, Claudia Cardinale, Peter Riegert, John Berry, Vincent Lindon, Jean Pigozzi', null, 'An American film-star and an unknown British actress meet on set in Rome. She is angry when he refuses to speak to her journalist father, but later they have a passionate relationship.', 'An American film-star and an unknown British actress meet on set in Rome. She is angry when he refuses to speak to her journalist father, but later they have a passionate relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lbCwckiCZZDPSnDBhWVeQLspQqF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80605'),
  ('84844854925102387', 'A Man in Our House', 1961, 'Drama, History, Romance', 'Hassan Ibrahim, Abdullah Barakat, Henry Barakat', 'Henry Barakat', 'Omar Sharif, Zubaida Tharwat, Rushdy Abaza, Zahrat Al-Ola, Hassan Youssef, Hussein Reyaad, Tawfiq Al-Deqen, Nahed Samir', null, 'Rebel Ibrahim Hamdy assassinates a pro-colonial Prime Minister but is arrested and hides with a fellow university student, who initially refuses but eventually accepts him. Abdul Hamid Khatib meets Samia and her cousin, and Ibrahim uses the situation to hasten Samia’s marriage, which she rejects. Nawal, the youngest daughter, becomes the liaison between Ibrahim and his colleagues, helping him escape. Abdul Hamid tries to inform the political police of Ibrahim’s location, but Samia stops him. The head of the political police suspects them and punishes them to find Ibrahim. Ibrahim refuses to leave the country, returning to fight colonialism and participating in an operation.', 'Rebel Ibrahim Hamdy assassinates a pro-colonial Prime Minister but is arrested and hides with a fellow university student, who initially refuses but eventually accepts him. Abdul Hamid Khatib meets Samia and her cousin, and Ibrahim uses the situation to hasten Samia’s marriage, which she rejects. Nawal, the youngest daughter, becomes the liaison between Ibrahim and his colleagues, helping him escape. Abdul Hamid tries to inform the political police of Ibrahim’s location, but Samia stops him. The head of the political police suspects them and punishes them to find Ibrahim. Ibrahim refuses to leave the country, returning to fight colonialism and participating in an operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jCWFwuSiumEXDpOBF36RzvCqS5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:280464'),
  ('1066512130632303889', 'A Man is Dead', 2018, 'Animation, Drama, History, Documentary', 'Olivier Cossu', 'Guillaume Mautalent, Sébastien Oursel', null, null, 'Brest, 1950. The war ended five years ago and nothing remains of the city. Massive bombings and intense fighting lasting more than a month turned the city, its docks, its arsenal, into ashes. Thousands of workers will build it up again, brick by brick. But with awful work conditions protests quickly arise and a strike begins. Violent confrontations happen during manifestations. Until one man falls. The next day René Vautier lands at Brest clandestinely to make a movie about the movement.', 'Brest, 1950. The war ended five years ago and nothing remains of the city. Massive bombings and intense fighting lasting more than a month turned the city, its docks, its arsenal, into ashes. Thousands of workers will build it up again, brick by brick. But with awful work conditions protests quickly arise and a strike begins. Violent confrontations happen during manifestations. Until one man falls. The next day René Vautier lands at Brest clandestinely to make a movie about the movement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lgqExnF6BhrDwAAMguEDwObWywO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:506212'),
  ('943591385881242341', 'A Man Named Rocca', 1961, 'Drama, Crime', 'Jean Becker, Ghislain Cloquet', null, 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Christine Kaufmann, Pierre Vaneck, Béatrice Altariba, Henri Virlogeux, Mario David, Pedro Serano, Charles Moulin', null, 'Roberto goes to Marseilles to give a hand to his friend Xavier, wrongly imprisoned following a frame-up organized by his associate Villanova. Roberto sets out to seduce Villanova''s mistress, but when Villanova is killed, Roberto ends up leader of the band...', 'Roberto goes to Marseilles to give a hand to his friend Xavier, wrongly imprisoned following a frame-up organized by his associate Villanova. Roberto sets out to seduce Villanova''s mistress, but when Villanova is killed, Roberto ends up leader of the band...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uFtMXQmNqb5Lvp2KbTUCngQN8jR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62876'),
  ('1126532976360620909', 'A Man Named Scott', 2021, 'Documentary, Music', 'Nathan Salter, Robert Alexander', 'Robert Alexander', 'Kid Cudi, Jaden Smith, Blake Young, Shia LaBeouf, Timothée Chalamet, Willow Smith, Ye, A$AP Rocky', null, 'In 2009, Scott Mescudi aka Kid Cudi released his debut LP, Man on the Moon: The End of Day. A genre-bending album that broke barriers by featuring songs dealing with depression, anxiety and loneliness, it resonated deeply with young listeners and launched Cudi as a musical star and cultural hero. A Man Named Scott explores Cudi’s journey over a decade of creative choices, struggles and breakthroughs, making music that continues to move and empower his millions of fans around the world.', 'In 2009, Scott Mescudi aka Kid Cudi released his debut LP, Man on the Moon: The End of Day. A genre-bending album that broke barriers by featuring songs dealing with depression, anxiety and loneliness, it resonated deeply with young listeners and launched Cudi as a musical star and cultural hero. A Man Named Scott explores Cudi’s journey over a decade of creative choices, struggles and breakthroughs, making music that continues to move and empower his millions of fans around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sihn5PoMqS4EvVOqO5zRtPKJjns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:890228'),
  ('860448137312728303', 'A Man of Action', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Javier Ruiz Caldera, Juan Carlevaris, Raul Kingtai', 'Patxi Amezcua', 'Juan José Ballesta, Miki Esparbé, Luis Callejo, Liah O''Prey, Alexandre Blazy, Josean Bengoetxea, Philip Schurer, Daniel Chamorro', null, 'Loosely inspired by the life of Lucio Urtubia, explore the figure of the so-called anarchist ''Robin Hood,'' who ran a legendary counterfeiting operation in Paris that put him in the crosshairs of America''s largest bank, when he managed to obtain a huge amount of money by forging traveler''s checks to invest in causes he believed in.', 'Loosely inspired by the life of Lucio Urtubia, explore the figure of the so-called anarchist ''Robin Hood,'' who ran a legendary counterfeiting operation in Paris that put him in the crosshairs of America''s largest bank, when he managed to obtain a huge amount of money by forging traveler''s checks to invest in causes he believed in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/50bEzUzctV12Zgzu0xPUEnxLEla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945897'),
  ('138668304503423028', 'A Man of Integrity', 2017, 'Drama', 'Mohammad Rasoulof, Ashkan Ashkani', 'Mohammad Rasoulof', 'Reza Akhlaghirad, Soudabeh Bayzai, Nasim Adabi, Misagh Zare, Zeinab Shabani, Zhila Shahi, Majid Potki, Mehdi Mehraban', null, 'Reza, residing in the wilderness with his wife and son, lives a retired life and devotes himself to freshwater fish farming. A private company that has targets on his land is ready to do anything to force him to sell.', 'Reza, residing in the wilderness with his wife and son, lives a retired life and devotes himself to freshwater fish farming. A private company that has targets on his land is ready to do anything to force him to sell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/meIOwiPGMAYsRQzsgdAkeU0qCpu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:452013'),
  ('479096116307902403', 'A Man of No Importance', 1994, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Suri Krishnamma, Ashley Rowe', 'Barry Devlin', 'Albert Finney, Brenda Fricker, Michael Gambon, Tara Fitzgerald, Rufus Sewell, Patrick Malahide, David Kelly, Mick Lally', null, 'Alfie Byrne is a middle-aged bus conductor in Dublin in 1963. He would appear to live a life of quiet desperation: he''s gay, but firmly closeted, and his sister is always trying to find him "the right girl". His passion is Oscar Wilde, his hobby is putting on amateur theatre productions in the local church hall. We follow him as he struggles with temptation, friendship, disapproval, and the conservative yet oddly lyrical world of Ireland in the early 1960s.', 'Alfie Byrne is a middle-aged bus conductor in Dublin in 1963. He would appear to live a life of quiet desperation: he''s gay, but firmly closeted, and his sister is always trying to find him "the right girl". His passion is Oscar Wilde, his hobby is putting on amateur theatre productions in the local church hall. We follow him as he struggles with temptation, friendship, disapproval, and the conservative yet oddly lyrical world of Ireland in the early 1960s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKHmxia0cdXMmNu5LUEwiJQJQoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52038'),
  ('551004553382894820', 'A Man of Principle', 1984, 'Action, Drama', 'Francisco Norden, Carlos Suárez', 'Dunav Kuzmanich, Francisco Norden', 'Frank Ramírez, Isabela Corona, Victor Hugo Morant, Santiago García, Luis Chiape, Juan Gentile, Vicky Hernández, Antonio Aparicio', null, 'Dramatisation of the massacre which took place in Colombia in 1948, as a result of conflict between conservative and liberal forces, and concentrating on the character of a former cheesemonger-turned professional killer.', 'Dramatisation of the massacre which took place in Colombia in 1948, as a result of conflict between conservative and liberal forces, and concentrating on the character of a former cheesemonger-turned professional killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Y0vof1hdkt0adVPSA6hesKaGFC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256055'),
  ('151332497368890993', 'A Man of Reason', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Go Rak-sun, Go Rak-sun, Jung Woo-sung', 'Jung Hae-sin, Jung Woo-sung', 'Jung Woo-sung, Kim Nam-gil, Kim Jun-han, Park You-na, Ryu Ji-an, Park Sung-woong, Lee Elijah, Park Seong-joon', null, 'After spending a decade in prison, a hitman learns that he has a daughter and just wants a chance at a normal life. But his former mob boss wants him back at any cost, sending merciless assassins after him.', 'After spending a decade in prison, a hitman learns that he has a daughter and just wants a chance at a normal life. But his former mob boss wants him back at any cost, sending merciless assassins after him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePwZs1oOh4pg8UZP8DuVZZeIn89.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:656156'),
  ('173167623932020830', 'A Man on His Knees', 1979, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Damiano Damiani, Enrico Bergier, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Nicola Badalucco, Damiano Damiani', 'Giuliano Gemma, Eleonora Giorgi, Michele Placido, Tano Cimarosa, Ettore Manni, Nello Pazzafini, Fabrizio Forte, Luciano Catenacci', null, 'Nino, a regular working-class guy, finds that a hitman has been hired to kill him. He discovers that a wealthy woman has been kidnapped and that everyone who was involved in it is being killed off. However, Nino had nothing to do with the kidnapping and has to find out who has sent the killers and stop them before it''s too late.', 'Nino, a regular working-class guy, finds that a hitman has been hired to kill him. He discovers that a wealthy woman has been kidnapped and that everyone who was involved in it is being killed off. However, Nino had nothing to do with the kidnapping and has to find out who has sent the killers and stop them before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kZenNPRSS96am16pVqcqW1OnqEz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:183635'),
  ('386747979563829222', 'A Man There Was', 1917, 'Drama, History', 'Victor Sjöström, Julius Jaenzon', 'Gustaf Molander, Victor Sjöström', 'Victor Sjöström, Bergliot Husberg, August Falck, Edith Erastoff, Eric Abrahamsson, Hildur Carlberg, Gucken Cederborg, John Ekman', null, 'Terje Vigen, a sailor, suffers the loss of his family through the inflexibility of another man. Years later, when his enemy''s family finds itself dependent on his benevolence, Terje must decide whether to avenge himself.', 'Terje Vigen, a sailor, suffers the loss of his family through the inflexibility of another man. Years later, when his enemy''s family finds itself dependent on his benevolence, Terje must decide whether to avenge himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ejxTovLF2vbcII1kz5vClkFt8np.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108017'),
  ('425547843789447750', 'A Man to Kill', 1967, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Philippe Condroyer, Jean Penzer', 'Mariette Condroyer, Philippe Condroyer', 'Jean-Louis Trintignant, Valérie Lagrange, Luis Prendes, Josep Maria Angelat, Luis Padrós, André Oumansky, Manuel Bronchud, Emilio Sancho', null, 'Barcelona, 1967. Hans Fromm, a German-born architect, lives an well-ordered everyday life. He has become the target of an antifascist death squad though. Indeed their leader, Julius, whose brother was killed by Schmidt, a merciless S.S., believes, without being absolutely certain, that Fromm and Schmidt are the same man. The team, whose other members are Georges, the son of a deportee liquidated by Schmidt craving for action, Raphaël, a mercenary type, Nils, the photographer and Romain, watch Fromm''s every move until Julius, convinced at last that the quiet German is their man, gives the green light for the operation. They manage to lure the former Nazi to an old house but Schmidt/Fromm won''t let himself be captured so easily...', 'Barcelona, 1967. Hans Fromm, a German-born architect, lives an well-ordered everyday life. He has become the target of an antifascist death squad though. Indeed their leader, Julius, whose brother was killed by Schmidt, a merciless S.S., believes, without being absolutely certain, that Fromm and Schmidt are the same man. The team, whose other members are Georges, the son of a deportee liquidated by Schmidt craving for action, Raphaël, a mercenary type, Nils, the photographer and Romain, watch Fromm''s every move until Julius, convinced at last that the quiet German is their man, gives the green light for the operation. They manage to lure the former Nazi to an old house but Schmidt/Fromm won''t let himself be captured so easily...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37hqAdB0QtiKhBjDDGh6fajRjkQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136237'),
  ('707835579620277140', 'A Man Vanishes', 1967, 'Drama, Documentary', 'Shōhei Imamura', null, 'Yoshie Hayakawa, Shōhei Imamura, Shigeru Tsuyuguchi', null, 'A Man Vanishes examines the concept of Johatsu, tackling the phenomenon of people missing in Japan over the years. It picks one such person from the list, someone who had seemed to disappear from the face of the earth due to embezzlement from his company, and the filmmakers begin an investigative documentary into the reasons behind and attempt at tracking him down.', 'A Man Vanishes examines the concept of Johatsu, tackling the phenomenon of people missing in Japan over the years. It picks one such person from the list, someone who had seemed to disappear from the face of the earth due to embezzlement from his company, and the filmmakers begin an investigative documentary into the reasons behind and attempt at tracking him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wxj8qnBwBAe6JpRfIqM1jaLWewj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85692'),
  ('266628503330982039', 'A Man Who Was Superman', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Chung Yoon-chul, Lee Jung-ho', 'Chung Yoon-chul', 'Hwang Jung-min, Gianna Jun, Jin Ji-hee, Do Yong-gu, Sun Woo-sun, Kim Jae-rok, Park Yong-su, Lee Sang-yeob', null, 'A snobbish producer makes a documentary about the extraordinary behavior of her neighbor who believes himself to be Superman.', 'A snobbish producer makes a documentary about the extraordinary behavior of her neighbor who believes himself to be Superman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c4FQVzPp41DlLd4dswe95x2wom1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35010'),
  ('302718027455934446', 'A man, a fjord!', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Angelo Colagrossi', null, 'Hape Kerkeling, Jürgen Tarrach, Johanna Gastdorf, Anneke Kim Sarnau, Matthias Brandt, Horst Krause, Wenche Myhre, Petra Zieser', null, 'A fast-paced comedy full of misunderstandings: Norbert Krabbe from pan, unemployed Bürokaufmann and passionate contest participant wins a fjord in Lofoten. But how to get only to Norway - for "Norbert Crab Fjord" including his own cabin - when you''re broke and one is already driving poor at S-Bahn? What Norbert lack of money, he makes through original ideas betting: Disguised as a cleaning crew, he makes his way to his daughter by train to Copenhagen, on we go as a hitchhiker and with ill-gotten ship tickets. Many abstruse encounters later, among others with Horst Schlämmer, Uschi Blum and the strong-smelling Norwegians Lars, who predicts the future based on a Dog Quartet, Norbert expects the next surprise at its destination ...', 'A fast-paced comedy full of misunderstandings: Norbert Krabbe from pan, unemployed Bürokaufmann and passionate contest participant wins a fjord in Lofoten. But how to get only to Norway - for "Norbert Crab Fjord" including his own cabin - when you''re broke and one is already driving poor at S-Bahn? What Norbert lack of money, he makes through original ideas betting: Disguised as a cleaning crew, he makes his way to his daughter by train to Copenhagen, on we go as a hitchhiker and with ill-gotten ship tickets. Many abstruse encounters later, among others with Horst Schlämmer, Uschi Blum and the strong-smelling Norwegians Lars, who predicts the future based on a Dog Quartet, Norbert expects the next surprise at its destination ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iDvB4OX67f1BNTWQXA1QqkxtqMc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16336'),
  ('1099667152585826678', 'A Man, a Woman and a Bank', 1979, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Noel Black, Jack Cardiff, Stanley Neufeld', 'Bruce A. Evans, Stuart Margolin, Raynold Gideon', 'Donald Sutherland, Brooke Adams, Paul Mazursky, Allan Kolman, Leigh Hamilton, Wong Kung-Miu, Campbell Lane, Terence Kelly', 'PG', 'Two novice thieves are plotting to rob a bank in Vancouver. A photographer snaps a shot of one thief as he is carrying the bank building''s blueprints. The would-be thief then begins a relationship with the photographer and attempts to retrieve the photos. Meanwhile, the thieves'' plot consists of this: one man will enter the bank building after dark, while the other man sits in a van and uses a computer to unlock the building''s doors. The final step involves transporting the cash to a freight ship waiting on the docks, for transportation to a money launderer in Macau.', 'Two novice thieves are plotting to rob a bank in Vancouver. A photographer snaps a shot of one thief as he is carrying the bank building''s blueprints. The would-be thief then begins a relationship with the photographer and attempts to retrieve the photos. Meanwhile, the thieves'' plot consists of this: one man will enter the bank building after dark, while the other man sits in a van and uses a computer to unlock the building''s doors. The final step involves transporting the cash to a freight ship waiting on the docks, for transportation to a money launderer in Macau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ydiUyQ8XqhPrOWjA2iHlmh8Abpz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53435'),
  ('380706263401779260', 'A Man''s Neck', 1933, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Julien Duvivier, Pierre Calmann, Gilbert de Kniff', 'Julien Duvivier, Pierre Calmann, Louis Delaprée', 'Harry Baur, Valéry Inkijinoff, Alexandre Rignault, Gaston Jacquet, Gina Manès, Louis Gauthier, Henri Échourin, Marcel Bourdel', null, 'Willy Ferrière is a gambler living beyond his means, and his mistress is as greedy as he''s dead broke. One day, he says out of loud in a a Montparnasse café that he would give 100,000 francs to get rid of his wealthy aunt so he could claim his inheritance. Someone secretly lets Willy know it''s a deal. The old lady is murdered, and a low-life criminal is manipulated to be the perfect suspect. But Superintendant Maigret feels something is wrong.', 'Willy Ferrière is a gambler living beyond his means, and his mistress is as greedy as he''s dead broke. One day, he says out of loud in a a Montparnasse café that he would give 100,000 francs to get rid of his wealthy aunt so he could claim his inheritance. Someone secretly lets Willy know it''s a deal. The old lady is murdered, and a low-life criminal is manipulated to be the perfect suspect. But Superintendant Maigret feels something is wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYRaUpD4gqQohf8MjUuBQQYFHGL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84248'),
  ('127155000053847320', 'A Mano Disarmata', 2019, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Emmanuele Bianco, Claudio Bonivento, Maurizio Dell''Orco', 'Federica Angeli, Domitilla Di Pietro', 'Claudia Gerini, Francesco Pannofino, Mirko Frezza, Milena Mancini, Francesco Venditti, Maurizio Mattioli, Rodolfo Laganà, Massimo De Francovich', null, 'The story of Federica Angeli, reporter of the daily newspaper "La Repubblica" that investigates the Roman underworld, challenging threats and dangers.', 'The story of Federica Angeli, reporter of the daily newspaper "La Repubblica" that investigates the Roman underworld, challenging threats and dangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqtjnopjhK6h6ppLqtu7M8hJBNe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593057'),
  ('920869912203755754', 'A Map of the Heart', 2002, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Dominik Graf, Benedict Neuenfels', 'Dominik Graf, Markus Busch', 'Karoline Eichhorn, Antonio Wannek, Sebastian Urzendowsky, Ralph Herforth, Peter Lohmeyer, Ulrich Gebauer, Caroline Schreiber, Max Richter', null, 'Katrin and Jürgen spend their holidays in Corsica. Katrin is in her mid-thirties, working as a tracer at Jürgen’s company who suddenly remembers he’s married – but not with Kathrin. So they decide to end their vacation earlier than they had planned. Virtually a second before they start to drive back to the airport, Katrin takes her belongings out of Jürgen’s car again and lets him go. Now being alone for the remaining days of her vacation, Katrin finds herself more and more bewildered by the things that happened to her.', 'Katrin and Jürgen spend their holidays in Corsica. Katrin is in her mid-thirties, working as a tracer at Jürgen’s company who suddenly remembers he’s married – but not with Kathrin. So they decide to end their vacation earlier than they had planned. Virtually a second before they start to drive back to the airport, Katrin takes her belongings out of Jürgen’s car again and lets him go. Now being alone for the remaining days of her vacation, Katrin finds herself more and more bewildered by the things that happened to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pY0acm1TNbiVyJxAnua9gAxeL6B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85388'),
  ('1054112240624924206', 'A Map of the World', 1999, 'Drama', 'Janet Zdyb, Jonathan Wright, Michelle Morris', 'Peter Hedges, Polly Platt', 'Sigourney Weaver, Julianne Moore, David Strathairn, Arliss Howard, Chloë Sevigny, Sara Rue, Aunjanue Ellis-Taylor, Nicole Ari Parker', 'R', 'School nurse Alice Goodwin lives with her husband and two daughters on a dairy farm in a small Wisconsin community. After an accident on her property involving a friend''s child, the town turns against her and Alice finds herself fighting charges of child abuse.', 'School nurse Alice Goodwin lives with her husband and two daughters on a dairy farm in a small Wisconsin community. After an accident on her property involving a friend''s child, the town turns against her and Alice finds herself fighting charges of child abuse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhoXmw3zbds7gjDPJfA7CiNNssI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54933'),
  ('9179177126432949', 'A Maple Valley Christmas', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Paul Ziller, Jason Rody, Dan Dumouchel', 'Claire Boyles, Joie Botkin', 'Peyton List, Andrew W. Walker, Frances Flanagan, Ella Cannon, Jeff Gonek, Paul Jarrett, Francisco Trujillo Avalos-Davidson, Joe Costa', 'G', 'Erica is a rancher who has spent her whole life working the family farm with her mother and sister. When Aaron arrives and disrupts her plans, she starts to question what it is she actually wants.', 'Erica is a rancher who has spent her whole life working the family farm with her mother and sister. When Aaron arrives and disrupts her plans, she starts to question what it is she actually wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mMpXU9tJOtOGdMkUTJzotJbNd1j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1027442'),
  ('537263380699832327', 'A March to Remember', 2019, 'Drama, History', 'Víctor Cabaco, Gaizka Bourgeaud, Txabe Atxa', 'Héctor Amado, Juan Ibarrondo', 'Amaia Aberasturi, Mikel Iglesias, Ruth Díaz, Alberto Berzal, José Manuel Seda, Oti Manzano, Ane Pikaza, Iñigo de la Iglesia', null, 'Vitoria, Basque Country, Spain, March 3, 1976. After several months of protests demanding decent working conditions, a general strike is called. Thousands of workers gather at the church of San Francisco while a hundred heavily armed policemen wait to act.', 'Vitoria, Basque Country, Spain, March 3, 1976. After several months of protests demanding decent working conditions, a general strike is called. Thousands of workers gather at the church of San Francisco while a hundred heavily armed policemen wait to act.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tcDWPVMCggP9hJR3uimPI44wHZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:560726'),
  ('648866307178122789', 'A Married Couple', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Allan King', null, 'Billy Edwards, Antoinette Edwards, Bogart Edwards, Merton', null, 'In this classic exploration of marriage in conflict, Billy and Antoinette Edwards—as well as their son Bogart and dog Merton—live out their daily lives. Hoping to discover the heart of the trouble in their marriage, Billy and Antoinette offer up their day to day lives to documentary filmmaker Allan King, as laughter, tears, wit, tenderness, anger, patience, pain, and sorrow ensue.', 'In this classic exploration of marriage in conflict, Billy and Antoinette Edwards—as well as their son Bogart and dog Merton—live out their daily lives. Hoping to discover the heart of the trouble in their marriage, Billy and Antoinette offer up their day to day lives to documentary filmmaker Allan King, as laughter, tears, wit, tenderness, anger, patience, pain, and sorrow ensue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kmx3hrkWJnDJ6CGJBLttbCld8E5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86655'),
  ('792996769690219748', 'A Married Woman''s Ejaculation Log', 2022, 'Romance', 'Ya Sin-soo', null, 'Jin Seo-yool, Kim Ji-ah, Kim Soo-yeon, Sang Woo, Im Tae-mok', null, 'A film depicting the revenge of a couple who are fooled by the physical pleasures of a couple at work.', 'A film depicting the revenge of a couple who are fooled by the physical pleasures of a couple at work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVxXVL0n3AgisEP0vdEQeJQdMBc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:992827'),
  ('71597675525493185', 'A Matador''s Mistress', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Menno Meyjes, Robert D. Yeoman', 'Menno Meyjes', 'Adrien Brody, Penélope Cruz, Nacho Aldeguer, Santiago Segura, Juan Echanove, Ann Mitchell, José Linuesa, Pedro Casablanc', null, 'Scandal erupts over a famous bullfighter''s affair with a left-wing actress.', 'Scandal erupts over a famous bullfighter''s affair with a left-wing actress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8M4ydEC8LJaAM5kfwhJWMO95dNw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45127'),
  ('127025454484973407', 'A Match Made in Heaven', 1997, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Wendkos, Chuck Arnold', 'Susan Rice', 'Olympia Dukakis, John Stamos, Della Reese, Kelly Rowan, Mitchell Whitfield, Estelle Getty, Stephanie Erb, Karen Ludwig', null, 'A dying widow plays matchmaker to her 32-year-old unmarried son and sets him up with a nurse that she meets.', 'A dying widow plays matchmaker to her 32-year-old unmarried son and sets him up with a nurse that she meets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuAsRsLt5ePaC4dyEXmeMejOFMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258317'),
  ('219326819073489150', 'A Match Revenge', 1968, 'Animation', 'Boris Dyozhkin', 'Aleksandr Kumma, Sakko Runge, Boris Dyozhkin', null, null, 'Ice team is fighting hard. We believe in the courage of the desperate guys. Real men play hockey. Coward does not play hockey.', 'Ice team is fighting hard. We believe in the courage of the desperate guys. Real men play hockey. Coward does not play hockey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFPNCZnQW85u3fNocPvqyDsnMQY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248555'),
  ('865439910959378923', 'A Matter of Courage', 2016, 'Drama', 'Roberto Gervitz, Lauro Escorel', 'Roberto Gervitz, Isaac Eshete', 'Armando Babaioff, Mariana Ximenes, Áurea Maranhão, Daniel Volpi, César Troncoso, Nickolas Caprio, Marcele Tedy, Nicolas Vargas', null, 'Hermano is a doctor who plans to climb a dangerous mountain. He feels guilty about the death of his best friend and needs a test of courage. But Hermano''s wife reveals that she is pregnant and he needs to make a decision.', 'Hermano is a doctor who plans to climb a dangerous mountain. He feels guilty about the death of his best friend and needs a test of courage. But Hermano''s wife reveals that she is pregnant and he needs to make a decision.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvuWoKIiGOMC1dQd4QB55ruw3Fw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352996'),
  ('856252165513020768', 'A Matter of Dignity', 1958, 'Drama', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Walter Lassally, Anis Nohra', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Ellie Lambeti, Eleni Zafeiriou, Dimitris Papamichael, Giorgos Pappas, Michalis Nikolinakos, Athena Michaelidou, Minas Christidis, Zorz Sarri', null, 'A daughter discovers her wealthy family is actually on the verge of bankruptcy and decides to charm a millionaire for his money in marriage. Soon she is torn between living a lie and keeping up appearances.', 'A daughter discovers her wealthy family is actually on the verge of bankruptcy and decides to charm a millionaire for his money in marriage. Soon she is torn between living a lie and keeping up appearances.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kGjPP0p3L65SPR73iLuAIvaOGFb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164421'),
  ('63215061928137481', 'A Matter of Earnestness', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Alekos Sakellarios, Andreas Andreadakis', 'Alekos Sakellarios', 'Labros Konstadaras, Dionysis Papagiannopoulos, Niki Linardou, Andreas Douzos, Giorgos Gavriilidis, Melpo Zarokosta, Mitsi Konstadara, Takis Hristoforidis', null, 'Minister Andreas Mavrogialouros (Labros Konstadaras) visits the village of his electoral district, Platanias for the inauguration of a maternity hospital. After an accident, he finds his voters'' dissatisfaction and the scams of his partners. He, therefore, decides to step down from the government and bring order to his life, starting from his wife and his daughter.', 'Minister Andreas Mavrogialouros (Labros Konstadaras) visits the village of his electoral district, Platanias for the inauguration of a maternity hospital. After an accident, he finds his voters'' dissatisfaction and the scams of his partners. He, therefore, decides to step down from the government and bring order to his life, starting from his wife and his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oebFhbWg2bh66n3TPYSiOTuADA4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:297342'),
  ('148732763549045284', 'A Matter of Faith', 1995, 'Drama', 'Marcos Loayza', 'Marcos Loayza', 'Óscar García, Jorge Ortiz Sánchez, Jorge Mendívil, Marta Monzón, Rodolfo Calaumana, Norma Merlo, Raúl Beltrán, Juan Carlos Avelo', null, 'Cuestión de fe es un largometraje producido en Bolivia en 1995, dirigida por Marcos Loayza. En esta película participa Jorge Ortiz y Elías Serrano. La película trata de una imagen sagrada que debe ser trasladada por encargo desde una región altiplánica hacia el oriente del país. Pero durante el viaje, la virgen es robada en uno de los pueblos de las regiones andinas y llevado a la región de los Yungas, los protagonistas tratan de recuperar la imagen sagrada, pero al final, llegan a un acuerdo con los pobladores en los Yungas y la imagen se queda en un pueblo de dicha región.', 'Cuestión de fe es un largometraje producido en Bolivia en 1995, dirigida por Marcos Loayza. En esta película participa Jorge Ortiz y Elías Serrano. La película trata de una imagen sagrada que debe ser trasladada por encargo desde una región altiplánica hacia el oriente del país. Pero durante el viaje, la virgen es robada en uno de los pueblos de las regiones andinas y llevado a la región de los Yungas, los protagonistas tratan de recuperar la imagen sagrada, pero al final, llegan a un acuerdo con los pobladores en los Yungas y la imagen se queda en un pueblo de dicha región.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6wsoeGa96wenKLzLkzjCcUZX6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107586'),
  ('706130753599756381', 'A Matter of Heart', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Francesca Archibugi, Fabio Zamarion, Elisabetta Boni', 'Francesca Archibugi', 'Antonio Albanese, Kim Rossi Stuart, Micaela Ramazzotti, Francesca Inaudi, Alessia Fugardi, Andrea Calligari, Nelsi Xhemalaj, Chiara Noschese', null, 'Garage owner Angelo and big-time film producer Alberto find themselves occupying neighbouring beds in a Rome hospital after suffering heart attacks. Alberto is a gregarious joker - and chain smoker - who has a strong effect on the impressionable Angelo. However, as one of the men''s condition deteriorates, the other becomes more deeply involved in his personal life.', 'Garage owner Angelo and big-time film producer Alberto find themselves occupying neighbouring beds in a Rome hospital after suffering heart attacks. Alberto is a gregarious joker - and chain smoker - who has a strong effect on the impressionable Angelo. However, as one of the men''s condition deteriorates, the other becomes more deeply involved in his personal life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imy57oW4ZCS4SiuvrldqVPBFhcS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56400'),
  ('1062202068698574783', 'A Matter of Honor', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Luigi Zampa, Luciano Trasatti, Carlo Di Palma', 'Luigi Zampa, Lorenzo Gicca Palli, Piero De Bernardi', 'Ugo Tognazzi, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Bernard Blier, Franco Fabrizi, Lucien Raimbourg, Tecla Scarano, Leopoldo Trieste, Sandro Merli', null, 'Efisio Mulas is a meek laborer who lives with occasional work, especially in Don Leandro Sanna''s salon, and rounds up the slim balance by betting with colleagues in strength with the game "head against head". In the village the Sanna and Porcu families'' conflict has lasted over a century.', 'Efisio Mulas is a meek laborer who lives with occasional work, especially in Don Leandro Sanna''s salon, and rounds up the slim balance by betting with colleagues in strength with the game "head against head". In the village the Sanna and Porcu families'' conflict has lasted over a century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sGYgIXYyVV2UkC6CbPiFfsBYUxM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239329'),
  ('137643955416073001', 'A Matter of Loaf and Death', 2008, 'Family, Animation, Comedy, Mystery, Romance', 'Nick Park, Dave Alex Riddett, Manon Wright', null, 'Peter Sallis, Sally Lindsay, Melissa Collier, Sarah Laborde, Geraldine McEwan, Ben Whitehead', 'G', 'Wallace and Gromit open a bakery, accidentally getting tied up with a murder mystery in the process. But when Wallace falls in love, Gromit is left to solve the case by himself.', 'Wallace and Gromit open a bakery, accidentally getting tied up with a murder mystery in the process. But when Wallace falls in love, Gromit is left to solve the case by himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCRoffkRpWRlArR7dAkxabaimLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14447'),
  ('751730578882136163', 'A Matter of Perspective', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Olivier Smolders, Patrice Payen', 'Olivier Smolders', 'Catherine Aymerie, François Galland, Stéphanie Dessens, Sarah Lefévre, Valerie De Wilde, Gille Duhâteau, Anne Bourdoud, Catherine Van Hauwermeiren', null, 'A young teacher is the victim of a cruel joke. When she enters the classroom, all her pupils are naked, standing near their bench. Their clothes are heaped up on the podium.', 'A young teacher is the victim of a cruel joke. When she enters the classroom, all her pupils are naked, standing near their bench. Their clothes are heaped up on the podium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyrSxchu6gjEp3sgNarZ3dzicdA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239439'),
  ('896698210319263040', 'A Matter of Prestige', 2023, 'Drama, Music', 'Emre Yapıcı, Mahsun Kırmızıgül, Ersan Çapan', 'Mahsun Kırmızıgül', 'Mahmut Kırmızıgül, Onur Gözeten, Ali Erkin Acır, Engin Hepileri, Eser Yenenler, Aslıhan Güner, Biran Damla Yılmaz, Şebnem Bozoklu', null, 'The film, which deals with the birth and rise of the Prestige Music generation, tells the passions and life struggles of artists, including Özcan Deniz, Haluk Levent and Mahsun Kırmızıgül, from the 1990s to the present.', 'The film, which deals with the birth and rise of the Prestige Music generation, tells the passions and life struggles of artists, including Özcan Deniz, Haluk Levent and Mahsun Kırmızıgül, from the 1990s to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Fsr8mHyd0GxQYBl83357e23kCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1024600'),
  ('389146895373774022', 'A Matter of Principles', 2009, null, 'Rodrigo Grande', 'Roberto Fontanarrosa, Rodrigo Grande', 'Federico Luppi, Norma Aleandro, Pablo Echarri, María Carámbula, Pepe Novoa, Mabel Pessen, Oscar Núñez, Oscar Alegre', null, 'A man with seemingly unwavering ethics is challenged by his new boss, who believes everyone has a price and it willing to prove it. In this Capra-esque tale no one leaves unscathed when principles and pragmatism collide.', 'A man with seemingly unwavering ethics is challenged by his new boss, who believes everyone has a price and it willing to prove it. In this Capra-esque tale no one leaves unscathed when principles and pragmatism collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/edCRtTjtVzYpcURA4FrOqvMI4nr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40711'),
  ('523232658956004836', 'A Matter of Resistance', 1966, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Pierre Lhomme, Olivier Gérard', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau, Alain Cavalier, Claude Sautet', 'Catherine Deneuve, Pierre Brasseur, Philippe Noiret, Mary Marquet, Henri Garcin, Carlos Thompson, Paul Le Person, Marc Dudicourt', null, 'In the countryside near Normandy''s beaches lives Marie, unhappy. It''s 1945, she''s married to Jérôme, a somewhat fussy milquetoast, diffident to the war around him and unwilling to move his wife to Paris, where she longs to live, shop, and party. A German outfit is bivouacked at Jérôme and Marie''s crumbling château because its commanding officer is pursuing Marie. She''s also eyed by a French spy working with the Allies as they plan D-Day. He woos her (posing to the Germans as her brother) and, in his passion, forgets his mission. Heroics come from an unexpected direction, and Marie makes her choice.', 'In the countryside near Normandy''s beaches lives Marie, unhappy. It''s 1945, she''s married to Jérôme, a somewhat fussy milquetoast, diffident to the war around him and unwilling to move his wife to Paris, where she longs to live, shop, and party. A German outfit is bivouacked at Jérôme and Marie''s crumbling château because its commanding officer is pursuing Marie. She''s also eyed by a French spy working with the Allies as they plan D-Day. He woos her (posing to the Germans as her brother) and, in his passion, forgets his mission. Heroics come from an unexpected direction, and Marie makes her choice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hPfS3Emw7P3QzxjJ9vQisoneW2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4194'),
  ('951771020292023195', 'A Matter of Size', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Erez Tadmor, Sharon Maymon, David Gurfinkel', 'Danny Cohen-Solal, Sharon Maymon', 'Itzik Cohen, Dvir Benedek, Alon Dahan, Shmulik Cohen, Irit Kaplan, Togo Igawa, Levana Finkelstein, Hila Sorjon-Fisher', null, 'Four overweight friends from the Israeli city of Ramle are fed up of dieting and the dieting club they belong to. When Herzl (155 kilos), the main protagonist, loses his job as a cook and starts working as a dishwasher in a Japanese restaurant in Ramle he discovers the world of Sumo where large people such as himself are honored and appreciated. Through Kitano (60 kilos), the restaurant owner, a former Sumo coach in Japan (who is supposedly hiding from the Yakuza in Israel), he falls in love with a sport involving "two fatsos in diapers and girly hairdos". Herzl wants Kitano to be their coach but Kitano is reluctant - they first have to earn their spurs. "A MATTER OF SIZE" is a comedy about a ‘coming out’ of a different kind - overweight people learning to accept themselves.', 'Four overweight friends from the Israeli city of Ramle are fed up of dieting and the dieting club they belong to. When Herzl (155 kilos), the main protagonist, loses his job as a cook and starts working as a dishwasher in a Japanese restaurant in Ramle he discovers the world of Sumo where large people such as himself are honored and appreciated. Through Kitano (60 kilos), the restaurant owner, a former Sumo coach in Japan (who is supposedly hiding from the Yakuza in Israel), he falls in love with a sport involving "two fatsos in diapers and girly hairdos". Herzl wants Kitano to be their coach but Kitano is reluctant - they first have to earn their spurs. "A MATTER OF SIZE" is a comedy about a ‘coming out’ of a different kind - overweight people learning to accept themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruyB1RYgumzscnr8P8IEx9UPzgo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35856'),
  ('759193989334516462', 'A Matter of Taste', 2000, 'Drama', 'Bernard Rapp', null, 'Bernard Giraudeau, Jean-Pierre Lorit, Charles Berling, Florence Thomassin, Jean-Pierre Léaud, Artus de Penguern, Laurent Spielvogel, Élizabeth Macocco', null, 'Nicolas, a handsome, young waiter, is befriended by Frédéric Delamont, a wealthy middle-aged businessman. Delamont, a man of power, influence and strictly refined tastes, is immediately smitten by Nicolas'' charm. Lonely and phobic, Delamont offers Nicolas a lucrative job as his personal food taster. In spite of their differences, a close friendship begins to emerge between the two men. However, their bond of trust and admiration soon spirals downward into a dangerous game of deceit and obsession for which neither is prepared.', 'Nicolas, a handsome, young waiter, is befriended by Frédéric Delamont, a wealthy middle-aged businessman. Delamont, a man of power, influence and strictly refined tastes, is immediately smitten by Nicolas'' charm. Lonely and phobic, Delamont offers Nicolas a lucrative job as his personal food taster. In spite of their differences, a close friendship begins to emerge between the two men. However, their bond of trust and admiration soon spirals downward into a dangerous game of deceit and obsession for which neither is prepared.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3OKEpJKer0QfzYH2gShboxaJlQA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74578'),
  ('548831511278583442', 'A Matter of Time', 1976, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Vincente Minnelli, Geoffrey Unsworth', 'John Gay', 'Liza Minnelli, Ingrid Bergman, Charles Boyer, Spiros Focás, Tina Aumont, Gabriele Ferzetti, Geoffrey Copleston, Dominot', 'PG', 'During a press conference, international star Nina remembers simpler times, flashing back to her days as a maid in a run-down Italian hotel. As a young woman, Nina befriends Contessa Sanziani, an elderly woman who entertains Nina with memories of her vibrant, wealthy life with Count Sanziani. Inspired by her tales of success, young Nina fantasizes about her own adventures and seeks to find the same excitement in her life.', 'During a press conference, international star Nina remembers simpler times, flashing back to her days as a maid in a run-down Italian hotel. As a young woman, Nina befriends Contessa Sanziani, an elderly woman who entertains Nina with memories of her vibrant, wealthy life with Count Sanziani. Inspired by her tales of success, young Nina fantasizes about her own adventures and seeks to find the same excitement in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rwj3zPFSvfF64P3LIeoyozGUSkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78358'),
  ('724723036918465186', 'A Melbourne Match', 2026, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie, Comedy', 'Colin Budds', 'Mallory Jansen', 'Ryan Corr, Christopher Kirby, Rhemy Ashton, Jessica Clarke, Kevin Khan', 'TV-G', 'A travel writer''s structured Australia assignment gets derailed by a laid-back ex-football player who helps her discover the joy in unplanned moments.', 'A travel writer''s structured Australia assignment gets derailed by a laid-back ex-football player who helps her discover the joy in unplanned moments.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FNm49NSh8UUGtEMmTUImjZFZuAs.jpg', 'plex:movie:a-melbourne-match-2026'),
  ('451515373263743635', 'A Melody to Remember', 2016, 'Drama, War', 'Lee Han, Kim Jae-keun, Hong Jae-sik', 'Lee Woo-tak', 'Yim Si-wan, Ko A-sung, Lee Hee-jun, Lee Jun-hyeok, Jeong Joon-won, Kim Hyun-bin, Lee Re, Park Ji-yeon', null, 'Second Lieutenant Han Sang-yeol leads his platoon during the Korean War in the early 1950s. He carries emotional scars and pain within. So when he meets some children from a choir, who have lost everything in the war, Sang-yeol is deeply moved and tries to protect to them.', 'Second Lieutenant Han Sang-yeol leads his platoon during the Korean War in the early 1950s. He carries emotional scars and pain within. So when he meets some children from a choir, who have lost everything in the war, Sang-yeol is deeply moved and tries to protect to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i71EsFi3ChgXZVYc4fwC65mU6QY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:379880'),
  ('385580992983474316', 'A Menina Índigo', 2017, 'Drama', 'Wagner de Assis, Guy Gonçalves, Mitzzi Carvalho', 'Wagner de Assis', 'Letícia Braga, Murilo Rosa, Fernanda Machado, Eriberto Leão, Paulo Figueiredo, Xuxa Lopes, Nika Bonfim, Nizo Neto', null, 'Unlike the other children, Sophie discovers in the midst of her abilities to paint the gift of being able to cure illnesses. The news spreads and reaches the hands of a tabloid journalist. To protect the girl, her separated parents need to unite.', 'Unlike the other children, Sophie discovers in the midst of her abilities to paint the gift of being able to cure illnesses. The news spreads and reaches the hands of a tabloid journalist. To protect the girl, her separated parents need to unite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlG36w6mPtq85ilL6lPycRTCceA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480486'),
  ('996293909003489696', 'A Mermaid in Paris', 2020, 'Romance, Fantasy, Drama, Comedy', 'Virginie Saint-Martin, Mathias Malzieu', 'Stéphane Landowski, Mathias Malzieu', 'Nicolas Duvauchelle, Marilyn Lima, Rossy de Palma, Tchéky Karyo, Romane Bohringer, Alexis Michalik, Rodolphe Pauly, Lola Bessis', null, 'A man rescues a mermaid in Paris and slowly falls in love with her.', 'A man rescues a mermaid in Paris and slowly falls in love with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6tn0pNVvTfFTREKOfixksU8QCSV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:600479'),
  ('154779013033835138', 'A Mermaid''s Tale', 2017, 'Family', 'Dustin Rikert', 'Fred Hogge, Rafael Jordan', 'Jerry O''Connell, Barry Bostwick, Caitlin Carmichael, Nancy Stafford, Ronnie Gene Blevins, Sydney Scotia, Callan Wilson, Jaimi Paige', 'G', '12-year-old Ryan moves to the town where her father was born—a bleak, dying fishing town. However, exploring the coast, she discovers a cove that is home to a mysterious girl named Coral who reveals herself to be a mermaid.', '12-year-old Ryan moves to the town where her father was born—a bleak, dying fishing town. However, exploring the coast, she discovers a cove that is home to a mysterious girl named Coral who reveals herself to be a mermaid.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4m6MJnH7EdwQ6Tcli8pI8YgQscT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455546'),
  ('364832076525711523', 'A Merry Christmas Wish', 2022, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Bradley Walsh, Jonathan Yapp', 'Adam Rockoff, Blaine Chiappetta', 'Jill Wagner, Cameron Mathison, Neil Whitely, Morgan David Jones, Deanna Jarvis, Van Stewart, Taya Messier', 'G', 'Janie, a rising marketing executive living in The Big Apple, returns to her hometown of Woodland Falls when her Great-Uncle Randall passes away. Randall has even arranged for his farmhand, Dylan to help at the event, which is being held in the farm’s sprawling barn. Aware that her Manhattan boyfriend is anxious for her to return to the city so the pair can jet off to a previously planned holiday on the beach, Janie begins to feel an unexpected emotional tug about living life in a more authentic, meaningful way.', 'Janie, a rising marketing executive living in The Big Apple, returns to her hometown of Woodland Falls when her Great-Uncle Randall passes away. Randall has even arranged for his farmhand, Dylan to help at the event, which is being held in the farm’s sprawling barn. Aware that her Manhattan boyfriend is anxious for her to return to the city so the pair can jet off to a previously planned holiday on the beach, Janie begins to feel an unexpected emotional tug about living life in a more authentic, meaningful way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9qBQDIED8O8ehWODVt3s304KQlt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:971503'),
  ('354313075362897060', 'A Merry Friggin'' Christmas', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Tristram Shapeero, Giovani Lampassi', 'Michael Brown', 'Joel McHale, Lauren Graham, Clark Duke, Oliver Platt, Wendi McLendon-Covey, Tim Heidecker, Candice Bergen, Robin Williams', 'PG-13', 'Boyd Mitchler and his family must spend Christmas with his estranged family of misfits. Upon realizing that he left all his son''s gifts at home, he hits the road with his dad in an attempt to make the 8-hour round trip before sunrise.', 'Boyd Mitchler and his family must spend Christmas with his estranged family of misfits. Upon realizing that he left all his son''s gifts at home, he hits the road with his dad in an attempt to make the 8-hour round trip before sunrise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eR9muFXkNCknGdfTQSeDS6tdPdZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286532'),
  ('136463496912453920', 'A Merry Little Ex-Mas', 2025, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Steve Carr, Adam Santelli, Teshaya Jervis', 'Holly Hester', 'Alicia Silverstone, Oliver Hudson, Jameela Jamil, Pierson Fodé, Wilder Hudson, Emily Hall, Bert Cardozo, Timothy Innes', 'PG', 'Recently separated, Kate hopes to celebrate one last perfect family Christmas with her soon-to-be ex-husband Everett and their kids before their divorce is final and the house is sold. But her holiday plans are hilariously derailed when Everett unexpectedly brings his younger, successful new girlfriend.', 'Recently separated, Kate hopes to celebrate one last perfect family Christmas with her soon-to-be ex-husband Everett and their kids before their divorce is final and the house is sold. But her holiday plans are hilariously derailed when Everett unexpectedly brings his younger, successful new girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4ytu75uJ1b0AgPd0wLm7iZMsWJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1401318'),
